export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"civilcraft","name":"CivilCraft","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","brave":"Brave","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"whats-new","scope":"civilcraft","title":"What's new in 0.10","summary":"Railroads with spirals, cant, track corridors, turnouts and clearance envelopes, the Swept path add-on for vehicles, big surveys that stay smooth when you zoom, and the concept stage with BimCraft and ModelCraft.","section":"start","order":5,"keywords":["whats new","what's new","0.10","release notes","changelog","changes","version","new features","railroad","railway","rail","rail alignment","spiral","transition","cant","track","track corridor","ballast","sleepers","formation","turnout","crossover","clearance envelope","swept path","vehicle","truck","trailer","turning","big survey","large surface","outline","zoom","survey points","labels","concept stage","massing","building lines","boundary","ground surface","undo","paving","lawns","regulations","pro layouts","trackpad","swipe","tour"],"headings":[{"id":"new","text":"New","level":2},{"id":"railroads","text":"Railroads","level":3},{"id":"swept-paths","text":"Swept paths","level":3},{"id":"big-surveys","text":"Big surveys","level":3},{"id":"concept-stage","text":"Concept stage","level":3},{"id":"fixed","text":"Fixed","level":2},{"id":"in-every-app","text":"In every app","level":2},{"id":"said-plainly","text":"Said plainly","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThis is what changed in CivilCraft 0.10, compared with 0.9. The big parts are railroads and the Swept path add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"new\"\u003ENew\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"railroads\"\u003ERailroads\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERail alignments\u003C/strong\u003E with spirals and cant, \u003Cstrong\u003Etrack corridors\u003C/strong\u003E (ballast, sleepers, formation), \u003Cstrong\u003Eturnouts\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003Eclearance envelopes\u003C/strong\u003E, on the alignment, profile and corridor tools. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/railway\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/railway\"\u003EDesign a railway track\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"swept-paths\"\u003ESwept paths\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe Swept path add-on\u003C/strong\u003E (off by default) draws vehicle swept paths, checked against closed forms and published turning radii. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/swept-paths\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/swept-paths\"\u003EVehicle swept paths\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"big-surveys\"\u003EBig surveys\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA large surface no longer rebuilds its outline on every zoom, and survey points are thinned and labels capped when you zoom out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"concept-stage\"\u003EConcept stage\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith BimCraft and ModelCraft: survey points, a ground surface, the boundary, building lines and massing options. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/building-masses\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/building-masses\"\u003EDraw building masses on a site\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fixed\"\u003EFixed\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAn edit that failed half-way left the half edit in the project.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhat linked paving and lawns change was outside the undo step.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe Regulations add-on&#039;s language files had drifted, and a pack with no rules could not be ticked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"in-every-app\"\u003EIn every app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDocking tool groups.\u003C/strong\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, a group of tools can be docked as a palette beside the drawing. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/dock-tool-groups\" data-topic=\"basics/dock-tool-groups\"\u003EDock a group of tools\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFour Pro layouts\u003C/strong\u003E (Ribbon, Workbench, Review, Studio) in an optional Pro skin, in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA two-finger trackpad swipe pans\u003C/strong\u003E the plan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETour tips\u003C/strong\u003E have one \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E button; the X closes the tour.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"said-plainly\"\u003ESaid plainly\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENo railway engineer has compared the rail tools with a standard, and the rail LandXML and IFC were not opened in another program.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe Swept path add-on has not been checked against a real site and is in English only.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe big-survey timings were taken on a busy server, so no number is claimed here.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDocking tool groups has not been tried on two monitors.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe new tools were checked by automated tests in a browser, not yet by a person on a real project.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELanguages beyond English are machine drafts, and some words new in 0.10 are still English only.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor the version before this one, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/whats-new-0-9\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/whats-new-0-9\"\u003EWhat&#039;s new in 0.9\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"This is what changed in CivilCraft 0.10, compared with 0.9. The big parts are railroads and the Swept path add-on. New Railroads Rail alignments with spirals and cant, track corridors (ballast, sleepers, formation), turnouts and clearance envelopes, on the alignment, profile and corridor tools. See Design a railway track. Swept paths The Swept path add-on (off by default) draws vehicle swept paths, checked against closed forms and published turning radii. See Vehicle swept paths. Big surveys A large surface no longer rebuilds its outline on every zoom, and survey points are thinned and labels capped when you zoom out. Concept stage With BimCraft and ModelCraft: survey points, a ground surface, the boundary, building lines and massing options. See Draw building masses on a site. Fixed An edit that failed half-way left the half edit in the project. What linked paving and lawns change was outside the undo step. The Regulations add-on's language files had drifted, and a pack with no rules could not be ticked. In every app Docking tool groups. In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, a group of tools can be docked as a palette beside the drawing. See Dock a group of tools. Four Pro layouts (Ribbon, Workbench, Review, Studio) in an optional Pro skin, in Settings › Global › Layout. A two-finger trackpad swipe pans the plan. Tour tips have one Next button; the X closes the tour. Said plainly No railway engineer has compared the rail tools with a standard, and the rail LandXML and IFC were not opened in another program. The Swept path add-on has not been checked against a real site and is in English only. The big-survey timings were taken on a busy server, so no number is claimed here. Docking tool groups has not been tried on two monitors. The new tools were checked by automated tests in a browser, not yet by a person on a real project. Languages beyond English are machine drafts, and some words new in 0.10 are still English only. For the version before this one, see What's new in 0.9.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-9","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Waxa cusub 0.9 (hore)","summary":"Qaababka kooridorka iyo dhulka, qabsashada iyo badhamada Pick markaad naqshadeyso, falanqaynta GIS oo leh miis sifooyinka, daraasadaha hooska, qorraxda-korontada, raaxada iyo dabaysha goobta, muuqaalka 3D Render, iyo add-on-yada Daruurta barta iyo WaterCraft.","section":"start","order":6,"keywords":["waxa cusub 0.9","nooca hore","waxa cusub","0.9","qoraalka nooca","qaababka kooridorka","qaababka dhulka","tifaftiraha qaababka","qaabka qaybta caadiga ah","kooridoro dhowr ah","snap","qabso","pick","guuri","koobiyee","leexi","tangent","render","3d render","falanqaynta gis","buffer","overlay","spatial join","miiska sifooyinka","qaab sifada ku salaysan","daraasadda hooska","solar yield","utci","raaxada dibadda","daraasadda dabaysha","openfoam","daruurta barta","las","laz","watercraft","socodka dab-damin","hydrant","da'da biyaha","kloriin","baahiyo","tooltips","qaabeyn","waxa cusub","qoraalka nooca","isbedel","0.8","0.8.1","nooca","astaamaha cusub","roob","duufaan","ponding","overtopping","shaqada dhulka","balance","buuxin","gaadiid","jidka ugu wanaagsan","alignment","balliga ilaalinta","outlet","drawdown","freeboard","horumar","sahan","drone","kaydka","cinwaanka goobta","parcel","ciid","daad","xasilloonida jeexjeexa","bishop","settlement","isgoys","striping","calaamadaha","sight distance","hagaajin","least squares","traverse","godka furan","block model","xidhiidhka raadiyaha","fresnel","laf-jeexyada","crossover","luqadaha","dhibaatooyin","live","dwg"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"qaababka-kooridorka-iyo-dhulka","text":"Qaababka kooridorka iyo dhulka","level":3},{"id":"naqshadeynta","text":"Naqshadeynta","level":3},{"id":"falanqaynta-gis","text":"Falanqaynta GIS","level":3},{"id":"goobta-qorraxda-qorraxda-korontada-raaxada-iyo-dabaysha","text":"Goobta: qorraxda, qorraxda-korontada, raaxada iyo dabaysha","level":3},{"id":"daruurta-barta-add-on","text":"Daruurta barta (add-on)","level":3},{"id":"watercraft-add-on","text":"WaterCraft (add-on)","level":3},{"id":"wada-shaqaynta","text":"Wada shaqaynta","level":3},{"id":"app-kasta","text":"App kasta","level":2},{"id":"la-saxay","text":"La saxay","level":2},{"id":"xadka-runta-ah","text":"Xadka runta ah","level":2},{"id":"hore-0-8-iyo-0-8-1","text":"Hore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1","level":2},{"id":"cusub-2","text":"Cusub","level":3},{"id":"app-kasta-2","text":"App kasta","level":3},{"id":"la-saxay-0-8-1","text":"La saxay 0.8.1","level":3},{"id":"weli-ma-jiraan-nooca-tan","text":"Weli ma jiraan nooca tan","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWaa waxa isbeddelay CivilCraft 0.9, marka la barbardhigo 0.8.1. CivilCraft 0.9 waxa uu qayb ka yahay CadCraft Studio 0.9 iyo siddeeda app-keeda. Qaybaha waaweyn waa qaababka kooridorka iyo dhulka, qabsashada markaad sawirayso, falanqaynta GIS, daraasadaha qorraxda goobta, qorraxda-korontada, raaxada iyo dabaysha, iyo laba add-on: Daruurta barta iyo WaterCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"qaababka-kooridorka-iyo-dhulka\"\u003EQaababka kooridorka iyo dhulka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaababka kooridorka.\u003C/strong\u003E Ka fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaababka kooridorka…\u003C/span\u003E (ama qor \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ETEMPLATES\u003C/code\u003E). Qaabku waa qaybta dhexdhexaadka yar oo leh qaybaha, ka-saarka, jeexjeexyada, walxaha iyo koodhka barta. Ku hay mashruuca, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabaddayda\u003C/span\u003E ama fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.cctemplates.json\u003C/code\u003E. Tifaftiraha qaabku wuxuu tusaa sawir cabbir run ah oo liis dhibaatooyin marka aad qorayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhis isteeshanka iyadoo laga kaashanayo qaababka.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro khad waddo oo shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhis iyadoo laga kaashanayo qaababka isteeshanka\u003C/span\u003E Sifooyinkiisa. Dhinac kasta oo gobol kasta wuxuu leeyahay liiskiisa dusha waddada iyo xaalkiisa dhamaadka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar kooridor\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKooridorada khadkan\u003C/span\u003E waxa uu saaraa kooridorro dhowr ah hal khad waddo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaababka dhulka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaababka dhulka…\u003C/span\u003E (ama qor \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ETERRAINTEMPLATES\u003C/code\u003E) waxa uu dhulka saaraa walxo lakab lakab ah sida dhulka sare ama dusha iyo saldhiga, oo leh aag iyo mug lakab kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor-templates\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor-templates\"\u003EQaababka kooridorka iyo qaababka dhulka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"naqshadeynta\"\u003ENaqshadeynta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQabsashada.\u003C/strong\u003E Qalabyada Khadka waddada, Padka, Qaybta dhulka, Mass, Xariiqa muhiimka ah, Qiyaas, Xuduudda iyo Biyo-ku-urayaa waxa ay qabsadaan barooyinka sahanka, PI-yada, geedaha, geedaha hore iyo dhismayaasha, calaamad ku dhow calaamadda. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E barta xor ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhamada Pick, tangent iyo guuri, koobiyee, leexi.\u003C/strong\u003E Geedaha padka, qaybta dhulka iyo xariiqa muhiimka ah waxa leh sanduuqyo lagu qoro Easting iyo Northing iyo badhanka Pick ee calaamadda. Sifooyinka waxa kale oo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETangent laba barood ah\u003C/span\u003E khadadka waddada iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri, koobiyee iyo leexi\u003C/span\u003E khadadka waddada, padyada, qaybaha dhulka iyo xariiqyada muhiimka ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/draft-with-snaps\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/draft-with-snaps\"\u003ENaqshadee qabsashada, geedaha la doortay iyo guuri, koobiyee, leexi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka render 3D.\u003C/strong\u003E Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar\u003C/span\u003E ee xariiqda 3D wuxuu sawiraa dhulka midabbada dabiiciga ah, samada, uurka iyo hooska jilicsan. Ma beddelo moodelka. Menu-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorraxda\u003C/span\u003E hadda waxa uu leeyahay badhamada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/site-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/site-3d\"\u003EArag goobta 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGarabadu waxa ay mid mid u furmaan qaybta.\u003C/strong\u003E Garabka bidix iyo garabka Sifooyinka mid qaybood ayaa furaan oo kuwa kale xiraan, qalabka Beerta ee leh qalab badan waa badhamo kala qaybsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"falanqaynta-gis\"\u003EFalanqaynta GIS\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFalanqee.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqee\u003C/span\u003E waxa uu bixiyaa buffer, overlay, spatial join, doorashada sifo ama qaab, iyo qiyaasid. Qalab kasta waxa uu sameeyaa lakab cusub hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiiska sifooyinka.\u003C/strong\u003E Menu-ka saddex-dhibcood ee lakabka waxa ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiska sifooyinka…\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaab sifada ku salaysan…\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-analysis\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-analysis\"\u003EFalanqee lakabyada GIS\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-table\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-table\"\u003EKu shaqee miiska sifooyinka lakabka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"goobta-qorraxda-qorraxda-korontada-raaxada-iyo-dabaysha\"\u003EGoobta: qorraxda, qorraxda-korontada, raaxada iyo dabaysha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta deegaanka.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro mass: qaybta Deegaanka waxay ku taalla hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaacadaha qorraxda\u003C/span\u003E Sifooyinkeeda. Waxa ku jira daraasad hooska (khariidad, miis, animation, CSV), soo saaridda shamsiyada faylka cimilada sannad caadi ah (.epw) iyo raaxada dibadda (UTCI).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaysha, baaritaan keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer daraasadda dabaysha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu midabeeyaa dhulka xagga fadhiga ilaa aan raaxo lahayn jihada dabaysha kasta ee faylka cimilada. Lama xaqiijin, garabkuna sidaas buu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd-on-ka dabaysha socodka (OpenFOAM).\u003C/strong\u003E Wuu damsan yahay ilaa aad ku shiido \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E. OpenFOAM waa barnaamij aad adigu rakibto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/environment\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/environment\"\u003EHooska, shamsiyada iyo raaxada dibadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"daruurta-barta-add-on\"\u003EDaruurta barta (add-on)\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaruurta barta\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E; tab Daruurta barta ayaa ka soo muuqanaya garabka midig. Fur fayl LAS ama LAZ, nadiifi, u kala sooc dhul, dhir iyo dhismayaal, dhis dhulka, konturada iyo mugyada, oo dhoofi LAS ama LAZ. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EDaruurta barta drone ama scanner-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"watercraft-add-on\"\u003EWaterCraft (add-on)\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaterCraft (qaybinta biyaha)\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E; tab WaterCraft ayaa soo muuqanaya. Waxa ku jira baahiyo macaamiisha ka imanaya, socodka dab-damin ee hydrant kasta, tuubada joojinteeda ugu muhiimsan, iyo da&#039;da biyaha iyo kloriinta, midkoodba CSV ahaan loo kaydiyo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/watercraft\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/watercraft\"\u003EWaterCraft: baahiyo, socodka dab-damin, shaqo-joogsi iyo da&#039;da biyaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"wada-shaqaynta\"\u003EWada shaqaynta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKal-fadhi toos ah ku jira waxaad aragtaa kursoorada iyo magacyada midba midka kale qorshaha. Dhirta maktabadda: CivilCraft Landscape wuxuu ka bilaabaa ururinta maktabadda ee caadiga ah, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECivilCraft beerta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"app-kasta\"\u003EApp kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETalo-siinta waxa lagu muujiyaa tooltips-ka Bootstrap, talada bilowga ayaa la xiri karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka tab-ka garabka ee aan ku habboonayn wuu ku socdaa halkii laga gooyi lahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECinwaanka tab-ka browser-ka wuxuu akhriyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;document&gt; - CivilCraft | CadCraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E waxa ku jira qayb Qaabeynta ah oo qaababka ay yihiin liis-hoos-u-dhac oo laba-saf ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnugyada miisaanka iyo heerkulka waxay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaalami\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnugyada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska luqadaha wuxuu tusaa luqadaha dhismuhu fayl u leeyahay. Luqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraalo mishiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-saxay\"\u003ELa saxay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd-on-yada raadinta cinwaanka iyo hubinta EnergyPlus lama shidi karin; hadda way shidi karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawinta hadda waxay sheegtaa in add-on-ka Daruurta barta uu qoro daruur nadiifsan oo LAS 1.4 ama LAZ ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji gacanta shayga la doortay ma bilaabo jiidis gacan oo joojiya Pick sugaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xadka-runta-ah\"\u003EXadka runta ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaababka kooridorka ee tusaalaha ah waa meel-hayn aan heer caadi ahayn; injineer ayaa hubin laga rabaa. Qaababka dhulka ma darayaan dusha wayna aan lagu sawirin 3D ama muuqaalka qaybta. Kooridorka labaad ee khad waddo dhexdiisa kuma jiro dhoofinta IFC. Ma jiro isbedel u dhexeeya laba qaab isteeshanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaruurta barta waxa lagu tijaabiyay faylal la sameeyay, ma aha sahan drone oo dhab ah. LAS iyo LAZ oo keliya ayaa la akhriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFalanqaynta GIS waxa lagu tijaabiyay lakabyo la sameeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHooska, qorraxda-korontada iyo raaxadu waa qiyaasaha qorshaynta; dabaysha waa baaritaan aan la xaqiijin. Midna ma aha qiime naqshadeed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaterCraft waa qalab xisaabin oo lagu hubiyay shabakado la sameeyay. Injineer biyo ah ayaa go&#039;aaminaya qiimaha tirooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELuqadaha ka baxsan Ingiriisiga waa qoraalo mishiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERakibayaasha Windows lama saxiixin code-ka, sawirka diskka macOS-na lama ansixin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hore-0-8-iyo-0-8-1\"\u003EHore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa waxa isbeddelay CivilCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) iyo 0.8.1 (2026-11-02), marka la barbardhigo 0.7. Qaybaha cusub ee waaweyn waa qalabyo tijaabiya jeexjeexkaaga iyo goobtaada (roob, shaqada dhulka, jidadka, balliyada, horumarka) iyo lix daaqadood oo xisaabin dhulka, waddooyinka, sahanka, macdanta, xidhiidhka iyo rail.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cusub-2\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETijaabi jeexjeexkaaga\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoob ha da&#039;o.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoobka keen…\u003C/span\u003E (hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu dhulka jeexjeexan dhexdiisa duufaan dhigaa. Waxaad arkaysaa biyaha oo ka socda padyada, ku balliyeeya geedaha hoose, iyo balliyada yaryar ee ka sarreeya. Socodku wuu animate yahay, wuxuuna siiyaa mugyada, socodka ugu sarreeya ee baxaya iyo CSV balli kasta. Unuggu caadi ahaan waa weyn, sidaas darteed dhakhso ayaa loo arkaa; unug fiican wuu gaabiyaa. Balliyada ka sarreeya waxa kale oo ku muuqda garabka Dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dheelitiraha dhulka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dheelitiraha dhulka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kor u qaadaa ama hoos u dhigaa pad ilaa jarista la siman tahay buuxinta, wuxuuna tusaa miiska gaadiidka u dhexeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidka ugu wanaagsan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaddada ugu wanaagsan…\u003C/span\u003E: dooro bilowga iyo dhamaadka, CivilCraft wuxuu helaa jidka ugu jaban dhulka dhexdiisa oo ku dhegan xadka jeexjeexkaaga iyo wareegkaaga, kadibna khad waddo ka sameeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBalliyada ilaalinta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBalliyada ilaalinta…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xisaabiyaa heerka iyo kaydinta dhulkaaga, qaataa qalabka soo-bixinta (orifice, weir, V-notch, spillway), wuxuu duufaan u maraa balliga oo hubiyaa socodka ugu sarreeya ee la xakameeyay, wakhtiga hoos-u-dhaca iyo freeboard-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHorumarka sahamyada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHorumarka sahamyada…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isbarbar dhigayaa dusha drone ama scan ee taariikho kala duwan ah dhulka sidii ahaa iyo naqshadda: boqolkiiba la dhammeeyay mugga, aagagga la qodey ka badan iyo la buuxiyay ka badan, kuwa kaydka, iyo goorta shaqada ay dhammaanayso xawaaraha sidaas (lagu calaamadeeyay qiyaas).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGaro goobta\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECinwaanka ilaa goobta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECinwaanka ka geli goobta…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isku safeeyaa xogta qaybta furan, dhismaha, qeybinta, ciidda, daadka iyo dhulka goob hal ah. Goobta waxaad ku hayn kartaa faylka mashruuca: cinwaanka la qoray, ilaha kasta oo maalinta aad soo qaadatay iyo shatiga, iyo wixii soo noqday. Mashruuca dib u fur ama wadaag, goobtu weli way jirtaa, mana soo qaadanayso mar kale. Waxa kale oo aad u kaydin kartaa faylka goob ama u dir BimCraft. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/address-to-site\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/address-to-site\"\u003ECinwaanka ilaa goobta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka, waddooyinka, sahanka, macdanta, xidhiidhka iyo rail-ka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECiidda iyo jeexjeexyada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECiidda iyo jeexjeexyada…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa muuqaalka ciidda u dhexeeya godadka aad qortay. Habka Bishop wuxuu kadibna raadiyaa goobta khatarta ah ee wareegga dhulkaaga, oo leh miiska biyaha, culeys dheeraad ah iyo isla-daadashada dhulgariirka; hoos-u-dhaca aasaaska waxa uu helaa ku-dhimis, hoos-u-dhac degdeg ah iyo wakhti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoysyada iyo calaamadaynta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsgoysyada iyo calaamadaynta…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isku geliyaa lugaha leh kerbi-soo-celin (raadiyo kala duwan oo lug kasta, ama soo-celin saddex-dhexe), masaafada aragga xawaaraha naqshadda, hubinta saddexagalada aragga, dhambaalada socodka, xariiqyada istaagga, calaamadaynta iyo astaamaha iyo jadwalka astaamaha. Qorshaha waa la sawiraa oo waxa loo kaydiyaa .dxf lakabyo magac leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHagaajinta sahaminta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaajinta sahaminta…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu fuliyaa hagaajinta least-squares ee traverse ama shabakad: isku-xidhka la hagaajiyay, ellipse-yada khaladka, tijaabada chi-squared iyo calaamad ku dhigan cabbirka aan ku habboonin. Shabakadaha xor ah, xidhida traverse-ka xeerka compass iyo faylalka goobta RW5, GSI, JobXML ama CSV ayaa ku jira, barooyinka la hagaajiyay waxay u kaydiyaan CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGodad furan.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGodad furan…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tusaalooyinka godka u beddelaa moodel block, iyo godka ugu dambeeya gudaha xagga jeexjeexkaaga, oo leh nisbadda xariiqda, miis sida sariirta ah iyo curve-ka heerka iyo tirada. Godad isku dhex jira sida factor-ka dakhliga iyo jadwal wax soo saar oo leh cash flow la dhimay ayaa sidoo kale jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidhiidhada raadiyaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhiidhada raadiyaha…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hubiyaa aragga toosan ee dhulkaaga iyo kor-u-kaca dhulka, Fresnel-ka koowaad, miisaaniyadda xidhiidhka, marginka ifka iyo khasaaraha multipath, wuxuuna siiyaa dhererka tiirka ee jidka cadaynaya. Waxa kale oo samaynaya miisaaniyadda khasaaraha fiberka, tirada jidka iyo dabaysha tiirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaf-jeexyada tareenka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaf-jeexyada tareenka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa laf-jeex lambarka frog-ka, isgoysyada u dhexeeya jidadka isle&#039;eg iyo cabbirka dhismaha ee dhinac u jeexjeexan cant-ka oo ballac lagu daro wareeg. Laf-jeex waxa laga dhigi karaa isteeshan khad waddo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/soils-roads-survey-mines-links\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/soils-roads-survey-mines-links\"\u003ECiidda, isgoysyada, hagaajinta sahaminta, godadka, xidhiidhada raadiyaha iyo laf-jeexyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"app-kasta-2\"\u003EApp kasta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E 54 luqadood, toban ka mid ah cusub. Luqadaha ka baxsan Ingiriisiga waa qoraalo mishiin ilaa uu hadal dhalad ah akhriyo. Mawduucyada caawinta weli inta badan Ingiriisi ayay yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka qalabka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafafka qalabka\u003C/span\u003E: Wrap (sida hore), 2 saf ama 1 safka. Ribbon-ka CivilCraft wuxuu tusaa qalabka ugu badan la isticmaalo oo weyn, kuwa xiga yaryar, kuwa kalena ka dambeeya fallaadha magaca kooxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka gelinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Trackpad, qalin, mouse 3D, kontoroolar iyo MIDI ayaa app-yada wadi kara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka.\u003C/strong\u003E Garab Dhibaatooyinka ah oo digaya app kasta, oo leh hubinno akhrinaya pack-yada xeerarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELive.\u003C/strong\u003E Muuqaal ah cidda meesha ku jirta kal-fadhiga toosan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKordhinno.\u003C/strong\u003E Liis add-on-yo ah, oo ay ku jiraan add-on-yada iftiinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh AI-gaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaalmo kasta oo aad ku xirto wuu wadi karaa qalabka CivilCraft. Waxa uu leeyahay qoraal ah in xidhidda hal-riix gudaha CadCraft Studio iyo xidhiiyaha martida aysan wali diyaar ahayn. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/assistants\"\u003EKaaliye AI ha kugu shaqeeyo goobtaada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"la-saxay-0-8-1\"\u003ELa saxay 0.8.1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta fasalada DWG.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxa loo akhriyay nooc qaldan (GitHub cadcraft#5). Waa la saxay CivilCraft iyo CadCraft, BimCraft, ModelCraft iyo TakeoffCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeddelka luqadda marka la shaqeynayo.\u003C/strong\u003E CadCraft Studio iyo nooca la xirey waxay beddeli karaan luqadda waqtiga shaqada. Ka hor waxay ahaayeen Ingiriisi keliya. Weli kuma tijaabinna dhammaan madal-badeedyada: noo sheeg haddii luqaddu beddelmin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"weli-ma-jiraan-nooca-tan\"\u003EWeli ma jiraan nooca tan\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKuwani waa qalab xisaabin.\u003C/strong\u003E Natiijo kasta daaqadaha cusub waxa u baahan hubin injineer. Xoogga ciidda wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qiyamka caadiga ah ee kooxda ciidda, daaqaduna waa sheegtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoob ha da&#039;o.\u003C/strong\u003E Shaqada goobta muunadda waxay qaadan kartaa in ka badan laba daqiiqo browser-ka unug fiican. Waxa lagu hubiyay kiisaska gacanta iyo biyo-ku-urayaa V-shaped ah, lama haysto goob jeexjeexan oo dhab ah wali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECinwaanka ilaa goobta.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxa ay akhrisaa faylalka xogta furan ee aad keento, waxayna tijaabiyey faylalkeenna keliya. Geedaha ma aha ilo. Ilaha adiga kuu soo qaadida waxay sugaysaa qoraalka asturnaanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHorumarka sahamyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxa lagu tijaabiyay sahamyo la sameeyay oo keliya. Horumarka xaashiyada iyo calaamadaha (MarkupCraft) iyo scan-ka marka la barbardhigo model-ka (BimCraft) lama dhisin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECiidda iyo jeexjeexyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Dusha wareeg keliya: ma jiro raadinta wedge ama block iyo ma jiro dillaaca xoogga (tension crack).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoysyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Hal raadiyo lug kasta, ma jiro jidadka wareejinta baabuurta, mana gelaan kooridorka weli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka goobta.\u003C/strong\u003E Akhriyeyaashu waxa loo qoray qeexitaanka qaabka dadweynaha, waxaana lagu tijaabiyay faylal aan sameynay. Faylalka qalabka dhabta ah ayaa la rabaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidhiidhada iyo rail-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Xidhiidhada raadiyaha: khasaaraha meel bannaan iyo multipath keliya (ma jiro ifka roobka ama qaabka antenna-ha), mana jiro heer rail-ka caadi ah: xadka kasta ee rail-ka waa meel-hayn, tirooyin qabyo ah oo aan injineer rail ah hubin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWindows iyo macOS.\u003C/strong\u003E 0.8 lama saxiixin code-ka. Windows waxay digi kartaa, macOS-na wuxuu weydiiyaa midig-guji kadibna Fur.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo dhan waxa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E. Nooca hore, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EWaxa cusub 0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waa waxa isbeddelay CivilCraft 0.9, marka la barbardhigo 0.8.1. CivilCraft 0.9 waxa uu qayb ka yahay CadCraft Studio 0.9 iyo siddeeda app-keeda. Qaybaha waaweyn waa qaababka kooridorka iyo dhulka, qabsashada markaad sawirayso, falanqaynta GIS, daraasadaha qorraxda goobta, qorraxda-korontada, raaxada iyo dabaysha, iyo laba add-on: Daruurta barta iyo WaterCraft. Cusub Qaababka kooridorka iyo dhulka Qaababka kooridorka. Ka fur Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Qaababka kooridorka… (ama qor TEMPLATES). Qaabku waa qaybta dhexdhexaadka yar oo leh qaybaha, ka-saarka, jeexjeexyada, walxaha iyo koodhka barta. Ku hay mashruuca, ama Maktabaddayda ama fayl .cctemplates.json. Tifaftiraha qaabku wuxuu tusaa sawir cabbir run ah oo liis dhibaatooyin marka aad qorayso. Dhis isteeshanka iyadoo laga kaashanayo qaababka. Dooro khad waddo oo shid Dhis iyadoo laga kaashanayo qaababka isteeshanka Sifooyinkiisa. Dhinac kasta oo gobol kasta wuxuu leeyahay liiskiisa dusha waddada iyo xaalkiisa dhamaadka. Ku dar kooridor hoosta Kooridorada khadkan waxa uu saaraa kooridorro dhowr ah hal khad waddo. Qaababka dhulka. Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Qaababka dhulka… (ama qor TERRAINTEMPLATES) waxa uu dhulka saaraa walxo lakab lakab ah sida dhulka sare ama dusha iyo saldhiga, oo leh aag iyo mug lakab kasta. Eeg Qaababka kooridorka iyo qaababka dhulka. Naqshadeynta Qabsashada. Qalabyada Khadka waddada, Padka, Qaybta dhulka, Mass, Xariiqa muhiimka ah, Qiyaas, Xuduudda iyo Biyo-ku-urayaa waxa ay qabsadaan barooyinka sahanka, PI-yada, geedaha, geedaha hore iyo dhismayaasha, calaamad ku dhow calaamadda. Riix Alt barta xor ah. Badhamada Pick, tangent iyo guuri, koobiyee, leexi. Geedaha padka, qaybta dhulka iyo xariiqa muhiimka ah waxa leh sanduuqyo lagu qoro Easting iyo Northing iyo badhanka Pick ee calaamadda. Sifooyinka waxa kale oo ku jira Tangent laba barood ah khadadka waddada iyo Guuri, koobiyee iyo leexi khadadka waddada, padyada, qaybaha dhulka iyo xariiqyada muhiimka ah. Eeg Naqshadee qabsashada, geedaha la doortay iyo guuri, koobiyee, leexi. Muuqaalka render 3D. Badhanka Rendar ee xariiqda 3D wuxuu sawiraa dhulka midabbada dabiiciga ah, samada, uurka iyo hooska jilicsan. Ma beddelo moodelka. Menu-ka Qorraxda hadda waxa uu leeyahay badhamada Codso iyo Xir. Eeg Arag goobta 3D. Garabadu waxa ay mid mid u furmaan qaybta. Garabka bidix iyo garabka Sifooyinka mid qaybood ayaa furaan oo kuwa kale xiraan, qalabka Beerta ee leh qalab badan waa badhamo kala qaybsan. Falanqaynta GIS Falanqee. Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Falanqee waxa uu bixiyaa buffer, overlay, spatial join, doorashada sifo ama qaab, iyo qiyaasid. Qalab kasta waxa uu sameeyaa lakab cusub hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Miiska sifooyinka. Menu-ka saddex-dhibcood ee lakabka waxa ku jira Miiska sifooyinka… iyo Qaab sifada ku salaysan…. Eeg Falanqee lakabyada GIS iyo Ku shaqee miiska sifooyinka lakabka. Goobta: qorraxda, qorraxda-korontada, raaxada iyo dabaysha Qaybta deegaanka. Dooro mass: qaybta Deegaanka waxay ku taalla hoosta Saacadaha qorraxda Sifooyinkeeda. Waxa ku jira daraasad hooska (khariidad, miis, animation, CSV), soo saaridda shamsiyada faylka cimilada sannad caadi ah (.epw) iyo raaxada dibadda (UTCI). Dabaysha, baaritaan keliya. Dherer daraasadda dabaysha wuxuu midabeeyaa dhulka xagga fadhiga ilaa aan raaxo lahayn jihada dabaysha kasta ee faylka cimilada. Lama xaqiijin, garabkuna sidaas buu sheegaa. Add-on-ka dabaysha socodka (OpenFOAM). Wuu damsan yahay ilaa aad ku shiido Dejinta › Kordhinno. OpenFOAM waa barnaamij aad adigu rakibto. Eeg Hooska, shamsiyada iyo raaxada dibadda. Daruurta barta (add-on) Shid Daruurta barta ee Dejinta › Kordhinno; tab Daruurta barta ayaa ka soo muuqanaya garabka midig. Fur fayl LAS ama LAZ, nadiifi, u kala sooc dhul, dhir iyo dhismayaal, dhis dhulka, konturada iyo mugyada, oo dhoofi LAS ama LAZ. Eeg Daruurta barta drone ama scanner-ka. WaterCraft (add-on) Shid WaterCraft (qaybinta biyaha) ee Dejinta › Kordhinno; tab WaterCraft ayaa soo muuqanaya. Waxa ku jira baahiyo macaamiisha ka imanaya, socodka dab-damin ee hydrant kasta, tuubada joojinteeda ugu muhiimsan, iyo da'da biyaha iyo kloriinta, midkoodba CSV ahaan loo kaydiyo. Eeg WaterCraft: baahiyo, socodka dab-damin, shaqo-joogsi iyo da'da biyaha. Wada shaqaynta Kal-fadhi toos ah ku jira waxaad aragtaa kursoorada iyo magacyada midba midka kale qorshaha. Dhirta maktabadda: CivilCraft Landscape wuxuu ka bilaabaa ururinta maktabadda ee caadiga ah, CivilCraft beerta. App kasta Talo-siinta waxa lagu muujiyaa tooltips-ka Bootstrap, talada bilowga ayaa la xiri karaa. Safka tab-ka garabka ee aan ku habboonayn wuu ku socdaa halkii laga gooyi lahaa. Cinwaanka tab-ka browser-ka wuxuu akhriyaa \u003Cdocument\u003E - CivilCraft | CadCraft. Dejinta waxa ku jira qayb Qaabeynta ah oo qaababka ay yihiin liis-hoos-u-dhac oo laba-saf ah. Unugyada miisaanka iyo heerkulka waxay ku jiraan Dejinta › Caalami › Unugyada. Liiska luqadaha wuxuu tusaa luqadaha dhismuhu fayl u leeyahay. Luqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraalo mishiin. La saxay Add-on-yada raadinta cinwaanka iyo hubinta EnergyPlus lama shidi karin; hadda way shidi karaan. Caawinta hadda waxay sheegtaa in add-on-ka Daruurta barta uu qoro daruur nadiifsan oo LAS 1.4 ama LAZ ah. Guji gacanta shayga la doortay ma bilaabo jiidis gacan oo joojiya Pick sugaya. Xadka runta ah Qaababka kooridorka ee tusaalaha ah waa meel-hayn aan heer caadi ahayn; injineer ayaa hubin laga rabaa. Qaababka dhulka ma darayaan dusha wayna aan lagu sawirin 3D ama muuqaalka qaybta. Kooridorka labaad ee khad waddo dhexdiisa kuma jiro dhoofinta IFC. Ma jiro isbedel u dhexeeya laba qaab isteeshanka. Daruurta barta waxa lagu tijaabiyay faylal la sameeyay, ma aha sahan drone oo dhab ah. LAS iyo LAZ oo keliya ayaa la akhriyaa. Falanqaynta GIS waxa lagu tijaabiyay lakabyo la sameeyay. Hooska, qorraxda-korontada iyo raaxadu waa qiyaasaha qorshaynta; dabaysha waa baaritaan aan la xaqiijin. Midna ma aha qiime naqshadeed. WaterCraft waa qalab xisaabin oo lagu hubiyay shabakado la sameeyay. Injineer biyo ah ayaa go'aaminaya qiimaha tirooyinka. Luqadaha ka baxsan Ingiriisiga waa qoraalo mishiin. Rakibayaasha Windows lama saxiixin code-ka, sawirka diskka macOS-na lama ansixin. Hore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1 Waa waxa isbeddelay CivilCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) iyo 0.8.1 (2026-11-02), marka la barbardhigo 0.7. Qaybaha cusub ee waaweyn waa qalabyo tijaabiya jeexjeexkaaga iyo goobtaada (roob, shaqada dhulka, jidadka, balliyada, horumarka) iyo lix daaqadood oo xisaabin dhulka, waddooyinka, sahanka, macdanta, xidhiidhka iyo rail. Cusub Tijaabi jeexjeexkaaga Roob ha da'o. Roobka keen… (hoosta Dusha) wuxuu dhulka jeexjeexan dhexdiisa duufaan dhigaa. Waxaad arkaysaa biyaha oo ka socda padyada, ku balliyeeya geedaha hoose, iyo balliyada yaryar ee ka sarreeya. Socodku wuu animate yahay, wuxuuna siiyaa mugyada, socodka ugu sarreeya ee baxaya iyo CSV balli kasta. Unuggu caadi ahaan waa weyn, sidaas darteed dhakhso ayaa loo arkaa; unug fiican wuu gaabiyaa. Balliyada ka sarreeya waxa kale oo ku muuqda garabka Dhibaatooyinka. Isku-dheelitiraha dhulka. Isku-dheelitiraha dhulka… wuxuu kor u qaadaa ama hoos u dhigaa pad ilaa jarista la siman tahay buuxinta, wuxuuna tusaa miiska gaadiidka u dhexeeya. Jidka ugu wanaagsan. Waddada ugu wanaagsan…: dooro bilowga iyo dhamaadka, CivilCraft wuxuu helaa jidka ugu jaban dhulka dhexdiisa oo ku dhegan xadka jeexjeexkaaga iyo wareegkaaga, kadibna khad waddo ka sameeya. Balliyada ilaalinta. Balliyada ilaalinta… wuxuu xisaabiyaa heerka iyo kaydinta dhulkaaga, qaataa qalabka soo-bixinta (orifice, weir, V-notch, spillway), wuxuu duufaan u maraa balliga oo hubiyaa socodka ugu sarreeya ee la xakameeyay, wakhtiga hoos-u-dhaca iyo freeboard-ka. Horumarka sahamyada. Horumarka sahamyada… wuxuu isbarbar dhigayaa dusha drone ama scan ee taariikho kala duwan ah dhulka sidii ahaa iyo naqshadda: boqolkiiba la dhammeeyay mugga, aagagga la qodey ka badan iyo la buuxiyay ka badan, kuwa kaydka, iyo goorta shaqada ay dhammaanayso xawaaraha sidaas (lagu calaamadeeyay qiyaas). Garo goobta Cinwaanka ilaa goobta. Cinwaanka ka geli goobta… wuxuu isku safeeyaa xogta qaybta furan, dhismaha, qeybinta, ciidda, daadka iyo dhulka goob hal ah. Goobta waxaad ku hayn kartaa faylka mashruuca: cinwaanka la qoray, ilaha kasta oo maalinta aad soo qaadatay iyo shatiga, iyo wixii soo noqday. Mashruuca dib u fur ama wadaag, goobtu weli way jirtaa, mana soo qaadanayso mar kale. Waxa kale oo aad u kaydin kartaa faylka goob ama u dir BimCraft. Eeg Cinwaanka ilaa goobta. Dhulka, waddooyinka, sahanka, macdanta, xidhiidhka iyo rail-ka Ciidda iyo jeexjeexyada. Ciidda iyo jeexjeexyada… wuxuu sawiraa muuqaalka ciidda u dhexeeya godadka aad qortay. Habka Bishop wuxuu kadibna raadiyaa goobta khatarta ah ee wareegga dhulkaaga, oo leh miiska biyaha, culeys dheeraad ah iyo isla-daadashada dhulgariirka; hoos-u-dhaca aasaaska waxa uu helaa ku-dhimis, hoos-u-dhac degdeg ah iyo wakhti. Isgoysyada iyo calaamadaynta. Isgoysyada iyo calaamadaynta… wuxuu isku geliyaa lugaha leh kerbi-soo-celin (raadiyo kala duwan oo lug kasta, ama soo-celin saddex-dhexe), masaafada aragga xawaaraha naqshadda, hubinta saddexagalada aragga, dhambaalada socodka, xariiqyada istaagga, calaamadaynta iyo astaamaha iyo jadwalka astaamaha. Qorshaha waa la sawiraa oo waxa loo kaydiyaa .dxf lakabyo magac leh. Hagaajinta sahaminta. Hagaajinta sahaminta… wuxuu fuliyaa hagaajinta least-squares ee traverse ama shabakad: isku-xidhka la hagaajiyay, ellipse-yada khaladka, tijaabada chi-squared iyo calaamad ku dhigan cabbirka aan ku habboonin. Shabakadaha xor ah, xidhida traverse-ka xeerka compass iyo faylalka goobta RW5, GSI, JobXML ama CSV ayaa ku jira, barooyinka la hagaajiyay waxay u kaydiyaan CSV. Godad furan. Godad furan… wuxuu tusaalooyinka godka u beddelaa moodel block, iyo godka ugu dambeeya gudaha xagga jeexjeexkaaga, oo leh nisbadda xariiqda, miis sida sariirta ah iyo curve-ka heerka iyo tirada. Godad isku dhex jira sida factor-ka dakhliga iyo jadwal wax soo saar oo leh cash flow la dhimay ayaa sidoo kale jira. Xidhiidhada raadiyaha. Xidhiidhada raadiyaha… wuxuu hubiyaa aragga toosan ee dhulkaaga iyo kor-u-kaca dhulka, Fresnel-ka koowaad, miisaaniyadda xidhiidhka, marginka ifka iyo khasaaraha multipath, wuxuuna siiyaa dhererka tiirka ee jidka cadaynaya. Waxa kale oo samaynaya miisaaniyadda khasaaraha fiberka, tirada jidka iyo dabaysha tiirka. Laf-jeexyada tareenka. Laf-jeexyada tareenka… wuxuu sameeyaa laf-jeex lambarka frog-ka, isgoysyada u dhexeeya jidadka isle'eg iyo cabbirka dhismaha ee dhinac u jeexjeexan cant-ka oo ballac lagu daro wareeg. Laf-jeex waxa laga dhigi karaa isteeshan khad waddo. Eeg Ciidda, isgoysyada, hagaajinta sahaminta, godadka, xidhiidhada raadiyaha iyo laf-jeexyada. App kasta Luqadaha. 54 luqadood, toban ka mid ah cusub. Luqadaha ka baxsan Ingiriisiga waa qoraalo mishiin ilaa uu hadal dhalad ah akhriyo. Mawduucyada caawinta weli inta badan Ingiriisi ayay yihiin. Safafka qalabka. Dejinta › Guud › Safafka qalabka: Wrap (sida hore), 2 saf ama 1 safka. Ribbon-ka CivilCraft wuxuu tusaa qalabka ugu badan la isticmaalo oo weyn, kuwa xiga yaryar, kuwa kalena ka dambeeya fallaadha magaca kooxda. Qalabka gelinta. Trackpad, qalin, mouse 3D, kontoroolar iyo MIDI ayaa app-yada wadi kara. Dhibaatooyinka. Garab Dhibaatooyinka ah oo digaya app kasta, oo leh hubinno akhrinaya pack-yada xeerarka. Live. Muuqaal ah cidda meesha ku jirta kal-fadhiga toosan. Kordhinno. Liis add-on-yo ah, oo ay ku jiraan add-on-yada iftiinka. Ku xidh AI-gaaga. Kaalmo kasta oo aad ku xirto wuu wadi karaa qalabka CivilCraft. Waxa uu leeyahay qoraal ah in xidhidda hal-riix gudaha CadCraft Studio iyo xidhiiyaha martida aysan wali diyaar ahayn. Eeg Kaaliye AI ha kugu shaqeeyo goobtaada. La saxay 0.8.1 Qaybta fasalada DWG. Waxa loo akhriyay nooc qaldan (GitHub cadcraft#5). Waa la saxay CivilCraft iyo CadCraft, BimCraft, ModelCraft iyo TakeoffCraft. Beddelka luqadda marka la shaqeynayo. CadCraft Studio iyo nooca la xirey waxay beddeli karaan luqadda waqtiga shaqada. Ka hor waxay ahaayeen Ingiriisi keliya. Weli kuma tijaabinna dhammaan madal-badeedyada: noo sheeg haddii luqaddu beddelmin. Weli ma jiraan nooca tan Kuwani waa qalab xisaabin. Natiijo kasta daaqadaha cusub waxa u baahan hubin injineer. Xoogga ciidda wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qiyamka caadiga ah ee kooxda ciidda, daaqaduna waa sheegtaa. Roob ha da'o. Shaqada goobta muunadda waxay qaadan kartaa in ka badan laba daqiiqo browser-ka unug fiican. Waxa lagu hubiyay kiisaska gacanta iyo biyo-ku-urayaa V-shaped ah, lama haysto goob jeexjeexan oo dhab ah wali. Cinwaanka ilaa goobta. Waxa ay akhrisaa faylalka xogta furan ee aad keento, waxayna tijaabiyey faylalkeenna keliya. Geedaha ma aha ilo. Ilaha adiga kuu soo qaadida waxay sugaysaa qoraalka asturnaanta. Horumarka sahamyada. Waxa lagu tijaabiyay sahamyo la sameeyay oo keliya. Horumarka xaashiyada iyo calaamadaha (MarkupCraft) iyo scan-ka marka la barbardhigo model-ka (BimCraft) lama dhisin. Ciidda iyo jeexjeexyada. Dusha wareeg keliya: ma jiro raadinta wedge ama block iyo ma jiro dillaaca xoogga (tension crack). Isgoysyada. Hal raadiyo lug kasta, ma jiro jidadka wareejinta baabuurta, mana gelaan kooridorka weli. Faylalka goobta. Akhriyeyaashu waxa loo qoray qeexitaanka qaabka dadweynaha, waxaana lagu tijaabiyay faylal aan sameynay. Faylalka qalabka dhabta ah ayaa la rabaa. Xidhiidhada iyo rail-ka. Xidhiidhada raadiyaha: khasaaraha meel bannaan iyo multipath keliya (ma jiro ifka roobka ama qaabka antenna-ha), mana jiro heer rail-ka caadi ah: xadka kasta ee rail-ka waa meel-hayn, tirooyin qabyo ah oo aan injineer rail ah hubin. Windows iyo macOS. 0.8 lama saxiixin code-ka. Windows waxay digi kartaa, macOS-na wuxuu weydiiyaa midig-guji kadibna Fur. Waxa kale oo dhan waxa ku jira Wali lama dhisin. Nooca hore, eeg Waxa cusub 0.7.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-7","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Waxa cusub ee 0.7 (hore)","summary":"CivilCraft 0.7 wuxuu ku daraa Shaqada xariiqyada korontada (xariiqyo sare iyo kable dhulka hoostiisa ah, oo leh maktabadahaaga, hoos-u-dhaca iyo xoogga, hubinta fogaanta iyo adkaanta, miisaska xariiqyada, tirooyinka, xaashiyada iyo GIS), Shaqada beerta (liiska geedaha, qorshayaasha beeristaa iyo jadwalada, simaynta dhulka beerta, duubista iyo derbiyada, biyo-qulqulka, xaashiyada beerta iyo shayada xor ah), tirooyinka dhismaha leh xadadka aad qortid iyo saacadaha qorraxda, clothoid spirals, kooridorada laga dhisay qaybo dhinac kasta, dhoofinta USD iyo qalab badan oo caawiyeyaasha AI.","section":"start","order":7,"keywords":["waxa cusub 0.7","nooca hore","qoraalka sii deynta","liiska isbedelada","isbedel","0.7","nooca","astaamaha cusub","beerta","shaqada beerta","liiska geedaha","geedaha","beeristaa","jadwalka geedaha","geed","xaleen","simaynta dhulka","plaatfoom","berm","swale","dhibcaha dhererka","falanqaynta nuugga","biyo ku taagan","dhul adag","duubis","waddo","derbi","kerb","kontuur","biyo-qulqulka","sprinkler","drip","xaashiyada beerta","shayada xor ah","tirada dhismaha","qaabka dhismaha","dhererka guud ee dabaqa","xadka","dhererka ka hor","sinaha","qorraxda","hooska","nisbada dhulka dabaqa","dabool","saacadaha qorraxda","ifc","ku horumari bimcraft","spiral","clothoid","isbedel","qaab dhismo","curb","gutter","sidewalk","usd","caawiyeyaasha","unugyada","af-bortuqiis"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"shaqada-beerta","text":"Shaqada beerta","level":3},{"id":"shaqada-xariiqyada-korontada","text":"Shaqada xariiqyada korontada","level":3},{"id":"cabbirka","text":"Cabbirka","level":3},{"id":"tirooyinka-dhismaha","text":"Tirooyinka dhismaha","level":3},{"id":"jihaynta","text":"Jihaynta","level":3},{"id":"kooridoorada","text":"Kooridoorada","level":3},{"id":"faylalka-3d","text":"Faylalka 3D","level":3},{"id":"caawiyeyaasha-ai","text":"Caawiyeyaasha AI","level":3},{"id":"dhammaan-barnaamijyada","text":"Dhammaan barnaamijyada","level":2},{"id":"aan-weli-ku-jirin-nooca-hadda","text":"Aan weli ku jirin nooca hadda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWaa wax ka beddelay CivilCraft 0.7, marka la barbar dhigo 0.6. Qaybaha cusub ee ugu waaweyn waa Shaqada xariiqyada korontada iyo Shaqada beerta, iyo tirooyinka dhismaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"shaqada-beerta\"\u003EShaqada beerta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShaqada beerta isla goobta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaqada beerta\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku daraysaa qalabka beeristaa, simaynta dhulka, dhul adag, iyo biyo-qulqulka goobta aad horey u lahayd: isla dhibcaha sahanka, isla dusha iyo isla faylka mashruuca. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ECivil\u003C/strong\u003E hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EShaqo\u003C/strong\u003E si aad dib ugu noqoto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape\"\u003EShaqada beerta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiiska geedaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku dhowaad 420 geed, xaleen, geedo hoose, cawska, geedo sanadle ah, dhul daboolayaal iyo kor u fuulayaal oo caadi ah oo meel dhexe iyo Mediterranean ah, oo leh cabbirradooda markii la beerayo iyo markii ay weynaadaan, heerka qaboowga, iftiinka, biyaha iyo masaafada. Raadi magac kasta oo Ingiriis, Isbaanish ama Bortuqiis ah. Liistaada ku soo rar CSV; waxay ku kaydsan tahay mashruuca. Cabbirrada ku jira waa kuwo caadi ah oo la soo wareejiyey: ku hubi beerta maxaliga ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plant-list\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plant-list\"\u003ELiiska geedaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshayaasha beeristaa.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeed\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geedo keligood ah ku dhigaa dhulka oo raacaa simaynta dambe, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeer\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa qaab masaafada geedaha oo leh isku-dhafka boqolkiiba, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaleen\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa hal ama laba safar oo dhanka khadka ah. Geedaha qorshaha ayaa lagu calaamadeeyaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/planting\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/planting\"\u003EQorshayaasha beeristaa iyo jadwalada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJadwalka geedaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax dheeraad ah › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwalka geedaha…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa geedaha sida noocyada iyo cabbirka beerista. Kaydi sida CSV ama XLSX, ama u dir TakeoffCraft si loo qiimeeyo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/planting#the-plant-schedule\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/planting\" data-hash=\"the-plant-schedule\"\u003EJadwalka geedaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESimaynta dhulka beerta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimaynta dhulka\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay dusha (sinaha ama hoos u dhac), berm-yo, swale-yo, iyo meelo simayn ah oo leh dhibcaha dhererka iyo kontuur aad jiiqdo. Goynta iyo buuxinta waxay muuqdaan intaad socoto. \u003Cstrong\u003EFalanqaynta nuugga\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dusha ku midabeeyaa laba xadka aad leedahay, \u003Cstrong\u003EFallaadhaha socodka iyo biyo ku taagan\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa meelaha biyuhu socdaan iyo meelaha ay ku taagan lahaayeen. Dhammaan waxaa lagu daraa dusha cusub ee la soo jeediyey, oo ay ku jiraan dhulka-saldhigyada iyo kooridorada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-grading\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-grading\"\u003ESimaynta dhulka beerta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDuubista, jidadka, derbiyada, kerbs-ka, dhulka u dhaca iyo tallaabooyinka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhul adag\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa duubis leh sinaha dhinaca ama hoos-u-dhac loo maro biyaha, qaab iyo lakabyadooda; jidad raacaya dhulka; derbiyo dhulka haya iyo kuwa xor ah oo leh aasaas tallaabo-tallaabo ah; kerbs-yo; iyo dhulka u dhaca iyo tallaabooyinka oo la hubiyo xadadka aad dejiso. Derbi dhulka haya oo ka weyn 1.2 m (4 ft) injineer ayaa loo calaamadeeyaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/hardscape\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/hardscape\"\u003EDuubista, derbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalab xisaab caawiye oo biyo-qulqulka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa madaxyada, xariiqyada laterals-ka, tuubada weyn, valfyada, xariiqyada qoyska iyo barta xidhiidhka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi nidaamka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka helaa aagagga tuubooyinka, wuxuuna xisaabiyaa socodka aag kasta, cadaadiska loo baahan yahay valfkiisa iyo bixiyaha (Hazen–Williams), roobka, wakhtiga shubka, daboolka iyo liiska alaabta. Waa qalab xisaab caawiye, ma aha shahaado naqshadeed: naqshadeeye biyo-qulqulka ayaa natiijo kasta hubiya. Madaxyada waa noocyo guud, ama kuwaaga aad ka soo rarto fayl. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/irrigation\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/irrigation\"\u003ENaqshadaynta biyo-qulqulka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashiyada beerta.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax dheeraad ah › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada beerta…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa qorshayaasha beeristaa, simaynta dhulka iyo biyo-qulqulka oo leh astaamahooda, iyo xaashi faahfaahin ah oo qaybo derbiyada, qaababka duubista iyo tallaabooyinka ku jira, dhammaan PDF hal ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-sheets\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-sheets\"\u003EXaashiyada beerta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShayada xor ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax dheeraad ah › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay xor ah…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa shabaq STL, OBJ ama shay maktabad ah oo laga sameeyey barnaamij kale, sida beer-dhire ama farshaxan. Waxay saaran tahay dhulka ama way ku gooyaa, mugeeda, aaggeeda iyo raadkeeda ayaa la tiriyaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/freeform-objects\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/freeform-objects\"\u003EShayada xor ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC beerta.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax dheeraad ah › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi beerta IFC\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa geedaha (sida noolaha leh hantidooda), dhul adag iyo shayada xor ah sida IFC 4.3 moodel BIM ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/planting#ifc\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/planting\" data-hash=\"ifc\"\u003EIFC\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilow ilaa dhammaad.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-walkthrough\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-walkthrough\"\u003ENaqshadee beer, bilow ilaa dhammaad\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu ku marsadaa shaqada oo dhan goobta tusaalaha ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"shaqada-xariiqyada-korontada\"\u003EShaqada xariiqyada korontada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyo sare iyo kable dhulka hoostiisa ah goobtaada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaqada xariiqyada korontada\u003C/span\u003E: sawir xariiq adigoo isticmaalaya taageerayaasha, kablayaasha tuunooyinka, qalabka iyo caqabadaha, isla dhulka iyo isla faylka mashruuca. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-lines\"\u003EShaqada xariiqyada korontada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabadahaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Hogaanka, kablayaasha, taageerayaasha, qalabka (xarriiqyada hoose, dhaqdhaqaaqa, xidhidhiyayaasha, xidhmooyinka, xargaha, gaadiidyada korontada, kabadaha, isku-xidhka) iyo noocyada tuunooyinka, oo ku jira qaybo aad magacowdo, oo la wadaago fayl ama miis xisaab. Ma jirto katalog dal ama soo saare laga dhisay; tusaalooyinku waxay sheegayaan inay yihiin tusaalooyin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-library\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-library\"\u003EMaktabadda xariiqyada korontada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHoos-u-dhac iyo xoog, hoos kiisaska culeyskaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Kulayl, dabayl, barafka iyo barafka hal dhinac; xadadka xoogga oo ah qayb ka mid ah xoogga jabka; catenary-ga saxda ah ee dhammaan dhererka, oo ay ku jiraan jiifka; miisaska fiilada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sag-and-tension\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sag-and-tension\"\u003EHoos-u-dhaca iyo xoogga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubinno, had iyo jeer cusub.\u003C/strong\u003E Fogaanta dhulka iyo caqabadaha, masaafada fayzka, dhaqdhaqaaqa kabadda, kor-u-kac, culeyska taageerayaasha oo leh cabbirka maktabadaada, xidhmooyinka, aasaaska, xogta maqan, kablayaasha la jaraa, culeyska xad-dhaafka ah iyo hoos-u-dhaca korontada, oo lagu calaamadeeyey qorshaha iyo profile-ka xariiqa. Qalab naqshadeed: injineer ayaa hubiya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-checks\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-checks\"\u003EHubinta xariiqyada korontada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaska, xaashiyada iyo GIS.\u003C/strong\u003E Miisaska fiilada iyo taageerayaasha, tirooyinka (CSV, Excel, TakeoffCraft), xaashiyada qorshaha iyo profile-ka oo leh warbixin daraasad hal PDF, lakabyada GIS oo leh xogta hantida kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-outputs\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-outputs\"\u003EMiisaska, tirooyinka, xaashiyada iyo GIS ee xariiqyada korontada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku dayga kadib.\u003C/strong\u003E Profile-ka xariiqa wuxuu raacaa xariiqa aad dooratay, wuxuu leeyahay liis \u003Cstrong\u003EXariiq\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuu akhrinayaa dhulka, kablaha iyo fogaanta hoosteeda ee calaamadda, wuxuuna cabbiraa intaa u dhexeysa labo barood. Dhirta iyo derbiyada shabakadu waxay yihiin caqabado hoosta xariiqyada; waddooyinka kablayaasha iyo tuubooyinka waxay muuqdaan profile-ka xariiqa, oo waxay isku gudbaan xeer fogaan aad dooratay; \u003Cstrong\u003EXeerarka…\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku taal fogaan kasta wuxuu furaa xeerarkaaga; xeerarka oo leh maktabado waxay u kaydsan yihiin xirmooyin la wadaago dal ahaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-checks\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-checks\"\u003EHubinta xariiqyada korontada\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sag-and-tension#packs-rules-and-a-library-for-a-country\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sag-and-tension\" data-hash=\"packs-rules-and-a-library-for-a-country\"\u003EXirmooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyada faylashaada.\u003C/strong\u003E Xariiqyada korontada waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylka mashruuca CivilCraft; maktabadaha waxay ku kaydsan yihiin \u003Ccode\u003E.cclines.json\u003C/code\u003E ama CSV; xeerarka iyo xirmooyinka waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylal JSON gaar ah. Qof walba wuu akhrin ama beddeli karaa. Faylka daraasadda \u003Ccode\u003E.DON\u003C/code\u003E waa mid dheeraad ah oo la soo dejiyo iyo la dhoofiyo oo ka dhinac ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylal daraasadeed (.DON), aan la tijaabin.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku kaydi xariiq sida faylka daraasadda \u003Ccode\u003E.DON\u003C/code\u003E barnaamij xariiq kale, ama akhri taageerayaasha mid ka mid ah; waxaa laga dhisay magacyada goobta qaabka, weli lama tijaabin barnaamijkaas. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-study-file\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-study-file\"\u003EFaylalka daraasadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cabbirka\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka cabbirka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu cabbiraa qorshaha: dhererka iyo jihada dhinac kasta, wadarta socota, dhererka dhulka marka lagu jiro iyo sinaha, iyo aagga iyo perimeter-ka marka aad xidhto qaabka. Waxba lama sawirin mashruuca. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/measure\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tirooyinka-dhismaha\"\u003ETirooyinka dhismaha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir tirooyinka dhismaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Properties ku jira, hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ETirooyinka dhismaha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir tiro\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyin\u003C/span\u003E). Tiro kasta siiso dabaqyo iyo dhererka dabaqa oo akhri aagga guud ee dabaqa. Dooro sida ay ugu jirto dhul-jiiran (tallaabo, podium ama goyn) oo arag buuxinta iyo goynta. Tirooyinku waxay muuqdaan qorshaha, PDF-ka, iyo DWG iyo DXF oo lakabyo gaar ah ku jira. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/building-masses\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/building-masses\"\u003ESawirka tirooyinka dhismaha goobta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix iyo jiid 3D.\u003C/strong\u003E Aragga 3D, jiid saqafka tiro la doortay, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, si aad u beddesho dabaq mar, hal tallaabo ka ka noqoshada. \u003Cstrong\u003EQorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E waxay soo saartaa hooska tirooyinka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/building-masses#in-the-3d-view\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/building-masses\" data-hash=\"in-the-3d-view\"\u003EAragga 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadadka qaabeynta aad qortid.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhererka laga cabbiro xariiqa waddada, xadka dhererka, xadka hooska-saamaynta, nisbada aagga dabaqa, iyo daboolka. Qaabka dhismaha ee la dhisi karo wuxuu muujiyaa qorshaha, tiro kasta waxay helaysaa calaamad saxan ama khalad ah xad kasta. CivilCraft ma leh xeer magaalo gudaha ah: tiro kasta waa mid aad ka qortid amarkaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/zoning-limits\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/zoning-limits\"\u003EHubi tirooyinka marka loo eego xadadka aad qortid\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaacadaha qorraxda.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro maalin, ama xilli, iyo aag waqti magac ama kala-duwanaansho, oo akhri saacadaha qorraxda toos ah derbi kasta oo tiro kasta, dabaq kasta, iyo dhulka ku wareegsan, oo lagu sawiro qorshaha. Derbiyada iyo dhulka kaydi sida CSV. Mashruucu wuxuu u baahan yahay nidaamka isku-xidhka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sun-hours\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sun-hours\"\u003EHubi saacadaha qorraxda goobta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirooyin sida IFC, iyo ku sii wad BimCraft.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka IFC ahaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa tirooyinka sida IFC4, meel khariidadda ku jira marka mashruucu leeyahay nidaamka isku-xidhka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu horumari BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa BimCraft tab cusub oo tirooyinka ku jira, halkaas oo \u003Cstrong\u003EKu horumari tirada tan\u003C/strong\u003E uu dhisayo derbiyada dabaq kasta iyo dabaq ka dhisan aaga. Waxba lama soo rarin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/building-masses#send-it-on\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/building-masses\" data-hash=\"send-it-on\"\u003EKu dir\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"jihaynta\"\u003EJihaynta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EClothoid spirals.\u003C/strong\u003E Qor dherer \u003Cstrong\u003ESpiral gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESpiral dibada\u003C/strong\u003E miiska PI ee curve: tangent, spiral, curve, spiral, tangent, oo leh dherer isku mid ah ama kala duwan. Qorshuhu wuxuu calaamadiyaa TS, SC, CS iyo ST, liiska curve-ka wuxuu bixiyaa θs iyo masaafooyinka tangent-ka iyo dibadda, goobaha iyo kala-fogaanta waxay mari spiralada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/alignment#spirals\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/alignment\" data-hash=\"spirals\"\u003ESpirals\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpiralada LandXML.\u003C/strong\u003E LandXML wuxuu qoraa oo wuxuu akhrinayaa clothoid spirals. Jihaynta leh spiralada, oo CivilCraft markii hore dhex-dhex uga dhaafi jirtay marka la soo dejiyo, hadda way furmaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landxml\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landxml\"\u003EIs-wada-dhoofi LandXML\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kooridoorada\"\u003EKooridoorada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac kasta ka dhis qaybo.\u003C/strong\u003E Hubi \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac kasta ka dhis qaybo\u003C/strong\u003E si dhinac kasta u helo liiskiisa u bilaabma dhexda xariiqa ilaa dibada: waddooyin, garab, gutter, curb, xariiq beeris, sidewalk, iyo sinaha dhinaca oo leh goynteeda iyo buuxinteeda. Ka bilow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaddo miyi\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaddo magaalo\u003C/span\u003E oo dhinac hal ah ku koobiyee dhinaca kale. Qaybaha tooska ah waxay calaamadinayaan khadka socodka, curb-ka iyo socodka, dusha la simeeyey wuxuu leeyahay curb-ka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor#build-each-side-from-parts\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor\" data-hash=\"build-each-side-from-parts\"\u003EDhinac kasta ka dhis qaybo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESare-isku-kor spiralada.\u003C/strong\u003E Curve leh spiralada, sare-isku-korka wuxuu u socdaa spiralka: heer sare TS, sare-isku-kor oo dhammaystiran SC. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor#superelevation\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor\" data-hash=\"superelevation\"\u003ESare-isku-kor\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"faylalka-3d\"\u003EFaylalka 3D\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofinta USD.\u003C/strong\u003E Aragga 3D, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa goobta sida \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E cabbirka dhabta ah iyo isku-xidhka mashruuca: dushaha, tuubooyinka iyo qaababka sida shabaqyo, xariiqyada, alignment kasta, iyo dhibcaha sahanka oo leh lambarradooda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/usd\"\u003EDhoofinta goobta 3D ee USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"caawiyeyaasha-ai\"\u003ECaawiyeyaasha AI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax dheeraad ah caawiyeyaasha.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka caawiyeyaasha lagu daro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/span\u003E, caawiye wuxuu hadda sidoo kale akhrin karaa parcels, goyn iyo buuxin, profiles, wuxuu ku dari karaa dhibcaha sahanka, wuxuu kaydin karaa mashruuca, wuxuu dhoofin karaa LandXML, DWG iyo USD, wuxuuna ku shaqayn karaa faylal aad dooratay gudaha CadCraft Studio. Shaqada beerta waxay ku darinaysaa qalab si loo helo geedaha, loo beero geedaha, beerta iyo xaleenka, loo simeeyo dhulka, iyo loo hubiyo biyo-qulqulka. Server-ka faylka iyo amarka \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E waxay furaan mashruucyada la kaydiyey iyagoon daaqad la furin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/assistants\"\u003EKa dhig caawiye AI inuu kaa shaqeeyo goobtaada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhammaan-barnaamijyada\"\u003EDhammaan barnaamijyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnugyada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay liis kasta oo dhererka, aagga, mugga, xagasha iyo sinaha, oo leh cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidda unugyada (cagta sahanka ee Mareykanka waa unug gaar ah). Kuwa aadan isticmaalin deji oo ka saar liisaska; hal calaamad ku qor, shaqadu waxay ku bilaabmaysaa unugga. Fayl kasta wuxuu had iyo jeer ku hayaa unuggiisa. Liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada\u003C/strong\u003E ee CivilCraft mashruuca wuxuu raacaa beddelayaasha; calaamadda dhererka mitirka ayaa mashruucyada cusub ku bilaabaysa mitirka (haddii kale feet, oo ah feet sahanka Mareykanka); calaamadda aagga ama mugga ayaa dejisa unugyada aagga iyo mugga la soo sheegayo; sanduuqa dhererkuna wuxuu aqbalaa calaamadda unug kasta, sida \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EUnugyada, qiimayaasha la qoray iyo liisaska unugyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeyn ka kaashan oo panelo la ururin karo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka qaabeynta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKooban\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa wax badan shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo taleefannada waxay haystaan badhamadooda waaweyn). Panel kasta oo dhinac ah wuxuu leeyahay qaybta cinwaanka oo jilicsan; jiid si aad u dhigto ama u kala-qaybiso panelka, ku dhig korka panel kale si aad u wadaagto hal qaab oo tabyo ah, ku xidh si uu u dhaqaaqo ilaa geesha, ama qari oo ku soo celi geesha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#make-the-layout-denser\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"make-the-layout-denser\"\u003EQaabee panelladaada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqyada wadahadalka way dhaqaaqaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Jiid sanduuq wadahadal adigoo isticmaalaya cinwaankiisa si uu uga baxo sawirka; wuxuu ku soo noqdaa meeshii aad ka tagtay. Laba jeer riix cinwaanka si uu dib dhexda ugu dhigo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#move-a-dialog\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"move-a-dialog\"\u003ESanduuq wadahadal ku dhaqaaq\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHab-raacyada caawiyeyaasha AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Toban codsi oo shaqeyn ah oo caawiyahaaga ah (nadiifi naqshadda, qorshee qaybta, hubi naqshadaha, weydii moodelka su&#039;aalo, isku-geeri miisaska, isku day kala-duwanaanshaha qaybta…), mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu wicinayo iyo ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay, oo mid kasta tijaabooyinkeenna dib u socdaaliyaan. Barnaamijyadu ma leeyihin AI. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003EHab-raacyada caawiyeyaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Portugal)\u003C/strong\u003E waa cusub \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuuqad\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Brasil)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEspañol (México)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBahasa Indonesia\u003C/strong\u003E hadda leeyihiin erayada barnaamijyada oo dhan, sida qabyo aan weli ay akhriyin qof af-hooyo ah. Mawduucyada caawinta waxay ku qoran yihiin Ingiriisi, qaarkood Isbaanish.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegaa sababta hubinta cusboonaysiinta u fashilantay (ma jiro fayl nidaamkaaga weli, ma jiro shabakad, saxiixa khalad ah) halkii uu ku odhan lahaa &quot;Dhammaaday&quot;, wuxuuna joogsadaa inuu soo celiyo kaarka Waxa cusub ee aad xirtay ilaa nooc cusub la helo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aan-weli-ku-jirin-nooca-hadda\"\u003EAan weli ku jirin nooca hadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.7 kuma saxiixnayn koodka.\u003C/strong\u003E Saxiixa iyo xirmada dukaanka Microsoft waxay u guureen 0.8 sababtoo ah hubinta shahaadada weli ma soo dhamaan. Hubi SHA-256 ka xiga fayl kasta getcadcraft.com/download. Windows, haddii SmartScreen joojiyo rakibaha, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaad dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu socodso si kastaba\u003C/span\u003E. Mac-ka, markii ugu horeysay, midig-riix CadCraft Studio oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E. CadCraft Studio weli kuma jirto dukaan barnaamij, mana jirto dhismo iPad ama iPhone ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiisaska xagasha iyo sinaha ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnugyada\u003C/span\u003E waa la kaydiyaa, laakiin weli ma jiro sanduuq akhrinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMadaxyada biyo-qulqulka ee soo saarayaasha: kaliya madaxyada guud iyo madaxyadaada aad ka soo rarto fayl. Xogta soo saarayaasha waxay imanaysaa kaliya marka ay ogolaadaan, weli mid ma la siin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft iyo ModelCraft waxay haystaan liiska geedaha, laakiin Ku dhig maktabadda ma bixiyaan geedo weli. Geedaha waxay BimCraft ku gaaraan IFC-ga beerta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabka caawiyeyaasha ee beerta wuxuu shaqeeyaa marka daaqadda CivilCraft la furan yahay; server-ka faylka iyo amarka ma haystaan weli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinka dhismaha: ma jiro iftiinka facade ama dabaysha, ma jiro hooska geedaha ama wax aan lagu sawirin sida tiro, ma jiro qaabka saqafka; saacadaha qorraxda waxay muuqdaan qorshaha, ma aha aragga 3D. Ku horumari BimCraft wuxuu dhisaa derbiyo iyo dabaq fudud, ma leh furitaan ama saqaf.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqyada korontada: ma jiro heer dal oo lagu dhisay (waxaad dejisaa culeyska, xadadka iyo fogaanta); ma jiro daraasad ku saabsan dheerinta, kulaylka dhulka hoostiisa, short-circuit, ilaalinta ama dhulka-xidhka; ma jiro xariiq aragga 3D ama IFC ah. Faylka daraasadda \u003Ccode\u003E.DON\u003C/code\u003E lama tijaabin barnaamijka akhriya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpiralada aan clothoid ahayn, spiral u dhexeeya laba curve, iyo spiralada xariiqyada muuqaalka. Spiralada waxaa lagu hubiyey qaacidooyinka iyo qaabka LandXML; weli lama hubin fayl LandXML oo spiral leh oo barnaamij kale ka soo baxay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJihaynta kooridorka ee isbeddela wadada dhexdeeda, gobollada, iyo beegsiga dhinaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqyada biyaha iyo shabakadaha cadaadiska (shaqada dhismaha ee soo socota), socodka isbeddela waqtiga, iyo xidhiidhka shabakadaha biyaha iyo kuwa roobka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqyada jajabka ee la sawiray. Miisaska gaadiidka naqshadeynta caadiga ah: shanta gaari ee la soo rarayo waa placeholders. Xariiqyada qaabka ee la wadaago mashruucyada waxay sugayaan mashruucyada kooxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo dhan waxaa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waa wax ka beddelay CivilCraft 0.7, marka la barbar dhigo 0.6. Qaybaha cusub ee ugu waaweyn waa Shaqada xariiqyada korontada iyo Shaqada beerta, iyo tirooyinka dhismaha. Cusub Shaqada beerta Shaqada beerta isla goobta. Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Shaqada beerta waxay ku daraysaa qalabka beeristaa, simaynta dhulka, dhul adag, iyo biyo-qulqulka goobta aad horey u lahayd: isla dhibcaha sahanka, isla dusha iyo isla faylka mashruuca. Dooro Civil hoos Shaqo si aad dib ugu noqoto. Eeg Shaqada beerta. Liiska geedaha. Ku dhowaad 420 geed, xaleen, geedo hoose, cawska, geedo sanadle ah, dhul daboolayaal iyo kor u fuulayaal oo caadi ah oo meel dhexe iyo Mediterranean ah, oo leh cabbirradooda markii la beerayo iyo markii ay weynaadaan, heerka qaboowga, iftiinka, biyaha iyo masaafada. Raadi magac kasta oo Ingiriis, Isbaanish ama Bortuqiis ah. Liistaada ku soo rar CSV; waxay ku kaydsan tahay mashruuca. Cabbirrada ku jira waa kuwo caadi ah oo la soo wareejiyey: ku hubi beerta maxaliga ah. Eeg Liiska geedaha. Qorshayaasha beeristaa. Geed wuxuu geedo keligood ah ku dhigaa dhulka oo raacaa simaynta dambe, Beer wuxuu buuxiyaa qaab masaafada geedaha oo leh isku-dhafka boqolkiiba, Xaleen wuxuu dhigaa hal ama laba safar oo dhanka khadka ah. Geedaha qorshaha ayaa lagu calaamadeeyaa. Eeg Qorshayaasha beeristaa iyo jadwalada. Jadwalka geedaha. Wax dheeraad ah › Jadwalka geedaha… wuxuu tiriyaa geedaha sida noocyada iyo cabbirka beerista. Kaydi sida CSV ama XLSX, ama u dir TakeoffCraft si loo qiimeeyo. Eeg Jadwalka geedaha. Simaynta dhulka beerta. Simaynta dhulka waxay leedahay dusha (sinaha ama hoos u dhac), berm-yo, swale-yo, iyo meelo simayn ah oo leh dhibcaha dhererka iyo kontuur aad jiiqdo. Goynta iyo buuxinta waxay muuqdaan intaad socoto. Falanqaynta nuugga wuxuu dusha ku midabeeyaa laba xadka aad leedahay, Fallaadhaha socodka iyo biyo ku taagan wuxuu muujinayaa meelaha biyuhu socdaan iyo meelaha ay ku taagan lahaayeen. Dhammaan waxaa lagu daraa dusha cusub ee la soo jeediyey, oo ay ku jiraan dhulka-saldhigyada iyo kooridorada. Eeg Simaynta dhulka beerta. Duubista, jidadka, derbiyada, kerbs-ka, dhulka u dhaca iyo tallaabooyinka. Dhul adag wuxuu sawiraa duubis leh sinaha dhinaca ama hoos-u-dhac loo maro biyaha, qaab iyo lakabyadooda; jidad raacaya dhulka; derbiyo dhulka haya iyo kuwa xor ah oo leh aasaas tallaabo-tallaabo ah; kerbs-yo; iyo dhulka u dhaca iyo tallaabooyinka oo la hubiyo xadadka aad dejiso. Derbi dhulka haya oo ka weyn 1.2 m (4 ft) injineer ayaa loo calaamadeeyaa. Eeg Duubista, derbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka. Qalab xisaab caawiye oo biyo-qulqulka. Biyo-qulqulka wuxuu dhigaa madaxyada, xariiqyada laterals-ka, tuubada weyn, valfyada, xariiqyada qoyska iyo barta xidhiidhka. Hubi nidaamka… wuxuu ka helaa aagagga tuubooyinka, wuxuuna xisaabiyaa socodka aag kasta, cadaadiska loo baahan yahay valfkiisa iyo bixiyaha (Hazen–Williams), roobka, wakhtiga shubka, daboolka iyo liiska alaabta. Waa qalab xisaab caawiye, ma aha shahaado naqshadeed: naqshadeeye biyo-qulqulka ayaa natiijo kasta hubiya. Madaxyada waa noocyo guud, ama kuwaaga aad ka soo rarto fayl. Eeg Naqshadaynta biyo-qulqulka. Xaashiyada beerta. Wax dheeraad ah › Xaashiyada beerta… wuxuu sameeyaa qorshayaasha beeristaa, simaynta dhulka iyo biyo-qulqulka oo leh astaamahooda, iyo xaashi faahfaahin ah oo qaybo derbiyada, qaababka duubista iyo tallaabooyinka ku jira, dhammaan PDF hal ah. Eeg Xaashiyada beerta. Shayada xor ah. Wax dheeraad ah › Shay xor ah… wuxuu dhigaa shabaq STL, OBJ ama shay maktabad ah oo laga sameeyey barnaamij kale, sida beer-dhire ama farshaxan. Waxay saaran tahay dhulka ama way ku gooyaa, mugeeda, aaggeeda iyo raadkeeda ayaa la tiriyaa. Eeg Shayada xor ah. IFC beerta. Wax dheeraad ah › Dhoofi beerta IFC wuxuu kaydiyaa geedaha (sida noolaha leh hantidooda), dhul adag iyo shayada xor ah sida IFC 4.3 moodel BIM ah. Eeg IFC. Bilow ilaa dhammaad. Naqshadee beer, bilow ilaa dhammaad wuxuu ku marsadaa shaqada oo dhan goobta tusaalaha ah. Shaqada xariiqyada korontada Xariiqyo sare iyo kable dhulka hoostiisa ah goobtaada. Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Shaqada xariiqyada korontada: sawir xariiq adigoo isticmaalaya taageerayaasha, kablayaasha tuunooyinka, qalabka iyo caqabadaha, isla dhulka iyo isla faylka mashruuca. Eeg Shaqada xariiqyada korontada. Maktabadahaaga. Hogaanka, kablayaasha, taageerayaasha, qalabka (xarriiqyada hoose, dhaqdhaqaaqa, xidhidhiyayaasha, xidhmooyinka, xargaha, gaadiidyada korontada, kabadaha, isku-xidhka) iyo noocyada tuunooyinka, oo ku jira qaybo aad magacowdo, oo la wadaago fayl ama miis xisaab. Ma jirto katalog dal ama soo saare laga dhisay; tusaalooyinku waxay sheegayaan inay yihiin tusaalooyin. Eeg Maktabadda xariiqyada korontada. Hoos-u-dhac iyo xoog, hoos kiisaska culeyskaaga. Kulayl, dabayl, barafka iyo barafka hal dhinac; xadadka xoogga oo ah qayb ka mid ah xoogga jabka; catenary-ga saxda ah ee dhammaan dhererka, oo ay ku jiraan jiifka; miisaska fiilada. Eeg Hoos-u-dhaca iyo xoogga. Hubinno, had iyo jeer cusub. Fogaanta dhulka iyo caqabadaha, masaafada fayzka, dhaqdhaqaaqa kabadda, kor-u-kac, culeyska taageerayaasha oo leh cabbirka maktabadaada, xidhmooyinka, aasaaska, xogta maqan, kablayaasha la jaraa, culeyska xad-dhaafka ah iyo hoos-u-dhaca korontada, oo lagu calaamadeeyey qorshaha iyo profile-ka xariiqa. Qalab naqshadeed: injineer ayaa hubiya. Eeg Hubinta xariiqyada korontada. Miisaska, xaashiyada iyo GIS. Miisaska fiilada iyo taageerayaasha, tirooyinka (CSV, Excel, TakeoffCraft), xaashiyada qorshaha iyo profile-ka oo leh warbixin daraasad hal PDF, lakabyada GIS oo leh xogta hantida kasta. Eeg Miisaska, tirooyinka, xaashiyada iyo GIS ee xariiqyada korontada. Isku dayga kadib. Profile-ka xariiqa wuxuu raacaa xariiqa aad dooratay, wuxuu leeyahay liis Xariiq, wuxuu akhrinayaa dhulka, kablaha iyo fogaanta hoosteeda ee calaamadda, wuxuuna cabbiraa intaa u dhexeysa labo barood. Dhirta iyo derbiyada shabakadu waxay yihiin caqabado hoosta xariiqyada; waddooyinka kablayaasha iyo tuubooyinka waxay muuqdaan profile-ka xariiqa, oo waxay isku gudbaan xeer fogaan aad dooratay; Xeerarka… oo ku taal fogaan kasta wuxuu furaa xeerarkaaga; xeerarka oo leh maktabado waxay u kaydsan yihiin xirmooyin la wadaago dal ahaan. Eeg Hubinta xariiqyada korontada iyo Xirmooyinka. Noocyada faylashaada. Xariiqyada korontada waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylka mashruuca CivilCraft; maktabadaha waxay ku kaydsan yihiin .cclines.json ama CSV; xeerarka iyo xirmooyinka waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylal JSON gaar ah. Qof walba wuu akhrin ama beddeli karaa. Faylka daraasadda .DON waa mid dheeraad ah oo la soo dejiyo iyo la dhoofiyo oo ka dhinac ah. Faylal daraasadeed (.DON), aan la tijaabin. Ku kaydi xariiq sida faylka daraasadda .DON barnaamij xariiq kale, ama akhri taageerayaasha mid ka mid ah; waxaa laga dhisay magacyada goobta qaabka, weli lama tijaabin barnaamijkaas. Eeg Faylalka daraasadda. Cabbirka Qalabka cabbirka. Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Qiyaas (ama M) wuxuu cabbiraa qorshaha: dhererka iyo jihada dhinac kasta, wadarta socota, dhererka dhulka marka lagu jiro iyo sinaha, iyo aagga iyo perimeter-ka marka aad xidhto qaabka. Waxba lama sawirin mashruuca. Eeg Qiyaas. Tirooyinka dhismaha Sawir tirooyinka dhismaha. Properties ku jira, hoos Tirooyinka dhismaha, Sawir tiro (ama Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Tirooyin). Tiro kasta siiso dabaqyo iyo dhererka dabaqa oo akhri aagga guud ee dabaqa. Dooro sida ay ugu jirto dhul-jiiran (tallaabo, podium ama goyn) oo arag buuxinta iyo goynta. Tirooyinku waxay muuqdaan qorshaha, PDF-ka, iyo DWG iyo DXF oo lakabyo gaar ah ku jira. Eeg Sawirka tirooyinka dhismaha goobta. Riix iyo jiid 3D. Aragga 3D, jiid saqafka tiro la doortay, ama riix Page Up iyo Page Down, si aad u beddesho dabaq mar, hal tallaabo ka ka noqoshada. Qorraxda waxay soo saartaa hooska tirooyinka. Eeg Aragga 3D. Xadadka qaabeynta aad qortid. Dhererka laga cabbiro xariiqa waddada, xadka dhererka, xadka hooska-saamaynta, nisbada aagga dabaqa, iyo daboolka. Qaabka dhismaha ee la dhisi karo wuxuu muujiyaa qorshaha, tiro kasta waxay helaysaa calaamad saxan ama khalad ah xad kasta. CivilCraft ma leh xeer magaalo gudaha ah: tiro kasta waa mid aad ka qortid amarkaaga. Eeg Hubi tirooyinka marka loo eego xadadka aad qortid. Saacadaha qorraxda. Dooro maalin, ama xilli, iyo aag waqti magac ama kala-duwanaansho, oo akhri saacadaha qorraxda toos ah derbi kasta oo tiro kasta, dabaq kasta, iyo dhulka ku wareegsan, oo lagu sawiro qorshaha. Derbiyada iyo dhulka kaydi sida CSV. Mashruucu wuxuu u baahan yahay nidaamka isku-xidhka. Eeg Hubi saacadaha qorraxda goobta. Tirooyin sida IFC, iyo ku sii wad BimCraft. Tirooyinka IFC ahaan wuxuu kaydiyaa tirooyinka sida IFC4, meel khariidadda ku jira marka mashruucu leeyahay nidaamka isku-xidhka. Ku horumari BimCraft wuxuu furaa BimCraft tab cusub oo tirooyinka ku jira, halkaas oo Ku horumari tirada tan uu dhisayo derbiyada dabaq kasta iyo dabaq ka dhisan aaga. Waxba lama soo rarin. Eeg Ku dir. Jihaynta Clothoid spirals. Qor dherer Spiral gudaha iyo Spiral dibada miiska PI ee curve: tangent, spiral, curve, spiral, tangent, oo leh dherer isku mid ah ama kala duwan. Qorshuhu wuxuu calaamadiyaa TS, SC, CS iyo ST, liiska curve-ka wuxuu bixiyaa θs iyo masaafooyinka tangent-ka iyo dibadda, goobaha iyo kala-fogaanta waxay mari spiralada. Eeg Spirals. Spiralada LandXML. LandXML wuxuu qoraa oo wuxuu akhrinayaa clothoid spirals. Jihaynta leh spiralada, oo CivilCraft markii hore dhex-dhex uga dhaafi jirtay marka la soo dejiyo, hadda way furmaan. Eeg Is-wada-dhoofi LandXML. Kooridoorada Dhinac kasta ka dhis qaybo. Hubi Dhinac kasta ka dhis qaybo si dhinac kasta u helo liiskiisa u bilaabma dhexda xariiqa ilaa dibada: waddooyin, garab, gutter, curb, xariiq beeris, sidewalk, iyo sinaha dhinaca oo leh goynteeda iyo buuxinteeda. Ka bilow Waddo miyi ama Waddo magaalo oo dhinac hal ah ku koobiyee dhinaca kale. Qaybaha tooska ah waxay calaamadinayaan khadka socodka, curb-ka iyo socodka, dusha la simeeyey wuxuu leeyahay curb-ka. Eeg Dhinac kasta ka dhis qaybo. Sare-isku-kor spiralada. Curve leh spiralada, sare-isku-korka wuxuu u socdaa spiralka: heer sare TS, sare-isku-kor oo dhammaystiran SC. Eeg Sare-isku-kor. Faylalka 3D Dhoofinta USD. Aragga 3D, USD wuxuu qoraa goobta sida .usda, .usdc ama .usdz cabbirka dhabta ah iyo isku-xidhka mashruuca: dushaha, tuubooyinka iyo qaababka sida shabaqyo, xariiqyada, alignment kasta, iyo dhibcaha sahanka oo leh lambarradooda. Eeg Dhoofinta goobta 3D ee USD. Caawiyeyaasha AI Wax dheeraad ah caawiyeyaasha. Marka caawiyeyaasha lagu daro Dejinta › CivilCraft, caawiye wuxuu hadda sidoo kale akhrin karaa parcels, goyn iyo buuxin, profiles, wuxuu ku dari karaa dhibcaha sahanka, wuxuu kaydin karaa mashruuca, wuxuu dhoofin karaa LandXML, DWG iyo USD, wuxuuna ku shaqayn karaa faylal aad dooratay gudaha CadCraft Studio. Shaqada beerta waxay ku darinaysaa qalab si loo helo geedaha, loo beero geedaha, beerta iyo xaleenka, loo simeeyo dhulka, iyo loo hubiyo biyo-qulqulka. Server-ka faylka iyo amarka cadcraft waxay furaan mashruucyada la kaydiyey iyagoon daaqad la furin. Eeg Ka dhig caawiye AI inuu kaa shaqeeyo goobtaada. Dhammaan barnaamijyada Cabbirrada. Dejinta › Guud › Unugyada wuxuu leeyahay liis kasta oo dhererka, aagga, mugga, xagasha iyo sinaha, oo leh cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidda unugyada (cagta sahanka ee Mareykanka waa unug gaar ah). Kuwa aadan isticmaalin deji oo ka saar liisaska; hal calaamad ku qor, shaqadu waxay ku bilaabmaysaa unugga. Fayl kasta wuxuu had iyo jeer ku hayaa unuggiisa. Liiska Unugyada ee CivilCraft mashruuca wuxuu raacaa beddelayaasha; calaamadda dhererka mitirka ayaa mashruucyada cusub ku bilaabaysa mitirka (haddii kale feet, oo ah feet sahanka Mareykanka); calaamadda aagga ama mugga ayaa dejisa unugyada aagga iyo mugga la soo sheegayo; sanduuqa dhererkuna wuxuu aqbalaa calaamadda unug kasta, sida 3 ch ama 450 mm. Eeg Unugyada, qiimayaasha la qoray iyo liisaska unugyada. Qaabeyn ka kaashan oo panelo la ururin karo. Dejinta › Guud › Cabbirka qaabeynta › Kooban wuxuu ku daraa wax badan shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo taleefannada waxay haystaan badhamadooda waaweyn). Panel kasta oo dhinac ah wuxuu leeyahay qaybta cinwaanka oo jilicsan; jiid si aad u dhigto ama u kala-qaybiso panelka, ku dhig korka panel kale si aad u wadaagto hal qaab oo tabyo ah, ku xidh si uu u dhaqaaqo ilaa geesha, ama qari oo ku soo celi geesha. Eeg Qaabee panelladaada. Sanduuqyada wadahadalka way dhaqaaqaan. Jiid sanduuq wadahadal adigoo isticmaalaya cinwaankiisa si uu uga baxo sawirka; wuxuu ku soo noqdaa meeshii aad ka tagtay. Laba jeer riix cinwaanka si uu dib dhexda ugu dhigo. Eeg Sanduuq wadahadal ku dhaqaaq. Hab-raacyada caawiyeyaasha AI. Toban codsi oo shaqeyn ah oo caawiyahaaga ah (nadiifi naqshadda, qorshee qaybta, hubi naqshadaha, weydii moodelka su'aalo, isku-geeri miisaska, isku day kala-duwanaanshaha qaybta…), mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu wicinayo iyo ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay, oo mid kasta tijaabooyinkeenna dib u socdaaliyaan. Barnaamijyadu ma leeyihin AI. Eeg Hab-raacyada caawiyeyaasha AI. Luuqadaha. Português (Portugal) waa cusub Dejinta › Guud › Luuqad. Waxay iyo Português (Brasil), Español (México) iyo Bahasa Indonesia hadda leeyihiin erayada barnaamijyada oo dhan, sida qabyo aan weli ay akhriyin qof af-hooyo ah. Mawduucyada caawinta waxay ku qoran yihiin Ingiriisi, qaarkood Isbaanish. CadCraft Studio wuxuu sheegaa sababta hubinta cusboonaysiinta u fashilantay (ma jiro fayl nidaamkaaga weli, ma jiro shabakad, saxiixa khalad ah) halkii uu ku odhan lahaa \"Dhammaaday\", wuxuuna joogsadaa inuu soo celiyo kaarka Waxa cusub ee aad xirtay ilaa nooc cusub la helo. Aan weli ku jirin nooca hadda 0.7 kuma saxiixnayn koodka. Saxiixa iyo xirmada dukaanka Microsoft waxay u guureen 0.8 sababtoo ah hubinta shahaadada weli ma soo dhamaan. Hubi SHA-256 ka xiga fayl kasta getcadcraft.com/download. Windows, haddii SmartScreen joojiyo rakibaha, dooro Macluumaad dheeraad ah, kadibna Ku socodso si kastaba. Mac-ka, markii ugu horeysay, midig-riix CadCraft Studio oo dooro Fur. CadCraft Studio weli kuma jirto dukaan barnaamij, mana jirto dhismo iPad ama iPhone ah. Liisaska xagasha iyo sinaha ee Unugyada waa la kaydiyaa, laakiin weli ma jiro sanduuq akhrinaya. Madaxyada biyo-qulqulka ee soo saarayaasha: kaliya madaxyada guud iyo madaxyadaada aad ka soo rarto fayl. Xogta soo saarayaasha waxay imanaysaa kaliya marka ay ogolaadaan, weli mid ma la siin. BimCraft iyo ModelCraft waxay haystaan liiska geedaha, laakiin Ku dhig maktabadda ma bixiyaan geedo weli. Geedaha waxay BimCraft ku gaaraan IFC-ga beerta. Qalabka caawiyeyaasha ee beerta wuxuu shaqeeyaa marka daaqadda CivilCraft la furan yahay; server-ka faylka iyo amarka ma haystaan weli. Tirooyinka dhismaha: ma jiro iftiinka facade ama dabaysha, ma jiro hooska geedaha ama wax aan lagu sawirin sida tiro, ma jiro qaabka saqafka; saacadaha qorraxda waxay muuqdaan qorshaha, ma aha aragga 3D. Ku horumari BimCraft wuxuu dhisaa derbiyo iyo dabaq fudud, ma leh furitaan ama saqaf. Xariiqyada korontada: ma jiro heer dal oo lagu dhisay (waxaad dejisaa culeyska, xadadka iyo fogaanta); ma jiro daraasad ku saabsan dheerinta, kulaylka dhulka hoostiisa, short-circuit, ilaalinta ama dhulka-xidhka; ma jiro xariiq aragga 3D ama IFC ah. Faylka daraasadda .DON lama tijaabin barnaamijka akhriya. Spiralada aan clothoid ahayn, spiral u dhexeeya laba curve, iyo spiralada xariiqyada muuqaalka. Spiralada waxaa lagu hubiyey qaacidooyinka iyo qaabka LandXML; weli lama hubin fayl LandXML oo spiral leh oo barnaamij kale ka soo baxay. Jihaynta kooridorka ee isbeddela wadada dhexdeeda, gobollada, iyo beegsiga dhinaca. Xariiqyada biyaha iyo shabakadaha cadaadiska (shaqada dhismaha ee soo socota), socodka isbeddela waqtiga, iyo xidhiidhka shabakadaha biyaha iyo kuwa roobka. Xariiqyada jajabka ee la sawiray. Miisaska gaadiidka naqshadeynta caadiga ah: shanta gaari ee la soo rarayo waa placeholders. Xariiqyada qaabka ee la wadaago mashruucyada waxay sugayaan mashruucyada kooxda. Waxa kale oo dhan waxaa ku jira Wali lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Bilow CivilCraft","summary":"Waxa CivilCraft qabato, sida loo furo, iyo daqiiqadaha ugu horreeya ee goobta tusaalaha: barooyinka ilaa kontuurrada, waddo, iyo mashruuc la kaydiyay.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["bilow","socodsiinta koowaad","goobta tusaalaha","hordhac","bilow degdeg ah","casharka","mashruuc cusub"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-u-baahan-tahay","text":"Waxa aad u baahan tahay","level":2},{"id":"fur-civilcraft","text":"Fur CivilCraft","level":2},{"id":"daqiiqadaha-ugu-horreeya-goobta-tusaalaha","text":"Daqiiqadaha ugu horreeya: goobta tusaalaha","level":2},{"id":"waddo-gaaban-dhis","text":"Waddo gaaban dhis","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-shaqadaada","text":"Kaydi shaqadaada","level":2},{"id":"halka-aad-u-aadi-karto-xiga","text":"Halka aad u aadi karto xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft waa app-ka naqshadaynta dhulka iyo goobta ee qoyska CadCraft. Wuxuu qaadaa barooyinka sahanka wuxuuna u beddelaa dusha (TIN) oo leh kontuurro, kadibna wuxuu kuu ogolaanayaa inaad habeysid jid-hagayaasha iyo naqshadaha dhererka, aad jid korridor fudud ku dhaqaaqdo, aad padyada dhismaha u dhigtid si ay u gaaraan iftiinka (daylight), aad shabakadda tuubooyinka ee cuf-dhacaadka ku hubiso xeerarkaaga, iyo aad aragto mugga jarista iyo buuxinta. Wuxuu akhriyaa oo qoraa LandXML, wuxuu dhoofiyaa qorshaha sida DXF, wuxuuna ku plot-iyaa PDF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad isticmaashay Civil 3D, fikradaha way kuu caadi noqon doonaan: barooyin, kooxo barooyin, khadadka jebinta, jid-hagayaasha iyadoo lagu saleeyay PI, naqshadaha iyadoo lagu saleeyay PVI, korridoro, dhulka la sameeyay, shabakadda tuubooyinka. Habka aad u shaqeyso waa kala duwan, waana mid aad uga yar: ma jiro safka amarka, ma jiro qaabab (styles) iyo ma jiro fayl naqshad. Akhri \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coming-from\"\u003ESoftware-ka dhulka ee kale\u003C/a\u003E hal mar ka hor shaqadaada dhabta ah ee ugu horreysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-u-baahan-tahay\"\u003EWaxa aad u baahan tahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrowser desktop oo casri ah: Chrome, Edge, Firefox ama Safari. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowsers\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMouse ama trackpad iyo kiiboodh, ama shaashad taabasho: naqshaddu waxay leedahay badhamada shaashadda ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo dhibicda\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/keyboard#mouse-trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"mouse-trackpad-and-touch\"\u003EMouse, trackpad iyo taabasho\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu ku qoran yahay 2D canvas-ka browser-ka. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/site-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/site-3d\"\u003EMuuqaalka 3D\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa grafikada WebGL ee browser-ka; haddii aanu bilaabi karin, bar-ka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya sababta oo qorshuhu wuu shaqeynayaa weli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa jiro akoon iyo ma jiro upload. Faylalku waxay furmaan kombiyuutarkaaga oo waxay kaydiyaan sida soo dejin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EFaylalkaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft maanta wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa sida browser dhismo horeyn ah oo weli la sameynayo. Dhismayaasha desktop-ka weli ma diyaar aha, kaydinta gacan-ka-geynta (cloud) weli ma diyaar aha. Wax kasta oo aad samayso wuxuu ku sii jiraa kombiyuutarkaaga ilaa aad kaydiso ama dhoofiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-civilcraft\"\u003EFur CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur CivilCraft browser-kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug shaashaddu inay buuxso: qalab bar ah oo sare, panel bidix, qorshaha dhexe iyo panel midig oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshe madhan dhexdiisa waxaad aragtaa sanduuq magacaaban \u003Cstrong\u003EKu bilow barooyinka sahanka\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu liistaa tillaabooyinka ugu horreeya wuxuuna leeyahay xiriir, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur goobta tusaalaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad rabto inaad CivilCraft ku isticmaasho markii aadan xidhiidh lahayn, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka app-ka oo sug \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E. Wuxuu ku jiraa caawimaadan, goobta tusaalaha, iyo maktabadaha 3D iyo GIS. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawimaad\u003C/span\u003E waqti kasta si aad caawimaadan ugu furto dhinac app-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daqiiqadaha-ugu-horreeya-goobta-tusaalaha\"\u003EDaqiiqadaha ugu horreeya: goobta tusaalaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobta tusaalaha waa sahan yar oo feet-ka Maraykanka ah: 276 barood oo ku saabsan isku-xirka state plane, buur, jeexjeexyo (swale) leh khad qulqulka ah iyo laba sare-xeed oo dhulka ah. Waxay ku timaadaa app-ka, sidaas darteed waad raaci kartaa iyada oo aan fayl gaar ah lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur goobta tusaalaha\u003C/span\u003E sanduuqa qorshaha ku jira. Wada-hadalka \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi barood\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa furmaa. Wuxuu leeyahay &quot;276 barood ayaa la akhriyay sida PNEZD (safka madhan ee madaxa), oo kala saaran kooma.&quot; wuxuuna muujinayaa safafka ugu horreeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E. Qorshaha wuxuu buuxmaa barooyin, kontuurro iyo xuduudka dusha. Bar-ka hoose ee xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa in barooyinka la soo dhoofiyay iyo inta saddexagal ee dusha ay leedahay (546).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg panelka bidix hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBarood\u003C/strong\u003E. Barooyinka waxa loo kooxeeyay ereyga koowaad ee sharaxaadda: CP, FL, GRD, RIDGE, TBN, TBS iyo TREE.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E ee miiskaas, deji \u003Cstrong\u003EFL\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ERIDGE\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETBN\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ETBS\u003C/strong\u003E sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E. Dusha ayaa isla markiiba dib loo dhisaa. Xogta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E hadda waxay leedahay &quot;Khadadka jebinta: 4&quot;, kontuurrada waxay si xad-dhaaf ah ugu qawsaan khadka qulqulka iyo ridge-ka halkii ay ku gudbi lahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaq pointer-ka qorshaha. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu muujinayaa cirifka (easting) iyo waqooyiga (northing) hoosta pointer-ka, iyo sare-taagga dhulka halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E, deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKontuur kasta\u003C/span\u003E 0.5 ft oo shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagaaga heerarka\u003C/span\u003E. Xagaaga midabka ayaa soo muuqda oo leh sharaxaad hoosta sanduuqyada hubinta. Demi xagaagii marka aad dhammayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda waxaad leedahay dusha dhulka jira. Xiga, waddo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waddo-gaaban-dhis\"\u003EWaddo gaaban dhis\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJid-hagaha\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji saddex barood oo isku xiga goobta, mid mid. Khad casaan ah ayaa raacaya pointer-ka oo muujinaya dherer iyo jihada tangent-ka soo socda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammayso. Jid-hagaha ayaa soo muuqda oo leh station. Panelka midig wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EJid-hagaha\u003C/strong\u003E: dherereedka, miiska PI, iyo qallooca PI-ga dhexe (radius 100 ft, ama ka yar haddii 100 ft aanu ku habboonayn).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka midig, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dhererka\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bilow dhulka\u003C/span\u003E. Muuqaalka dherer ayaa ka furmaa qorshaha hoosteeda, oo leh dhulka jira iyo heer naqshad oo toos ah oo ka socda dhamaadka ilaa dhamaadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u shido \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar PVI-yo\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna mar guji muuqaalka dherer meel u dhow dhexda. PVI ayaa soo muuqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiiska PVI ee midig, ku qor dherer qallooc (tusaale 100) sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EQallooca L\u003C/strong\u003E ee PVI-ga dhexe, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Naqshaddu hadda waxay leedahay qallooc toosan, K-kiisa oo calaamadaysan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKorridorka\u003C/strong\u003E, shid \u003Cstrong\u003EQaab-dhismeed ku dhex mari naqshadda dhererka\u003C/strong\u003E. Waddadu waxay ku dhejisan tahay dhulka: waddooyinka, garabyada iyo jeexjeexyada dhinacyada ilaa iftiinka. \u003Cstrong\u003EShaqada dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa jarista iyo buuxinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHa ka walaacin tirooyinka saxda ah. Qiime kasta waa la beddeli karaa panelka midig, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka noqdaa isbeddelka ugu dambeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-shaqadaada\"\u003EKaydi shaqadaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor magac sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E sare panelka bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E). Browser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl magaciisu yahay magaca goobta, oo dhammaadkiisu yahay \u003Ccode\u003E.civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E. Wuxuu ku hayaa barooyinka, dejinta dusha, jid-hagayaasha, naqshadaha, korridoroyinka, padyada iyo tuubooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad dib u sii wadato, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo dooro faylkaas, ama jiid qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa jiro kaydin toos ah. Haddii aad xidho tab-ka isbeddel aan la kaydin, browser-ku wuxuu weydiinayaa inaad rabto inaad baxdo; haddii aad baxdo, isbeddelada way luntaan. Badanaa kaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-aad-u-aadi-karto-xiga\"\u003EHalka aad u aadi karto xiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003ESoo dhoofi barooyinka sahanka\u003C/a\u003E faylalkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EDhis oo hagaaji dusha\u003C/a\u003E khadadka jebinta iyo xuduudka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/workspace\"\u003EShaashadda, qayb qayb\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"CivilCraft waa app-ka naqshadaynta dhulka iyo goobta ee qoyska CadCraft. Wuxuu qaadaa barooyinka sahanka wuxuuna u beddelaa dusha (TIN) oo leh kontuurro, kadibna wuxuu kuu ogolaanayaa inaad habeysid jid-hagayaasha iyo naqshadaha dhererka, aad jid korridor fudud ku dhaqaaqdo, aad padyada dhismaha u dhigtid si ay u gaaraan iftiinka (daylight), aad shabakadda tuubooyinka ee cuf-dhacaadka ku hubiso xeerarkaaga, iyo aad aragto mugga jarista iyo buuxinta. Wuxuu akhriyaa oo qoraa LandXML, wuxuu dhoofiyaa qorshaha sida DXF, wuxuuna ku plot-iyaa PDF. Haddii aad isticmaashay Civil 3D, fikradaha way kuu caadi noqon doonaan: barooyin, kooxo barooyin, khadadka jebinta, jid-hagayaasha iyadoo lagu saleeyay PI, naqshadaha iyadoo lagu saleeyay PVI, korridoro, dhulka la sameeyay, shabakadda tuubooyinka. Habka aad u shaqeyso waa kala duwan, waana mid aad uga yar: ma jiro safka amarka, ma jiro qaabab (styles) iyo ma jiro fayl naqshad. Akhri Software-ka dhulka ee kale hal mar ka hor shaqadaada dhabta ah ee ugu horreysa. Waxa aad u baahan tahay Browser desktop oo casri ah: Chrome, Edge, Firefox ama Safari. Eeg Browsers. Mouse ama trackpad iyo kiiboodh, ama shaashad taabasho: naqshaddu waxay leedahay badhamada shaashadda ah Dhammee, Ka noqo dhibicda iyo Jooji (eeg Mouse, trackpad iyo taabasho). Qorshuhu wuxuu ku qoran yahay 2D canvas-ka browser-ka. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu isticmaalaa grafikada WebGL ee browser-ka; haddii aanu bilaabi karin, bar-ka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya sababta oo qorshuhu wuu shaqeynayaa weli. Ma jiro akoon iyo ma jiro upload. Faylalku waxay furmaan kombiyuutarkaaga oo waxay kaydiyaan sida soo dejin. Eeg Faylalkaaga. CivilCraft maanta wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa sida browser dhismo horeyn ah oo weli la sameynayo. Dhismayaasha desktop-ka weli ma diyaar aha, kaydinta gacan-ka-geynta (cloud) weli ma diyaar aha. Wax kasta oo aad samayso wuxuu ku sii jiraa kombiyuutarkaaga ilaa aad kaydiso ama dhoofiso. Fur CivilCraft Fur CivilCraft browser-kaaga. Sug shaashaddu inay buuxso: qalab bar ah oo sare, panel bidix, qorshaha dhexe iyo panel midig oo leh Sifooyinka. Qorshe madhan dhexdiisa waxaad aragtaa sanduuq magacaaban Ku bilow barooyinka sahanka. Wuxuu liistaa tillaabooyinka ugu horreeya wuxuuna leeyahay xiriir, Fur goobta tusaalaha. Haddii aad rabto inaad CivilCraft ku isticmaasho markii aadan xidhiidh lahayn, guji Kaydi khadka ka baxsan bar-ka app-ka oo sug Khadka ka baxsan diyaar. Wuxuu ku jiraa caawimaadan, goobta tusaalaha, iyo maktabadaha 3D iyo GIS. Eeg Khadka ka baxsan. Riix F1 ama guji Caawimaad waqti kasta si aad caawimaadan ugu furto dhinac app-ka. Daqiiqadaha ugu horreeya: goobta tusaalaha Goobta tusaalaha waa sahan yar oo feet-ka Maraykanka ah: 276 barood oo ku saabsan isku-xirka state plane, buur, jeexjeexyo (swale) leh khad qulqulka ah iyo laba sare-xeed oo dhulka ah. Waxay ku timaadaa app-ka, sidaas darteed waad raaci kartaa iyada oo aan fayl gaar ah lahayn. Guji Fur goobta tusaalaha sanduuqa qorshaha ku jira. Wada-hadalka Soo dhoofi barood ayaa furmaa. Wuxuu leeyahay \"276 barood ayaa la akhriyay sida PNEZD (safka madhan ee madaxa), oo kala saaran kooma.\" wuxuuna muujinayaa safafka ugu horreeya. Guji Soo dhoofi. Qorshaha wuxuu buuxmaa barooyin, kontuurro iyo xuduudka dusha. Bar-ka hoose ee xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa in barooyinka la soo dhoofiyay iyo inta saddexagal ee dusha ay leedahay (546). Eeg panelka bidix hoosta Barood. Barooyinka waxa loo kooxeeyay ereyga koowaad ee sharaxaadda: CP, FL, GRD, RIDGE, TBN, TBS iyo TREE. Tiirka Dusha ee miiskaas, deji FL, RIDGE, TBN iyo TBS sida Xarriiqa jabinta. Dusha ayaa isla markiiba dib loo dhisaa. Xogta Dusha hadda waxay leedahay \"Khadadka jebinta: 4\", kontuurrada waxay si xad-dhaaf ah ugu qawsaan khadka qulqulka iyo ridge-ka halkii ay ku gudbi lahaayeen. Dhaq pointer-ka qorshaha. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu muujinayaa cirifka (easting) iyo waqooyiga (northing) hoosta pointer-ka, iyo sare-taagga dhulka halkaas. Hoosta Bandhig, deji Kontuur kasta 0.5 ft oo shid Xagaaga heerarka. Xagaaga midabka ayaa soo muuqda oo leh sharaxaad hoosta sanduuqyada hubinta. Demi xagaagii marka aad dhammayso. Hadda waxaad leedahay dusha dhulka jira. Xiga, waddo. Waddo gaaban dhis Riix A (ama guji Jid-hagaha kooxda Naqshadda). Guji saddex barood oo isku xiga goobta, mid mid. Khad casaan ah ayaa raacaya pointer-ka oo muujinaya dherer iyo jihada tangent-ka soo socda. Riix Enter si aad u dhammayso. Jid-hagaha ayaa soo muuqda oo leh station. Panelka midig wuxuu muujinayaa Jid-hagaha: dherereedka, miiska PI, iyo qallooca PI-ga dhexe (radius 100 ft, ama ka yar haddii 100 ft aanu ku habboonayn). Panelka midig, hoosta Naqshadda dhererka, guji Ka bilow dhulka. Muuqaalka dherer ayaa ka furmaa qorshaha hoosteeda, oo leh dhulka jira iyo heer naqshad oo toos ah oo ka socda dhamaadka ilaa dhamaadka. Riix I si aad u shido Ku dar PVI-yo, kadibna mar guji muuqaalka dherer meel u dhow dhexda. PVI ayaa soo muuqda. Miiska PVI ee midig, ku qor dherer qallooc (tusaale 100) sanduuqa Qallooca L ee PVI-ga dhexe, kadibna riix Enter. Naqshaddu hadda waxay leedahay qallooc toosan, K-kiisa oo calaamadaysan. Hoosta Korridorka, shid Qaab-dhismeed ku dhex mari naqshadda dhererka. Waddadu waxay ku dhejisan tahay dhulka: waddooyinka, garabyada iyo jeexjeexyada dhinacyada ilaa iftiinka. Shaqada dhulka wuxuu muujinayaa jarista iyo buuxinta. Ha ka walaacin tirooyinka saxda ah. Qiime kasta waa la beddeli karaa panelka midig, Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqdaa isbeddelka ugu dambeeya. Kaydi shaqadaada Ku qor magac sanduuqa Magaca sare panelka bidix. Riix Ctrl+S (ama guji Kaydi). Browser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl magaciisu yahay magaca goobta, oo dhammaadkiisu yahay .civilcraft.json. Wuxuu ku hayaa barooyinka, dejinta dusha, jid-hagayaasha, naqshadaha, korridoroyinka, padyada iyo tuubooyinka. Si aad dib u sii wadato, guji Fur (ama riix Ctrl+O) oo dooro faylkaas, ama jiid qorshaha. Ma jiro kaydin toos ah. Haddii aad xidho tab-ka isbeddel aan la kaydin, browser-ku wuxuu weydiinayaa inaad rabto inaad baxdo; haddii aad baxdo, isbeddelada way luntaan. Badanaa kaydi. Halka aad u aadi karto xiga Soo dhoofi barooyinka sahanka faylalkaaga. Dhis oo hagaaji dusha khadadka jebinta iyo xuduudka. Shaashadda, qayb qayb. Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Shaashadda, qayb qayb","summary":"Safar ah dhammaan xariiqyada iyo panelada CivilCraft magacyadooda shaashadda, laga bilaabo qalabka ilaa xariiqa xaaladda.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["isku-xidhka","shaashad","qalab","panelo","sifooyin","xariiqa xaaladda","muuqaalka dherer","habayn","safar","ui"],"headings":[{"id":"bar-ka-app-ka","text":"Bar-ka app-ka","level":2},{"id":"qalabka","text":"Qalabka","level":2},{"id":"panelka-bidix","text":"Panelka bidix","level":2},{"id":"goob","text":"Goob","level":3},{"id":"barood","text":"Barood","level":3},{"id":"dusha","text":"Dusha","level":3},{"id":"bandhig","text":"Bandhig","level":3},{"id":"qorshaha","text":"Qorshaha","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-dherer","text":"Muuqaalka dherer","level":2},{"id":"panelka-midig-sifooyinka","text":"Panelka midig: Sifooyinka","level":2},{"id":"bar-ka-xaaladda","text":"Bar-ka xaaladda","level":2},{"id":"wada-hadallada","text":"Wada-hadallada","level":2},{"id":"shaashadaha-yaryar","text":"Shaashadaha yaryar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu leeyahay hal shaashad. Ma jiro tabs iyo ma jiro habayn kale. Panelada dhinacyada way dhaqaaqi karaan, way ka kala go&#039;i karaan ama daaqad u gaar ah ayey gelaan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada oo isticmaal shaashad labaad\u003C/a\u003E. Sare ilaa hoose iyo bidix ilaa midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ebar-ka app-ka\u003C/strong\u003E (calaamadda CadCraft, magaca app-ka, nooca, About, habka shaashadda, Caawimaad, Kaydi khadka ka baxsan, Warqad iyo Moodeel)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eqalabka\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh toddobo kooxood oo badhamo ah\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Epanelka bidix\u003C/strong\u003E: Goob, Barood, Dusha, Bandhig iyo, marka aad soo dhoofiso xogaha, lakabyada GIS\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eqorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E dhexe, oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003Emuuqaalka dherer\u003C/strong\u003E hoosteeda marka la furo\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Epanelka midig\u003C/strong\u003E: Sifooyinka waxa la doortay\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ebar-ka xaaladda\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bar-ka-app-ka\"\u003EBar-ka app-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBar-ka khafiifka ah ee ugu sarreeya wuxuu ku sugan yahay goobta CadCraft, ma aha CivilCraft laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenu-ga nooca wuxuu muujinayaa dhismaha aad socodsiinayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout CivilCraft\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa bogga app-ka ee goobta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaashad buuxda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wareegaa hababka shaashadda: shaashad buuxda, kadibna shaashad buuxda oo bar-yada laga qariyay, kadibna dib u noqo caadi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa isla shaqada nidaamyada oo dhan, oo ay ku jiraan Mac (waa furaha Control halkaas, ma aha Command). Marka bar-yada la qariyo, u dhaq pointer-ka xagga sare si aad u soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawimaad\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu furaa caawimaadan panel dhinac ah; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa xiraya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu CivilCraft ku hayaa browser-kan si uu u furmo iyada oo aan xidhiidh jirin; markaas wuxuu muujiyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/files#online-and-offline\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/files\" data-hash=\"online-and-offline\"\u003EFaylalkaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarqad\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E waxay u beddelaan midabka iftiinka iyo mugdiga. Qorshaha iyo muuqaalka dherer way raacaan midabka; PDF-yada had iyo jeer cadaan ayay ku daabacaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxba kasta wuxuu leeyahay calaamad yar oo qoraal ah oo ka sarreysa badhamadiisa. Dhaq badhanka si aad u aragto sharaxaadda iyo furaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKooxda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhamada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameeyaan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u bilow, fur fayl barood, LandXML ama mashruuc, kaydi mashruuca sida soo dejin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandXML\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor LandXML 1.2, R12 DXF ama DWG qorshaha, ama plot qorshaha PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXadka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir khad jebin ah oo ku dhex mara barooyinka sahanka; sawir xadka dibadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJid-hagaha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPadka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubooyinka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal dherer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir jid-hagaha, pad, tuubo; muuji ama qari muuqaalka dherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo, samee mar kale, koobiyee iyo dhaji barooyinka sahanka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu haysaa Jar, Dhaji meeshii, Nuqul, Tirtir, Dooro dhammaan barooyinka iyo Ha dooran midna\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGIS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-xirka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhariidad\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDeji nidaamka isku-xirka, soo dhoofi iyo dhoofi faylalka GIS, muuji lakabyada khariidadda hoosta qorshaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro iyo guuri waxyaabaha; ku weyn si wax walba loo arko; muuji goobta 3D (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/site-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/site-3d\"\u003EEeg goobta 3D\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab naqshadeed wuxuu ku sii jiraa riixan intuu firfircoon yahay. Mar kale guji, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E iyo waxyaabaha ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E way ifiran yihiin marka aanay shaqayn karin; tooltip-ka ayaa sheegaya sababta (tusaale &quot;Marka hore dooro barooyinka sahanka&quot;). Badhan kasta waxaa lagu liistaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/toolbar\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/toolbar\"\u003ETixraaca qalabka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqad fiiqan dhexdeeda qalabku wuxuu u dhaqdhaqaaqaa dhinac.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelka-bidix\"\u003EPanelka bidix\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"goob\"\u003EGoob\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E: magaca mashruuca. Wuxuu magacaabaa fayl kasta oo aad kaydiso ama dhoofiso, wuxuuna ku qoran yahay cinwaanka PDF-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECutubyada\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFuudhka Maraykanka\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMitirro\u003C/span\u003E. Tan waxay sheegtaa macnaha lambarada. Beddelidda ma \u003Cstrong\u003Ebeddelayso\u003C/strong\u003E isku-xirka; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/units-and-stations\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/units-and-stations\"\u003ECutubyada, istaysanka iyo qaababka lambarada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"barood\"\u003EBarood\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka aanu jirin, wuxuu kuu sheegayaa sida loo furo fayl barood. Marka ay barooyin jiraan, wuxuu muujinayaa magaca faylka, tirada barooyinka iyo tirada kuwa leh sare-taag, kadibna miis ah \u003Cstrong\u003Ekooxaha barooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: hal safar oo loogu talagalay ereyga koowaad ee sharaxaadda (GRD, FL, TBS …), oo leh tiro iyo doorasho \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarood\u003C/span\u003E: barooyinka waxay galaan dusha (waa caadiga kooxda kasta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E: barooyinka kooxda waa la isku xidhay, sida lambarka barta, hal khad jebin ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaga reebay\u003C/span\u003E: kooxda ma taabanayso dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"dusha\"\u003EDusha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXogta dhulka jira: barooyin, saddexagallo, sare-taag hoose iyo sare, celceliska sare-taagga, ballaca 2D iyo 3D, khadadka jebinta iyo haddii uu xuduud yeelan yahay. Hoosta xogta, sanduuq ayaa liisanaya wixii dusha dhisaa ay hagaajisay ama aanu awoodin. Ka dib:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeerida ugu dheer ee dibadda\u003C/strong\u003E: 0 wuxuu hayaa dhammaan saddexagallada dibadda; lambar wuxuu ka jarayaa saddexagallada dheer ee dibadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhiidho soo muuqda marka ay khuseyso: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir xadka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir khadadka jejebinta ee la sawiray\u003C/span\u003E iyo, dusha laga akhriyay LandXML, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u dhis dusha barooyinka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"bandhig\"\u003EBandhig\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhulka jira\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELa soo jeediyay (la sameeyay)\u003C/span\u003E. Kan labaad waa diyaar marka pad ama korridor uu dhulka sameeyo si dhibaato la&#039;aan ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKontuur kasta\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWeyn kasta\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EXagaaga\u003C/strong\u003E (tirada xagaagyada midabka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqyada hubinta: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKontuurrada\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha kontuurka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaddexagallada\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagaaga heerarka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFallaadaha naqaska\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarood\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha barta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadadka jebinta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuduudka dusha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubooyinka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska sare-taagyada xagaagyada ayaa soo muuqda marka xagaagyadu shidan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta bandhigga waa la kaydiyaa mashruuca, laakiin ma aha tallaabooyin ka noqosho: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ma soo celiyo sanduuq hubin marnaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorshaha\"\u003EQorshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa barooyinka, dusha iyo wax kasta oo aad naqshadayso, qorshe ahaan oo waqooyigu sare yahay. Foorsho wheel-ka si aad u weyneyso meeshii pointer-ka; jiid meel bannaan si aad u wareejiso. Liiska buuxa waa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMashruuc madhan dhexdiisa sanduuq magacaaban \u003Cstrong\u003EKu bilow barooyinka sahanka\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa liisanaya tillaabooyinka ugu horreeya wuxuuna bixinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur goobta tusaalaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka qalab naqshadeed firfircoon yahay, talo ayaa ku sarreysa qorshaha oo sheegaysa waxa la gujinayo iyo sida loo dhammeeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFayl ku jiid qorshaha wuxuu muujinayaa &quot;Ku rid fayl barood, LandXML ama mashruuc&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxyaabaha la doortay way iftiimaan. Jid-hagaha ama padka la doortay wuxuu muujinayaa xabbado labajibbaaran oo PI-yada ama geesaha; qaab-dhismeed la doortay wuxuu muujiyaa hal xabbad. Jiid xabbad si aad u guurisid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarooyinka sahanka la doortay waxay leeyihiin wareeg. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo guji wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa barta; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiid wuxuu sameeyaa sanduuq (ama, haddii aad ku wareegto, lasso) oo ku daraa barooyinka gudaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/copy-paste-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/copy-paste-points\"\u003EDooro, koobiyee iyo dhaji barooyinka sahanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-dherer\"\u003EMuuqaalka dherer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal dherer\u003C/span\u003E si aad u furto hoosta qorshaha. Bar-kiisa wuxuu leeyahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eliiska jid-hagaha (waa diyaar marka ay jid-hagayaal laba ama ka badan jiraan)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar PVI-yo\u003C/span\u003E: intii ay riixan tahay, guji muuqaalka dherer wuxuu ku daraa PVI (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa beddela)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eakhrin ah station, dhul, sare-taag naqshad, dhal iyo jarid ama buuxin hoosta pointer-ka\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebadhanka xidhista\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka dherer wuxuu muujinayaa dhulka jira, naqshadda dherer, dhalalka tangent kasta, PVI kasta station-kiisa iyo sare-taagga, L iyo K ee qallooc kasta oo BVC iyo EVC la socda, meelaha sare iyo hoose, iyo kor u qaadista toosan (vertical exaggeration). Wuxuu had iyo jeer ku habboonaa jid-hagaha oo dhan: ma zoom-ayo ama ma wareejiyo. Pointer-ka oo ku socda wuxuu dhigaa dhibic jid-hagaha qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelka-midig-sifooyinka\"\u003EPanelka midig: Sifooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMadaxa wuxuu sheegayaa waxa uu muujinayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E (wax lagu dooran waayo): jid-hagayaasha iyo padyada sida xiriiro, qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EShaqada dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EShabakadda tuubooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh xeerarkeeda iyo dhibaatooyinkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJid-hagaha\u003C/strong\u003E: magac, station bilowga, dherer, miiska PI, qallooca, miiska PVI iyo xogta naqshadda dherer, iyo dejinta \u003Cstrong\u003EKorridorka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPadka\u003C/strong\u003E: magac, sare-taag, dhalalka jarista iyo buuxinta, ballac, xogta iftiinka iyo shaqada dhulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaab-dhismeed\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ETuubo\u003C/strong\u003E: cabbirrada, afar-cidda, dhulka sare, dhul-hoose, dhal, dabka iyo dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibic\u003C/strong\u003E iyo lambarkeeda: isku-xirka barta, sare-taagga, sharaxaadda iyo kooxda (akhriska keliya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobaha waxay bilaabaan markaad riixdo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama markaad ka baxdo goobta. Qiime aan la aqbalin waa la calaamadiyaa inuu khalad yahay, wax lagu beddelina ma jiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bar-ka-xaaladda\"\u003EBar-ka xaaladda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EE\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EN\u003C/strong\u003E: cirifka iyo waqooyiga hoosta pointer-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhul\u003C/strong\u003E sare-taag halkaas (iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeysan\u003C/strong\u003E meesha pad ama korridor uu ka beddelay), ama &quot;Ka baxsan dusha&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJid-hagaha ugu dhow (ama midka la doortay) oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003ESta\u003C/strong\u003E iyo kala-fogaanta (\u003Cstrong\u003EL\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ER\u003C/strong\u003E) hoosta pointer-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidig, fariimo: waxa dhacay hadda, ama sababta wax loo diiday. Fariinta ayaa iskeed u dhammaataa kadib wakhti yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wada-hadallada\"\u003EWada-hadallada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi barooyin\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu furaa fayl kasta oo barood. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003ESoo dhoofi barooyinka sahanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha ku daabac PDF\u003C/strong\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plot-pdf\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plot-pdf\"\u003EQorshaha ku daabac PDF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddel aan la kaydin\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu weydiiyaa ka hor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E ama furidda mashruuc ama fayl LandXML oo ka tirtirto shaqada aan la kaydin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi nuqul\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu marka hore soo dejiyaa mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashadaha-yaryar\"\u003EShaashadaha yaryar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlaa 760 pixel ballac, sida telefoon, qorshuhu wuxuu hayaa shaashadda: qalabku waa hal safar oo u dhaqdhaqaaqa dhinac, panelkana waxay ka furmaan sida xaashi bar-ka hoose. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qariyaa qalabka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa hoosta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"CivilCraft wuxuu leeyahay hal shaashad. Ma jiro tabs iyo ma jiro habayn kale. Panelada dhinacyada way dhaqaaqi karaan, way ka kala go'i karaan ama daaqad u gaar ah ayey gelaan: eeg Habee panelada oo isticmaal shaashad labaad. Sare ilaa hoose iyo bidix ilaa midig: bar-ka app-ka (calaamadda CadCraft, magaca app-ka, nooca, About, habka shaashadda, Caawimaad, Kaydi khadka ka baxsan, Warqad iyo Moodeel) qalabka oo leh toddobo kooxood oo badhamo ah panelka bidix: Goob, Barood, Dusha, Bandhig iyo, marka aad soo dhoofiso xogaha, lakabyada GIS qorshaha dhexe, oo leh muuqaalka dherer hoosteeda marka la furo panelka midig: Sifooyinka waxa la doortay bar-ka xaaladda hoosta Bar-ka app-ka Bar-ka khafiifka ah ee ugu sarreeya wuxuu ku sugan yahay goobta CadCraft, ma aha CivilCraft laftiisa. Menu-ga nooca wuxuu muujinayaa dhismaha aad socodsiinayso. About CivilCraft wuxuu furaa bogga app-ka ee goobta. Shaashad buuxda wuxuu wareegaa hababka shaashadda: shaashad buuxda, kadibna shaashad buuxda oo bar-yada laga qariyay, kadibna dib u noqo caadi. Ctrl+Shift+F wuxuu sameeyaa isla shaqada nidaamyada oo dhan, oo ay ku jiraan Mac (waa furaha Control halkaas, ma aha Command). Marka bar-yada la qariyo, u dhaq pointer-ka xagga sare si aad u soo celiso. Caawimaad (ama F1) wuxuu furaa caawimaadan panel dhinac ah; F1 ama Esc ayaa xiraya. Kaydi khadka ka baxsan wuxuu CivilCraft ku hayaa browser-kan si uu u furmo iyada oo aan xidhiidh jirin; markaas wuxuu muujiyaa Khadka ka baxsan diyaar. Eeg Faylalkaaga. Warqad iyo Moodeel waxay u beddelaan midabka iftiinka iyo mugdiga. Qorshaha iyo muuqaalka dherer way raacaan midabka; PDF-yada had iyo jeer cadaan ayay ku daabacaan. Qalabka Kooxba kasta wuxuu leeyahay calaamad yar oo qoraal ah oo ka sarreysa badhamadiisa. Dhaq badhanka si aad u aragto sharaxaadda iyo furaha. Kooxda Badhamada Waxa ay sameeyaan Faylka Cusub, Fur, Kaydi Dib u bilow, fur fayl barood, LandXML ama mashruuc, kaydi mashruuca sida soo dejin Dhoofin LandXML, DXF, DWG, PDF Qor LandXML 1.2, R12 DXF ama DWG qorshaha, ama plot qorshaha PDF Dusha Xarriiqa jabinta, Xadka Sawir khad jebin ah oo ku dhex mara barooyinka sahanka; sawir xadka dibadda Naqshadda Jid-hagaha, Padka, Tuubooyinka, Muuqaal dherer Sawir jid-hagaha, pad, tuubo; muuji ama qari muuqaalka dherer Tafatirka Ka noqo, Samee mar kale, Koobiyee, Dhaji, Wax dheeraad ah Ka noqo, samee mar kale, koobiyee iyo dhaji barooyinka sahanka; Wax dheeraad ah wuxuu haysaa Jar, Dhaji meeshii, Nuqul, Tirtir, Dooro dhammaan barooyinka iyo Ha dooran midna GIS Isku-xirka, Soo dhoofi, Dhoofi, Khariidad Deji nidaamka isku-xirka, soo dhoofi iyo dhoofi faylalka GIS, muuji lakabyada khariidadda hoosta qorshaha Muuqaal Dooro, Ku habee, 3D Dooro iyo guuri waxyaabaha; ku weyn si wax walba loo arko; muuji goobta 3D (Eeg goobta 3D) Qalab naqshadeed wuxuu ku sii jiraa riixan intuu firfircoon yahay. Mar kale guji, riix Esc ama riix V wuxuu soo celinayaa Dooro. Ka noqo, Samee mar kale, Koobiyee iyo waxyaabaha ku jira Wax dheeraad ah way ifiran yihiin marka aanay shaqayn karin; tooltip-ka ayaa sheegaya sababta (tusaale \"Marka hore dooro barooyinka sahanka\"). Badhan kasta waxaa lagu liistaa Tixraaca qalabka. Daaqad fiiqan dhexdeeda qalabku wuxuu u dhaqdhaqaaqaa dhinac. Panelka bidix Goob Magaca: magaca mashruuca. Wuxuu magacaabaa fayl kasta oo aad kaydiso ama dhoofiso, wuxuuna ku qoran yahay cinwaanka PDF-ka. Cutubyada: Fuudhka Maraykanka ama Mitirro. Tan waxay sheegtaa macnaha lambarada. Beddelidda ma beddelayso isku-xirka; eeg Cutubyada, istaysanka iyo qaababka lambarada. Barood Marka aanu jirin, wuxuu kuu sheegayaa sida loo furo fayl barood. Marka ay barooyin jiraan, wuxuu muujinayaa magaca faylka, tirada barooyinka iyo tirada kuwa leh sare-taag, kadibna miis ah kooxaha barooyinka: hal safar oo loogu talagalay ereyga koowaad ee sharaxaadda (GRD, FL, TBS …), oo leh tiro iyo doorasho Dusha: Barood: barooyinka waxay galaan dusha (waa caadiga kooxda kasta). Xarriiqa jabinta: barooyinka kooxda waa la isku xidhay, sida lambarka barta, hal khad jebin ah. Laga reebay: kooxda ma taabanayso dusha. Dusha Xogta dhulka jira: barooyin, saddexagallo, sare-taag hoose iyo sare, celceliska sare-taagga, ballaca 2D iyo 3D, khadadka jebinta iyo haddii uu xuduud yeelan yahay. Hoosta xogta, sanduuq ayaa liisanaya wixii dusha dhisaa ay hagaajisay ama aanu awoodin. Ka dib: Geerida ugu dheer ee dibadda: 0 wuxuu hayaa dhammaan saddexagallada dibadda; lambar wuxuu ka jarayaa saddexagallada dheer ee dibadda. Xidhiidho soo muuqda marka ay khuseyso: Tirtir xadka, Tirtir khadadka jejebinta ee la sawiray iyo, dusha laga akhriyay LandXML, Dib u dhis dusha barooyinka. Bandhig Dusha: Dhulka jira ama La soo jeediyay (la sameeyay). Kan labaad waa diyaar marka pad ama korridor uu dhulka sameeyo si dhibaato la'aan ah. Kontuur kasta, Weyn kasta iyo Xagaaga (tirada xagaagyada midabka). Sanduuqyada hubinta: Kontuurrada, Calaamadaha kontuurka, Saddexagallada, Xagaaga heerarka, Fallaadaha naqaska, Barood, Calaamadaha barta, Khadadka jebinta, Xuduudka dusha, Tuubooyinka. Liiska sare-taagyada xagaagyada ayaa soo muuqda marka xagaagyadu shidan yihiin. Dejinta bandhigga waa la kaydiyaa mashruuca, laakiin ma aha tallaabooyin ka noqosho: Ctrl+Z ma soo celiyo sanduuq hubin marnaba. Qorshaha Qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa barooyinka, dusha iyo wax kasta oo aad naqshadayso, qorshe ahaan oo waqooyigu sare yahay. Foorsho wheel-ka si aad u weyneyso meeshii pointer-ka; jiid meel bannaan si aad u wareejiso. Liiska buuxa waa Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Mashruuc madhan dhexdiisa sanduuq magacaaban Ku bilow barooyinka sahanka ayaa liisanaya tillaabooyinka ugu horreeya wuxuuna bixinayaa Fur goobta tusaalaha. Marka qalab naqshadeed firfircoon yahay, talo ayaa ku sarreysa qorshaha oo sheegaysa waxa la gujinayo iyo sida loo dhammeeyo. Fayl ku jiid qorshaha wuxuu muujinayaa \"Ku rid fayl barood, LandXML ama mashruuc\". Waxyaabaha la doortay way iftiimaan. Jid-hagaha ama padka la doortay wuxuu muujinayaa xabbado labajibbaaran oo PI-yada ama geesaha; qaab-dhismeed la doortay wuxuu muujiyaa hal xabbad. Jiid xabbad si aad u guurisid. Barooyinka sahanka la doortay waxay leeyihiin wareeg. Shift iyo guji wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa barta; Shift iyo jiid wuxuu sameeyaa sanduuq (ama, haddii aad ku wareegto, lasso) oo ku daraa barooyinka gudaha. Eeg Dooro, koobiyee iyo dhaji barooyinka sahanka. Muuqaalka dherer Riix R ama guji Muuqaal dherer si aad u furto hoosta qorshaha. Bar-kiisa wuxuu leeyahay: liiska jid-hagaha (waa diyaar marka ay jid-hagayaal laba ama ka badan jiraan) Ku dar PVI-yo: intii ay riixan tahay, guji muuqaalka dherer wuxuu ku daraa PVI (I ayaa beddela) akhrin ah station, dhul, sare-taag naqshad, dhal iyo jarid ama buuxin hoosta pointer-ka badhanka xidhista Muuqaalka dherer wuxuu muujinayaa dhulka jira, naqshadda dherer, dhalalka tangent kasta, PVI kasta station-kiisa iyo sare-taagga, L iyo K ee qallooc kasta oo BVC iyo EVC la socda, meelaha sare iyo hoose, iyo kor u qaadista toosan (vertical exaggeration). Wuxuu had iyo jeer ku habboonaa jid-hagaha oo dhan: ma zoom-ayo ama ma wareejiyo. Pointer-ka oo ku socda wuxuu dhigaa dhibic jid-hagaha qorshaha. Panelka midig: Sifooyinka Madaxa wuxuu sheegayaa waxa uu muujinayo. Mashruuca (wax lagu dooran waayo): jid-hagayaasha iyo padyada sida xiriiro, qaybta Shaqada dhulka, iyo qaybta Shabakadda tuubooyinka oo leh xeerarkeeda iyo dhibaatooyinkeeda. Jid-hagaha: magac, station bilowga, dherer, miiska PI, qallooca, miiska PVI iyo xogta naqshadda dherer, iyo dejinta Korridorka. Padka: magac, sare-taag, dhalalka jarista iyo buuxinta, ballac, xogta iftiinka iyo shaqada dhulka. Qaab-dhismeed ama Tuubo: cabbirrada, afar-cidda, dhulka sare, dhul-hoose, dhal, dabka iyo dhibaatooyinka. Dhibic iyo lambarkeeda: isku-xirka barta, sare-taagga, sharaxaadda iyo kooxda (akhriska keliya). Goobaha waxay bilaabaan markaad riixdo Enter ama markaad ka baxdo goobta. Qiime aan la aqbalin waa la calaamadiyaa inuu khalad yahay, wax lagu beddelina ma jiro. Bar-ka xaaladda E iyo N: cirifka iyo waqooyiga hoosta pointer-ka. Dhul sare-taag halkaas (iyo Qaabeysan meesha pad ama korridor uu ka beddelay), ama \"Ka baxsan dusha\". Jid-hagaha ugu dhow (ama midka la doortay) oo leh Sta iyo kala-fogaanta (L ama R) hoosta pointer-ka. Midig, fariimo: waxa dhacay hadda, ama sababta wax loo diiday. Fariinta ayaa iskeed u dhammaataa kadib wakhti yar. Wada-hadallada Soo dhoofi barooyin: wuxuu furaa fayl kasta oo barood. Eeg Soo dhoofi barooyinka sahanka. Qorshaha ku daabac PDF: eeg Qorshaha ku daabac PDF. Isbeddel aan la kaydin: wuxuu weydiiyaa ka hor Cusub ama furidda mashruuc ama fayl LandXML oo ka tirtirto shaqada aan la kaydin. Kaydi nuqul wuxuu marka hore soo dejiyaa mashruuca. Shaashadaha yaryar Ilaa 760 pixel ballac, sida telefoon, qorshuhu wuxuu hayaa shaashadda: qalabku waa hal safar oo u dhaqdhaqaaqa dhinac, panelkana waxay ka furmaan sida xaashi bar-ka hoose. Qalabka wuxuu qariyaa qalabka, Guuri wuxuu dhigaa hoosta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"files","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Faylalka aad furi, kaydin iyo dhoofin karto","summary":"Faylalka barta ku soo geli, LandXML iyo mashruucyada CivilCraft; mashruucyada, LandXML, DXF iyo PDF u dhoofi; waxa mid kasta hayo, meesha faylalku tagaan, iyo waxa isbedela marka offline.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["fur","kaydi","dhoofin","soo geli","qaababka faylalka","csv","txt","landxml","xml","dxf","pdf","json","soo degso","faylka mashruuca"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-uu-furayo","text":"Waxa uu furayo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-uu-kaydiyo","text":"Waxa uu kaydiyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-uu-dhoofiyo","text":"Waxa uu dhoofiyo","level":2},{"id":"faylalku-halkay-ku-tagaan","text":"Faylalku halkay ku tagaan","level":2},{"id":"online-iyo-offline","text":"Online iyo offline","level":2},{"id":"kordhinta-uu-faylku-isticmaalo","text":"Kordhinta uu faylku isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"ka-noqo-studio-ga","text":"Ka noqo Studio-ga","level":2},{"id":"xidhista-isbedello-aan-la-kaydin","text":"Xidhista isbedello aan la kaydin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu ka furaa faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ku jira wuxuuna kaydiyaa iyagoo ku soo degsanaya kombiyuutarka. Waxba lama soo rarin, waxna server-ka lama kaydiyo. Eeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EFaylalkaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-furayo\"\u003EWaxa uu furayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo dooro fayl, ama jiidi faylka \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Emaamulaha faylalkaaga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E oo keen saxanka. Hal fayl mar; faylalka ka weyn 200 MB waa la diidaa. LandXML ama fayl mashruuc oo ka weyn 32 MB waxa la akhriyaa qaybo ku dhow 4 MB, weligood qoraal hal jeex ah ma aha; intii LandXML la furayo, filo inuu xusuusta isticmaalo qiyaastii 13 jeer cabbirka faylka (fayl 69 MB ah wuxuu isticmaalay qiyaastii 0.9 GB tijaabadeenna).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMagacyada faylalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa dhaca\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl barta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.txt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pnt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.xyz\u003C/code\u003E (fayl qoraal kasta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqadda \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo geli barta\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa furmaysa. Barta ayaa beddelaysa barta mashruuca; khadadka waddada, saldhigyada iyo tuubooyinka way sii joogaan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELandXML\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.xml\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.landxml\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruuc cusub\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa laga sameeyaa faylka (waa la weydiin doonaa marka hore haddii mashruuca hadda jira uu leeyahay isbedello aan la kaydin).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashruuca CivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E (wixii \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E ah)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashruucu wuxuu furmaa sida loo kaydiyay (waa la weydiin doonaa marka hore haddii mashruuca hadda jira uu leeyahay isbedello aan la kaydin).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu go&#039;aan ka gaadhaa dhamaadka magaca faylka, kadibna xarfaha ugu horreeya: qoraal ku bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E{\u003C/code\u003E waa la akhriyaa mashruuc, qoraal ku bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;\u003C/code\u003E waa LandXML, wixii kale waa fayl barta. Fayl uu sanduuqa furista ku madoobeeyo ayaa weli lagu tuuri karaa saxanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo gelinta fayl barta mashruuc leh barta horey u jirta waxay beddeshaa barta jirta si aan la weydiin, waxayna tirtirtaa taariikhda ka noqoshada (furidda wax kasta waa bilow cusub oo ka noqoshada). Haddii dusha laga keenay LandXML, soo gelinta barta waxay dib ugu beddeshaa dusha loo sameeyay barta. Marka hore kaydi haddii aad rabto barta hore dib u soo celin karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaahfaahin dheeraad ah: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/point-file-formats\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/point-file-formats\"\u003EQaababka faylalka barta\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landxml-reference\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landxml-reference\"\u003ELandXML: waxa la akhriyo iyo la qoro\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-kaydiyo\"\u003EWaxa uu kaydiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu qoraa laba fayl oo ku dhinac-dhinac ah, oo magacooda laga qaatay \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E ku jira xagga bidix: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, mashruuca aad sii wadid tafatirka, iyo \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.ifc\u003C/code\u003E, isla naqshadda oo IFC 4.3 ah oo dadka kale loogu talagalay (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ifc\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ifc\"\u003Edhoofinta iyo soo gelinta IFC\u003C/a\u003E). Fayl kasta wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa kan kale, IFC-na wuxuu sidoo kale qaadaa nuqul la kaabay oo mashruuca ah, sidaas darteed IFC keligeed loo diro weli si buuxda ayuu tafatir ugu furmaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStudio gudahiisa\u003C/strong\u003E labada fayl waa la qoraa dhinac-dhinac, meeshii ay joogeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChrome iyo Edge gudahooda\u003C/strong\u003E kaydinta ugu horreysa waxay weydiisaa folder, waxayna labadooda ku qortaa; kaydinta dambe waxay tagaan isla folderkaas. Ka jawaab folder-ka weydiinta si labadooda loogu soo dego.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBrowser-ada kale gudahooda\u003C/strong\u003E labada fayl way soo degaan, mashruucuna marka hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFuridda fayl kasta waxay raadisaa kan kale. Labadooda isku mar fur (ama jiid labadooda), ama mid keliya fur: Studio gudahiisa kan kale isla folderkaas ayay ka helaysaa; browser gudahiisa CivilCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa inaad ku darto, ama inaad ku sii wadato midka aad haysato. Haddii IFC-ga barnaamij kale beddelay ka dib markii CivilCraft kaydiyay, ama mid ka mid ah labada fayl ayaa ka hor yimid kan kale, mashruucu wuxuu ka furmaa naqshadda cusub, garoonka Dhibaatooyinka ayaa sheegaa waxa dhacay, oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi hadda\u003C/strong\u003E (labada fayl mar kale qoraa) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ETus joometriga IFC ahaan tixraac\u003C/strong\u003E. IFC keligiis oo uu barnaamij kale beddelay wuxuu ka furmaa nuqulkiisa mashruuca oo wuxuu qaadaa wixii weli isku mid ah: waxyaabaha wax-ka-beddelkooda leh waxay qaadaan joometriga IFC-ga, shayada uu tirtiray way ka maqnaadaan, isbeddellada kale waa la liistaa, ma aha la qaadan. Fayl mashruuc ka hor nooca 0.7.1 wuxuu furmaa sidii hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka mashruucu wuxuu hayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebarta kasta (lambarka, koordinaadyada, sare-u-kac, sharraxaadda) iyo magaca faylka barta ay ka timaadeen\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edejinta dusha: doorashooyinka kooxda, khadadka jajabka ee la sawiray, xadka, cirifka dibedda ee ugu dheer, iyo TIN laga akhriyay LandXML\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edejinta muuqaalka\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekhadadka waddada oo leh PI-kooda, radiyadooda iyo station-ka bilowga, naqshadaha dhulka (PVI-yada iyo dhererka qallooyinka) iyo dejinta koridorka\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esaldhigyada iyo shabakada tuubooyinka oo leh qawaaniinteeda\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa hayo taariikhda ka noqoshada. Dusha, konturada, khadadka dhulka ee daylight iyo mugga lama kaydiyo; waxa dib loo dhisaa xogta la kaydiyay marka mashruucu furmo. Fayl mashruuc oo ka cusub CivilCraft cusub waa la diidaa, fariin magaciisa nooca ku jirtaa ayaa tusaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-dhoofiyo\"\u003EWaxa uu dhoofiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandXML\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.xml\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELandXML 1.2: barta, dhulka jira (iyo dusha la dhisay haddii ay jirto) oo ah dusha TIN, khadadka waddada, naqshadaha dhulka iyo kuwa naqshadda, shabakada tuubooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.dxf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka sawirka sida loo muujiyay DXF R12 oo leh lakabyo magacaabani\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.dwg\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla khadadka sawir DWG ah, qaabka aad doorato (2000 ilaa 2018)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirka dhulka oo vector ah oo ku taal warqad, miisaan aad doorato\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOBJ\u003C/span\u003E (qaybta ku taal muuqaalka 3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;-3d.glb\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;-3d.obj\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa muuqaalka 3D uu muujiyo oo ah moodeel 3D: meter, Y sare, cabbir run ah, oo ku wareegsan meel asal ah oo la duubay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa mid kasta ka reebo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landxml\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landxml\"\u003ELandXML dhoofin\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/dxf-export\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/dxf-export\"\u003EDhoofi sawirka DXF\u003C/a\u003E (DWG sidoo kale), \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plot-pdf\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plot-pdf\"\u003EDaabac sawirka PDF\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/export-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/export-3d\"\u003EDhoofi goobta 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalku-halkay-ku-tagaan\"\u003EFaylalku halkay ku tagaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylalka la kaydiyay iyo kuwa la dhoofiyay waxay aadayaan meesha browser-ku ku soo dego, badanaaba folderka Soo degidda. Si aad folder u dooratid mar kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta\u003C/strong\u003E browser-ka, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo degidda\u003C/strong\u003E, oo shid \u003Cstrong\u003EWeydii halka faylka kasta ka hor soo degidda loo kaydinayo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EGuud\u003C/strong\u003E, oo hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylal iyo Barnaamijyo\u003C/strong\u003E dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWeydii had iyo jeer halka faylalka loo kaydinayo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003ESafari &gt; Dejinta &gt; Guud\u003C/strong\u003E oo deji \u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta soo dejinta faylka\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EWeydii soo dejin kasta\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad labo jeer kaydiso isla magac, browser-ku wuxuu ku dari karaa lambar fayl labaad, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003ESite (1).civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E. Mar xiga fayl ugu cusub fur.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"online-iyo-offline\"\u003EOnline iyo offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu shaqeeyaa kombiyuutarkaaga keliya, online ama offline kasta: furidda waxay akhrisaa faylka browser-ka, kaydinta waxay soo dejisaa. Si aad CivilCraft ugu furto iyada oo aan xiriir lahayn, marka hore u kaydi offline:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkaad online tahay, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E ee bar-ka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanku wuxuu tiriyaa (&quot;Saving 12 of 30&quot;) kadibna wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E. CivilCraft waa yar yahay (qiyaastii 0.6 MB), sidaas darteed waqti yar ayuu qaadanayaa. Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu ku jiraa caawinta iyo goobta tusaalaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriir la&#039;aan, fur isla cinwaanka (ama bookmark-ka); wax kasta waa shaqeeyaa, oo ay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur goobta tusaalaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudbinta kale ee badhanka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELama kaydin karin\u003C/span\u003E: qaar ka mid ah faylalka lama soo dejin. Hubi xiriirka oo guji si aad mar kale u isku daydo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan lama heli karo\u003C/span\u003E: daaqaddan browser-ka ma kari karto nuqul offline ah (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarada maamulka qaarkood way xannibaan). Isticmaal daaqad caadi ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto goorta la kaydiyay nuqulka, oo leh laba ikhtiyaar: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E. Mar kale kaydi ka hor booqashada goobta si nuqulku ula mid noqdo dhismaha ugu dambeeya. Wax dheeraad ah: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda offline ayaad tahay. Haddii CivilCraft loo kaydiyay isticmaalka offline, wax kasta waa shaqeeyaa, oo ay ku jiraan goobta tusaalaha. Haddii aysan ahayn, ku sii wad shaqada tabkan, laakiin ha dib u soo rarin ilaa aad online ku noqoto; haddii aanu jirin nuqul la kaydiyay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur goobta tusaalaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu fashilmaa oo wuxuu sheegaa &quot;The sample could not be loaded&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaqada beerta, kaydi CivilCraft isticmaalka offline oo keen faylalka barta kombiyuutarka laftiisa. Mashruucyada iyo dhoofinta waxay u kaydiyaan sida soo degitaanno iyada oo aan xiriir jirin, sidaas darteed waxaad soo gelin kartaa tirooyinka maalinta, hubin kartaa dusha, oo kaydin kartaa mashruuca goobta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta sixaabka weli lama heli karo, qalabka desktop-kana weli lama soo saarin. Hadda faylalka aad kaydiso ayaa nuqulka keliya ah: ku hay meel la kaabay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kordhinta-uu-faylku-isticmaalo\"\u003EKordhinta uu faylku isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka aad kaydiso mashruuc ku jira xog ka timid kordhin (xulashooyinka Building regulations, ama Address to site source), faylku wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa kordhinnada iyo noocyadooda. Haddii laga furo kombiyuutar uusan lahayn mid ka mid ah, garoonka sare ee sawirka ayaa sheegaa oo waxay ku bixisaa in laga soo daro liiska akoonkaaga. Diiwaanku waa fiiro keliya; faylku wuu furmaa si kastaba ha ahaatee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-noqo-studio-ga\"\u003EKa noqo Studio-ga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha CadCraft Studio, talaabo kasta oo aad ku dhamaysid CivilCraft waxaa loo sheegaa Studio, sidaas darteed ka noqoshadeeda heerka mashruucu waxay ka noqon kartaa talaabada ugu dambeysay dhammaan barnaamijyada. Studio wuxuu ka noqdaa talaabo kaliya marka xidhmada ka noqoshada CivilCraft ay tahay sidii talaabadaas ka tagtay; markaad fayl kale furto, wuu ka tallaabsadaa daaqaddan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidhista-isbedello-aan-la-kaydin\"\u003EXidhista isbedello aan la kaydin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka mashruucu leeyahay isbedello aan la kaydin oo aad xirto tab-ka, dib u soo rarto, ama aad bogga ka baxdo, browser-ku wuxuu weydiin doonaa inaad rabto inaad baxdo. Hadalkiisa iyo muuqiisa waa kan browser-ka, CivilCraft ma beddeli karo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E, iyo furidda mashruuc ama fayl LandXML, waxay weydiiyaan sanduuqa CivilCraft ee \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbedello aan la kaydin\u003C/strong\u003E, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHa kaydin\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi nuqul\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"CivilCraft wuxuu ka furaa faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ku jira wuxuuna kaydiyaa iyagoo ku soo degsanaya kombiyuutarka. Waxba lama soo rarin, waxna server-ka lama kaydiyo. Eeg sidoo kale Faylalkaaga. Waxa uu furayo Guji Fur (ama riix Ctrl+O) oo dooro fayl, ama jiidi faylka Finder / File Explorer / maamulaha faylalkaaga oo keen saxanka. Hal fayl mar; faylalka ka weyn 200 MB waa la diidaa. LandXML ama fayl mashruuc oo ka weyn 32 MB waxa la akhriyaa qaybo ku dhow 4 MB, weligood qoraal hal jeex ah ma aha; intii LandXML la furayo, filo inuu xusuusta isticmaalo qiyaastii 13 jeer cabbirka faylka (fayl 69 MB ah wuxuu isticmaalay qiyaastii 0.9 GB tijaabadeenna). Nooca Magacyada faylalka Waxa dhaca Fayl barta .csv, .txt, .pnt, .xyz (fayl qoraal kasta) Daaqadda Soo geli barta ayaa furmaysa. Barta ayaa beddelaysa barta mashruuca; khadadka waddada, saldhigyada iyo tuubooyinka way sii joogaan. LandXML .xml, .landxml Mashruuc cusub ayaa laga sameeyaa faylka (waa la weydiin doonaa marka hore haddii mashruuca hadda jira uu leeyahay isbedello aan la kaydin). Mashruuca CivilCraft .civilcraft.json (wixii .json ah) Mashruucu wuxuu furmaa sida loo kaydiyay (waa la weydiin doonaa marka hore haddii mashruuca hadda jira uu leeyahay isbedello aan la kaydin). CivilCraft wuxuu go'aan ka gaadhaa dhamaadka magaca faylka, kadibna xarfaha ugu horreeya: qoraal ku bilaabma { waa la akhriyaa mashruuc, qoraal ku bilaabma \u003C waa LandXML, wixii kale waa fayl barta. Fayl uu sanduuqa furista ku madoobeeyo ayaa weli lagu tuuri karaa saxanka. Soo gelinta fayl barta mashruuc leh barta horey u jirta waxay beddeshaa barta jirta si aan la weydiin, waxayna tirtirtaa taariikhda ka noqoshada (furidda wax kasta waa bilow cusub oo ka noqoshada). Haddii dusha laga keenay LandXML, soo gelinta barta waxay dib ugu beddeshaa dusha loo sameeyay barta. Marka hore kaydi haddii aad rabto barta hore dib u soo celin karto. Faahfaahin dheeraad ah: Qaababka faylalka barta, LandXML: waxa la akhriyo iyo la qoro. Waxa uu kaydiyo Kaydi (Ctrl+S) wuxuu qoraa laba fayl oo ku dhinac-dhinac ah, oo magacooda laga qaatay Magaca ku jira xagga bidix: \u003Cname\u003E.civilcraft.json, mashruuca aad sii wadid tafatirka, iyo \u003Cname\u003E.ifc, isla naqshadda oo IFC 4.3 ah oo dadka kale loogu talagalay (eeg dhoofinta iyo soo gelinta IFC). Fayl kasta wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa kan kale, IFC-na wuxuu sidoo kale qaadaa nuqul la kaabay oo mashruuca ah, sidaas darteed IFC keligeed loo diro weli si buuxda ayuu tafatir ugu furmaa. Studio gudahiisa labada fayl waa la qoraa dhinac-dhinac, meeshii ay joogeen. Chrome iyo Edge gudahooda kaydinta ugu horreysa waxay weydiisaa folder, waxayna labadooda ku qortaa; kaydinta dambe waxay tagaan isla folderkaas. Ka jawaab folder-ka weydiinta si labadooda loogu soo dego. Browser-ada kale gudahooda labada fayl way soo degaan, mashruucuna marka hore. Furidda fayl kasta waxay raadisaa kan kale. Labadooda isku mar fur (ama jiid labadooda), ama mid keliya fur: Studio gudahiisa kan kale isla folderkaas ayay ka helaysaa; browser gudahiisa CivilCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa inaad ku darto, ama inaad ku sii wadato midka aad haysato. Haddii IFC-ga barnaamij kale beddelay ka dib markii CivilCraft kaydiyay, ama mid ka mid ah labada fayl ayaa ka hor yimid kan kale, mashruucu wuxuu ka furmaa naqshadda cusub, garoonka Dhibaatooyinka ayaa sheegaa waxa dhacay, oo leh Kaydi hadda (labada fayl mar kale qoraa) iyo Tus joometriga IFC ahaan tixraac. IFC keligiis oo uu barnaamij kale beddelay wuxuu ka furmaa nuqulkiisa mashruuca oo wuxuu qaadaa wixii weli isku mid ah: waxyaabaha wax-ka-beddelkooda leh waxay qaadaan joometriga IFC-ga, shayada uu tirtiray way ka maqnaadaan, isbeddellada kale waa la liistaa, ma aha la qaadan. Fayl mashruuc ka hor nooca 0.7.1 wuxuu furmaa sidii hore. Faylka mashruucu wuxuu hayaa: barta kasta (lambarka, koordinaadyada, sare-u-kac, sharraxaadda) iyo magaca faylka barta ay ka timaadeen dejinta dusha: doorashooyinka kooxda, khadadka jajabka ee la sawiray, xadka, cirifka dibedda ee ugu dheer, iyo TIN laga akhriyay LandXML dejinta muuqaalka khadadka waddada oo leh PI-kooda, radiyadooda iyo station-ka bilowga, naqshadaha dhulka (PVI-yada iyo dhererka qallooyinka) iyo dejinta koridorka saldhigyada iyo shabakada tuubooyinka oo leh qawaaniinteeda Ma hayo taariikhda ka noqoshada. Dusha, konturada, khadadka dhulka ee daylight iyo mugga lama kaydiyo; waxa dib loo dhisaa xogta la kaydiyay marka mashruucu furmo. Fayl mashruuc oo ka cusub CivilCraft cusub waa la diidaa, fariin magaciisa nooca ku jirtaa ayaa tusaysa. Waxa uu dhoofiyo Badhanka Faylka Waxa ku jira LandXML \u003Cname\u003E.xml LandXML 1.2: barta, dhulka jira (iyo dusha la dhisay haddii ay jirto) oo ah dusha TIN, khadadka waddada, naqshadaha dhulka iyo kuwa naqshadda, shabakada tuubooyinka DXF \u003Cname\u003E.dxf Khadadka sawirka sida loo muujiyay DXF R12 oo leh lakabyo magacaabani DWG \u003Cname\u003E.dwg Isla khadadka sawir DWG ah, qaabka aad doorato (2000 ilaa 2018) PDF \u003Cname\u003E.pdf Sawirka dhulka oo vector ah oo ku taal warqad, miisaan aad doorato GLB ama OBJ (qaybta ku taal muuqaalka 3D) \u003Cname\u003E-3d.glb, \u003Cname\u003E-3d.obj Waxa muuqaalka 3D uu muujiyo oo ah moodeel 3D: meter, Y sare, cabbir run ah, oo ku wareegsan meel asal ah oo la duubay Waxa mid kasta ka reebo: LandXML dhoofin, Dhoofi sawirka DXF (DWG sidoo kale), Daabac sawirka PDF, Dhoofi goobta 3D. Faylalku halkay ku tagaan Faylalka la kaydiyay iyo kuwa la dhoofiyay waxay aadayaan meesha browser-ku ku soo dego, badanaaba folderka Soo degidda. Si aad folder u dooratid mar kasta: Fur Dejinta browser-ka, kadibna Soo degidda, oo shid Weydii halka faylka kasta ka hor soo degidda loo kaydinayo. Fur Dejinta, kadibna Guud, oo hoos Faylal iyo Barnaamijyo dooro Weydii had iyo jeer halka faylalka loo kaydinayo. Fur Safari \u003E Dejinta \u003E Guud oo deji Goobta soo dejinta faylka Weydii soo dejin kasta. Haddii aad labo jeer kaydiso isla magac, browser-ku wuxuu ku dari karaa lambar fayl labaad, tusaale ahaan Site (1).civilcraft.json. Mar xiga fayl ugu cusub fur. Online iyo offline CivilCraft wuxuu shaqeeyaa kombiyuutarkaaga keliya, online ama offline kasta: furidda waxay akhrisaa faylka browser-ka, kaydinta waxay soo dejisaa. Si aad CivilCraft ugu furto iyada oo aan xiriir lahayn, marka hore u kaydi offline: Markaad online tahay, guji Kaydi khadka ka baxsan ee bar-ka sare. Badhanku wuxuu tiriyaa (\"Saving 12 of 30\") kadibna wuxuu muujinayaa Khadka ka baxsan diyaar. CivilCraft waa yar yahay (qiyaastii 0.6 MB), sidaas darteed waqti yar ayuu qaadanayaa. Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu ku jiraa caawinta iyo goobta tusaalaha. Xiriir la'aan, fur isla cinwaanka (ama bookmark-ka); wax kasta waa shaqeeyaa, oo ay ku jiraan Fur goobta tusaalaha. Gudbinta kale ee badhanka: Lama kaydin karin: qaar ka mid ah faylalka lama soo dejin. Hubi xiriirka oo guji si aad mar kale u isku daydo. Khadka ka baxsan lama heli karo: daaqaddan browser-ka ma kari karto nuqul offline ah (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarada maamulka qaarkood way xannibaan). Isticmaal daaqad caadi ah. Guji Khadka ka baxsan diyaar si aad u aragto goorta la kaydiyay nuqulka, oo leh laba ikhtiyaar: Mar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya) iyo Ka saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan. Mar kale kaydi ka hor booqashada goobta si nuqulku ula mid noqdo dhismaha ugu dambeeya. Wax dheeraad ah: Offline. Hadda offline ayaad tahay. Haddii CivilCraft loo kaydiyay isticmaalka offline, wax kasta waa shaqeeyaa, oo ay ku jiraan goobta tusaalaha. Haddii aysan ahayn, ku sii wad shaqada tabkan, laakiin ha dib u soo rarin ilaa aad online ku noqoto; haddii aanu jirin nuqul la kaydiyay, Fur goobta tusaalaha wuxuu fashilmaa oo wuxuu sheegaa \"The sample could not be loaded\". Shaqada beerta, kaydi CivilCraft isticmaalka offline oo keen faylalka barta kombiyuutarka laftiisa. Mashruucyada iyo dhoofinta waxay u kaydiyaan sida soo degitaanno iyada oo aan xiriir jirin, sidaas darteed waxaad soo gelin kartaa tirooyinka maalinta, hubin kartaa dusha, oo kaydin kartaa mashruuca goobta. Kaydinta sixaabka weli lama heli karo, qalabka desktop-kana weli lama soo saarin. Hadda faylalka aad kaydiso ayaa nuqulka keliya ah: ku hay meel la kaabay. Kordhinta uu faylku isticmaalo Marka aad kaydiso mashruuc ku jira xog ka timid kordhin (xulashooyinka Building regulations, ama Address to site source), faylku wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa kordhinnada iyo noocyadooda. Haddii laga furo kombiyuutar uusan lahayn mid ka mid ah, garoonka sare ee sawirka ayaa sheegaa oo waxay ku bixisaa in laga soo daro liiska akoonkaaga. Diiwaanku waa fiiro keliya; faylku wuu furmaa si kastaba ha ahaatee. Ka noqo Studio-ga Gudaha CadCraft Studio, talaabo kasta oo aad ku dhamaysid CivilCraft waxaa loo sheegaa Studio, sidaas darteed ka noqoshadeeda heerka mashruucu waxay ka noqon kartaa talaabada ugu dambeysay dhammaan barnaamijyada. Studio wuxuu ka noqdaa talaabo kaliya marka xidhmada ka noqoshada CivilCraft ay tahay sidii talaabadaas ka tagtay; markaad fayl kale furto, wuu ka tallaabsadaa daaqaddan. Xidhista isbedello aan la kaydin Marka mashruucu leeyahay isbedello aan la kaydin oo aad xirto tab-ka, dib u soo rarto, ama aad bogga ka baxdo, browser-ku wuxuu weydiin doonaa inaad rabto inaad baxdo. Hadalkiisa iyo muuqiisa waa kan browser-ka, CivilCraft ma beddeli karo. Cusub, iyo furidda mashruuc ama fayl LandXML, waxay weydiiyaan sanduuqa CivilCraft ee Isbedello aan la kaydin, oo leh Jooji, Ha kaydin iyo Kaydi nuqul.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"import-points","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Soo dhoofi barooyinka sahanka","summary":"Fur fayl CSV ama qoraal oo barood ah, hubi dalabka tiirarka ee wada-hadalka Soo dhoofi barooyinka, saxi safafka aan la akhriyi karin, oo barooyinka u kala saar kooxo.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["soo dhoofi barooyinka","csv","txt","pnezd","penzd","faylka barta","sahan dhul","barooyinka COGO","kooxaha barta","tiirarka","waqooyi bari"],"headings":[{"id":"ka-hor-inta-aanad-bilaabin","text":"Ka hor inta aanad bilaabin","level":2},{"id":"soo-dhoofi-faylka","text":"Soo dhoofi faylka","level":2},{"id":"hubi-kooxaha","text":"Hubi kooxaha","level":2},{"id":"safafka-aan-la-akhriyin","text":"Safafka aan la akhriyin","level":2},{"id":"beddel-ama-ku-dar-barood","text":"Beddel ama ku dar barood","level":2},{"id":"la-xiriira","text":"La xiriira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFayl barta waa fayl qoraal ah oo mid kasta oo barood ah ku jiro hal safar: lambarka barta, waqooyiga, bariga, sare-geedka iyo sharraxaadda, dalab kasta oo ah, kuwaas oo ay kala saaran yihiin koomaho, tab, fasalo (;) ama meelo bannaan. CivilCraft wuxuu ku akhriyaa browser-ka oo mar dhow wuxuu ka dhisaa dusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-hor-inta-aanad-bilaabin\"\u003EKa hor inta aanad bilaabin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOgow dalabka tiirarka faylka haddii aad awoodo (PNEZD iyo PENZD waxay u eg yihiin kombiyuutarka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOgow cabbirradiisa. CivilCraft ma beddelo: deji \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca bidix si ay u waafaqdo faylka (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/units-and-stations\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/units-and-stations\"\u003ECabbirrada, istaysiyada iyo qaababka tirada\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-xidhku wuxuu noqon karaa mid weyn (waqooyi-bari ee nidaamka dhulka ee milyanka ah waa wanaagsan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-dhoofi-faylka\"\u003ESoo dhoofi faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, oo dooro faylka. Waxaad sidoo kale ku jiidi kartaa qorshaha. Wada-hadalka \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi barooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu furmaa magaca faylka, liiska \u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOgaag\u003C/span\u003E, safka soo koobid iyo lix barood ee ugu horreeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri safka soo koobidka. Wuxuu sheegayaa inta barood la akhriyay, dalabka tiirarka, sida dalabkaas loo helay, iyo waxa kala saaraya tiirarka. Saddexda hab ee dalabka loo helo:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;laga helay safka madaxa&quot;: safka koowaad wuxuu magacaabayaa tiirarkiisa (Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation, Description, ama X, Y, Z …). Tanu waa tan ugu badbaadada badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;sida la doortay&quot;: waxaad dooratay dalab ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;lagu qiyaasay tirada tiirarka iyo dejinta safka barta (PNEZD) — hubi in waqooyiga iyo bariga aanay is beddelin&quot;: ma jirin madax la isticmaali karo. Haddii faylashaadu badanaa bari hore leedahay, deji \u003Cstrong\u003ESafka barta\u003C/strong\u003E P, E, N, Z, D ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi jadwalka horudhaca. Tiirarkiisu waa mar walba \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWaqooyi\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBari\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESare-geed\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESharraxaad\u003C/strong\u003E, iyada dalabka faylku isticmaalo ha ahaadee. Waqooyiga iyo bariga goob dhab ah badanaa cabbir aad u kala duwan leeyihiin: haddii ay is beddelan yihiin u eg, qiyaasta waa khalad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii dalabku qaldan yahay, dooro midka saxda ah \u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E (tusaale ahaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPENZD — barta, bari (E), waqooyi (N), sare-geed (Z), sharraxaad (D)\u003C/span\u003E). Soo koobidka iyo horudhaca mar dhow ayaa cusboonaysiiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta horudhaca raadi \u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka aan la akhriyin\u003C/strong\u003E. Safka kasta wuxuu magacaabayaa lambarka safka faylka, sababta iyo bilowga safka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points#rows-that-are-not-read\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\" data-hash=\"rows-that-are-not-read\"\u003ESafafka aan la akhriyin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E. Barooyinku waxay ka muuqdaan qorshaha, muuqaalku wuu ku weynaadaa iyaga, dusha ayaa la dhisaa. Safka xaaladda wuxuu tusaale ahaan dhahaa: &quot;La soo dhoofiyay 276 barood site.csv; dusha: 546 saddex-geesood.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii mashruucu aanu weli magac lahayn, wuxuu qaadanayaa magaca faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-kooxaha\"\u003EHubi kooxaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarta kasta waxay ku jirtaa koox loo magacaabay \u003Cstrong\u003Eereyga koowaad ee sharraxaaddeeda\u003C/strong\u003E, xarfo weyn: &quot;GRD&quot;, &quot;FL 12&quot; iyo &quot;fl&quot; waa kooxo GRD, FL iyo FL. Barooyinka aan sharraxaad lahayn waxay gelayaan &quot;(aan sharraxaad lahayn)&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiiri jadwalka hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBarooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca bidix: kooxda, tirada barooyinka iyo doorashada \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoox kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarooyinka\u003C/span\u003E. Bedel xariiqyada socodka, geesaha dhulka adag, sare iyo hoosta janjeerka, dhabbooyinka iyo xariiqyo la mid ah oo koodh leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E. Kooxaha aan dhulka qaabeynin (barooyinka xakamaynta, dhirta sare, tiirarka adeegga ee lagu rasaasay sare) deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaga reebay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix barta qorshaha (adiga oo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E) si aad u aragto lambarkeeda, isku-xidhkeeda, sare-geedkeeda, sharraxaaddeeda iyo kooxdeeda dhinaca midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda xarriiqa jabinta waxay isku xidhaa \u003Cstrong\u003Edhammaan\u003C/strong\u003E barooyinkeeda hal xariiq, iyada oo lagu kala horreynayo lambarka barta. Tani waa shaqaynaysaa marka xariiq kasta koodhkeedu la rasaaseeyay si tartiib ah koodhkeeda gaarka ah. Laba xariiqyo socod oo kala duwan oo labaduba koodh &quot;FL&quot; leeyihiin waxay noqdaan hal xariiq oo isku dhex-dhex jeexaya. Haddii koodhadkaagu wadaagan yihiin, isticmaal qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E si aad u riixdo barooyinka xariiq kasta (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EDhis oo hagaaji dusha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"safafka-aan-la-akhriyin\"\u003ESafafka aan la akhriyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababta la muujiyay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay micnaheedu yahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;waqooyi ama bari ma aha tiro&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiirka isku-xidhka wuxuu hayaa qoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHubi dalabka tiirarka, ama safka qoraalka ah ee ku jira dhexda faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;sare-geed ma aha tiro&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiirka sare-geedka wuxuu hayaa qoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDalabka tiirarka qaldan, ama sharraxaad tiirka sare-geedka ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;ma jiro lambarka barta&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiirka barta waa madhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELambar u geli barta, ama dooro dalab aan P lahayn (NEZD, NEZ …): barooyinka markaas waxa loo lambarayaa 1, 2, 3 …\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;barta 12 waxay ku soo muuqatay laba jeer (kii kowaad ayaa la hayaa)&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabo safood wadaagaan hal lambar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u lambeeri mid ka mid ah faylka haddii labaduba rasaas dhab ah yihiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;3 tiir, la filayay 5 (PNEZD)&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafku gaaban yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq jabsan, ama dalabka tiirarka qaldan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarta sare-geed madhan waa la hayaa, laakiin dusha lama isticmaalo. Xaqiiqooyinka \u003Cstrong\u003EBarooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay muujinayaan inta barood oo sare-geed leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafafka bilaabmaya \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E//\u003C/code\u003E waa faallo oo waa la tallaabaa. Safafka madhan waa la tallaabaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-ama-ku-dar-barood\"\u003EBeddel ama ku dar barood\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofinta mar kale waxay \u003Cstrong\u003Ebeddeshaa\u003C/strong\u003E dhammaan barooyinka; kuma darto kuwa jira. Xariiqyadaada, padyada, tuubooyinka, xariiqyada jabinta ee la sawiray iyo xuduudka way sii jiraan. Taariikhda ka noqoshada waa la nadiifiyaa, sidaas darteed marka hore kaydi mashruuca haddii aad rabto barooyinkii hore mar kale. Si aad labo fayl isugu geliso, ku dar tafatire qoraal ama spreadsheet ka hor soo dhoofinta (ka feejignow lambarada barooyinka ee soo noqnoqda).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarooyinka weli lama dhaqaajin karo, lama tafatiri karo, lamana tirtiri karo gudaha CivilCraft. Ku saxi faylka oo mar kale soo dhoofi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-xiriira\"\u003ELa xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/point-file-formats\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/point-file-formats\"\u003EQaababka faylka barta\u003C/a\u003E: dalab kasta oo tiirarka iyo sida madaxyada loo aqoonsado.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EDhis oo hagaaji dusha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Fayl barta waa fayl qoraal ah oo mid kasta oo barood ah ku jiro hal safar: lambarka barta, waqooyiga, bariga, sare-geedka iyo sharraxaadda, dalab kasta oo ah, kuwaas oo ay kala saaran yihiin koomaho, tab, fasalo (;) ama meelo bannaan. CivilCraft wuxuu ku akhriyaa browser-ka oo mar dhow wuxuu ka dhisaa dusha. Ka hor inta aanad bilaabin Ogow dalabka tiirarka faylka haddii aad awoodo (PNEZD iyo PENZD waxay u eg yihiin kombiyuutarka). Ogow cabbirradiisa. CivilCraft ma beddelo: deji Cabbirrada dhinaca bidix si ay u waafaqdo faylka (eeg Cabbirrada, istaysiyada iyo qaababka tirada). Isku-xidhku wuxuu noqon karaa mid weyn (waqooyi-bari ee nidaamka dhulka ee milyanka ah waa wanaagsan). Soo dhoofi faylka Riix Fur qalabka sare, ama riix Ctrl+O, oo dooro faylka. Waxaad sidoo kale ku jiidi kartaa qorshaha. Wada-hadalka Soo dhoofi barooyinka wuxuu furmaa magaca faylka, liiska Tiirarka oo ah Ogaag, safka soo koobid iyo lix barood ee ugu horreeya. Akhri safka soo koobidka. Wuxuu sheegayaa inta barood la akhriyay, dalabka tiirarka, sida dalabkaas loo helay, iyo waxa kala saaraya tiirarka. Saddexda hab ee dalabka loo helo: \"laga helay safka madaxa\": safka koowaad wuxuu magacaabayaa tiirarkiisa (Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation, Description, ama X, Y, Z …). Tanu waa tan ugu badbaadada badan. \"sida la doortay\": waxaad dooratay dalab ku jira Tiirarka. \"lagu qiyaasay tirada tiirarka iyo dejinta safka barta (PNEZD) — hubi in waqooyiga iyo bariga aanay is beddelin\": ma jirin madax la isticmaali karo. Haddii faylashaadu badanaa bari hore leedahay, deji Safka barta P, E, N, Z, D ee Dejinta CivilCraft. Hubi jadwalka horudhaca. Tiirarkiisu waa mar walba Barta, Waqooyi, Bari, Sare-geed, Sharraxaad, iyada dalabka faylku isticmaalo ha ahaadee. Waqooyiga iyo bariga goob dhab ah badanaa cabbir aad u kala duwan leeyihiin: haddii ay is beddelan yihiin u eg, qiyaasta waa khalad. Haddii dalabku qaldan yahay, dooro midka saxda ah Tiirarka (tusaale ahaan PENZD — barta, bari (E), waqooyi (N), sare-geed (Z), sharraxaad (D)). Soo koobidka iyo horudhaca mar dhow ayaa cusboonaysiiya. Hoosta horudhaca raadi Safafka aan la akhriyin. Safka kasta wuxuu magacaabayaa lambarka safka faylka, sababta iyo bilowga safka. Eeg Safafka aan la akhriyin. Riix Soo dhoofi. Barooyinku waxay ka muuqdaan qorshaha, muuqaalku wuu ku weynaadaa iyaga, dusha ayaa la dhisaa. Safka xaaladda wuxuu tusaale ahaan dhahaa: \"La soo dhoofiyay 276 barood site.csv; dusha: 546 saddex-geesood.\" Haddii mashruucu aanu weli magac lahayn, wuxuu qaadanayaa magaca faylka. Hubi kooxaha Barta kasta waxay ku jirtaa koox loo magacaabay ereyga koowaad ee sharraxaaddeeda, xarfo weyn: \"GRD\", \"FL 12\" iyo \"fl\" waa kooxo GRD, FL iyo FL. Barooyinka aan sharraxaad lahayn waxay gelayaan \"(aan sharraxaad lahayn)\". Fiiri jadwalka hoosta Barooyinka dhinaca bidix: kooxda, tirada barooyinka iyo doorashada Dusha. Koox kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa Barooyinka. Bedel xariiqyada socodka, geesaha dhulka adag, sare iyo hoosta janjeerka, dhabbooyinka iyo xariiqyo la mid ah oo koodh leh Xarriiqa jabinta. Kooxaha aan dhulka qaabeynin (barooyinka xakamaynta, dhirta sare, tiirarka adeegga ee lagu rasaasay sare) deji Laga reebay. Riix barta qorshaha (adiga oo isticmaalaya Dooro) si aad u aragto lambarkeeda, isku-xidhkeeda, sare-geedkeeda, sharraxaaddeeda iyo kooxdeeda dhinaca midig. Kooxda xarriiqa jabinta waxay isku xidhaa dhammaan barooyinkeeda hal xariiq, iyada oo lagu kala horreynayo lambarka barta. Tani waa shaqaynaysaa marka xariiq kasta koodhkeedu la rasaaseeyay si tartiib ah koodhkeeda gaarka ah. Laba xariiqyo socod oo kala duwan oo labaduba koodh \"FL\" leeyihiin waxay noqdaan hal xariiq oo isku dhex-dhex jeexaya. Haddii koodhadkaagu wadaagan yihiin, isticmaal qalabka Xarriiqa jabinta si aad u riixdo barooyinka xariiq kasta (eeg Dhis oo hagaaji dusha). Safafka aan la akhriyin Sababta la muujiyay Waxa ay micnaheedu yahay Waxa la sameeyo \"waqooyi ama bari ma aha tiro\" Tiirka isku-xidhka wuxuu hayaa qoraal Hubi dalabka tiirarka, ama safka qoraalka ah ee ku jira dhexda faylka \"sare-geed ma aha tiro\" Tiirka sare-geedka wuxuu hayaa qoraal Dalabka tiirarka qaldan, ama sharraxaad tiirka sare-geedka ku jirta \"ma jiro lambarka barta\" Tiirka barta waa madhan Lambar u geli barta, ama dooro dalab aan P lahayn (NEZD, NEZ …): barooyinka markaas waxa loo lambarayaa 1, 2, 3 … \"barta 12 waxay ku soo muuqatay laba jeer (kii kowaad ayaa la hayaa)\" Labo safood wadaagaan hal lambar Dib u lambeeri mid ka mid ah faylka haddii labaduba rasaas dhab ah yihiin \"3 tiir, la filayay 5 (PNEZD)\" Safku gaaban yahay Xariiq jabsan, ama dalabka tiirarka qaldan Barta sare-geed madhan waa la hayaa, laakiin dusha lama isticmaalo. Xaqiiqooyinka Barooyinka waxay muujinayaan inta barood oo sare-geed leh. Safafka bilaabmaya #, ; ama // waa faallo oo waa la tallaabaa. Safafka madhan waa la tallaabaa. Beddel ama ku dar barood Soo dhoofinta mar kale waxay beddeshaa dhammaan barooyinka; kuma darto kuwa jira. Xariiqyadaada, padyada, tuubooyinka, xariiqyada jabinta ee la sawiray iyo xuduudka way sii jiraan. Taariikhda ka noqoshada waa la nadiifiyaa, sidaas darteed marka hore kaydi mashruuca haddii aad rabto barooyinkii hore mar kale. Si aad labo fayl isugu geliso, ku dar tafatire qoraal ama spreadsheet ka hor soo dhoofinta (ka feejignow lambarada barooyinka ee soo noqnoqda). Barooyinka weli lama dhaqaajin karo, lama tafatiri karo, lamana tirtiri karo gudaha CivilCraft. Ku saxi faylka oo mar kale soo dhoofi. La xiriira Qaababka faylka barta: dalab kasta oo tiirarka iyo sida madaxyada loo aqoonsado. Dhis oo hagaaji dusha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"elevation-grids-and-lidar","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Gridka dhererka iyo LiDAR","summary":"Dhulka jira ka dhis DEM (GeoTIFF ama ASCII grid) ama barooyinka LiDAR (LAS, LAZ) — dooro aagga, dhimi xogta, dooro fasallada oo hubi cutubyada dhererka — kadibna dusha ku soo celi GeoTIFF gridka dhererka.","section":"tasks","order":14,"keywords":["dem","dtm","gridka dhererka","geotiff","tif","ascii grid","asc","lidar","las","laz","daruurta barooyinka","fasallada","dhulka","dhimista","nodata","raster","dhoofi geotiff","gis"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-faylka","text":"Fur faylka","level":2},{"id":"dooro-waxa-la-soo-gelinayo","text":"Dooro waxa la soo gelinayo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-hesho","text":"Waxa aad hesho","level":2},{"id":"nidaamyada-isku-xidhka","text":"Nidaamyada isku-xidhka","level":2},{"id":"dhoofi-dusha-sida-geotiff","text":"Dhoofi dusha sida GeoTIFF","level":2},{"id":"hubinta","text":"Hubinta","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXogta dhererka ee dadweynaha ah waxay u timaadaa laba habood: \u003Cstrong\u003Egridka dhererka\u003C/strong\u003E (DEM: hal dhererka unug kasta oo laba geesood leh, badanaa GeoTIFF \u003Ccode\u003E.tif\u003C/code\u003E ama ASCII grid \u003Ccode\u003E.asc\u003C/code\u003E) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarooyinka LiDAR\u003C/strong\u003E (malaayiin laser ah oo ku jira fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.las\u003C/code\u003E, ama \u003Ccode\u003E.laz\u003C/code\u003E marka la kaydiyo). CivilCraft wuxuu midkoodba u beddelaa barooyin sahan ama dusha, browser-ka gudihiisa: waxba lama soo rarayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-faylka\"\u003EFur faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E kooxda GIS) oo dooro faylka, ama jiid oo dhig qorshaha. ASCII grid ah, dooro sidoo kale faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E, si CivilCraft u ogaado nidaamka isku-xidhkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqa soo geynta wuxuu muujinayaa waxa faylku sheegayo naftiisa: cabbirkiisa, unugyada ama barooyinka, nidaamka isku-xidhka, goobtiisa latitude iyo longitude, iyo kala-duwanaanta dhererka. LiDAR-ka, marka hore wuxuu akhrisaa barta kastaa mar si uu u tiriyo \u003Cstrong\u003Efasallada\u003C/strong\u003E (cabbir-horumarka waa la muujiyaa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E ayaa joojiya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeoTIFF oo leh saddex ama afar kanaal (cas, cagaar, buluug) waa sawir, mana aha dhererro: waxay tagaa layers-ka khariidadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-waxa-la-soo-gelinayo\"\u003EDooro waxa la soo gelinayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagga\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe project’s extents and a margin\u003C/span\u003E (qor cidhifka), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the plan shows now\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe whole file\u003C/span\u003E. Qaybtaas faylka keliya ayaa la akhriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhimo ilaa\u003C/strong\u003E: masaafada u dhexaysa barooyinka aad heshid, cutubyada mashruuca. Xariiqda hoose ee dejinta waxay muujinaysaa inta barood oo ay taasi siinayso intaad qorto. Gridka, CivilCraft wuxuu hayaa unug kasta labaad, saddexaad … sidaas awgeed dhererrada waxay sii joogaan sida faylka oo kale; ma celceliyo unugyada. LiDAR-ka, aagga waxa loo jarayaa labajibaaro cabbirkaas leh, mid kasta waxa lagu hayaa hal bar: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe point nearest each cell’s center\u003C/span\u003E (waa default-ka), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe lowest point in each cell\u003C/span\u003E (wanaagsan marka faylka aanu fasal dhul lahayn: dhulku wuxuu hoostaa geedaha), ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe average of each cell’s points\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFasallada\u003C/strong\u003E (LiDAR): dhulka (fasal 2) waa la calaamadiyaa marka faylka leeyahay; dhismayaasha, geedaha iyo buuqa waa la dhaafaa. Marka aanu fasal dhul lahayn, fasal kasta waa la calaamadiyaa, wadahadalkuna wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka\u003C/strong\u003E (LiDAR, 0.8): daruur drone ah ma lahan fasal dhul. Marka faylka aanu lahayn, wadahadalku wuxuu ku bilaabaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind the ground myself (drone clouds, no ground class)\u003C/span\u003E: fasal kasta marka laga reebo buuqa waa la akhriyaa, barta ugu hooseysa unug kasta waa la hayaa, kadibna CivilCraft wuxuu dhismayaasha, geedaha iyo barooyinka hoose ee kala firidhsan ka saaraa shaandhe morphology-ka oo horumaraysa (Zhang iyo kuwa kale, 2003) oo aad hagi karto: \u003Cstrong\u003EShayga ugu weyn ee la saaro\u003C/strong\u003E (ballaca dhismaha ugu weyn; daaqadaha way weynaadaan ilaa ay daboolaan; 0 waxay ka dhigan tahay 20 unug) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJiidka dhulka ee ugu jiifka badan\u003C/strong\u003E. Shaqada waxay ku dhacdaa gridka barooyinka ugu hooseeya, sidaas darteed daruur ka kooban toban milyan oo barood ma kharash badan tahay tirada unugyadeeda (dhimista waa hal marin oo socda). Masaafadu waa unugga: mid ka weyn waa dhakhso badan yahay, oo wax yar oo yaryar ka sii luntaa intaad filan tahay, mid ka yar wuxuu hayaa faahfaahin dhulka badan. Warbixinta waxay sheegaysaa inta barood oo la hayay dhul ahaan, inta unug oo lagu saaray shay ahaan, iyo inta barood hoose oo kala firidhsan oo la tuuray. Sahan drone ah oo 300 m ah oo la sameeyay, oo leh shan dhismood, 70 geed iyo 200 barood hoose oo dibadda ah, barooyinka la hayay waxay ku jireen 3 cm dhexdooda dhulka runta ah, mana hayn saqaf ama geed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka faylka\u003C/strong\u003E: mitir, fiit, ama fiit US survey. Marka faylku sheego, cutubkiisa horay ayaa la doortaa. Marka aanu sheegin, waa inaad dooratid: sanduuqu wuxuu muujinayaa kala-duwanaanta dhererka labada jid, si aad u ogaato kan macquul u ah goobta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo geli sida\u003C/strong\u003E (gridka kaliya): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurvey points (description DEM)\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe surface itself (a grid of triangles)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal soo gelin ma qaadan karto ka badan 500,000 bar. Marka doorashadu ka badan siiso, sanduuqu wuxuu sheegaa inta ay ka badan tahay iyo masaafada ku habboon, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E wuu damaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E. Cabbir-horumarka akhrinta ayaa muuqda; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E waa joojiyaa, waxna ma beddela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECutubyada dhererka waa dhibaato caadi ah. DEM-yo badan oo state plane ah waxay leeyihiin bari iyo woqooyi fiit ah, laakiin dhererro mitir ah. Kala-duwanaanta uu sanduuqu muujiyo ka hubi wixii aad ka garanayso goobta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-hesho\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarooyinka sahanka\u003C/strong\u003E: waxay lambar u helaan ka dib barta ugu lambarka weyn, sharaxaadda \u003Ccode\u003EDEM\u003C/code\u003E (gridka) ama \u003Ccode\u003ELIDAR\u003C/code\u003E, si ay u sameeyaan koox barooyin oo keliya hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBarooyin\u003C/strong\u003E, dusha ayay u dhisaan sida barooyinka kale. Soo gelinta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa mar kale ka saaraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha laftiisa\u003C/strong\u003E: dusha TIN ee gridka, laba saddexagallo unug kasta, oo lagu kala jeexay jiifka koonfur-galbeed ilaa waqooyi-bari. Saddexagallo leh geesta aan xog lahayn waa la dhaafaa, sidaas awgeed godadka xogta ayaa godad ah. Dusha waxay la mid tahay gridka barta kasta oo gridka ah, waxayna dhexdooda tahay dayax fidsan oo saddexagallo kasta gudihiisa. Waxay beddeshaa dusha mashruuca (sanduuqu wuu weyddiinayaa hore), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u soo celinaysa dusha hore. Cinwaanka xagga bidix wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha (ka gridka dhererka)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nidaamyada-isku-xidhka\"\u003ENidaamyada isku-xidhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii mashruucu leeyahay nidaam isku-xidhka faylkuna sheego mid kale, barta kasta waa la beddelaa nidaamka mashruuca (iyo dhulka ama isku-xidhka maxalliga ah haddii ay leeyihiin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii mashruucu aanu lahayn, nidaamka faylkuna yahay cutubka mashruuca (fiit ama mitir), sanduuqu wuxuu soo jeedinayaa in la ka dhigo nidaamka isku-xidhka mashruuca, isla tallaabada qalinka ee barooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii faylku yahay latitude iyo longitude, ama mitir mashruuc fiit ah, sanduuqu wuxuu weyddiinayaa inaad marka hore doorato nidaamka isku-xidhka mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii faylku aanu sheegin, lambarradiisa waxaa loo qaadanayaa inay yihiin isku-xidhka mashruuca. Waxaad doortaa nidaamka faylka halkii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofi-dusha-sida-geotiff\"\u003EDhoofi dusha sida GeoTIFF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E kooxda GIS.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta GeoTIFF dooro dusha (dhulka jira ama dusha la sawiray) iyo cabbirka unugga. Default-ka wuxuu ka imanayaa celceliska geesta saddexagallada dusha. Sanduuqu wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka gridka uu qori doono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload GeoTIFF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylku waa hal kanaal oo dhererro point-ka kaymaha 32-bit ah, unugyada mashruuca, oo dusha ballaadhkeeda ku jira; unugyada ka baxsan dusha waa &quot;nodata&quot; (−3.4028235e38). Qiimaha unug kasta waa dhererka dusha dhexdhexaadka unugga. Isku-xidhku waa \u003Cstrong\u003Egrid\u003C/strong\u003E: mashruuc dhul ama isku-xidh maxalli ah waxa lagu beddelaa gridka. Faylku wuxuu sheegaa nidaamka isku-xidhka mashruuca koodka EPSG; nidaam aan koodka EPSG lahayn lama qori karo, sanduuquna wuu kaa digayaa inaad u sheegto waaxda GIS nidaamka uu yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta\"\u003EHubinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhristayaasha GeoTIFF iyo ASCII grid waa la hubiyay GDAL (rasterio ahaan), maktabada barnaamijyada GIS badankood u isticmaalaan inay akhriyaan faylasha kanu: gridyada 32-bit float iyo 16-bit integer, tiled iyo stripped, DEFLATE iyo LZW, nodata, scale iyo offset, pixel-is-point, gridka UTM, gridka state plane oo fiit US survey ah, iyo gridka latitude/longitude — qiimaha walba waa isku mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhristayaasha LAS iyo LAZ waa la hubiyay laspy: LAS 1.2 iyo 1.4, qaababka barooyinka 0, 1, 3, 6, 7 iyo 8, nidaamka isku-xidhka oo leh iyo oo aan lahayn, iyo LAZ oo ay qorday dhabarka LASzip-ka u dhiganta — barta kasta waa isku mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-xidhyada la beddelay waa la hubiyay PROJ ilaa 1 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeoTIFF-yada la dhoofiyay waa lagu akhriyay GDAL: nidaamka isku-xidhka, goobaha unugyada, nodata, cutubyada, iyo qiimayaasha oo la mid ah dusha ilaa 0.0001.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba halkan laguma furin barnaamijyada GIS ama CAD kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddelka datum-ka dhererka (moodelada geoid): dhererrada waxa loo isticmaalaa sida faylku leeyahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXogta waveform-ka, jawaabaha LiDAR ee aan ahayn fasal, midabyada iyo iftiinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhowr kanaal, overviews, ama faylal ka weyn 200 MB.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorista LAS ama LAZ dusha ama qalabkan (add-on-ka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EDaruurta barooyinka\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu qoraa daruur la nadiifiyay oo ah LAS 1.4 ama LAZ).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Xogta dhererka ee dadweynaha ah waxay u timaadaa laba habood: gridka dhererka (DEM: hal dhererka unug kasta oo laba geesood leh, badanaa GeoTIFF .tif ama ASCII grid .asc) iyo barooyinka LiDAR (malaayiin laser ah oo ku jira fayl .las, ama .laz marka la kaydiyo). CivilCraft wuxuu midkoodba u beddelaa barooyin sahan ama dusha, browser-ka gudihiisa: waxba lama soo rarayo. Fur faylka Riix Open (ama Import kooxda GIS) oo dooro faylka, ama jiid oo dhig qorshaha. ASCII grid ah, dooro sidoo kale faylka .prj, si CivilCraft u ogaado nidaamka isku-xidhkiisa. Sanduuqa soo geynta wuxuu muujinayaa waxa faylku sheegayo naftiisa: cabbirkiisa, unugyada ama barooyinka, nidaamka isku-xidhka, goobtiisa latitude iyo longitude, iyo kala-duwanaanta dhererka. LiDAR-ka, marka hore wuxuu akhrisaa barta kastaa mar si uu u tiriyo fasallada (cabbir-horumarka waa la muujiyaa; Cancel ayaa joojiya). GeoTIFF oo leh saddex ama afar kanaal (cas, cagaar, buluug) waa sawir, mana aha dhererro: waxay tagaa layers-ka khariidadda. Dooro waxa la soo gelinayo Aagga: The project’s extents and a margin (qor cidhifka), What the plan shows now, ama The whole file. Qaybtaas faylka keliya ayaa la akhriyaa. Dhimo ilaa: masaafada u dhexaysa barooyinka aad heshid, cutubyada mashruuca. Xariiqda hoose ee dejinta waxay muujinaysaa inta barood oo ay taasi siinayso intaad qorto. Gridka, CivilCraft wuxuu hayaa unug kasta labaad, saddexaad … sidaas awgeed dhererrada waxay sii joogaan sida faylka oo kale; ma celceliyo unugyada. LiDAR-ka, aagga waxa loo jarayaa labajibaaro cabbirkaas leh, mid kasta waxa lagu hayaa hal bar: The point nearest each cell’s center (waa default-ka), The lowest point in each cell (wanaagsan marka faylka aanu fasal dhul lahayn: dhulku wuxuu hoostaa geedaha), ama The average of each cell’s points. Fasallada (LiDAR): dhulka (fasal 2) waa la calaamadiyaa marka faylka leeyahay; dhismayaasha, geedaha iyo buuqa waa la dhaafaa. Marka aanu fasal dhul lahayn, fasal kasta waa la calaamadiyaa, wadahadalkuna wuu sheegaa. Dhulka (LiDAR, 0.8): daruur drone ah ma lahan fasal dhul. Marka faylka aanu lahayn, wadahadalku wuxuu ku bilaabaa Find the ground myself (drone clouds, no ground class): fasal kasta marka laga reebo buuqa waa la akhriyaa, barta ugu hooseysa unug kasta waa la hayaa, kadibna CivilCraft wuxuu dhismayaasha, geedaha iyo barooyinka hoose ee kala firidhsan ka saaraa shaandhe morphology-ka oo horumaraysa (Zhang iyo kuwa kale, 2003) oo aad hagi karto: Shayga ugu weyn ee la saaro (ballaca dhismaha ugu weyn; daaqadaha way weynaadaan ilaa ay daboolaan; 0 waxay ka dhigan tahay 20 unug) iyo Jiidka dhulka ee ugu jiifka badan. Shaqada waxay ku dhacdaa gridka barooyinka ugu hooseeya, sidaas darteed daruur ka kooban toban milyan oo barood ma kharash badan tahay tirada unugyadeeda (dhimista waa hal marin oo socda). Masaafadu waa unugga: mid ka weyn waa dhakhso badan yahay, oo wax yar oo yaryar ka sii luntaa intaad filan tahay, mid ka yar wuxuu hayaa faahfaahin dhulka badan. Warbixinta waxay sheegaysaa inta barood oo la hayay dhul ahaan, inta unug oo lagu saaray shay ahaan, iyo inta barood hoose oo kala firidhsan oo la tuuray. Sahan drone ah oo 300 m ah oo la sameeyay, oo leh shan dhismood, 70 geed iyo 200 barood hoose oo dibadda ah, barooyinka la hayay waxay ku jireen 3 cm dhexdooda dhulka runta ah, mana hayn saqaf ama geed. Dhererka faylka: mitir, fiit, ama fiit US survey. Marka faylku sheego, cutubkiisa horay ayaa la doortaa. Marka aanu sheegin, waa inaad dooratid: sanduuqu wuxuu muujinayaa kala-duwanaanta dhererka labada jid, si aad u ogaato kan macquul u ah goobta. Soo geli sida (gridka kaliya): Survey points (description DEM), ama The surface itself (a grid of triangles). Hal soo gelin ma qaadan karto ka badan 500,000 bar. Marka doorashadu ka badan siiso, sanduuqu wuxuu sheegaa inta ay ka badan tahay iyo masaafada ku habboon, Import wuu damaa. Riix Import. Cabbir-horumarka akhrinta ayaa muuqda; Cancel waa joojiyaa, waxna ma beddela. Cutubyada dhererka waa dhibaato caadi ah. DEM-yo badan oo state plane ah waxay leeyihiin bari iyo woqooyi fiit ah, laakiin dhererro mitir ah. Kala-duwanaanta uu sanduuqu muujiyo ka hubi wixii aad ka garanayso goobta. Waxa aad hesho Barooyinka sahanka: waxay lambar u helaan ka dib barta ugu lambarka weyn, sharaxaadda DEM (gridka) ama LIDAR, si ay u sameeyaan koox barooyin oo keliya hoosta Barooyin, dusha ayay u dhisaan sida barooyinka kale. Soo gelinta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa mar kale ka saaraa. Dusha laftiisa: dusha TIN ee gridka, laba saddexagallo unug kasta, oo lagu kala jeexay jiifka koonfur-galbeed ilaa waqooyi-bari. Saddexagallo leh geesta aan xog lahayn waa la dhaafaa, sidaas awgeed godadka xogta ayaa godad ah. Dusha waxay la mid tahay gridka barta kasta oo gridka ah, waxayna dhexdooda tahay dayax fidsan oo saddexagallo kasta gudihiisa. Waxay beddeshaa dusha mashruuca (sanduuqu wuu weyddiinayaa hore), Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u soo celinaysa dusha hore. Cinwaanka xagga bidix wuxuu leeyahay Dusha (ka gridka dhererka). Nidaamyada isku-xidhka Haddii mashruucu leeyahay nidaam isku-xidhka faylkuna sheego mid kale, barta kasta waa la beddelaa nidaamka mashruuca (iyo dhulka ama isku-xidhka maxalliga ah haddii ay leeyihiin). Haddii mashruucu aanu lahayn, nidaamka faylkuna yahay cutubka mashruuca (fiit ama mitir), sanduuqu wuxuu soo jeedinayaa in la ka dhigo nidaamka isku-xidhka mashruuca, isla tallaabada qalinka ee barooyinka. Haddii faylku yahay latitude iyo longitude, ama mitir mashruuc fiit ah, sanduuqu wuxuu weyddiinayaa inaad marka hore doorato nidaamka isku-xidhka mashruuca. Haddii faylku aanu sheegin, lambarradiisa waxaa loo qaadanayaa inay yihiin isku-xidhka mashruuca. Waxaad doortaa nidaamka faylka halkii. Dhoofi dusha sida GeoTIFF Riix Export kooxda GIS. Qaybta GeoTIFF dooro dusha (dhulka jira ama dusha la sawiray) iyo cabbirka unugga. Default-ka wuxuu ka imanayaa celceliska geesta saddexagallada dusha. Sanduuqu wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka gridka uu qori doono. Riix Download GeoTIFF. Faylku waa hal kanaal oo dhererro point-ka kaymaha 32-bit ah, unugyada mashruuca, oo dusha ballaadhkeeda ku jira; unugyada ka baxsan dusha waa \"nodata\" (−3.4028235e38). Qiimaha unug kasta waa dhererka dusha dhexdhexaadka unugga. Isku-xidhku waa grid: mashruuc dhul ama isku-xidh maxalli ah waxa lagu beddelaa gridka. Faylku wuxuu sheegaa nidaamka isku-xidhka mashruuca koodka EPSG; nidaam aan koodka EPSG lahayn lama qori karo, sanduuquna wuu kaa digayaa inaad u sheegto waaxda GIS nidaamka uu yahay. Hubinta Akhristayaasha GeoTIFF iyo ASCII grid waa la hubiyay GDAL (rasterio ahaan), maktabada barnaamijyada GIS badankood u isticmaalaan inay akhriyaan faylasha kanu: gridyada 32-bit float iyo 16-bit integer, tiled iyo stripped, DEFLATE iyo LZW, nodata, scale iyo offset, pixel-is-point, gridka UTM, gridka state plane oo fiit US survey ah, iyo gridka latitude/longitude — qiimaha walba waa isku mid. Akhristayaasha LAS iyo LAZ waa la hubiyay laspy: LAS 1.2 iyo 1.4, qaababka barooyinka 0, 1, 3, 6, 7 iyo 8, nidaamka isku-xidhka oo leh iyo oo aan lahayn, iyo LAZ oo ay qorday dhabarka LASzip-ka u dhiganta — barta kasta waa isku mid. Isku-xidhyada la beddelay waa la hubiyay PROJ ilaa 1 mm. GeoTIFF-yada la dhoofiyay waa lagu akhriyay GDAL: nidaamka isku-xidhka, goobaha unugyada, nodata, cutubyada, iyo qiimayaasha oo la mid ah dusha ilaa 0.0001. Waxba halkan laguma furin barnaamijyada GIS ama CAD kale. Weli lama dhisin Beddelka datum-ka dhererka (moodelada geoid): dhererrada waxa loo isticmaalaa sida faylku leeyahay. Xogta waveform-ka, jawaabaha LiDAR ee aan ahayn fasal, midabyada iyo iftiinka. Dhowr kanaal, overviews, ama faylal ka weyn 200 MB. Qorista LAS ama LAZ dusha ama qalabkan (add-on-ka Daruurta barooyinka wuxuu qoraa daruur la nadiifiyay oo ah LAS 1.4 ama LAZ).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"edit-points","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Wax ka beddel barta sahanka","summary":"Beddel lambarka barta, isku-xidhkeeda, dhererkeeda ama sharaxaaddeeda, ama jiid oo geey meel cusub oo qorshaha ku taal.","section":"tasks","order":14,"keywords":["wax ka beddel barta","guuri barta","beddel dhererka","dib u lambaree","lambarka barta","sharaxaad","jiid","woqooyi","bari","hagaaji barta","qalad"],"headings":[{"id":"beddel-qiimayaasha-barta","text":"Beddel qiimayaasha barta","level":2},{"id":"guuri-barta-qorshaha","text":"Guuri barta qorshaha","level":2},{"id":"xarriiqyada-jabinta-waxay-raacaan-barta","text":"Xarriiqyada jabinta waxay raacaan barta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaadis qaldan, dhererka laaska oo qaldan, sharaxaad qaldan la qoray: hagaaji barta keliya, dusha ayaa raacaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-qiimayaasha-barta\"\u003EBeddel qiimayaasha barta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E, guji barta qorshaha. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa lambarkeeda, bari, woqooyi, dhererka iyo sharaxaadda sanduuqyo ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiimaha cusub qor oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama guji meel kale). Barta aan dhererka lahayn, ka dhig \u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka\u003C/strong\u003E oo banaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha, kontuurada iyo waxa dhan ee ku saleysan ayaa isla markiiba cusboonaysiiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa ka noqotaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa samee mar kale. Qiimaha CivilCraft aan isticmaali karin (lambar uu horay barta kale u leedahay, xaraf isku-xidhka ku jira) waa la diidaa: sanduuqa ayaa la muujiyaa oo status bar-ka ayaa sheegaa sababta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESharaxaad code cusub oo cusub ayaa abuuraysa koox barooyin cusub, sida soo dejintu samaysa (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EDhis dusha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guuri-barta-qorshaha\"\u003EGuuri barta qorshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro barta (waxay heshaa wareeg).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid wareegga. Status bar-ka wuxuu muujinayaa bari iyo woqooyiga ay mari doonto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii dayso si aad u guurto; dhererkeedu way joogi doonaa. Ka hor intaadan sii dayn, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad dib ugu celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xarriiqyada-jabinta-waxay-raacaan-barta\"\u003EXarriiqyada jabinta waxay raacaan barta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarriiqa jabinta ee lagu sawiray qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreakline\u003C/span\u003E waxay koobiyeysaa barooyinka uu mari. Marka aad barta guurto ama dhererkeeda beddesho, geesaha xarriiqa jabinta ee ku saleysan ayaa iyaga la guurta, isla tallaabo gudaheeda. Kooxaha xarriiqa jabinta ee laga sameeyay sharaxaadaha had iyo jeer waa dib loo dhisaa barooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha laga akhriyay faylka LandXML wuxuu hayaa saddexagalladiisa: wax ka beddelka barta waxay beddelaan kaliya ka dib markii aad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERebuild the surface from the points\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Qaadis qaldan, dhererka laaska oo qaldan, sharaxaad qaldan la qoray: hagaaji barta keliya, dusha ayaa raacaysa. Beddel qiimayaasha barta Adigoo isticmaalaya Select, guji barta qorshaha. Sifooyinka wuxuu muujinayaa lambarkeeda, bari, woqooyi, dhererka iyo sharaxaadda sanduuqyo ku jira. Qiimaha cusub qor oo riix Enter (ama guji meel kale). Barta aan dhererka lahayn, ka dhig Dhererka oo banaan. Dusha, kontuurada iyo waxa dhan ee ku saleysan ayaa isla markiiba cusboonaysiiya. Beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z waa ka noqotaa, Ctrl+Y waa samee mar kale. Qiimaha CivilCraft aan isticmaali karin (lambar uu horay barta kale u leedahay, xaraf isku-xidhka ku jira) waa la diidaa: sanduuqa ayaa la muujiyaa oo status bar-ka ayaa sheegaa sababta. Sharaxaad code cusub oo cusub ayaa abuuraysa koox barooyin cusub, sida soo dejintu samaysa (eeg Dhis dusha). Guuri barta qorshaha Dooro barta (waxay heshaa wareeg). Jiid wareegga. Status bar-ka wuxuu muujinayaa bari iyo woqooyiga ay mari doonto. Sii dayso si aad u guurto; dhererkeedu way joogi doonaa. Ka hor intaadan sii dayn, riix Esc si aad dib ugu celiso. Xarriiqyada jabinta waxay raacaan barta Xarriiqa jabinta ee lagu sawiray qalabka Breakline waxay koobiyeysaa barooyinka uu mari. Marka aad barta guurto ama dhererkeeda beddesho, geesaha xarriiqa jabinta ee ku saleysan ayaa iyaga la guurta, isla tallaabo gudaheeda. Kooxaha xarriiqa jabinta ee laga sameeyay sharaxaadaha had iyo jeer waa dib loo dhisaa barooyinka. Dusha laga akhriyay faylka LandXML wuxuu hayaa saddexagalladiisa: wax ka beddelka barta waxay beddelaan kaliya ka dib markii aad Rebuild the surface from the points.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"copy-paste-points","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dooro, koobiyee iyo dhaji barahaaga sahanka","summary":"Dooro barood sahan oo guji, Shift iyo sanduuq, ama dhammaantood hal mar; koobiyee, goo, dhaji, ku dhaji meeshii, samee nuqul iyo tirtir iyagoo leh lambar cusub oo aan isku dhicin; dhaji safafka barta spreadsheet-ka iyo ka soo.","section":"tasks","order":15,"keywords":["koobiyee","dhaji","goo","samee nuqul","tirtir barood","dooro barood","dooro dhammaan","sanduuq dooro","daaqad","clipboard","spreadsheet","csv","lambarada barta","ku dhaji meeshii","clone","calaamadaynta goobta"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-barood","text":"Dooro barood","level":2},{"id":"koobiyee-goo-iyo-tirtir","text":"Koobiyee, goo iyo tirtir","level":2},{"id":"dhaji","text":"Dhaji","level":2},{"id":"lambarada-barta-ma-isku-dhacaan","text":"Lambarada barta ma isku dhacaan","level":2},{"id":"samee-nuqul","text":"Samee nuqul","level":2},{"id":"spreadsheet-ama-faylka-qoraalka","text":"Spreadsheet ama faylka qoraalka","level":2},{"id":"mashruucyada-iyo-tab-yada-ka-dhexeeya","text":"Mashruucyada iyo tab-yada ka dhexeeya","level":2},{"id":"wixii-aan-la-koobiyeyn","text":"Wixii aan la koobiyeyn","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBarahaaga sahanka waa la koobiyeyn karaa oo dhajin karaa mashruuca gudihiisa, mashruucyada ka dhexeeya laba tab oo browser ah, iyo spreadsheet-ka labada dhinac. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo, dusha ayaa isla markiiba dib u dhisma barahaaga cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-barood\"\u003EDooro barood\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuji\u003C/strong\u003E barta si aad u doorato (iyo keliya). Lambarradeeda ayaa muuqda hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eguji\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku darta barta doorashada, ama ka saaraysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ejiid\u003C/strong\u003E waxay sameeyaa sanduuq: barahaa gudihiisa ayaa lagu daraa doorashada. Haddii aad barahaaga ku jiidto si wareeg ah, waxay noqotaa lasso; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/lasso-selection\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/lasso-selection\"\u003EDoorashada lasso ee barahaaga sahanka\u003C/a\u003E. Jiid aan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E lahayn waxay u wareejisaa sida caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dhammaan bararka\u003C/span\u003E) waxay doortaa barta oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarahaa la doortay waxay leeyihiin giraan. Marka wax ka badan hal la doorto, \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa inta ay tahay, lambarradooda, kala duwanaanshaha heerkooda iyo kooxahooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koobiyee-goo-iyo-tirtir\"\u003EKoobiyee, goo iyo tirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay koobiyeysaa barahaa la doortay. CivilCraft wuxuu koobiga ku hayaa, waxayna sidoo kale dhigtaa clipboard-ka nidaamka safaf barood ah, si aad isla markiiba ugu dhajin karto spreadsheet ama faylka qoraalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E way koobiyeysaa oo way tirtirtaa, hal tallaabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa tirtira. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafafku waa: barta, waqooyiga, bariga, heerka, sharaxaadda (P,N,E,Z,D), oo ay kala soocaan comma, saddex meelood oo jajab ah. Si bariga uu uga horreeyo waqooyiga, deji \u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka barta\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E. Sharaxaad uu spreadsheet-ku u arko qaacido (ku bilaabanta =, +, - ama @) waxaa hor dhigta apostrophe, si ay u sii jirto qoraal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaji\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E. Barahaa waxay raacaan tusaha iyagoo ah calaamado yaryar, oo leh xariiq dhibcaha ah oo ku soo celinaya meesha ay ka yimaadeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha ay tagayaan. Dhexda barahii la koobiyeeyay ayaa dhacda gujinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si ay ugu dhacaan koordinaatadooda, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhaji meeshii\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dhajiyaa koordinaatadooda isla markiiba. Barahii la dhajiyay ayaa markaas la doortaa, si aad mar kale u koobiyeyso, u guuriso ama u tirtirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGujinta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E ee toolbar-ka waxay akhrisaa clipboard-ka nidaamka. Markii ugu horreysay, browser-ku wuu weydiin karaa in CivilCraft uu arki karo clipboard-ka. Haddii aad diido, badhanka toolbar-ka wuxuu dhajiyaa koobiga CivilCraft oo keliya; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wali wuxuu dhajiyaa safafka spreadsheet-ka iyada oo aan wax la weydiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lambarada-barta-ma-isku-dhacaan\"\u003ELambarada barta ma isku dhacaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba barood weligood lambar ma wadaagaan. Markaad dhajiso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarta la dhajiyay waxay ilaalisaa lambarkeeda haddii mashruucu aanu barta kale lahayn. Sidaas darteed ka dib \u003Cstrong\u003EGoo\u003C/strong\u003E, barahu waxay ku dhajmaan lambarkooda, barahii laga koobiyeeyay mashruuc kale waxay ilaalinayaan lambarkooda meelaha bannaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarta la dhajiyay oo lambarkeeda la qabsaday waxay heshaa lambar buuxa oo cusub: midka ugu sarreeya ee la isticmaalayo oo dheeraad ah, iyada oo kor loo tiriyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBar-xaaladdu waxay sheegaysaa wixii dhacay, tusaale ahaan &quot;1 ayaa ilaalisay lambarkeeda; 9 waxay heleen lambar cusub: 10–18 waxay noqdeen 277–285&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E waxaad dooran kartaa \u003Cstrong\u003EHad iyo jeer lambar cusub\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo lambar ay lambarada cusub ka bilaabmaan, tusaale ahaan 5000 barahaaga naqshadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxaha barta ee dusha ka dhisaya \u003Cstrong\u003Ekhad jebin\u003C/strong\u003E waxay barahooda ku xidhaan tirada lambarkooda. Nuqullada barta khad jebinta (tusaale ahaan dhibcaha FL) waxay helaan lambarro cusub oo sare, waxayna ku xidhmaan dhamaadka khadkaas, laga yaabaa inay leeyihiin kala fogaansho dheer. Hubi qorshaha markaad dhajiso barahaas, ama dhig kooxdooda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarood\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-nuqul\"\u003ESamee nuqul\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee nuqul\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa nuqul barahii la doortay oo raacaya tusaha: guji meesha ay tagayso. Nuqullada had iyo jeer lambar cusub ayay helaan, clipboard-ka CivilCraft waxaa lagu hayaa sidii hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spreadsheet-ama-faylka-qoraalka\"\u003ESpreadsheet ama faylka qoraalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro safafka barahaaga spreadsheet-ka (barta, waqooyiga, bariga, heerka, sharaxaadda) oo koobiyee. CivilCraft riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo guji meesha ay tagayaan, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si ay ugu dhacaan koordinaatadooda, taas oo badanaa aad rabto xogta sahanka dhabta ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafafku waxay u akhrisan yihiin sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/point-file-formats\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/point-file-formats\"\u003Efaylka barta\u003C/a\u003E oo kale: comma, tab ama meel-bannaan, safka madasha haddii uu jiro. Madasha la&#039;aanteed, dalbashada tiirarka waxay ka timaadaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka barta\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkay labaduba jiraan, CivilCraft wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa cusubaha: safafka clipboard-ka nidaamka ee ka duwan koobigii ugu dambeeyay ee CivilCraft waxay ahaayeen kuwa dambe la koobiyeeyay, sidaas darteed ayaa la dhajiyaa. Qoraal aan barood lahayn waa la iska indho tirayaa, koobiga CivilCraft ayaa halkiisa lagu dhajiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mashruucyada-iyo-tab-yada-ka-dhexeeya\"\u003EMashruucyada iyo tab-yada ka dhexeeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoobigu wuxuu ku jiraa browser-kan, sidaas darteed tab labaad oo CivilCraft ah ayaa dhajin karta, xitaa ka dib markii tab-kii hore la xiro. Barahii laga koobiyeeyay mashruuc mitir ah oo lagu dhajiyay mashruuc fiit ah waxay ilaalinayaan lambarradooda sidooda: waxba lama beddelo, bar-xaaladduna way sheegtaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wixii-aan-la-koobiyeyn\"\u003EWixii aan la koobiyeyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda waxaa la koobiyeeyaa kaliya barahaaga sahanka. Jidadka, padka, shabakadaha biibaanka, khadadka jebinta iyo xuduudyada weli ma la koobiyeyn karo ama dhajin karo. Dhajinta ma guurin karto barahaa jira: isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E iyo dhaji, ama guuri hal barood mar (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/edit-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/edit-points\"\u003EWax ka beddel barta sahanka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Barahaaga sahanka waa la koobiyeyn karaa oo dhajin karaa mashruuca gudihiisa, mashruucyada ka dhexeeya laba tab oo browser ah, iyo spreadsheet-ka labada dhinac. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo, dusha ayaa isla markiiba dib u dhisma barahaaga cusub. Dooro barood Marka Dooro (V): Guji barta si aad u doorato (iyo keliya). Lambarradeeda ayaa muuqda hoosta Guryaha. Shift iyo guji waxay ku darta barta doorashada, ama ka saaraysaa. Shift iyo jiid waxay sameeyaa sanduuq: barahaa gudihiisa ayaa lagu daraa doorashada. Haddii aad barahaaga ku jiidto si wareeg ah, waxay noqotaa lasso; eeg Doorashada lasso ee barahaaga sahanka. Jiid aan Shift lahayn waxay u wareejisaa sida caadiga ah. Ctrl+A (ama Wax dheeraad ah › Dooro dhammaan bararka) waxay doortaa barta oo dhan. Esc (ama Wax dheeraad ah › Ka saar dhammaan) wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada. Barahaa la doortay waxay leeyihiin giraan. Marka wax ka badan hal la doorto, Guryaha wuxuu muujinayaa inta ay tahay, lambarradooda, kala duwanaanshaha heerkooda iyo kooxahooda. Koobiyee, goo iyo tirtir Koobiyee ama Ctrl+C waxay koobiyeysaa barahaa la doortay. CivilCraft wuxuu koobiga ku hayaa, waxayna sidoo kale dhigtaa clipboard-ka nidaamka safaf barood ah, si aad isla markiiba ugu dhajin karto spreadsheet ama faylka qoraalka. Wax dheeraad ah › Goo ama Ctrl+X way koobiyeysaa oo way tirtirtaa, hal tallaabo. Wax dheeraad ah › Tirtir ama Delete ayaa tirtira. Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaysa. Safafku waa: barta, waqooyiga, bariga, heerka, sharaxaadda (P,N,E,Z,D), oo ay kala soocaan comma, saddex meelood oo jajab ah. Si bariga uu uga horreeyo waqooyiga, deji Safafka barta ee Dejinta CivilCraft. Sharaxaad uu spreadsheet-ku u arko qaacido (ku bilaabanta =, +, - ama @) waxaa hor dhigta apostrophe, si ay u sii jirto qoraal. Dhaji Riix Ctrl+V ama guji Dhaji. Barahaa waxay raacaan tusaha iyagoo ah calaamado yaryar, oo leh xariiq dhibcaha ah oo ku soo celinaya meesha ay ka yimaadeen. Guji meesha ay tagayaan. Dhexda barahii la koobiyeeyay ayaa dhacda gujinta. Ama riix Enter si ay ugu dhacaan koordinaatadooda, ama Esc si aad u joojiso. Wax dheeraad ah › Ku dhaji meeshii ama Ctrl+Shift+V wuxuu dhajiyaa koordinaatadooda isla markiiba. Barahii la dhajiyay ayaa markaas la doortaa, si aad mar kale u koobiyeyso, u guuriso ama u tirtirto. Gujinta Dhaji ee toolbar-ka waxay akhrisaa clipboard-ka nidaamka. Markii ugu horreysay, browser-ku wuu weydiin karaa in CivilCraft uu arki karo clipboard-ka. Haddii aad diido, badhanka toolbar-ka wuxuu dhajiyaa koobiga CivilCraft oo keliya; Ctrl+V wali wuxuu dhajiyaa safafka spreadsheet-ka iyada oo aan wax la weydiin. Lambarada barta ma isku dhacaan Laba barood weligood lambar ma wadaagaan. Markaad dhajiso: Barta la dhajiyay waxay ilaalisaa lambarkeeda haddii mashruucu aanu barta kale lahayn. Sidaas darteed ka dib Goo, barahu waxay ku dhajmaan lambarkooda, barahii laga koobiyeeyay mashruuc kale waxay ilaalinayaan lambarkooda meelaha bannaan. Barta la dhajiyay oo lambarkeeda la qabsaday waxay heshaa lambar buuxa oo cusub: midka ugu sarreeya ee la isticmaalayo oo dheeraad ah, iyada oo kor loo tiriyo. Bar-xaaladdu waxay sheegaysaa wixii dhacay, tusaale ahaan \"1 ayaa ilaalisay lambarkeeda; 9 waxay heleen lambar cusub: 10–18 waxay noqdeen 277–285\". Dejinta CivilCraft waxaad dooran kartaa Had iyo jeer lambar cusub, iyo lambar ay lambarada cusub ka bilaabmaan, tusaale ahaan 5000 barahaaga naqshadda. Kooxaha barta ee dusha ka dhisaya khad jebin waxay barahooda ku xidhaan tirada lambarkooda. Nuqullada barta khad jebinta (tusaale ahaan dhibcaha FL) waxay helaan lambarro cusub oo sare, waxayna ku xidhmaan dhamaadka khadkaas, laga yaabaa inay leeyihiin kala fogaansho dheer. Hubi qorshaha markaad dhajiso barahaas, ama dhig kooxdooda Barood. Samee nuqul Wax dheeraad ah › Samee nuqul ama Ctrl+D wuxuu sameeyaa nuqul barahii la doortay oo raacaya tusaha: guji meesha ay tagayso. Nuqullada had iyo jeer lambar cusub ayay helaan, clipboard-ka CivilCraft waxaa lagu hayaa sidii hore. Spreadsheet ama faylka qoraalka Dooro safafka barahaaga spreadsheet-ka (barta, waqooyiga, bariga, heerka, sharaxaadda) oo koobiyee. CivilCraft riix Ctrl+V oo guji meesha ay tagayaan, ama riix Ctrl+Shift+V si ay ugu dhacaan koordinaatadooda, taas oo badanaa aad rabto xogta sahanka dhabta ah. Safafku waxay u akhrisan yihiin sida faylka barta oo kale: comma, tab ama meel-bannaan, safka madasha haddii uu jiro. Madasha la'aanteed, dalbashada tiirarka waxay ka timaadaa Safafka barta ee Dejinta CivilCraft. Markay labaduba jiraan, CivilCraft wuxuu go'aaminayaa cusubaha: safafka clipboard-ka nidaamka ee ka duwan koobigii ugu dambeeyay ee CivilCraft waxay ahaayeen kuwa dambe la koobiyeeyay, sidaas darteed ayaa la dhajiyaa. Qoraal aan barood lahayn waa la iska indho tirayaa, koobiga CivilCraft ayaa halkiisa lagu dhajiyaa. Mashruucyada iyo tab-yada ka dhexeeya Koobigu wuxuu ku jiraa browser-kan, sidaas darteed tab labaad oo CivilCraft ah ayaa dhajin karta, xitaa ka dib markii tab-kii hore la xiro. Barahii laga koobiyeeyay mashruuc mitir ah oo lagu dhajiyay mashruuc fiit ah waxay ilaalinayaan lambarradooda sidooda: waxba lama beddelo, bar-xaaladduna way sheegtaa. Wixii aan la koobiyeyn Hadda waxaa la koobiyeeyaa kaliya barahaaga sahanka. Jidadka, padka, shabakadaha biibaanka, khadadka jebinta iyo xuduudyada weli ma la koobiyeyn karo ama dhajin karo. Dhajinta ma guurin karto barahaa jira: isticmaal Goo iyo dhaji, ama guuri hal barood mar (Wax ka beddel barta sahanka).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"lasso-selection","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Doorashada lasso ee barooyinka sahanka","summary":"Shift ku riix oo jiid hareeraha barooyinka sahanka si aad u doorato, sida daaqad, isgoys ama xayn; Space ku beddel inta aad jiidayso. Jiid toosan weli waxay sawirtaa sanduuq.","section":"tasks","order":16,"keywords":["lasso","gacanta-xor ah","dooro barooyin","doorasho","daaqad","isgoys","xayn","space","polygon","doorashada sanduuqa","shift jiid"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontid","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid","level":2},{"id":"samee-lasso","text":"Samee lasso","level":2},{"id":"daaqad-isgoys-iyo-xayn","text":"Daaqad, isgoys iyo xayn","level":2},{"id":"eeg-sidoo-kale","text":"Eeg sidoo kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida loo doorto barooyinka sahanka adigoo wareegaya, marka sanduuqu ka badan yahay barooyinka aadan doonayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-lasso\"\u003ESamee lasso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, riix qorshaha oo jiid \u003Cstrong\u003Ewareeg\u003C/strong\u003E barooyinka aad rabto, adigoo marka hore u dhaqaqaya \u003Cstrong\u003Emidig\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii deyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha ku jira hareeraha ayaa lagu daraa doorashada. Jiid aan ka fogaanaynin khad toosan wuxuu sawiraa sanduuq, sida hore; markii uu ka leexdo khadkaas (ka badan 12 pixel qiyaas ahaan) wuxuu noqdaa lasso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daaqad-isgoys-iyo-xayn\"\u003EDaaqad, isgoys iyo xayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad jiidda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELasso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidig marka hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqad (hareer adag)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyinka ku jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBidix marka hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsgoys (jajab, cagaar)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyinka ku jira, iyo barooyinka ay hareerta taabanayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inta aad jiidayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqad, kadibna isgoys, kadibna xayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXayn (jid jajab, oranji ah, aan la xirin): barooyinka ay jidku marayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStatus-khaddu wuxuu magacaabaa lasso-ga inta aad jiidayso. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inta aad jiidayso wuu joojiyaa, wixna ma doorto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXayn waa habka degdega ah ee lagu doortaa barooyinka ku dhex jira kerb-ka ama khadka godka: jiid dhinacooda oo sii deyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-sidoo-kale\"\u003EEeg sidoo kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/copy-paste-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/copy-paste-points\"\u003EDooro, koobiyee oo dhaji barooyinka sahanka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid Sida loo doorto barooyinka sahanka adigoo wareegaya, marka sanduuqu ka badan yahay barooyinka aadan doonayn. Samee lasso Guji Select (ama riix V). Hay Shift, riix qorshaha oo jiid wareeg barooyinka aad rabto, adigoo marka hore u dhaqaqaya midig. Sii deyso. Dhibcaha ku jira hareeraha ayaa lagu daraa doorashada. Jiid aan ka fogaanaynin khad toosan wuxuu sawiraa sanduuq, sida hore; markii uu ka leexdo khadkaas (ka badan 12 pixel qiyaas ahaan) wuxuu noqdaa lasso. Daaqad, isgoys iyo xayn Waxa aad jiidda Lasso Doorta Midig marka hore Daaqad (hareer adag) Barooyinka ku jira Bidix marka hore Isgoys (jajab, cagaar) Barooyinka ku jira, iyo barooyinka ay hareerta taabanayso Riix Space inta aad jiidayso Daaqad, kadibna isgoys, kadibna xayn Xayn (jid jajab, oranji ah, aan la xirin): barooyinka ay jidku marayo Status-khaddu wuxuu magacaabaa lasso-ga inta aad jiidayso. Esc inta aad jiidayso wuu joojiyaa, wixna ma doorto. Xayn waa habka degdega ah ee lagu doortaa barooyinka ku dhex jira kerb-ka ama khadka godka: jiid dhinacooda oo sii deyso. Eeg sidoo kale Dooro, koobiyee oo dhaji barooyinka sahanka Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","lang":"so"},{"slug":"description-keys","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Furayaasha sharaxaadda iyo koodhadhka xarriiqda","summary":"Ku beddel koodhadhka goobta kooxaha barta leh sharaxaad, oo ku xidh barood koodhadh leh khadad (bilow, dhamaad, xidh) oo noqda khadad jebin.","section":"tasks","order":16,"keywords":["furayaasha sharaxaadda","koodhadhka goobta","koodhadhka xarriiqda","shakhsiyaadka","xarriiqyada","bilow","dhamaad","xidh","kooxaha barta","koodhadhka","koodhadhka sahanka","data collector","khadadka jebinta","kurbi","geesta waddada"],"headings":[{"id":"koodhadhka-xarriiqda","text":"Koodhadhka xarriiqda","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-sharaxaadda","text":"Furayaasha sharaxaadda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESahamiyayaashu koodhadh bar kasta oo goobta ah: \u003Ccode\u003EEP\u003C/code\u003E geesta waddada, \u003Ccode\u003ETC\u003C/code\u003E geesta kurbiga sare, \u003Ccode\u003EBLDG\u003C/code\u003E geeska dhismaha. Koodhadhku waa ereyga koowaad ee sharaxaadda barta. CivilCraft wuxuu barta kooxeeyaa koodhadhkaas, koodhadhka xarriiqda ee ku xiga wuxuu u beddelaa khadad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koodhadhka-xarriiqda\"\u003EKoodhadhka xarriiqda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoodhadhka xarriiqda waa ereyga ku xiga koodhadhka goobta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESharaxaad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EEP B\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBilow xarriiq geesta waddada cusub bartan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EEP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESii wad xarriiqda EP ee hadda jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EEP E\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhamee xarriiqda EP ee hadda jirta bartan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EBLDG C\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXidh dhismaha: ku xidh barta dib u dhig bartii ugu horreysay ee khadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarahaa leh koodhad isku mid ah waxaa lagu xidhaa lambarkooda tiro ahaan. Koodhadhyo kala duwan waa khado kala duwan xitaa haddii ay kooxda isku mid tahay, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003EEP1\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EEP2\u003C/code\u003E waxay siinayaan laba geesood isku mar. Koodhadh aan koodhad xarriiq isticmaalin, wuxuu u xidhmaa dhammaan barahiisa, sida nooca hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadadka kooxda loo isticmaalo \u003Cstrong\u003EKhad jebin\u003C/strong\u003E waxay noqdaan khadad jebin, mid kasta khad keliya, sidaas darteed kurbi leh god ma kala kordhin godka. Khadadka kooxaha kale waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha (layer V-NODE-LINE) waxayna u baxaan DXF, DWG iyo PDF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEreyada bilowga, dhamaadka iyo xidhka waa \u003Ccode\u003EB\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EBEG\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ESTART\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003EE\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EEND\u003C/code\u003E; iyo \u003Ccode\u003EC\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECLO\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECLOSE\u003C/code\u003E. Beddel iyaga, ama demi koodhadhka xarriiqda, qaabka hoose.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-sharaxaadda\"\u003EFurayaasha sharaxaadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFuraha sharaxaadda wuxuu koodhadh u beddelaa kooxda barta, isticmaal iyo sharaxaad dheer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBarood\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha sharaxaadda iyo koodhadhka xarriiqda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar fur\u003C/span\u003E oo buuxi safka:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKoodh\u003C/strong\u003E: koodhadhka goobta ee la isku dayo. \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu matalaa xaraf kasta, \u003Ccode\u003E?\u003C/code\u003E hal xaraf, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003EEP*\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu qabtaa EP, EP1 iyo EP12.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKooxda\u003C/strong\u003E: kooxda barta ee barahaan ku biirayaan (madhan = koodhadhka laftiisa). \u003Ccode\u003EEP*\u003C/code\u003E oo leh kooxda \u003Ccode\u003EEP\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu geliyaa EP1 iyo EP2 hal kooxood inta ay khad ahaan ku kala go&#039;ayaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaalka\u003C/strong\u003E: Barood, Khad jebin ama Ka saar, markii kooxdu hore u soo muuqato (ama ka tag \u003Cstrong\u003EBarood\u003C/strong\u003E miiska).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESharaxaadda\u003C/strong\u003E: magaca dheer, oo lagu muujiyo \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E barta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EBarood\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa barta furku qabto markaad qorayso. Furka ugu horreeya ee ku habboonaada koodhadh ayaa guuleysta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E. Kooxaha, dusha iyo qorshaha way raacaan hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqonaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda waxay hayaa isticmaalka aad siisay miiska \u003Cstrong\u003EBarood\u003C/strong\u003E; isticmaalka furka wuxuu dejiyaa kooxda cusub oo keliya. Furayaasha iyo koodhadhka xarriiqda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sahamiyayaashu koodhadh bar kasta oo goobta ah: EP geesta waddada, TC geesta kurbiga sare, BLDG geeska dhismaha. Koodhadhku waa ereyga koowaad ee sharaxaadda barta. CivilCraft wuxuu barta kooxeeyaa koodhadhkaas, koodhadhka xarriiqda ee ku xiga wuxuu u beddelaa khadad. Koodhadhka xarriiqda Koodhadhka xarriiqda waa ereyga ku xiga koodhadhka goobta: Sharaxaad Macnaha EP B Bilow xarriiq geesta waddada cusub bartan EP Sii wad xarriiqda EP ee hadda jirta EP E Dhamee xarriiqda EP ee hadda jirta bartan BLDG C Xidh dhismaha: ku xidh barta dib u dhig bartii ugu horreysay ee khadka Barahaa leh koodhad isku mid ah waxaa lagu xidhaa lambarkooda tiro ahaan. Koodhadhyo kala duwan waa khado kala duwan xitaa haddii ay kooxda isku mid tahay, sidaas darteed EP1 iyo EP2 waxay siinayaan laba geesood isku mar. Koodhadh aan koodhad xarriiq isticmaalin, wuxuu u xidhmaa dhammaan barahiisa, sida nooca hore. Khadadka kooxda loo isticmaalo Khad jebin waxay noqdaan khadad jebin, mid kasta khad keliya, sidaas darteed kurbi leh god ma kala kordhin godka. Khadadka kooxaha kale waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha (layer V-NODE-LINE) waxayna u baxaan DXF, DWG iyo PDF. Ereyada bilowga, dhamaadka iyo xidhka waa B, BEG, START; E, END; iyo C, CLO, CLOSE. Beddel iyaga, ama demi koodhadhka xarriiqda, qaabka hoose. Furayaasha sharaxaadda Furaha sharaxaadda wuxuu koodhadh u beddelaa kooxda barta, isticmaal iyo sharaxaad dheer. Hoosta Barood, guji Furayaasha sharaxaadda iyo koodhadhka xarriiqda. Guji Ku dar fur oo buuxi safka: Koodh: koodhadhka goobta ee la isku dayo. * wuxuu matalaa xaraf kasta, ? hal xaraf, sidaas darteed EP* wuxuu qabtaa EP, EP1 iyo EP12. Kooxda: kooxda barta ee barahaan ku biirayaan (madhan = koodhadhka laftiisa). EP* oo leh kooxda EP wuxuu geliyaa EP1 iyo EP2 hal kooxood inta ay khad ahaan ku kala go'ayaan. Isticmaalka: Barood, Khad jebin ama Ka saar, markii kooxdu hore u soo muuqato (ama ka tag Barood miiska). Sharaxaadda: magaca dheer, oo lagu muujiyo Guryaha barta. Tiirka Barood wuxuu tiriyaa barta furku qabto markaad qorayso. Furka ugu horreeya ee ku habboonaada koodhadh ayaa guuleysta. Guji Codso. Kooxaha, dusha iyo qorshaha way raacaan hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqonaysa. Kooxda waxay hayaa isticmaalka aad siisay miiska Barood; isticmaalka furka wuxuu dejiyaa kooxda cusub oo keliya. Furayaasha iyo koodhadhka xarriiqda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"build-surface","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhis oo hagaaji dusha","summary":"Sida CivilCraft u saddex-geesayo dhulka jira, iyo sida loo qaabeeyo iyada oo la isticmaalayo kooxaha xariiqyada jebinta, xariiqyada la sawiray, xadka dibadda iyo cidhifka dibadda ee ugu dheer.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["tin","dusha","saddex-geeska","xariiqa jebinta","xadka","dhulka jira","eg","abuur dusha","delaunay","saddex-geesaha","max edge","xadka dibadda"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-galaya-dusha","text":"Waxa galaya dusha","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-xariiqyada-koodka-leh-xariiqyo-jebin","text":"Ka dhig xariiqyada koodka leh xariiqyo jebin","level":2},{"id":"sawir-xariiq-jebin-dhibcaha-dhexdooda","text":"Sawir xariiq jebin dhibcaha dhexdooda","level":2},{"id":"sawir-xadka-dibadda","text":"Sawir xadka dibadda","level":2},{"id":"jar-saddex-geeskyada-dibadda-ee-dheer","text":"Jar saddex-geeskyada dibadda ee dheer","level":2},{"id":"akhri-warbixinta-dusha","text":"Akhri warbixinta dusha","level":2},{"id":"dusha-laga-akhriyay-landxml","text":"Dusha laga akhriyay LandXML","level":2},{"id":"xidhiidh","text":"Xidhiidh","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu leeyahay hal dusha dhulka jira mashruuc kasta. Waa TIN (triangulated irregular network) oo laga dhisay dhibcahaaga, waxaana si toos ah dib loo dhisaa marka kasta oo wax gelinta isbeddelo. Ma jiro amar &quot;rebuild&quot; ah, ma jiro dusha duugoobay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-galaya-dusha\"\u003EWaxa galaya dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibcaha kasta oo leh kor u kac kooxda loo dejiyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoints\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKooxda kasta oo loo dejiyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreakline\u003C/span\u003E, oo lagu xidhay lambarka dhibcaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiq jebin kasta oo aad ku sawirtay qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreakline\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXadka dibadda, haddii aad sawirtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejinta \u003Cstrong\u003ELongest outside edge\u003C/strong\u003E (Cidhifka dibadda ee ugu dheer).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddex-geeskuna ma gudbaan xariiq jebin: dusha waa la qasbaa inuu raaco, ka dibna waxaa si siman loo sameeyaa oo ku wareegsan (Delaunay meelaha kale oo dhan).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-xariiqyada-koodka-leh-xariiqyo-jebin\"\u003EKa dhig xariiqyada koodka leh xariiqyo jebin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca bidix hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EPoints\u003C/strong\u003E (Barood), hel kooxda (tusaale FL).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji doorashada \u003Cstrong\u003ESurface\u003C/strong\u003E (Dusha) ee kooxda oo ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreakline\u003C/span\u003E. Dusha dib ayuu u dhisaa, xariiqa waxaa lagu sawiraa midabka liin-cad (orange) (oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreaklines\u003C/span\u003E shidan hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDisplay\u003C/strong\u003E (Bandhig)), \u003Cstrong\u003EBreaklines\u003C/strong\u003E (Khadadka jebinta) ee xogta dusha ayaa kor u kacda hal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi xariiqa qorshaha. Waa inuu ka socdaa dhibic ilaa dhibic, siday u kala horreeyeen xariiqa la rasaasay. Haddii uu u dhaco sida zig-zag, kooxdu waxay haysaa in ka badan hal xariiq, ama dhibcaha lambarradooda si sax ah uma kala horreeyaan: dib u deji kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoints\u003C/span\u003E oo xariiqyada ku sawir gacanta (qaybta soo socota).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-xariiq-jebin-dhibcaha-dhexdooda\"\u003ESawir xariiq jebin dhibcaha dhexdooda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreakline\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003ESurface\u003C/strong\u003E (Dusha). Calaamadda hagista ayaa sheegaysa in aad guujiso dhibcaha sahanka siday u kala horreeyaan (waxay qaadaan kor u kacooda). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu dhammaysiiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaaq jiritaanka dhibic u dhow. Afar-geesle yar oo liin-cad ah ayaa calaamadeynaya dhibicda uu qaadan doono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dhibcaha xariiqa mid mid. Guji kasta wuxuu magacaabaa dhibcaha iyo kor u kaca bar-xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammaysato. Bar-xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa &quot;Breakline 1 added; the surface was rebuilt.&quot; (Xariiqa jebinta 1 waa lagu daray; dusha waa dib loo dhisay.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGujinta waa inay ku dhacaan dhibic sahan oo leh kor u kac; gujin meel kale waa la diidaa, oo waxaa la sheegaa: &quot;Click a survey point with an elevation: a breakline takes the points’ elevations.&quot; (Guji dhibic sahan oo leh kor u kac: xariiq jebin wuxuu qaadaa kor u kaca dhibcaha.) \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa dhibicda ugu dambeysa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu joojiyaa xariiqa oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaystir \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Laba jeer guji ayaa sidoo kale dhammaysta, laakiin dhismahan wuxuu tirtiraa dhibicda aad laba jeer gujisay. Guji dhibicda ugu dambeysa hal mar, ka dibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u tirtirto dhammaan xariiqyada jebinta la sawiray hal mar, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove drawn breaklines\u003C/span\u003E qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003ESurface\u003C/strong\u003E. Si aad u tirtirto kaliya kii ugu dambeeyay, isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Xariiqyada la sawiray lama dooran karo ama lama tafatiri karo midmid ahaan weli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-xadka-dibadda\"\u003ESawir xadka dibadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXadku wuxuu jaraa dusha ilaa aagga aad isku halleyso, tusaale ahaan xuduudaha sahanka, si saddex-geesaha dheer ee ku fidsan geesaha aan la sahamin ay u baxaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBoundary\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesaha mid mid wareegga aagga. Xariiq jajab ah ayaa muujinaysa qaabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Bar-xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa &quot;Boundary set; triangles outside it are gone.&quot; (Xadka waa la dejiyay; saddex-geesaha ka baxsan waa la tirtiray.) \u003Cstrong\u003EBoundary\u003C/strong\u003E (Xadka) ee xogta dusha wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Yes&quot; (Haa) iyo tirada geesaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad ogaataa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxaa jira hal xad oo keliya. Mid kale sawirista wuxuu beddelaa midka hore. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove the boundary\u003C/span\u003E ayaa tirtiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa uu kaliya kala saari karaa: xad oo ka gudba dhibcaha ayaa lagu jaraa qaabkooda, oo waxaa la sheegaa &quot;The boundary reaches past the points; it was cut back to their outline.&quot; (Xadku wuxuu ka gudbaa dhibcaha; waxaa lagu jaray qaabkooda.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesihiisu waxay qaataan kor u kacooda dusha, sidaas darteed cidhifku si sax ah ayuu u raacaa dhulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXadka qarsan (gudaha) weli ma diyaar aha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jar-saddex-geeskyada-dibadda-ee-dheer\"\u003EJar saddex-geeskyada dibadda ee dheer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aanu xad jirin, dusha wuxuu buuxiyaa qaabka dhibcaha oo dhan, oo ay ku jiraan saddex-geesaha dheer ee khafiifka ah ee ku fidsan geesaha foorarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ESurface\u003C/strong\u003E (Dusha), qor dherer ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003ELongest outside edge\u003C/strong\u003E (Cidhifka dibadda ee ugu dheer) oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ku bilow qiyaas ahaan laba ama saddex jeer masaafada rasaaska caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaddex-geesaha dibadda kuwaas oo cidhifkooda dibadda uu ka dheer yahay taas waa la saaraa, si gudaha loo galo ilaa cidhifyada dibadda oo dhan ay gaabanaadaan. Cidhifka xariiq jebin weligiis lama jaro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor 0 si aad mar kale u ilaaliso saddex-geesaha oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-warbixinta-dusha\"\u003EAkhri warbixinta dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta xogta dusha, sanduuq ayaa liistaa waxa dhisuhu sameeyay. Bar liin-cad oo bidixda ah wuxuu yahay macluumaad; bar cas wuxuu leeyahay khalad, oo dusha ma jiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;3 points were at the same place as another and joined it.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha ka yar 0.0001 qorshaha waxay noqdeen hal geesood (kii ugu horreeyay ayaa la ilaaliyay).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;2 places have two different elevations …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha isku dul saaran, ama xariiqyada jebinta oo isgoysa, kuma heshiiyaan dhererka. Kor u kaca xariiqa jebinta ayaa u guuleysta, ka dibna kii ugu horreeyay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;1 breakline piece could not be forced into the surface.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb xariiq jebin oo aad u gaaban ama ku dhow isku dhac ma mahan; hubi meeshaas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A surface needs at least three points with elevations.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcood yar: hubi tiirarka iyo kooxaha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The points are all on one line: no triangles.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha oo dhan waa hal xariiq: ma jiro saddex-geesood. Dhibcaha ma leh ballac, tusaale hal xariiq traverse.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The boundary does not overlap the points.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadku meel kale ayuu ku yaal, badanaa khalad unit ama isku-xirka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;No triangles are left inside the boundary.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadku aad buu u yar yahay ama meel khalad ah ayuu yaal.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha-laga-akhriyay-landxml\"\u003EDusha laga akhriyay LandXML\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka aad furto LandXML, TIN-ka koowaad ee faylka waa la isticmaalaa sida uu yahay: madaxa \u003Cstrong\u003ESurface\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Surface (from LandXML)&quot; (Dusha (laga soo qaadan LandXML)), \u003Cstrong\u003ELongest outside edge\u003C/strong\u003E waa la xidhay (midab-cad). Intii dushaas la isticmaalayo, kooxaha xariiqyada jebinta, xariiqyada la sawiray iyo xad cusub ma beddelaan. Si aad dusha uga dhisto dhibcaha faylka, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERebuild the surface from the points\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa dusha LandXML.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidhiidh\"\u003EXidhiidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/contours\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/contours\"\u003EAkhri xariiqyada heerka, kor u kacyada iyo jiifyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003ESoo geli dhibcaha sahanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"CivilCraft wuxuu leeyahay hal dusha dhulka jira mashruuc kasta. Waa TIN (triangulated irregular network) oo laga dhisay dhibcahaaga, waxaana si toos ah dib loo dhisaa marka kasta oo wax gelinta isbeddelo. Ma jiro amar \"rebuild\" ah, ma jiro dusha duugoobay. Waxa galaya dusha Dhibcaha kasta oo leh kor u kac kooxda loo dejiyay Points. Kooxda kasta oo loo dejiyay Breakline, oo lagu xidhay lambarka dhibcaha. Xariiq jebin kasta oo aad ku sawirtay qalabka Breakline. Xadka dibadda, haddii aad sawirtay. Dejinta Longest outside edge (Cidhifka dibadda ee ugu dheer). Saddex-geeskuna ma gudbaan xariiq jebin: dusha waa la qasbaa inuu raaco, ka dibna waxaa si siman loo sameeyaa oo ku wareegsan (Delaunay meelaha kale oo dhan). Ka dhig xariiqyada koodka leh xariiqyo jebin Dhinaca bidix hoosta Points (Barood), hel kooxda (tusaale FL). Deji doorashada Surface (Dusha) ee kooxda oo ah Breakline. Dusha dib ayuu u dhisaa, xariiqa waxaa lagu sawiraa midabka liin-cad (orange) (oo Breaklines shidan hoosta Display (Bandhig)), Breaklines (Khadadka jebinta) ee xogta dusha ayaa kor u kacda hal. Hubi xariiqa qorshaha. Waa inuu ka socdaa dhibic ilaa dhibic, siday u kala horreeyeen xariiqa la rasaasay. Haddii uu u dhaco sida zig-zag, kooxdu waxay haysaa in ka badan hal xariiq, ama dhibcaha lambarradooda si sax ah uma kala horreeyaan: dib u deji kooxda Points oo xariiqyada ku sawir gacanta (qaybta soo socota). Sawir xariiq jebin dhibcaha dhexdooda Riix B, ama guji Breakline kooxda Surface (Dusha). Calaamadda hagista ayaa sheegaysa in aad guujiso dhibcaha sahanka siday u kala horreeyaan (waxay qaadaan kor u kacooda). Enter wuu dhammaysiiyaa. Dhaqaaq jiritaanka dhibic u dhow. Afar-geesle yar oo liin-cad ah ayaa calaamadeynaya dhibicda uu qaadan doono. Guji dhibcaha xariiqa mid mid. Guji kasta wuxuu magacaabaa dhibcaha iyo kor u kaca bar-xaaladda. Riix Enter si aad u dhammaysato. Bar-xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa \"Breakline 1 added; the surface was rebuilt.\" (Xariiqa jebinta 1 waa lagu daray; dusha waa dib loo dhisay.) Gujinta waa inay ku dhacaan dhibic sahan oo leh kor u kac; gujin meel kale waa la diidaa, oo waxaa la sheegaa: \"Click a survey point with an elevation: a breakline takes the points’ elevations.\" (Guji dhibic sahan oo leh kor u kac: xariiq jebin wuxuu qaadaa kor u kaca dhibcaha.) Backspace wuxuu tirtiraa dhibicda ugu dambeysa; Esc wuxuu joojiyaa xariiqa oo dhan. Dhammaystir Enter. Laba jeer guji ayaa sidoo kale dhammaysta, laakiin dhismahan wuxuu tirtiraa dhibicda aad laba jeer gujisay. Guji dhibicda ugu dambeysa hal mar, ka dibna riix Enter. Si aad u tirtirto dhammaan xariiqyada jebinta la sawiray hal mar, guji Remove drawn breaklines qaybta Surface. Si aad u tirtirto kaliya kii ugu dambeeyay, isticmaal Ctrl+Z. Xariiqyada la sawiray lama dooran karo ama lama tafatiri karo midmid ahaan weli. Sawir xadka dibadda Xadku wuxuu jaraa dusha ilaa aagga aad isku halleyso, tusaale ahaan xuduudaha sahanka, si saddex-geesaha dheer ee ku fidsan geesaha aan la sahamin ay u baxaan. Riix O, ama guji Boundary. Guji geesaha mid mid wareegga aagga. Xariiq jajab ah ayaa muujinaysa qaabka. Riix Enter. Bar-xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa \"Boundary set; triangles outside it are gone.\" (Xadka waa la dejiyay; saddex-geesaha ka baxsan waa la tirtiray.) Boundary (Xadka) ee xogta dusha wuxuu leeyahay \"Yes\" (Haa) iyo tirada geesaha. Waxaad ogaataa: Waxaa jira hal xad oo keliya. Mid kale sawirista wuxuu beddelaa midka hore. Remove the boundary ayaa tirtiraa. Waxa uu kaliya kala saari karaa: xad oo ka gudba dhibcaha ayaa lagu jaraa qaabkooda, oo waxaa la sheegaa \"The boundary reaches past the points; it was cut back to their outline.\" (Xadku wuxuu ka gudbaa dhibcaha; waxaa lagu jaray qaabkooda.) Geesihiisu waxay qaataan kor u kacooda dusha, sidaas darteed cidhifku si sax ah ayuu u raacaa dhulka. Xadka qarsan (gudaha) weli ma diyaar aha. Jar saddex-geeskyada dibadda ee dheer Haddii aanu xad jirin, dusha wuxuu buuxiyaa qaabka dhibcaha oo dhan, oo ay ku jiraan saddex-geesaha dheer ee khafiifka ah ee ku fidsan geesaha foorarka. Hoosta Surface (Dusha), qor dherer ku jira Longest outside edge (Cidhifka dibadda ee ugu dheer) oo riix Enter. Ku bilow qiyaas ahaan laba ama saddex jeer masaafada rasaaska caadiga ah. Saddex-geesaha dibadda kuwaas oo cidhifkooda dibadda uu ka dheer yahay taas waa la saaraa, si gudaha loo galo ilaa cidhifyada dibadda oo dhan ay gaabanaadaan. Cidhifka xariiq jebin weligiis lama jaro. Qor 0 si aad mar kale u ilaaliso saddex-geesaha oo dhan. Akhri warbixinta dusha Hoosta xogta dusha, sanduuq ayaa liistaa waxa dhisuhu sameeyay. Bar liin-cad oo bidixda ah wuxuu yahay macluumaad; bar cas wuxuu leeyahay khalad, oo dusha ma jiro. Fariinta Macnaha \"3 points were at the same place as another and joined it.\" Dhibcaha ka yar 0.0001 qorshaha waxay noqdeen hal geesood (kii ugu horreeyay ayaa la ilaaliyay). \"2 places have two different elevations …\" Dhibcaha isku dul saaran, ama xariiqyada jebinta oo isgoysa, kuma heshiiyaan dhererka. Kor u kaca xariiqa jebinta ayaa u guuleysta, ka dibna kii ugu horreeyay. \"1 breakline piece could not be forced into the surface.\" Qayb xariiq jebin oo aad u gaaban ama ku dhow isku dhac ma mahan; hubi meeshaas. \"A surface needs at least three points with elevations.\" Dhibcood yar: hubi tiirarka iyo kooxaha. \"The points are all on one line: no triangles.\" Dhibcaha oo dhan waa hal xariiq: ma jiro saddex-geesood. Dhibcaha ma leh ballac, tusaale hal xariiq traverse. \"The boundary does not overlap the points.\" Xadku meel kale ayuu ku yaal, badanaa khalad unit ama isku-xirka. \"No triangles are left inside the boundary.\" Xadku aad buu u yar yahay ama meel khalad ah ayuu yaal. Dusha laga akhriyay LandXML Marka aad furto LandXML, TIN-ka koowaad ee faylka waa la isticmaalaa sida uu yahay: madaxa Surface wuxuu leeyahay \"Surface (from LandXML)\" (Dusha (laga soo qaadan LandXML)), Longest outside edge waa la xidhay (midab-cad). Intii dushaas la isticmaalayo, kooxaha xariiqyada jebinta, xariiqyada la sawiray iyo xad cusub ma beddelaan. Si aad dusha uga dhisto dhibcaha faylka, guji Rebuild the surface from the points. Ctrl+Z wuxuu soo celinayaa dusha LandXML. Xidhiidh Akhri xariiqyada heerka, kor u kacyada iyo jiifyada. Soo geli dhibcaha sahanka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"measure","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qiyaas masaafooyin, bed iyo janjeer","summary":"Ku qiyaas sawirka adigoo riixaya barooyin — dherer iyo jihada qayb kasta, wadarta socota, dherer dhulka dul socda, janjeerka, iyo bedka iyo wareegga qaab xidhan — iyo inta u dhexaysa laba barood oo ku jira muuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa korantada.","section":"tasks","order":21,"keywords":["qiyaas","qiyaasid","masaafo","dherer","bed","wareeg","jihada","janjeer","heer","qalabka qiyaasta","xadka dherer","dul socda","muuqaalka dherer","farqiga dhererka"],"headings":[{"id":"sawirka","text":"Sawirka","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-dherer-ee-xariiqa-korantada","text":"Muuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa korantada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E (sidoo kale menyuga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E ee goobta Xariiqyada korantada, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu qiyaasaa adoon wax ku darin mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirka\"\u003ESawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji barooyin. Guji oo u dhow barta sahanka wuxuu meesha iyo sare-u-kaca ka qaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqa xaaladda ayaa tirada barooyinka iyo wadarta dherer muujinaysa, dhererka iyo jihada qayb ugu dambeeya, janjeerka haddii dhulka labada dhamaadka hoostooda la yaqaan, iyo dherer dhulka dul socda. Xagga calaamadda ayaa qaybta la sawirayo iyo wadarta socota.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta koowaad mar kale si aad qaabka u xidho: xariiqa xaaladda wuxuu ku daraa \u003Cstrong\u003Ebedka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ewareegga\u003C/strong\u003E. Guji xiga wuxuu bilaabaa qiyaas cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dhammeeyaa qiyaasta wuxuuna tirooyinkeeda ku hayaa xariiqa xaaladda; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa barta u dambaysay; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu nadiifiyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale wuxuu kuu celinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDherarka waxa lagu qiyaasaa unitiga mashruuca, bedadkana unitiga laba-jibbaaran ee mashruuca. Janjeerka iyo dherer dhulka dul socda waxay isticmaalaan dusha la soo jeediyay haddii uu jiro, haddii kale dhulka jira; meel dusha ka baxsan waa laga reebaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-dherer-ee-xariiqa-korantada\"\u003EMuuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa korantada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/overhead-line#the-line-profile\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/overhead-line\" data-hash=\"the-line-profile\"\u003EMuuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa\u003C/a\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira qalabka muuqaalka dherer wuxuu qaadaa laba guji, wuxuuna akhrinayaa masaafada u dhexaysa, farqiga dhererka, masaafada toosan iyo janjeerka u dhexaysa. Guji u dhow dhulka, silig-ka ama qolofka sare ee tiir wuu u hoos-jiidaa. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E mar kale si aad u joojiso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Qiyaas (sidoo kale menyuga Wax dheeraad ah ee goobta Xariiqyada korantada, ama riix M) wuxuu qiyaasaa adoon wax ku darin mashruuca. Sawirka Dooro Qiyaas, kadibna guji barooyin. Guji oo u dhow barta sahanka wuxuu meesha iyo sare-u-kaca ka qaadaa. Xariiqa xaaladda ayaa tirada barooyinka iyo wadarta dherer muujinaysa, dhererka iyo jihada qayb ugu dambeeya, janjeerka haddii dhulka labada dhamaadka hoostooda la yaqaan, iyo dherer dhulka dul socda. Xagga calaamadda ayaa qaybta la sawirayo iyo wadarta socota. Guji barta koowaad mar kale si aad qaabka u xidho: xariiqa xaaladda wuxuu ku daraa bedka iyo wareegga. Guji xiga wuxuu bilaabaa qiyaas cusub. Enter wuxuu dhammeeyaa qiyaasta wuxuuna tirooyinkeeda ku hayaa xariiqa xaaladda; Backspace wuxuu soo celinayaa barta u dambaysay; Esc wuu nadiifiyaa, Esc mar kale wuxuu kuu celinayaa Dooro. Dherarka waxa lagu qiyaasaa unitiga mashruuca, bedadkana unitiga laba-jibbaaran ee mashruuca. Janjeerka iyo dherer dhulka dul socda waxay isticmaalaan dusha la soo jeediyay haddii uu jiro, haddii kale dhulka jira; meel dusha ka baxsan waa laga reebaa. Muuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa korantada Muuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa: Qiyaas oo ku jira qalabka muuqaalka dherer wuxuu qaadaa laba guji, wuxuuna akhrinayaa masaafada u dhexaysa, farqiga dhererka, masaafada toosan iyo janjeerka u dhexaysa. Guji u dhow dhulka, silig-ka ama qolofka sare ee tiir wuu u hoos-jiidaa. Guji Qiyaas mar kale si aad u joojiso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-dwg-dxf","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Fur DWG ama DXF sida khadad","summary":"Fur khadadka naqshadda qorshaha, layer kasta oo keliya, isticmaal kontuurradeeda, polilayn 3D iyo xuduudaha xidhan ee dusha, oo u beddel bloogyada barooyinka barooyin sahan.","section":"tasks","order":22,"keywords":["hubinta sahanka","sare-u-kaca qoraalka","dwg","dxf","cad","naqshad","khadad","khadka jejebinta","kontuur","xuduud","polilayn","polilayn 3d","layer-yada","khariidadda aasaasiga","topo","naqshadda sahanka","bloogyada","tixraacyada bloogyada","barooyin sahan oo ka bloogyada","sifooyinka","barta gelinta"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-naqshadda","text":"Fur naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-layer-kasta-bixin-karo","text":"Waxa layer kasta bixin karo","level":2},{"id":"barooyinka-sahanka-ee-bloogyada","text":"Barooyinka sahanka ee bloogyada","level":2},{"id":"heerarka-qoraal-ahaan-iyo-hubinta","text":"Heerarka qoraal ahaan iyo hubinta","level":2},{"id":"akhrinta-naqshadda","text":"Akhrinta naqshadda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESahan dhul-badan badanaa wuxuu u yimaadaa naqshad: kontuurrada oo ah polilayn sare-u-kac, khadadka jejebinta oo ah polilayn 3D, iyo xuduudda goobta oo ah polilayn xidhan. CivilCraft wuxuu furaa \u003Cstrong\u003Emeesha moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E naqshadda oo layer-yo qorshaha ah, wuxuuna khadadkaas si toos ah ugu beddeli karaa dusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-naqshadda\"\u003EFur naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiqyada\u003C/span\u003E qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E, ama ku rid faylka qorshaha) oo dooro fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E. Naqshaddu waxa la akhriyaa kombiyuutarkan; waxba lama soo dejin. DWG 2000 ilaa 2018 iyo ASCII DXF waa la akhriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWada-hadalka \u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa layer-yada naqshadda ee hayaa khadad, qaabab xidhan ama barooyin, iyo inay leeyihiin \u003Cstrong\u003Esare-u-kac\u003C/strong\u003E. Layer-yada damaysan naqshadda waxay ku bilaabmaan aan la calaamadin. Qoraal, hatches, cabbir iyo waxyaabo kale oo aan khad ahayn waa la tiriyaa oo waa la reebaa (wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegaa kuwa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee \u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Marka naqshaddu sheegto unitiyadeeda, CivilCraft wuu u beddelaa unitiyada mashruuca (millimitir ilaa mitir, mitir ilaa feet, inch ilaa feet). Naqshad feet ah waxa loo akhriyaa sida US survey feet iyada oo aan la cabbirin: labadaba way ka duwan yihiin 2 qaybood halkii milyan, cabbirka isku-xirka state plane oo taas loo cabbiro wuxuu u rari lahaa feet. Marka naqshaddu aan sheegin unitiyadeeda, tirooyinkeedu waxa lagu akhriyaa unitiyada mashruuca; dooro unitiga saxda ah liiska haddii aysan ahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal dusha\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro waxa layer kasta siinayo dusha (ama ka reeb \u003Cstrong\u003EKaliya tus\u003C/strong\u003E). Layer-yada loo magacaabo sida kontuurrada (TOPO, CONT, CNTR) oo leh sare-u-kac waxay ku bilaabmaan sida khadka jejebinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E. Layer-yada waxay ka muuqdaan \u003Cstrong\u003ELayer-yada GIS\u003C/strong\u003E panel-ka bidix; isticmaal kasta waxa la dhigaa dusha. Qaybta kasta waa tallaabo gaar ah: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu mid mid dib u celiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-layer-kasta-bixin-karo\"\u003EWaxa layer kasta bixin karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELayer-ku wuxuu hayaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsticmaal dusha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurro (polilayn sare-u-kac)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka jejebinta oo sare-u-kaca khadka laftiisa, ama ELEV field\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka jejebinta oo sare-u-kacooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuduud xidhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuduudda dusha (qaabka xidhan ee ugu weyn, ama midka aad doorato)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyin sare-u-kac leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyinka sahanka, oo lagu sharaxo magaca layer-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadad sare-u-kac 0 (khadka qorshaha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba: wuxuu ku sii jiraa qorshaha sida naqshad aasaasi ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshad uu CivilCraft qoray waxay hayaa khadadka muuqaalkeeda oo ah polilayn 3D oo xusuusta qaansooyinkooda. Wada-hadalku markaas wuxuu tusayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EKhadadka muuqaalka\u003C/strong\u003E: ka tag inay soo celiyaan sida khadadka muuqaal oo qaansooyinkooda iyo isticmaalkooda (hal tallaabo undo), ama ka reeb si ay u akhrisan yihiin sida layer kasta oo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadhow, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal dusha\u003C/span\u003E ee menyuga layer-ka ku hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ELayer-yada GIS\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u samayso wax layer aad kaliya tustay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barooyinka-sahanka-ee-bloogyada\"\u003EBarooyinka sahanka ee bloogyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadaha sahanku badanaa barooyinkooda ku qaadaan bloogyo: calaamad yar oo ah rasaas kasta, oo leh sifooyin lambarka barta, sharraxaadda iyo sare-u-kaca. Marka naqshaddu leedahay tixraacyada bloogyada, wada-hadalku wuxuu leeyahay qayb \u003Cstrong\u003EBarooyinka sahanka ee bloogyada\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee bloogyada la qaadanayo (miiska wuxuu sheegayaa tirada tixraacyada kasta, layer-yada ay ku yaallaan, iyo sifooyinka), ama calaamee layer-yo si aad u qaadato dhammaan tixraacyada bloogyada ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro meesha uu ka yimaado \u003Cstrong\u003Elambarka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esharraxaadda\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Esare-u-kaca\u003C/strong\u003E barta kasta: sifo, magaca bloogga ama layer-ka, lambarrada xor ah ee xiga, ama Z-ka barta gelinta. CivilCraft wuxuu ku bilaabaa sifooyinka caadiga ah (PT, DESC, ELEV iyo kuwa la mid ah), wuxuuna sare-u-kaca ka qaadaa sifo oo keliya marka bloogyadu ku yaallaan eber.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa reeb layer-yada khadadka haddii aad doonayso barooyinka kaliya, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETixraac kasta wuxuu noqdaa hal barta sahan ah oo ku taal barta gelinteeda. Kaliya tixraacyada lagu dhigay meesha moodeelka ayaa la tiriyaa; bloogyada ku jira bloogyo kale lama tirinayo. Lambarrada hore mashruuca ama laba jeer naqshadda ku isticmaalan, waxay helaan lambar cusub oo ka dambeeya kan ugu sarreeya; sifada sare-u-kaca oo aan lambar ahayn barta waxay uga tagtaa sare-u-kac la’aan; wadada xaaladda ayaa tiriyaa labadaba. Naqshadda lama beddelo, barta kasta waxay xusuusataa bloogeeda: sifooyinkeeda waxay tusaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bloogga\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh bloogga, layer-ka iyo handle-ka. Ku darista barooyinka waa hal tallaabo, marka \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dhammaantood wuu tirtiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerarka-qoraal-ahaan-iyo-hubinta\"\u003EHeerarka qoraal ahaan iyo hubinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESare-u-kac calaamad ah oo qoraal ah (ama sifo bloog oo aan ahayn bloogga barta sahanka) ma aha khad. Qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka sahanka iyo hubinta\u003C/strong\u003E waxay qaadan kartaa iyaga sida barooyin sahan, waxayna liistaa wixii qaldan naqshadda: unitiyada, nidaamka isku-xirka, fogaanta ka xagga zero, kontuurro siman, sare-u-kac aan caadi ahayn, iyo barooyin labajibaaran. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/survey-check\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/survey-check\"\u003EHubinta naqshadda sahanka markii la soo geliyo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhrinta-naqshadda\"\u003EAkhrinta naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaansooyinka, goobaha, ellipses-ka, qaybaha polilayn-ka ee foorar leh iyo splines-ka waxay noqdaan qaybo toosan oo gaaban (5° ilaa ugu badnaan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETixraacyada bloogyada waxa lagu sawiraa meesha lagu dhigay, bloogyada ku jira bloog kale sidoo kale; wixii bloog ku hayo layer 0 waxay qaadaan layer-ka tixraaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShayada lagu sawiray diyaarad kale (jihada extrusion ee kala duwan) waxa lagu dhigaa isku-xirka adduunka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay kasta wuxuu helaa saddex goob: LAYER, TYPE (nooca shayga) iyo ELEV (sare-u-kaciisa marka dhammaan barooyinkiisu wadaagaan mid).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-xirka waa la qaadaa sidii uu yahay: naqshaddu waa inuu isticmaalaa isku-xirka mashruuca (tusaale ahaan isla state plane zone). Naqshadaha xiriiran (xrefs) lama furo: fur kuwaas si gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshad kontuur ah ayaa siinaysa dusha ugu wanaagsan marka lagu daro dhowr sare-u-kac goobaha buurta sare iyo godadka, halkaas oo kontuurrada keligood ay ka tagaan saddexagalo siman. Ku dar iyagoo barooyin sahan ah, ama layer-ka barooyinka ee naqshadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Sahan dhul-badan badanaa wuxuu u yimaadaa naqshad: kontuurrada oo ah polilayn sare-u-kac, khadadka jejebinta oo ah polilayn 3D, iyo xuduudda goobta oo ah polilayn xidhan. CivilCraft wuxuu furaa meesha moodeelka naqshadda oo layer-yo qorshaha ah, wuxuuna khadadkaas si toos ah ugu beddeli karaa dusha. Fur naqshadda Guji Xariiqyada qaybta Dusha (ama Fur, ama ku rid faylka qorshaha) oo dooro fayl .dwg ama .dxf. Naqshaddu waxa la akhriyaa kombiyuutarkan; waxba lama soo dejin. DWG 2000 ilaa 2018 iyo ASCII DXF waa la akhriyaa. Wada-hadalka Xariiqyada wuxuu liistaa layer-yada naqshadda ee hayaa khadad, qaabab xidhan ama barooyin, iyo inay leeyihiin sare-u-kac. Layer-yada damaysan naqshadda waxay ku bilaabmaan aan la calaamadin. Qoraal, hatches, cabbir iyo waxyaabo kale oo aan khad ahayn waa la tiriyaa oo waa la reebaa (wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegaa kuwa). Calaamee Unitiyada naqshadda. Marka naqshaddu sheegto unitiyadeeda, CivilCraft wuu u beddelaa unitiyada mashruuca (millimitir ilaa mitir, mitir ilaa feet, inch ilaa feet). Naqshad feet ah waxa loo akhriyaa sida US survey feet iyada oo aan la cabbirin: labadaba way ka duwan yihiin 2 qaybood halkii milyan, cabbirka isku-xirka state plane oo taas loo cabbiro wuxuu u rari lahaa feet. Marka naqshaddu aan sheegin unitiyadeeda, tirooyinkeedu waxa lagu akhriyaa unitiyada mashruuca; dooro unitiga saxda ah liiska haddii aysan ahayn. Ku Isticmaal dusha, dooro waxa layer kasta siinayo dusha (ama ka reeb Kaliya tus). Layer-yada loo magacaabo sida kontuurrada (TOPO, CONT, CNTR) oo leh sare-u-kac waxay ku bilaabmaan sida khadka jejebinta. Guji Ku dar. Layer-yada waxay ka muuqdaan Layer-yada GIS panel-ka bidix; isticmaal kasta waxa la dhigaa dusha. Qaybta kasta waa tallaabo gaar ah: Ctrl+Z wuxuu mid mid dib u celiyaa. Waxa layer kasta bixin karo Layer-ku wuxuu hayaa Isticmaal dusha Kontuurro (polilayn sare-u-kac) Khadka jejebinta oo sare-u-kaca khadka laftiisa, ama ELEV field Polilayn 3D Khadka jejebinta oo sare-u-kacooda Xuduud xidhan Xuduudda dusha (qaabka xidhan ee ugu weyn, ama midka aad doorato) Barooyin sare-u-kac leh Barooyinka sahanka, oo lagu sharaxo magaca layer-ka Khadad sare-u-kac 0 (khadka qorshaha) Waxba: wuxuu ku sii jiraa qorshaha sida naqshad aasaasi ah Naqshad uu CivilCraft qoray waxay hayaa khadadka muuqaalkeeda oo ah polilayn 3D oo xusuusta qaansooyinkooda. Wada-hadalku markaas wuxuu tusayaa Khadadka muuqaalka: ka tag inay soo celiyaan sida khadadka muuqaal oo qaansooyinkooda iyo isticmaalkooda (hal tallaabo undo), ama ka reeb si ay u akhrisan yihiin sida layer kasta oo kale. Hadhow, isticmaal Isticmaal dusha ee menyuga layer-ka ku hoos Layer-yada GIS si aad u samayso wax layer aad kaliya tustay. Barooyinka sahanka ee bloogyada Naqshadaha sahanku badanaa barooyinkooda ku qaadaan bloogyo: calaamad yar oo ah rasaas kasta, oo leh sifooyin lambarka barta, sharraxaadda iyo sare-u-kaca. Marka naqshaddu leedahay tixraacyada bloogyada, wada-hadalku wuxuu leeyahay qayb Barooyinka sahanka ee bloogyada: Calaamee bloogyada la qaadanayo (miiska wuxuu sheegayaa tirada tixraacyada kasta, layer-yada ay ku yaallaan, iyo sifooyinka), ama calaamee layer-yo si aad u qaadato dhammaan tixraacyada bloogyada ku jira. Dooro meesha uu ka yimaado lambarka, sharraxaadda iyo sare-u-kaca barta kasta: sifo, magaca bloogga ama layer-ka, lambarrada xor ah ee xiga, ama Z-ka barta gelinta. CivilCraft wuxuu ku bilaabaa sifooyinka caadiga ah (PT, DESC, ELEV iyo kuwa la mid ah), wuxuuna sare-u-kaca ka qaadaa sifo oo keliya marka bloogyadu ku yaallaan eber. Ka reeb layer-yada khadadka haddii aad doonayso barooyinka kaliya, kadibna guji Ku dar. Tixraac kasta wuxuu noqdaa hal barta sahan ah oo ku taal barta gelinteeda. Kaliya tixraacyada lagu dhigay meesha moodeelka ayaa la tiriyaa; bloogyada ku jira bloogyo kale lama tirinayo. Lambarrada hore mashruuca ama laba jeer naqshadda ku isticmaalan, waxay helaan lambar cusub oo ka dambeeya kan ugu sarreeya; sifada sare-u-kaca oo aan lambar ahayn barta waxay uga tagtaa sare-u-kac la’aan; wadada xaaladda ayaa tiriyaa labadaba. Naqshadda lama beddelo, barta kasta waxay xusuusataa bloogeeda: sifooyinkeeda waxay tusaysaa Laga bloogga oo leh bloogga, layer-ka iyo handle-ka. Ku darista barooyinka waa hal tallaabo, marka Ctrl+Z dhammaantood wuu tirtiraa. Heerarka qoraal ahaan iyo hubinta Sare-u-kac calaamad ah oo qoraal ah (ama sifo bloog oo aan ahayn bloogga barta sahanka) ma aha khad. Qaybta Heerarka sahanka iyo hubinta waxay qaadan kartaa iyaga sida barooyin sahan, waxayna liistaa wixii qaldan naqshadda: unitiyada, nidaamka isku-xirka, fogaanta ka xagga zero, kontuurro siman, sare-u-kac aan caadi ahayn, iyo barooyin labajibaaran. Eeg Hubinta naqshadda sahanka markii la soo geliyo. Akhrinta naqshadda Qaansooyinka, goobaha, ellipses-ka, qaybaha polilayn-ka ee foorar leh iyo splines-ka waxay noqdaan qaybo toosan oo gaaban (5° ilaa ugu badnaan). Tixraacyada bloogyada waxa lagu sawiraa meesha lagu dhigay, bloogyada ku jira bloog kale sidoo kale; wixii bloog ku hayo layer 0 waxay qaadaan layer-ka tixraaca. Shayada lagu sawiray diyaarad kale (jihada extrusion ee kala duwan) waxa lagu dhigaa isku-xirka adduunka. Shay kasta wuxuu helaa saddex goob: LAYER, TYPE (nooca shayga) iyo ELEV (sare-u-kaciisa marka dhammaan barooyinkiisu wadaagaan mid). Isku-xirka waa la qaadaa sidii uu yahay: naqshaddu waa inuu isticmaalaa isku-xirka mashruuca (tusaale ahaan isla state plane zone). Naqshadaha xiriiran (xrefs) lama furo: fur kuwaas si gaar ah. Naqshad kontuur ah ayaa siinaysa dusha ugu wanaagsan marka lagu daro dhowr sare-u-kac goobaha buurta sare iyo godadka, halkaas oo kontuurrada keligood ay ka tagaan saddexagalo siman. Ku dar iyagoo barooyin sahan ah, ama layer-ka barooyinka ee naqshadda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"survey-check","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Hubi sawirka sahanka markaad soo dhoofinayso","summary":"Akhri heerarka qoraal ahaan ama sifooyinka jarxadaha sida barrooyin sahan, oo hubi DWG ama DXF oo ay ka mid yihiin cabbir aan la sheegin, nidaam isku-xiriye aan lahayn, asal fog, konturo siman, heer xun iyo barro isku dhafan ka hor intaadan dhul ka dhisin.","section":"tasks","order":23,"keywords":["hubinta sahanka","hubinta soo dhoofinta","heerarka sahanka","heerarka qoraalka","sifooyinka","cabbirka","nidaamka isku-xirka","fog asalka","konturada eber","dhibaatooyin","naqshadeeyaha dhulka","sawirka sahanka"],"headings":[{"id":"heerar-qoraal-ahaan-ama-sifooyin-ahaan","text":"Heerar qoraal ahaan ama sifooyin ahaan","level":2},{"id":"hubinta","text":"Hubinta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-la-hubin","text":"Waxa aan la hubin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESawirka sahanka wuxuu u muuqan karaa mid sax ah, laakiin wuxuu noqon karaa mid khaldan dhulka: cabbirkiisa waa la qiyaasay, konturadiisu waxay ku taagan yihiin heerka 0, ama heerarkiisa waxaa lagu qoray qoraal aan xarriiq ahayn. Qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka sahanka iyo hubinta\u003C/strong\u003E ee daaqadda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinework\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/open-dwg-dxf\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/open-dwg-dxf\"\u003EFur DWG ama DXF sida xarriiqyo\u003C/a\u003E) waxay akhrisaa heerarkaas, oo waxay kuu sheegaysaa waxa khaldan ka hor intaan wax lagu daro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerar-qoraal-ahaan-ama-sifooyin-ahaan\"\u003EHeerar qoraal ahaan ama sifooyin ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawiro badan ayaa siiya heer dhul oo qoraal yar oo ku taal calaamad (cross) sida \u003Ccode\u003E104.37\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EEL 104.37\u003C/code\u003E, ama sifo ka mid ah jarxadda barta. Kuwani ma aha xarriiqyo, sidaas darteed akhriyaha xarriiqyada ayaa ka tagaya. Qaybtu waxay tirinaysaa inta ay heshay, waxayna kuu ogolaanaysaa inaad qaadato \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarrooyin sahan\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EQaado … heerar sida barrooyin sahan\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa lagu calaamadin bilowga, sababtoo ah ma aha tiro kasta oo sawirka ku jirta inay tahay dhererka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoraalka waa la akhriyaa marka uu yahay heer keligiis: tiro leh qeyb tobanle (\u003Ccode\u003E104.37\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+104,37\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-3.50\u003C/code\u003E), ama tiro ka dambeysa \u003Ccode\u003EEL\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EELEV\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ERL\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EFFL\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EGL\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ETW\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EBW\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EINV\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EZ\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003ELEVEL\u003C/code\u003E, oo ay ku xigto \u003Ccode\u003Em\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E haddii la doono. Tiro buuxa oo keligeed ah (\u003Ccode\u003E12\u003C/code\u003E) waxaa loo akhriyaa lambar dhul ama warqad, ma aha heer; qoraal sida \u003Ccode\u003EGATE 3\u003C/code\u003E ama taariikh lama akhriyo abid. Calaamadaha qaabaynta qoraalka waa la iska indho tiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESifooyinka jarxadda, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ESifada jarxadda ee haysa heerka\u003C/strong\u003E. CivilCraft wuxuu si toos ah u helaa calaamad magaceedu yahay ELEV, Z, LEVEL, RL ama mid la mid ah; ka dooro mid kale liiska haddii sawirku isticmaalo mid gaar ah. Doorashadu waxaa lagu xusaa magaca faylka kumbuyuutarkan, sidaas darteed markii dib loo furo wuxuu ku bilaabmaa isla calaamadda. Calaamad aad doorato tirooyinka oo dhan ayay u qaadataa heerar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E. Barrooyinka waxaa loo lambar siiyaa iyada oo ka dambeysa lambarka ugu sarreeya mashruuca, barta kasta waxaa lagu sharraxaa layer-kiisa (ama jarxaddiisa), heerarkana waxay u beddelmaan cutubyada mashruuca sida qaybta kale ee sawirka. Dhammaantood waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa iyaga ka saara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoraalka wuxuu ku jiraa barta uu gelinta ka yaalo (ama barta isku-toosidda haddii uu leeyahay). Qoraalka gudaha jarxaddaha lama akhriyo, sawirkana weligiis lama beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta\"\u003EHubinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubintu waxay ku shaqeysaa waxa aad hadda soo geliyeyso, waxayna liistaa wax kasta oo ay ogaato, hal sadar mid kasta nooc dhibaato ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxay leedahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka lama sheegin\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirku ma sheegin cabbirkiisa, sidaas darteed tirooyinkiisa waxaa loo akhriyaa cabbirka mashruuca. Hubi hal masaafo aad taqaanno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka waa la beddelay\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka sawirka wuu ka duwan yahay kan mashruuca, waana la miisaamay (fiiro gaar ah, ma aha khalad).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXogtu waxay gaartaa … km\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003E… m\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBallaca waa ka weyn yahay 200 km ama ka yar yahay nus mitir, taas oo badanaa tilmaamaysa cabbir khaldan (millimitir loo akhriyay mitir, ama beddelka).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENidaamka isku-xirka ma jiro\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashruucu ma leh. Waa digniin marka xogta ay meel ka fog eber ku taal, sida koorsiyada state plane ama grid-ka qaranka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coordinate-systems\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coordinate-systems\"\u003ENidaamyada isku-xirka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa fog asalka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXogta waxay ku taal in ka badan 100 km eber. Meel fog eber, muuqaalada 3D iyo dhoofinta sax ma aha oo way gariiraan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELayer-ka konturka … ma leh heer\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELayer-ka magaciisu la mid yahay konturada (TOPO, CONT, CNTR, CONTOUR) wuxuu ku jiraa xarriiqyo heerkoodu yahay 0, sidaas darteed dhul laga dhisay wuu siman noqon lahaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka oo dhan 0\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaar heerarka waa 0 halka heerka caadiga ahi uu aad uga fog yahay: badanaa kor-u-jeedsiyada maqan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka ka fog kuwa kale\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaar heerar ayaa aad uga baxsan kuwa kale (waxaa la ogaadaa iyadoo lagu barbar dhigayo bartamaha dhammaan heerarka, sidaas darteed goob janjeer leh oo ballac weyn ayaa aan la calaamadin), ama ka sarreeya 9,000 m ama ka hooseeya -11,000 m.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarro korka barta kale\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba barood oo isku meel ku jira, oo heer isku mid ah ama kala duwan leh.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii aad gujiso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E, isla sadarradaas waxay tagaan \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/strong\u003E, mid kasta nooc kasta, magaca faylka lagu daray, si aad dib ugu noqon karto. Hubintu waxay xukuntaa sawirka; ma beddesho waxba gudihiisa, ma-na joojinayso inaad isticmaasho sawirka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hubintu sheegto in konturadu ay siman yihiin 0 oo ay jiraan heerar qoraal ahaan, ku qaad heerarka barrooyin sahan: badanaa waxay sidaas u xambaaraan heerarka dhabta ah ee konturadu ku maqan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-la-hubin\"\u003EWaxa aan la hubin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubintu ma barbar dhigto sawirka sahan kale, ma-na garanayso nidaamka isku-xirka ee sawirku ku jiro: waxay kaliya kuu sheegtaa in mid aan la dejin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sawirka sahanka wuxuu u muuqan karaa mid sax ah, laakiin wuxuu noqon karaa mid khaldan dhulka: cabbirkiisa waa la qiyaasay, konturadiisu waxay ku taagan yihiin heerka 0, ama heerarkiisa waxaa lagu qoray qoraal aan xarriiq ahayn. Qaybta Heerarka sahanka iyo hubinta ee daaqadda Linework (eeg Fur DWG ama DXF sida xarriiqyo) waxay akhrisaa heerarkaas, oo waxay kuu sheegaysaa waxa khaldan ka hor intaan wax lagu daro. Heerar qoraal ahaan ama sifooyin ahaan Sawiro badan ayaa siiya heer dhul oo qoraal yar oo ku taal calaamad (cross) sida 104.37 ama EL 104.37, ama sifo ka mid ah jarxadda barta. Kuwani ma aha xarriiqyo, sidaas darteed akhriyaha xarriiqyada ayaa ka tagaya. Qaybtu waxay tirinaysaa inta ay heshay, waxayna kuu ogolaanaysaa inaad qaadato barrooyin sahan: Calaamadi Qaado … heerar sida barrooyin sahan. Waa lagu calaamadin bilowga, sababtoo ah ma aha tiro kasta oo sawirka ku jirta inay tahay dhererka. Qoraalka waa la akhriyaa marka uu yahay heer keligiis: tiro leh qeyb tobanle (104.37, +104,37, -3.50), ama tiro ka dambeysa EL, ELEV, RL, FFL, GL, TW, BW, INV, Z ama LEVEL, oo ay ku xigto m, ft ama ' haddii la doono. Tiro buuxa oo keligeed ah (12) waxaa loo akhriyaa lambar dhul ama warqad, ma aha heer; qoraal sida GATE 3 ama taariikh lama akhriyo abid. Calaamadaha qaabaynta qoraalka waa la iska indho tiraa. Sifooyinka jarxadda, dooro Sifada jarxadda ee haysa heerka. CivilCraft wuxuu si toos ah u helaa calaamad magaceedu yahay ELEV, Z, LEVEL, RL ama mid la mid ah; ka dooro mid kale liiska haddii sawirku isticmaalo mid gaar ah. Doorashadu waxaa lagu xusaa magaca faylka kumbuyuutarkan, sidaas darteed markii dib loo furo wuxuu ku bilaabmaa isla calaamadda. Calaamad aad doorato tirooyinka oo dhan ayay u qaadataa heerar. Guji Add. Barrooyinka waxaa loo lambar siiyaa iyada oo ka dambeysa lambarka ugu sarreeya mashruuca, barta kasta waxaa lagu sharraxaa layer-kiisa (ama jarxaddiisa), heerarkana waxay u beddelmaan cutubyada mashruuca sida qaybta kale ee sawirka. Dhammaantood waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa iyaga ka saara. Qoraalka wuxuu ku jiraa barta uu gelinta ka yaalo (ama barta isku-toosidda haddii uu leeyahay). Qoraalka gudaha jarxaddaha lama akhriyo, sawirkana weligiis lama beddelo. Hubinta Hubintu waxay ku shaqeysaa waxa aad hadda soo geliyeyso, waxayna liistaa wax kasta oo ay ogaato, hal sadar mid kasta nooc dhibaato ah: Waxay leedahay Macnaha Cabbirka lama sheegin Sawirku ma sheegin cabbirkiisa, sidaas darteed tirooyinkiisa waxaa loo akhriyaa cabbirka mashruuca. Hubi hal masaafo aad taqaanno. Cabbirka waa la beddelay Cabbirka sawirka wuu ka duwan yahay kan mashruuca, waana la miisaamay (fiiro gaar ah, ma aha khalad). Xogtu waxay gaartaa … km ama … m Ballaca waa ka weyn yahay 200 km ama ka yar yahay nus mitir, taas oo badanaa tilmaamaysa cabbir khaldan (millimitir loo akhriyay mitir, ama beddelka). Nidaamka isku-xirka ma jiro Mashruucu ma leh. Waa digniin marka xogta ay meel ka fog eber ku taal, sida koorsiyada state plane ama grid-ka qaranka. Eeg Nidaamyada isku-xirka. Ka fog asalka Xogta waxay ku taal in ka badan 100 km eber. Meel fog eber, muuqaalada 3D iyo dhoofinta sax ma aha oo way gariiraan. Layer-ka konturka … ma leh heer Layer-ka magaciisu la mid yahay konturada (TOPO, CONT, CNTR, CONTOUR) wuxuu ku jiraa xarriiqyo heerkoodu yahay 0, sidaas darteed dhul laga dhisay wuu siman noqon lahaa. Heerarka oo dhan 0 Qaar heerarka waa 0 halka heerka caadiga ahi uu aad uga fog yahay: badanaa kor-u-jeedsiyada maqan. Heerarka ka fog kuwa kale Qaar heerar ayaa aad uga baxsan kuwa kale (waxaa la ogaadaa iyadoo lagu barbar dhigayo bartamaha dhammaan heerarka, sidaas darteed goob janjeer leh oo ballac weyn ayaa aan la calaamadin), ama ka sarreeya 9,000 m ama ka hooseeya -11,000 m. Barro korka barta kale Laba barood oo isku meel ku jira, oo heer isku mid ah ama kala duwan leh. Markii aad gujiso Add, isla sadarradaas waxay tagaan Dhibaatooyin, mid kasta nooc kasta, magaca faylka lagu daray, si aad dib ugu noqon karto. Hubintu waxay xukuntaa sawirka; ma beddesho waxba gudihiisa, ma-na joojinayso inaad isticmaasho sawirka. Marka hubintu sheegto in konturadu ay siman yihiin 0 oo ay jiraan heerar qoraal ahaan, ku qaad heerarka barrooyin sahan: badanaa waxay sidaas u xambaaraan heerarka dhabta ah ee konturadu ku maqan. Waxa aan la hubin Hubintu ma barbar dhigto sawirka sahan kale, ma-na garanayso nidaamka isku-xirka ee sawirku ku jiro: waxay kaliya kuu sheegtaa in mid aan la dejin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"contours","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Akhri kontuurada, heerarka iyo naqaska","summary":"Deji masaafada kontuurka iyo kontuurada waaweyn, muuji xagaaga heerarka, fallaadaha naqaska iyo saddexagallada, oo akhri heerka dhulka hoosta tusaha.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["kontuur","masaafada kontuurka","kontuurada waaweyn","calaamadaha","xagaaga heerarka","fallaadaha naqaska","saddexagallada","heerka barta","falanqaynta dusha","falanqaynta heerka","falanqaynta naqaska"],"headings":[{"id":"deji-masaafada-kontuurka","text":"Deji masaafada kontuurka","level":2},{"id":"jilciyi-kontuurada","text":"Jilciyi kontuurada","level":2},{"id":"dusha-ka-dambeysa-kontuurada","text":"Dusha ka dambeysa kontuurada","level":2},{"id":"akhri-heer-meel-kasta","text":"Akhri heer meel kasta","level":2},{"id":"muuji-xagaaga-heerarka","text":"Muuji xagaaga heerarka","level":2},{"id":"muuji-fallaadaha-naqaska","text":"Muuji fallaadaha naqaska","level":2},{"id":"muuji-saddexagallada-barahaaga-iyo-geeska","text":"Muuji saddexagallada, barahaaga iyo geeska","level":2},{"id":"jira-ama-la-soo-jeediyay","text":"Jira ama la soo jeediyay","level":2},{"id":"wixii-la-dhoofiyo","text":"Wixii la dhoofiyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDusha waxaa lagu muujiyaa kontuurro markii ay jirto. Wax kasta oo mawduucan ku jira waxaa lagu dejiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E panelka bidix. Dejinta bandhigga waxay beddeshaa kaliya wixii aad aragto (iyo wixii aad dhoofinayso); ma aha tallaabo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"deji-masaafada-kontuurka\"\u003EDeji masaafada kontuurka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro qiime ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EKontuur kasta\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiit: 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2, 5, 10 ama 20 ft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMitir: 0.1, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2, 5 ama 10 m.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWaaweyn kasta\u003C/strong\u003E: kontuurka 2aad, 4aad, 5aad ama 10aad. Kontuurada waaweyn waxaa lagu sawiraa xarriiq culus, waana lagu calaamadiyaa heerkooda. Waxay ku dhacaan tirooyin buuxa oo ah masaafada waaweyn (marka kontuurada 1 ft tahay oo waaweyn kasta yahay 5aad: 245, 250, 255 …).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDemi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha kontuurka\u003C/span\u003E haddii calaamadaha ay ku soo xoogaystaan qorshe yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMashruuc cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa 1 unit, iyo kontuur kasta oo 5aad oo ah waaweyn. Kontuurada waxay ku foorarsadaan khadadka jebinta; haddii ay si toos ah u gooyaan xarriiq socod ama bir, xarriiqaas weli ma aha khad jebin (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EDhis oo hagaaji dusha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKontuurada waxaa la sawiraa kaliya marka aan ka badnayn 2,000 heer oo u dhexeeya barta ugu hooseysa iyo tan ugu sarraysa. Goob leh fidin badan oo masaafo aad u yar, qorshuhu ma muujinayo kontuur kastaba: dooro masaafo weyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jilciyi-kontuurada\"\u003EJilciyi kontuurada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKontuurada waxaa lagu raadiyaa qaybo toosan, mid kasta oo saddexagal ah dhexdiisa, sidaas darteed waxay leexdaan geesi yar geesaha saddexagal kasta. \u003Cstrong\u003EJilcinta kontuurka\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa geeskaas wareegaya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMidna (qaybo toosan)\u003C/strong\u003E: xarriiqyada la raadiyay sida ay yihiin. Waa waxa qoraal cusub ama hore uu muujiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFudud\u003C/strong\u003E: geesaha si yar ayaa loo wareejiyaa. Xarriiq weligeed ma u dhaqaaqdo in ka badan 10% jidka ilaa kontuurka xiga, mana uu ka fogaan qaybtiisa toosan in ka badan hal qaybi lixaad dhererkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXoog\u003C/strong\u003E: qalloocan socda. Xarriiq weligeed ma u dhaqaaqdo in ka badan 25% jidka ilaa kontuurka xiga, mana uu ka fogaan qaybtiisa toosan in ka badan saddex meelood meel dhererkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabada doorasho midkoodna, kontuur jilcisan weli wuxuu gooyaa saddexagal kasta oo xuduud ah barta isku mid ah ee kontuurka la raadiyay, waxaana uu ku jiraa saddexagalka qayb kasta gooyo, sidaas darteed ma gooyi karo ama taaban karo kontuur kale. Meel kontuurku ku gooyo khad jebin ama xuduud, wuxuu hayaa geeskiisa cad. Xarriiqyada jilcisan ayaa la qorayaa oo la dhoofiyaa (DXF, DWG, PDF, GIS iyo 3D), waxayna leeyihiin geesas badan xarriiqyada la raadiyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJilcintu waxay beddeshaa kaliya xarriiqyada la sawiray. Heerarka, mugga, profiles-ka iyo qaybaha waxaa laga akhriyaa dusha laftiisa. Kontuur uu si toos ah ugu gudbo barta sahanka (barta 250.00 ee kontuurka 250) wuxuu hayaa geesas yar meel kasta oo noocaas ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha-ka-dambeysa-kontuurada\"\u003EDusha ka dambeysa kontuurada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKontuurada waxay raacaan dusha, dushuna waxay raacaa \u003Cstrong\u003EHabka kontuurka\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E panelka bidix. Caadiga ah, \u003Cstrong\u003ESaddexagallada oo leh interpolation toos ah\u003C/strong\u003E, waxay isku xidhaa barahaaga saddexagallo waxayna hayaan barta iyo khad jebin kasta si sax ah. Hababka kale marka hore waxay ku habboonaysiiyaan shabakad joogto ah barahaaga (kriging, minimum curvature, natural neighbor, inverse distance iyo kuwa kale), taasoo siinaysa kontuur wareegsan intervallada u dhexeeya barta, laakiin ma marayso dhammaan barahaaga si sax ah; warbixinta dusha ee hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa sheegaysa intee ka fog tahay natiijadu barahaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EABOS (approximation based on smoothing)\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah hababka shabakadda. Wuxuu leeyahay laba dejin oo gaar ah: \u003Cstrong\u003EJilicsanaan\u003C/strong\u003E (0.5 ilaa bilow; yar waa jilicsan) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESaxnaan\u003C/strong\u003E (1 ilaa bilow: dusha waxaa lagu keenayaa 1% ilaa kala duwanaanshaha sare ee goobta barahaaga; ku qor tiro yar si aad u heshid habboon oo dhow). Haddii aanu gaarin saxnaanta shabakadda uu haysto, warbixinta dusha way sheegaysaa: ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EFogaanta shabakada\u003C/strong\u003E oo yar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-heer-meel-kasta\"\u003EAkhri heer meel kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETusaha u dhaqaajiso qorshaha. Bar-xaaladdu waxay muujinaysaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EE\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EN\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta tusaha\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhul\u003C/strong\u003E iyo heerka dhulka jira halkaas, oo lagu xisaabiyay saddexagalka hoosta tusaha\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELa sameeyay\u003C/strong\u003E iyo heerka la soo jeediyay, meesha pad ama kooridor uu dhulka beddelay\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Dusha ka baxsan&quot; dibadda dusha\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad barta sahanka si sax ah u akhrido, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E oo guji barta: panelka midig wuxuu muujinayaa lambarkeeda, bariga (E), waqooyiga (N), heerka, sharaxaadda iyo kooxda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuji-xagaaga-heerarka\"\u003EMuuji xagaaga heerarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagaaga heerarka\u003C/span\u003E. Dusha waxaa lagu buuxiyaa midab ka bilaabmaya hoose (buluug-cagaar) ilaa sare (qaxwe-jaalle). Liiska hoosta sanduuqyada hubinta wuxuu muujinayaa kala duwanaanshaha heer kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro inta xagaago ah ee \u003Cstrong\u003EXagaagaha\u003C/strong\u003E: 5, 8, 10 ama 12. Xagaagahu wuxuu kala qaybiyaa kala duwanaanshaha heerka hoose ilaa sare qaybo siman.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXagaagahu waa kuwo la eegayo oo keliya. Looma dhoofiyo DXF looma qorayo PDF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuji-fallaadaha-naqaska\"\u003EMuuji fallaadaha naqaska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFallaadaha naqaska\u003C/span\u003E. Fallaad gaaban ayaa saddexagal kasta oo ku filan weyn si ay mid u qabato ayaa u tilmaamaysa dhinaca hoose. Saddexagallada siman fallaad ma helaan. Fallaadahu waa hubin degdeg ah oo ku saabsan jihada biyaha; qiimaha naqaska laftiisa weli lama calaamadin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuji-saddexagallada-barahaaga-iyo-geeska\"\u003EMuuji saddexagallada, barahaaga iyo geeska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaddexagallada\u003C/span\u003E waxay sawirtaa geesaha TIN-ka. Shid si aad u hubiso sida dusha ula xidhan tahay barahaaga, gaar ahaan khadadka jebinta iyo dibada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarood\u003C/span\u003E waxay sawirtaa barta sahan kasta; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha barta\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku darta lambarkeeda, heerkeeda iyo sharaxaadda (ama ka yar: eeg \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha barta\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadadka jebinta\u003C/span\u003E waxay sawirtaa khadadka jebinta (iyo xuduudka) midab oranji ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuduudka dusha\u003C/span\u003E waxay sawirtaa dhamaadka dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jira-ama-la-soo-jeediyay\"\u003EJira ama la soo jeediyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii pad ama kooridor uu dhulka si nadiif ah u sameeyo, \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E waxay bixisaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELa soo jeediyay (la sameeyay)\u003C/span\u003E. Kontuurada, xagaagaha iyo fallaadaha markaas waxay muujinayaan dusha la sameeyay, si aad u aragto dhulka cusub iyo iftiinka dibadiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu noqo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhulka jira\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto sahanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wixii-la-dhoofiyo\"\u003EWixii la dhoofiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhoofinta DXF iyo PDF waxay raacaan dejintan: wixii aad damisay looma qorayo, kontuurada waa kuwa dusha la muujiyay. Xagaagaha heerarka weligood looma dhoofiyo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dusha waxaa lagu muujiyaa kontuurro markii ay jirto. Wax kasta oo mawduucan ku jira waxaa lagu dejiyaa Bandhig panelka bidix. Dejinta bandhigga waxay beddeshaa kaliya wixii aad aragto (iyo wixii aad dhoofinayso); ma aha tallaabo ka noqo. Deji masaafada kontuurka Hoosta Bandhig, dooro qiime ku jira Kontuur kasta. Fiit: 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2, 5, 10 ama 20 ft. Mitir: 0.1, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2, 5 ama 10 m. Dooro Waaweyn kasta: kontuurka 2aad, 4aad, 5aad ama 10aad. Kontuurada waaweyn waxaa lagu sawiraa xarriiq culus, waana lagu calaamadiyaa heerkooda. Waxay ku dhacaan tirooyin buuxa oo ah masaafada waaweyn (marka kontuurada 1 ft tahay oo waaweyn kasta yahay 5aad: 245, 250, 255 …). Demi Calaamadaha kontuurka haddii calaamadaha ay ku soo xoogaystaan qorshe yar. Mashruuc cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa 1 unit, iyo kontuur kasta oo 5aad oo ah waaweyn. Kontuurada waxay ku foorarsadaan khadadka jebinta; haddii ay si toos ah u gooyaan xarriiq socod ama bir, xarriiqaas weli ma aha khad jebin (eeg Dhis oo hagaaji dusha). Kontuurada waxaa la sawiraa kaliya marka aan ka badnayn 2,000 heer oo u dhexeeya barta ugu hooseysa iyo tan ugu sarraysa. Goob leh fidin badan oo masaafo aad u yar, qorshuhu ma muujinayo kontuur kastaba: dooro masaafo weyn. Jilciyi kontuurada Kontuurada waxaa lagu raadiyaa qaybo toosan, mid kasta oo saddexagal ah dhexdiisa, sidaas darteed waxay leexdaan geesi yar geesaha saddexagal kasta. Jilcinta kontuurka oo ku jirta Bandhig ayaa geeskaas wareegaya: Midna (qaybo toosan): xarriiqyada la raadiyay sida ay yihiin. Waa waxa qoraal cusub ama hore uu muujiyo. Fudud: geesaha si yar ayaa loo wareejiyaa. Xarriiq weligeed ma u dhaqaaqdo in ka badan 10% jidka ilaa kontuurka xiga, mana uu ka fogaan qaybtiisa toosan in ka badan hal qaybi lixaad dhererkeeda. Xoog: qalloocan socda. Xarriiq weligeed ma u dhaqaaqdo in ka badan 25% jidka ilaa kontuurka xiga, mana uu ka fogaan qaybtiisa toosan in ka badan saddex meelood meel dhererkeeda. Labada doorasho midkoodna, kontuur jilcisan weli wuxuu gooyaa saddexagal kasta oo xuduud ah barta isku mid ah ee kontuurka la raadiyay, waxaana uu ku jiraa saddexagalka qayb kasta gooyo, sidaas darteed ma gooyi karo ama taaban karo kontuur kale. Meel kontuurku ku gooyo khad jebin ama xuduud, wuxuu hayaa geeskiisa cad. Xarriiqyada jilcisan ayaa la qorayaa oo la dhoofiyaa (DXF, DWG, PDF, GIS iyo 3D), waxayna leeyihiin geesas badan xarriiqyada la raadiyay. Jilcintu waxay beddeshaa kaliya xarriiqyada la sawiray. Heerarka, mugga, profiles-ka iyo qaybaha waxaa laga akhriyaa dusha laftiisa. Kontuur uu si toos ah ugu gudbo barta sahanka (barta 250.00 ee kontuurka 250) wuxuu hayaa geesas yar meel kasta oo noocaas ah. Dusha ka dambeysa kontuurada Kontuurada waxay raacaan dusha, dushuna waxay raacaa Habka kontuurka hoosta Dusha panelka bidix. Caadiga ah, Saddexagallada oo leh interpolation toos ah, waxay isku xidhaa barahaaga saddexagallo waxayna hayaan barta iyo khad jebin kasta si sax ah. Hababka kale marka hore waxay ku habboonaysiiyaan shabakad joogto ah barahaaga (kriging, minimum curvature, natural neighbor, inverse distance iyo kuwa kale), taasoo siinaysa kontuur wareegsan intervallada u dhexeeya barta, laakiin ma marayso dhammaan barahaaga si sax ah; warbixinta dusha ee hoosta Dusha ayaa sheegaysa intee ka fog tahay natiijadu barahaaga. ABOS (approximation based on smoothing) waa mid ka mid ah hababka shabakadda. Wuxuu leeyahay laba dejin oo gaar ah: Jilicsanaan (0.5 ilaa bilow; yar waa jilicsan) iyo Saxnaan (1 ilaa bilow: dusha waxaa lagu keenayaa 1% ilaa kala duwanaanshaha sare ee goobta barahaaga; ku qor tiro yar si aad u heshid habboon oo dhow). Haddii aanu gaarin saxnaanta shabakadda uu haysto, warbixinta dusha way sheegaysaa: ku qor Fogaanta shabakada oo yar. Akhri heer meel kasta Tusaha u dhaqaajiso qorshaha. Bar-xaaladdu waxay muujinaysaa: E iyo N hoosta tusaha Dhul iyo heerka dhulka jira halkaas, oo lagu xisaabiyay saddexagalka hoosta tusaha La sameeyay iyo heerka la soo jeediyay, meesha pad ama kooridor uu dhulka beddelay \"Dusha ka baxsan\" dibadda dusha Si aad barta sahanka si sax ah u akhrido, dooro Dooro oo guji barta: panelka midig wuxuu muujinayaa lambarkeeda, bariga (E), waqooyiga (N), heerka, sharaxaadda iyo kooxda. Muuji xagaaga heerarka Calaamadee Xagaaga heerarka. Dusha waxaa lagu buuxiyaa midab ka bilaabmaya hoose (buluug-cagaar) ilaa sare (qaxwe-jaalle). Liiska hoosta sanduuqyada hubinta wuxuu muujinayaa kala duwanaanshaha heer kasta. Dooro inta xagaago ah ee Xagaagaha: 5, 8, 10 ama 12. Xagaagahu wuxuu kala qaybiyaa kala duwanaanshaha heerka hoose ilaa sare qaybo siman. Xagaagahu waa kuwo la eegayo oo keliya. Looma dhoofiyo DXF looma qorayo PDF. Muuji fallaadaha naqaska Calaamadee Fallaadaha naqaska. Fallaad gaaban ayaa saddexagal kasta oo ku filan weyn si ay mid u qabato ayaa u tilmaamaysa dhinaca hoose. Saddexagallada siman fallaad ma helaan. Fallaadahu waa hubin degdeg ah oo ku saabsan jihada biyaha; qiimaha naqaska laftiisa weli lama calaamadin. Muuji saddexagallada, barahaaga iyo geeska Saddexagallada waxay sawirtaa geesaha TIN-ka. Shid si aad u hubiso sida dusha ula xidhan tahay barahaaga, gaar ahaan khadadka jebinta iyo dibada. Barood waxay sawirtaa barta sahan kasta; Calaamadaha barta waxay ku darta lambarkeeda, heerkeeda iyo sharaxaadda (ama ka yar: eeg Calaamadaha barta ee Dejinta CivilCraft). Khadadka jebinta waxay sawirtaa khadadka jebinta (iyo xuduudka) midab oranji ah. Xuduudka dusha waxay sawirtaa dhamaadka dusha. Jira ama la soo jeediyay Markii pad ama kooridor uu dhulka si nadiif ah u sameeyo, Dusha hoosta Bandhig waxay bixisaa La soo jeediyay (la sameeyay). Kontuurada, xagaagaha iyo fallaadaha markaas waxay muujinayaan dusha la sameeyay, si aad u aragto dhulka cusub iyo iftiinka dibadiisa. Ku noqo Dhulka jira si aad u aragto sahanka. Wixii la dhoofiyo Dhoofinta DXF iyo PDF waxay raacaan dejintan: wixii aad damisay looma qorayo, kontuurada waa kuwa dusha la muujiyay. Xagaagaha heerarka weligood looma dhoofiyo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"terrain-from-contours","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhulka khadadka konturka laga sameeyo","summary":"Samee dusha dhulka khariidad konturo ah: dooro layer-yada khadadka, sheeg meesha heerka khad kasta ka yimaado, hubi isgoysyada iyo isku-midka, kadibna dhis. Khadadka konturka waxay noqdaan breaklines, saddexagalada siman ee buuraha, dooxooyinka iyo qoorta ayaa la saxaa. Khariidad laga soo rogay sawir ama PDF waa la cabbiri karaa oo la meeleyn karaa laba nuqood oo la yaqaan.","section":"tasks","order":31,"keywords":["konturada","khadadka konturka","dhulka laga sameeyo konturada","dusha laga sameeyo konturada","khariidadda topograafiga","khariidadda sahanka","aan koorsiyo lahayn","breaklines","saddexagalada siman","buur","dooxo","qoorta","isgoysyada konturada","konturada isku mid","fogaanta konturka","cabbirka khariidadda","laba nuqood","meel-geynta khariidadda","DXF","DWG","shapefile"],"headings":[{"id":"konturada-soo-geli","text":"Konturada soo geli","level":2},{"id":"sheeg-meesha-heerka-khad-kasta-ka-yimaado","text":"Sheeg meesha heerka khad kasta ka yimaado","level":2},{"id":"hubi-kadibna-dhis","text":"Hubi, kadibna dhis","level":2},{"id":"khariidad-aan-koorsiyo-lahayn","text":"Khariidad aan koorsiyo lahayn","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESahamiyaha mararka qaarkood wuxuu soo diraa khariidad konturo: khadad leh heerar, laakiin aan barro lahayn. CivilCraft wuxuu dhulka jira ka dhisaa khadadkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"konturada-soo-geli\"\u003EKonturada soo geli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur khariidadda sida linework: sawir DXF ama DWG, shapefile ama GeoJSON (\u003Cstrong\u003EGIS\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E, ama dhig faylka qorshaha dushiisa). Khadadka waxay u yimaadaan sida \u003Cstrong\u003Elayer-yada khariidadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETerrain from contours\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sheeg-meesha-heerka-khad-kasta-ka-yimaado\"\u003ESheeg meesha heerka khad kasta ka yimaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi layer-yada ku jira konturada, kadibna dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka ka yimaada\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe lines&#039; own elevations\u003C/span\u003E: khad kasta oo dhammaan barradiisu leeyihiin heer isku mid ah (3D polyline, ama polyline leh heer). Khad heerkiisu yahay 0 waa khad qorshe ah oo aan heer lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoob tiro\u003C/strong\u003E oo layer-ka ah (tusaale ELEV), haddii khariiddu lagu soo diray mid ka mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA start and an interval, in the order the lines are listed\u003C/span\u003E: khadadka aan heer lahayn. Khadka ugu horreeya ee liiska ku jira wuxuu helaa \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka khadka koowaad\u003C/strong\u003E, khadka xiga wuxuu helaa heerkaas oo lagu daray \u003Cstrong\u003EFogaanta konturka\u003C/strong\u003E, iwm. Liiska khadadka ka bilow kan ugu hooseeya ee kor u kaca (ama dib u habee layer-ka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-kadibna-dhis\"\u003EHubi, kadibna dhis\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa waxa khaldan, qoraal ahaan, ka hor intaan wax la beddelin:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekhad aan lahayn \u003Cstrong\u003Eheer\u003C/strong\u003E ama ka yar laba barood;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekhad \u003Cstrong\u003Eisku mid ah\u003C/strong\u003E (isla qaabka laba jeer, xitaa haddii si ka soo rogan loo sawiray);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elaba khad oo \u003Cstrong\u003Eisgoysa\u003C/strong\u003E, heerar kala duwan ama isku mid ah (khad isgoysa naftiisa sidoo kale), iyo meesha lagu sheegay;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eheer \u003Cstrong\u003Eaan ku jirin fogaanta\u003C/strong\u003E (qaladka qorista sida 105.5 khariidad 1 m ah).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave out lines that cross another\u003C/span\u003E si aad u tirtirto khadka isgoysa inta badan (kadibna kan xiga, ilaa aan wax isgoyn). Khad sharaf-darro ah oo jari kara konturada oo dhan ayaa baabi&#039;ayaa, ma aha konturada. \u003Cstrong\u003ESimplify lines within\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu yareeyaa barrooyinka u dhow khad toosan oo masaafadaas la siiyey.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuild the ground\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu khadadka ku daraa dhulka jira breaklines ahaan (hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho), sidaas darteed dusha wuxuu marayaa konturo kasta si sax ah. Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFix flat triangles on ridges, valleys and hilltops\u003C/span\u003E la calaamadiyo, la-na siiyo fogaanta, CivilCraft wuxuu sidoo kale ku daraa barro saddexagal siman kasta gudihiisa (saddexagal kaas oo geeskiisa oo dhan ku jira hal kontur) heerka ay wadada ku xigta sii socoto, markasta oo ka badnaan karin badh fogaan ah konturka. Haddii kale, buuraha dusheeda, dooxooyinka hoose iyo qoorta waxay u muuqdaan sida saxan siman. Buul tijaabo ah, khaladka ka soo horjeeda dusha run ahaaneed wuxuu hoos u dhacay rubuc; buuraha dheer, 40%.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khariidad-aan-koorsiyo-lahayn\"\u003EKhariidad aan koorsiyo lahayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhariidad konturo oo laga rogay sawir ama PDF, fur \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir oo meel u geli layer-yada laba nuqood oo la yaqaan\u003C/strong\u003E. Bixi laba nuqood khariidadda, iyo meesha ay dhab ahaan ku yaalaan; layer-yada la calaamadiyey waa la cabbiraa, la wareejiyaa, lagana dhaqaajiyaa si ay u habboonaadaan (hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho; heerarka lama beddelo). Laba nuqoodkaas isla markaana cabbirka (fariinta ku jirta) iyo jeexjeexa (rotation) ayaa siiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha waxay ahaan kartaa sida khariiddu tahay wanaagsan: between two contours waa diyaarad, sidaas darteed dhulka dhabta ah ee u dhexeeya lama yaqaan. Natiijada ku hubi barrooyinka sare ka hor intaadan isku hallayn.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sahamiyaha mararka qaarkood wuxuu soo diraa khariidad konturo: khadad leh heerar, laakiin aan barro lahayn. CivilCraft wuxuu dhulka jira ka dhisaa khadadkaas. Konturada soo geli Fur khariidadda sida linework: sawir DXF ama DWG, shapefile ama GeoJSON (GIS › Import, ama dhig faylka qorshaha dushiisa). Khadadka waxay u yimaadaan sida layer-yada khariidadda. Hoosta Dusha › More, dooro Terrain from contours. Sheeg meesha heerka khad kasta ka yimaado Calaamadi layer-yada ku jira konturada, kadibna dooro Heerka ka yimaada: The lines' own elevations: khad kasta oo dhammaan barradiisu leeyihiin heer isku mid ah (3D polyline, ama polyline leh heer). Khad heerkiisu yahay 0 waa khad qorshe ah oo aan heer lahayn. Goob tiro oo layer-ka ah (tusaale ELEV), haddii khariiddu lagu soo diray mid ka mid ah. A start and an interval, in the order the lines are listed: khadadka aan heer lahayn. Khadka ugu horreeya ee liiska ku jira wuxuu helaa Heerka khadka koowaad, khadka xiga wuxuu helaa heerkaas oo lagu daray Fogaanta konturka, iwm. Liiska khadadka ka bilow kan ugu hooseeya ee kor u kaca (ama dib u habee layer-ka). Hubi, kadibna dhis Check wuxuu liistaa waxa khaldan, qoraal ahaan, ka hor intaan wax la beddelin: khad aan lahayn heer ama ka yar laba barood; khad isku mid ah (isla qaabka laba jeer, xitaa haddii si ka soo rogan loo sawiray); laba khad oo isgoysa, heerar kala duwan ama isku mid ah (khad isgoysa naftiisa sidoo kale), iyo meesha lagu sheegay; heer aan ku jirin fogaanta (qaladka qorista sida 105.5 khariidad 1 m ah). Calaamadi Leave out lines that cross another si aad u tirtirto khadka isgoysa inta badan (kadibna kan xiga, ilaa aan wax isgoyn). Khad sharaf-darro ah oo jari kara konturada oo dhan ayaa baabi'ayaa, ma aha konturada. Simplify lines within wuxuu yareeyaa barrooyinka u dhow khad toosan oo masaafadaas la siiyey. Build the ground wuxuu khadadka ku daraa dhulka jira breaklines ahaan (hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho), sidaas darteed dusha wuxuu marayaa konturo kasta si sax ah. Marka Fix flat triangles on ridges, valleys and hilltops la calaamadiyo, la-na siiyo fogaanta, CivilCraft wuxuu sidoo kale ku daraa barro saddexagal siman kasta gudihiisa (saddexagal kaas oo geeskiisa oo dhan ku jira hal kontur) heerka ay wadada ku xigta sii socoto, markasta oo ka badnaan karin badh fogaan ah konturka. Haddii kale, buuraha dusheeda, dooxooyinka hoose iyo qoorta waxay u muuqdaan sida saxan siman. Buul tijaabo ah, khaladka ka soo horjeeda dusha run ahaaneed wuxuu hoos u dhacay rubuc; buuraha dheer, 40%. Khariidad aan koorsiyo lahayn Khariidad konturo oo laga rogay sawir ama PDF, fur Cabbir oo meel u geli layer-yada laba nuqood oo la yaqaan. Bixi laba nuqood khariidadda, iyo meesha ay dhab ahaan ku yaalaan; layer-yada la calaamadiyey waa la cabbiraa, la wareejiyaa, lagana dhaqaajiyaa si ay u habboonaadaan (hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho; heerarka lama beddelo). Laba nuqoodkaas isla markaana cabbirka (fariinta ku jirta) iyo jeexjeexa (rotation) ayaa siiya. Dusha waxay ahaan kartaa sida khariiddu tahay wanaagsan: between two contours waa diyaarad, sidaas darteed dhulka dhabta ah ee u dhexeeya lama yaqaan. Natiijada ku hubi barrooyinka sare ka hor intaadan isku hallayn.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"alignment","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qorso jid-hagaha toosan","summary":"Ka sawir jid-hagaha iyadoo lagu xidhayo PI-yada, deji radius-yada wareegga iyo station-ka bilowga, u dhaqaaq PI-yada, oo akhri xogta wareegga iyo station-ka iyo offset-ka.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["jid-hagaha","ma jiro xal","wareeg ma ku habboonaan","radius ugu weyn","radius ugu yar","radius ugu yar ee la oggol yahay","xawaaraha naqshadeynta","isku dhac","centerline","pi","wareeg toosan","radius","stationing","tangent","abuur jid-hagaha","qorsha jid-hagaha","pc","pt","station offset"],"headings":[{"id":"ka-sawir-jid-hagaha","text":"Ka sawir jid-hagaha","level":2},{"id":"deji-radius-yada-iyo-isku-xirka","text":"Deji radius-yada iyo isku-xirka","level":2},{"id":"marka-wareeg-aanu-ku-habboonayn","text":"Marka wareeg aanu ku habboonayn","level":2},{"id":"radius-naqshadeyn-oo-ugu-yar","text":"Radius naqshadeyn oo ugu yar","level":3},{"id":"dhaqaaq-pi-yada-qorshaha","text":"Dhaqaaq PI-yada qorshaha","level":2},{"id":"akhri-station-iyo-offset","text":"Akhri station iyo offset","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-sawiray","text":"Waxa la sawiray","level":2},{"id":"tirtir-jid-hagaha","text":"Tirtir jid-hagaha","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2},{"id":"xawaaraha-naqshadeynta-iyo-fasalka","text":"Xawaaraha naqshadeynta iyo fasalka","level":2},{"id":"spiraalyo","text":"Spiraalyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EJid-hagaha ku jira CivilCraft waa silsiladda tangent-yada oo ku xiran barta isgoysyada (PI), oo leh wareeg goobo ah PI kasta oo gudaha ah oo leh radius. Waxaa lagu station-gareeyaa station bilow ah oo aad doorato. Mashruuc wuxuu hayn karaa jid-hagyo badan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-sawir-jid-hagaha\"\u003EKa sawir jid-hagaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlignment\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EDesign\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamadda hagista ayaa sheegaysa in aad guujiso PI-yada siday u kala horreeyaan. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama laba jeer guji ayaa dhammaysta, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa kii ugu dambeeyay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji PI-ga koowaad (bilowga jid-hagaha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji PI-yada soo socda siday u kala horreeyaan. Xariiq cas ayaa raacda mu&#039;ashirka oo muujinaysa dhererka iyo jihada tangent-ka aad sawirayso, tusaale ahaan &quot;212.40 ft  N 63°12&#039;05&quot; E&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji PI-ga ugu dambeeya (dhammaadka jid-hagaha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Jid-hagaha waa la sawiray oo leh station-yada, waana la doortay. Bar-xaaladda waxay sheegaysaa, tusaale ahaan, &quot;Alignment 1: 386.36 ft, curves of 100 ft radius where they fit. Edit radii in Properties; Profile (R) to design its grade.&quot; (Jid-hagaha 1: 386.36 ft, wareegyo radius 100 ft ah meelaha ku habboon. Wax ka beddel radius-yada Sifooyinka; Muuqaal dherer (R) si aad u naqshadeyso heerkiisa.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntii aad sawirayso: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa PI-ga ugu dambeeya, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa, jiidista meel bannaan ayaa keliya dhaqaajisa muuqaalka iyada oo aan PI lagu darin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaystir \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Laba jeer guji ayaa sidoo kale dhammaysta, laakiin dhismahan wuxuu tirtiraa PI-ga aad laba jeer ku gujisay. Guji PI-ga ugu dambeeya hal mar, ka dibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPI kasta oo gudaha ah wuxuu helaa wareeg 100 ft ah (30 m mashruuca mitirka), ama radius-ka ugu weyn ee tiro dhan ee ku habboon badh tangent kasta haddii 100 ft aanu ku habboonayn. PI-yada aad u foorar ama toos ah ma helaan wareeg.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"deji-radius-yada-iyo-isku-xirka\"\u003EDeji radius-yada iyo isku-xirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka jid-hagaha la doortay, dhinaca midig wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EJid-hagaha\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EStation-ka bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E. Station-ka qor sida \u003Ccode\u003E10+00\u003C/code\u003E (feet) ama \u003Ccode\u003E0+500\u003C/code\u003E (mitir), ama lambar caadi ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/units-and-stations\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/units-and-stations\"\u003EHalbeegyada, stationyada iyo qaabka lambarada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EStation-ka dhammaadka\u003C/strong\u003E waa la xisaabiyay adiga oo aan qorin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiiska \u003Cstrong\u003EPIs\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EEasting\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ENorthing\u003C/strong\u003E PI kasta, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ERadius\u003C/strong\u003E PI kasta oo gudaha ah. Qor qiime cusub oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERadius 0 wuxuu sameeyaa barta xagasha oo aan wareeg lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPI-ga koowaad iyo kii ugu dambeeyay mar waligood ma lahaan radius.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadda x ee yar ee dhamaadka safka ayaa tirtirta PI-gaas (jid-hagaha wuxuu haysaa ugu yaraan laba PI).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri liiska \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E: wareeg kasta, station-yada PC iyo PT, radius R, deflection Δ iyo jihadda (bidix ama midig), dhererka L, tangent T, masaafada dibadda E iyo chord.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqa hoosta wareegyada wuxuu bixiyaa jihada (bearing) tangent-ka koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-wareeg-aanu-ku-habboonayn\"\u003EMarka wareeg aanu ku habboonayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii wareegyadu u baahan yihiin tangent ka badan kan u dhexeeya PI-yadooda, jid-hagaha ma leh xal: lama sawirin si sax ah ilaa aad hagaajiso, waana laga saaraa dhoofinta LandXML. Sanduuq cas ayaa sababta ku sheegta lambarro, wuxuuna soo jeedinayaa waxa ku habboon:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareegyada PI 2 iyo PI 3 waxay u baahan yihiin 240.00 ft oo tangent ah dhexdooda (130.00 + 110.00), laakiin PI-yadu waxay ka fog yihiin 180.00 ft. Haddii mid kaliya uu leeyahay wareeg, fariintu waxay tahay wareegga PI 2 wuxuu u baahan yahay 240.00 ft oo tangent ah dhinaca PI 1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhan kasta oo PI ah wuxuu dejiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius-ka ugu weyn ee ku habboon\u003C/strong\u003E meeshaas, iyada oo wareegga kale sida uu yahay loo ilaaliyo (waxayna sidoo kale u baahan tahay inuu ku habboonaado tangent-ka kale ee PI-ga). Halka labada PI ay leeyihiin wareeg, \u003Cstrong\u003ELabaduba\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu labadooda radius-kooda ku yareeyaa isbarbardhig ahaan si ay u kulmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka wareeg keliya uu ka dheer yahay tangent-ka, sanduuqu wuxuu sheegayaa in ma jiro wareeg PI kale oo ku habboonaan kara inta uu yahay weyn sidaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPI oo si toos ah dib ugu jeesta ma qaadan karo wareeg; sanduuqu wuxuu soo jeedinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ENo curve at PI n\u003C/strong\u003E (Ma jiro wareeg PI n).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhan kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa radius-yadii hore. Radius-yada la soo jeediyay waxaa lagu wareejiyaa 0.01 hoose si ay had iyo jeer ku habboonaadaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"radius-naqshadeyn-oo-ugu-yar\"\u003ERadius naqshadeyn oo ugu yar\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003EDesign minimum radius\u003C/strong\u003E (tusaale ahaan ka xisaabi xawaaraha naqshadeynta) si wareeg kasta loo hubiyo; ka tag madhan haddii aadan doonayn. Wareeg ka hooseeya ayaa la liisanayaa badhan \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius-ka ugu yar ee buuxinaya ugu yarta\u003C/strong\u003E, marka radius-kaasi ku habboon yahay. Marka aanu ku habboonayn, sanduuqu wuu sheegaa oo wuxuu siinayaa radius-ka ugu weyn ee tangent-yadu oggol yihiin, si aad u ogaato inaad u dhaqaaqdo PI ama aad hoosaysiiso ugu yarta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaq-pi-yada-qorshaha\"\u003EDhaqaaq PI-yada qorshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E la shido, guji jid-hagaha si aad u doorato. Gacmo-qabasho afar-geesle ah ayaa ka soo muuqata PI-yadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid gacmo-qabashada. Jid-hagaha, stationing-keeda, muuqaalka dherer iyo corridor-ka way raacaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii daa. Dhaqdhaqaaqa waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqon karta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda ma suurtogasho inaad ku darto PI ka dhex jirta laba jira: tirtir jid-hagaha oo mar kale sawir, ama qor isku-xirka cusub ee PI-yada aad haysid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-station-iyo-offset\"\u003EAkhri station iyo offset\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMu&#039;ashirka dul mari qorshaha. Bar-xaaladdu wuxuu muujinayaa jid-hagaha ugu dhow (ama kan la doortay) oo leh station-ka iyo offset-ka, \u003Cstrong\u003EL\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ER\u003C/strong\u003E marka la eego station-ka hore, tusaale ahaan &quot;Alignment 1: Sta 2+15.30, offset 18.42 R&quot;. Dhinac kasta oo ka baxsan dhammaadka, waxay ku darta &quot;(beyond the end)&quot; (ka baxsan dhammaadka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-sawiray\"\u003EWaxa la sawiray\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshaha, DXF iyo PDF: centerline-ka (tangent-yada sida xariiqyo, wareegyada sida qaansooyin dhab ah), calaamad kasta 50 ft (20 m) oo calaamad dheer leh iyo sumad station ah kasta 100 unit, iyo calaamadaha PC iyo PT oo lagu sumeeyay station-kooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirtir-jid-hagaha\"\u003ETirtir jid-hagaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E qalabka ama hoosta dhinaca midig. Muuqaalkiisa iyo corridor-kiisa way raacaan. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka, furaha lagu sheegay \u003Cstrong\u003Edelete\u003C/strong\u003E waa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E brawsarka dhexdiisa, oo ma tirtirto wax la doortay. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Fn iyo delete), ama isticmaal badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/profile\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/profile\"\u003ENaqshadee muuqaal dherer toosan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xawaaraha-naqshadeynta-iyo-fasalka\"\u003EXawaaraha naqshadeynta iyo fasalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta Sifooyinka jid-hagaha, \u003Cstrong\u003EDesign speed\u003C/strong\u003E (km/h ama mph) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDesign class\u003C/strong\u003E waxay la socdaan jid-hagaha, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa mashruuca, waxaana lagu qoraa IFC (Pset_RoadDesignCriteriaCommon). CivilCraft ma leh miis xidhiidhinaysa xawaare iyo radius ugu yar, markaa waxba lagama hubinayo iyaga: deji \u003Cstrong\u003EMinimum radius\u003C/strong\u003E iyadoo laga raacayo heerkaaga naqshadeynta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spiraalyo\"\u003ESpiraalyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWareeg wuxuu leeyahay spiraal clothoid ah oo ku yaal labada dhinac: tangent, spiraal, wareeg, spiraal, tangent. Miiska PI, qor dherer ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003ESpiral in\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESpiral out\u003C/strong\u003E PI-ga leh radius. PI-gu meeshiisa ayuu ku sii jiraa; wareegga ayaa u soo dhowaada si uu meel u sameeyo, sidaas darteed masaafada tangent-ka ayaa kordhaysa offset-ka spiraalka. Labada dherer way kala duwan yihiin karaan; PI-ga leh hal dherer oo keliya wuxuu helaa spiraal dhinaca keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska wareegga markaas wuxuu akhrinayaa TS, SC, CS iyo ST (tangent ilaa spiraal, spiraal ilaa wareeg, wareeg ilaa spiraal, spiraal ilaa tangent) oo leh xagasha spiraalka θs, masaafooyinka tangent-ka iyo masaafada dibadda. Stations-ka waxay socdaan dhinacyada spiraalyada sida meelkasta kale. Spiraalyada oo wadar ahaan leh xagal ka weyn tan wareegga waa la diidaa, iyada oo PI-ga la magacaabo; spiraal ka dheer tangent-ka oo ay u oggolaatay waa isku dhac, sida wareeg kasta. Superelevation wuxuu isticmaalaa spiraalka sida runoff-kiisa (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor\"\u003ECorridor\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jid-hagaha ku jira CivilCraft waa silsiladda tangent-yada oo ku xiran barta isgoysyada (PI), oo leh wareeg goobo ah PI kasta oo gudaha ah oo leh radius. Waxaa lagu station-gareeyaa station bilow ah oo aad doorato. Mashruuc wuxuu hayn karaa jid-hagyo badan. Ka sawir jid-hagaha Riix A, ama guji Alignment kooxda Design. Calaamadda hagista ayaa sheegaysa in aad guujiso PI-yada siday u kala horreeyaan. Enter ama laba jeer guji ayaa dhammaysta, Backspace wuxuu tirtiraa kii ugu dambeeyay, Esc wuu joojiyaa. Guji PI-ga koowaad (bilowga jid-hagaha). Guji PI-yada soo socda siday u kala horreeyaan. Xariiq cas ayaa raacda mu'ashirka oo muujinaysa dhererka iyo jihada tangent-ka aad sawirayso, tusaale ahaan \"212.40 ft N 63°12'05\" E\". Guji PI-ga ugu dambeeya (dhammaadka jid-hagaha). Riix Enter. Jid-hagaha waa la sawiray oo leh station-yada, waana la doortay. Bar-xaaladda waxay sheegaysaa, tusaale ahaan, \"Alignment 1: 386.36 ft, curves of 100 ft radius where they fit. Edit radii in Properties; Profile (R) to design its grade.\" (Jid-hagaha 1: 386.36 ft, wareegyo radius 100 ft ah meelaha ku habboon. Wax ka beddel radius-yada Sifooyinka; Muuqaal dherer (R) si aad u naqshadeyso heerkiisa.) Intii aad sawirayso: Backspace wuxuu tirtiraa PI-ga ugu dambeeya, Esc wuu joojiyaa, jiidista meel bannaan ayaa keliya dhaqaajisa muuqaalka iyada oo aan PI lagu darin. Dhammaystir Enter. Laba jeer guji ayaa sidoo kale dhammaysta, laakiin dhismahan wuxuu tirtiraa PI-ga aad laba jeer ku gujisay. Guji PI-ga ugu dambeeya hal mar, ka dibna riix Enter. PI kasta oo gudaha ah wuxuu helaa wareeg 100 ft ah (30 m mashruuca mitirka), ama radius-ka ugu weyn ee tiro dhan ee ku habboon badh tangent kasta haddii 100 ft aanu ku habboonayn. PI-yada aad u foorar ama toos ah ma helaan wareeg. Deji radius-yada iyo isku-xirka Marka jid-hagaha la doortay, dhinaca midig wuxuu muujinayaa Jid-hagaha: Magaca iyo Station-ka bilowga. Station-ka qor sida 10+00 (feet) ama 0+500 (mitir), ama lambar caadi ah. Eeg Halbeegyada, stationyada iyo qaabka lambarada. Dherer iyo Station-ka dhammaadka waa la xisaabiyay adiga oo aan qorin. Miiska PIs wuxuu liistaa Easting iyo Northing PI kasta, iyo Radius PI kasta oo gudaha ah. Qor qiime cusub oo riix Enter. Radius 0 wuxuu sameeyaa barta xagasha oo aan wareeg lahayn. PI-ga koowaad iyo kii ugu dambeeyay mar waligood ma lahaan radius. Calaamadda x ee yar ee dhamaadka safka ayaa tirtirta PI-gaas (jid-hagaha wuxuu haysaa ugu yaraan laba PI). Akhri liiska Curves: wareeg kasta, station-yada PC iyo PT, radius R, deflection Δ iyo jihadda (bidix ama midig), dhererka L, tangent T, masaafada dibadda E iyo chord. Xariiqa hoosta wareegyada wuxuu bixiyaa jihada (bearing) tangent-ka koowaad. Marka wareeg aanu ku habboonayn Haddii wareegyadu u baahan yihiin tangent ka badan kan u dhexeeya PI-yadooda, jid-hagaha ma leh xal: lama sawirin si sax ah ilaa aad hagaajiso, waana laga saaraa dhoofinta LandXML. Sanduuq cas ayaa sababta ku sheegta lambarro, wuxuuna soo jeedinayaa waxa ku habboon: Wareegyada PI 2 iyo PI 3 waxay u baahan yihiin 240.00 ft oo tangent ah dhexdooda (130.00 + 110.00), laakiin PI-yadu waxay ka fog yihiin 180.00 ft. Haddii mid kaliya uu leeyahay wareeg, fariintu waxay tahay wareegga PI 2 wuxuu u baahan yahay 240.00 ft oo tangent ah dhinaca PI 1. Badhan kasta oo PI ah wuxuu dejiyaa radius-ka ugu weyn ee ku habboon meeshaas, iyada oo wareegga kale sida uu yahay loo ilaaliyo (waxayna sidoo kale u baahan tahay inuu ku habboonaado tangent-ka kale ee PI-ga). Halka labada PI ay leeyihiin wareeg, Labaduba wuxuu labadooda radius-kooda ku yareeyaa isbarbardhig ahaan si ay u kulmaan. Marka wareeg keliya uu ka dheer yahay tangent-ka, sanduuqu wuxuu sheegayaa in ma jiro wareeg PI kale oo ku habboonaan kara inta uu yahay weyn sidaas. PI oo si toos ah dib ugu jeesta ma qaadan karo wareeg; sanduuqu wuxuu soo jeedinayaa No curve at PI n (Ma jiro wareeg PI n). Badhan kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z wuxuu soo celinayaa radius-yadii hore. Radius-yada la soo jeediyay waxaa lagu wareejiyaa 0.01 hoose si ay had iyo jeer ku habboonaadaan. Radius naqshadeyn oo ugu yar Qor Design minimum radius (tusaale ahaan ka xisaabi xawaaraha naqshadeynta) si wareeg kasta loo hubiyo; ka tag madhan haddii aadan doonayn. Wareeg ka hooseeya ayaa la liisanayaa badhan radius-ka ugu yar ee buuxinaya ugu yarta, marka radius-kaasi ku habboon yahay. Marka aanu ku habboonayn, sanduuqu wuu sheegaa oo wuxuu siinayaa radius-ka ugu weyn ee tangent-yadu oggol yihiin, si aad u ogaato inaad u dhaqaaqdo PI ama aad hoosaysiiso ugu yarta. Dhaqaaq PI-yada qorshaha Marka Select la shido, guji jid-hagaha si aad u doorato. Gacmo-qabasho afar-geesle ah ayaa ka soo muuqata PI-yadiisa. Jiid gacmo-qabashada. Jid-hagaha, stationing-keeda, muuqaalka dherer iyo corridor-ka way raacaan. Sii daa. Dhaqdhaqaaqa waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqon karta. Hadda ma suurtogasho inaad ku darto PI ka dhex jirta laba jira: tirtir jid-hagaha oo mar kale sawir, ama qor isku-xirka cusub ee PI-yada aad haysid. Akhri station iyo offset Mu'ashirka dul mari qorshaha. Bar-xaaladdu wuxuu muujinayaa jid-hagaha ugu dhow (ama kan la doortay) oo leh station-ka iyo offset-ka, L ama R marka la eego station-ka hore, tusaale ahaan \"Alignment 1: Sta 2+15.30, offset 18.42 R\". Dhinac kasta oo ka baxsan dhammaadka, waxay ku darta \"(beyond the end)\" (ka baxsan dhammaadka). Waxa la sawiray Qorshaha, DXF iyo PDF: centerline-ka (tangent-yada sida xariiqyo, wareegyada sida qaansooyin dhab ah), calaamad kasta 50 ft (20 m) oo calaamad dheer leh iyo sumad station ah kasta 100 unit, iyo calaamadaha PC iyo PT oo lagu sumeeyay station-kooda. Tirtir jid-hagaha Dooro oo riix Delete, ama guji Delete qalabka ama hoosta dhinaca midig. Muuqaalkiisa iyo corridor-kiisa way raacaan. Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaya. Kiiboodhka Mac-ka, furaha lagu sheegay delete waa Backspace brawsarka dhexdiisa, oo ma tirtirto wax la doortay. Riix Delete (Fn iyo delete), ama isticmaal badhanka Delete. Xiga Naqshadee muuqaal dherer toosan. Xawaaraha naqshadeynta iyo fasalka Hoosta Sifooyinka jid-hagaha, Design speed (km/h ama mph) iyo Design class waxay la socdaan jid-hagaha, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa mashruuca, waxaana lagu qoraa IFC (Pset_RoadDesignCriteriaCommon). CivilCraft ma leh miis xidhiidhinaysa xawaare iyo radius ugu yar, markaa waxba lagama hubinayo iyaga: deji Minimum radius iyadoo laga raacayo heerkaaga naqshadeynta. Spiraalyo Wareeg wuxuu leeyahay spiraal clothoid ah oo ku yaal labada dhinac: tangent, spiraal, wareeg, spiraal, tangent. Miiska PI, qor dherer ku jira Spiral in iyo Spiral out PI-ga leh radius. PI-gu meeshiisa ayuu ku sii jiraa; wareegga ayaa u soo dhowaada si uu meel u sameeyo, sidaas darteed masaafada tangent-ka ayaa kordhaysa offset-ka spiraalka. Labada dherer way kala duwan yihiin karaan; PI-ga leh hal dherer oo keliya wuxuu helaa spiraal dhinaca keliya. Liiska wareegga markaas wuxuu akhrinayaa TS, SC, CS iyo ST (tangent ilaa spiraal, spiraal ilaa wareeg, wareeg ilaa spiraal, spiraal ilaa tangent) oo leh xagasha spiraalka θs, masaafooyinka tangent-ka iyo masaafada dibadda. Stations-ka waxay socdaan dhinacyada spiraalyada sida meelkasta kale. Spiraalyada oo wadar ahaan leh xagal ka weyn tan wareegga waa la diidaa, iyada oo PI-ga la magacaabo; spiraal ka dheer tangent-ka oo ay u oggolaatay waa isku dhac, sida wareeg kasta. Superelevation wuxuu isticmaalaa spiraalka sida runoff-kiisa (eeg Corridor).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"check-against-ids","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Hubi dhoofinta IFC marka loo eego IDS-ka macmiilka","summary":"Rar faylka .ids ee macmiilka ama hay'adda waddada ku siiyay oo ka arag unsur kasta oo la dhoofiyay oo aan ku dhicin ee Problems.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["ids","information delivery specification","buildingsmart","shuruudaha","gaarsiinta","hubinta","xaqiijinta","qa","dhoofinta ifc","ifc 4.3","jid-hagaha","waddada","iibsiga dadweynaha"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arkaysaa","text":"Waxa aad arkaysaa","level":2},{"id":"waxa-muhiim-ah","text":"Waxa muhiim ah","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samaynaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad samaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIDS (Information Delivery Specification, heer buildingSMART ah) waa liiska waxa IFC ay ka koobnaan karto. Iibsiga dadweynaha badanaa wuxuu kuu soo diraa mid shaqada la socota. CivilCraft wuxuu hubiyaa IFC-ga mashruucan la dhoofinayo, nooca IFC aad dooratay dhoofinta, marka loo eego, wuxuuna liistaa unsur kasta oo ka hooseeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur mashruucaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Export ee qalabka. Dialogka, dooro nooca IFC ee aad gudbin doonto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck against IDS…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoad an .ids file…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylka. Waxba lama soo shubo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri natiijada: qaab kasta oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPass\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFail\u003C/span\u003E iyo inta unsur ay khuseyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur Problems (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift M\"\u003E⌃⇧M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo guji fashil si aad u doorato jid-hagaha, pad-ka, tuubada, qaab-dhismeedka ama mugga dhismaha uu ka soo jeeday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arkaysaa\"\u003EWaxa aad arkaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDigniin kasta oo unsur dhoofin ah iyo shuruud uu ku waayo, oo leh magaca qaabka, waxa IDS-ku weydiiyo iyo waxa dhoofintu leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWarbixinta hubinta (ee Problems) waxay ka bilaabataa IDS-ka: cinwaankiisa, nooca, qoraha iyo tirooyinka qaab kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EWaxa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIDS waa la kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca, sidaas darteed mar kasta oo aad furto mashruuca waa dib loo hubiyaa. Soo rarista ama illoobidda waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqon karta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa dib loo hubiyaa wakhti yar ka dib. Dusha weyn waxay qaadaa waqti dheer inay qoraan, sidaas darteed hubintu wuxuu sugaa wakhti dheer intervals-ka u dhexeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubintu wuxuu isticmaalaa faylka isku mid ah ee badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC\u003C/span\u003E qoro, nooca ugu dambeeyay ee laga doortay halkaas (IFC 4.3 haddii aadan dooran mid).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinka waxaa lagu barbardhigaa unit-yada SI: mashruuc feet ah waa lagu beddelaa mitir marka hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabka IDS-ka waxaa loo akhriyaa sida qiimaha oo dhan. \u003Ccode\u003E^\u003C/code\u003E bilowga iyo \u003Ccode\u003E$\u003C/code\u003E dhamaadka waxaa sidoo kale loo tixgeliyaa inay yihiin &quot;qiimaha oo dhan&quot;, sida inta badan faylalka IDS ay ula jeedaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ifc\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ifc\"\u003EDhoofi IFC\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samaynaysaa IDS (Information Delivery Specification, heer buildingSMART ah) waa liiska waxa IFC ay ka koobnaan karto. Iibsiga dadweynaha badanaa wuxuu kuu soo diraa mid shaqada la socota. CivilCraft wuxuu hubiyaa IFC-ga mashruucan la dhoofinayo, nooca IFC aad dooratay dhoofinta, marka loo eego, wuxuuna liistaa unsur kasta oo ka hooseeya. Tallaabooyinka Fur mashruucaaga. Guji IFC kooxda Export ee qalabka. Dialogka, dooro nooca IFC ee aad gudbin doonto. Guji Check against IDS…. Guji Load an .ids file… oo dooro faylka. Waxba lama soo shubo. Akhri natiijada: qaab kasta oo leh Pass ama Fail iyo inta unsur ay khuseyso. Fur Problems (Ctrl+Shift+M) oo guji fashil si aad u doorato jid-hagaha, pad-ka, tuubada, qaab-dhismeedka ama mugga dhismaha uu ka soo jeeday. Waxa aad arkaysaa Digniin kasta oo unsur dhoofin ah iyo shuruud uu ku waayo, oo leh magaca qaabka, waxa IDS-ku weydiiyo iyo waxa dhoofintu leedahay. Warbixinta hubinta (ee Problems) waxay ka bilaabataa IDS-ka: cinwaankiisa, nooca, qoraha iyo tirooyinka qaab kasta. Waxa muhiim ah IDS waa la kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca, sidaas darteed mar kasta oo aad furto mashruuca waa dib loo hubiyaa. Soo rarista ama illoobidda waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqon karta. Isbeddel kasta waa dib loo hubiyaa wakhti yar ka dib. Dusha weyn waxay qaadaa waqti dheer inay qoraan, sidaas darteed hubintu wuxuu sugaa wakhti dheer intervals-ka u dhexeeya. Hubintu wuxuu isticmaalaa faylka isku mid ah ee badhanka IFC qoro, nooca ugu dambeeyay ee laga doortay halkaas (IFC 4.3 haddii aadan dooran mid). Tirooyinka waxaa lagu barbardhigaa unit-yada SI: mashruuc feet ah waa lagu beddelaa mitir marka hore. Qaabka IDS-ka waxaa loo akhriyaa sida qiimaha oo dhan. ^ bilowga iyo $ dhamaadka waxaa sidoo kale loo tixgeliyaa inay yihiin \"qiimaha oo dhan\", sida inta badan faylalka IDS ay ula jeedaan. Xiga Dhoofi IFC","lang":"so"},{"slug":"house-platforms","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Madallada guriga dhulka janjeeran","summary":"Madal guri ku samee buur janjeeran: derbiyada taageeraya sida cidhifyada padka, khariidadda jarista iyo buuxinta oo midabka iyo qiyaasta, qayb xor ah oo lagu sawiro meel kasta dhulka iyo naqshadda, iyo jidad ama padyo janjeeran oo waddooyinka gaadiidka loogu talagalay.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["madal","padka guriga","dhul janjeeran","buur","derbi taageeraya","jarista iyo buuxinta","khariidadda jarista","heerarka meel-gaar","qayb xor ah","xariiqda qaybta","sawirada golaha","waddo gaadiid","jid","padka janjeeran","simayn","tiro isbeddel","shaqada dhulka"],"headings":[{"id":"derbiyada-taageeraya-sida-cidhifyada-padka","text":"Derbiyada taageeraya sida cidhifyada padka","level":2},{"id":"khariidadda-jarista-iyo-buuxinta","text":"Khariidadda jarista iyo buuxinta","level":2},{"id":"qayb-xor-ah","text":"Qayb xor ah","level":2},{"id":"jidad-iyo-padyo-janjeeran","text":"Jidad iyo padyo janjeeran","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMadal guri waa \u003Cstrong\u003Epad\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadeyn\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPadka\u003C/span\u003E): koronto fidsan oo heer hal ah, oo lagu simay dhulka. Afar shay ayaa ka caawiya buur janjeeran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"derbiyada-taageeraya-sida-cidhifyada-padka\"\u003EDerbiyada taageeraya sida cidhifyada padka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro padka oo deji dhinac ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosan (derbi taageeraya)\u003C/span\u003E halkii janjeer (\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinacyada iyo derbiyada taageeraya\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosan: derbiyada taageeraya\u003C/span\u003E dhinac kasta hal mar). Joogta derbiga waxaa laga akhriyaa dhulka dhinacdiisa: sare ee dhulka, hoose ee padka, waxaana lagu muujiyaa dhamaadyada labadaba iyo meeshiisa ugu sarreysa qorshaha, oo digniin ayaa loo siiyaa marka uu ka sarreeyo xadka aad dejisay. Derbiyada iyo janjeeraha way isku dhex jiri karaan dhinac-dhinaca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khariidadda-jarista-iyo-buuxinta\"\u003EKhariidadda jarista iyo buuxinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhariidadda jarista iyo buuxinta\u003C/span\u003E hoostiisa \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji\u003C/strong\u003E. Qorshaha waxaa lagu midabeeyaa sida jarista ama buuxintu u qoto dheer tahay, tallaabooyin siman oo leh calaamad (jarista kulul, buuxinta buluug, heer ku dhow oo cadcad), iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eheerarka meel-gaar\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu daabacaa padka: isbeddelka heerka barta shabakad kasta, iyo jarista ugu qotodheer iyo buuxinta ugu sarreysa oo lagu calaamadeeyay ▲. Unugyada waa kuwii uu isticmaalo mugaha shaqada dhulka, sidaas darteed khariidadda iyo tirooyinku mar walba way isku raacaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka 3D, ka dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EJarista iyo buuxinta\u003C/strong\u003E liiska midabka si aad midabyadaas isugu ridid dhulka iyo naqshadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECinjirka kordhinta ama yaraynta waxaa ku jira qalabka qaadista culeyska (\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadeyn\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaadista culeyska\u003C/span\u003E); ma codsato mugaha padka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qayb-xor-ah\"\u003EQayb xor ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQayb xor ah\u003C/span\u003E, riix barta xariiqda qaybta meel kasta (waxay foororsan kartaa) oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Wada-hadal ayaa sawirta qaybta: dhulka jira, naqshadda simaysan (dhib-dhib) iyo jarista iyo buuxinta intooda u dhexeeya, oo midab la siiyay, iyo aagagooda (naqshaddu waxay tirisaa kaliya gudaha padyada iyo waddooyinka). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeynaynta toosan\u003C/span\u003E waxaa caadiyaan lagu habeeyaa sawirta; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu kaydi SVG ahaan\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida CSV\u003C/span\u003E waxay kugu siiyaan sawir guddiga golaha iyo tirooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidad-iyo-padyo-janjeeran\"\u003EJidad iyo padyo janjeeran\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJid ama balaadh janjeeran\u003C/span\u003E, riix dhamaadka hoose ka dibna dhamaadka sare, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, oo bixi ballaadha, heerka dhamaadka hoose iyo janjeerka. Padku waa xariiq geesihiisu ku jiraan heerarkaas (cidhifka u dhexeeya laba geesood wuxuu ku socdaa janjeer joogto ah), wuxuuna u simaysan yahay dhulka sida padka kasta. Geesaha padka kasta ayaa sidoo kale heerar gaar ah sidaas u qaadan kara, sidaas darteed waddo gaadiid, jid janjeeran ama teras janjeeran waa pad oo heer leh geesta kasta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Madal guri waa pad (Naqshadeyn › Padka): koronto fidsan oo heer hal ah, oo lagu simay dhulka. Afar shay ayaa ka caawiya buur janjeeran. Derbiyada taageeraya sida cidhifyada padka Dooro padka oo deji dhinac ah Toosan (derbi taageeraya) halkii janjeer (Sifooyinka › Dhinacyada iyo derbiyada taageeraya, ama Toosan: derbiyada taageeraya dhinac kasta hal mar). Joogta derbiga waxaa laga akhriyaa dhulka dhinacdiisa: sare ee dhulka, hoose ee padka, waxaana lagu muujiyaa dhamaadyada labadaba iyo meeshiisa ugu sarreysa qorshaha, oo digniin ayaa loo siiyaa marka uu ka sarreeyo xadka aad dejisay. Derbiyada iyo janjeeraha way isku dhex jiri karaan dhinac-dhinaca. Khariidadda jarista iyo buuxinta Calaamadee Khariidadda jarista iyo buuxinta hoostiisa Muuji. Qorshaha waxaa lagu midabeeyaa sida jarista ama buuxintu u qoto dheer tahay, tallaabooyin siman oo leh calaamad (jarista kulul, buuxinta buluug, heer ku dhow oo cadcad), iyo heerarka meel-gaar waxaa lagu daabacaa padka: isbeddelka heerka barta shabakad kasta, iyo jarista ugu qotodheer iyo buuxinta ugu sarreysa oo lagu calaamadeeyay ▲. Unugyada waa kuwii uu isticmaalo mugaha shaqada dhulka, sidaas darteed khariidadda iyo tirooyinku mar walba way isku raacaan. Muuqaalka 3D, ka dooro Jarista iyo buuxinta liiska midabka si aad midabyadaas isugu ridid dhulka iyo naqshadda. Cinjirka kordhinta ama yaraynta waxaa ku jira qalabka qaadista culeyska (Naqshadeyn › Qaadista culeyska); ma codsato mugaha padka. Qayb xor ah Hoosta Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah, dooro Qayb xor ah, riix barta xariiqda qaybta meel kasta (waxay foororsan kartaa) oo riix Enter. Wada-hadal ayaa sawirta qaybta: dhulka jira, naqshadda simaysan (dhib-dhib) iyo jarista iyo buuxinta intooda u dhexeeya, oo midab la siiyay, iyo aagagooda (naqshaddu waxay tirisaa kaliya gudaha padyada iyo waddooyinka). Weynaynta toosan waxaa caadiyaan lagu habeeyaa sawirta; Ku kaydi SVG ahaan iyo Kaydi sida CSV waxay kugu siiyaan sawir guddiga golaha iyo tirooyinka. Jidad iyo padyo janjeeran Hoosta Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah, dooro Jid ama balaadh janjeeran, riix dhamaadka hoose ka dibna dhamaadka sare, riix Enter, oo bixi ballaadha, heerka dhamaadka hoose iyo janjeerka. Padku waa xariiq geesihiisu ku jiraan heerarkaas (cidhifka u dhexeeya laba geesood wuxuu ku socdaa janjeer joogto ah), wuxuuna u simaysan yahay dhulka sida padka kasta. Geesaha padka kasta ayaa sidoo kale heerar gaar ah sidaas u qaadan kara, sidaas darteed waddo gaadiid, jid janjeeran ama teras janjeeran waa pad oo heer leh geesta kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"profile","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Naqshadee muuqaalka dherer","summary":"Fur muuqaalka dherer, bilow muuqaal naqshadeed oo laga bilaabo dhulka, ku dar oo jiid PVI-yada, dejii dhererka wareegyada toosan, oo akhri heerarka, qiimayaasha K iyo meelaha sare iyo hoose.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["muuqaal dherer","khadka toosan","pvi","wareeg toosan","heer","qiimaha K","sare","hoose","bvc","evc","muuqaalka dherer","heerka dhamaadka","muuqaalka dhulka jira","xariiqyada muhiimka ah ee muuqaalka","isgoysyada","dhinac u jira","kerbi","mari","calaamado"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-muuqaalka-dherer","text":"Fur muuqaalka dherer","level":2},{"id":"weynee-oo-wareeji-muuqaalka-dherer","text":"Weynee oo wareeji muuqaalka dherer","level":2},{"id":"bilow-muuqaalka-naqshadda","text":"Bilow muuqaalka naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-pvi-yo","text":"Ku dar PVI-yo","level":2},{"id":"qabo-markaad-ku-darayso-ama-jiidayso","text":"Qabo markaad ku darayso ama jiidayso","level":2},{"id":"hagaaji-pvi-yada","text":"Hagaaji PVI-yada","level":2},{"id":"wareegyada-toosan","text":"Wareegyada toosan","level":2},{"id":"akhri-xaqiiqada","text":"Akhri xaqiiqada","level":2},{"id":"xariiqyada-muhiimka-ah-muuqaalka-dherer","text":"Xariiqyada muhiimka ah muuqaalka dherer","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKhadka waddo kasta wuxuu leeyahay hal muuqaal dherer naqshadeed: liis PVI-yo (isteeshan iyo sare-mar) oo isku xidhan heerar toosan, iyo wareeg toosan oo parabolic simanta ah oo ku yaal PVI dhex-ah kasta oo dhererka leh. Muuqaalka dhulka jira waa la soo qaadaa dusha adiga oo aan wax qabanayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-muuqaalka-dherer\"\u003EFur muuqaalka dherer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro khadka waddada (guji adoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal dherer\u003C/span\u003E qalabka dusha, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur muuqaalka dherer\u003C/span\u003E hoosta garabka midig. Muuqaalka dherer wuxuu ka furmaa hoosta qorshaha iyadoo dhulka jira uu khadka waddada ku jiro. Haddii khadad laba ama ka badan jiraan, dooro mid liiska bidix ee xariiqda muuqaalka dherer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalku wuxuu bilaabaa isagoo tusaya khadka waddada oo dhan oo sare-marka uu ku fidsanayo si uu u buuxiyo garoonka; weynaynta waxa lagu qoraa geeska bidix hoose, tusaale ahaan &quot;Weynaynta toosan 10×&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weynee-oo-wareeji-muuqaalka-dherer\"\u003EWeynee oo wareeji muuqaalka dherer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynee:\u003C/strong\u003E wareeg giraanta mouse-ka (ama ku qabo trackpad-ka) oo muuqaalku wuxuu weynaadaa meesha calaamaddu tahay. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad isteeshannada oo keliya u weyneyso, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sare-marka oo keliya u weyneyso (taas waxay beddeshaa weynaynta). Marka muuqaalka dherer uu xoogga hayo, furayaasha ku-dar iyo ka-yaree dhexda ayay weynaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWareeji:\u003C/strong\u003E jiid badhanka midig ama dhexe ee mouse-ka, ama mari laba farood trackpad-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu habee:\u003C/strong\u003E laba jeer guji muuqaalka ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad mar kale khadka oo dhan u tuso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax-beddelka PVI wuxuu ilaaliyaa weynaynta aad dooratay; ma dib u noqdo ku habaynta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFiiri jeexjeexa muuqaalka: xariiqdu waxay tusaysaa isteeshanka, sare-marka dhulka iyo naqshadda, heerka iyo jarista ama buuxinta meeshaas, iyo dhibic raacda khadka waddada qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow-muuqaalka-naqshadda\"\u003EBilow muuqaalka naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGarabka midig hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bilow dhulka\u003C/span\u003E. Laba PVI ayaa lagu dhigaa dhulka labada dhamaad ee khadka waddada, oo isku xidhan heer toosan. Status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Muuqaalka naqshadda wuxuu bilaabmay dhulka labada dhamaad. Shid Ku dar PVI-yo oo guji si aad u darto jebinta heerka; siiyo dhererka wareegga miiska.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii khadka waddada aanu dusha gudbin, waxaad heleysaa &quot;Khadkan ma lahan dhul hoosta uu ka bilaabmo.&quot; Markaas ku dar PVI-yo guji halkii (qaybta xigta).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-pvi-yo\"\u003EKu dar PVI-yo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar PVI-yo\u003C/span\u003E xariiqda muuqaalka dherer. Waa la riixi hayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji muuqaalka dherer meesha aad rabto jebinta heerka. PVI waxa lagu daraa isteeshankaas iyo sare-marka, oo lagu wareejiyay 0.01, oo la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar inta aad u baahan tahay, kadibna mar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso ku darista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji meel horay PVI u jirtay waa la diidaa (&quot;Horay PVI ayaa ku jira …&quot;). PVI-yadu weligood waxay ku jiraan amarka isteeshanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qabo-markaad-ku-darayso-ama-jiidayso\"\u003EQabo markaad ku darayso ama jiidayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cstrong\u003EQabo\u003C/strong\u003E xariiqda muuqaalka dherer ayaa bilowga ah shid. Intuu shidan yahay, PVI aad ku darto ama jiidto wuxuu ku dhacaa PVI-ga ugu dhow, barta dhulka, isteeshanka PVI-ga ama khadka dhulka, calaamad ku dhow calaamadda ayaa sheegta kee. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E barta xor ah, meel kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hagaaji-pvi-yada\"\u003EHagaaji PVI-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid\u003C/strong\u003E PVI muuqaalka dherer si aad u dhaqaaqdo. Ma gudbi karo deriskiisa. Dhaqdhaqaaqu waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu qor\u003C/strong\u003E qiyamka saxda ah miiska PVI garabka midig: \u003Cstrong\u003EIsteeshan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESare-mar\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJeexjeex %\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg L\u003C/strong\u003E (dhererka wareegga toosan). Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kasta ka dib.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E qiime muuqaalka dherer: badhanka yar ee ku dhow isteeshanka ama sare-marka PVI wuxuu sugaa hal guji muuqaalka dherer oo qiimahaas buuxiya. Gujintu waxay qabsataa sida Ku dar PVI-yo; riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E barta xor ah; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa joojiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJeexjeex %\u003C/strong\u003E waa heerka tangent-ka oo ka bilaabma PVI-kaas oo ku dhamaada kii xiga. Ku qorista waxay dhaqaajinaysaa sare-marka PVI-ga \u003Cstrong\u003Exiga\u003C/strong\u003E (isteeshankiisu ma dhaqaajiso). Haddii PVI-ga xiga la xidhay, sare-marka PVI-ga hore ayaa dhaqaaqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidh\u003C/strong\u003E PVI furaha qufulka ee ku dhamaada safkiisa. PVI la xidhay lama jiido, wax-beddelka jeexjeexuna ma dhaqaajiyo. Haddii labada dhamaad ee tangent-ka la xidhay, jeexjeexkiisa ma beddelan karo: status bar-ka ayaa sheega, markaas marka hore hal dhamaad fur. Xidhka waa la kaydiyaa faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar\u003C/strong\u003E PVI calaamadda x ee ku dhamaada safkiisa, ama dooro (guji) kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Marka muuqaalka dherer uu xoogga hayo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sidoo kale wuu ka saaraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPVI-ga ugu horreeya iyo kan ugu dambeeya weligood wareeg ma qaadan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wareegyada-toosan\"\u003EWareegyada toosan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor dherer \u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg L\u003C/strong\u003E PVI dhexe, tusaale ahaan 200.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareegga waxa lagu sawiraa dhexdhexaadka PVI-ga. Muuqaalka iyo garabka midig waxay tusaan nooceeda (sare ama hoose), L iyo K, isteeshannada BVC iyo EVC iyo sare-markooda, iyo barta sare ama hoose haddii ay wareegga gudihiisa ku jirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EK waxa laga xisaabiyaa L (K = L oo loo qaybiyo farqiga aljebra ee heerarka, boqolkiiba). Adigu L ku qortaa; K si toos ah ku qorista weli ma diyaar aha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii wareeg toosan ku habboon, sanduuq casaan ah ayaa sababta sheega: wuxuu gudbaa PVI ama wareeg ka hor, ama ka dhaafa PVI xiga, iyo inta meel ku jirta dhinaca (wareeg wuxuu u baahan yahay badhka dhererkiisa dhinac kasta PVI-ga). Badhankiisu wuxuu dejiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ewareega ugu dheer ee ku habboon\u003C/strong\u003E, oo K-kiisa, hal tallaabo ahaan (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa celisa). Ama PVI-yada u fogee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-xaqiiqada\"\u003EAkhri xaqiiqada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta miiska PVI, liis wuxuu siinayaa heer kasta boqolkiiba (&quot;Heerka 1: +1.25%&quot;) iyo wareeg kasta, tusaale ahaan &quot;Sare ee 2+00.00: L 200.00, K 85.3, BVC 1+00.00 (253.10), EVC 3+00.00 (252.40)&quot;, kadibna &quot;Barta sare 1+62.40, 254.12&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii PVI-yadu labada dhamaad ee khadka waddada gaarin, qoraal ayaa sheega. Kooridor waxa la dhisaa kaliya meesha muuqaalka iyo khadku is-dul marayaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xariiqyada-muhiimka-ah-muuqaalka-dherer\"\u003EXariiqyada muhiimka ah muuqaalka dherer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqyada muhiimka ah sidoo kale muuqaalka dherer ayay ku muuqdaan, si aad u aragto kerbi, xagaal ama sare-darbiga marka loo barbardhigo muuqaalka waddada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha xariiqa muhiimka ah \u003Cstrong\u003Eisgoysto\u003C/strong\u003E khadka waddada, muuqaalku wuxuu tusaa dhibic yar isteeshanka iyo sare-marka, oo calaamad ah magaca xariiqda iyo sare-marka meeshaas (sare-marka xariiqda, oo laga xisaabiyey qaybta isgoysata).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor masaafo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinaca oo gudaha\u003C/span\u003E si aad u sawirto xariiqyada muhiimka ah ee \u003Cstrong\u003Eku socda dhinaca\u003C/strong\u003E khadka waddada masaafadaas gudaheeda, sida khadad jajaban oo sare-marka ay leeyihiin. Madhan ama 0 waxa uu tusaa isgoysyada oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha iyo calaamadaha raacaan wax-beddel kasta: dhaqaaji geed, ku qor heer ama kor u qaad xariiqda, muuqaaluna wuxuu isla markiiba tusaa sare-marka cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dhibicda isgoysta si aad xariiqdaas u doorato; xariiqda la doortay waxa lagu sawiraa midabka iftiinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiqyada muhiimka ah\u003C/span\u003E xariiqda muuqaalka dherer ayaa dhammaantood qarisa ama tusa. Labada dejin mashruuca ayaa lagu kaydiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/feature-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/feature-lines\"\u003EXariiqyada muhiimka ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor\"\u003EWareeji kooridor waddo\u003C/a\u003E khadka waddada iyo muuqaalkan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka dherer waxa lagu qoraa LandXML oo khadka waddada la socda; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landxml\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landxml\"\u003EIsweydaarsiga LandXML\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Khadka waddo kasta wuxuu leeyahay hal muuqaal dherer naqshadeed: liis PVI-yo (isteeshan iyo sare-mar) oo isku xidhan heerar toosan, iyo wareeg toosan oo parabolic simanta ah oo ku yaal PVI dhex-ah kasta oo dhererka leh. Muuqaalka dhulka jira waa la soo qaadaa dusha adiga oo aan wax qabanayn. Fur muuqaalka dherer Dooro khadka waddada (guji adoo isticmaalaya Dooro). Riix R, ama guji Muuqaal dherer qalabka dusha, ama Fur muuqaalka dherer hoosta garabka midig. Muuqaalka dherer wuxuu ka furmaa hoosta qorshaha iyadoo dhulka jira uu khadka waddada ku jiro. Haddii khadad laba ama ka badan jiraan, dooro mid liiska bidix ee xariiqda muuqaalka dherer. Muuqaalku wuxuu bilaabaa isagoo tusaya khadka waddada oo dhan oo sare-marka uu ku fidsanayo si uu u buuxiyo garoonka; weynaynta waxa lagu qoraa geeska bidix hoose, tusaale ahaan \"Weynaynta toosan 10×\". Weynee oo wareeji muuqaalka dherer Weynee: wareeg giraanta mouse-ka (ama ku qabo trackpad-ka) oo muuqaalku wuxuu weynaadaa meesha calaamaddu tahay. Hay Shift si aad isteeshannada oo keliya u weyneyso, ama Alt si aad sare-marka oo keliya u weyneyso (taas waxay beddeshaa weynaynta). Marka muuqaalka dherer uu xoogga hayo, furayaasha ku-dar iyo ka-yaree dhexda ayay weynaadaan. Wareeji: jiid badhanka midig ama dhexe ee mouse-ka, ama mari laba farood trackpad-ka. Ku habee: laba jeer guji muuqaalka ama riix F si aad mar kale khadka oo dhan u tuso. Wax-beddelka PVI wuxuu ilaaliyaa weynaynta aad dooratay; ma dib u noqdo ku habaynta. Fiiri jeexjeexa muuqaalka: xariiqdu waxay tusaysaa isteeshanka, sare-marka dhulka iyo naqshadda, heerka iyo jarista ama buuxinta meeshaas, iyo dhibic raacda khadka waddada qorshaha. Bilow muuqaalka naqshadda Garabka midig hoosta Muuqaalka naqshadda, guji Ka bilow dhulka. Laba PVI ayaa lagu dhigaa dhulka labada dhamaad ee khadka waddada, oo isku xidhan heer toosan. Status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay \"Muuqaalka naqshadda wuxuu bilaabmay dhulka labada dhamaad. Shid Ku dar PVI-yo oo guji si aad u darto jebinta heerka; siiyo dhererka wareegga miiska.\" Haddii khadka waddada aanu dusha gudbin, waxaad heleysaa \"Khadkan ma lahan dhul hoosta uu ka bilaabmo.\" Markaas ku dar PVI-yo guji halkii (qaybta xigta). Ku dar PVI-yo Riix I, ama guji Ku dar PVI-yo xariiqda muuqaalka dherer. Waa la riixi hayaa. Guji muuqaalka dherer meesha aad rabto jebinta heerka. PVI waxa lagu daraa isteeshankaas iyo sare-marka, oo lagu wareejiyay 0.01, oo la doortay. Ku dar inta aad u baahan tahay, kadibna mar kale riix I si aad u joojiso ku darista. Guji meel horay PVI u jirtay waa la diidaa (\"Horay PVI ayaa ku jira …\"). PVI-yadu weligood waxay ku jiraan amarka isteeshanka. Qabo markaad ku darayso ama jiidayso Badhanka Qabo xariiqda muuqaalka dherer ayaa bilowga ah shid. Intuu shidan yahay, PVI aad ku darto ama jiidto wuxuu ku dhacaa PVI-ga ugu dhow, barta dhulka, isteeshanka PVI-ga ama khadka dhulka, calaamad ku dhow calaamadda ayaa sheegta kee. Riix Alt barta xor ah, meel kasta. Hagaaji PVI-yada Jiid PVI muuqaalka dherer si aad u dhaqaaqdo. Ma gudbi karo deriskiisa. Dhaqdhaqaaqu waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Ku qor qiyamka saxda ah miiska PVI garabka midig: Isteeshan, Sare-mar, Jeexjeex % iyo Wareeg L (dhererka wareegga toosan). Riix Enter kasta ka dib. Dooro qiime muuqaalka dherer: badhanka yar ee ku dhow isteeshanka ama sare-marka PVI wuxuu sugaa hal guji muuqaalka dherer oo qiimahaas buuxiya. Gujintu waxay qabsataa sida Ku dar PVI-yo; riix Alt barta xor ah; Esc waa joojiyaa. Jeexjeex % waa heerka tangent-ka oo ka bilaabma PVI-kaas oo ku dhamaada kii xiga. Ku qorista waxay dhaqaajinaysaa sare-marka PVI-ga xiga (isteeshankiisu ma dhaqaajiso). Haddii PVI-ga xiga la xidhay, sare-marka PVI-ga hore ayaa dhaqaaqa. Xidh PVI furaha qufulka ee ku dhamaada safkiisa. PVI la xidhay lama jiido, wax-beddelka jeexjeexuna ma dhaqaajiyo. Haddii labada dhamaad ee tangent-ka la xidhay, jeexjeexkiisa ma beddelan karo: status bar-ka ayaa sheega, markaas marka hore hal dhamaad fur. Xidhka waa la kaydiyaa faylka. Ka saar PVI calaamadda x ee ku dhamaada safkiisa, ama dooro (guji) kadibna riix Delete. Marka muuqaalka dherer uu xoogga hayo, Backspace sidoo kale wuu ka saaraa. PVI-ga ugu horreeya iyo kan ugu dambeeya weligood wareeg ma qaadan. Wareegyada toosan Ku qor dherer Wareeg L PVI dhexe, tusaale ahaan 200. Wareegga waxa lagu sawiraa dhexdhexaadka PVI-ga. Muuqaalka iyo garabka midig waxay tusaan nooceeda (sare ama hoose), L iyo K, isteeshannada BVC iyo EVC iyo sare-markooda, iyo barta sare ama hoose haddii ay wareegga gudihiisa ku jirto. K waxa laga xisaabiyaa L (K = L oo loo qaybiyo farqiga aljebra ee heerarka, boqolkiiba). Adigu L ku qortaa; K si toos ah ku qorista weli ma diyaar aha. Haddii wareeg toosan ku habboon, sanduuq casaan ah ayaa sababta sheega: wuxuu gudbaa PVI ama wareeg ka hor, ama ka dhaafa PVI xiga, iyo inta meel ku jirta dhinaca (wareeg wuxuu u baahan yahay badhka dhererkiisa dhinac kasta PVI-ga). Badhankiisu wuxuu dejiyaa wareega ugu dheer ee ku habboon, oo K-kiisa, hal tallaabo ahaan (Ctrl+Z ayaa celisa). Ama PVI-yada u fogee. Akhri xaqiiqada Hoosta miiska PVI, liis wuxuu siinayaa heer kasta boqolkiiba (\"Heerka 1: +1.25%\") iyo wareeg kasta, tusaale ahaan \"Sare ee 2+00.00: L 200.00, K 85.3, BVC 1+00.00 (253.10), EVC 3+00.00 (252.40)\", kadibna \"Barta sare 1+62.40, 254.12\". Haddii PVI-yadu labada dhamaad ee khadka waddada gaarin, qoraal ayaa sheega. Kooridor waxa la dhisaa kaliya meesha muuqaalka iyo khadku is-dul marayaan. Xariiqyada muhiimka ah muuqaalka dherer Xariiqyada muhiimka ah sidoo kale muuqaalka dherer ayay ku muuqdaan, si aad u aragto kerbi, xagaal ama sare-darbiga marka loo barbardhigo muuqaalka waddada. Meesha xariiqa muhiimka ah isgoysto khadka waddada, muuqaalku wuxuu tusaa dhibic yar isteeshanka iyo sare-marka, oo calaamad ah magaca xariiqda iyo sare-marka meeshaas (sare-marka xariiqda, oo laga xisaabiyey qaybta isgoysata). Ku qor masaafo Dhinaca oo gudaha si aad u sawirto xariiqyada muhiimka ah ee ku socda dhinaca khadka waddada masaafadaas gudaheeda, sida khadad jajaban oo sare-marka ay leeyihiin. Madhan ama 0 waxa uu tusaa isgoysyada oo keliya. Calaamadaha iyo calaamadaha raacaan wax-beddel kasta: dhaqaaji geed, ku qor heer ama kor u qaad xariiqda, muuqaaluna wuxuu isla markiiba tusaa sare-marka cusub. Guji dhibicda isgoysta si aad xariiqdaas u doorato; xariiqda la doortay waxa lagu sawiraa midabka iftiinka. Xariiqyada muhiimka ah xariiqda muuqaalka dherer ayaa dhammaantood qarisa ama tusa. Labada dejin mashruuca ayaa lagu kaydiyaa. Eeg Xariiqyada muhiimka ah. Xiga Wareeji kooridor waddo khadka waddada iyo muuqaalkan. Muuqaalka dherer waxa lagu qoraa LandXML oo khadka waddada la socda; eeg Isweydaarsiga LandXML.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sections","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xariiqyada muunadda iyo qaybaha","summary":"Goyo qaybaha xagga khadka waddada, arag dhulka, naqshadda iyo jarista iyo buuxinta isteeshan kasta, oo hel mugyada iyada oo la isticmaalayo celceliska aagga dhamaadka.","section":"tasks","order":55,"keywords":["gaadiidka mass","jaantuska mass","barta isku-dheelitirka","yaraan","kor-u-kac","masaafada gaadiidka","amaah","qashin","xaashiyada qaybaha","xaashiyada qaybaha pdf","qaybaha","qaybaha dhexdhexaadka","xariiqyada muunadda","muuqaalka qaybta","jarista","buuxinta","aagga","celceliska aagga dhamaadka","mugyada aagga dhamaadka","shaqada dhulka","isteeshan","ka-saar","csv"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-xariiqyada-muunadda","text":"Ku dar xariiqyada muunadda","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-qaybta","text":"Muuqaalka qaybta","level":2},{"id":"qiyaas-qayb-gudaheeda","text":"Qiyaas qayb gudaheeda","level":2},{"id":"xaashiyada-qaybaha","text":"Xaashiyada qaybaha","level":2},{"id":"jarista-iyo-buuxinta-waxa-lagu-cabbiraa","text":"Jarista iyo buuxinta waxa lagu cabbiraa","level":2},{"id":"mugyada-celceliska-aagga-dhamaadka","text":"Mugyada celceliska aagga dhamaadka","level":2},{"id":"gaadiidka-mass","text":"Gaadiidka mass","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQayb dhexdhexaad waxay tusaysaa waddada sida loo dhisi doono: xagga khadka waddada isteeshan hal, dhulka jira, naqshadda (kooridorka ama padka la jeexjeexay) iyo jarista iyo buuxinta u dhexeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-xariiqyada-muunadda\"\u003EKu dar xariiqyada muunadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro khad waddo. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyada muunadda\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar xariiqyada muunadda\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejii \u003Cstrong\u003EQayb kasta\u003C/strong\u003E (masaafada: 50 ft ama 20 m bilowga), \u003Cstrong\u003EBallaca bidix\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBallaca midig\u003C/strong\u003E (inta uu qayb kastaa ka gaadho dhexdhexaadka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad qayb u gooyo isteeshan gaar ah, ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar isteeshan\u003C/strong\u003E (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E2+35\u003C/code\u003E) oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha waa la jaraa masaafo kasta oo tiro dhammeystiran, labada dhamaad ee khadka waddada, bilowga iyo dhamaadka wareeg kasta (PC iyo PT), iyo isteeshannada aad ku darto. Xariiqyada muunadda qorshaha waxay ku muuqdaan khadad cawl oo khadka waddada xagga; waxay sidoo kale u baxaan DXF, DWG iyo PDF lakabka C-ROAD-SCTN. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa celisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-qaybta\"\u003EMuuqaalka qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka qaybta\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E khadka waddada, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Waxay meesha ka qaadaa muuqaalka dherer ee qorshaha hoosteeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii gudub qaybaha fallaadhaha xariiqdiisa, liiska isteeshannada, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka muuqaalka qaybta uu xoogga hayo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kan ugu horreeya iyo kan ugu dambeeya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadka cawl waa dhulka jira, khadka casaanka ah waa naqshadda. Jarista waxa lagu hoosaysiiyaa midab liin, buuxinta midab cagaar. Barooyinka kooridorka waa la calaamadiyay: CL (dhexdhexaadka), EOP (cidlada dusha waddada), SH (garabka) iyo DL (iftiinka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMadaxa wuxuu siinayaa isteeshanka, aagga jarista iyo buuxinta qaybtan iyo weynaynta toosan. \u003Cstrong\u003EKu habee\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa garoonka; dooro 1× si aad u aragto qaybta cabbirka run ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadka qaro weyn ee qorshaha ayaa tusaa qaybta shaashadda ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynee iyo wareeji:\u003C/strong\u003E giraanta ayaa weynaysa meesha calaamaddu tahay, jiidista ayaa dhaqaajisa muuqaalka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama laba jeer guji) ayaa mar kale qaybta oo dhan ku habeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaas-qayb-gudaheeda\"\u003EQiyaas qayb gudaheeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E xariiqda qaybta, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Talo-siiyaha wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Guji barta kowaad, kadibna labaad.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji laba barood. Mid walba wuxuu qabsadaa dhamaadka khad ama barta kooridorka (CL, EOP, SH, DL); riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E barta xor ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhriska wuxuu siinayaa masaafada toosan (ΔH), masaafada toosan ee sare-marka (ΔV), jeexjeexa boqolkiiba iyo nisbadeeda, iyo dhererka toosan, unugyada mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMar kale guji si aad u bilowdo qiyaas cusub. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa nadiifiyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxa uu damiyaa qiyaaska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashiyada-qaybaha\"\u003EXaashiyada qaybaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada qaybaha (PDF)\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyada muunadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhigaa qayb kasta bogagga PDF, safaf ahaan bidix ilaa midig iyo sare ilaa hoose tartanka isteeshannada. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWarqadda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaanka qorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E (miisaanka toosan ee qaybaha) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta muuqaalka dherer\u003C/strong\u003E (1×, 2×, 5× ama 10×); wadahadalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta qaybood ee bog kasta ku habboon iyo inta bog ay tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb kasta waxa uu tusaa shabakad leh ka-saarka iyo sare-marka, dhulka (jajaban), naqshadda, jarista iyo buuxinta oo midab la siiyay (liin iyo cagaar), barooyinka kooridorka, iyo hoosteeda isteeshankeeda iyo aagga jarista iyo buuxinta. Qaybaha xaashiyada oo dhan waxa la sawiraa cabbir isku mid ah, dherer u filan kan ugu weyn; haddii aysan bogga ku habboon weynaynteena, CivilCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa kan ugu weyn ee ku habboon oo waa sheegaa. Xariga cinwaanka wuxuu magacaabaa khadka waddada, isteeshannada bogga, miisaannada, iyo &quot;Xaashi 1 ee 3&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jarista-iyo-buuxinta-waxa-lagu-cabbiraa\"\u003EJarista iyo buuxinta waxa lagu cabbiraa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooridor waxa uu lahaan karaa lakabyo hoosta dusha waddada: lakabyada dusha, qaybaha qaababka, jidka. \u003Cstrong\u003EMugyada lagu cabbiro\u003C/strong\u003E oo doorashada qaybta bar-ka ayaa dooranaysa ilaa halka jarista iyo buuxinta ay gaarayaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha hoose\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga): ilaa hoosta qaybahaas, si jarista u ka mid ahaato qoto dhismaha dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha sare\u003C/strong\u003E: ilaa sare-ka naqshadda oo keliya, sida hore markii qaybaha la tirinayay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAagga madaxa, mugyada hoose, CSV iyo gaadiidka mass dhammaantood waxay raacaan doorashadan, waana la kaydiyaa mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mugyada-celceliska-aagga-dhamaadka\"\u003EMugyada celceliska aagga dhamaadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabada qayb ee deriska ah dhexdooda, mugga waa celceliska labada aagood oo ay ku dhufato masaafada u dhexeysa isteeshannadooda. Bar-ku wuxuu tusaa wadarta khadka waddada, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E waxa uu soo dejiyaa aagga iyo mugyada qayb kasta oo wadarta socota (cubic yards mashruucyada feet, cubic meters kuwa metric).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tusaa wadarta isla markaana mugyada habka shabakadda ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EMugyada shaqada dhulka\u003C/a\u003E. Labadaba qiyaas kala duwan ayay yihiin: qaybaha is-dhow ayay isu dhowaadaan, waddo toosan dhul fidsan dushiisa waa isku mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJarista iyo buuxinta waxa la tiraa kaliya aagagga la jeexjeexay gudahooda (khadadka iftiinka kooridorka ama padka), sida habka shabakadda. Kooridor ama pad la&#039;aantiis naqshaddu waa dhulka, sidaas darteed qayb ma tusayso jarista ama buuxinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gaadiidka-mass\"\u003EGaadiidka mass\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGaadiidka mass\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyada muunadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sawiraa jaantuska gaadiidka mass isla mugyada aagga dhamaadka: isteeshannada dhexdooda, wadarta socota ee jarista ka dhimma buuxinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYaraanta (−) ama kor-u-kaca (+) ee jarista\u003C/strong\u003E waxay sheegaysaa waxa cubic yard jarista ay noqoto markii la dhigo buuxin: −10 % (qiimaha bilowga, meel-hayn) waxa uu ka dhigan yahay wuxuu yaraanayaa ilaa 0.9; dhagax kor u kaca ayaa laga yaabaa +5 %. Isticmaal lambarka warbixinta juqraafi-dhulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha khadku kor u kaco waddadu waa jarista; meesha hoos u dhaco, buuxinta. Ka sarreeya eber (midab liin) dhulku wuxuu u guuraa isteeshanka kor; ka hooseeya eber (cagaar), isteeshanka hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarta isku-dheelitirka\u003C/strong\u003E waa meesha khadku eber ka gudbo: labada midkood dhexdooda jarista iyo buuxinta way isku dheelitiran yihiin. Miiska wuxuu liistaa qayb kasta oo isku-dheelitirtay, mugga la dhaqaajiyay (barta ugu sarreysa ama ugu hoosaysa) iyo masaafada gaadiidka celceliska ah (aagga hoos-hoosaysan oo loo qaybiyo mugga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha khadku ku dhamaado eber ka baxsan, wixii haray waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqashin\u003C/strong\u003E (sare) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Eamaah\u003C/strong\u003E (hoose). Qaybtaas ugu dambeysa kaliya dhulka ka baxsan heerka uu ku dhamaado ayaa loo tiraa inuu dhaqaaqay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECSV\u003C/strong\u003E waxa ay kaydisaa qiimaha mass isteeshan kasta, qaybaha iyo factor-ka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qayb dhexdhexaad waxay tusaysaa waddada sida loo dhisi doono: xagga khadka waddada isteeshan hal, dhulka jira, naqshadda (kooridorka ama padka la jeexjeexay) iyo jarista iyo buuxinta u dhexeeya. Ku dar xariiqyada muunadda Dooro khad waddo. Sifooyinka hoosta Xariiqyada muunadda, guji Ku dar xariiqyada muunadda. Dejii Qayb kasta (masaafada: 50 ft ama 20 m bilowga), Ballaca bidix iyo Ballaca midig (inta uu qayb kastaa ka gaadho dhexdhexaadka). Si aad qayb u gooyo isteeshan gaar ah, ku qor Ku dar isteeshan (tusaale ahaan 2+35) oo riix Enter. Qaybaha waa la jaraa masaafo kasta oo tiro dhammeystiran, labada dhamaad ee khadka waddada, bilowga iyo dhamaadka wareeg kasta (PC iyo PT), iyo isteeshannada aad ku darto. Xariiqyada muunadda qorshaha waxay ku muuqdaan khadad cawl oo khadka waddada xagga; waxay sidoo kale u baxaan DXF, DWG iyo PDF lakabka C-ROAD-SCTN. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa celisa. Muuqaalka qaybta Ka fur Muuqaalka qaybta Sifooyinka khadka waddada, Qaybaha hoosta Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah, ama X. Waxay meesha ka qaadaa muuqaalka dherer ee qorshaha hoosteeda. Ku sii gudub qaybaha fallaadhaha xariiqdiisa, liiska isteeshannada, ama ← iyo → marka muuqaalka qaybta uu xoogga hayo (Home iyo End kan ugu horreeya iyo kan ugu dambeeya). Khadka cawl waa dhulka jira, khadka casaanka ah waa naqshadda. Jarista waxa lagu hoosaysiiyaa midab liin, buuxinta midab cagaar. Barooyinka kooridorka waa la calaamadiyay: CL (dhexdhexaadka), EOP (cidlada dusha waddada), SH (garabka) iyo DL (iftiinka). Madaxa wuxuu siinayaa isteeshanka, aagga jarista iyo buuxinta qaybtan iyo weynaynta toosan. Ku habee wuxuu buuxiyaa garoonka; dooro 1× si aad u aragto qaybta cabbirka run ah. Khadka qaro weyn ee qorshaha ayaa tusaa qaybta shaashadda ku jirta. Weynee iyo wareeji: giraanta ayaa weynaysa meesha calaamaddu tahay, jiidista ayaa dhaqaajisa muuqaalka. Ku habee (ama F, ama laba jeer guji) ayaa mar kale qaybta oo dhan ku habeeya. Qiyaas qayb gudaheeda Guji Qiyaas xariiqda qaybta, ama riix M. Talo-siiyaha wuxuu leeyahay \"Guji barta kowaad, kadibna labaad.\" Guji laba barood. Mid walba wuxuu qabsadaa dhamaadka khad ama barta kooridorka (CL, EOP, SH, DL); riix Alt barta xor ah. Akhriska wuxuu siinayaa masaafada toosan (ΔH), masaafada toosan ee sare-marka (ΔV), jeexjeexa boqolkiiba iyo nisbadeeda, iyo dhererka toosan, unugyada mashruuca. Mar kale guji si aad u bilowdo qiyaas cusub. Esc waa nadiifiyaa, M waxa uu damiyaa qiyaaska. Xaashiyada qaybaha Xaashiyada qaybaha (PDF) hoosta Xariiqyada muunadda wuxuu dhigaa qayb kasta bogagga PDF, safaf ahaan bidix ilaa midig iyo sare ilaa hoose tartanka isteeshannada. Dooro Warqadda, Miisaanka qorshaha (miisaanka toosan ee qaybaha) iyo Weynaynta muuqaalka dherer (1×, 2×, 5× ama 10×); wadahadalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta qaybood ee bog kasta ku habboon iyo inta bog ay tahay. Qayb kasta waxa uu tusaa shabakad leh ka-saarka iyo sare-marka, dhulka (jajaban), naqshadda, jarista iyo buuxinta oo midab la siiyay (liin iyo cagaar), barooyinka kooridorka, iyo hoosteeda isteeshankeeda iyo aagga jarista iyo buuxinta. Qaybaha xaashiyada oo dhan waxa la sawiraa cabbir isku mid ah, dherer u filan kan ugu weyn; haddii aysan bogga ku habboon weynaynteena, CivilCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa kan ugu weyn ee ku habboon oo waa sheegaa. Xariga cinwaanka wuxuu magacaabaa khadka waddada, isteeshannada bogga, miisaannada, iyo \"Xaashi 1 ee 3\". Jarista iyo buuxinta waxa lagu cabbiraa Kooridor waxa uu lahaan karaa lakabyo hoosta dusha waddada: lakabyada dusha, qaybaha qaababka, jidka. Mugyada lagu cabbiro oo doorashada qaybta bar-ka ayaa dooranaysa ilaa halka jarista iyo buuxinta ay gaarayaan: Dusha hoose (bilowga): ilaa hoosta qaybahaas, si jarista u ka mid ahaato qoto dhismaha dusha. Dusha sare: ilaa sare-ka naqshadda oo keliya, sida hore markii qaybaha la tirinayay. Aagga madaxa, mugyada hoose, CSV iyo gaadiidka mass dhammaantood waxay raacaan doorashadan, waana la kaydiyaa mashruuca. Mugyada celceliska aagga dhamaadka Labada qayb ee deriska ah dhexdooda, mugga waa celceliska labada aagood oo ay ku dhufato masaafada u dhexeysa isteeshannadooda. Bar-ku wuxuu tusaa wadarta khadka waddada, CSV waxa uu soo dejiyaa aagga iyo mugyada qayb kasta oo wadarta socota (cubic yards mashruucyada feet, cubic meters kuwa metric). Sifooyinka wuxuu tusaa wadarta isla markaana mugyada habka shabakadda ee Mugyada shaqada dhulka. Labadaba qiyaas kala duwan ayay yihiin: qaybaha is-dhow ayay isu dhowaadaan, waddo toosan dhul fidsan dushiisa waa isku mid. Jarista iyo buuxinta waxa la tiraa kaliya aagagga la jeexjeexay gudahooda (khadadka iftiinka kooridorka ama padka), sida habka shabakadda. Kooridor ama pad la'aantiis naqshaddu waa dhulka, sidaas darteed qayb ma tusayso jarista ama buuxinta. Gaadiidka mass Gaadiidka mass hoosta Xariiqyada muunadda wuxuu sawiraa jaantuska gaadiidka mass isla mugyada aagga dhamaadka: isteeshannada dhexdooda, wadarta socota ee jarista ka dhimma buuxinta. Yaraanta (−) ama kor-u-kaca (+) ee jarista waxay sheegaysaa waxa cubic yard jarista ay noqoto markii la dhigo buuxin: −10 % (qiimaha bilowga, meel-hayn) waxa uu ka dhigan yahay wuxuu yaraanayaa ilaa 0.9; dhagax kor u kaca ayaa laga yaabaa +5 %. Isticmaal lambarka warbixinta juqraafi-dhulka. Meesha khadku kor u kaco waddadu waa jarista; meesha hoos u dhaco, buuxinta. Ka sarreeya eber (midab liin) dhulku wuxuu u guuraa isteeshanka kor; ka hooseeya eber (cagaar), isteeshanka hoos. Barta isku-dheelitirka waa meesha khadku eber ka gudbo: labada midkood dhexdooda jarista iyo buuxinta way isku dheelitiran yihiin. Miiska wuxuu liistaa qayb kasta oo isku-dheelitirtay, mugga la dhaqaajiyay (barta ugu sarreysa ama ugu hoosaysa) iyo masaafada gaadiidka celceliska ah (aagga hoos-hoosaysan oo loo qaybiyo mugga). Meesha khadku ku dhamaado eber ka baxsan, wixii haray waa qashin (sare) ama amaah (hoose). Qaybtaas ugu dambeysa kaliya dhulka ka baxsan heerka uu ku dhamaado ayaa loo tiraa inuu dhaqaaqay. CSV waxa ay kaydisaa qiimaha mass isteeshan kasta, qaybaha iyo factor-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"river-hydraulics","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qorshayaasha dusha biyaha ee webiga","summary":"Webiga ka dhig dhulka jira oo xisaabi qorshayaasha dusha biyaha joogtada ah ee socda habka tallaabada heerka (standard step): heerarka biyaha, tamarta, xawaaraha, tirada Froude iyo daadka qorshaha. Qaybta shaybaarka; natiijo kasta waxay u baahan tahay dib-u-eegis injineer.","section":"tasks","order":58,"keywords":["xeed (levee)","aagga socodka aan waxtar lahayn","tafatiraha qaybta","webi","hayodoolik","qorshaha dusha biyaha","biyo-dib-u-soo-noqod (backwater)","habka tallaabada heerka","socod joogto ah","1d","qaybaha-jarka","manning","adkaan","qaadista (conveyance)","qoto-dheer khatar","qoto-dheer caadi","froude","khadka tamarta","aagga daadka","dooxada daadka","daadashada","barta xeebta","dhererka qaybta","yaraynta (contraction)","ballaarinta (expansion)","ka hooseeya khatarta","ka sarreeya khatarta","nidaam isku-dhafan","dhac hayodoolik"],"headings":[{"id":"webiga-sawir","text":"Webiga sawir","level":2},{"id":"webiga-dejin","text":"Webiga dejin","level":2},{"id":"qaybta-tafatirka-xeebaha-xeedka-iyo-aagagga-aan-waxtarka-lahayn","text":"Qaybta tafatirka: xeebaha, xeedka iyo aagagga aan waxtarka lahayn","level":2},{"id":"xisaabi-iyo-akhri-natiijooyinka","text":"Xisaabi iyo akhri natiijooyinka","level":2},{"id":"sawirka-iyo-dhibaatooyinka","text":"Sawirka iyo Dhibaatooyinka","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-xisaabiyo","text":"Sida loo xisaabiyo","level":2},{"id":"dhuunta-iyo-buundooyinka","text":"Dhuunta iyo buundooyinka","level":2},{"id":"socod-aan-joogtada-ahayn","text":"Socod aan joogtada ahayn","level":2},{"id":"isku-xirka","text":"Isku-xirka","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-dhisin","text":"Wali lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu xisaabiyaa qorshayaasha dusha biyaha joogtada ah ee hal-cabbir ah, dhererka webiga: qiimo kasta oo socod ah oo aad siiso, heerka biyaha qaybta kasta oo laga qaaday, isla-markaana isu-dheelitirka tamarta ee u dhexeeya qaybaha deriska ah (habka tallaabada heerka). Waa mid ku jira shaybaarka inta la hubinayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaalmo naqshadeed oo keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E Heerarka biyaha waxay u baahan yihiin dib-u-eegis injineer oo khibrad leh intaan qofna isku halayn: moodel 1D waa sida qaybahiisa, qiimaha adkaanta, dhererka qaybta iyo xuduudaha oo kaliya ayay tahay, mana garanayso buundooyinka, dhuunta ama socodka ka baxa webiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"webiga-sawir\"\u003EWebiga sawir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka hore dhis dusha dhulka jira (barta, khadadka-jeexa, ama TIN aad furtay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiver\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix xariiqda dhexe ee webiga \u003Cstrong\u003Elaga bilaabo hoosta-socodka ilaa hoosta\u003C/strong\u003E (from upstream to downstream), kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama laba-jeex.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu jarjaraa qayb toos ah oo xariiqda dhexe ah 50 m (200 ft) kasta, 100 m (300 ft) dhinac kasta, dhulka. Saldhigyada webiga waxay ka tirinayaan dhamaadka hoose, sidaas darteed way kordhaan ka sarreeya socodka. Xeebaha waxay bilaabmaan sida qiyaas 10 m (30 ft) labada dhinac qaybta kasta oo ka hooseeya barta ugu hoosaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u darto qayb meesha webigu yaraado ama qalab uu ku yaal, dooro webiga, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a section\u003C/span\u003E oo jar khad jeexa oo dhaadheer (labada jihoodba way shaqeeyaan: waa la rogaa si uu u socdo bidix ilaa midig marka laga eego hoosta-socodka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"webiga-dejin\"\u003EWebiga dejin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro webiga si aad uga aragto \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlow regime\u003C/strong\u003E: ka hooseeya (caadiga: lagu xisaabiyo ka sarreeya socodka xuduudda hoose), ka sarreeya (lagu xisaabiyo hoos-socod xuduudda sare), ama isku-dhafan (labadaba, markaas midka leh force-ka gaarka ah ee weyn qayb kasta; hordhac).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlow profiles\u003C/strong\u003E: magac iyo socod kasta (tusaale 10-sano iyo 100-sano), iyo xuduudda hoose (iyo sare marka nidaamku aanu ka hooseyn): \u003Cstrong\u003ENormal depth\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh energy slope (bed slope waa qiyaas hore), heerka \u003Cstrong\u003EKnown water surface\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003ECritical depth\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESections from the ground\u003C/strong\u003E: fogaanta, inta bidix iyo midig, qiyaasta xeebta iyo labada qiime ee Manning&#039;s n; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut sections again\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa qaybaha (hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiiska qaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E: qayb kasta, fogaanshaha xeebta bidix iyo midig, Manning n ee channel-ka iyo overbank-ka, dherer qaybta ilaa qaybta xiga ee hoose (overbank bidix, channel, overbank midig; laga cabbiray qorshaha si uu u bilaabmo) iyo isku-xirnaanta contraction iyo expansion (0.1 iyo 0.3 si loo bilaabo: isbedel tartiib ah). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa tafatiraha qaybta (xiga); dhibcaha ka dambeeya wuxuu muujinayaa in qaybtaas leedahay xeed ama aag aan waxtar lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaybta-tafatirka-xeebaha-xeedka-iyo-aagagga-aan-waxtarka-lahayn\"\u003EQaybta tafatirka: xeebaha, xeedka iyo aagagga aan waxtarka lahayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E qaybta wuxuu sawiraa dhulkeeda, waxaana aad jiidi kartaa waxa xalliyuhu akhriyo: \u003Cstrong\u003Exeebta bidix iyo midig\u003C/strong\u003E (waxay qaybta u kala jebiyaan overbank-ka bidix, channel-ka dhexe iyo overbank-ka midig), \u003Cstrong\u003Exeed\u003C/strong\u003E labada dhinac iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eaagagga socodka aan waxtar lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E. Dhammaan gacmaha waxaa lagu dhaqaajin karaa furayaasha jihada (arrow keys), dhammaan tirooyinka waxaa lagu qori karaa xagga sawirka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EApply\u003C/span\u003E waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXeed (\u003Cstrong\u003Elevee\u003C/strong\u003E) wuxuu leeyahay meel (fogaansho) iyo sare-dhaadheer qulqulka (crest). Dhulka ka dambeeya, oo ka fog webiga, waa la gooyaa webiga ka hor inta dusha biyaha ka hooseeyo crest-ka: aagiisa, perimeter-ka qoyan iyo conveyance-kiisa waa la reebaa. Ka sarreeya crest-ka qaybta oo dhan ayaa mar kale tirinta. Xeedku wuxuu taagan yahay dibadda xeebta uu ilaaliyo; kan ku jira xeebaha waa la calaamadiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagga socodka aan waxtar lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E (ineffective flow area) wuxuu haystaa biyo laakiin ma qaadayo socod (godka ka dambeeya bannaanka, biyo dhimanaya dhinaca jidka buundada). Siiso labada fogaansho, iyo haddii aad doonto, heer biyo oo ka hooseeya kaas aagga aan waxtarka lahayn yahay (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ealways\u003C/span\u003E haddii madhan): ka sarreeya heerkaas wuxuu u socdaa sida kuwa kale. Mid qayb ka ah channel-ka ugu weyn waa la calaamadiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELabada qaybood dhexdooda, daadka dhulka xeedka ka dambeeya oo labadoodaba leh, wuxuu ka tagaa qalalan, marka dusha biyaha halkaas ka hooseeyo crest-ka (khadka u dhexeeya labada crest waa toos).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xisaabi-iyo-akhri-natiijooyinka\"\u003EXisaabi iyo akhri natiijooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWater surface profiles\u003C/span\u003E. Qorshaha aad dooratid waxaad heleysaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Egaraaf\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca webiga (socod bidix ilaa midig): hoosta channel-ka, xeebaha, dusha biyaha, khadka tamarta iyo dusha biyaha qoto-dheer khatar; qaybaha lagu hayo qoto-dheer khatar waa la wareegay;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Emiis\u003C/strong\u003E qayb kasta: saldhigga webiga, socodka, hoosta channel-ka, dusha biyaha, dusha biyaha qoto-dheer khatar, khadka tamarta, qoto-dheer, xawaaraha channel-ka iyo guud, tirada Froude ee channel-ka, aagga socodka, ballaca sare, socodka overbank kasta iyo channel-ka, isku-dhaca tamarta, iyo digniinaha;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Edigniinaha\u003C/strong\u003E erayo cad, tusaale qayb loo dejiyay qoto-dheer khatar, biyo ka sarreeya dhamaadka qaybta, ama isbedel weyn oo conveyance ah labada qayb u dhexeeya (ku dar qaybo dhexe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETable (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport\u003C/span\u003E (qoraal cad oo leh habka, xuduudaha iyo miisaska oo dhan) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlot (SVG)\u003C/span\u003E waxay kaydiyaan soo dejinta. Mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay khadka eegista.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the flood extent\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u iftiimiso aagga qoyan ee qorshaha, qorshaha la doortay, oo leh xariiq dhibcaha biyaha halkaas qoto-dheeruhu eber yahay. Qaybaha u dhexeeya, dusha biyaha waa siman yahay webiga oo dhan, wuxuuna isbedelaa si toos ah dhererka webiga. Dhulka xeedka ka dambeeya waa qalalan inta biyuhu ka hooseeyo crest-ka. Dhulka hoose ee kale ee ku yaal corridor-ka webiga oo biyuhu gaari karin (sida ka dambeeya xeedka waddada) weli waa la iftiimiyaa: hubi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirka-iyo-dhibaatooyinka\"\u003ESawirka iyo Dhibaatooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadadka webiga waxay u gudbaan qorshaha, PDF-ka iyo DWG-ga lakabyadooda gaarka ah: \u003Cstrong\u003EC-WATR-CNTR\u003C/strong\u003E (xariiqda dhexe), \u003Cstrong\u003EC-WATR-SCTN\u003C/strong\u003E (khadka jarka kasta, leh saldhiggiisa webiga) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EC-WATR-FLOD\u003C/strong\u003E (khadka daadka, marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the flood extent\u003C/span\u003E la calaamadiyo qorshaha). Digniinaha webiga (qayb loo dejiyay qoto-dheer khatar, biyo ka sarreeya dhamaadka qaybta, isbedel conveyance ah oo baahi u leh qaybo dheeraad ah, isku-dheelitir tamarta oo aan xirmin, xeed gudaha xeebaha) waxay kaloo u gudbaan guddiga \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ku saabsan webiga oo lagu dhejiyay qaybta ay ka timid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-xisaabiyo\"\u003ESida loo xisaabiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETamarta labada qayb ee u dhexeeya: WS₂ + α₂V₂²/2g = WS₁ + α₁V₁²/2g + L·Sf + C·|α₂V₂²/2g − α₁V₁²/2g|.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EConveyance-ka qaybo-qaybta: overbank kasta waa la kala jebiyaa meesha n-kiisu isbedelo, K = Σ (1/n)·A·R^(2/3) (1.486/n unitiyada US); channel-ka waa hal qayb, oo leh composite n marka n-kiisu isbedelo. α waxay ka imanaysaa sida conveyance-ka loo kala qaybiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFriction slope oo ah celceliska conveyance-ka, Sf = ((Q₁ + Q₂)/(K₁ + K₂))², dhererka reach-ka oo la miisaamay socodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContraction coefficient marka socodku xawaareeyo hoos, expansion marka uu gaabiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECritical depth = tamarta gaarka ah ee ugu yar. Heer kasta oo biyo waxaa lagu xallaa bracket, markaas kama dhaco dhinaca khaldan ee critical; marka jawaab la&#039;aan, waa la dejiyaa qoto-dheer khatar oo waa la calaamadiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarnaamijka waxaa lagu hubiyay Manning normal depth, critical depth channel tikitan (rectangular), iyo tusaalaha backwater ee Chow (\u003Cem\u003EOpen-Channel Hydraulics\u003C/em\u003E, 1959, cutubka 10) oo si madax-banaan loo isku-dhafay. Habka ayaa lagu isticmaalaa barnaamijyada webiga 1D ee caadiga ah, sidaas darteed xisaab-gacmeedka ama qoraallada ardaydu way wada-raacaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhuunta-iyo-buundooyinka\"\u003EDhuunta iyo buundooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESifooyinka webiga, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDhuunta iyo buundooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a culvert\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a bridge\u003C/span\u003E waxay mid dhigtaa labada qaybood u dhexeeya (qayb kasta waxay hayaa ugu yaraan labo qayb). Qorshaha ka hooseeya wuu isla sidaas yahay; dusha biyaha ka sarreeya waxay ka timaadaa dhismaha, qorshuhuna wuu sii socdaa hoos ka sarreeya. \u003Cstrong\u003ENatiijooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku daraan miis dhismo kasta: tailwater, heerka headwater, xakamaynta ka talisa, socodka furka iyo socodka waddada ama sagxadda. Socod ka hooseeya oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECulvert\u003C/strong\u003E (sanduuq ama wareeg, hal ama ka badan oo xagal isku mid ah). Xakamaynta gelitaanka waa socod weir inta gelitaanku bilaash yahay, socod orifice markuu biyaha ku buuxo, oo isku-dhafan labada u dhexeeya headwater ah hal iyo hal iyo badh jeer kor-u-kaca. Xakamaynta bixitaanka waa isu-dheelitirka tamarta: luminta gelitaanka, adkaanta iyo cadaadiska xawaaraha bixitaanka, ka sarreeya tailwater-ka iyo dhexdhexaadka qoto-dheer khatar iyo sare-ka (crown), ka dhimma hoos-u-dhaca barrel-ka. Headwater-ku waa mid ka weyn labadii. Calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EBiyuhu waa gudbi karaan waddada\u003C/strong\u003E oo socodka weir-ka waddadu wuxuu la wadaagaa socodka barrel-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuundo.\u003C/strong\u003E Furku waa qaybta ka hooseysa buundada, oo lagu jaray abutments, iyo pier kasta oo aag ah oo aan socod qaadin. Dusha biyaha furka waxay ka timaadaa qaybta hoose (isku-xirka ballaarinta), qaybta sare-na furka (isku-xirka yaraynta). Haddii furku aanu socodka ka qaadi karin tailwater-kaas, wuxuu ku socdaa qoto-dheer khatar, buundadana waa la calaamadiyaa inay xidhan tahay (choking). Haddii biyuhu gaaro chord-ka hoose, socodku waa socod cadaadis (nooca sluice inta tailwater-ku ka hooseeyo chord-ka hoose, ka dibna nooca drowned ka sarreeya), iyo biyaha dusha waddada ku-darsanaya socod weir; heerka dhinaca sare waa heerka ay isku darsadaan socodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-xirnaanta (discharge, luminta gelitaanka, weir) waa qiyam go&#039;an oo lagu qoray tiro wareeg ah. Ku beddel naqshaddaada. Ma aha miisaska khariidadda ee buugagga naqshadda dhuunta ee la daabaco, sidaas darteed u tix-geli headwater-ka dhuun ku dhow xadkiisa sida qiyaas. Biyaha waddada ama sagxadda ka-sarreeya, gelitaanka biyo la&#039;aysay, furka xidhan iyo socodka degdega ah ee barrel-ka waxay ku muuqdaan \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socod-aan-joogtada-ahayn\"\u003ESocod aan joogtada ahayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnsteady flow…\u003C/span\u003E sifooyinka webiga wuxuu u wareejiyaa hydrograph-ka daadka qaybaha hoose. Galinta ku qor sida saacado iyo socod, hal labo kasta sadar, gradient-ka hoose (normal depth) iyo intee le&#039;eg ayuu socdaa. Wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dusha biyaha joogtada ah ee socodka ugu horeeya, wuxuuna xalliyaa isle&#039;egta laba-geesoodka ah ee buuxda (habka afar-barta implicit, miisaanka 0.6 wakhtiga). Waxaad hesha heerka biyaha ugu sarreeya iyo socodka qayb kasta iyo saacadda ay dhacdo, jaantus socodka labada dhamaad, iyo hubinta mugga (gala, bax iyo isbedelka la kaydiyay). Waa la hubiyaa in socodka joogtada ahi uu joogto ahaado, isbedel gelinta ah oo dhamaanaya dusha biyaha cusub, mugga oo xirmaya, iyo xawaaraha mawjadda daadka marka la barbardhigo mawjadda kinematic. Socod ka hooseeya, hal reach, aan gelin dhinac lahayn, aan dhuun ama buundo ku jirin socodka dhexdiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-xirka\"\u003EIsku-xirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha socodka isku xira hal bax: socodyada isku-darsanaya, dusha biyaha madaxa qaybta hoose ayaa loo qaadaa dhamaadka qaybaha ku biiraya (isla dusha biyaha isku-xirka, habka fudud: ma jiro xagal, ma jiro momentum, sidaas darteed waxay ku habboon tahay Froude hoose). Moodelka iyo tijaabooyinka way jiraan (\u003Ccode\u003Eriver-structures.js\u003C/code\u003E); guddi lagu isku xiro laba webi qorshaha ma dhisna weli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeir-yada iyo irdaha qaab dhismo gooni ah, guddiga isku-xirka, dhismayaasha dhexdooda socodka aan joogtada ahayn, iyo socod aan joogtada ahayn oo ka sarreeya khatarta. Socod nidaam isku-dhafan wuxuu calaamadiyaa dhac hayodoolik oo u dhexeeya laba qayb laakiin ma dhigo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHalka webiyaasha ku biiraan.\u003C/strong\u003E Sifooyinka webiga, &quot;Flows into&quot; wuxuu magacaabaa webiga uu ku biiro. Webiyaasha isku biirta waa la xalliyaa wada: webiga ay ku biiraan wuxuu qaadaa wadarta socodyadooda, mid kastoo ka mid ahna wuxuu dhammaadaa dusha biyaha qaybta ugu horeysa webigaas (habka dusha biyaha isku-mid ah; ma jiro xagal iyo momentum). Si loo isku xiro webi weyn iyo webi yar, samee webi gaaban hoosta isku-xirka oo ha ku biiraan labadaba. Natiijooyinku waxay muujiyaan miis isku-xirka. Qiyamka caadiga ah ee natiijooyinkan (contraction 0.1, expansion 0.3, channel hal qayb oo leh composite roughness, nidaamka isku-dhafan ee force-ka gaarka ah) ayaa jiraya ilaa injineer uu dib u eego, natiijooyinkuna way sheegaan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"CivilCraft wuxuu xisaabiyaa qorshayaasha dusha biyaha joogtada ah ee hal-cabbir ah, dhererka webiga: qiimo kasta oo socod ah oo aad siiso, heerka biyaha qaybta kasta oo laga qaaday, isla-markaana isu-dheelitirka tamarta ee u dhexeeya qaybaha deriska ah (habka tallaabada heerka). Waa mid ku jira shaybaarka inta la hubinayo. Kaalmo naqshadeed oo keliya. Heerarka biyaha waxay u baahan yihiin dib-u-eegis injineer oo khibrad leh intaan qofna isku halayn: moodel 1D waa sida qaybahiisa, qiimaha adkaanta, dhererka qaybta iyo xuduudaha oo kaliya ayay tahay, mana garanayso buundooyinka, dhuunta ama socodka ka baxa webiga. Webiga sawir Marka hore dhis dusha dhulka jira (barta, khadadka-jeexa, ama TIN aad furtay). Hoosta Dusha › More, dooro River. Riix xariiqda dhexe ee webiga laga bilaabo hoosta-socodka ilaa hoosta (from upstream to downstream), kadibna riix Enter ama laba-jeex. CivilCraft wuxuu jarjaraa qayb toos ah oo xariiqda dhexe ah 50 m (200 ft) kasta, 100 m (300 ft) dhinac kasta, dhulka. Saldhigyada webiga waxay ka tirinayaan dhamaadka hoose, sidaas darteed way kordhaan ka sarreeya socodka. Xeebaha waxay bilaabmaan sida qiyaas 10 m (30 ft) labada dhinac qaybta kasta oo ka hooseeya barta ugu hoosaysa. Si aad u darto qayb meesha webigu yaraado ama qalab uu ku yaal, dooro webiga, riix Add a section oo jar khad jeexa oo dhaadheer (labada jihoodba way shaqeeyaan: waa la rogaa si uu u socdo bidix ilaa midig marka laga eego hoosta-socodka). Webiga dejin Dooro webiga si aad uga aragto Sifooyinka: Flow regime: ka hooseeya (caadiga: lagu xisaabiyo ka sarreeya socodka xuduudda hoose), ka sarreeya (lagu xisaabiyo hoos-socod xuduudda sare), ama isku-dhafan (labadaba, markaas midka leh force-ka gaarka ah ee weyn qayb kasta; hordhac). Flow profiles: magac iyo socod kasta (tusaale 10-sano iyo 100-sano), iyo xuduudda hoose (iyo sare marka nidaamku aanu ka hooseyn): Normal depth oo leh energy slope (bed slope waa qiyaas hore), heerka Known water surface, ama Critical depth. Sections from the ground: fogaanta, inta bidix iyo midig, qiyaasta xeebta iyo labada qiime ee Manning's n; Cut sections again wuxuu beddelaa qaybaha (hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo). Miiska qaybaha: qayb kasta, fogaanshaha xeebta bidix iyo midig, Manning n ee channel-ka iyo overbank-ka, dherer qaybta ilaa qaybta xiga ee hoose (overbank bidix, channel, overbank midig; laga cabbiray qorshaha si uu u bilaabmo) iyo isku-xirnaanta contraction iyo expansion (0.1 iyo 0.3 si loo bilaabo: isbedel tartiib ah). Edit wuxuu furaa tafatiraha qaybta (xiga); dhibcaha ka dambeeya wuxuu muujinayaa in qaybtaas leedahay xeed ama aag aan waxtar lahayn. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo (Ctrl+Z). Qaybta tafatirka: xeebaha, xeedka iyo aagagga aan waxtarka lahayn Edit qaybta wuxuu sawiraa dhulkeeda, waxaana aad jiidi kartaa waxa xalliyuhu akhriyo: xeebta bidix iyo midig (waxay qaybta u kala jebiyaan overbank-ka bidix, channel-ka dhexe iyo overbank-ka midig), xeed labada dhinac iyo aagagga socodka aan waxtar lahayn. Dhammaan gacmaha waxaa lagu dhaqaajin karaa furayaasha jihada (arrow keys), dhammaan tirooyinka waxaa lagu qori karaa xagga sawirka. Apply waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo. Xeed (levee) wuxuu leeyahay meel (fogaansho) iyo sare-dhaadheer qulqulka (crest). Dhulka ka dambeeya, oo ka fog webiga, waa la gooyaa webiga ka hor inta dusha biyaha ka hooseeyo crest-ka: aagiisa, perimeter-ka qoyan iyo conveyance-kiisa waa la reebaa. Ka sarreeya crest-ka qaybta oo dhan ayaa mar kale tirinta. Xeedku wuxuu taagan yahay dibadda xeebta uu ilaaliyo; kan ku jira xeebaha waa la calaamadiyaa. Aagga socodka aan waxtar lahayn (ineffective flow area) wuxuu haystaa biyo laakiin ma qaadayo socod (godka ka dambeeya bannaanka, biyo dhimanaya dhinaca jidka buundada). Siiso labada fogaansho, iyo haddii aad doonto, heer biyo oo ka hooseeya kaas aagga aan waxtarka lahayn yahay (always haddii madhan): ka sarreeya heerkaas wuxuu u socdaa sida kuwa kale. Mid qayb ka ah channel-ka ugu weyn waa la calaamadiyaa. Labada qaybood dhexdooda, daadka dhulka xeedka ka dambeeya oo labadoodaba leh, wuxuu ka tagaa qalalan, marka dusha biyaha halkaas ka hooseeyo crest-ka (khadka u dhexeeya labada crest waa toos). Xisaabi iyo akhri natiijooyinka Riix Water surface profiles. Qorshaha aad dooratid waxaad heleysaa: garaaf dhinaca webiga (socod bidix ilaa midig): hoosta channel-ka, xeebaha, dusha biyaha, khadka tamarta iyo dusha biyaha qoto-dheer khatar; qaybaha lagu hayo qoto-dheer khatar waa la wareegay; miis qayb kasta: saldhigga webiga, socodka, hoosta channel-ka, dusha biyaha, dusha biyaha qoto-dheer khatar, khadka tamarta, qoto-dheer, xawaaraha channel-ka iyo guud, tirada Froude ee channel-ka, aagga socodka, ballaca sare, socodka overbank kasta iyo channel-ka, isku-dhaca tamarta, iyo digniinaha; digniinaha erayo cad, tusaale qayb loo dejiyay qoto-dheer khatar, biyo ka sarreeya dhamaadka qaybta, ama isbedel weyn oo conveyance ah labada qayb u dhexeeya (ku dar qaybo dhexe). Table (CSV), Report (qoraal cad oo leh habka, xuduudaha iyo miisaska oo dhan) iyo Plot (SVG) waxay kaydiyaan soo dejinta. Mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay khadka eegista. Calaamadi Show the flood extent Sifooyinka si aad u iftiimiso aagga qoyan ee qorshaha, qorshaha la doortay, oo leh xariiq dhibcaha biyaha halkaas qoto-dheeruhu eber yahay. Qaybaha u dhexeeya, dusha biyaha waa siman yahay webiga oo dhan, wuxuuna isbedelaa si toos ah dhererka webiga. Dhulka xeedka ka dambeeya waa qalalan inta biyuhu ka hooseeyo crest-ka. Dhulka hoose ee kale ee ku yaal corridor-ka webiga oo biyuhu gaari karin (sida ka dambeeya xeedka waddada) weli waa la iftiimiyaa: hubi. Sawirka iyo Dhibaatooyinka Khadadka webiga waxay u gudbaan qorshaha, PDF-ka iyo DWG-ga lakabyadooda gaarka ah: C-WATR-CNTR (xariiqda dhexe), C-WATR-SCTN (khadka jarka kasta, leh saldhiggiisa webiga) iyo C-WATR-FLOD (khadka daadka, marka Show the flood extent la calaamadiyo qorshaha). Digniinaha webiga (qayb loo dejiyay qoto-dheer khatar, biyo ka sarreeya dhamaadka qaybta, isbedel conveyance ah oo baahi u leh qaybo dheeraad ah, isku-dheelitir tamarta oo aan xirmin, xeed gudaha xeebaha) waxay kaloo u gudbaan guddiga Dhibaatooyinka, oo ku saabsan webiga oo lagu dhejiyay qaybta ay ka timid. Sida loo xisaabiyo Tamarta labada qayb ee u dhexeeya: WS₂ + α₂V₂²/2g = WS₁ + α₁V₁²/2g + L·Sf + C·|α₂V₂²/2g − α₁V₁²/2g|. Conveyance-ka qaybo-qaybta: overbank kasta waa la kala jebiyaa meesha n-kiisu isbedelo, K = Σ (1/n)·A·R^(2/3) (1.486/n unitiyada US); channel-ka waa hal qayb, oo leh composite n marka n-kiisu isbedelo. α waxay ka imanaysaa sida conveyance-ka loo kala qaybiyo. Friction slope oo ah celceliska conveyance-ka, Sf = ((Q₁ + Q₂)/(K₁ + K₂))², dhererka reach-ka oo la miisaamay socodka. Contraction coefficient marka socodku xawaareeyo hoos, expansion marka uu gaabiyo. Critical depth = tamarta gaarka ah ee ugu yar. Heer kasta oo biyo waxaa lagu xallaa bracket, markaas kama dhaco dhinaca khaldan ee critical; marka jawaab la'aan, waa la dejiyaa qoto-dheer khatar oo waa la calaamadiyaa. Barnaamijka waxaa lagu hubiyay Manning normal depth, critical depth channel tikitan (rectangular), iyo tusaalaha backwater ee Chow (Open-Channel Hydraulics, 1959, cutubka 10) oo si madax-banaan loo isku-dhafay. Habka ayaa lagu isticmaalaa barnaamijyada webiga 1D ee caadiga ah, sidaas darteed xisaab-gacmeedka ama qoraallada ardaydu way wada-raacaan. Dhuunta iyo buundooyinka Sifooyinka webiga, hoosta Dhuunta iyo buundooyinka, Add a culvert ama Add a bridge waxay mid dhigtaa labada qaybood u dhexeeya (qayb kasta waxay hayaa ugu yaraan labo qayb). Qorshaha ka hooseeya wuu isla sidaas yahay; dusha biyaha ka sarreeya waxay ka timaadaa dhismaha, qorshuhuna wuu sii socdaa hoos ka sarreeya. Natiijooyinka waxay ku daraan miis dhismo kasta: tailwater, heerka headwater, xakamaynta ka talisa, socodka furka iyo socodka waddada ama sagxadda. Socod ka hooseeya oo keliya. Culvert (sanduuq ama wareeg, hal ama ka badan oo xagal isku mid ah). Xakamaynta gelitaanka waa socod weir inta gelitaanku bilaash yahay, socod orifice markuu biyaha ku buuxo, oo isku-dhafan labada u dhexeeya headwater ah hal iyo hal iyo badh jeer kor-u-kaca. Xakamaynta bixitaanka waa isu-dheelitirka tamarta: luminta gelitaanka, adkaanta iyo cadaadiska xawaaraha bixitaanka, ka sarreeya tailwater-ka iyo dhexdhexaadka qoto-dheer khatar iyo sare-ka (crown), ka dhimma hoos-u-dhaca barrel-ka. Headwater-ku waa mid ka weyn labadii. Calaamadi Biyuhu waa gudbi karaan waddada oo socodka weir-ka waddadu wuxuu la wadaagaa socodka barrel-ka. Buundo. Furku waa qaybta ka hooseysa buundada, oo lagu jaray abutments, iyo pier kasta oo aag ah oo aan socod qaadin. Dusha biyaha furka waxay ka timaadaa qaybta hoose (isku-xirka ballaarinta), qaybta sare-na furka (isku-xirka yaraynta). Haddii furku aanu socodka ka qaadi karin tailwater-kaas, wuxuu ku socdaa qoto-dheer khatar, buundadana waa la calaamadiyaa inay xidhan tahay (choking). Haddii biyuhu gaaro chord-ka hoose, socodku waa socod cadaadis (nooca sluice inta tailwater-ku ka hooseeyo chord-ka hoose, ka dibna nooca drowned ka sarreeya), iyo biyaha dusha waddada ku-darsanaya socod weir; heerka dhinaca sare waa heerka ay isku darsadaan socodka. Isku-xirnaanta (discharge, luminta gelitaanka, weir) waa qiyam go'an oo lagu qoray tiro wareeg ah. Ku beddel naqshaddaada. Ma aha miisaska khariidadda ee buugagga naqshadda dhuunta ee la daabaco, sidaas darteed u tix-geli headwater-ka dhuun ku dhow xadkiisa sida qiyaas. Biyaha waddada ama sagxadda ka-sarreeya, gelitaanka biyo la'aysay, furka xidhan iyo socodka degdega ah ee barrel-ka waxay ku muuqdaan Dhibaatooyinka. Socod aan joogtada ahayn Unsteady flow… sifooyinka webiga wuxuu u wareejiyaa hydrograph-ka daadka qaybaha hoose. Galinta ku qor sida saacado iyo socod, hal labo kasta sadar, gradient-ka hoose (normal depth) iyo intee le'eg ayuu socdaa. Wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dusha biyaha joogtada ah ee socodka ugu horeeya, wuxuuna xalliyaa isle'egta laba-geesoodka ah ee buuxda (habka afar-barta implicit, miisaanka 0.6 wakhtiga). Waxaad hesha heerka biyaha ugu sarreeya iyo socodka qayb kasta iyo saacadda ay dhacdo, jaantus socodka labada dhamaad, iyo hubinta mugga (gala, bax iyo isbedelka la kaydiyay). Waa la hubiyaa in socodka joogtada ahi uu joogto ahaado, isbedel gelinta ah oo dhamaanaya dusha biyaha cusub, mugga oo xirmaya, iyo xawaaraha mawjadda daadka marka la barbardhigo mawjadda kinematic. Socod ka hooseeya, hal reach, aan gelin dhinac lahayn, aan dhuun ama buundo ku jirin socodka dhexdiisa. Isku-xirka Qaybaha socodka isku xira hal bax: socodyada isku-darsanaya, dusha biyaha madaxa qaybta hoose ayaa loo qaadaa dhamaadka qaybaha ku biiraya (isla dusha biyaha isku-xirka, habka fudud: ma jiro xagal, ma jiro momentum, sidaas darteed waxay ku habboon tahay Froude hoose). Moodelka iyo tijaabooyinka way jiraan (river-structures.js); guddi lagu isku xiro laba webi qorshaha ma dhisna weli. Wali lama dhisin Weir-yada iyo irdaha qaab dhismo gooni ah, guddiga isku-xirka, dhismayaasha dhexdooda socodka aan joogtada ahayn, iyo socod aan joogtada ahayn oo ka sarreeya khatarta. Socod nidaam isku-dhafan wuxuu calaamadiyaa dhac hayodoolik oo u dhexeeya laba qayb laakiin ma dhigo. Halka webiyaasha ku biiraan. Sifooyinka webiga, \"Flows into\" wuxuu magacaabaa webiga uu ku biiro. Webiyaasha isku biirta waa la xalliyaa wada: webiga ay ku biiraan wuxuu qaadaa wadarta socodyadooda, mid kastoo ka mid ahna wuxuu dhammaadaa dusha biyaha qaybta ugu horeysa webigaas (habka dusha biyaha isku-mid ah; ma jiro xagal iyo momentum). Si loo isku xiro webi weyn iyo webi yar, samee webi gaaban hoosta isku-xirka oo ha ku biiraan labadaba. Natiijooyinku waxay muujiyaan miis isku-xirka. Qiyamka caadiga ah ee natiijooyinkan (contraction 0.1, expansion 0.3, channel hal qayb oo leh composite roughness, nidaamka isku-dhafan ee force-ka gaarka ah) ayaa jiraya ilaa injineer uu dib u eego, natiijooyinkuna way sheegaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"plan-profile-sheets","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xaashiyada qorshaha iyo profiilka","summary":"Khadka waddada u soo saar sida xaashiyo qorshe iyo profiil ah oo ku jira hal PDF, oo leh khadadka isku-xidhka ee u dhexeeya.","section":"tasks","order":58,"keywords":["qorshe iyo profiil","xaashiyo","soo saar","khadka isku-xidhka","pdf","soo saarista qorshaha","qorshayaasha waddada","muuqaalka profiilka","sare u qaadid","set-ka xaashiyada"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-xaashiyada","text":"Samee xaashiyada","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xaashiga-ku-jira","text":"Waxa xaashiga ku jira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXaashiyada qorshaha iyo profiilka waa habka caadiga ah ee loo sawiro qorshayaasha waddada: xaashi kasta wuxuu muujiyaa qayb waddo ah laba jeer, qorshaha sare iyo profiilka hoose, isla miisaanka dhexe, si istaysin kastaa ugu jirto isla meel labadaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-xaashiyada\"\u003ESamee xaashiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro khadka waddada. Ku \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlan and profile sheets\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWarqadda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaanka qorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESare u qaadista profiilka\u003C/strong\u003E (inta jeer ee profiilka uga dheer dhererka uu yahay; 10× ayaa lagu bilaabo). Wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta xaashi ee ay samayso iyo inta khadka waddada ee xaashi kasta muujisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad qayb ka soo saarto khadka waddada, beddel \u003Cstrong\u003EIstaysinka ka bilaabma\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIstaysinka ilaa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload PDF\u003C/span\u003E. PDF-ka waxa ku jira hal bog oo xaashi kasta u ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xaashiga-ku-jira\"\u003EWaxa xaashiga ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQayb\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu muujinayaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorshe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax walba oo ku jira qorshaha (kontuurrada, barta sahanka, khadka waddada iyo istaysinkeeda, kooridorada, padyada, khadadka astaanta, tuubooyinka, khadadka muunadda) oo la rogay si qaybtan ay xaashida uga soo marto, iyo fallaadha waqooyiga oo la rogay si la mid ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka isku-xidhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhad dash-dot ah oo u toosan khadka waddada meel kasta oo ku sii socda xaashi kale, oo lagu calaamadeeyay &quot;Khadka isku-xidhka sta 5+50.00, eeg xaashiga 2&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProfiil\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka jira (xariiq jajaban), qorshaha naqaska (casaan), naqaska tangent kasta iyo PVI kasta oo goobeed, dherer, L iyo K; istaysinnada hoosta, dherarka labada dhinac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiqda cinwaanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca mashruuca, khadka waddada iyo kala-duwanaanshaha istaysinkeeda, &quot;Xaashi 1 ee 3&quot;, miisaannada dhexe iyo dhexe ee dhererka, iyo sare u qaadista\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhererka qayb kasta oo xaashi ahaan waa sida daaqadda qorshuhu u ogolaato miisaanka, oo lagu wareejiyay 50 ft (20 m) oo buuxa marka qaybtu dheer tahay, ama 10 ft (5 m) oo buuxa marka ay gaaban tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka dhererka profiilka aan ku mahayn sare u qaadista aad dooratay, CivilCraft wuxuu xaashi kasta ku sawiraa xagga weyn ee 10×, 5×, 4×, 2× iyo 1× ee ku mahaysa, oo xariiqda xaaladda ayaa taas sheegta. Khadka waddada ee qallooca leh waxa loo rogaa jihada ka bilaabanta ilaa dhamaadka qayb kasta, sidaas darteed waddadu xaashida waxay ku kor-kaci kartaa ama hoos-u-dhici kartaa wax yar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Xaashiyada qorshaha iyo profiilka waa habka caadiga ah ee loo sawiro qorshayaasha waddada: xaashi kasta wuxuu muujiyaa qayb waddo ah laba jeer, qorshaha sare iyo profiilka hoose, isla miisaanka dhexe, si istaysin kastaa ugu jirto isla meel labadaba. Samee xaashiyada Dooro khadka waddada. Ku Guryaha, guji Plan and profile sheets. Dooro Warqadda, Miisaanka qorshaha iyo Sare u qaadista profiilka (inta jeer ee profiilka uga dheer dhererka uu yahay; 10× ayaa lagu bilaabo). Wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta xaashi ee ay samayso iyo inta khadka waddada ee xaashi kasta muujisa. Si aad qayb ka soo saarto khadka waddada, beddel Istaysinka ka bilaabma iyo Istaysinka ilaa. Guji Download PDF. PDF-ka waxa ku jira hal bog oo xaashi kasta u ah. Waxa xaashiga ku jira Qayb Waxa uu muujinayaa Qorshe Wax walba oo ku jira qorshaha (kontuurrada, barta sahanka, khadka waddada iyo istaysinkeeda, kooridorada, padyada, khadadka astaanta, tuubooyinka, khadadka muunadda) oo la rogay si qaybtan ay xaashida uga soo marto, iyo fallaadha waqooyiga oo la rogay si la mid ah Khadadka isku-xidhka Khad dash-dot ah oo u toosan khadka waddada meel kasta oo ku sii socda xaashi kale, oo lagu calaamadeeyay \"Khadka isku-xidhka sta 5+50.00, eeg xaashiga 2\" Profiil Dhulka jira (xariiq jajaban), qorshaha naqaska (casaan), naqaska tangent kasta iyo PVI kasta oo goobeed, dherer, L iyo K; istaysinnada hoosta, dherarka labada dhinac Xarriiqda cinwaanka Magaca mashruuca, khadka waddada iyo kala-duwanaanshaha istaysinkeeda, \"Xaashi 1 ee 3\", miisaannada dhexe iyo dhexe ee dhererka, iyo sare u qaadista Dhererka qayb kasta oo xaashi ahaan waa sida daaqadda qorshuhu u ogolaato miisaanka, oo lagu wareejiyay 50 ft (20 m) oo buuxa marka qaybtu dheer tahay, ama 10 ft (5 m) oo buuxa marka ay gaaban tahay. Marka dhererka profiilka aan ku mahayn sare u qaadista aad dooratay, CivilCraft wuxuu xaashi kasta ku sawiraa xagga weyn ee 10×, 5×, 4×, 2× iyo 1× ee ku mahaysa, oo xariiqda xaaladda ayaa taas sheegta. Khadka waddada ee qallooca leh waxa loo rogaa jihada ka bilaabanta ilaa dhamaadka qayb kasta, sidaas darteed waddadu xaashida waxay ku kor-kaci kartaa ama hoos-u-dhici kartaa wax yar.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"address-to-site","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Cinwaanka ilaa goobta","summary":"Ka beddel cinwaan wax u sheegta goobta waxa ay u baahan tahay in la ogaado: qeybta dhulka, dhismayaasha ku wareegsan, qaabeynta dhulka, ciidda iyo aagga daadka, iyada oo laga helayo xog furan oo aad ku codsato badhanka ama aad u keento fayl ahaan, kuna gudbiso BimCraft talooyin ahaan.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["cinwaan","geocode","goob","qeybta dhulka","dhismayaasha","qaabeynta dhulka","ciid","daad","xog furan","openstreetmap","fema","ssurgo","usgs","xaaladda hareeraha","ccsite","bimcraft"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-uu-sameeyo","text":"Waxa uu sameeyo","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-isticmaalo","text":"Sida loo isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-sameeyo\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha › Dheeraad › Cinwaanka ilaa goobta wuxuu u jawaabaa barta: qeybta dhulka ee ay ku taal, dhismayaasha ku wareegsan, qaabeynta dhulka, ciidda iyo aagga daadka. Xogtu waa furan tahay: faylal aad ku darto (GeoJSON, shapefile, KML, GeoPackage) iyo, marka aad shido kordhinta, badhamo kasta oo codsta hal adeeg furan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-isticmaalo\"\u003ESida loo isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor cinwaan oo riix badhanka raadinta cinwaanka (kordhinta &quot;Address search&quot;), ama qor latitude iyo longitude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar lakabyada: faylal oo leh &quot;Add files&quot;, ama badhamada ilaha kale (aagga daadka, dhismayaasha, ciidda, dhererka dhulka, qeybaha dhulka ee degmada). Adeeg waxaa la weydiiyaa kaliya marka aad riixdo badhankiisa; wax lagama soo qaadayo marka bilowga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix badhanka socodsiinta si aad u hesho jawaabta hadal ahaan, iyo CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Kaydi goobta fayl ahaan&quot; ama &quot;U dir BimCraft talooyin ahaan&quot; wuxuu siinayaa khadadka BimCraft ama ModelCraft; iyagu waa liistaa oo waxay ku daraan kaliya waxa aad calaamadiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaadinta cinwaanka waxay mareysaa getcadcraft.com, taas oo adiga kuu weydiisa OpenStreetMap&#039;s Nominatim (hal codsi ilbiriqsi kasta ugu badnaan; jawaabaha waxaa la hayaa 90 maalmood si cinwaan isku mid ah aan mar kale loo weydiin. Waxaa la kaydiyaa kaliya xashiishka cinwaanka, qofka weydiiyay weligiis ma la kaydiyo). Badhamada kale waxay si toos ah u gaadhaan adeegoodooda brawsarkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlaha kasta wuxuu leeyahay liisanskiisa (OpenStreetMap waa ODbL: ku hay sadarka aqoonsiga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELakabyadu waxay ku fiican yihiin sida xogta furan ee meeshaada u fiican tahay. Wax muhiim ah ka hubi iyada oo laga barbardhigayo sahanka dhulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa uu sameeyo Dusha › Dheeraad › Cinwaanka ilaa goobta wuxuu u jawaabaa barta: qeybta dhulka ee ay ku taal, dhismayaasha ku wareegsan, qaabeynta dhulka, ciidda iyo aagga daadka. Xogtu waa furan tahay: faylal aad ku darto (GeoJSON, shapefile, KML, GeoPackage) iyo, marka aad shido kordhinta, badhamo kasta oo codsta hal adeeg furan. Sida loo isticmaalo Qor cinwaan oo riix badhanka raadinta cinwaanka (kordhinta \"Address search\"), ama qor latitude iyo longitude. Ku dar lakabyada: faylal oo leh \"Add files\", ama badhamada ilaha kale (aagga daadka, dhismayaasha, ciidda, dhererka dhulka, qeybaha dhulka ee degmada). Adeeg waxaa la weydiiyaa kaliya marka aad riixdo badhankiisa; wax lagama soo qaadayo marka bilowga. Riix badhanka socodsiinta si aad u hesho jawaabta hadal ahaan, iyo CSV. \"Kaydi goobta fayl ahaan\" ama \"U dir BimCraft talooyin ahaan\" wuxuu siinayaa khadadka BimCraft ama ModelCraft; iyagu waa liistaa oo waxay ku daraan kaliya waxa aad calaamadiso. Waxa aad ogaataa Raadinta cinwaanka waxay mareysaa getcadcraft.com, taas oo adiga kuu weydiisa OpenStreetMap's Nominatim (hal codsi ilbiriqsi kasta ugu badnaan; jawaabaha waxaa la hayaa 90 maalmood si cinwaan isku mid ah aan mar kale loo weydiin. Waxaa la kaydiyaa kaliya xashiishka cinwaanka, qofka weydiiyay weligiis ma la kaydiyo). Badhamada kale waxay si toos ah u gaadhaan adeegoodooda brawsarkaaga. Ilaha kasta wuxuu leeyahay liisanskiisa (OpenStreetMap waa ODbL: ku hay sadarka aqoonsiga). Lakabyadu waxay ku fiican yihiin sida xogta furan ee meeshaada u fiican tahay. Wax muhiim ah ka hubi iyada oo laga barbardhigayo sahanka dhulka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"assistants","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Ka dhig caawiye AI inuu kaalmeeyo goobtaada","summary":"Hirgeli caawiyeyaasha Dejinta si caawiye ku yaal kombiyuutarkaaga u akhrin karo goobta furan (dhibcaha, dusha, mugyada, muuqaalada dherer, qeybaha dhulka), u ku dari karo dhibcaha sahanka, u kaydin karo oo u dhoofin karo LandXML ama DWG, iyada oo loo marayo CadCraft Studio. Waa la damiyaa ilaa aad shido.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["ai","caawiye","mcp","script","automation","studio","dhibcaha","kor u kac","station","offset","jid-hagaha","mug","goyn","buuxin","muuqaal dherer","qeybta dhulka","landxml","dwg","usd","galleyda","ogolaansho","ka jaree","dhaqdhaqaaq"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad baran doontaa","level":2},{"id":"waxa-caawiyuhu-samayn-karo-civilcraft","text":"Waxa caawiyuhu samayn karo CivilCraft","level":2},{"id":"shid","text":"Shid","level":2},{"id":"intii-caawiyuhu-xiran-yahay","text":"Intii caawiyuhu xiran yahay","level":2},{"id":"iyada-oo-aan-civilcraft-la-furin","text":"Iyada oo aan CivilCraft la furin","level":2},{"id":"demi","text":"Demi","level":2},{"id":"eeg-sidoo-kale","text":"Eeg sidoo kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida loo oggolaado caawiye AI (caawiye kasta oo ku hadla MCP) inuu ka shaqeeyo goobta aad furtay, waxa uu samayn karo iyo waxa aanu samayn karin, iyo sida loo joojiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-caawiyuhu-samayn-karo-civilcraft\"\u003EWaxa caawiyuhu samayn karo CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu weydiiyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu helayaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu u baahan yahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca, unit-yada, nidaamka isku-xirka, kooxaha dhibcaha, jid-hagayaasha, dusha, pad-yada, qeybaha dhulka iyo tuubooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha sahanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELambarka, easting, northing, kor u kac iyo sharaxaad, kooxda, sharaxaadda ama gudaha sanduuq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKor u kaca dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka jira (ama dusha la simay) meelaha uu magacaabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStations iyo offsets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStation-ka iyo offset-ka dhibcaha jid-hagaha dhexdiisa, ama isku-xirka iyo kor u kaca dhulka ee stations-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaal dherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka jira, naqshadda naqshadeynta iyo dusha la simay kor u kaca jid-hagaha dhexdiisa, masaafo kasta oo feet ama mitir ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoyn iyo buuxin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMugga u dhexeeya dhulka jira iyo dusha la simay (pad kasta iyo corridor kasta sidoo kale), ama u dhexeeya dhulka iyo heer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQeybaha dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeeska, aagga (acres ama hectares), perimeter iyo sharaxaadda sharciga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoorasho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha la doortay ayaa lagu calaamadiyaa qorshaha, sida haddii aad doorato\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha cusub ee sahanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha lagu daray lambarrada uu bixiyo, ama kuwa xiga ee bannaan. Wac kasta waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E ee CivilCraft-ka laftiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELandXML ama DWG\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylalka isku mid ah ee badhamada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandXML\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobta 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpenUSD (.usdz, .usda ama .usdc) ee dhulka jira, dusha la simay, pad-yada iyo tuubooyinka, sida muuqaalka 3D u dhoofiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhirta iyo jadwalka dhirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhirta laga helo liiska dhirta magac kasta, iyo tirinta jadwalka dhirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeerta iyo simaynta dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhir, beer ama xayd la geliyay, ama platform, berm, swale ama aag simaynta lagu daray, mid kasta oo hal tallaabo ah oo aad ka noqon karto, oo ay weheliso goyntiisa iyo buuxinteeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHubinta biyo-qulqulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQulqulka aag kasta, cadaadiska loo baahan yahay valve-kiisa iyo bixinta, madaxa xaaladda ugu xun, waqtiyada socodka, dhibaatooyinka iyo liiska alaabta, oo ah caawin xisaabeed oo naqshadeeyaha biyo-qulqulku hubiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu ka shaqeeyaa goobta furan. Studio-da wuxuu sidoo kale ku kaydin karaa oo dhoofin karaa galleyda aad doorato (hoose); galla la&#039;aanteed faylashiisu waxay soo dejin doonaan sida badhamadu soo dejiyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shid\"\u003EShid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawiyeyaasha waxay gaadhaan CivilCraft iyada oo loo marayo CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga; brawsarka caadiga ah ma leh hab uu ku galo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EAssistants\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadi &quot;Oggolow caawiyeyaasha AI iyo script-yada inay isticmaalaan CivilCraft&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E (Akhri) waa la calaamadiyay adiga. Calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E (Wax ka beddel), \u003Cstrong\u003ESave\u003C/strong\u003E (Kaydi) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E (Dhoofin) kaliya marka caawiyuhu u baahdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi uu u kaydiyo oo u dhoofiyo galka, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a folder…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EFolders it may use\u003C/strong\u003E (Galleyda uu isticmaali karo) oo dooro galka dialogka Studio. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E wuu soo celinayaa isla markiiba; jid kasta oo kale waa la diidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu xidh caawiyaha Studio (Studio wuxuu muujinayaa cinwaanka iyo dejinta lagu dhejiyo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"intii-caawiyuhu-xiran-yahay\"\u003EIntii caawiyuhu xiran yahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoraal ku yaal qeybta sare ee dhinaca midig wuxuu sheegayaa caawiyaha xiran iyo waxa uu samayn karo. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDisconnect\u003C/span\u003E si aad isla markiiba u dhammaysato fadhigiisa; wuxuu u baahan yahay inuu mar kale xirmo si uu u sii wado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EActivity\u003C/strong\u003E (Dhaqdhaqaaqa), hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EAssistants\u003C/strong\u003E ee Settings, wuxuu liistaa wac kasta oo caawiyuhu sameeyay, kan ugu dambeeyay marka hore, iyo in uu shaqeeyay ama uusan shaqeynin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu weydii erayo fudud, tusaale ahaan &quot;waa maxay kor u kaca dhulka 50 feet kasta oo ku dhex jira Main Street?&quot;, &quot;goyn iyo buuxin intee in leh ayey pad-yadu u baahan yihiin?&quot; ama &quot;ku dar dhibic kontaroolka ah iyadoo laga raacayo isku-xirkan&quot;. Caawiyuhu wuu akhrin doonaa goobta oo jawaab bixin doonaa, ama wuxuu samayn doonaa isbeddelka hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iyada-oo-aan-civilcraft-la-furin\"\u003EIyada oo aan CivilCraft la furin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EServer-ka faylalka ee caawiyeyaasha (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp\u003C/code\u003E) iyo amarka \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line waxay furaan mashaariicda la kaydiyay (\u003Ccode\u003E.civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E) iyo faylalka dhibcaha, iyagoo isticmaalaya koodka CivilCraft-ka, aan daaqad lahayn: isla qalabyada akhrinta, ku darista dhibcaha, kaydinta mashruuca, LandXML iyo goobta 3D sida OpenUSD. \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert site.civilcraft.json site.xml\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu qoraa LandXML amarka command line-ka. Furidda LandXML, dhoofinta DWG iyo qalabyada meesha shaqada Landscape wali waxay u baahan yihiin daaqadda CivilCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"demi\"\u003EDemi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa saar calaamadda &quot;Oggolow caawiyeyaasha AI iyo script-yada inay isticmaalaan CivilCraft&quot;. Caawiye kasta waa la xiriiriyaa isla markiiba, dejintuna waa la kaydiyaa xilli kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-sidoo-kale\"\u003EEeg sidoo kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ECuntooyinka caawiyeyaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E: tusaalooyin, mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu wacayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/alignment\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/alignment\"\u003EQorso jid-hagaha toosan\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EDhis oo hagaaji dusha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/copy-paste-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/copy-paste-points\"\u003EDooro, koobiyee oo dhaji dhibcaha sahanka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontaa Sida loo oggolaado caawiye AI (caawiye kasta oo ku hadla MCP) inuu ka shaqeeyo goobta aad furtay, waxa uu samayn karo iyo waxa aanu samayn karin, iyo sida loo joojiyo. Waxa caawiyuhu samayn karo CivilCraft Wuxuu weydiiyaa Waxa uu helayaa Wuxuu u baahan yahay Goobta Magaca, unit-yada, nidaamka isku-xirka, kooxaha dhibcaha, jid-hagayaasha, dusha, pad-yada, qeybaha dhulka iyo tuubooyinka Akhri Dhibcaha sahanka Lambarka, easting, northing, kor u kac iyo sharaxaad, kooxda, sharaxaadda ama gudaha sanduuq Akhri Kor u kaca dusha Dhulka jira (ama dusha la simay) meelaha uu magacaabo Akhri Stations iyo offsets Station-ka iyo offset-ka dhibcaha jid-hagaha dhexdiisa, ama isku-xirka iyo kor u kaca dhulka ee stations-ka Akhri Muuqaal dherer Dhulka jira, naqshadda naqshadeynta iyo dusha la simay kor u kaca jid-hagaha dhexdiisa, masaafo kasta oo feet ama mitir ah Akhri Goyn iyo buuxin Mugga u dhexeeya dhulka jira iyo dusha la simay (pad kasta iyo corridor kasta sidoo kale), ama u dhexeeya dhulka iyo heer Akhri Qeybaha dhulka Geeska, aagga (acres ama hectares), perimeter iyo sharaxaadda sharciga Akhri Doorasho Dhibcaha la doortay ayaa lagu calaamadiyaa qorshaha, sida haddii aad doorato Wax ka beddel Dhibcaha cusub ee sahanka Dhibcaha lagu daray lambarrada uu bixiyo, ama kuwa xiga ee bannaan. Wac kasta waa hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto Wax ka beddel Kaydi Badhanka Save ee CivilCraft-ka laftiisa Kaydi LandXML ama DWG Faylalka isku mid ah ee badhamada LandXML iyo DWG Dhoofin Goobta 3D OpenUSD (.usdz, .usda ama .usdc) ee dhulka jira, dusha la simay, pad-yada iyo tuubooyinka, sida muuqaalka 3D u dhoofiyo Dhoofin Dhirta iyo jadwalka dhirta Dhirta laga helo liiska dhirta magac kasta, iyo tirinta jadwalka dhirta Akhri Beerta iyo simaynta dhulka Dhir, beer ama xayd la geliyay, ama platform, berm, swale ama aag simaynta lagu daray, mid kasta oo hal tallaabo ah oo aad ka noqon karto, oo ay weheliso goyntiisa iyo buuxinteeda Wax ka beddel Hubinta biyo-qulqulka Qulqulka aag kasta, cadaadiska loo baahan yahay valve-kiisa iyo bixinta, madaxa xaaladda ugu xun, waqtiyada socodka, dhibaatooyinka iyo liiska alaabta, oo ah caawin xisaabeed oo naqshadeeyaha biyo-qulqulku hubiyo Akhri Wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa goobta furan. Studio-da wuxuu sidoo kale ku kaydin karaa oo dhoofin karaa galleyda aad doorato (hoose); galla la'aanteed faylashiisu waxay soo dejin doonaan sida badhamadu soo dejiyaan. Shid Caawiyeyaasha waxay gaadhaan CivilCraft iyada oo loo marayo CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga; brawsarka caadiga ah ma leh hab uu ku galo. Furo Settings oo dooro tab-ka CivilCraft. Hoosta Assistants, calaamadi \"Oggolow caawiyeyaasha AI iyo script-yada inay isticmaalaan CivilCraft\". Read (Akhri) waa la calaamadiyay adiga. Calaamadi Edit (Wax ka beddel), Save (Kaydi) ama Export (Dhoofin) kaliya marka caawiyuhu u baahdo. Si uu u kaydiyo oo u dhoofiyo galka, dooro Add a folder… hoosta Folders it may use (Galleyda uu isticmaali karo) oo dooro galka dialogka Studio. Remove wuu soo celinayaa isla markiiba; jid kasta oo kale waa la diidaa. Ku xidh caawiyaha Studio (Studio wuxuu muujinayaa cinwaanka iyo dejinta lagu dhejiyo). Intii caawiyuhu xiran yahay Qoraal ku yaal qeybta sare ee dhinaca midig wuxuu sheegayaa caawiyaha xiran iyo waxa uu samayn karo. Guji Disconnect si aad isla markiiba u dhammaysato fadhigiisa; wuxuu u baahan yahay inuu mar kale xirmo si uu u sii wado. Activity (Dhaqdhaqaaqa), hoosta Assistants ee Settings, wuxuu liistaa wac kasta oo caawiyuhu sameeyay, kan ugu dambeeyay marka hore, iyo in uu shaqeeyay ama uusan shaqeynin. Ku weydii erayo fudud, tusaale ahaan \"waa maxay kor u kaca dhulka 50 feet kasta oo ku dhex jira Main Street?\", \"goyn iyo buuxin intee in leh ayey pad-yadu u baahan yihiin?\" ama \"ku dar dhibic kontaroolka ah iyadoo laga raacayo isku-xirkan\". Caawiyuhu wuu akhrin doonaa goobta oo jawaab bixin doonaa, ama wuxuu samayn doonaa isbeddelka hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto. Iyada oo aan CivilCraft la furin Server-ka faylalka ee caawiyeyaasha (npx @getcadcraft/mcp) iyo amarka cadcraft command line waxay furaan mashaariicda la kaydiyay (.civilcraft.json) iyo faylalka dhibcaha, iyagoo isticmaalaya koodka CivilCraft-ka, aan daaqad lahayn: isla qalabyada akhrinta, ku darista dhibcaha, kaydinta mashruuca, LandXML iyo goobta 3D sida OpenUSD. cadcraft convert site.civilcraft.json site.xml wuxuu qoraa LandXML amarka command line-ka. Furidda LandXML, dhoofinta DWG iyo qalabyada meesha shaqada Landscape wali waxay u baahan yihiin daaqadda CivilCraft. Demi Ka saar calaamadda \"Oggolow caawiyeyaasha AI iyo script-yada inay isticmaalaan CivilCraft\". Caawiye kasta waa la xiriiriyaa isla markiiba, dejintuna waa la kaydiyaa xilli kale. Eeg sidoo kale Cuntooyinka caawiyeyaasha AI: tusaalooyin, mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu wacayo. Qorso jid-hagaha toosan Dhis oo hagaaji dusha Dooro, koobiyee oo dhaji dhibcaha sahanka Dejinta CivilCraft","lang":"so"},{"slug":"corridor","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Wareeji kooridor waddo","summary":"Shid kooridor khadka waddada, dejii qiimayaasha dariiqa, garabka iyo jeexjeexa dhinaca, oo akhri qaybaha, iftiinka dhulka iyo shaqada dhulka uu soo saaro.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["isgoys","isgoysyo","waddo la kulmo waddo","waddo dhinac","isgoys T","isgudub","heerka padka","ku xidh","isku xidh","kor-u-kac dhinac","super","bangi","runoff","runout","miiska heerka","jeexjeexa dhinac-dhinac","jeeste","kooridor","assembly","subassembly","qaybta caadiga ah","waddo","dariiq","garab","jeexjeexa dhinaca","iftiin dhul","jarid","buuxin","qaybaha","bartilmaameed","bartilmaameedka ballaca","bartilmaameedka sare-marka","ballac","cidla dusha waddada","kooridor raacaya kooridor kale"],"headings":[{"id":"assembly-ga","text":"Assembly-ga","level":2},{"id":"dhis-kooridorka","text":"Dhis kooridorka","level":2},{"id":"marka-aan-dhisin","text":"Marka aan dhisin","level":2},{"id":"kooridorada-iyo-padyada-wada","text":"Kooridorada iyo padyada wada","level":2},{"id":"kor-u-kac-dhinac","text":"Kor-u-kac dhinac","level":2},{"id":"bartilmaameedyada","text":"Bartilmaameedyada","level":2},{"id":"dhinac-kasta-ka-dhis-qaybaha","text":"Dhinac kasta ka dhis qaybaha","level":2},{"id":"lakabyada-dusha","text":"Lakabyada dusha","level":2},{"id":"meelaha-waddooyinku-ku-kulmaan-waddooyin-padyo-iyo-jidad","text":"Meelaha waddooyinku ku kulmaan waddooyin, padyo iyo jidad","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-dhisin","text":"Wali lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKooridor waxa uu hal qaybta caadiga ah ee fudud (assembly) ku wareejiyaa khadka waddada iyo muuqaalka dherer ee naqshadda, dhulka jira ayuu ku habeeyaa jeexjeex, natiijadana wuxuu ku daraa dusha la soo jeediyay. Khadka waddo wuxuu qaadi karaa kooridorro dhowr ah oo ku kala duwan xadka isteeshannada, kooridorna waxa laga dhisi karaa qaababka dib loo isticmaali karo isteeshan ahaan (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor-templates\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor-templates\"\u003EQaababka kooridorka\u003C/a\u003E). Assembly-ga fudud ee hoose labada dhinac way isku mid yihiin; dhinac kasta qaybaha u gaar ahaan u lahaadaan, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor#build-each-side-from-parts\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor\" data-hash=\"build-each-side-from-parts\"\u003EDhinac kasta ka dhis qaybaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assembly-ga\"\u003EAssembly-ga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaga bilaabo dhexdhexaadka khadka oo bannaanka u socda, dhinac kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Edariiq\u003C/strong\u003E oo ballac la siiyay, oo ka hoosaysa qoorta \u003Cstrong\u003Ejeexjeexa dariiqa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Egarab\u003C/strong\u003E oo ballac la siiyay, oo \u003Cstrong\u003Ejeexjeexa garabka\u003C/strong\u003E leh\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ejeexjeexa dhinaca\u003C/strong\u003E laga bilaabo cidlada garabka ilaa meesha ay dhulka la kulanto: \u003Cstrong\u003Ejeexjeexa jarista\u003C/strong\u003E meesha dhulku sare yahay, \u003Cstrong\u003Ejeexjeexa buuxinta\u003C/strong\u003E meesha uu hoose yahay\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiimayaasha bilowga ah waa meel-hayn, ma aha heer naqshadeed:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiimaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFeet (US)\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMitir\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBallaca dariiqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3.6 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJeexjeexa dariiqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2%\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBallaca garabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.2 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJeexjeexa garabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4%\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJeexjeexa jarista\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 : 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 : 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJeexjeexa buuxinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3 : 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3 : 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJeexjeexyada dhinacyada waxa lagu qiyaasaa aaga toosan ilaa toosan (H:V): 3 : 1 waxay ka dhigan tahay 3 bannaanka 1 hoos.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhis-kooridorka\"\u003EDhis kooridorka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad u baahan tahay khad waddo aan khalad lahayn iyo muuqaal dherer naqshadeed oo leh ugu yaraan laba PVI iyo aan khalad lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro khadka waddada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGarabka midig, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKooridor\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EAssembly-ga ku wareeji muuqaalka dherer ee naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Goobaha ayaa soo muuqda oo kooridorka isla markiiba la dhisaa. Qorshuhu wuxuu tusayaa cidlada dariiqa iyo garabka iyo khadadka iftiinka; markii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELa soo jeediyay (la sameeyay)\u003C/span\u003E la doorto hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E, konturada ayaa tusaya dhulka cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBedel qiime kasta: \u003Cstrong\u003EBallaca dariiqa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJeexjeexa dariiqa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBallaca garabka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJeexjeexa garabka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJeexjeexa jarista\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJeexjeexa buuxinta\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQayb kasta\u003C/strong\u003E. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kasta ka dib. Jarista, buuxinta iyo masaafada qaybaha waa inay ka weyn yihiin 0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri sadarka hoos goobaha, tusaale ahaan &quot;39 qaybood laga bilaabo 0+00.00 ilaa 3+86.36; jarista 240.2 cu yd, buuxinta 556.0 cu yd.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha waa la jaraa tallaabo kasta oo \u003Cstrong\u003EQayb kasta\u003C/strong\u003E, dhamaadka khadka, iyo bilowga iyo dhamaadka wareeg kasta oo toosan iyo kan toosan ah. Qayb kasta iyo khadadka ku jira (dhexdhexaadka, cidlada dariiqa iyo garabka, iftiinka) waxay noqdaan khadadka jejebinta ee dusha la soo jeediyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad kooridorka u damiso, ka saar calaamadda sanduuqa. Qiimayaashiisa waa la kaydiyaa marka xigta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-aan-dhisin\"\u003EMarka aan dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuq casaan ah oo hoos goobaha ayaa sababta sheegaysa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooridorku wuxuu u baahan yahay muuqaal dherer naqshadeed oo aan khalad lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar PVI, ama hagaaji wareegyada toosan ee is-dhex-galaya (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/profile\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/profile\"\u003ENaqshadee muuqaal dherer toosan\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka naqshadda ma is-dhex-galo khadka waddada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu rid PVI-yada xadka isteeshannada khadka waddada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooridorku wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan laba qayb dusha dhexdeeda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta badan kooridorka waa ka baxsan dhulka jira.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 jeexjeexa dhinac ayaa ka baxa dusha ka hor inta aysan dhulka gaarin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinaca dusha ee ku dhow, jeexjeexa ma gaari karo dhulka. Ka dhig waddada meel ka fog cidlada, ama yaree dhererka buuxinta ama jarista halkaas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka iftiinka kooridorka way isgoyaan (qaybaha way is-dul marayaan, tusaale ahaan dhinaca gudaha ee wareeg adag). Isticmaal raadiyo weyn ama assembly ballac yar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha dhinaca gudaha ee wareeg adag way is-dul marayaan. Kor u qaad raadiyaha ama yaree assembly-ga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooridor leh dhibaato ma la jeexjeexi karo, ma tirinayo shaqada dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kooridorada-iyo-padyada-wada\"\u003EKooridorada iyo padyada wada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha la soo jeediyay waxa lagu dhisaa tartiib: marka hore kooridor kasta, markaas pad kasta. Meel uu jeexjeexa padka la kulmo kooridor, padku wuu guuleystaa. Meel shay dambe uu waddo la kulmo, qaybta waddada ku jirta iftiinka shayga dambe oo kaliya ayaa la beddelaa; inta kale ee waddada, iyo khadka jejebinta dhulka ee ay waddadu gudubto, waa ay ku joogaan qaabkooda. Mugyada waxa lagu xisaabiyaa dhammaan khadadka iftiinka hal mar; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EMugyada shaqada dhulka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kor-u-kac-dhinac\"\u003EKor-u-kac dhinac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWareeg dhexdiisa waddadu waxay u janjeeri kartaa dhinaca gudaha, si gaadiidku dibadda ugu riix yar yahay. Calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EKor-u-kac wareegyada\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKor-u-kac dhinac\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E khadka waddada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareeg kasta oo goobo ah wuxuu qaadaa heerka \u003Cstrong\u003Ee\u003C/strong\u003E miiska heerka: safka hore oo raadiyihiisa wareeggu gaaro (safka heerkiisa madhan wuxuu hayaa qoorta caadiga ah). Miiska iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJeexjeexa ugu badan ee isbedelka\u003C/strong\u003E (0.5 % bilowga) waa meel-hayn, ma aha heer caadi: ku dheji kuwaaga naqshaddaada. Ku dar ama ka saar safafka sida aad u baahan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDariiqyadu waxay ku wareegaan dhexdhexaadka khadka. Ka hor wareegga dariiqa dibadda ayaa fidsanaya \u003Cstrong\u003Erunout\u003C/strong\u003E (qoorta caadiga ah ÷ e × runoff), kadib \u003Cstrong\u003Erunoff\u003C/strong\u003E (ballaca dariiqa × e ÷ jeexjeexa) dariiqa dibadda ayaa weli wareeggaysa ilaa waddada oo dhan ay ku jeexjeexan tahay e u janjeera dhinaca gudaha; saddex meelood laba meelood runoff-ka waxay ka horreeyaan wareegga, hal meel saddex ee ku jirta. Wareegga ka dib wax isku mid ah ayaa dhacaya oo rogan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGarabka dhinaca hoose weligii kama fiicna dariiqiisa; dhinaca sare wuxuu hayaa jeexjeexiisa (wuu rogmadaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiiska hoosta wuxuu liistaa raadiyaha wareeg kasta, heerka, runoff iyo runout, iyo meesha kor-u-kaca buuxa ka bilaabanayso iyo ka dhamaanayso. \u003Cstrong\u003EJaantuska kor-u-kaca\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu soo rogayaa jeexjeexyada dhinacyada labada dariiq isteeshannada dhexdooda (dariiqa bidix oo buuxa, midigna oo jajaban).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareeg aad u gaaban si uu u gaaro kor-u-kac buuxa, ama laba wareeg oo isbedelkoodu is-dhex-galo, waxa sanduuq ka sare miiska lagu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha, mugyada, muuqaalka 3D iyo xaashiyadu dhammaantood waddada jeexjeexan ayay tusaan. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa celisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bartilmaameedyada\"\u003EBartilmaameedyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBartilmaameed wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa hal barta hal dhinac oo waddada ah oo u gaarta khad: \u003Cstrong\u003ECidlada dusha waddada\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ECidlada garabka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBidix\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMidig\u003C/strong\u003E. Qayb kasta khadka waxay la kulantaa si toosan dhexdhexaadka, oo waxay u bixi dhinacaas oo kaliya, sidaas darteed bartilmaameed midig ma dhaqaajiso dhinaca bidix abid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejiya\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa dhaca meesha qayb khadka la kulanto\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBallac\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta waxay ku taallaa khadka: dariiqa (ama garabka) ayaa ballacaad ama yaraada ilaa khadka, isagoo ilaalinaya jeexjeexa dhinaca.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESare-mar\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta waxay qaadaa sare-marka khadka meeshaas, joogteeda gaarka ah: jeexjeexa dariiqa (ama garabka) ayaa raacda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadku wuxuu noqon karaa khad muhiim ah (ayuu \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaalkiisu\u003C/strong\u003E yahay) ama khad kooridor kale: dhexdhexaadkiisa, cidlada dusha waddada, cidlada garabka ama khadadka iftiinka. Khadka kooridor wuxuu raacaa kooridorkaas: haddii waddada kale la beddelo, kan tan ayaa raacda. CivilCraft wuxuu marka hore dhisaa kooridorka kale; labada kooridor oo isku bartilmaameedsan xalqad ah dhinac hal ayaa la diidaa, miiskuna wuu sheegaa kee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro khadka waddada oo shid kooridorkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBartilmaameedyada\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar bartilmaameedka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta\u003C/strong\u003E, waxa ay \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinayso\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka\u003C/strong\u003E. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENatiijada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay sheegaysaa qaybaha imisa ee khadku gaaray. Qaybaha aan gaarin (ka baxsan dhamaadkiisa, ama meesha ay ka gadaal dhexdhexaadka ku jirto) waxay sii hayaan qiimayaasha assembly-ga. Khad la tirtiro wuxuu kooridorka ku soo celiyaa sidii ay ahayd ka hor bartilmaameedka, miiskuna wuu sheegaa. Dhinac kasta wuxuu u yeelan karaa hal bartilmaameed ballac iyo hal sare-mar barta kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhinac-kasta-ka-dhis-qaybaha\"\u003EDhinac kasta ka dhis qaybaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShid \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac kasta ka dhis qaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta dejinta kooridorka. Dhinac kasta markaas liis gaar ah ayuu leeyahay, laga bilaabo dhexdhexaadka dibadda: dariiqyada, garab, marinka biyaha, \u003Cstrong\u003Ekerbi\u003C/strong\u003E, xariiqda beerta, waddada socodka iyo, ugu dambeyntii, jeexjeexa dhinaca ilaa dhulka (oo leh saamiyadiisa jarista iyo buuxinta). Ka bilow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaddo miyi\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaddo magaalo\u003C/span\u003E, ku dar oo ka saar qaybaha, u dhaqaaji fallaadhaha, oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E dhinac ka dhig dhinac kale. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJeexjeexa dhinac-dhinac waa hoos-u-dhaca ka fogaanaya waddada, sidaas darteed waddo socod ah oo biyaha u dirta waddada waa mid taban. Kerbi waa wajiga sare ee aad siiso, sare oo ballac aad siiso iyo hoos-u-dhac ikhtiyaari ah dhabarka. Kor-u-kacu wuxuu wareejiyaa dariiq kasta safka hore; marinka biyaha, kerbiga, xariiqda iyo waddada socodka waxay ka laabanayaan cidlada dariiqyada sida loo dhisay. Bartilmaameedyadu wali waxay dhaqaajiyaan dhamaadka dariiqyada iyo qaybta ugu dambeysa. Qaybaha jeexjeexa waxay calaamadiyaan khadka biyaha marinka, sare iyo dabada kerbiga, iyo wixii kale. Wareeg leh spiral-yo, runoff-ka waa spiral-ka: qoorta sinaha TS-ka, kor-u-kaca buuxa SC-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lakabyada-dusha\"\u003ELakabyada dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDariiq, garab, marin biyaha, xariiqda beerta ama waddada socodka ayaa qaadi kara dhismihiisa: hoosta qaybta, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar lakab\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa lakab magac, walax, dhumuc iyo nooceeda (dusha, binder, saldhig, saldhig hoose, daboolka ama kale), kolkaas hoos u sii. Lakabyadu ma dhaqaajiyaan dusha waddada (sare-kiisu waa dusha naqshadda); lakab kasta wuxuu ku jiraa qaybtiisa hoosteeda, qotodheeftiisa oo toosan hoos loo cabbiraa. Qaybaha jeexjeexa waxay sawiraan hoosta lakab kasta sida khad jajaban, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELakabyada dusha: tirooyin\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa qorshaha dhulka iyo mugga lakab kasta (bedka kooridorka dheer ee qaybahiisa, mugga = bed × dhumuc). Dhoofinta IFC wuxuu qoraa lakab kasta sida unug gaar ah oo leh dhumucdeeda iyo walaxdeeda (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ifc\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ifc\"\u003EDhoofinta iyo soo gelinta IFC\u003C/a\u003E). Dhumucda aad ku qorto waa kaaga; CivilCraft ma cabbiro dusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meelaha-waddooyinku-ku-kulmaan-waddooyin-padyo-iyo-jidad\"\u003EMeelaha waddooyinku ku kulmaan waddooyin, padyo iyo jidad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh waddooyinka iyo padyada ay taabanayaan\u003C/span\u003E la shiido (waa la shidaa kooridor kasta), CivilCraft wuxuu kooridorka ku xidhaa waxa uu qorshaha ku kulmo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaddo ku dhamaada waddo kale\u003C/strong\u003E (dhamaadka khadkiisa waddada kale ayuu saaran yahay, ama ku dhow qiyaastii badhka ballaca dusha waddadiisa ee geedka waddadaas) waa waddada dhinaca ee isgoysyada. Waddada ay la kulanto ayaa geedkeeda u furta dusha waddada dhinaca; afka dhexdiisa garabka, kerbiga, xariiqda iyo waddada socodka waxay ku dhigmaan jeexjeexa dhinac dariiqa, waxayna u muuqdaan dusha waddo. Waddada dhinaca waxay ku dhigmaan dusha waddada weyn meesha ay isku dul maraan, waxayna u kor-u-kacaan ama hoos u dhacaan ilaa ay gaarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELabo waddo oo isgoysa\u003C/strong\u003E waxay isku xirmaan siday isku mid tahay labada dhinac. Waddada ugu horreysa liiska Khadadka waddada waa waddada toos ah; kan kale ayaa raacda dusheeda gudihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaddo ku dhamaada pad\u003C/strong\u003E (gudaha ku jirta, ama ku dhow qiyaastii badhka ballaca dusha waddadiisa ee cidlada padka) wuxuu gaaraa heerka padka oo wuu u kor-u-kacaa ama hoos u dhacaa ilaa uu gaaro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJid\u003C/strong\u003E (Beerta › Dhul adag) wuxuu ku joogsadaa cidlada dibadda ee waddada, heerka waddo socodka ama garabka meeshaas, halkii uu ku jiri lahaa waddada korteeda. Jid isgoysa waddo wuxuu noqdaa laba qayb. Dhamaad lagu sawiray wax yar oo ka gaaban waddo (ku dhowyahay laba jeer ballaca jidka) ayaa lagu sii wadaa cidlada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay sheegaysaa kooridor kasta waxa ku xidhay, inta ay kor loo qaadey ama hoos loo dhigey halkaas iyo dhererka ay ku socoto. Dhererkaas waa inta ugu weyn ee 10 m (30 ft) iyo labaatan jeer isbedelka, mana dhaafi karo 45% kooridorka. \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka naqshadda lama beddelo\u003C/strong\u003E: muuqaalka dherer wali wuxuu tusayaa khadka jeexjeexa aad sawirtay, qaybaha, dusha la soo jeediyay, mugyada iyo muuqaalka 3D waxay tusaan waddada sida la isku xiray. Si xidhiidhku naqshad ahaan u noqdo mid sax ah, u dhaqaaji PVI-ga ugu dambeeya heerka uu Sifooyinku sheegayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooridor kasta ka damin wiishka si ay u ahaato sida muuqaalkeeda dherer iyo assembly-gu sheegaan; markaas ma qaybgalo isgoys kasta, ha ahaato waddada dhinaca ama waddada toosan. Waddooyinka ku kulma toos ah qiyaastii (ka yar 20°) waa la dhaafaa, sidoo kale waa jidadka dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa isgoysku wali sameyn: ma jiro kerbi-soo-celin (geedaha way afeef yihiin), ma jiro dariiqyo rogmada ama jasiiraad, dhamaadka waddada dhinaca waxaa lagu jaray afeef khadkiisa, kooridor laga dhisay qaababka wuxuu geedkiisa u furaa si fudud oo isku mid ah (xagaal ama darbi oo ku jira xaaladda dhamaadkiisa waa la siman yahay afka dhexdiisa, iyada oo aan culvert lahayn). Kerbi-soo-celinta qorshaha, saddexagalada aragga iyo calaamadaynta eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/soils-roads-survey-mines-links\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/soils-roads-survey-mines-links\"\u003ECiidda, waddooyinka, sahanka, macdanta iyo xidhiidhyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBartilmaameedyada jeexjeexa iftiinka wali lama heli karo. Kooridor isbedela waddada dhexdeeda, bidix iyo midig oo gaar ah, isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor-templates\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor-templates\"\u003EQaababka kooridorka\u003C/a\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kooridor waxa uu hal qaybta caadiga ah ee fudud (assembly) ku wareejiyaa khadka waddada iyo muuqaalka dherer ee naqshadda, dhulka jira ayuu ku habeeyaa jeexjeex, natiijadana wuxuu ku daraa dusha la soo jeediyay. Khadka waddo wuxuu qaadi karaa kooridorro dhowr ah oo ku kala duwan xadka isteeshannada, kooridorna waxa laga dhisi karaa qaababka dib loo isticmaali karo isteeshan ahaan (Qaababka kooridorka). Assembly-ga fudud ee hoose labada dhinac way isku mid yihiin; dhinac kasta qaybaha u gaar ahaan u lahaadaan, eeg Dhinac kasta ka dhis qaybaha. Assembly-ga Laga bilaabo dhexdhexaadka khadka oo bannaanka u socda, dhinac kasta: dariiq oo ballac la siiyay, oo ka hoosaysa qoorta jeexjeexa dariiqa garab oo ballac la siiyay, oo jeexjeexa garabka leh jeexjeexa dhinaca laga bilaabo cidlada garabka ilaa meesha ay dhulka la kulanto: jeexjeexa jarista meesha dhulku sare yahay, jeexjeexa buuxinta meesha uu hoose yahay Qiimayaasha bilowga ah waa meel-hayn, ma aha heer naqshadeed: Qiimaha Feet (US) Mitir Ballaca dariiqa 12 ft 3.6 m Jeexjeexa dariiqa 2% 2% Ballaca garabka 4 ft 1.2 m Jeexjeexa garabka 4% 4% Jeexjeexa jarista 2 : 1 2 : 1 Jeexjeexa buuxinta 3 : 1 3 : 1 Qayb kasta 10 ft 5 m Jeexjeexyada dhinacyada waxa lagu qiyaasaa aaga toosan ilaa toosan (H:V): 3 : 1 waxay ka dhigan tahay 3 bannaanka 1 hoos. Dhis kooridorka Waxaad u baahan tahay khad waddo aan khalad lahayn iyo muuqaal dherer naqshadeed oo leh ugu yaraan laba PVI iyo aan khalad lahayn. Dooro khadka waddada. Garabka midig, hoosta Kooridor, calaamadee Assembly-ga ku wareeji muuqaalka dherer ee naqshadda. Goobaha ayaa soo muuqda oo kooridorka isla markiiba la dhisaa. Qorshuhu wuxuu tusayaa cidlada dariiqa iyo garabka iyo khadadka iftiinka; markii La soo jeediyay (la sameeyay) la doorto hoosta Bandhig, konturada ayaa tusaya dhulka cusub. Bedel qiime kasta: Ballaca dariiqa, Jeexjeexa dariiqa, Ballaca garabka, Jeexjeexa garabka, Jeexjeexa jarista, Jeexjeexa buuxinta, Qayb kasta. Riix Enter kasta ka dib. Jarista, buuxinta iyo masaafada qaybaha waa inay ka weyn yihiin 0. Akhri sadarka hoos goobaha, tusaale ahaan \"39 qaybood laga bilaabo 0+00.00 ilaa 3+86.36; jarista 240.2 cu yd, buuxinta 556.0 cu yd.\" Qaybaha waa la jaraa tallaabo kasta oo Qayb kasta, dhamaadka khadka, iyo bilowga iyo dhamaadka wareeg kasta oo toosan iyo kan toosan ah. Qayb kasta iyo khadadka ku jira (dhexdhexaadka, cidlada dariiqa iyo garabka, iftiinka) waxay noqdaan khadadka jejebinta ee dusha la soo jeediyay. Si aad kooridorka u damiso, ka saar calaamadda sanduuqa. Qiimayaashiisa waa la kaydiyaa marka xigta. Marka aan dhisin Sanduuq casaan ah oo hoos goobaha ayaa sababta sheegaysa: Fariinta Waxa la sameeyo Kooridorku wuxuu u baahan yahay muuqaal dherer naqshadeed oo aan khalad lahayn. Ku dar PVI, ama hagaaji wareegyada toosan ee is-dhex-galaya (eeg Naqshadee muuqaal dherer toosan). Muuqaalka naqshadda ma is-dhex-galo khadka waddada. Ku rid PVI-yada xadka isteeshannada khadka waddada. Kooridorku wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan laba qayb dusha dhexdeeda. Inta badan kooridorka waa ka baxsan dhulka jira. 4 jeexjeexa dhinac ayaa ka baxa dusha ka hor inta aysan dhulka gaarin. Dhinaca dusha ee ku dhow, jeexjeexa ma gaari karo dhulka. Ka dhig waddada meel ka fog cidlada, ama yaree dhererka buuxinta ama jarista halkaas. Khadadka iftiinka kooridorka way isgoyaan (qaybaha way is-dul marayaan, tusaale ahaan dhinaca gudaha ee wareeg adag). Isticmaal raadiyo weyn ama assembly ballac yar. Qaybaha dhinaca gudaha ee wareeg adag way is-dul marayaan. Kor u qaad raadiyaha ama yaree assembly-ga. Kooridor leh dhibaato ma la jeexjeexi karo, ma tirinayo shaqada dhulka. Kooridorada iyo padyada wada Dusha la soo jeediyay waxa lagu dhisaa tartiib: marka hore kooridor kasta, markaas pad kasta. Meel uu jeexjeexa padka la kulmo kooridor, padku wuu guuleystaa. Meel shay dambe uu waddo la kulmo, qaybta waddada ku jirta iftiinka shayga dambe oo kaliya ayaa la beddelaa; inta kale ee waddada, iyo khadka jejebinta dhulka ee ay waddadu gudubto, waa ay ku joogaan qaabkooda. Mugyada waxa lagu xisaabiyaa dhammaan khadadka iftiinka hal mar; eeg Mugyada shaqada dhulka. Kor-u-kac dhinac Wareeg dhexdiisa waddadu waxay u janjeeri kartaa dhinaca gudaha, si gaadiidku dibadda ugu riix yar yahay. Calaamadee Kor-u-kac wareegyada hoosta Kor-u-kac dhinac ee Sifooyinka khadka waddada: Wareeg kasta oo goobo ah wuxuu qaadaa heerka e miiska heerka: safka hore oo raadiyihiisa wareeggu gaaro (safka heerkiisa madhan wuxuu hayaa qoorta caadiga ah). Miiska iyo Jeexjeexa ugu badan ee isbedelka (0.5 % bilowga) waa meel-hayn, ma aha heer caadi: ku dheji kuwaaga naqshaddaada. Ku dar ama ka saar safafka sida aad u baahan tahay. Dariiqyadu waxay ku wareegaan dhexdhexaadka khadka. Ka hor wareegga dariiqa dibadda ayaa fidsanaya runout (qoorta caadiga ah ÷ e × runoff), kadib runoff (ballaca dariiqa × e ÷ jeexjeexa) dariiqa dibadda ayaa weli wareeggaysa ilaa waddada oo dhan ay ku jeexjeexan tahay e u janjeera dhinaca gudaha; saddex meelood laba meelood runoff-ka waxay ka horreeyaan wareegga, hal meel saddex ee ku jirta. Wareegga ka dib wax isku mid ah ayaa dhacaya oo rogan. Garabka dhinaca hoose weligii kama fiicna dariiqiisa; dhinaca sare wuxuu hayaa jeexjeexiisa (wuu rogmadaa). Miiska hoosta wuxuu liistaa raadiyaha wareeg kasta, heerka, runoff iyo runout, iyo meesha kor-u-kaca buuxa ka bilaabanayso iyo ka dhamaanayso. Jaantuska kor-u-kaca wuxuu soo rogayaa jeexjeexyada dhinacyada labada dariiq isteeshannada dhexdooda (dariiqa bidix oo buuxa, midigna oo jajaban). Wareeg aad u gaaban si uu u gaaro kor-u-kac buuxa, ama laba wareeg oo isbedelkoodu is-dhex-galo, waxa sanduuq ka sare miiska lagu sheegaa. Qaybaha, mugyada, muuqaalka 3D iyo xaashiyadu dhammaantood waddada jeexjeexan ayay tusaan. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa celisa. Bartilmaameedyada Bartilmaameed wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa hal barta hal dhinac oo waddada ah oo u gaarta khad: Cidlada dusha waddada ama Cidlada garabka, Bidix ama Midig. Qayb kasta khadka waxay la kulantaa si toosan dhexdhexaadka, oo waxay u bixi dhinacaas oo kaliya, sidaas darteed bartilmaameed midig ma dhaqaajiso dhinaca bidix abid. Dejiya Waxa dhaca meesha qayb khadka la kulanto Ballac Barta waxay ku taallaa khadka: dariiqa (ama garabka) ayaa ballacaad ama yaraada ilaa khadka, isagoo ilaalinaya jeexjeexa dhinaca. Sare-mar Barta waxay qaadaa sare-marka khadka meeshaas, joogteeda gaarka ah: jeexjeexa dariiqa (ama garabka) ayaa raacda. Khadku wuxuu noqon karaa khad muhiim ah (ayuu Isticmaalkiisu yahay) ama khad kooridor kale: dhexdhexaadkiisa, cidlada dusha waddada, cidlada garabka ama khadadka iftiinka. Khadka kooridor wuxuu raacaa kooridorkaas: haddii waddada kale la beddelo, kan tan ayaa raacda. CivilCraft wuxuu marka hore dhisaa kooridorka kale; labada kooridor oo isku bartilmaameedsan xalqad ah dhinac hal ayaa la diidaa, miiskuna wuu sheegaa kee. Dooro khadka waddada oo shid kooridorkiisa. Hoosta Bartilmaameedyada, guji Ku dar bartilmaameedka. Dooro Dhinaca, Barta, waxa ay Dejinayso iyo Khadka. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Natiijada waxay sheegaysaa qaybaha imisa ee khadku gaaray. Qaybaha aan gaarin (ka baxsan dhamaadkiisa, ama meesha ay ka gadaal dhexdhexaadka ku jirto) waxay sii hayaan qiimayaasha assembly-ga. Khad la tirtiro wuxuu kooridorka ku soo celiyaa sidii ay ahayd ka hor bartilmaameedka, miiskuna wuu sheegaa. Dhinac kasta wuxuu u yeelan karaa hal bartilmaameed ballac iyo hal sare-mar barta kasta. Dhinac kasta ka dhis qaybaha Shid Dhinac kasta ka dhis qaybaha hoosta dejinta kooridorka. Dhinac kasta markaas liis gaar ah ayuu leeyahay, laga bilaabo dhexdhexaadka dibadda: dariiqyada, garab, marinka biyaha, kerbi, xariiqda beerta, waddada socodka iyo, ugu dambeyntii, jeexjeexa dhinaca ilaa dhulka (oo leh saamiyadiisa jarista iyo buuxinta). Ka bilow Waddo miyi ama Waddo magaalo, ku dar oo ka saar qaybaha, u dhaqaaji fallaadhaha, oo Koobiyee dhinac ka dhig dhinac kale. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Jeexjeexa dhinac-dhinac waa hoos-u-dhaca ka fogaanaya waddada, sidaas darteed waddo socod ah oo biyaha u dirta waddada waa mid taban. Kerbi waa wajiga sare ee aad siiso, sare oo ballac aad siiso iyo hoos-u-dhac ikhtiyaari ah dhabarka. Kor-u-kacu wuxuu wareejiyaa dariiq kasta safka hore; marinka biyaha, kerbiga, xariiqda iyo waddada socodka waxay ka laabanayaan cidlada dariiqyada sida loo dhisay. Bartilmaameedyadu wali waxay dhaqaajiyaan dhamaadka dariiqyada iyo qaybta ugu dambeysa. Qaybaha jeexjeexa waxay calaamadiyaan khadka biyaha marinka, sare iyo dabada kerbiga, iyo wixii kale. Wareeg leh spiral-yo, runoff-ka waa spiral-ka: qoorta sinaha TS-ka, kor-u-kaca buuxa SC-ka. Lakabyada dusha Dariiq, garab, marin biyaha, xariiqda beerta ama waddada socodka ayaa qaadi kara dhismihiisa: hoosta qaybta, Ku dar lakab wuxuu ku daraa lakab magac, walax, dhumuc iyo nooceeda (dusha, binder, saldhig, saldhig hoose, daboolka ama kale), kolkaas hoos u sii. Lakabyadu ma dhaqaajiyaan dusha waddada (sare-kiisu waa dusha naqshadda); lakab kasta wuxuu ku jiraa qaybtiisa hoosteeda, qotodheeftiisa oo toosan hoos loo cabbiraa. Qaybaha jeexjeexa waxay sawiraan hoosta lakab kasta sida khad jajaban, Lakabyada dusha: tirooyin wuxuu liistaa qorshaha dhulka iyo mugga lakab kasta (bedka kooridorka dheer ee qaybahiisa, mugga = bed × dhumuc). Dhoofinta IFC wuxuu qoraa lakab kasta sida unug gaar ah oo leh dhumucdeeda iyo walaxdeeda (eeg Dhoofinta iyo soo gelinta IFC). Dhumucda aad ku qorto waa kaaga; CivilCraft ma cabbiro dusha. Meelaha waddooyinku ku kulmaan waddooyin, padyo iyo jidad Marka Ku xidh waddooyinka iyo padyada ay taabanayaan la shiido (waa la shidaa kooridor kasta), CivilCraft wuxuu kooridorka ku xidhaa waxa uu qorshaha ku kulmo: Waddo ku dhamaada waddo kale (dhamaadka khadkiisa waddada kale ayuu saaran yahay, ama ku dhow qiyaastii badhka ballaca dusha waddadiisa ee geedka waddadaas) waa waddada dhinaca ee isgoysyada. Waddada ay la kulanto ayaa geedkeeda u furta dusha waddada dhinaca; afka dhexdiisa garabka, kerbiga, xariiqda iyo waddada socodka waxay ku dhigmaan jeexjeexa dhinac dariiqa, waxayna u muuqdaan dusha waddo. Waddada dhinaca waxay ku dhigmaan dusha waddada weyn meesha ay isku dul maraan, waxayna u kor-u-kacaan ama hoos u dhacaan ilaa ay gaarto. Labo waddo oo isgoysa waxay isku xirmaan siday isku mid tahay labada dhinac. Waddada ugu horreysa liiska Khadadka waddada waa waddada toos ah; kan kale ayaa raacda dusheeda gudihiisa. Waddo ku dhamaada pad (gudaha ku jirta, ama ku dhow qiyaastii badhka ballaca dusha waddadiisa ee cidlada padka) wuxuu gaaraa heerka padka oo wuu u kor-u-kacaa ama hoos u dhacaa ilaa uu gaaro. Jid (Beerta › Dhul adag) wuxuu ku joogsadaa cidlada dibadda ee waddada, heerka waddo socodka ama garabka meeshaas, halkii uu ku jiri lahaa waddada korteeda. Jid isgoysa waddo wuxuu noqdaa laba qayb. Dhamaad lagu sawiray wax yar oo ka gaaban waddo (ku dhowyahay laba jeer ballaca jidka) ayaa lagu sii wadaa cidlada. Sifooyinka waxay sheegaysaa kooridor kasta waxa ku xidhay, inta ay kor loo qaadey ama hoos loo dhigey halkaas iyo dhererka ay ku socoto. Dhererkaas waa inta ugu weyn ee 10 m (30 ft) iyo labaatan jeer isbedelka, mana dhaafi karo 45% kooridorka. Muuqaalka naqshadda lama beddelo: muuqaalka dherer wali wuxuu tusayaa khadka jeexjeexa aad sawirtay, qaybaha, dusha la soo jeediyay, mugyada iyo muuqaalka 3D waxay tusaan waddada sida la isku xiray. Si xidhiidhku naqshad ahaan u noqdo mid sax ah, u dhaqaaji PVI-ga ugu dambeeya heerka uu Sifooyinku sheegayo. Kooridor kasta ka damin wiishka si ay u ahaato sida muuqaalkeeda dherer iyo assembly-gu sheegaan; markaas ma qaybgalo isgoys kasta, ha ahaato waddada dhinaca ama waddada toosan. Waddooyinka ku kulma toos ah qiyaastii (ka yar 20°) waa la dhaafaa, sidoo kale waa jidadka dhulka. Waxa isgoysku wali sameyn: ma jiro kerbi-soo-celin (geedaha way afeef yihiin), ma jiro dariiqyo rogmada ama jasiiraad, dhamaadka waddada dhinaca waxaa lagu jaray afeef khadkiisa, kooridor laga dhisay qaababka wuxuu geedkiisa u furaa si fudud oo isku mid ah (xagaal ama darbi oo ku jira xaaladda dhamaadkiisa waa la siman yahay afka dhexdiisa, iyada oo aan culvert lahayn). Kerbi-soo-celinta qorshaha, saddexagalada aragga iyo calaamadaynta eeg Ciidda, waddooyinka, sahanka, macdanta iyo xidhiidhyada. Wali lama dhisin Bartilmaameedyada jeexjeexa iftiinka wali lama heli karo. Kooridor isbedela waddada dhexdeeda, bidix iyo midig oo gaar ah, isticmaal Qaababka kooridorka. Eeg Wali lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"climate-futures","scope":"civilcraft","title":"\"Cimilada mustaqbalka: daadka, kulaylka iyo dab-baadiyaha 2050 iyo 2080\"","summary":"Cinwaanka ilaa goobta, kor u qaad heerka daadka goobta cimilada mustaqbalka, qiimee khatarta dab-baadiyaha, oo u beddel faylka cimilada, hadda iyo mustaqbalka oo is barbar ah, xirmada xogta cimilada (SSP2-4.5 iyo SSP5-8.5, 2050 iyo 2080).","section":"tasks","order":61,"keywords":["cimilada","isbeddelka cimilada","mustaqbal","2050","2080","ssp","cmip6","sanad","heerka badda","daad","base flood elevation","bfe","fema","kulul","faylka cimilada","epw","morph","dab-baadiye","wildfire","bushfire"],"headings":[{"id":"meesha-ay-ku-taal","text":"Meesha ay ku taal","level":2},{"id":"heerka-daadka-naqshadeynta","text":"Heerka daadka naqshadeynta","level":2},{"id":"khatarta-dab-baadiyaha-tirtir-baadhis-oo-keliya","text":"Khatarta dab-baadiyaha (tirtir-baadhis oo keliya)","level":2},{"id":"kulaylka-faylka-cimilada-mustaqbalka","text":"Kulaylka: faylka cimilada mustaqbalka","level":2},{"id":"meesha-tirooyinka-ka-imanayaan","text":"Meesha tirooyinka ka imanayaan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXogta cimilada waxay ka timaadaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exirmo xog\u003C/strong\u003E (data pack), ma aha barnaamijka. Shid add-on-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClimate futures\u003C/span\u003E ee Dejinta › Kordhin, ama soo rar faylka xirmada xogta aad leedahay block-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClimate future\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXirmada ku timid add-on-ka waa \u003Cstrong\u003Etusaale\u003C/strong\u003E: saddex meelood (Denver, Miami, Johannesburg), hal moodel cimilo, shan sano ku jira 20 sano kasta. Waxaa loogu talagalay inaad isku daydo qalabka, \u003Cstrong\u003Ema loo isticmaalo naqshadeyn\u003C/strong\u003E. Xirmo buuxda waxaa lagu dhisaa \u003Ccode\u003Etools/climate/build-pack.mjs\u003C/code\u003E iyada oo laga soo qaadayo xogta NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-ay-ku-taal\"\u003EMeesha ay ku taal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha › Dheeraad › Cinwaanka ilaa goobta. Dejji barta, ku dar lakabyada (lakabka daadka FEMA wuxuu siinayaa base flood elevation) oo riix badhanka akhrinta goobta. Hoosta safafka goobta waxaa ku yaal block-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClimate future\u003C/span\u003E: dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EScenario\u003C/strong\u003E (SSP2-4.5 ama SSP5-8.5) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EYear\u003C/strong\u003E (2050 = 2041-2060, 2080 = 2071-2090, labaduba waxay ka hadlayaan 1995-2014). Meesha xirmada ugu dhow barta ayaa la isticmaalaa, ama tii aad doorato; haddii ay ka fog tahay mid kasta, isbeddelka celceliska caalamiga ah ayaa la isticmaalaa, bannaanku wuu sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerka-daadka-naqshadeynta\"\u003EHeerka daadka naqshadeynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeerka hadda waa base flood elevation ee FEMA marka lakabka daadku uu leeyahay (feet, NAVD 88), haddii kale qor kaaga. Dooro nooca daadka (xeebta, webiga ama roobka xoogga leh, ama labaduba), qoto dheerka daadka goobta qaybta roobka, iyo freeboard haddii aad doonto. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaise the flood level\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa heerka hadda iyo kan mustaqbalka oo is barbar ah, qaybaha heerka badda iyo roobka, iyo mala-awaalka: heerka badda oo dhan ayaa lagu daraa heerka xeebta; socodka webiga wuxuu u kordhaa hal-hal la mid ah roobka maalinta ugu qoyan badanaa, qoto dheerkuna wuxuu raacaa socodka oo wuxuu noqonayaa awoodda 0.6 (Manning, wadi ballaaran); qaybaha waa la isku daraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa tirtir-baadhis isbeddelka, ma aha daraasad daad. Heerka naqshadeynta ee daadka waa kan hay&#039;adda ama injineerkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khatarta-dab-baadiyaha-tirtir-baadhis-oo-keliya\"\u003EKhatarta dab-baadiyaha (tirtir-baadhis oo keliya)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhirta ugu dhow, jiifka kor loo raaco iyo masaafadu waxay siinayaan qaab ka bilaabmaysa aad u yar ilaa aad u xun, hadda iyo mustaqbalka (mustaqbalka waxa uu ku dhufanayaa isbeddelka xisaabta dab-cimilo ee xirmada). \u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir-baadhis keliya:\u003C/strong\u003E cabbir nala lahaa si loo ogaado in goobtu u baahan tahay qiimeyn dab-baadiye oo sax ah; ma aha qiimo xeer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kulaylka-faylka-cimilada-mustaqbalka\"\u003EKulaylka: faylka cimilada mustaqbalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.epw\u003C/code\u003E oo maanta ah, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake the future weather file\u003C/span\u003E: waxaa lagu beddelaa habka wareejinta iyo fidinta la daabacay (Belcher, Hacker iyo Powell 2005), kulaylka waa la barbardhigaa (celceliska iyo heerkulka ugu kulul, heerkulka naqshadeynta, saacadaha ka sarreeya 30 °C iyo 35 °C, degree-days). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the future weather file\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa faylka Environment panel-ka, hubinta tamarta BimCraft ama qalabkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-tirooyinka-ka-imanayaan\"\u003EMeesha tirooyinka ka imanayaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6 (wax soo saarka moodelka CMIP6 ee hoos loo dhigay, CC BY 4.0 moodel kasta) ee heerkulka, qoyaanka, qorraxda, roobka iyo cimilada dabka; celceliska caalamiga ah ee IPCC AR6 ee kor u kaca heerka badda, marka xirmadu aanay lahayn tirooyin maxalli ah. Bannaanku wuxuu muujinayaa ilaha xirmada, liisanskeeda iyo taariikhdeeda.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Xogta cimilada waxay ka timaadaa xirmo xog (data pack), ma aha barnaamijka. Shid add-on-ka Climate futures ee Dejinta › Kordhin, ama soo rar faylka xirmada xogta aad leedahay block-ka Climate future. Xirmada ku timid add-on-ka waa tusaale: saddex meelood (Denver, Miami, Johannesburg), hal moodel cimilo, shan sano ku jira 20 sano kasta. Waxaa loogu talagalay inaad isku daydo qalabka, ma loo isticmaalo naqshadeyn. Xirmo buuxda waxaa lagu dhisaa tools/climate/build-pack.mjs iyada oo laga soo qaadayo xogta NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6. Meesha ay ku taal Dusha › Dheeraad › Cinwaanka ilaa goobta. Dejji barta, ku dar lakabyada (lakabka daadka FEMA wuxuu siinayaa base flood elevation) oo riix badhanka akhrinta goobta. Hoosta safafka goobta waxaa ku yaal block-ka Climate future: dooro Scenario (SSP2-4.5 ama SSP5-8.5) iyo Year (2050 = 2041-2060, 2080 = 2071-2090, labaduba waxay ka hadlayaan 1995-2014). Meesha xirmada ugu dhow barta ayaa la isticmaalaa, ama tii aad doorato; haddii ay ka fog tahay mid kasta, isbeddelka celceliska caalamiga ah ayaa la isticmaalaa, bannaanku wuu sheegaa. Heerka daadka naqshadeynta Heerka hadda waa base flood elevation ee FEMA marka lakabka daadku uu leeyahay (feet, NAVD 88), haddii kale qor kaaga. Dooro nooca daadka (xeebta, webiga ama roobka xoogga leh, ama labaduba), qoto dheerka daadka goobta qaybta roobka, iyo freeboard haddii aad doonto. Raise the flood level wuxuu muujinayaa heerka hadda iyo kan mustaqbalka oo is barbar ah, qaybaha heerka badda iyo roobka, iyo mala-awaalka: heerka badda oo dhan ayaa lagu daraa heerka xeebta; socodka webiga wuxuu u kordhaa hal-hal la mid ah roobka maalinta ugu qoyan badanaa, qoto dheerkuna wuxuu raacaa socodka oo wuxuu noqonayaa awoodda 0.6 (Manning, wadi ballaaran); qaybaha waa la isku daraa. Waa tirtir-baadhis isbeddelka, ma aha daraasad daad. Heerka naqshadeynta ee daadka waa kan hay'adda ama injineerkaaga. Khatarta dab-baadiyaha (tirtir-baadhis oo keliya) Dhirta ugu dhow, jiifka kor loo raaco iyo masaafadu waxay siinayaan qaab ka bilaabmaysa aad u yar ilaa aad u xun, hadda iyo mustaqbalka (mustaqbalka waxa uu ku dhufanayaa isbeddelka xisaabta dab-cimilo ee xirmada). Tirtir-baadhis keliya: cabbir nala lahaa si loo ogaado in goobtu u baahan tahay qiimeyn dab-baadiye oo sax ah; ma aha qiimo xeer. Kulaylka: faylka cimilada mustaqbalka Dooro fayl .epw oo maanta ah, kadibna Make the future weather file: waxaa lagu beddelaa habka wareejinta iyo fidinta la daabacay (Belcher, Hacker iyo Powell 2005), kulaylka waa la barbardhigaa (celceliska iyo heerkulka ugu kulul, heerkulka naqshadeynta, saacadaha ka sarreeya 30 °C iyo 35 °C, degree-days). Save the future weather file wuxuu kaydiyaa faylka Environment panel-ka, hubinta tamarta BimCraft ama qalabkaaga. Meesha tirooyinka ka imanayaan NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6 (wax soo saarka moodelka CMIP6 ee hoos loo dhigay, CC BY 4.0 moodel kasta) ee heerkulka, qoyaanka, qorraxda, roobka iyo cimilada dabka; celceliska caalamiga ah ee IPCC AR6 ee kor u kaca heerka badda, marka xirmadu aanay lahayn tirooyin maxalli ah. Bannaanku wuxuu muujinayaa ilaha xirmada, liisanskeeda iyo taariikhdeeda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"point-clouds","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Daruuro dhibcood oo ka timid drone ama skaner","summary":"Adigoo isticmaalaya kordhinta Daruuro dhibcood, fur fayl LAS ama LAZ oo leh malaayiin dhibcood, eeg oo dhan, nadiifi, kala soo saar dhulka, dhirta iyo dhismayaasha, oo ka dhis dhulka, kontuurada iyo mugga.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["daruuro dhibcood","las","laz","drone","photogrammetry","recap","lidar","skaner","dhul","kala saar","buuq","kaydka","mugga","jar iyo buuxin","kontuur","breakline","eye-dome","orthomosaic","ortho","ku dabool","lakab khariidad","dhoofi las","dhoofi laz","cadaadi"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-daruuro","text":"Fur daruuro","level":2},{"id":"eeg","text":"Eeg","level":2},{"id":"nadiifi","text":"Nadiifi","level":2},{"id":"kala-soocid","text":"Kala soocid","level":2},{"id":"dhulka-kontuurada-xariiqyada-jebinta","text":"Dhulka, kontuurada, xariiqyada jebinta","level":2},{"id":"mugga","text":"Mugga","level":2},{"id":"orthomosaic","text":"Orthomosaic","level":2},{"id":"dhoofi","text":"Dhoofi","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-samayn","text":"Waxa aan samayn","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDadka badankood ma u baahna tan, sidaas darteed waa kordhin. Ku shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoint clouds\u003C/span\u003E ee Dejinta › Kordhin; tab \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoint clouds\u003C/span\u003E ayaa soo muuqda panelka dhinaca midig. Faylka waxaa akhrisa browser-kaaga, waxaana loo jaraa qaybo yaryar oo lagu kaydiyo kaydka browser-kaaga (ama gal aad dooratid). \u003Cstrong\u003EWax lagama soo rarin.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWixii tab-kan sheego oo dhan waa tiro ka timid xogtaada, ma aha shahaado. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay goob la sameeyay, weli ma aha xog drone oo dhab ah: natiijooyinka hore si taxaddar leh u akhri oo noo sheeg waxa aad ogaatay. Xirfadlaha diiwaan-gelisan ayaa go&#039;aaminaya qiimaha dhulka, kontuurada iyo mugga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-daruuro\"\u003EFur daruuro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoos ta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur daruuro\u003C/span\u003E dooro fayl LAS ama LAZ. Tab-ku wuxuu sheegayaa inta dhibcood ee uu hayo, nidaamka kala-sarrayn iyo unugyada, iyo inta meel ee dhismuhu u baahan yahay; riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhis daruuro\u003C/span\u003E. Dhismaha waa la joojin karaa, waxaana lagu sii wadi karaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESii wad\u003C/span\u003E (dooro isla faylka mar kale). Faylka lama beddelo. Fayl leh 100 milyan dhibcood wuxuu ku dhismaa daqiiqado workstation, meelna uma qaadanayo ka badan qaddarka faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoos ta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaruuro kombiyuutarkan ku jira\u003C/span\u003E waxaad furi ama ka saari kartaa daruuro. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi daruuro gal…\u003C/span\u003E (Chrome, Edge iyo app-ka Studio) wuxuu qaybaha kaydiyaa galka aad dooratid, tusaale ahaan galka CadCraft daruuro ee Documents, si daruuro 10 GB ah aanay ugu baahnaan kaydka browser-ka; daruuro hore loo dhisay way ku sii jiraan meeshii la dhisay. Browser-ku mar kale ayuu oggolaansho weydiin doonaa kadib dib-u-bilowga: riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal galka … mar kale\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg\"\u003EEeg\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEeg 3D\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu daruurta ka sawiraa qaybo qaro weyn, wuxuuna sii fiican-saaraa markaad u soo dhowaato, laakiin marna ma ka badan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibcaha ugu badan ee la muujiyo\u003C/span\u003E mar keliya (2.5 milyan; 500 kun telefoon). Midabee ka dhig midabka faylka, dhererka, fasalka, iska-shiidnimada ama hadhaaga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka eye-dome\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu iftiimiyaa geesaha iyadoo loo eegayo fogaanshaha, si qaabku u muuqdo iyada oo aan lagu jirin xarriiqyo caadi ah (waa la damiyaa telefoon). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibcaha fog yaraadaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhibcaha fog ka dhigaa kuwo yar, kuwa dhow ka dhigana kuwo weyn; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka dhibcaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa cabbirka. Qorshuhu daruurta wuxuu u muujiyaa sawir raster hoosta naqshadaada, wuxuuna \u003Cstrong\u003Esii wanaagsanaadaa marka aad ku soo dhowaato\u003C/strong\u003E qayb ka mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nadiifi\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoos ta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E ku sawir xadhig, sanduuq ama bolligon qorshaha (ama 3D ee muuqaalka sare: 3D xuduudda waa la qaadaa toos hoos, sidaas darteed waa sax kaliya marka laga eego sare). Tab-ku wuxuu tusayaa inta dhibcood ee ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003Eka hor\u003C/strong\u003E intaadan codsan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir dhibcahan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel fasalkooda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo celi dhibcihii la tirtiray\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar xadkan\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E waxay socdaan liiska wax-beddelka; faylka laftiisa lama beddelo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaandhaynta buuqa…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu calaamadiyaa dhibcaha hoose sida fasal 7 ama buuq sare sida fasal 18.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-soocid\"\u003EKala soocid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHel dhulka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu shaqeeyaa qaybo qaybo, wuxuuna calaamadiyaa dhulka (fasal 2) iyo dhibcaha hoose; dulqaadka waa 0.15 m, ama 0.08 m markaad shid heerka sahanka. Wuxuu sheegaa xadka qaybaha aan isku raacin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala saar dhirta iyo dhismayaasha\u003C/span\u003E ka dib wuxuu calaamadiyaa dhirta hoose, dhexe iyo sare, iyo dhismayaasha iyadoo loo eegayo sarrayntooda dhulka iyo sida dhulka ku xeeran u sinaan yahay. Ma jiro barashada mashiinka, sidaas darteed hal rooga dusha sare leh oo geedo hoostooda ku jira ayaa khalad noqon kara: eeg.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhulka-kontuurada-xariiqyada-jebinta\"\u003EDhulka, kontuurada, xariiqyada jebinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhis dhulka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhulka jira ka dhigaa dhibcaha dhulka, oo wuxuu ku daraa mashruuca siday tahay soo dhoofinta LAS. Kadib wuxuu isbarbar dhigaa dhibcaha iyo dhulka: celceliska, RMS, boqolkiiba 95aad, qayb-ka ku jirta dulqaadka, iyo toddobaatan meelood ee ugu kala duwan, mid walba leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETag halkaas\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHadhaaga\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa meelaha dhulka iyo daruurta ku kala duwan yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBreakline\u003C/strong\u003E (kerb, god ama sare-bar) waxaa lagu doortaa daruurta: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro breakline daruurta\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira muuqaalka 3D wuxuu qaadaa dhibcha ugu dhow ee la muujiyay riix kasta; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro breakline qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa dhibcha daruurta ugu dhow (dhulka marka hore) hoos ta riix kasta. Laba jeer riix ama Enter ayaa dhammeeya xariiqda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhis dhulka\u003C/span\u003E xiga ayaa isticmaala. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji kontuurada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kontuurada ku muujiyaa daruurta sawir yar, wuxuuna dejiyaa masaafada mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mugga\"\u003EMugga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMugga kaydka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xisaabiyaa mugga dusha ka sarraysa salka xuduud aad ku rasmayso. Xuduudda ku rasm dhulka siman ee ku hareeraysan kaydka, oo dooro saldhigga: dhibcaha ugu hooseeya ee xuduudda, diyaarad, sal qalloocan oo nacnac ah, dusha dhex-marta xuduudda, ama heer aad ku qortid. Dhulka u janjeera ama qalloocan, diyaarad ama salka qalloocan isticmaal; dhibcaha ugu hooseeya wuxuu u muuqdaa mid aad u sarreeya. Dhibcaha xuduudda ee ka sarreeya kuwa kale (geed ku jira xariiqda) waa laga reebaa saldhigga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuulimaad ilaa duulimaad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa goyn iyo buuxin u dhexeeya laba daruuro. Labaduba waxa lagu kaydin karaa sida CSV.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"orthomosaic\"\u003EOrthomosaic\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoos ta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrthomosaic (sawir sare ka qaadan)\u003C/span\u003E dooro orthomosaic-ka drone-ka oo wada jir faylka dunida iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E marka ay leeyihiin: GeoTIFF, ama PNG ama JPEG. Waxay noqotaa \u003Cstrong\u003Elakab khariidad\u003C/strong\u003E ee mashruuca, si qorshuhu u muujiyo hoosta naqshadaada, muuqaalka 3D (midab \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhariidad\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu ku rido dhulka la dhisay, sidaas darteed marka hore \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhis dhulka\u003C/span\u003E. Tab-ku wuxuu sheegayaa inta daruurta ay sawirku daboolayo, wuxuuna digayaa haddii aanu daboolin midna: sababta caadiga ah waa nidaam kala-sarrayn oo kale, sidaas darteed ku dar faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E. Haddii \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E aan jirin, barnaamijku wuxuu weydiin doonaa halka ay iska kaashadaan. Sawirku waxa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka mashruuca; GeoTIFF ka weyn 200 MB waa la diidaa, orthomosaic aad u weyn waxa loo yareeyaa 16 megapixel, sidaas darteed goob weyn marka hore jar orthomosaic-ka goobta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofi\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa daruurta la nadiifiyay oo la kala soociyay sida fayl cusub (dhibcaha oo dhan, fasallada nadiifka ah, ama dhulka keliya). Hoos ta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooca faylka\u003C/span\u003E dooro:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELAS 1.4 (aan la cadaadin)\u003C/strong\u003E: qaabka dhibcaha 6, ama 7 oo midab leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELAZ (la cadaadiyay)\u003C/strong\u003E: dhibcaha isla markaana aan lumin, si dhibcaha oo dhan dib loogu soo celiyo sax ahaan. Waxa loo qoraa qaabka dhibcaha 0, ama 2 oo midab leh, faylka LAS 1.4 gudihiisa. Tijaabada goobta 300 m, LAZ wuxuu ahaa qiyaastii shanaad-ka-hal ee cabbirka faylka LAS 1.4. LAZ qaabka 0 iyo 2 waxa ku jira fasallada 0 ilaa 31 keliya: dhibic fasal ka weyn waa la diidaa oo fariin ayaa la siiyaa, sidaas darteed daruurtaas ku dhoof LAS 1.4.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELAZ-ka waxaa qora cadaadiyaha CadCraft laftiisa, oo laga sameeyay qeexitaanka LAZ ee la daabacay. Waxaan hubinay in akhriyahayaga iyo laba akhriye oo LAZ oo madax-bannaan (laz-perf oo app-ku isticmaalo si uu u furo faylalka LAZ, iyo laspy oo leh lazrs) ay dhibcaha oo dhan si sax ah u soo celiyaan, iyo in faylalka LAZ ee laspy sameeyay ay isku mid yihiin baytka-baytka marka dhibcahooda dib loo qoro. Barnaamijyo kale weli lama tijaabin; haddii mid aanu furin faylka, noo sheeg magaceeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeesha browser-ku ka qori karo faylka isagoo socda, marka hore faylka dooro; daruurta weyn waxaa loo qoraa qayb-qayb, mana ururiso xusuusta; haddii kale faylka waa la ururiyaa oo la soo dejiyaa, taas oo fiican ilaa dhowr boqol megabyte.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-samayn\"\u003EWaxa aan samayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa keliya ee akhrisa LAS iyo LAZ (E57, PLY iyo PCD tab-kan weli lagama xidhin, oo dhowr faylal oo hal duulimaad ah lama isku xidho), kuma beddelo nidaamka daruurta (nidaamka mashruuca iyo mitirada waa la qaadaa), ma akhriyo RCP ama RCS oo Autodesk ah, ma samayn karo dusha sawirada, oo ma helo tiirar, kerb ama tuubooyin iyada oo keligeed.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dadka badankood ma u baahna tan, sidaas darteed waa kordhin. Ku shid Point clouds ee Dejinta › Kordhin; tab Point clouds ayaa soo muuqda panelka dhinaca midig. Faylka waxaa akhrisa browser-kaaga, waxaana loo jaraa qaybo yaryar oo lagu kaydiyo kaydka browser-kaaga (ama gal aad dooratid). Wax lagama soo rarin. Wixii tab-kan sheego oo dhan waa tiro ka timid xogtaada, ma aha shahaado. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay goob la sameeyay, weli ma aha xog drone oo dhab ah: natiijooyinka hore si taxaddar leh u akhri oo noo sheeg waxa aad ogaatay. Xirfadlaha diiwaan-gelisan ayaa go'aaminaya qiimaha dhulka, kontuurada iyo mugga. Fur daruuro Hoos ta Fur daruuro dooro fayl LAS ama LAZ. Tab-ku wuxuu sheegayaa inta dhibcood ee uu hayo, nidaamka kala-sarrayn iyo unugyada, iyo inta meel ee dhismuhu u baahan yahay; riix Dhis daruuro. Dhismaha waa la joojin karaa, waxaana lagu sii wadi karaa Sii wad (dooro isla faylka mar kale). Faylka lama beddelo. Fayl leh 100 milyan dhibcood wuxuu ku dhismaa daqiiqado workstation, meelna uma qaadanayo ka badan qaddarka faylka. Hoos ta Daruuro kombiyuutarkan ku jira waxaad furi ama ka saari kartaa daruuro. Kaydi daruuro gal… (Chrome, Edge iyo app-ka Studio) wuxuu qaybaha kaydiyaa galka aad dooratid, tusaale ahaan galka CadCraft daruuro ee Documents, si daruuro 10 GB ah aanay ugu baahnaan kaydka browser-ka; daruuro hore loo dhisay way ku sii jiraan meeshii la dhisay. Browser-ku mar kale ayuu oggolaansho weydiin doonaa kadib dib-u-bilowga: riix Isticmaal galka … mar kale. Eeg Eeg 3D wuxuu daruurta ka sawiraa qaybo qaro weyn, wuxuuna sii fiican-saaraa markaad u soo dhowaato, laakiin marna ma ka badan Dhibcaha ugu badan ee la muujiyo mar keliya (2.5 milyan; 500 kun telefoon). Midabee ka dhig midabka faylka, dhererka, fasalka, iska-shiidnimada ama hadhaaga. Iftiinka eye-dome wuxuu iftiimiyaa geesaha iyadoo loo eegayo fogaanshaha, si qaabku u muuqdo iyada oo aan lagu jirin xarriiqyo caadi ah (waa la damiyaa telefoon). Dhibcaha fog yaraadaan wuxuu dhibcaha fog ka dhigaa kuwo yar, kuwa dhow ka dhigana kuwo weyn; Cabbirka dhibcaha wuxuu dejiyaa cabbirka. Qorshuhu daruurta wuxuu u muujiyaa sawir raster hoosta naqshadaada, wuxuuna sii wanaagsanaadaa marka aad ku soo dhowaato qayb ka mid ah. Nadiifi Hoos ta Nadiifi ku sawir xadhig, sanduuq ama bolligon qorshaha (ama 3D ee muuqaalka sare: 3D xuduudda waa la qaadaa toos hoos, sidaas darteed waa sax kaliya marka laga eego sare). Tab-ku wuxuu tusayaa inta dhibcood ee ku jira ka hor intaadan codsan: Tirtir dhibcahan, Beddel fasalkooda, Soo celi dhibcihii la tirtiray ama Jar xadkan. Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale waxay socdaan liiska wax-beddelka; faylka laftiisa lama beddelo. Shaandhaynta buuqa… wuxuu calaamadiyaa dhibcaha hoose sida fasal 7 ama buuq sare sida fasal 18. Kala soocid Hel dhulka wuxuu shaqeeyaa qaybo qaybo, wuxuuna calaamadiyaa dhulka (fasal 2) iyo dhibcaha hoose; dulqaadka waa 0.15 m, ama 0.08 m markaad shid heerka sahanka. Wuxuu sheegaa xadka qaybaha aan isku raacin. Kala saar dhirta iyo dhismayaasha ka dib wuxuu calaamadiyaa dhirta hoose, dhexe iyo sare, iyo dhismayaasha iyadoo loo eegayo sarrayntooda dhulka iyo sida dhulka ku xeeran u sinaan yahay. Ma jiro barashada mashiinka, sidaas darteed hal rooga dusha sare leh oo geedo hoostooda ku jira ayaa khalad noqon kara: eeg. Dhulka, kontuurada, xariiqyada jebinta Dhis dhulka wuxuu dhulka jira ka dhigaa dhibcaha dhulka, oo wuxuu ku daraa mashruuca siday tahay soo dhoofinta LAS. Kadib wuxuu isbarbar dhigaa dhibcaha iyo dhulka: celceliska, RMS, boqolkiiba 95aad, qayb-ka ku jirta dulqaadka, iyo toddobaatan meelood ee ugu kala duwan, mid walba leh Tag halkaas. Hadhaaga wuxuu muujiyaa meelaha dhulka iyo daruurta ku kala duwan yihiin. Breakline (kerb, god ama sare-bar) waxaa lagu doortaa daruurta: Dooro breakline daruurta oo ku jira muuqaalka 3D wuxuu qaadaa dhibcha ugu dhow ee la muujiyay riix kasta; Dooro breakline qorshaha wuxuu qaadaa dhibcha daruurta ugu dhow (dhulka marka hore) hoos ta riix kasta. Laba jeer riix ama Enter ayaa dhammeeya xariiqda. Dhis dhulka xiga ayaa isticmaala. Muuji kontuurada wuxuu kontuurada ku muujiyaa daruurta sawir yar, wuxuuna dejiyaa masaafada mashruuca. Mugga Mugga kaydka… wuxuu xisaabiyaa mugga dusha ka sarraysa salka xuduud aad ku rasmayso. Xuduudda ku rasm dhulka siman ee ku hareeraysan kaydka, oo dooro saldhigga: dhibcaha ugu hooseeya ee xuduudda, diyaarad, sal qalloocan oo nacnac ah, dusha dhex-marta xuduudda, ama heer aad ku qortid. Dhulka u janjeera ama qalloocan, diyaarad ama salka qalloocan isticmaal; dhibcaha ugu hooseeya wuxuu u muuqdaa mid aad u sarreeya. Dhibcaha xuduudda ee ka sarreeya kuwa kale (geed ku jira xariiqda) waa laga reebaa saldhigga. Duulimaad ilaa duulimaad wuxuu siinayaa goyn iyo buuxin u dhexeeya laba daruuro. Labaduba waxa lagu kaydin karaa sida CSV. Orthomosaic Hoos ta Orthomosaic (sawir sare ka qaadan) dooro orthomosaic-ka drone-ka oo wada jir faylka dunida iyo .prj marka ay leeyihiin: GeoTIFF, ama PNG ama JPEG. Waxay noqotaa lakab khariidad ee mashruuca, si qorshuhu u muujiyo hoosta naqshadaada, muuqaalka 3D (midab Khariidad) wuxuu ku rido dhulka la dhisay, sidaas darteed marka hore Dhis dhulka. Tab-ku wuxuu sheegayaa inta daruurta ay sawirku daboolayo, wuxuuna digayaa haddii aanu daboolin midna: sababta caadiga ah waa nidaam kala-sarrayn oo kale, sidaas darteed ku dar faylka .prj. Haddii .prj aan jirin, barnaamijku wuxuu weydiin doonaa halka ay iska kaashadaan. Sawirku waxa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka mashruuca; GeoTIFF ka weyn 200 MB waa la diidaa, orthomosaic aad u weyn waxa loo yareeyaa 16 megapixel, sidaas darteed goob weyn marka hore jar orthomosaic-ka goobta. Dhoofi Dhoofi wuxuu qoraa daruurta la nadiifiyay oo la kala soociyay sida fayl cusub (dhibcaha oo dhan, fasallada nadiifka ah, ama dhulka keliya). Hoos ta Nooca faylka dooro: LAS 1.4 (aan la cadaadin): qaabka dhibcaha 6, ama 7 oo midab leh. LAZ (la cadaadiyay): dhibcaha isla markaana aan lumin, si dhibcaha oo dhan dib loogu soo celiyo sax ahaan. Waxa loo qoraa qaabka dhibcaha 0, ama 2 oo midab leh, faylka LAS 1.4 gudihiisa. Tijaabada goobta 300 m, LAZ wuxuu ahaa qiyaastii shanaad-ka-hal ee cabbirka faylka LAS 1.4. LAZ qaabka 0 iyo 2 waxa ku jira fasallada 0 ilaa 31 keliya: dhibic fasal ka weyn waa la diidaa oo fariin ayaa la siiyaa, sidaas darteed daruurtaas ku dhoof LAS 1.4. LAZ-ka waxaa qora cadaadiyaha CadCraft laftiisa, oo laga sameeyay qeexitaanka LAZ ee la daabacay. Waxaan hubinay in akhriyahayaga iyo laba akhriye oo LAZ oo madax-bannaan (laz-perf oo app-ku isticmaalo si uu u furo faylalka LAZ, iyo laspy oo leh lazrs) ay dhibcaha oo dhan si sax ah u soo celiyaan, iyo in faylalka LAZ ee laspy sameeyay ay isku mid yihiin baytka-baytka marka dhibcahooda dib loo qoro. Barnaamijyo kale weli lama tijaabin; haddii mid aanu furin faylka, noo sheeg magaceeda. Meesha browser-ku ka qori karo faylka isagoo socda, marka hore faylka dooro; daruurta weyn waxaa loo qoraa qayb-qayb, mana ururiso xusuusta; haddii kale faylka waa la ururiyaa oo la soo dejiyaa, taas oo fiican ilaa dhowr boqol megabyte. Waxa aan samayn Waxa keliya ee akhrisa LAS iyo LAZ (E57, PLY iyo PCD tab-kan weli lagama xidhin, oo dhowr faylal oo hal duulimaad ah lama isku xidho), kuma beddelo nidaamka daruurta (nidaamka mashruuca iyo mitirada waa la qaadaa), ma akhriyo RCP ama RCS oo Autodesk ah, ma samayn karo dusha sawirada, oo ma helo tiirar, kerb ama tuubooyin iyada oo keligeed.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"railway","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Naqshadaynta waddada tareenka","summary":"Ka dhig jid-hagaha waddo tareen: isbedelka dhamaadka (kolotoid, parabolad saddex-geesood, Bloss, Helmert, nuska-mawjadka sine, sine), kaadhka qalooca kasta oo leh kaadhkeeda isla-miisaanka, dhaawaca iyo xadka, xadadka qaabka waddada oo digniin ah, shaqaaqyada iyo isgoysyada saldhigyada, muuqaal ballaaran oo tareenka ku dhex socda, iyo waddo leh rails, sleepers iyo sariir ballast oo loo dhisay sida koridor, qorshe, goyn, qorshe-dhererka, 3D iyo tirooyinka.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["tareen","rail","railroad","waddo","qatar","metro","tram","kaadh","superelevation","dhaawaca kaadhka","kaadh xad-dhaaf ah","kaadh isla-miisaan","isbedel","isbedelka dhamaadka","kolotoid","parabolad saddex-geesood","bloss","helmert","nuska-mawjadka sine","cosine","balac","balaca caadiga ah","balaca ballaaran","balaca mitir","balaca yar","sleeper","tie","crosstie","ballast","sub-ballast","formation","cess","masaafada waddooyinka","60E1","54E1","UIC60","115RE","136RE","gradient kaadhka","xawaaraha isbedelka kaadhka","shaqaaq","lambarka shaqaaqa","frog","lambarka frog","lead","khadka xidhitaanka","xawaaraha kala firdhiska","cilad","cilad-koobaad","koobaadka cilada","balaca dhismaha","balaca culeyska","kinematic envelope","saldhig","balaca saldhigga","masaafada waddooyinka","gradient","vertical curve","radius ugu yar","LandXML cant"],"headings":[{"id":"jid-hagaha-ka-dhig-tareen","text":"Jid-hagaha ka dhig tareen","level":2},{"id":"isbedelka","text":"Isbedelka","level":2},{"id":"kaadhka","text":"Kaadhka","level":2},{"id":"xadadka-kaadhka-iyo-digniinta","text":"Xadadka kaadhka iyo digniinta","level":2},{"id":"waddada","text":"Waddada","level":2},{"id":"hubinta-joomatriga-waddada","text":"Hubinta joomatriga waddada","level":2},{"id":"shaqaaqyada-iyo-isgoysyada","text":"Shaqaaqyada iyo isgoysyada","level":2},{"id":"envelope-ka-beerta","text":"Envelope-ka beerta","level":2},{"id":"barnaamijyada-kale","text":"Barnaamijyada kale","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-dhisin","text":"Wali lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EJid-hagaha kasta wuxuu noqon karaa waddo tareen. Markaas qalooca wuxuu helaa isbedelo tareen iyo kaadh (kor-u-kaca rails-ka), koridorkiisana waxaa loo dhisaa sida waddo: rails oo ku taal sleepers, oo ku taal sariir ballast, oo lagu dhejiyay dhulka sida waddo. Shaqaaqyada iyo isgoysyada waxaa lagu daraa saldhigyada, waxaana la rari karaa muuqaal xad ah oo jid-hagaha ku dhex socda, kana hubi karaa waxa ku taagan dhinaca waddada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirooyinka hoose oo dhan waa \u003Cstrong\u003Emeel-hayn\u003C/strong\u003E (placeholder), ma aha heer caadi ah. Tareenadu xadadkooda waxay ku dejiyaan xawaaraha khadka, nooca waddada iyo dalka; dejinta ka soo qaado heerka tareenkaaga. CivilCraft ma leh miis qaran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jid-hagaha-ka-dhig-tareen\"\u003EJid-hagaha ka dhig tareen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro jid-hagaha oo ka hel \u003Cstrong\u003ETareen\u003C/strong\u003E sifooyinka (Properties).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EJid-hagahani waa waddo tareen\u003C/strong\u003E. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejiso \u003Cstrong\u003EXawaaraha naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E sifooyinka sare ee jid-hagaha: waa xawaaraha khadka oo kaadhka lagu hubiyo. \u003Cstrong\u003ETareennada ugu gaabsan\u003C/strong\u003E (qaybta Tareenka) waa xawaaraha ay kaadhka xad-dhaafka lagu hubiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isbedelka\"\u003EIsbedelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalooca kasta u dhig dherer spiral labada dhinac ee miiska PI (\u003Cstrong\u003ESpiral in\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESpiral out\u003C/strong\u003E), kadibna dooro nooceeda miiska qalooca qaybta Tareenka, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbedel qalooca kasta\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECurvature-ka isbedelka dhexdiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClothoid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewuxuu kordhaa si siman (sida jidka spiral-ka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EParabolad saddex-geesood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ey = x³ / (6·R·L), iyada oo L la cabbiray tangent-ka; qalooca laftiisa wuu ka dheer yahay yar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBloss\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3u² − 2u³ ee curvature-ka oo dhan (u = qaybta dhererka): wuu bilaabaa oo wuu dhamaadaa si tartiib ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHelmert\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Elaba parabolad, 2u² ka dibna 1 − 2(1 − u)²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuska-mawjad sine\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(1 − cos πu) / 2\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESine\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eu − sin(2πu) / 2π\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaan marka laga reebo parabolad saddex-geesood waxay u leexdaan L / 2R, sida clothoid. Saldhigyadu waxay socdaan dhererka dhabta ah. LandXML wuxuu hayaa nooca (spiType clothoid, cubicParabola, bloss, biquadratic, cosine, sinusoid).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaadhka\"\u003EKaadhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalooca kasta \u003Cstrong\u003ECant\u003C/strong\u003E qor millimitir. Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa qalooca kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEquilibrium\u003C/strong\u003E cant = G·v² / (g·R), G oo ah masaafada u dhexaysa dhexdhexaadka rails-ka (\u003Cstrong\u003ERail centres\u003C/strong\u003E, balaca iyo ballaca madaxa rail-ka haddii aadan qorin). Marka G = 1500 mm, tani waa qaabka caanka ah 11.8·V² / R (V km/h, R m).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDeficiency\u003C/strong\u003E = equilibrium xawaaraha khadka − kaadhka la codsaday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExcess\u003C/strong\u003E = kaadhka la codsaday − equilibrium xawaaraha tareennada ugu gaabsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERamp\u003C/strong\u003E: gradient-ka kaadhka ugu jaban rambooyinkiisa, mm kasta mitir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaadhku wuxuu kor u kacaa isbedel kasta oo ka dhex jira, wuxuuna raacaa curvature-kiisa: toos ah clothoid ama parabolad saddex-geesood, Bloss-shaped Bloss, iwm. Dhamaadka qalooca oo aan isbedel lahayn wuxuu kor u kacaa jidka ka hor, sida dheer ee xadka gradient-ka kaadhku u baahan yahay, wuxuuna sheegaa taas: markaas kaadhku wuu isbedelaa meesha curvature-ku aanu isbedelin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECant turns about\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegaa rail-ka ku haya qorshaha naqshadda: \u003Cstrong\u003Erail-ka hoose\u003C/strong\u003E (caadiga), \u003Cstrong\u003Erail-ka gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Edhexdhexaadka waddada\u003C/strong\u003E (rail kasta wuxuu dhaqaaqaa badhka kaadhka). Qorshaha naqshaddu waa sare ee rail-ka halkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECant diagram\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sawiraa dhererka rail kasta ka sarreeya qorshaha dhinaca saldhigyada; muuqaalka qorshaha iyo xaashiyada qorshe-dhererka waxay siiyaan isla waxaas sida bar hoose qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xadadka-kaadhka-iyo-digniinta\"\u003EXadadka kaadhka iyo digniinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaadhka ugu badan ee la codsaday\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDeficiency-ga ugu badan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EExcess-ka ugu badan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EGradient-ka kaadhka ugu sarreeya\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsbedelka kaadhka ugu dhakhsaha badan\u003C/strong\u003E (gradient-ka xawaaraha khadka, mm/s) waa la hubiyaa qalooca kasta. Qiimaha ka sarreeya xadka waa digniin qaybta Tareenka iyo guddiga Dhibaatooyinka, oo leh xadka iyo qiimaha la helay. Haddii aanu xawaaraha naqshadda lahayn, deficiency iyo isbedelka xawaaraha lama hubiyo (fiiro ayaa sheegaya).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waddada\"\u003EWaddada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejiso \u003Cstrong\u003EGauge\u003C/strong\u003E (balaca caadiga ah 1435 mm, ama preset-yada balaca ballaaran, mitir ama yar, ama mid kaaga), \u003Cstrong\u003ERail section\u003C/strong\u003E (60E1, 54E1, 49E1, 115RE, 136RE: cabbirradooda la daabacay oo keliya), tirada \u003Cstrong\u003ETracks\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ETrack centres\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ESleepers and ballast\u003C/strong\u003E: walxaha sleepers-ka, dherer, ballac, qoto-dheer iyo masaafo; qoto-dheer ballast-ka hoosta sleepers-ka (rail-ka hoose), garabka, jiifka, inta ka sarreysa sleepers-ka iyo ka hoosaysa; qoto-dheer sub-ballast-ka, cess-ka ka dhaadheer ballast toe-ka, iyo jiifka dhinacyada dhismaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003EDhis waddada\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxay shaqaysaa koridorka jid-hagaha, oo loo dhisay sida waddo qorshaha naqshadda ku dhex socda: rails iyo sleepers waxay u janjeeraan kaadhka, dhismuhuna ma janjeero. Jiifka iftiinka ayaa ka bilaabmaa xadka cess-ka ee goynta iyo buuxinta koridorka, waddadu waxay ku dhex socotaa dusha la soo jeediyay sida waddo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshe\u003C/strong\u003E: labada rail ee waddo kasta (layer C-RAIL-TRAK) iyo, marka waddooyin ka badan yihiin, dhexdhexaadka waddo kasta (C-RAIL-CNTR), shaashadda, DXF, DWG, PDF iyo xaashiyada qorshe-dhererka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E: sleepers, rails, hoosta ballast-ka iyo sub-ballast-ka qayb kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E3D\u003C/strong\u003E: rails, sleeper kasta iyo sariirta ballast (\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji\u003C/strong\u003E › Waddada), iyo sidoo kale GLB, OBJ iyo USD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: dhererka waddada, rail (labada rail ee waddo kasta, dhex jid kasta), sleepers, sariirta ballast iyo ballast-ka ka dhimma sleepers-ka, iyo sub-ballast, iyadoo celceliska aagga dhamaadyada u dhexeeya qaybaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta-joomatriga-waddada\"\u003EHubinta joomatriga waddada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhinaca kaadhka, qaybta Tareenka waxay hubisaa khadka laftiisa xadadka lix oo kale (dhammaantood meel-hayn, dhammaantood adiga ayaa dejinaya):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGradient-ka ugu sarreeya\u003C/strong\u003E ee qorshaha naqshadda, mm kasta mitir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERadius-ka ugu yar ee qalooca toosan\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ah tiro k sida R ≥ k·V² (R m, V km/h). Qalooca toosan ee dherer L oo u dhexeeya laba gradient wuxuu leeyahay radius L oo loo qaybiyay isbedelka gradient-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalooca toosan ee ugu gaaban\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERadius-ka qalooca ugu yar\u003C/strong\u003E qorshaha (0 wuxuu damiyaa hubinta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaws ama toos ugu gaaban\u003C/strong\u003E, sida ilbiriqsi safarka xawaaraha khadka: qaws wareeg ah, ama toosaha u dhexeeya laba qalooc, oo ka gaaban masaafadaas waa la digayaa. 1.8 s waa &quot;badhka xawaaraha km/h, mitir&quot; caanka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsbedelka deficiency-ga kaadhka\u003C/strong\u003E dhererka isbedel kasta, mm/s xawaaraha khadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrack geometry\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu soo bandhigaa gradient-ka ugu sarreeya ee la helay iyo qalooca toosan kasta leh radius-kiisa iyo radius-ka uu xawaaraha khadka u baahan yahay. Qalooca toosan ee ku yaal isbedel ama kaadh-rambo wuxuu helaa qoraal. Haddii aanu qorshaha naqshadda ama xawaaraha naqshadda jirin, hubinta u baahan kuwaas waa la dhaafaa, fiiro ayaana sheegaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaqaaqyada-iyo-isgoysyada\"\u003EShaqaaqyada iyo isgoysyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ETurnouts and crossovers\u003C/strong\u003E, riix \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd a turnout\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxaa lagu dhejiyaa toosaha ugu dheer; ku dejiso miiska:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESwitch toe station\u003C/strong\u003E: halka shaqaaqu ka bilaabmo jid-hagahan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFrog\u003C/strong\u003E: tirada frog N (1:N). Xagasha frog-ka waa 2·atan(1 / 2N).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESide\u003C/strong\u003E: bidix ama midig, marka laga eego u socda saldhigga sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECrossover spacing\u003C/strong\u003E mitir: ka weyn 0, shaqaaqu wuxuu noqdaa isgoys waddo isbarbar socota oo masaafadaas ka fog (laba shaqaaq iyo toosaha u dhexeeya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELead\u003C/strong\u003E (switch toe ilaa frog), \u003Cstrong\u003ERadius\u003C/strong\u003E-ka qalooca xidhitaanka iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EXawaaraha kala firdhiska\u003C/strong\u003E oo radiusku u oggolaado xadka deficiency-ga kaagu iyo kaadh la&#039;aan. \u003Cstrong\u003EMake its track\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu jidka kala firdhiska u beddelaa jid-hagaha keligii (switch, qalooca xidhitaanka, ka dibna toos ah xagasha frog-ka) oo leh dejinta tareenka ee isku mid, si loo dheereyn karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa labada rail ee kala firdhiska ah ee shaqaaq kasta, xarriiqda dhexe, calaamad ku taal switch toe iyo frog, iyo &quot;1:N&quot; (layer C-RAIL-TURN), shaashadda iyo DXF, DWG, PDF iyo xaashiyada. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu sawiraa rails-ka kala firdhiska ah heerka waddada weyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabku waa \u003Cstrong\u003Emeel-hayn\u003C/strong\u003E: shaqaaq toosan iyo hal qalooc xidhitaan oo ka soo kacda tirada frog. Shaqaaq la dhisay waxay raacaa heerka tareenka iyo sawirka soo saaraha. Digniinaha: shaqaaq ka baxa jid-hagaha, ku yaal qalooc, isbedel, kaadh ama qalooca toosan, ama isku dhaafa kan kale; iyo fiiro marka xawaaraha khadku ka sarreeyo xawaaraha kala firdhiskiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"envelope-ka-beerta\"\u003EEnvelope-ka beerta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003ESweep a clearance envelope along this track\u003C/strong\u003E. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EOutline\u003C/strong\u003E (laba qaab meel-hayn, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EYour own outline\u003C/strong\u003E oo lagu qoro hal barta mid kasta: fogaanshaha dhexdhexaadka waddada, ka dibna dherer ka sarreeya saldhigga rail-ka sare, mitir), \u003Cstrong\u003EVehicle length\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBogie centres\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo, haddii uu jiro, \u003Cstrong\u003EPlatform edge\u003C/strong\u003E (dhinaca, masaafada dhexdhexaadka, dherer ka sarreeya rail-ka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaldhig kasta, outline-ka waa la janjeeyaa kaadhka oo ku wareegaya rail-ka hoose, waana la ballaariyaa qalooca: badhka dhexe ee gaadhiga wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa gudaha b² / 8R, dhamaadyadiisuna dibadda (L² − b²) / 8R (b waa bogie centres, L dherer gaadhiga, R radius-ka meesha, oo raacaa isbedelka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybtu wuxuu sawiraa qaybta toosan iyo meesha ugu ballaaran, wuxuuna liistaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eenvelope-ka ugu ballaaran\u003C/strong\u003E iyo meesha,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Edhexdhexaadka waddooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E oo la barbardhigay dhexdhexaadka laba envelope oo deriska ah u baahan yihiin,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Emeesha ka hadhay xaddiga madbaxa\u003C/strong\u003E, ama sida uu u galay gudaha,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ekhad kasta oo muuqaal, tuubo iyo jid-hagaha tareen kale\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003Egudaha envelope-ka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadka muuqaalka leh sare-dhaadheerka waa la xukumaa outline-ka heerkiisa ka sarreeya rail-ka; haddii aanu qorshaha naqshadda jirin, ama barta aanay sare-dhaadheer lahayn, waa la xukumaa qorshaha oo keliya, liistuna way sheegtaa. Qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa labada geesood ee envelope-ka (layer C-RAIL-CLRN) oo leh calaamad xagga shay kasta oo ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOutline-yada la siiyo waa \u003Cstrong\u003Emeel-hayn\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha balaca tareen kasta. Ku qor balaca dhismaha tareenkaaga ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan natiijada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamijyada-kale\"\u003EBarnaamijyada kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELandXML\u003C/strong\u003E: jid-hagaha tareenka waxaa loo qoraa isbedelkiisa (spiType) iyo block \u003Ccode\u003ECant\u003C/code\u003E: balaca, barta jeedsashada, xawaaraha khadka, iyo saldhig kasta oo kaadh-rambo uu ka bilaabmo iyo ku dhammaado, leh kaadhka la codsaday, kaadhka isla-miisaanka iyo deficiency. Furitaanka faylka LandXML oo leh block \u003Ccode\u003ECant\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu jid-hagaha ka dhigaa tareen leh kaadhadaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E: jid-hagaha oo leh qaybaha kaadhka, rails, sleepers, ballast iyo sub-ballast.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaqaaqyada IFC export-ka, qoysaska shaqaaqyada ka baxsan qalooca xidhitaanka kaliya (shaqaaqyada gooni ah, frog-yada swing-nose, slips, diamonds), xeerarka balaca kinematic (envelope-ku waa outline go&#039;an oo leh curve throw), xariiqyada xagga sare ah iyo signalling.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka la tixraaco.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybta Tareenka, &quot;Standard to cite&quot; wuxuu qaadan karaa None ama European (UIC iyo EN). Dooro European waxay magacaabaa dokumentiyada mashruuca Yurub ay tixraacaan (EN 13803 cabbirrada jid-hagaha, EN 13232 shaqaaqyada iyo isgoysyada, EN 15273 balacyada, EN 13848 tayada joomatriga waddada), oo xad kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq loo qoro qodobka uu ka yimid. Ma jiro tiro ka timid heer kasta oo lagu dhex jiro: kaadhka, deficiency-ga, excess-ka, gradient-ka iyo xadadka isbedelka, joomatriga shaqaaqa iyo balaca dhismaha wali waa meel-hayn, daaqaddu way sheegtaa. Injineer tareen ayaa hubiya qiime kasta qoraalka heerkiisa, oo ku qora qodobka ag dhinaceeda, ka hor intaan wax la dhisin. Koonfur Afrika iyo miisaska AREMA \u003Cstrong\u003Ekuma jiraan\u003C/strong\u003E sii-deyntan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jid-hagaha kasta wuxuu noqon karaa waddo tareen. Markaas qalooca wuxuu helaa isbedelo tareen iyo kaadh (kor-u-kaca rails-ka), koridorkiisana waxaa loo dhisaa sida waddo: rails oo ku taal sleepers, oo ku taal sariir ballast, oo lagu dhejiyay dhulka sida waddo. Shaqaaqyada iyo isgoysyada waxaa lagu daraa saldhigyada, waxaana la rari karaa muuqaal xad ah oo jid-hagaha ku dhex socda, kana hubi karaa waxa ku taagan dhinaca waddada. Tirooyinka hoose oo dhan waa meel-hayn (placeholder), ma aha heer caadi ah. Tareenadu xadadkooda waxay ku dejiyaan xawaaraha khadka, nooca waddada iyo dalka; dejinta ka soo qaado heerka tareenkaaga. CivilCraft ma leh miis qaran. Jid-hagaha ka dhig tareen Dooro jid-hagaha oo ka hel Tareen sifooyinka (Properties). Calaamadi Jid-hagahani waa waddo tareen. Isbedel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo laga noqon karo. Dejiso Xawaaraha naqshadda sifooyinka sare ee jid-hagaha: waa xawaaraha khadka oo kaadhka lagu hubiyo. Tareennada ugu gaabsan (qaybta Tareenka) waa xawaaraha ay kaadhka xad-dhaafka lagu hubiyo. Isbedelka Qalooca kasta u dhig dherer spiral labada dhinac ee miiska PI (Spiral in, Spiral out), kadibna dooro nooceeda miiska qalooca qaybta Tareenka, ama Isbedel qalooca kasta: Nooca Curvature-ka isbedelka dhexdiisa Clothoid wuxuu kordhaa si siman (sida jidka spiral-ka) Parabolad saddex-geesood y = x³ / (6·R·L), iyada oo L la cabbiray tangent-ka; qalooca laftiisa wuu ka dheer yahay yar Bloss 3u² − 2u³ ee curvature-ka oo dhan (u = qaybta dhererka): wuu bilaabaa oo wuu dhamaadaa si tartiib ah Helmert laba parabolad, 2u² ka dibna 1 − 2(1 − u)² Nuska-mawjad sine (1 − cos πu) / 2 Sine u − sin(2πu) / 2π Dhammaan marka laga reebo parabolad saddex-geesood waxay u leexdaan L / 2R, sida clothoid. Saldhigyadu waxay socdaan dhererka dhabta ah. LandXML wuxuu hayaa nooca (spiType clothoid, cubicParabola, bloss, biquadratic, cosine, sinusoid). Kaadhka Qalooca kasta Cant qor millimitir. Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa qalooca kasta: Equilibrium cant = G·v² / (g·R), G oo ah masaafada u dhexaysa dhexdhexaadka rails-ka (Rail centres, balaca iyo ballaca madaxa rail-ka haddii aadan qorin). Marka G = 1500 mm, tani waa qaabka caanka ah 11.8·V² / R (V km/h, R m). Deficiency = equilibrium xawaaraha khadka − kaadhka la codsaday. Excess = kaadhka la codsaday − equilibrium xawaaraha tareennada ugu gaabsan. Ramp: gradient-ka kaadhka ugu jaban rambooyinkiisa, mm kasta mitir. Kaadhku wuxuu kor u kacaa isbedel kasta oo ka dhex jira, wuxuuna raacaa curvature-kiisa: toos ah clothoid ama parabolad saddex-geesood, Bloss-shaped Bloss, iwm. Dhamaadka qalooca oo aan isbedel lahayn wuxuu kor u kacaa jidka ka hor, sida dheer ee xadka gradient-ka kaadhku u baahan yahay, wuxuuna sheegaa taas: markaas kaadhku wuu isbedelaa meesha curvature-ku aanu isbedelin. Cant turns about wuxuu sheegaa rail-ka ku haya qorshaha naqshadda: rail-ka hoose (caadiga), rail-ka gudaha, ama dhexdhexaadka waddada (rail kasta wuxuu dhaqaaqaa badhka kaadhka). Qorshaha naqshaddu waa sare ee rail-ka halkaas. Cant diagram wuxuu sawiraa dhererka rail kasta ka sarreeya qorshaha dhinaca saldhigyada; muuqaalka qorshaha iyo xaashiyada qorshe-dhererka waxay siiyaan isla waxaas sida bar hoose qorshaha. Xadadka kaadhka iyo digniinta Kaadhka ugu badan ee la codsaday, Deficiency-ga ugu badan, Excess-ka ugu badan, Gradient-ka kaadhka ugu sarreeya iyo Isbedelka kaadhka ugu dhakhsaha badan (gradient-ka xawaaraha khadka, mm/s) waa la hubiyaa qalooca kasta. Qiimaha ka sarreeya xadka waa digniin qaybta Tareenka iyo guddiga Dhibaatooyinka, oo leh xadka iyo qiimaha la helay. Haddii aanu xawaaraha naqshadda lahayn, deficiency iyo isbedelka xawaaraha lama hubiyo (fiiro ayaa sheegaya). Waddada Dejiso Gauge (balaca caadiga ah 1435 mm, ama preset-yada balaca ballaaran, mitir ama yar, ama mid kaaga), Rail section (60E1, 54E1, 49E1, 115RE, 136RE: cabbirradooda la daabacay oo keliya), tirada Tracks iyo Track centres, kadibna Sleepers and ballast: walxaha sleepers-ka, dherer, ballac, qoto-dheer iyo masaafo; qoto-dheer ballast-ka hoosta sleepers-ka (rail-ka hoose), garabka, jiifka, inta ka sarreysa sleepers-ka iyo ka hoosaysa; qoto-dheer sub-ballast-ka, cess-ka ka dhaadheer ballast toe-ka, iyo jiifka dhinacyada dhismaha. Riix Dhis waddada. Waxay shaqaysaa koridorka jid-hagaha, oo loo dhisay sida waddo qorshaha naqshadda ku dhex socda: rails iyo sleepers waxay u janjeeraan kaadhka, dhismuhuna ma janjeero. Jiifka iftiinka ayaa ka bilaabmaa xadka cess-ka ee goynta iyo buuxinta koridorka, waddadu waxay ku dhex socotaa dusha la soo jeediyay sida waddo. Qorshe: labada rail ee waddo kasta (layer C-RAIL-TRAK) iyo, marka waddooyin ka badan yihiin, dhexdhexaadka waddo kasta (C-RAIL-CNTR), shaashadda, DXF, DWG, PDF iyo xaashiyada qorshe-dhererka. Qaybaha: sleepers, rails, hoosta ballast-ka iyo sub-ballast-ka qayb kasta. 3D: rails, sleeper kasta iyo sariirta ballast (Muuji › Waddada), iyo sidoo kale GLB, OBJ iyo USD. Tirooyinka: dhererka waddada, rail (labada rail ee waddo kasta, dhex jid kasta), sleepers, sariirta ballast iyo ballast-ka ka dhimma sleepers-ka, iyo sub-ballast, iyadoo celceliska aagga dhamaadyada u dhexeeya qaybaha. Hubinta joomatriga waddada Dhinaca kaadhka, qaybta Tareenka waxay hubisaa khadka laftiisa xadadka lix oo kale (dhammaantood meel-hayn, dhammaantood adiga ayaa dejinaya): Gradient-ka ugu sarreeya ee qorshaha naqshadda, mm kasta mitir. Radius-ka ugu yar ee qalooca toosan, oo ah tiro k sida R ≥ k·V² (R m, V km/h). Qalooca toosan ee dherer L oo u dhexeeya laba gradient wuxuu leeyahay radius L oo loo qaybiyay isbedelka gradient-ka. Qalooca toosan ee ugu gaaban. Radius-ka qalooca ugu yar qorshaha (0 wuxuu damiyaa hubinta). Qaws ama toos ugu gaaban, sida ilbiriqsi safarka xawaaraha khadka: qaws wareeg ah, ama toosaha u dhexeeya laba qalooc, oo ka gaaban masaafadaas waa la digayaa. 1.8 s waa \"badhka xawaaraha km/h, mitir\" caanka ah. Isbedelka deficiency-ga kaadhka dhererka isbedel kasta, mm/s xawaaraha khadka. Track geometry wuxuu soo bandhigaa gradient-ka ugu sarreeya ee la helay iyo qalooca toosan kasta leh radius-kiisa iyo radius-ka uu xawaaraha khadka u baahan yahay. Qalooca toosan ee ku yaal isbedel ama kaadh-rambo wuxuu helaa qoraal. Haddii aanu qorshaha naqshadda ama xawaaraha naqshadda jirin, hubinta u baahan kuwaas waa la dhaafaa, fiiro ayaana sheegaya. Shaqaaqyada iyo isgoysyada Hoosta Turnouts and crossovers, riix Add a turnout. Waxaa lagu dhejiyaa toosaha ugu dheer; ku dejiso miiska: Switch toe station: halka shaqaaqu ka bilaabmo jid-hagahan. Frog: tirada frog N (1:N). Xagasha frog-ka waa 2·atan(1 / 2N). Side: bidix ama midig, marka laga eego u socda saldhigga sare. Crossover spacing mitir: ka weyn 0, shaqaaqu wuxuu noqdaa isgoys waddo isbarbar socota oo masaafadaas ka fog (laba shaqaaq iyo toosaha u dhexeeya). Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa Lead (switch toe ilaa frog), Radius-ka qalooca xidhitaanka iyo Xawaaraha kala firdhiska oo radiusku u oggolaado xadka deficiency-ga kaagu iyo kaadh la'aan. Make its track wuxuu jidka kala firdhiska u beddelaa jid-hagaha keligii (switch, qalooca xidhitaanka, ka dibna toos ah xagasha frog-ka) oo leh dejinta tareenka ee isku mid, si loo dheereyn karo. Qorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa labada rail ee kala firdhiska ah ee shaqaaq kasta, xarriiqda dhexe, calaamad ku taal switch toe iyo frog, iyo \"1:N\" (layer C-RAIL-TURN), shaashadda iyo DXF, DWG, PDF iyo xaashiyada. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu sawiraa rails-ka kala firdhiska ah heerka waddada weyn. Qaabku waa meel-hayn: shaqaaq toosan iyo hal qalooc xidhitaan oo ka soo kacda tirada frog. Shaqaaq la dhisay waxay raacaa heerka tareenka iyo sawirka soo saaraha. Digniinaha: shaqaaq ka baxa jid-hagaha, ku yaal qalooc, isbedel, kaadh ama qalooca toosan, ama isku dhaafa kan kale; iyo fiiro marka xawaaraha khadku ka sarreeyo xawaaraha kala firdhiskiisa. Envelope-ka beerta Calaamadi Sweep a clearance envelope along this track. Dooro Outline (laba qaab meel-hayn, ama Your own outline oo lagu qoro hal barta mid kasta: fogaanshaha dhexdhexaadka waddada, ka dibna dherer ka sarreeya saldhigga rail-ka sare, mitir), Vehicle length iyo Bogie centres, iyo, haddii uu jiro, Platform edge (dhinaca, masaafada dhexdhexaadka, dherer ka sarreeya rail-ka). Saldhig kasta, outline-ka waa la janjeeyaa kaadhka oo ku wareegaya rail-ka hoose, waana la ballaariyaa qalooca: badhka dhexe ee gaadhiga wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa gudaha b² / 8R, dhamaadyadiisuna dibadda (L² − b²) / 8R (b waa bogie centres, L dherer gaadhiga, R radius-ka meesha, oo raacaa isbedelka). Qaybtu wuxuu sawiraa qaybta toosan iyo meesha ugu ballaaran, wuxuuna liistaa: envelope-ka ugu ballaaran iyo meesha, dhexdhexaadka waddooyinka oo la barbardhigay dhexdhexaadka laba envelope oo deriska ah u baahan yihiin, meesha ka hadhay xaddiga madbaxa, ama sida uu u galay gudaha, khad kasta oo muuqaal, tuubo iyo jid-hagaha tareen kale oo ku jira gudaha envelope-ka. Khadka muuqaalka leh sare-dhaadheerka waa la xukumaa outline-ka heerkiisa ka sarreeya rail-ka; haddii aanu qorshaha naqshadda jirin, ama barta aanay sare-dhaadheer lahayn, waa la xukumaa qorshaha oo keliya, liistuna way sheegtaa. Qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa labada geesood ee envelope-ka (layer C-RAIL-CLRN) oo leh calaamad xagga shay kasta oo ku jira. Outline-yada la siiyo waa meel-hayn, ma aha balaca tareen kasta. Ku qor balaca dhismaha tareenkaaga ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan natiijada. Barnaamijyada kale LandXML: jid-hagaha tareenka waxaa loo qoraa isbedelkiisa (spiType) iyo block Cant: balaca, barta jeedsashada, xawaaraha khadka, iyo saldhig kasta oo kaadh-rambo uu ka bilaabmo iyo ku dhammaado, leh kaadhka la codsaday, kaadhka isla-miisaanka iyo deficiency. Furitaanka faylka LandXML oo leh block Cant wuxuu jid-hagaha ka dhigaa tareen leh kaadhadaas. IFC: jid-hagaha oo leh qaybaha kaadhka, rails, sleepers, ballast iyo sub-ballast. Wali lama dhisin Shaqaaqyada IFC export-ka, qoysaska shaqaaqyada ka baxsan qalooca xidhitaanka kaliya (shaqaaqyada gooni ah, frog-yada swing-nose, slips, diamonds), xeerarka balaca kinematic (envelope-ku waa outline go'an oo leh curve throw), xariiqyada xagga sare ah iyo signalling. Heerka la tixraaco. Qaybta Tareenka, \"Standard to cite\" wuxuu qaadan karaa None ama European (UIC iyo EN). Dooro European waxay magacaabaa dokumentiyada mashruuca Yurub ay tixraacaan (EN 13803 cabbirrada jid-hagaha, EN 13232 shaqaaqyada iyo isgoysyada, EN 15273 balacyada, EN 13848 tayada joomatriga waddada), oo xad kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq loo qoro qodobka uu ka yimid. Ma jiro tiro ka timid heer kasta oo lagu dhex jiro: kaadhka, deficiency-ga, excess-ka, gradient-ka iyo xadadka isbedelka, joomatriga shaqaaqa iyo balaca dhismaha wali waa meel-hayn, daaqaddu way sheegtaa. Injineer tareen ayaa hubiya qiime kasta qoraalka heerkiisa, oo ku qora qodobka ag dhinaceeda, ka hor intaan wax la dhisin. Koonfur Afrika iyo miisaska AREMA kuma jiraan sii-deyntan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"corridor-templates","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qaababka kooridorka iyo qaababka dhulka","summary":"Samee qaababka yar ee dib loo isticmaali karo (kurbi iyo gutter, dhinaca socodka, derbi, waabe), ka dhis kooridor iyaga oo isteeshanka ku salaysan oo bidix iyo midig loo kala saaray, u qaybi jidka kooridoro badan, oo dhig layers-ka walxaha dhulka.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["qaab","qaababka","maktabadda qaababka","samaynta qaabka","qaabka caadiga ah","assembly","subassembly","qaybaha","codes-ka barta","end condition","daylight","waabe","derbi taageero","kurbi","gutter","dhinaca socodka","gobollada","isteeshanka kala duwan","kooridoro badan","bidix iyo midig","qaabka dhulka","ciidda sare","dusha waddada","aasaas","dhig","walxaha","tirooyinka"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-qaababka","text":"Fur qaababka","level":2},{"id":"samee-qaab","text":"Samee qaab","level":2},{"id":"dhis-kooridor-qaababka","text":"Dhis kooridor qaababka","level":2},{"id":"kooridoro-badan-oo-jid-hal-ah","text":"Kooridoro badan oo jid hal ah","level":2},{"id":"qaababka-dhulka","text":"Qaababka dhulka","level":2},{"id":"walxaha-iyo-tirooyinka","text":"Walxaha iyo tirooyinka","level":2},{"id":"faylasha","text":"Faylasha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaab\u003C/strong\u003E waa qaybta yar ee dhexe oo aad mar sameyso, ka dibna dib u isticmaasho: barood leh offsets, naqas iyo codes-ka barta, iyo qaybo leh walxo. Kooridor waxaa laga dhisi karaa qaababka isteeshanka, dhinac kasta oo leh dusha waddadiisa iyo end condition-kiisa, qaababkana waxaa lagu dhigi karaa dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababka tusaalaha ah waa meelo-hayeen oo lagu bilaabo. Tirooyinkoodu laguma soo qaadanin heer ama hay&#039;ad. Injineer kasta waa inuu hubiyo qaab kasta iyo qiime kasta oo aad siiso ka hor inta aan naqshad loo isticmaalin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-qaababka\"\u003EFur qaababka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaababka kooridorka…\u003C/span\u003E (ama ku qor \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ETEMPLATES\u003C/code\u003E). Daaqaddu waxay leedahay saddex liis:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruucan\u003C/strong\u003E: qaababka uu kooridorada iyo qaababka dhulka ee mashruucani isticmaalo. Waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabaddayda\u003C/strong\u003E: qaababka lagu kaydiyo browser-kan oo la siiyo mashruuc kasta. Isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu kaydi Maktabaddayda\u003C/span\u003E qaab mashruuc si aad u kaydiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETusaalooyin\u003C/strong\u003E: laba waddo oo leh kurso, kurbi iyo gutter, dhinaca socodka, iftiinka, waabe, derbi taageero, ciidda sare ee dhulka hoose, iyo dusha waddada ee dhulka. Mid kasta waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa &quot;Injineer ayaa hubiya&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMashruucan isticmaal\u003C/span\u003E waxay qaabka tusaalaha ama maktabadda ku koobiyeysaa mashruuca. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaababka mashruucan u dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E waxay kaydiyaan sida fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.cctemplates.json\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl soo dhoof\u003C/span\u003E waxay akhrisaa fayl mashruuca iyo Maktabaddayda. Isticmaal faylka si aad qaababka u wadaagto ama u wareejiso kumbuyuutar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-qaab\"\u003ESamee qaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaab cusub\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E qaab mashruuc) wuxuu furaa tafatiraha qaabka. Jihada midig ka bilow, kaashanka qaabka 0,0 dibada u sii; dhinaca bidix wuxuu isticmaalaa isla qaabka dibada bidix.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBixi magac iyo nooc: \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha waddada\u003C/strong\u003E (qaabka xiga wuxuu ku xidhmaa dhamaadkiisa), \u003Cstrong\u003EEnd condition\u003C/strong\u003E (wuxuu taabanayaa dhulka) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar \u003Cstrong\u003Eqiimayaal\u003C/strong\u003E: tirooyin magac leh sida ballac \u003Ccode\u003Ew\u003C/code\u003E ama naqas \u003Ccode\u003Es\u003C/code\u003E. Sanduuqa tirada meel kasta oo qaabka ku jira wuxuu aqbalaa tiro ama magaca qiime; \u003Ccode\u003E-t\u003C/code\u003E waa qiimaha \u003Ccode\u003Et\u003C/code\u003E oo loo beddelay mid taban. Kooridor kasta wuxuu siin karaa qiimayaashiisa, sidaas darteed kurbi hal qaab ayaa u adeegta dhererro kala duwan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarood\u003C/strong\u003E iyagoo kala horreeya. Mid kasta waxaa lagu meeleeyaa barta hore (ama barta 0,0) iyadoo loo marayo xaddidaadda:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXaddidaadda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxay meeleeysaa barta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOffset oo naqas leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOffset dibada iyo naqas (kor-u-kac marka uu ku dhacayo; −0.02 wuxuu hoos u dhacaa 2%)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOffset iyo kor-u-kac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOffset iyo kor-u-kac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToos kor ama hoos\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKor-u-kac keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqaska dhinaca ilaa dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDibada barteeda ilaa dhulka, qiyaasta gooyida meesha dhulku sare yahay iyo qiyaasta buuxinta meesha ka hooseeyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlaa dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOffset, ka dibna toos kor ama hoos ilaa dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDerbi taageero\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDerbi qaro aad siinayso: gooyga, dusheeda sare waxay taabanaysaa wejiga waddada; buuxinta, waddadu waxay ku socotaa dusheeda, wejigeedii dibada wuu hoos u dhacaa ilaa dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003ESare\u003C/strong\u003E barahaaga dusha dhammaatay ee ay mari doonto. Barta sare ee ugu dambeysa ayaa meesha qaabka xiga ee dhinacaas ka bilaabmaya. \u003Cstrong\u003EBartilmaameed\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kooridorka u ogolaanayaa inuu barta u guuro: offsetkeeda ama heerkeeda waxay ka timaadaan khad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E: qaababka xiritaanka leh codes-ka barta (\u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E waa barta 0,0), mid kastaa magac, walax iyo nooc. Balaadhinta ayaa bixisa mugga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirku wuxuu raacaa isbeddel kasta si cabbir sax ah, liiska hoosteeda ayaa sheegaysa wixii khalad ah (barta dhulka taabanaysa ka hor dhamaadka, qiime uu qaabku ma lahan, qayb aan balaadhin lahayn). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar mashruucan\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E ayaa hayaa, hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhis-kooridor-qaababka\"\u003EDhis kooridor qaababka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro jid leh kooridor oo, hoosta sifooyinkiisa, daar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhis iyadoo laga kaashanayo qaababka isteeshanka\u003C/span\u003E. Kooridorku wuxuu bilaabmaa tusaalooyinka laba-waddo iyo iftiinka labada dhinac.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGobollada.\u003C/strong\u003E Gobol kasta wuxuu ka bilaabmaa isteeshan oo wuxuu gaaraa kan gobolka xiga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar gobol\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa mid; beddel isteeshankiisa bilowga sanduuqiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBidix iyo midig oo kala saaran.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhinac kasta oo gobol kasta wuxuu leeyahay liistiisa \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha waddada\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ka bilaabanta xariiqa dhexe ee dibada, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EEnd condition\u003C/strong\u003E: iftiin, waabe, derbi, ama qaab kasta oo dhulka taabanaya. Haddii end condition aan lahayn, dhinacu wuxuu iftiinka ka gaaraa naqaska jarista iyo buuxinta kooridorka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee bidixa midig u\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa dhinac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiimayaasha iyo bartilmaameedyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Hoosta qaab kasta oo dhinac ah, sanduuq kasta oo qiime ah (madhan = qiimaha qaabka), iyo barta leh bartilmaameed, khadka waxa uu dhaqaajiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo iyo ilaa\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu xaddidaa kooridorka qayb ka mid ah jidka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha, khadadka qorshaha ee codes-ka barta kasta, dusha la soo jeediyay, staking-ka iyo dhulka oo dhan way raacaan. Sifooyinka ayaa muujinaya mugga qayb kasta dhinac iyo gobol kasta (celceliska qaybaha dhexe). Superelevation iyo bartilmaameedyada geesaha kooridorku ma shaqeeyaan markay kooridorku ka dhisan yahay qaababka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kooridoro-badan-oo-jid-hal-ah\"\u003EKooridoro badan oo jid hal ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKooridoradaha jidkan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar kooridor\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa kooridor qaybta jidka ee hadhay: kooridorka koowaad wuxuu helaa isteeshan dhamaad dhexe (ama wuu hayaa kan uu leeyahay), kooridorka cusubna wuxuu ka bilaabmaa halkaas oo qaababkii gobolkii ugu dambeeyay ee kooridorka koowaad uu ku bilaabmo. Kooridor kasta wuxuu leeyahay magaciisa, kala duwanaanshaha isteeshanka, qaababkiisa iyo mugga dhulka. Dami mid adigoo isticmaalaya sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu\u003C/span\u003E. Meelaha ay kala duwanaanshuhu isku dhacaan, kooridorka dambe wuu ka sarreeyaa kii hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaababka-dhulka\"\u003EQaababka dhulka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka dhulka wuxuu dhigaa layers-ka qaab dhulka dhexdiisa, laga bilaabo barta 0,0: layer ka hooseeya barta 0,0 wuxuu galaa dhulka (ciidda sare ee la qaadayo), layer ka sareeya wuxuu ku fadhiyaa dhulka (aasaas iyo dusha waddada xaafadda baarkinka). Ballacyada iyo naqaska ma muhiimaan, waxa muhiimka ah kaliya qoto dheerka ama sare ee qaybta kasta ee ka hooseeya ama ka sareeya barta 0,0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaababka dhulka…\u003C/span\u003E (ama ku qor \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ETERRAINTEMPLATES\u003C/code\u003E); blokka waxaa sidoo kale laga helaa sifooyinka mashruuca. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar qaab dhulka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa mid leh ciidda sare ee tusaalaha ah. Mid kasta dooro:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eqaabka\u003C/strong\u003E (qiimayaashiisa waa la beddeli karaa mid kan oo keliya),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Edhulka\u003C/strong\u003E: dhulka jira ama dusha la soo jeediyay,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Efoomka\u003C/strong\u003E oo jarta: dhulka oo dhan, parcel, pad ama khad dhamaystiran oo naqshad ah. Qaabab dhulka oo kala duwan ayaa foomaska kala duwan ku isticmaali kara dhulka isku mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb kasta wuxuu liistaa qaro, aagga qorshaha iyo mugga. Mugga waa aagga qorshaha oo lagu dhufto qaro, qaroda oo toos loo qiyaaso hoos; aagga waxaa lagu qiyaasaa shabakad, aagga dhulka naqasan (ee la jiifay) ayaa sidoo kale la siiyaa. Foomaska waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha layer C-TOPO-TMPL. Qaababka dhulka ma beddelaan dusha la soo jeediyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"walxaha-iyo-tirooyinka\"\u003EWalxaha iyo tirooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEarthwork block-ka mashruuca wuxuu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EWalxaha qaababka\u003C/strong\u003E: qayb kasta oo kooridor ah iyo layer kasta oo qaab dhulka ah oo leh mugga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dir TakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku qoraa faylka tirooyinka ka dib jarista iyo buuxinta, shay kasta hal safar, mitir kuub ama yaar kuub (mashruucyada fiitka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha\"\u003EFaylasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababka, gobollada, kooridoradaha dheeraadka ah iyo qaababka dhulka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Mashruuc aan isticmaalin midkoodna wuxuu u kaydiyaa sidii hore, nooca CivilCraft ee hore ayaa furi kara mashruuca oo isticmaala (waxay iska indho-tiraan qaababka oo ay dhisaan qaabkii kooridorka).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaab waa qaybta yar ee dhexe oo aad mar sameyso, ka dibna dib u isticmaasho: barood leh offsets, naqas iyo codes-ka barta, iyo qaybo leh walxo. Kooridor waxaa laga dhisi karaa qaababka isteeshanka, dhinac kasta oo leh dusha waddadiisa iyo end condition-kiisa, qaababkana waxaa lagu dhigi karaa dhulka. Qaababka tusaalaha ah waa meelo-hayeen oo lagu bilaabo. Tirooyinkoodu laguma soo qaadanin heer ama hay'ad. Injineer kasta waa inuu hubiyo qaab kasta iyo qiime kasta oo aad siiso ka hor inta aan naqshad loo isticmaalin. Fur qaababka Fur Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Qaababka kooridorka… (ama ku qor TEMPLATES). Daaqaddu waxay leedahay saddex liis: Mashruucan: qaababka uu kooridorada iyo qaababka dhulka ee mashruucani isticmaalo. Waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Maktabaddayda: qaababka lagu kaydiyo browser-kan oo la siiyo mashruuc kasta. Isticmaal Ku kaydi Maktabaddayda qaab mashruuc si aad u kaydiso. Tusaalooyin: laba waddo oo leh kurso, kurbi iyo gutter, dhinaca socodka, iftiinka, waabe, derbi taageero, ciidda sare ee dhulka hoose, iyo dusha waddada ee dhulka. Mid kasta waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa \"Injineer ayaa hubiya\". Mashruucan isticmaal waxay qaabka tusaalaha ama maktabadda ku koobiyeysaa mashruuca. Qaababka mashruucan u dhoofi waxay kaydiyaan sida fayl .cctemplates.json, Fayl soo dhoof waxay akhrisaa fayl mashruuca iyo Maktabaddayda. Isticmaal faylka si aad qaababka u wadaagto ama u wareejiso kumbuyuutar kale. Samee qaab Qaab cusub (ama Tafatir qaab mashruuc) wuxuu furaa tafatiraha qaabka. Jihada midig ka bilow, kaashanka qaabka 0,0 dibada u sii; dhinaca bidix wuxuu isticmaalaa isla qaabka dibada bidix. Bixi magac iyo nooc: Dusha waddada (qaabka xiga wuxuu ku xidhmaa dhamaadkiisa), End condition (wuxuu taabanayaa dhulka) ama Qaabka dhulka. Ku dar qiimayaal: tirooyin magac leh sida ballac w ama naqas s. Sanduuqa tirada meel kasta oo qaabka ku jira wuxuu aqbalaa tiro ama magaca qiime; -t waa qiimaha t oo loo beddelay mid taban. Kooridor kasta wuxuu siin karaa qiimayaashiisa, sidaas darteed kurbi hal qaab ayaa u adeegta dhererro kala duwan. Ku dar barood iyagoo kala horreeya. Mid kasta waxaa lagu meeleeyaa barta hore (ama barta 0,0) iyadoo loo marayo xaddidaadda: Xaddidaadda Waxay meeleeysaa barta Offset oo naqas leh Offset dibada iyo naqas (kor-u-kac marka uu ku dhacayo; −0.02 wuxuu hoos u dhacaa 2%) Offset iyo kor-u-kac Offset iyo kor-u-kac Toos kor ama hoos Kor-u-kac keliya Naqaska dhinaca ilaa dhulka Dibada barteeda ilaa dhulka, qiyaasta gooyida meesha dhulku sare yahay iyo qiyaasta buuxinta meesha ka hooseeyo Ilaa dhulka Offset, ka dibna toos kor ama hoos ilaa dhulka Derbi taageero Derbi qaro aad siinayso: gooyga, dusheeda sare waxay taabanaysaa wejiga waddada; buuxinta, waddadu waxay ku socotaa dusheeda, wejigeedii dibada wuu hoos u dhacaa ilaa dhulka Calaamadee Sare barahaaga dusha dhammaatay ee ay mari doonto. Barta sare ee ugu dambeysa ayaa meesha qaabka xiga ee dhinacaas ka bilaabmaya. Bartilmaameed wuxuu kooridorka u ogolaanayaa inuu barta u guuro: offsetkeeda ama heerkeeda waxay ka timaadaan khad. Ku dar qaybaha: qaababka xiritaanka leh codes-ka barta (0 waa barta 0,0), mid kastaa magac, walax iyo nooc. Balaadhinta ayaa bixisa mugga. Sawirku wuxuu raacaa isbeddel kasta si cabbir sax ah, liiska hoosteeda ayaa sheegaysa wixii khalad ah (barta dhulka taabanaysa ka hor dhamaadka, qiime uu qaabku ma lahan, qayb aan balaadhin lahayn). Ku dar mashruucan ama Kaydi ayaa hayaa, hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Dhis kooridor qaababka Dooro jid leh kooridor oo, hoosta sifooyinkiisa, daar Dhis iyadoo laga kaashanayo qaababka isteeshanka. Kooridorku wuxuu bilaabmaa tusaalooyinka laba-waddo iyo iftiinka labada dhinac. Gobollada. Gobol kasta wuxuu ka bilaabmaa isteeshan oo wuxuu gaaraa kan gobolka xiga. Ku dar gobol wuxuu ku daraa mid; beddel isteeshankiisa bilowga sanduuqiisa. Bidix iyo midig oo kala saaran. Dhinac kasta oo gobol kasta wuxuu leeyahay liistiisa Dusha waddada, oo ka bilaabanta xariiqa dhexe ee dibada, iyo End condition: iftiin, waabe, derbi, ama qaab kasta oo dhulka taabanaya. Haddii end condition aan lahayn, dhinacu wuxuu iftiinka ka gaaraa naqaska jarista iyo buuxinta kooridorka. Koobiyee bidixa midig u wuxuu koobiyeeyaa dhinac. Qiimayaasha iyo bartilmaameedyada. Hoosta qaab kasta oo dhinac ah, sanduuq kasta oo qiime ah (madhan = qiimaha qaabka), iyo barta leh bartilmaameed, khadka waxa uu dhaqaajiyo. Laga bilaabo iyo ilaa wuxuu xaddidaa kooridorka qayb ka mid ah jidka. Qaybaha, khadadka qorshaha ee codes-ka barta kasta, dusha la soo jeediyay, staking-ka iyo dhulka oo dhan way raacaan. Sifooyinka ayaa muujinaya mugga qayb kasta dhinac iyo gobol kasta (celceliska qaybaha dhexe). Superelevation iyo bartilmaameedyada geesaha kooridorku ma shaqeeyaan markay kooridorku ka dhisan yahay qaababka. Kooridoro badan oo jid hal ah Hoosta Kooridoradaha jidkan, Ku dar kooridor wuxuu ku daraa kooridor qaybta jidka ee hadhay: kooridorka koowaad wuxuu helaa isteeshan dhamaad dhexe (ama wuu hayaa kan uu leeyahay), kooridorka cusubna wuxuu ka bilaabmaa halkaas oo qaababkii gobolkii ugu dambeeyay ee kooridorka koowaad uu ku bilaabmo. Kooridor kasta wuxuu leeyahay magaciisa, kala duwanaanshaha isteeshanka, qaababkiisa iyo mugga dhulka. Dami mid adigoo isticmaalaya sanduuqa Ku. Meelaha ay kala duwanaanshuhu isku dhacaan, kooridorka dambe wuu ka sarreeyaa kii hore. Qaababka dhulka Qaabka dhulka wuxuu dhigaa layers-ka qaab dhulka dhexdiisa, laga bilaabo barta 0,0: layer ka hooseeya barta 0,0 wuxuu galaa dhulka (ciidda sare ee la qaadayo), layer ka sareeya wuxuu ku fadhiyaa dhulka (aasaas iyo dusha waddada xaafadda baarkinka). Ballacyada iyo naqaska ma muhiimaan, waxa muhiimka ah kaliya qoto dheerka ama sare ee qaybta kasta ee ka hooseeya ama ka sareeya barta 0,0. Fur Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Qaababka dhulka… (ama ku qor TERRAINTEMPLATES); blokka waxaa sidoo kale laga helaa sifooyinka mashruuca. Ku dar qaab dhulka wuxuu ku daraa mid leh ciidda sare ee tusaalaha ah. Mid kasta dooro: qaabka (qiimayaashiisa waa la beddeli karaa mid kan oo keliya), dhulka: dhulka jira ama dusha la soo jeediyay, foomka oo jarta: dhulka oo dhan, parcel, pad ama khad dhamaystiran oo naqshad ah. Qaabab dhulka oo kala duwan ayaa foomaska kala duwan ku isticmaali kara dhulka isku mid ah. Qayb kasta wuxuu liistaa qaro, aagga qorshaha iyo mugga. Mugga waa aagga qorshaha oo lagu dhufto qaro, qaroda oo toos loo qiyaaso hoos; aagga waxaa lagu qiyaasaa shabakad, aagga dhulka naqasan (ee la jiifay) ayaa sidoo kale la siiyaa. Foomaska waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha layer C-TOPO-TMPL. Qaababka dhulka ma beddelaan dusha la soo jeediyay. Walxaha iyo tirooyinka Earthwork block-ka mashruuca wuxuu liistaa Walxaha qaababka: qayb kasta oo kooridor ah iyo layer kasta oo qaab dhulka ah oo leh mugga. U dir TakeoffCraft wuxuu ku qoraa faylka tirooyinka ka dib jarista iyo buuxinta, shay kasta hal safar, mitir kuub ama yaar kuub (mashruucyada fiitka). Faylasha Qaababka, gobollada, kooridoradaha dheeraadka ah iyo qaababka dhulka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Mashruuc aan isticmaalin midkoodna wuxuu u kaydiyaa sidii hore, nooca CivilCraft ee hore ayaa furi kara mashruuca oo isticmaala (waxay iska indho-tiraan qaababka oo ay dhisaan qaabkii kooridorka).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"issues","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Arrimaha iyo BCF","summary":"Ku xidh dhibaato qorshaha, istaysanka khadka waddada, barta dusha ama tuubo, siiso xaalad iyo faallooyin, oo is-beddel arrimaha sida faylal BCF 2.1 ah oo ag dhow faylka LandXML.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["arrin","arrimo","bcf","faallo","calaamadin","dhibaato yar","cilladda","goob","calaamad","xaalad","fur","xallay","xiran","qaabka iskaashiga bim","landxml","dhibaatooyin"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-arrin","text":"Ku dar arrin","level":2},{"id":"is-weydaarso-iyaga-oo-bcf-ah","text":"Is-weydaarso iyaga oo BCF ah","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-la-hubin","text":"Waxa aan la hubin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EArrin waa qoraal lagu xidho meel gudaha naqshaddaada CivilCraft, oo leh cinwaan, xaalad iyo faallooyin. Isticmaal si aad u sheegto shaqaalaha goobta ama barnaamij kale waxa loo baahan yahay in la eego, oo aad ku akhrido jawaabahooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-arrin\"\u003EKu dar arrin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha dhulka, Wax dheeraad ah, Arrimaha (BCF)...\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor cinwaan iyo waxa khaldan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro meesha aad ku xidhayso: dhexda muuqaalka qorshaha, barta dusha ee dhexda, istaysan ka mid ah khadka waddada la doortay (qor istaysanka iyo fogaanshaha, midigta waa togan), ama tuubada, qaab-dhismeedka ama khadka astaanta la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar arrin\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamadda ayaa ku muuqata qorshaha qaab dheeman ah oo leh lambarkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji cinwaanka arrin si aad ugu weynaysid, beddel xaaladeeda liiska (Fur, Firfircoon, Xallay, Xiran) oo ku dar faallooyin. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-celin ah, arrimaha waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"is-weydaarso-iyaga-oo-bcf-ah\"\u003EIs-weydaarso iyaga oo BCF ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi BCF\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoraa fayl BCF 2.1 ah oo leh mawduuc keliya arrin kasta: cinwaan, xaalad, faallooyin, iyo hal aragti oo leh kamarad qorshe orthogonal ah iyo calaamadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo geli BCF\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa fayl BCF (faylalka 2.0 iyo 3.0 waa la akhriyaa ilaa ay la mid yihiin 2.1). Mawduuc leh guid aad hore u haysatid wuxuu cusbooneysiinayaa arrinkaas (xaalad, faallooyin cusub) halkii uu ku dari lahaa mid labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa soo qaad dhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka sameeyaa arrin kasta oo furan oo ku jirta guddiga Dhibaatooyinka oo sheegaysa meesha ay tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBCF waxay qaadaa mitirada isku-xidhka mashruucan oo kaliya, iyada oo aan wax la wareejin. Barnaamijka kale waa inuu ku jiraa isla nidaamka isku-xidhka sida faylka LandXML si calaamadaha ay ugu dhacaan meesha saxda ah. Elementka calaamaddu tilmaamayso (khadka waddada, istaysanka, fogaanshaha, tuubada) wuxuu u gudbaa siddii sumado ku bilaabma &quot;cc:&quot;, kuwaas oo CivilCraft mar kale akhrisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-la-hubin\"\u003EWaxa aan la hubin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha iyo aragtida waxaa lagu tijaabiyay oo keliya iyada oo fayl la qorayo oo mar kale lagu akhrinayo CivilCraft. Weli ma jirto barnaamij BIM kale oo furay. Haddii &quot;view to world scale&quot; BCF uu macno u leeyahay buuxa mise badhka dhexe ee dhererka aragtida waxay kala duwan tahay barnaamijyada; CivilCraft wuxuu qoraa dhererka buuxa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Arrin waa qoraal lagu xidho meel gudaha naqshaddaada CivilCraft, oo leh cinwaan, xaalad iyo faallooyin. Isticmaal si aad u sheegto shaqaalaha goobta ama barnaamij kale waxa loo baahan yahay in la eego, oo aad ku akhrido jawaabahooda. Ku dar arrin Fur Dusha dhulka, Wax dheeraad ah, Arrimaha (BCF)... Qor cinwaan iyo waxa khaldan. Dooro meesha aad ku xidhayso: dhexda muuqaalka qorshaha, barta dusha ee dhexda, istaysan ka mid ah khadka waddada la doortay (qor istaysanka iyo fogaanshaha, midigta waa togan), ama tuubada, qaab-dhismeedka ama khadka astaanta la doortay. Riix Ku dar arrin. Calaamadda ayaa ku muuqata qorshaha qaab dheeman ah oo leh lambarkeeda. Guji cinwaanka arrin si aad ugu weynaysid, beddel xaaladeeda liiska (Fur, Firfircoon, Xallay, Xiran) oo ku dar faallooyin. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-celin ah, arrimaha waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Is-weydaarso iyaga oo BCF ah Dhoofi BCF wuxuu qoraa fayl BCF 2.1 ah oo leh mawduuc keliya arrin kasta: cinwaan, xaalad, faallooyin, iyo hal aragti oo leh kamarad qorshe orthogonal ah iyo calaamadda. Soo geli BCF wuxuu akhriyaa fayl BCF (faylalka 2.0 iyo 3.0 waa la akhriyaa ilaa ay la mid yihiin 2.1). Mawduuc leh guid aad hore u haysatid wuxuu cusbooneysiinayaa arrinkaas (xaalad, faallooyin cusub) halkii uu ku dari lahaa mid labaad. Ka soo qaad dhibaatooyinka wuxuu ka sameeyaa arrin kasta oo furan oo ku jirta guddiga Dhibaatooyinka oo sheegaysa meesha ay tahay. BCF waxay qaadaa mitirada isku-xidhka mashruucan oo kaliya, iyada oo aan wax la wareejin. Barnaamijka kale waa inuu ku jiraa isla nidaamka isku-xidhka sida faylka LandXML si calaamadaha ay ugu dhacaan meesha saxda ah. Elementka calaamaddu tilmaamayso (khadka waddada, istaysanka, fogaanshaha, tuubada) wuxuu u gudbaa siddii sumado ku bilaabma \"cc:\", kuwaas oo CivilCraft mar kale akhrisa. Waxa aan la hubin Calaamadaha iyo aragtida waxaa lagu tijaabiyay oo keliya iyada oo fayl la qorayo oo mar kale lagu akhrinayo CivilCraft. Weli ma jirto barnaamij BIM kale oo furay. Haddii \"view to world scale\" BCF uu macno u leeyahay buuxa mise badhka dhexe ee dhererka aragtida waxay kala duwan tahay barnaamijyada; CivilCraft wuxuu qoraa dhererka buuxa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"soils-roads-survey-mines-links","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhulka, isgoysyada, habaynta sahanka, godadka macdanta, xiriirrada raadiyaha iyo shaqaaqyada tareenka","summary":"Lix daaqadood oo ku jira Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah: dhulka iyo jiifka, isgoysyada iyo calaamadaynta (curb return saddex-borooska, dariiqyada, sawirka qorshaha iyo .dxf), habaynta sahanka (shabakad xor ah, wareegyo xidhan, faylalka ururiyaha xogta), godadka macdanta (marxaladaha iyo jadwal), xiriirrada raadiyaha (helitaanka iyo hubinta munaaradda) iyo shaqaaqyada tareenka oo lagu dhigo jid-hagaha.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["dhul","boring log","xasilnaanta jiifka","bishop","hoos-u-dhac","isgoys","junction","intersection","curb return","saddex-boroosh","qalooca isku-dhafan","compound curve","dariiqa-wadista","crosswalk","calaamadaynta","calaamadaha","masaafada aragga","ugu yar-labajibbaaran","least squares","habayn","adjustment","shabakad xor ah","free network","wareeg","traverse","bowditch","xeerka qutub-tilmaameedka","compass rule","ururiyaha xogta","data collector","rw5","gsi","jobxml","god","pit","macdan","mining","moodelka xannaanada","block model","marxaladaha","phases","jadwal","schedule","npv","xiriirka raadiyaha","radio link","fresnel","helitaanka","availability","munaarad","tower","dabayl","wind","shaqaaq","turnout","isgoys","crossover","dxf"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha › Wax dheeraad ah\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro daaqadda. Mid kasta wuxuu hayaa walxahiisa faylka mashruucaaga, wuxuuna socodsiiyaa xisaabta isla kan ay assistant-ku socodsiiyo, wuxuuna sheegaa meesha tiro ay tahay qiyaas bilow oo keliya. Kuwani waa qalab xisaab; injineer ayaa hubiya natiijo kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoysyada iyo calaamadaynta.\u003C/strong\u003E Isgoys waa cagaha isku-kulma barta. Siiso cag kasta radius curb return keeda haddii aad doonto, ama dooro \u003Cem\u003EThree centres (2:1:2)\u003C/em\u003E curb return isku-dhafan oo ay baahan tahay baabuur rogaya. \u003Cem\u003ECrosswalks\u003C/em\u003E wuxuu dhigaa dariiqa-wadista iyo barta istaagga cag kasta. Calaamadaynta iyo calaamadaha waxay socdaan jid-hagaha. Walxaha leh \u003Cem\u003EShow on the plan\u003C/em\u003E oo ah haa waa la sawiraa qorshaha, \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi sawirka jidka (.dxf)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoraa sawirka isku mid ah oo leh lakabyo magacaysan (\u003Ccode\u003EC-ROAD-EDGE\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EC-ROAD-MARK-YELLOW\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EC-ROAD-XWALK\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EC-ROAD-SIGN\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EC-RAIL-TURNOUT\u003C/code\u003E). Fogaanshaha dhismaha (setbacks), ballacyada iyo koodhka calaamadaha waa meel-hayn: buugga hay&#039;addaada ayaa xukuma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabaynta sahanka.\u003C/strong\u003E Geli barta iyo cabbiraadaha, ama soo dhoofi fayl ururiyaha xogta (RW5, GSI, JobXML, CSV). Dooro \u003Cem\u003EFree network: yes\u003C/em\u003E marka aanu barta midna la hayn: datum-ka waxaa la go&#039;aamiyaa wixii ugu yar ee loo baahan yahay, sidaas darteed isku-xidhka waxaa ku xidhan doorashadaas laakiin hadhaagga, factor-ka variance-ka iyo imtixaanka blunder-ka ma aha. \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi barta la habeeyay (.csv)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoraa natiijada. Akhristayaasha waxaa lagu qoray sharaxaadda guud ee formats-ka dadweynaha, waxaana lagu tijaabiyay faylal aan naga soo saarnay; waxay liistaa sadar kasta oo aanay fahmin. \u003Cem\u003ETraverses\u003C/em\u003E wuxuu wareegga ku xidhaa xeerka qutub-tilmaameedka, wuxuuna siiyaa misclosure iyo saxnaanta sida 1 : n.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGodadka macdanta.\u003C/strong\u003E Tijaabooyinka qodista waxay noqdaan moodel xannaano iyo god ugu dambeeya. Deji \u003Cem\u003EPit phases\u003C/em\u003E ka weyn 0 si aad u hesho godad dhex-dhex ah sida factor-ka dakhliga, iyo awoodda warshadda iyo ciidanka si loo sameeyo jadwal xilli kasta oo leh cash flow lacag-dhimma. Qiime kasta, kharash kasta iyo jiifkasta waa kaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXiriirrada raadiyaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka laga reebo khadka aragga iyo marginka, xiriirku wuxuu soo sheegaa go&#039;ida multipath (qiyaasta Vigants–Barnett, aan roob lahayn). Siiso ballaca wajiga munaarada si aad u hesho cadaadiska dabayshaha iyo momentka saldhigga, iyo factor-ka rogidda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShaqaaqyada tareenka.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro jid-hagaha iyo saldhig, shaqaaqa waa la sawiraa jid-hagahaas. Xuduudaha oo dhan waa meel-hayn ilaa aad ku dejiso heerka tareenkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERampka qaadista iyo godka 3D.\u003C/strong\u003E Siiso godka ballaca rampka, daaqadda godku wuxuu dhigaa rampka qaadista darbiyada ee gradient-ka rampka: wuxuu u dhacaa darbiga bench kasta sare-dhaadheerka bench-ka ka sarreeya gradient-ka, ka dibna wuxuu gudaha ugu soo gelaa bench-ka xiga. Sawir ayaa muujinaya bench-ka kasta iyo rampka ka sarreeya. &quot;Ramp lane flattens the pit wall&quot; wuxuu ka dhigaa xadka godka isticmaalka darbiga ka siman oo rampku u baahan yahay bench kasta. Rampku waa sawir ku saabsan darbiyada xannaanada, ma aha naqshad waddo qaadista; daaqaddu way sheegtaa marka waddadu u baahan tahay inay godka ku wareegto ka badan hal mar, ka dhaadho bench hoose, ama aanu dabaqa ku habboon. &quot;Cut the pit into the ground&quot; wuxuu god ka qodaa dhulka jira wuxuuna sheegaa inta uu tahay; &quot;Show in the 3D view&quot; wuxuu sawiraa dhulka la jaray, bench-ka rims-ka iyo rampka muuqaalka 3D (Open pits iyo haul ramps waa beddelayaan).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDaboolka.\u003C/strong\u003E Hoosta Radio links, tab-ka Coverage wuxuu qaataa transmitter, awoodiisa iyo gains-ka, dareenka receiver-ka, radius iyo cell size, wuxuuna iftiimiyaa aagga uu gaari karo dhulka jira, qorshaha iyo sawir aad keydin karto. Cell kasta waxay leedahay free-space loss iyo buurta ugu xun ee jidka toosan (knife-edge diffraction, ITU-R P.526); waxay ka tagtaa buuro dhowr oo isku xigta, roob iyo qaabka antenna, sidaas darteed way yar tahay u-cadaahay. Munaaradda xiriirka ayaa sidoo kale hesha hubinta lugta: cadaadiska lugta iyo kor-u-kaca ka dhalda momentka dabayshaha iyo miisaanka, la barbardhigo awoodda lugta iyo factor-ka culeyska aad siiso, iyo Euler buckling marka aad siiso qaybta. Waa statics oo keliya: ma jiraan tirooyin ka timid code-ka munaaradda, sidaas darteed code-kaaga ayaa go&#039;aamiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka goobta lama tijaabin faylal dhab ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Akhristayaasha RW5, GSI, JobXML iyo CSV waa la qoray sharaxaadda dadweynaha ee qaab kasta, waxaana lagu tijaabiyay oo keliya faylal aan naga soo saarnay, oo ay ku jiraan faylal burburay oo aan u ogolayn inay burburaan. Daaqadda sahanka way sheegtaa mar kasta oo aad soo dhoofinayso. Hubi barta iyo cabbiraadaha warbixinta aaladdaada; haddii faylka dhabta ahi aanu akhrin, noo dir (qoraalka tijaabada bulshada waa \u003Ccode\u003Edocs/community-tests/EG.11.md\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah oo dooro daaqadda. Mid kasta wuxuu hayaa walxahiisa faylka mashruucaaga, wuxuuna socodsiiyaa xisaabta isla kan ay assistant-ku socodsiiyo, wuxuuna sheegaa meesha tiro ay tahay qiyaas bilow oo keliya. Kuwani waa qalab xisaab; injineer ayaa hubiya natiijo kasta. Isgoysyada iyo calaamadaynta. Isgoys waa cagaha isku-kulma barta. Siiso cag kasta radius curb return keeda haddii aad doonto, ama dooro Three centres (2:1:2) curb return isku-dhafan oo ay baahan tahay baabuur rogaya. Crosswalks wuxuu dhigaa dariiqa-wadista iyo barta istaagga cag kasta. Calaamadaynta iyo calaamadaha waxay socdaan jid-hagaha. Walxaha leh Show on the plan oo ah haa waa la sawiraa qorshaha, Kaydi sawirka jidka (.dxf) wuxuu qoraa sawirka isku mid ah oo leh lakabyo magacaysan (C-ROAD-EDGE, C-ROAD-MARK-YELLOW, C-ROAD-XWALK, C-ROAD-SIGN, C-RAIL-TURNOUT). Fogaanshaha dhismaha (setbacks), ballacyada iyo koodhka calaamadaha waa meel-hayn: buugga hay'addaada ayaa xukuma. Habaynta sahanka. Geli barta iyo cabbiraadaha, ama soo dhoofi fayl ururiyaha xogta (RW5, GSI, JobXML, CSV). Dooro Free network: yes marka aanu barta midna la hayn: datum-ka waxaa la go'aamiyaa wixii ugu yar ee loo baahan yahay, sidaas darteed isku-xidhka waxaa ku xidhan doorashadaas laakiin hadhaagga, factor-ka variance-ka iyo imtixaanka blunder-ka ma aha. Kaydi barta la habeeyay (.csv) wuxuu qoraa natiijada. Akhristayaasha waxaa lagu qoray sharaxaadda guud ee formats-ka dadweynaha, waxaana lagu tijaabiyay faylal aan naga soo saarnay; waxay liistaa sadar kasta oo aanay fahmin. Traverses wuxuu wareegga ku xidhaa xeerka qutub-tilmaameedka, wuxuuna siiyaa misclosure iyo saxnaanta sida 1 : n. Godadka macdanta. Tijaabooyinka qodista waxay noqdaan moodel xannaano iyo god ugu dambeeya. Deji Pit phases ka weyn 0 si aad u hesho godad dhex-dhex ah sida factor-ka dakhliga, iyo awoodda warshadda iyo ciidanka si loo sameeyo jadwal xilli kasta oo leh cash flow lacag-dhimma. Qiime kasta, kharash kasta iyo jiifkasta waa kaaga. Xiriirrada raadiyaha. Marka laga reebo khadka aragga iyo marginka, xiriirku wuxuu soo sheegaa go'ida multipath (qiyaasta Vigants–Barnett, aan roob lahayn). Siiso ballaca wajiga munaarada si aad u hesho cadaadiska dabayshaha iyo momentka saldhigga, iyo factor-ka rogidda. Shaqaaqyada tareenka. Dooro jid-hagaha iyo saldhig, shaqaaqa waa la sawiraa jid-hagahaas. Xuduudaha oo dhan waa meel-hayn ilaa aad ku dejiso heerka tareenkaaga. Rampka qaadista iyo godka 3D. Siiso godka ballaca rampka, daaqadda godku wuxuu dhigaa rampka qaadista darbiyada ee gradient-ka rampka: wuxuu u dhacaa darbiga bench kasta sare-dhaadheerka bench-ka ka sarreeya gradient-ka, ka dibna wuxuu gudaha ugu soo gelaa bench-ka xiga. Sawir ayaa muujinaya bench-ka kasta iyo rampka ka sarreeya. \"Ramp lane flattens the pit wall\" wuxuu ka dhigaa xadka godka isticmaalka darbiga ka siman oo rampku u baahan yahay bench kasta. Rampku waa sawir ku saabsan darbiyada xannaanada, ma aha naqshad waddo qaadista; daaqaddu way sheegtaa marka waddadu u baahan tahay inay godka ku wareegto ka badan hal mar, ka dhaadho bench hoose, ama aanu dabaqa ku habboon. \"Cut the pit into the ground\" wuxuu god ka qodaa dhulka jira wuxuuna sheegaa inta uu tahay; \"Show in the 3D view\" wuxuu sawiraa dhulka la jaray, bench-ka rims-ka iyo rampka muuqaalka 3D (Open pits iyo haul ramps waa beddelayaan). Daboolka. Hoosta Radio links, tab-ka Coverage wuxuu qaataa transmitter, awoodiisa iyo gains-ka, dareenka receiver-ka, radius iyo cell size, wuxuuna iftiimiyaa aagga uu gaari karo dhulka jira, qorshaha iyo sawir aad keydin karto. Cell kasta waxay leedahay free-space loss iyo buurta ugu xun ee jidka toosan (knife-edge diffraction, ITU-R P.526); waxay ka tagtaa buuro dhowr oo isku xigta, roob iyo qaabka antenna, sidaas darteed way yar tahay u-cadaahay. Munaaradda xiriirka ayaa sidoo kale hesha hubinta lugta: cadaadiska lugta iyo kor-u-kaca ka dhalda momentka dabayshaha iyo miisaanka, la barbardhigo awoodda lugta iyo factor-ka culeyska aad siiso, iyo Euler buckling marka aad siiso qaybta. Waa statics oo keliya: ma jiraan tirooyin ka timid code-ka munaaradda, sidaas darteed code-kaaga ayaa go'aamiya. Faylalka goobta lama tijaabin faylal dhab ah. Akhristayaasha RW5, GSI, JobXML iyo CSV waa la qoray sharaxaadda dadweynaha ee qaab kasta, waxaana lagu tijaabiyay oo keliya faylal aan naga soo saarnay, oo ay ku jiraan faylal burburay oo aan u ogolayn inay burburaan. Daaqadda sahanka way sheegtaa mar kasta oo aad soo dhoofinayso. Hubi barta iyo cabbiraadaha warbixinta aaladdaada; haddii faylka dhabta ahi aanu akhrin, noo dir (qoraalka tijaabada bulshada waa docs/community-tests/EG.11.md).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"swept-paths","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Jidadka wareegga gaadiga","summary":"Gaari leh ilaa saddex gaari-dambe ah ku wad khad dhul ama alignment, hore ama dib, oo arag aagga uu mari doono, jidadka giraabta, u-jeedinta, iyo meesha uu ku jackknife-ayo.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["jidka wareegga","jidka leexashada","socodsiinta gaariga","wareegga","gaariga naqshadda","baabuur","bas","gaari-dambe","semitrailer","dib u socodka","dib u riixida","jackknife","isku-xirka","xakamaynta u-jeedinta","offtracking","jidka giraabta","albaabka dhoofinta","radiyaha wareegga"],"headings":[{"id":"gaari-ku-wad-khad","text":"Gaari ku wad khad","level":2},{"id":"hore-iyo-dib","text":"Hore iyo dib","level":2},{"id":"akhri-natiijada","text":"Akhri natiijada","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-xisaabiyo","text":"Sida loo xisaabiyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EJidka wareegga wuxuu gaari ku wadaa khad, wuxuuna muujinayaa dhulka uu jirkiisu mari doono. Isticmaal si aad u hubiso in baabuurku geesta wareegi karo, albaabka dhoofinta gaadhi karo, ama gaari-dambe dib u riixi karo oo ku dhigi karo meesha sax ah iyada oo aanu waddada ka bixin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gaari-ku-wad-khad\"\u003EGaari ku wad khad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir khadka ay gaarigu raacayo, jihada socodka: khad muuqaal (feature line) (qaansooyinka way fiican yihiin: taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E markaad sawirayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/feature-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/feature-lines\"\u003EKhadadka muuqaalka\u003C/a\u003E) ama alignment.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwept path…\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKa bilow\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro gaari, kadibna deji cabbirkiisa naqshadda gaarigaaga: ballaca, dheerka hore (front overhang), wheelbase, dheerka dambe (rear overhang), track iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EXidhka wareegga\u003C/strong\u003E (Steering lock). Ku dar ilaa saddex gaari-dambe, mid kasta oo leh meesha uu ku xirnaan, dherkiisa ilaa dhidibka (axle), dheerka hore iyo dambe, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xirka ugu weyn\u003C/strong\u003E (Largest articulation).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWadista\u003C/strong\u003E: hore ama dib. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrive it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadiyada laga bilaabayo waa meel-hayn (placeholder), ma aha caadi. Cabbirka ka dhig gaariga naqshadda ee mashruucaaga isticmaalo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hore-iyo-dib\"\u003EHore iyo dib\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWadista\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa raacaya khadka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa CivilCraft xisaabiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHore\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBartamaha dhidibka hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeesha dhidibka dambe iyo gaari-dambe kasta u gudbayaan, xagalka wareegga iyo isku-xirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDib\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBartamaha dhidibka ugu dambeeya (gadaasha gaari-dambe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeesha unug kasta oo hore u jira, iyo wareegga cabka ay gaari-dambe halkaas u gaadhayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDib u socodka waa sida dib-u-riixidda loo hubiyo: sheeg meesha gaari-dambe ay u tagi lahayd, CivilCraft wuxuu kuu sheegaa cabka ma samayn karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-natiijada\"\u003EAkhri natiijada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJidka wareegga waxaa lagu muujiyaa naqshadda midab orange ah: qaabkiisa iyo, qaab dashed ah, jidadka giraabta ugu dambeeya. Dooro (guji gudihiisa) si aad ugu aragto \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka la wado\u003C/strong\u003E, xagalka ugu weyn ee \u003Cstrong\u003EWareegga\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xirka\u003C/strong\u003E marka loo barbar dhigo xadadkooda, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EAagga wareega\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibaato kasta oo khadka ku jirta, iyo masaafadeeda: wareegga oo dhaafay xadka, ama gaari-dambe oo wareegaya dhaafay xadka isku-xirka (wuu jackknife-ayaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGaariga khadka dhinac\u003C/strong\u003E: dhaqaajinta slider-ka si aad u aragto gaariga meel kasta, oo leh wareegga iyo isku-xirkiisa halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadka marka aad beddesho, jidka wareegga wuu raacaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit the vehicle…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa cabbirrada; \u003Cstrong\u003EWadista\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u beddelaa hore iyo dib. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqda. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa jidka wareegga la doortay (khadka ayaa sii haysa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha iyo jidadka giraabta waxay u gudbaan PDF, DXF iyo DWG layer-ka C-ROAD-SWPT.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-xisaabiyo\"\u003ESida loo xisaabiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaari kasta wuxuu wareegaa xarriiqa dhidibka dambe, waxaana raacaya nuqta ka horeysa (dhidibka hore ama hitch-ka), oo ah habka xawaaraha-hooseeya ee aan lisin (low-speed, no-slip) ee ay jidadka wareegga hubiyaan. Aagga wareega waa dhammaan qaabka jirka mid kasta oo isku dhafan. Ma moodeelayo xawaaraha, lisidda taayirka, waqtiga ay wareegga u qaadato, gaari-dambe wareegga, iyo fogaanta hoosta jirka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jidka wareegga wuxuu gaari ku wadaa khad, wuxuuna muujinayaa dhulka uu jirkiisu mari doono. Isticmaal si aad u hubiso in baabuurku geesta wareegi karo, albaabka dhoofinta gaadhi karo, ama gaari-dambe dib u riixi karo oo ku dhigi karo meesha sax ah iyada oo aanu waddada ka bixin. Gaari ku wad khad Sawir khadka ay gaarigu raacayo, jihada socodka: khad muuqaal (feature line) (qaansooyinka way fiican yihiin: taabo C markaad sawirayso, eeg Khadadka muuqaalka) ama alignment. Dooro oo guji Swept path… Sifooyinkeeda. Hoosta Ka bilow, dooro gaari, kadibna deji cabbirkiisa naqshadda gaarigaaga: ballaca, dheerka hore (front overhang), wheelbase, dheerka dambe (rear overhang), track iyo Xidhka wareegga (Steering lock). Ku dar ilaa saddex gaari-dambe, mid kasta oo leh meesha uu ku xirnaan, dherkiisa ilaa dhidibka (axle), dheerka hore iyo dambe, iyo Isku-xirka ugu weyn (Largest articulation). Dooro Wadista: hore ama dib. Guji Drive it. Gaadiyada laga bilaabayo waa meel-hayn (placeholder), ma aha caadi. Cabbirka ka dhig gaariga naqshadda ee mashruucaaga isticmaalo. Hore iyo dib Wadista Waxa raacaya khadka Waxa CivilCraft xisaabiyo Hore Bartamaha dhidibka hore Meesha dhidibka dambe iyo gaari-dambe kasta u gudbayaan, xagalka wareegga iyo isku-xirka Dib Bartamaha dhidibka ugu dambeeya (gadaasha gaari-dambe) Meesha unug kasta oo hore u jira, iyo wareegga cabka ay gaari-dambe halkaas u gaadhayso Dib u socodka waa sida dib-u-riixidda loo hubiyo: sheeg meesha gaari-dambe ay u tagi lahayd, CivilCraft wuxuu kuu sheegaa cabka ma samayn karo. Akhri natiijada Jidka wareegga waxaa lagu muujiyaa naqshadda midab orange ah: qaabkiisa iyo, qaab dashed ah, jidadka giraabta ugu dambeeya. Dooro (guji gudihiisa) si aad ugu aragto Sifooyinkeeda: Dhererka la wado, xagalka ugu weyn ee Wareegga iyo Isku-xirka marka loo barbar dhigo xadadkooda, iyo Aagga wareega. Dhibaato kasta oo khadka ku jirta, iyo masaafadeeda: wareegga oo dhaafay xadka, ama gaari-dambe oo wareegaya dhaafay xadka isku-xirka (wuu jackknife-ayaa). Gaariga khadka dhinac: dhaqaajinta slider-ka si aad u aragto gaariga meel kasta, oo leh wareegga iyo isku-xirkiisa halkaas. Khadka marka aad beddesho, jidka wareegga wuu raacaa. Edit the vehicle… wuxuu beddelaa cabbirrada; Wadista wuxuu u beddelaa hore iyo dib. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqda. Delete wuxuu tirtiraa jidka wareegga la doortay (khadka ayaa sii haysa). Dhibcaha iyo jidadka giraabta waxay u gudbaan PDF, DXF iyo DWG layer-ka C-ROAD-SWPT. Sida loo xisaabiyo Gaari kasta wuxuu wareegaa xarriiqa dhidibka dambe, waxaana raacaya nuqta ka horeysa (dhidibka hore ama hitch-ka), oo ah habka xawaaraha-hooseeya ee aan lisin (low-speed, no-slip) ee ay jidadka wareegga hubiyaan. Aagga wareega waa dhammaan qaabka jirka mid kasta oo isku dhafan. Ma moodeelayo xawaaraha, lisidda taayirka, waqtiga ay wareegga u qaadato, gaari-dambe wareegga, iyo fogaanta hoosta jirka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"utility-networks","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Shabakadaha adeegga iyo OpenStreetMap","summary":"Jidadka biyaha, qashinka, biyaha roobka, gaaska, korontada iyo isgaarsiinta oo leh alaab, cabbir, daboolka iyo milkiileyaal; xogta OpenStreetMap oo ka timid fayl Overpass JSON ah; isgoysyada, xabaashyada iyo mugga; lakabyada adeegga ee DWG, DXF iyo PDF; qaybaha tuubada iyo kablaha ee IFC.","section":"tasks","order":64,"keywords":["adeeg","shabakad","adeegyo","osm","openstreetmap","overpass","tuubo","kable","gaas","qashin","biyo roob","korontada","isgaarsiin","biyo","hidranto","god","xabaash","isgoyn","fogaan","daboolka","qoto","dwg","ifc","juqraafi","lakabyo"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-jidadka","text":"Samee jidadka","level":2},{"id":"hubinta-iyo-wax-soo-saarka","text":"Hubinta iyo wax-soo-saarka","level":2},{"id":"xogta-openstreetmap","text":"Xogta OpenStreetMap","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-wali-la-samayn","text":"Waxa aan wali la samayn","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQeybaha hoose ee goobta u samee shabakad keliya oo adeeg kasta u gaar ah, hubi meesha ay isku gudbayaan, oo u dir lakabyo naqshad iyo IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-jidadka\"\u003ESamee jidadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha, Dheeraad, Shabakadaha adeegga...\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESamee jid laga doortay\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u beddelaa khadka jidka, khadka muuqaalka ama tuubada la doortay jid ah adeegga aad dooratay. Kadib buuxi alaabta, cabbirka (mm), daboolka (masaafada ilaa sare ee tuubada ama kabalka) iyo milkiilaha miiska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri xogta OpenStreetMap\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa fayl Overpass JSON ah oo aad kaydisay (weydiin leh \u003Ccode\u003Eout geom;\u003C/code\u003E). Mashruucu wuxuu u baahan yahay nidaam isku-xidhka marka hore, maxaa yeelay booska OpenStreetMap waa latitude iyo longitude. Tuubooyinka (sida maaddada), kablaha korontada iyo isgaarsiinta ee dhulka hoostiisa, hidrantada, godadka iyo biyo-marinnada roobka ayaa la akhrin doonaa. Wax kasta oo kale waa la tirin doonaa inay ka baxsan yihiin, fariinta ayaana sheegaysa. Xariiqyada korontada ee sare waa la reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar khariidadda OpenStreetMap\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku daraa khariidadda OpenStreetMap qorshaha hoose. Waxay muuqataa oo keliya marka khariidadaha internetka ee Dejinta ay daaran yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta-iyo-wax-soo-saarka\"\u003EHubinta iyo wax-soo-saarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoysyada\u003C/strong\u003E: jidadka adeegyo kala duwan ah ee qorshaha isku gudba waxaa lagu liis garaynayaa fogaanta u dhexaysa iyada oo lagu xusayo inta u dhexaysa dhulka sare, haddii uu jiro. Ugu yar waa meel-hayeen aad dejiso, ma aha tirada heerka ee caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXabaash\u003C/strong\u003E: jid kasta wuxuu helaa xabaash (cabbirka tuubada oo ay ku daraan fogaanta labada dhinac, nidaamka dhinaca, iyo aasaaska) oo leh mug. Wadarta waxay ka muuqanaysaa daaqadda iyo CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshad\u003C/strong\u003E: jidadka iyo dhibcaha waxay ku jiraan lakabyada adeegga (tusaale ahaan U-WATR-RUN, U-POWR-RUN), sidaas darteed waxay gaari doonaan PDF, DXF iyo DWG.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC\u003C/strong\u003E: jidadku waxay galaan dhoofinta IFC sida qaybo tuubo iyo qaybo kable, oo ay weheliyaan hidrantada, faalfaha iyo qolalka, hal nidaam oo adeeg kasta, oo ku salaysan nidaamka isku-xidhka mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xogta-openstreetmap\"\u003EXogta OpenStreetMap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXogta OpenStreetMap waa xuquuqda kuwa ku deeqay OpenStreetMap, waxayna leedahay liisanka ODbL. Tixraacidda waxa lagu daraa naqshadda, CSV iyo IFC. Haddii aad wadaagto fayl ka kooban xogta OpenStreetMap, ilaali tixraacidda oo akhri shuruudaha wadaagga isku mid ah ee liisanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-wali-la-samayn\"\u003EWaxa aan wali la samayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJidadka lama sawirin dhibic-dhibic qorshaha adigoo isticmaalaya qalab, isgoysyadana lama sawirin muuqaalka profile-ka weli (xisaabtu waa la dhisay). Qoto, cabbir iyo fogaan waxay bilaabmaan sida meel-hayeen; isticmaal tirooyinka heerkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qeybaha hoose ee goobta u samee shabakad keliya oo adeeg kasta u gaar ah, hubi meesha ay isku gudbayaan, oo u dir lakabyo naqshad iyo IFC. Samee jidadka Fur Dusha, Dheeraad, Shabakadaha adeegga... Samee jid laga doortay wuxuu u beddelaa khadka jidka, khadka muuqaalka ama tuubada la doortay jid ah adeegga aad dooratay. Kadib buuxi alaabta, cabbirka (mm), daboolka (masaafada ilaa sare ee tuubada ama kabalka) iyo milkiilaha miiska. Akhri xogta OpenStreetMap wuxuu akhrinayaa fayl Overpass JSON ah oo aad kaydisay (weydiin leh out geom;). Mashruucu wuxuu u baahan yahay nidaam isku-xidhka marka hore, maxaa yeelay booska OpenStreetMap waa latitude iyo longitude. Tuubooyinka (sida maaddada), kablaha korontada iyo isgaarsiinta ee dhulka hoostiisa, hidrantada, godadka iyo biyo-marinnada roobka ayaa la akhrin doonaa. Wax kasta oo kale waa la tirin doonaa inay ka baxsan yihiin, fariinta ayaana sheegaysa. Xariiqyada korontada ee sare waa la reebay. Ku dar khariidadda OpenStreetMap wuxuu ku daraa khariidadda OpenStreetMap qorshaha hoose. Waxay muuqataa oo keliya marka khariidadaha internetka ee Dejinta ay daaran yihiin. Hubinta iyo wax-soo-saarka Isgoysyada: jidadka adeegyo kala duwan ah ee qorshaha isku gudba waxaa lagu liis garaynayaa fogaanta u dhexaysa iyada oo lagu xusayo inta u dhexaysa dhulka sare, haddii uu jiro. Ugu yar waa meel-hayeen aad dejiso, ma aha tirada heerka ee caadiga ah. Xabaash: jid kasta wuxuu helaa xabaash (cabbirka tuubada oo ay ku daraan fogaanta labada dhinac, nidaamka dhinaca, iyo aasaaska) oo leh mug. Wadarta waxay ka muuqanaysaa daaqadda iyo CSV. Naqshad: jidadka iyo dhibcaha waxay ku jiraan lakabyada adeegga (tusaale ahaan U-WATR-RUN, U-POWR-RUN), sidaas darteed waxay gaari doonaan PDF, DXF iyo DWG. IFC: jidadku waxay galaan dhoofinta IFC sida qaybo tuubo iyo qaybo kable, oo ay weheliyaan hidrantada, faalfaha iyo qolalka, hal nidaam oo adeeg kasta, oo ku salaysan nidaamka isku-xidhka mashruuca. Xogta OpenStreetMap Xogta OpenStreetMap waa xuquuqda kuwa ku deeqay OpenStreetMap, waxayna leedahay liisanka ODbL. Tixraacidda waxa lagu daraa naqshadda, CSV iyo IFC. Haddii aad wadaagto fayl ka kooban xogta OpenStreetMap, ilaali tixraacidda oo akhri shuruudaha wadaagga isku mid ah ee liisanka. Waxa aan wali la samayn Jidadka lama sawirin dhibic-dhibic qorshaha adigoo isticmaalaya qalab, isgoysyadana lama sawirin muuqaalka profile-ka weli (xisaabtu waa la dhisay). Qoto, cabbir iyo fogaan waxay bilaabmaan sida meel-hayeen; isticmaal tirooyinka heerkaaga.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"parking-lot","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qaabeynta goobta baabuurta","summary":"Qabee meelaha baabuurta, waddooyinka, meelaha naafada iyo gaadiidka iyo jasiiradaha gudaha xuduud; dhulka u qiyaas biyo-qulqulka ilaa biyo-qulqulada iyo dhulka jira, kadibna dahaar oo beer. Waxaa sidoo kale loo heli karaa kaaliye.","section":"tasks","order":65,"keywords":["baabuur","goob","meel baabuur","waddo","naafo","ada","gaadiid","jasiirad","biyo-qulqul","hoos u dhac","simayn","jar","buuxin","dahaarka","dhagaxa dahaarka","beerinta","geedo","dhulka","bar-daruur","mcp","kaaliye"],"headings":[{"id":"qaabee","text":"Qaabee","level":2},{"id":"meelaha-naafada","text":"Meelaha naafada","level":2},{"id":"jiidh-biyo-qulqulada-jar-iyo-buuxin","text":"Jiidh biyo-qulqulada, jar iyo buuxin","level":2},{"id":"dahaarka-iyo-beerinta","text":"Dahaarka iyo beerinta","level":2},{"id":"kaaliye","text":"Kaaliye","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-la-qabanin","text":"Waxa aan la qabanin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKu habbee goob baabuur barcel, saldhig ama xariiq muuqaal oo xiran gudaha, oo hel tirooyinka, simaynta iyo dahaarka hal tallaabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabee\"\u003EQaabee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro barcel, saldhig ama xariiq muuqaal oo xiran sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha, Dheeraad, Goobta baabuurta...\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro xeerarka, xagasha meelaha baabuurta (90, 75, 60, 45, 30 degrees ama isbarbar) iyo waddooyinka hal-jihada ama laba-jihada. Cabbirrada meelaha, waddooyinka iyo jasiiradaha waxay ka bilaabmaan miiska, mid kastaana waa la qori karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabee\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafafku waxay socdaan geeska xuduudka ee siiya meelaha ugu badan (ama xagasha aad qortay). Meel baabuur waxay tirtaa kaliya haddii ay gebi ahaanba ku jirto xuduudka. Halka ay ka hadhay goob safaf iyo waddo, waxaa lagu daraa qayb hal-dhinac ah. Daaqaddu waxay liistaa meelaha, meelaha naafada iyo gaadiidka, jasiiradaha, biyo-qulqulada iyo aagga meel kasta, sawirkuna wuxuu muujinayaa meelaha baabuurta, meelaha naafada oo leh waddooyinkooda gelitaanka oo laba-geeska ah, jasiiradaha, khadadka dhexe ee waddooyinka iyo biyo-qulqulada lakabyadooda gaarka ah (C-PARK-...), si ay ugu gaadhaan PDF, DXF iyo DWG.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meelaha-naafada\"\u003EMeelaha naafada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXeerarka Maraykanka tirada waxaa raacaysa miiska ADA ee 2010 Standards miis 208.2 meelaha la bixiyay (hal ka mid ah lixda, la dhan-dhamaystiro, waa meel gaadiid), oo lagu dhigo geeska koowaad ee xuduudka (meesha gelitaanka), mid kasta oo leh waddo gelitaan; laba waa la wadaagaa. Meel baabuur oo ka yar ballaca naafada, ama jiid ka cad 1:48 meelaha naafada, waxay muujisaa dhib. \u003Cstrong\u003ELambarkan waxaa laga qoray heerka sida aan xasuusanayo, lama hubin xeerka la daabacay.\u003C/strong\u003E Cabbirrada caadiga ah ee meelaha iyo waddooyinka waxay ka soo jeeddaan hagayaasha naqshadaynta baabuurta, iyagana lama hubin. Hubi labadaba, iyo xeerka deegaankaaga, ka hor intaadan isku halleyn. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EGaar ah\u003C/strong\u003E si aad tirada naafada gacanta ugu geliso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiidh-biyo-qulqulada-jar-iyo-buuxin\"\u003EJiidh biyo-qulqulada, jar iyo buuxin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aadan demin, goobtu waxay noqonaysaa aag simayn gudaha Landscape workspace. Biyo-qulqulada waxaa lagu dhigaa khadadka dhexe ee waddooyinka qiyaastii 100 feet (30 m) kasta; dusha ayaa ka kacaysa biyo-qulqul kasta xagal aad siiso (1.5 percent bilowga), sidaas darteed barta kasta waxay u hoos dhacaysaa biyo-qulqulka ugu dhow. Heerka waa la doortaa si jarka iyo buuxinta goobtu u sinaadaan dhulka jira. Dhulka jira waa dusha jira ee mashruuca, oo laga yaabaa inuu ka yimaado barta sahanka, LandXML, bar-daruur lidar ama scan oo loo beddelay dusha, ama konturada. Daaqaddu waxay muujinaysaa qiyaasta jarka iyo buuxinta; mugga mashruuca ayaa tusaya tirada saxda ah markaas kadib. Aagga simaynta wuxuu hayaa xuduudkiisa dhulka jira, sidaas darteed meesha dusha cusub ka duwan tahay dhulka xuduudka waxaad hesha tallaabo, daaqaddana waxay sheegtaa sida ay weyn tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dahaarka-iyo-beerinta\"\u003EDahaarka iyo beerinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXuduudka oo dhan waxaa lagu dahaaraa dahaar dhagaxyo (naqshad stretcher ah oo aad bedeli karto hoosta Landscape, Hardscape), jasiirad kasta waxay heleysaa gadh dhir iyo, marka ay ballac ku filan tahay, geed, oo laga qaadayo liiska beerta. Wax kasta ka dib waa walax Landscape oo caadi ah: tafatir, ama dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabee mar kale\u003C/strong\u003E si uu wixii goobtu sameysay u bedelo. Goobta oo la tirtiro wixii ay samaysay waa la tirtiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaaliye\"\u003EKaaliye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobtaas isla markaa waxaa laga codsan karaa MCP: \u003Ccode\u003Eparking_layout\u003C/code\u003E horumarinta ayaa muujisa, \u003Ccode\u003Eparking_build\u003C/code\u003E ayaa qora, \u003Ccode\u003Eparking_remove\u003C/code\u003E ayaa goobta ka saara. Weydii magaca barcelka ama dir xuduudka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-la-qabanin\"\u003EWaxa aan la qabanin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa la hubinayo in waddooyinku gaadho waddo. Dahaarku wuxuu daboolaa xuduudka oo dhan, sidaas darteed aagiisu wuxuu ku jiraa jasiiradaha. Dooranka alaabta dahaarka ee Maktabadda iyo nooca Maktabadda ee meelaha lama dhisin; naqshadda dahaarka waa midda Hardscape. Xeerarka dalalka kale lama dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ku habbee goob baabuur barcel, saldhig ama xariiq muuqaal oo xiran gudaha, oo hel tirooyinka, simaynta iyo dahaarka hal tallaabo. Qaabee Dooro barcel, saldhig ama xariiq muuqaal oo xiran sawirka. Fur Dusha, Dheeraad, Goobta baabuurta... Dooro xeerarka, xagasha meelaha baabuurta (90, 75, 60, 45, 30 degrees ama isbarbar) iyo waddooyinka hal-jihada ama laba-jihada. Cabbirrada meelaha, waddooyinka iyo jasiiradaha waxay ka bilaabmaan miiska, mid kastaana waa la qori karaa. Dooro Qaabee. Safafku waxay socdaan geeska xuduudka ee siiya meelaha ugu badan (ama xagasha aad qortay). Meel baabuur waxay tirtaa kaliya haddii ay gebi ahaanba ku jirto xuduudka. Halka ay ka hadhay goob safaf iyo waddo, waxaa lagu daraa qayb hal-dhinac ah. Daaqaddu waxay liistaa meelaha, meelaha naafada iyo gaadiidka, jasiiradaha, biyo-qulqulada iyo aagga meel kasta, sawirkuna wuxuu muujinayaa meelaha baabuurta, meelaha naafada oo leh waddooyinkooda gelitaanka oo laba-geeska ah, jasiiradaha, khadadka dhexe ee waddooyinka iyo biyo-qulqulada lakabyadooda gaarka ah (C-PARK-...), si ay ugu gaadhaan PDF, DXF iyo DWG. Meelaha naafada Xeerarka Maraykanka tirada waxaa raacaysa miiska ADA ee 2010 Standards miis 208.2 meelaha la bixiyay (hal ka mid ah lixda, la dhan-dhamaystiro, waa meel gaadiid), oo lagu dhigo geeska koowaad ee xuduudka (meesha gelitaanka), mid kasta oo leh waddo gelitaan; laba waa la wadaagaa. Meel baabuur oo ka yar ballaca naafada, ama jiid ka cad 1:48 meelaha naafada, waxay muujisaa dhib. Lambarkan waxaa laga qoray heerka sida aan xasuusanayo, lama hubin xeerka la daabacay. Cabbirrada caadiga ah ee meelaha iyo waddooyinka waxay ka soo jeeddaan hagayaasha naqshadaynta baabuurta, iyagana lama hubin. Hubi labadaba, iyo xeerka deegaankaaga, ka hor intaadan isku halleyn. Dooro Gaar ah si aad tirada naafada gacanta ugu geliso. Jiidh biyo-qulqulada, jar iyo buuxin Haddii aadan demin, goobtu waxay noqonaysaa aag simayn gudaha Landscape workspace. Biyo-qulqulada waxaa lagu dhigaa khadadka dhexe ee waddooyinka qiyaastii 100 feet (30 m) kasta; dusha ayaa ka kacaysa biyo-qulqul kasta xagal aad siiso (1.5 percent bilowga), sidaas darteed barta kasta waxay u hoos dhacaysaa biyo-qulqulka ugu dhow. Heerka waa la doortaa si jarka iyo buuxinta goobtu u sinaadaan dhulka jira. Dhulka jira waa dusha jira ee mashruuca, oo laga yaabaa inuu ka yimaado barta sahanka, LandXML, bar-daruur lidar ama scan oo loo beddelay dusha, ama konturada. Daaqaddu waxay muujinaysaa qiyaasta jarka iyo buuxinta; mugga mashruuca ayaa tusaya tirada saxda ah markaas kadib. Aagga simaynta wuxuu hayaa xuduudkiisa dhulka jira, sidaas darteed meesha dusha cusub ka duwan tahay dhulka xuduudka waxaad hesha tallaabo, daaqaddana waxay sheegtaa sida ay weyn tahay. Dahaarka iyo beerinta Xuduudka oo dhan waxaa lagu dahaaraa dahaar dhagaxyo (naqshad stretcher ah oo aad bedeli karto hoosta Landscape, Hardscape), jasiirad kasta waxay heleysaa gadh dhir iyo, marka ay ballac ku filan tahay, geed, oo laga qaadayo liiska beerta. Wax kasta ka dib waa walax Landscape oo caadi ah: tafatir, ama dooro Qaabee mar kale si uu wixii goobtu sameysay u bedelo. Goobta oo la tirtiro wixii ay samaysay waa la tirtiraa. Kaaliye Goobtaas isla markaa waxaa laga codsan karaa MCP: parking_layout horumarinta ayaa muujisa, parking_build ayaa qora, parking_remove ayaa goobta ka saara. Weydii magaca barcelka ama dir xuduudka. Waxa aan la qabanin Ma la hubinayo in waddooyinku gaadho waddo. Dahaarku wuxuu daboolaa xuduudka oo dhan, sidaas darteed aagiisu wuxuu ku jiraa jasiiradaha. Dooranka alaabta dahaarka ee Maktabadda iyo nooca Maktabadda ee meelaha lama dhisin; naqshadda dahaarka waa midda Hardscape. Xeerarka dalalka kale lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"feature-lines","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xarriiqyada muhiimka ah","summary":"Sawir xarriiqyo 3D ah oo aad dhererkooda ka dhigayso goos-goos, samee kala-fogaysiga kor-u-kacaya ama hoos-u-dhacaya, oo isticmaal sida xarriiqyada jabinta dhulka ama padyada jiifka ah ee naqshadda.","section":"tasks","order":65,"keywords":["qaanso","qalloocan","radius","qaanso 3D","helix","curb qalloocan","overlay-ka dhererka","overlay-ka heerka","falaarta heerka","xariiq muhiim ah","heer","jiif","dherer","kala-fogaysiga kor-u-kacaya","kala-fogaysiga","xarriiqa jabinta","curb","dhanka","berm","pad jiif","iftiinka","dhul-fidinta","polilayn 3D"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-mid","text":"Sawir mid","level":2},{"id":"qaansooyinka","text":"Qaansooyinka","level":2},{"id":"dhererka-iyo-heerarka","text":"Dhererka iyo heerarka","level":2},{"id":"kala-fogaysiga-goos-goos-ah","text":"Kala-fogaysiga goos-goos ah","level":2},{"id":"heerarka-iyo-dhererka-shaashadda","text":"Heerarka iyo dhererka shaashadda","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-profile-ka","text":"Muuqaalka profile-ka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-dusha-ka-qabta","text":"Waxa dusha ka qabta","level":2},{"id":"wadaagga-xariiqyada-kooxdaada","text":"Wadaagga xariiqyada kooxdaada","level":2},{"id":"qaansooyinka-faylalka-kale","text":"Qaansooyinka faylalka kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXarriiqa muhiimka ah waa xariiq leh dhererka geesta kasta: curb, xarriiqa socodka dhanka, sare-berm, geesta pad-ka jiifka ah. Dhererkooda waxaad ku dejisaa tiro ama heer, waxaad ku koobiyeysaa dhinacyada kor-u-kac ama hoos-u-dhac, waxayna dusha u dhacdaa waxa ay sameeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-mid\"\u003ESawir mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeature line\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGujii geesaha qorshaha. Guji barta sahanka waxay qaadataa meeshii iyo dhererkii barta; meel kale geeska waxay qaadataa dhererka dhulka jira halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhamaysid xariiq furan, ama guji geeska koowaad mar kale si aad u xidho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqa cusub waa la doortaa, wuxuuna bilaabaa sida xarriiqa jabinta ee dhulka jira, isagoo dhulka saaran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaansooyinka\"\u003EQaansooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb kasta waxay noqon kartaa qaanso qorshaha ah oo geesahooda ku jiray dherer kala duwan: geesta curb, dhanka qalloocan, jid oo foorar ah. Heerkeedu si siman ayuu qaansada uga socdaa, dhererkeedana waxa laga cabbiraa qalloocanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMarkaad sawirayso:\u003C/strong\u003E riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (shaashadda taabashada, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E barta ku sare qorshaha) si aad qaansooyinka u shido. Geeska ka dib, gujii barta qalloocanka, kadibna guji meesha qaansadu ku dhammaato. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale qaybaha toosan. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu marka hore tirtiraa barta qalloocanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa dib:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E ku qor radius iyo jihada uu wareegayo sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EQaanso\u003C/strong\u003E ee geeska, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E50 L\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E50 R\u003C/code\u003E (bidix ama midig markaad xariiqda socoto), kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Sanduuqa banee si qaybtaas toosan dib ugu noqoto. Radius ka yar nus qayb waa la diidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqa la doortay wuxuu muujiyaa radius kasta qaansada oo ku xiga heerkeeda. \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E waa qalloocanka qorshaha; \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer 3D\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale tiriyaa kor-u-kaca iyo hoos-u-dhaca. Kala-fogaysiga goos-goos ah ayaa ilaaliya qaansooyinka: qaanso dibadda wareeg ahi way weynaatay, mid dhexe way yaraatay, kala-fogaysiga oo ka gudba dhexe qaansada waa la diidaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha, muuqaalka 3D, iyo DXF iyo DWG waxay qaansada u qaadanayaan qaybo toosan oo gaagaaban oo ku jira 0.01 qalloocanka. LandXML waxa ay ku hayaan qaansooyin (eeg \u003Cstrong\u003EQaansooyinka faylalka kale\u003C/strong\u003E hoos).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhererka-iyo-heerarka\"\u003EDhererka iyo heerarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E waxa ku liiska geesaha iyo masaafadooda xariiqda ku jirta, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka ilaa xiga\u003C/strong\u003E (boqolkiiba). Ku qor midkood oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDherer wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa geeska keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeer wuxuu dejiyaa dhererka dhamaadka qaybtaas; geesaha ka dambeeya way joogaan meeshooda, sidaas darteed heerka qaybta xigta way isbeddelaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESidoo kale \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E ku jira:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFicil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKor u qaad ama hoos u dhig dhammaan\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ku daraa dhererka aad qortay geesta kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevations from the ground\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesta kasta dib ugu celiya dhulka jira (geesaha dusha ka baxsan ayaa dhererkooda hayaan, waana la liistaa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne grade, first to last\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhererka koowaad iyo kan u dambeeya ayuu hayaa, geesaha dhexe heer siman ayuu siinayaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqa la doortay wuxuu muujiyaa dhererkeeda geesaha iyo heerarkooda qaybaha qorshaha. Geeska ku jiid adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E si aad u guurto; dhererkiisu wuu joogaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-fogaysiga-goos-goos-ah\"\u003EKala-fogaysiga goos-goos ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKala-fogaysiga goos-goos ah\u003C/strong\u003E, qor \u003Cstrong\u003EFogaanta\u003C/strong\u003E (togan midig ee jihada xariiqda, taban bidix), kadibna qor dherer (kor ama hoos) ama heer boqolkiiba, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake the offset line\u003C/span\u003E. Nuqulka waa xariiq muhiim ah oo cusub: tusaale ahaan dhabarka curb 0.5 ft dhinaca iyo 0.5 ft kor, ama geeska dhanka 6 ft dibadda 2 % ku. Fogaan kasta oo nuqulka ku laabaya isaga oo jeexaya qalloocan dhab ah waa la diidaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerarka-iyo-dhererka-shaashadda\"\u003EHeerarka iyo dhererka shaashadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka iyo dhererrada xariiqyada muhiimka ah\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta Bandhig, si aad u aragto heer kasta oo xariiq muhiim ah qayb kasta (oo leh fallaar yar oo u dhaadheerta hoos) iyo dhererkeeda geesaha. Shaashadda kaliya ayay muuqdaan: wax lagu daro ma jiro naqshadda, PDF, DXF iyo DWG way sii joogaan sida ay yihiin. Qaybaha gaagaaban iyo geesaha isku dhow waa lagu sii dhigi maayo calaamad ilaa aad ku weyn-dhawayso. Xariiqa la doortay had iyo jeer wuxuu muujiyaa heerarkiisa iyo dhererkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-profile-ka\"\u003EMuuqaalka profile-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqa muhiimka ah ee gooya khadka waddada waxa uu ku muuqdaa muuqaalka profile-ka khadkaas, magaciisa iyo dhererkiisa meesha gooyashada; xarriiqyada ku socda dhinaceeda ayaa sidoo kale la muujin karaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/profile\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/profile\"\u003ENaqshadda profile-ka tooska ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-dusha-ka-qabta\"\u003EWaxa dusha ka qabta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsticmaal\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa dhaca\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiqa jabinta ee dhulka jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka jira wuxuu xariiqda ku mari dhererkeeda, sida xarriiqa jabinta ee la sawiray.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELagu sawiray naqshadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq \u003Cstrong\u003Exidhan\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa noqonta pad jiif ah: dusha naqshadda ee gudaheeda waa la jiidaa ilaa cidhifkeeda. Shid \u003Cstrong\u003EIftiinka dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u socodsiiso jiifka jarka iyo buuxinta (sare ilaa toos 1 ee dhererka) cidhifkeeda ilaa dhulka, sida pad-ku sameeyo; jiifka kasta wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhererka cidhifka laftiisa halkaas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKeliya la sawiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay sii joogtaa qorshaha oo waxay u baxdaa DXF, DWG iyo PDF (layer C-GRAD-FEAT, polilayn 3D), laakiin dusheyu way iska indhatiraan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMugga, qaybaha iyo muuqaalka 3D waxay ku jiraan xariiqyada muhiimka ah ee lagu sameeyay naqshadda, sida padyada. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqota.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wadaagga-xariiqyada-kooxdaada\"\u003EWadaagga xariiqyada kooxdaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDukumeenti laga furay faylalkaaga daruurta ee CadCraft Studio, qorshe kooxeed, Sifooyinka mashruuca (wax la doortay ma jiro) waxa ku jira qayb \u003Cstrong\u003EKooxda\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETeam lines…\u003C/span\u003E: xariiqyada kooxdaadu wadaagtay, mid kasta leh nooca dib-u-eegista, adigoo aan marka hore xariiq muhiim ah dooran. Xariiq doorso si aad u wadaagto, dib-u-eegis cusub u dir, kooxda kan u soo qaad, ama joojin wadaagga. Dejinta ka baxsan, qaybtu waxay sheegtaa waxa ay u baahan tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaansooyinka-faylalka-kale\"\u003EQaansooyinka faylalka kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa dhaca xariiqa muhiimka ah ee leh qaansooyin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashruuca CivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESi sax ah ayaa loo hayaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELandXML\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa loo qoraa sida xariiq iyo qaansooyin leh dhererkooda oo naqshad, waxaana dib loo akhriyaa qaansooyinkeeda. Xariiq muhiim ah oo ka timid barnaamij kale wuxuu u imanayaa sida \u003Cstrong\u003EKeliya la sawiray\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal\u003C/strong\u003E si aad dusha ugu dhigto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG iyo DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn 3D ma qaadi karo qaanso, sidaas darteed xariiqa waxa loo qoraa qaybo gaagaaban oo ku jira 0.01 qaansada. CivilCraft wuxuu sidoo kale naqshadda ku qoraa qaybaha qaansooyin ahaa: markaad furto naqshadda sida xarriiqyo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeature lines\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xariiqyada dib ugu soo celiyaa sida xarriiqyo muhiim ah oo leh qaansooyinkooda. Barnaamijyada kale waxay arkaan polilayn 3D caadi ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Xarriiqa muhiimka ah waa xariiq leh dhererka geesta kasta: curb, xarriiqa socodka dhanka, sare-berm, geesta pad-ka jiifka ah. Dhererkooda waxaad ku dejisaa tiro ama heer, waxaad ku koobiyeysaa dhinacyada kor-u-kac ama hoos-u-dhac, waxayna dusha u dhacdaa waxa ay sameeyaan. Sawir mid Dooro Dusha › More › Feature line, ama riix L. Gujii geesaha qorshaha. Guji barta sahanka waxay qaadataa meeshii iyo dhererkii barta; meel kale geeska waxay qaadataa dhererka dhulka jira halkaas. Riix Enter si aad u dhamaysid xariiq furan, ama guji geeska koowaad mar kale si aad u xidho. Xariiqa cusub waa la doortaa, wuxuuna bilaabaa sida xarriiqa jabinta ee dhulka jira, isagoo dhulka saaran. Qaansooyinka Qayb kasta waxay noqon kartaa qaanso qorshaha ah oo geesahooda ku jiray dherer kala duwan: geesta curb, dhanka qalloocan, jid oo foorar ah. Heerkeedu si siman ayuu qaansada uga socdaa, dhererkeedana waxa laga cabbiraa qalloocanka. Markaad sawirayso: riix C (shaashadda taabashada, Arc barta ku sare qorshaha) si aad qaansooyinka u shido. Geeska ka dib, gujii barta qalloocanka, kadibna guji meesha qaansadu ku dhammaato. Riix C mar kale qaybaha toosan. Backspace wuxuu marka hore tirtiraa barta qalloocanka. Ka dib: Sifooyinka ku qor radius iyo jihada uu wareegayo sanduuqa Qaanso ee geeska, tusaale ahaan 50 L ama 50 R (bidix ama midig markaad xariiqda socoto), kadibna riix Enter. Sanduuqa banee si qaybtaas toosan dib ugu noqoto. Radius ka yar nus qayb waa la diidaa. Xariiqa la doortay wuxuu muujiyaa radius kasta qaansada oo ku xiga heerkeeda. Dherer waa qalloocanka qorshaha; Dherer 3D wuxuu sidoo kale tiriyaa kor-u-kaca iyo hoos-u-dhaca. Kala-fogaysiga goos-goos ah ayaa ilaaliya qaansooyinka: qaanso dibadda wareeg ahi way weynaatay, mid dhexe way yaraatay, kala-fogaysiga oo ka gudba dhexe qaansada waa la diidaa. Dusha, muuqaalka 3D, iyo DXF iyo DWG waxay qaansada u qaadanayaan qaybo toosan oo gaagaaban oo ku jira 0.01 qalloocanka. LandXML waxa ay ku hayaan qaansooyin (eeg Qaansooyinka faylalka kale hoos). Dhererka iyo heerarka Sifooyinka waxa ku liiska geesaha iyo masaafadooda xariiqda ku jirta, Dhererka iyo Heerka ilaa xiga (boqolkiiba). Ku qor midkood oo riix Enter: Dherer wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa geeska keliya. Heer wuxuu dejiyaa dhererka dhamaadka qaybtaas; geesaha ka dambeeya way joogaan meeshooda, sidaas darteed heerka qaybta xigta way isbeddelaa. Sidoo kale Sifooyinka ku jira: Ficil Waxa uu sameeyaa Kor u qaad ama hoos u dhig dhammaan Wuxuu ku daraa dhererka aad qortay geesta kasta. Elevations from the ground Geesta kasta dib ugu celiya dhulka jira (geesaha dusha ka baxsan ayaa dhererkooda hayaan, waana la liistaa). One grade, first to last Dhererka koowaad iyo kan u dambeeya ayuu hayaa, geesaha dhexe heer siman ayuu siinayaa. Xariiqa la doortay wuxuu muujiyaa dhererkeeda geesaha iyo heerarkooda qaybaha qorshaha. Geeska ku jiid adigoo isticmaalaya Select si aad u guurto; dhererkiisu wuu joogaa. Kala-fogaysiga goos-goos ah Hoosta Kala-fogaysiga goos-goos ah, qor Fogaanta (togan midig ee jihada xariiqda, taban bidix), kadibna qor dherer (kor ama hoos) ama heer boqolkiiba, kadibna guji Make the offset line. Nuqulka waa xariiq muhiim ah oo cusub: tusaale ahaan dhabarka curb 0.5 ft dhinaca iyo 0.5 ft kor, ama geeska dhanka 6 ft dibadda 2 % ku. Fogaan kasta oo nuqulka ku laabaya isaga oo jeexaya qalloocan dhab ah waa la diidaa. Heerarka iyo dhererka shaashadda Riix E, ama calaamadee Heerarka iyo dhererrada xariiqyada muhiimka ah hoosta Bandhig, si aad u aragto heer kasta oo xariiq muhiim ah qayb kasta (oo leh fallaar yar oo u dhaadheerta hoos) iyo dhererkeeda geesaha. Shaashadda kaliya ayay muuqdaan: wax lagu daro ma jiro naqshadda, PDF, DXF iyo DWG way sii joogaan sida ay yihiin. Qaybaha gaagaaban iyo geesaha isku dhow waa lagu sii dhigi maayo calaamad ilaa aad ku weyn-dhawayso. Xariiqa la doortay had iyo jeer wuxuu muujiyaa heerarkiisa iyo dhererkiisa. Muuqaalka profile-ka Xariiqa muhiimka ah ee gooya khadka waddada waxa uu ku muuqdaa muuqaalka profile-ka khadkaas, magaciisa iyo dhererkiisa meesha gooyashada; xarriiqyada ku socda dhinaceeda ayaa sidoo kale la muujin karaa. Eeg Naqshadda profile-ka tooska ah. Waxa dusha ka qabta Dooro Isticmaal: Isticmaal Waxa dhaca Xarriiqa jabinta ee dhulka jira Dhulka jira wuxuu xariiqda ku mari dhererkeeda, sida xarriiqa jabinta ee la sawiray. Lagu sawiray naqshadda Xariiq xidhan ayaa noqonta pad jiif ah: dusha naqshadda ee gudaheeda waa la jiidaa ilaa cidhifkeeda. Shid Iftiinka dhulka si aad u socodsiiso jiifka jarka iyo buuxinta (sare ilaa toos 1 ee dhererka) cidhifkeeda ilaa dhulka, sida pad-ku sameeyo; jiifka kasta wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhererka cidhifka laftiisa halkaas. Keliya la sawiray Waxay sii joogtaa qorshaha oo waxay u baxdaa DXF, DWG iyo PDF (layer C-GRAD-FEAT, polilayn 3D), laakiin dusheyu way iska indhatiraan. Mugga, qaybaha iyo muuqaalka 3D waxay ku jiraan xariiqyada muhiimka ah ee lagu sameeyay naqshadda, sida padyada. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqota. Wadaagga xariiqyada kooxdaada Dukumeenti laga furay faylalkaaga daruurta ee CadCraft Studio, qorshe kooxeed, Sifooyinka mashruuca (wax la doortay ma jiro) waxa ku jira qayb Kooxda oo leh Team lines…: xariiqyada kooxdaadu wadaagtay, mid kasta leh nooca dib-u-eegista, adigoo aan marka hore xariiq muhiim ah dooran. Xariiq doorso si aad u wadaagto, dib-u-eegis cusub u dir, kooxda kan u soo qaad, ama joojin wadaagga. Dejinta ka baxsan, qaybtu waxay sheegtaa waxa ay u baahan tahay. Qaansooyinka faylalka kale Faylka Waxa dhaca xariiqa muhiimka ah ee leh qaansooyin Mashruuca CivilCraft Si sax ah ayaa loo hayaa. LandXML Waxa loo qoraa sida xariiq iyo qaansooyin leh dhererkooda oo naqshad, waxaana dib loo akhriyaa qaansooyinkeeda. Xariiq muhiim ah oo ka timid barnaamij kale wuxuu u imanayaa sida Keliya la sawiray: dooro Isticmaal si aad dusha ugu dhigto. DWG iyo DXF Polilayn 3D ma qaadi karo qaanso, sidaas darteed xariiqa waxa loo qoraa qaybo gaagaaban oo ku jira 0.01 qaansada. CivilCraft wuxuu sidoo kale naqshadda ku qoraa qaybaha qaansooyin ahaa: markaad furto naqshadda sida xarriiqyo, Feature lines wuxuu xariiqyada dib ugu soo celiyaa sida xarriiqyo muhiim ah oo leh qaansooyinkooda. Barnaamijyada kale waxay arkaan polilayn 3D caadi ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"draft-with-snaps","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qabyo oo leh snap, geesaha la doortay iyo guuri, koobiyee, leexi","summary":"Ku dheji jidad, qaab, parcel iyo khad naqshad barta iyo geesaha aad horey u haysatid, ku qor ama dooro bariga iyo waqooyiga geeska, u leexi tangent-ka labo barood oo la doortay, oo guuri, koobiyee ama leexi shay masaafo ama xagal.","section":"tasks","order":66,"keywords":["snap","snaps","osnap","snap barta","snap geeska","pi","vertex","geesta","dooro","crosshair","bari","waqooyi","koordinaatada","koordinaatada qoran","tangent","jihada","bearing","guuri","koobiyee","leexi","transform","koobiyee oo la leexiyay","samee nuqul","alt","barta xor ah","qabyo"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"qoraallo","text":"Qoraallo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECusub 0.9: marka aad qorayso, calaamadaha ayaa dhacaan barta iyo geesaha ku jira qorshaha, pad, parcel ama geeska khadka naqshadda waa la qori karaa ama la dooran karaa. Mawduucan wuxuu tilmaamayaa saddexda qalab.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor snap, si jid cusub, pad, parcel ama khad isku dhacaan saxda ah ee wax jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji bariga iyo waqooyiga geeska adigoo qorayo ama meel qorshaha ah dooranaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeex tangent-ka jidka labo barood oo la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuuri, koobiyee ama leexi shay oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qalab naqshadeed, tusaale ahaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJid-hagaha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPad\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EParcel\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiqa muhiimka ah\u003C/span\u003E. Tusaha u dhow barta sahanka, geeska PI-ga jidka, pad, parcel ama geeska mass, geesta khadka muhiimka ah ama qaab-dhismeedka biibaanka. Calaamad ayaa muuqata oo leh calaamad (PI, Corner, Vertex, Structure ama Point iyo lambarkiisa) iyo bariga iyo waqooyiga ee ku dhacaya. Guji si aad barta halkaas u dhigto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad barta si xor ah u dhigto, hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inta aad gujinayso. Snap-ku wuu damaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro pad, parcel ama khad muhiim ah. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E, bloka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeesaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa geesta kasta oo leh sanduuq Bari iyo sanduuq Waqooyi. Ku qor tirooyin cusub, ama riix badhanka crosshair ee geeska agtiisa oo guji meel qorshaha ah. Geeska wuxuu qaadanayaa bariga iyo waqooyiga taas. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso dooranta. Crosshair-ku wuxuu shaqeeyaa qorshaha kaliya: marka hore xir muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u leexiso tangent-ka, dooro jid. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETangent laba barood ah\u003C/span\u003E, dooro tangent-ka, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarta koowaad\u003C/span\u003E oo guji qorshaha, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarta labaad\u003C/span\u003E oo mar kale guji, ka dibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeji jihada\u003C/span\u003E. Tangent-ku wuxuu u leexanayaa inuu ka bilaabmo barta koowaad oo u socdo barta labaad, dhererkiisana wuu hayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u guurto, u koobiyeysid ama u leexiso, dooro jid, geesaha, parcel ama khad muhiim ah. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri, koobiyee iyo leexi\u003C/span\u003E, ku qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri bari\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri waqooyi\u003C/span\u003E (tirooyinka taban waxay u socdaan galbeed iyo koonfur) ka dibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E. Ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafada laba barood ka\u003C/span\u003E oo guji barta laga guurayo iyo barta loo guurayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u leexiso, ku qor xagasha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeexi bidix\u003C/span\u003E (darajooyin), ka dibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeexi\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee oo la leexiyay\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay ku leexanaysaa dhexda geesaha ee aadan dooran barta leexinta, iyada oo laga caawinayo crosshair-ka xagasha agteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoraallo\"\u003EQoraallo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoobiyeyn waxay ka tagtaa asalka meeshiisa, koobiga ayaa la doortaa ka dib.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuur kasta, koobiyee, leexin, geesaha la doortay iyo tangent-ka la leexiyay waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESnap-ku wuxuu gaaraa 10 pixel-ka shaashadda ee tusaha. Calaamadda snap-ku waxay bixisaa meel kaliya; waxba lama beddelo ilaa aad gujiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECrosshair-ka isku mid ah wuxuu ku jiraa safafka PI ee jidka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/alignment\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/alignment\"\u003EJidadka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/parcels\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/parcels\"\u003EParcels\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/feature-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/feature-lines\"\u003EKhadadka muhiimka ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Cusub 0.9: marka aad qorayso, calaamadaha ayaa dhacaan barta iyo geesaha ku jira qorshaha, pad, parcel ama geeska khadka naqshadda waa la qori karaa ama la dooran karaa. Mawduucan wuxuu tilmaamayaa saddexda qalab. Waxa aad samayn doontid Qor snap, si jid cusub, pad, parcel ama khad isku dhacaan saxda ah ee wax jira. Deji bariga iyo waqooyiga geeska adigoo qorayo ama meel qorshaha ah dooranaya. Leex tangent-ka jidka labo barood oo la doortay. Guuri, koobiyee ama leexi shay oo dhan. Tallaabooyinka Dooro qalab naqshadeed, tusaale ahaan Jid-hagaha, Pad, Parcel ama Xariiqa muhiimka ah. Tusaha u dhow barta sahanka, geeska PI-ga jidka, pad, parcel ama geeska mass, geesta khadka muhiimka ah ama qaab-dhismeedka biibaanka. Calaamad ayaa muuqata oo leh calaamad (PI, Corner, Vertex, Structure ama Point iyo lambarkiisa) iyo bariga iyo waqooyiga ee ku dhacaya. Guji si aad barta halkaas u dhigto. Si aad barta si xor ah u dhigto, hay Alt inta aad gujinayso. Snap-ku wuu damaa. Dooro pad, parcel ama khad muhiim ah. Hoosta Guryaha, bloka Geesaha wuxuu liistaa geesta kasta oo leh sanduuq Bari iyo sanduuq Waqooyi. Ku qor tirooyin cusub, ama riix badhanka crosshair ee geeska agtiisa oo guji meel qorshaha ah. Geeska wuxuu qaadanayaa bariga iyo waqooyiga taas. Riix Esc si aad u joojiso dooranta. Crosshair-ku wuxuu shaqeeyaa qorshaha kaliya: marka hore xir muuqaalka 3D. Si aad u leexiso tangent-ka, dooro jid. Hoosta Guryaha, hoosta Tangent laba barood ah, dooro tangent-ka, riix Barta koowaad oo guji qorshaha, riix Barta labaad oo mar kale guji, ka dibna riix Deji jihada. Tangent-ku wuxuu u leexanayaa inuu ka bilaabmo barta koowaad oo u socdo barta labaad, dhererkiisana wuu hayaa. Si aad u guurto, u koobiyeysid ama u leexiso, dooro jid, geesaha, parcel ama khad muhiim ah. Hoosta Guryaha, hoosta Guuri, koobiyee iyo leexi, ku qor Guuri bari iyo Guuri waqooyi (tirooyinka taban waxay u socdaan galbeed iyo koonfur) ka dibna riix Guuri ama Koobiyee. Ama riix Masaafada laba barood ka oo guji barta laga guurayo iyo barta loo guurayo. Si aad u leexiso, ku qor xagasha Leexi bidix (darajooyin), ka dibna riix Leexi ama Koobiyee oo la leexiyay. Waxay ku leexanaysaa dhexda geesaha ee aadan dooran barta leexinta, iyada oo laga caawinayo crosshair-ka xagasha agteeda. Qoraallo Koobiyeyn waxay ka tagtaa asalka meeshiisa, koobiga ayaa la doortaa ka dib. Guur kasta, koobiyee, leexin, geesaha la doortay iyo tangent-ka la leexiyay waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Snap-ku wuxuu gaaraa 10 pixel-ka shaashadda ee tusaha. Calaamadda snap-ku waxay bixisaa meel kaliya; waxba lama beddelo ilaa aad gujiso. Crosshair-ka isku mid ah wuxuu ku jiraa safafka PI ee jidka. Eeg Jidadka, Parcels iyo Khadadka muhiimka ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"fences","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xayndaabyada","summary":"Xayndaab dhex marta xariiq, barcel ama saldhig: tiirarka, xadhigyada, panelada ama qaybaha toosan, irdoodyada, dhul jiifsan ama tallaabo-tallaabo, jadwal, calaamadaha sawirka iyo walxaha IFC. Waxaa sidoo kale loo heli karaa kaaliye.","section":"tasks","order":66,"keywords":["xayndaab","tiirar","xadhig","panel","qaybo toosan","irdood","jiifsan","tallaabo","dhul","jadwal","ifc","xaddi","xuduud"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-xayndaab","text":"Samee xayndaab","level":2},{"id":"jadwal-iyo-wax-soo-saarka","text":"Jadwal iyo wax-soo-saarka","level":2},{"id":"kaaliye","text":"Kaaliye","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-la-qabanin","text":"Waxa aan la qabanin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESamee xayndaab dhex marta xariiq muuqaal ah, khad jihayn ah, barcel ama saldhig, iyo tiirarkeeda iyo irdoodyadeeda oo loo dhigo adiga oo aan gacanta lagu dhigin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-xayndaab\"\u003ESamee xayndaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro xariiq, barcel ama saldhig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha, Dheeraad, Xayndaabyada...\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nooca (panelada, xadhigyada ama qaybaha toosan), dhul jiifsan ama tallaabo-tallaabo, dhererka, masaafada tiirarka iyo ballaca irdoodka, kadibna dhig \u003Cstrong\u003EXayndaab ku dhex jirta doorashada\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EIrdood leh\u003C/strong\u003E si irdood loogu dhigo dhexda xariiqa toosan ee ugu dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiirarka waxaa loo dhigaa dhamaadka, geesaha kasta (geesta uu ku leexdo 20 degrees ama ka badan), labada dhinac ee irdood kasta, iyo meelaha u dhexeeya oo siman, oo aan mid ka dheer masaafada la doortay. \u003Cstrong\u003EPanelada jiifsan\u003C/strong\u003E waxay raacaan dhulka inta u dhexaysa tiirarkooda. \u003Cstrong\u003EPanelada tallaabo-tallaabo\u003C/strong\u003E way toosan yihiin oo waxay ku tallaabsadaan tiirarka; furaha hoostiisa panelka ayaa ugu ballaaran tiirka hoose ee dhulka, daaqadduna waa digtaa marka furahaas uu ka badan yahay xadka, ama marka dhulku uu ku kacayo panel. Irdoodyada 6 feet (1.8 m) ama ka ballaaran waxay leeyihiin laba caleen; sawirku wuxuu tusayaa caleemaha furan iyo jihada ay u furmayaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwal-iyo-wax-soo-saarka\"\u003EJadwal iyo wax-soo-saarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXayndaab kasta wuxuu muujinayaa dherereeda, tiirarka sida nooca ay yihiin, panelada, irdoodyada iyo tallaabooyinka, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ECSV\u003C/strong\u003E jadwal ah oo tiirarka, panelada, xadhigyada, qaybaha toosan iyo irdoodyada ku jira. Sawirku wuxuu leeyahay lakabyada xayndaabka (C-FENC, C-FENC-POST, C-FENC-GATE) ee PDF, DXF iyo DWG. Dhoofinta IFC waxay hayaa tiirarka (IfcMember, post), panelada (IfcRailing, user defined fence panel), xadhigyada (IfcMember) iyo irdoodyada (IfcDoor, gate), hal nidaam oo xayndaab kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaaliye\"\u003EKaaliye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efence_build\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa xayndaab (dhibco ama xariiq magacaaban, barcel ama saldhig, irdoodyada meel-ka-meel), \u003Ccode\u003Efence_list\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu liistaa xayndaabyada iyo jadwalkooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-la-qabanin\"\u003EWaxa aan la qabanin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirrada bilowga waa doorashooyin caadi ah, ma aha xeer. Noocyada laga soo qaado Maktabadda waxaa la qaadaa magac oo keliya. Irdoodyadu waa inay ku jiraan hal xariiq toosan. BimCraft weli ma leh qalabkan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Samee xayndaab dhex marta xariiq muuqaal ah, khad jihayn ah, barcel ama saldhig, iyo tiirarkeeda iyo irdoodyadeeda oo loo dhigo adiga oo aan gacanta lagu dhigin. Samee xayndaab Dooro xariiq, barcel ama saldhig. Fur Dusha, Dheeraad, Xayndaabyada... Dooro nooca (panelada, xadhigyada ama qaybaha toosan), dhul jiifsan ama tallaabo-tallaabo, dhererka, masaafada tiirarka iyo ballaca irdoodka, kadibna dhig Xayndaab ku dhex jirta doorashada, ama Irdood leh si irdood loogu dhigo dhexda xariiqa toosan ee ugu dheer. Tiirarka waxaa loo dhigaa dhamaadka, geesaha kasta (geesta uu ku leexdo 20 degrees ama ka badan), labada dhinac ee irdood kasta, iyo meelaha u dhexeeya oo siman, oo aan mid ka dheer masaafada la doortay. Panelada jiifsan waxay raacaan dhulka inta u dhexaysa tiirarkooda. Panelada tallaabo-tallaabo way toosan yihiin oo waxay ku tallaabsadaan tiirarka; furaha hoostiisa panelka ayaa ugu ballaaran tiirka hoose ee dhulka, daaqadduna waa digtaa marka furahaas uu ka badan yahay xadka, ama marka dhulku uu ku kacayo panel. Irdoodyada 6 feet (1.8 m) ama ka ballaaran waxay leeyihiin laba caleen; sawirku wuxuu tusayaa caleemaha furan iyo jihada ay u furmayaan. Jadwal iyo wax-soo-saarka Xayndaab kasta wuxuu muujinayaa dherereeda, tiirarka sida nooca ay yihiin, panelada, irdoodyada iyo tallaabooyinka, iyo CSV jadwal ah oo tiirarka, panelada, xadhigyada, qaybaha toosan iyo irdoodyada ku jira. Sawirku wuxuu leeyahay lakabyada xayndaabka (C-FENC, C-FENC-POST, C-FENC-GATE) ee PDF, DXF iyo DWG. Dhoofinta IFC waxay hayaa tiirarka (IfcMember, post), panelada (IfcRailing, user defined fence panel), xadhigyada (IfcMember) iyo irdoodyada (IfcDoor, gate), hal nidaam oo xayndaab kasta. Kaaliye fence_build wuxuu sameeyaa xayndaab (dhibco ama xariiq magacaaban, barcel ama saldhig, irdoodyada meel-ka-meel), fence_list wuxuu liistaa xayndaabyada iyo jadwalkooda. Waxa aan la qabanin Cabbirrada bilowga waa doorashooyin caadi ah, ma aha xeer. Noocyada laga soo qaado Maktabadda waxaa la qaadaa magac oo keliya. Irdoodyadu waa inay ku jiraan hal xariiq toosan. BimCraft weli ma leh qalabkan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"grading","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhig padka dhismaha","summary":"Sawir pad sinaan, dejiso heerkiisa iyo jiifka jarista iyo buuxinta, oo ka dhig CivilCraft inuu iftiimiyo dhulka jira oo ku daro dusha la sameeyay.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["derbiga taageerada","derbiyada taageerada","geeska toosan","derbi halkii jiif","jiifka geeska kasta","dhulka dhaqan","grading","pad","building pad","iftiinka","khadka astaanta","kooxda grading","jiifka jarista","jiifka buuxinta","heerka dhammaadka","dusha la soo jeediyay","grading-ka goobta"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-padka","text":"Sawir padka","level":2},{"id":"dejinta-heerka-iyo-jiifyada","text":"Dejinta heerka iyo jiifyada","level":2},{"id":"sida-iftiinka-loo-helo","text":"Sida iftiinka loo helo","level":2},{"id":"jiifyada-geesta-kasta-iyo-derbiyada-taageerada","text":"Jiifyada geesta kasta iyo derbiyada taageerada","level":2},{"id":"dhaqaaqa-geeskaha","text":"Dhaqaaqa geeskaha","level":2},{"id":"marka-aanu-grade-gareyn","text":"Marka aanu grade-gareyn","level":2},{"id":"arag-natiijada","text":"Arag natiijada","level":2},{"id":"tirtir-padka","text":"Tirtir padka","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-dhisin","text":"Wali lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPad waa goob sinaan oo heer hal ah. Laga bilaabo geeskiisa, CivilCraft wuxuu u fidiyaa dibadda jiifka jarista haddii dhulku ka sareeyo padka, iyo jiifka buuxinta haddii uu ka hooseeyo, ilaa jiifku la kulmo dhulka jira. Khadkaas kulanka waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekhadka iftiinka\u003C/strong\u003E. Padka iyo jiifyadiisa waxay bedelaan dhulka jira gudaha khadka iftiinka si ay u sameeyaan dusha la soo jeediyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-padka\"\u003ESawir padka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa inaad marka hore haysataa dusha dhulka jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPadka\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamaddu waxay tidhi &quot;Padka: riix geeskiisa. Enter ama labo jeer-riix ayaa dhammeeya, Backspace wuxuu tirtiraa midka ugu dambeeya, Esc wuu joogsadaa.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix geesaha padka siday u dhacaan, dhinac kasta. Khadka buluug ah ayaa raacaa calaamadeeyaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E geeska ugu dambeeya (ugu yaraan saddex). Padka waa la sawiray oo la doortay. Wuxuu ku bilaabmaa heerka dhulka badhkiisa dhexe, oo lagu wareejiyay 0.1, oo leh jiif jarista 2 : 1 iyo jiif buuxinta 3 : 1. Xariga xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa, tusaale ahaan, &quot;Padka 1 heerka 254.3 (dhulka badhkiisa dhexe), jarista 2:1, buuxinta 3:1. Beddel iyaga Guryaha.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhamee \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Labo jeer-riixu sidoo kale wuu dhammeeyaa, laakiin dhismahan wuxuu tirtiraa geeska aad labo jeer riixday. Riix geeska ugu dambeeya hal jeer, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadka padka isuma gooyi karo (&quot;Khadka padka wuu isgoyaa.&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta-heerka-iyo-jiifyada\"\u003EDejinta heerka iyo jiifyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii padka la doortay, panel-ka midig wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EPadka\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka\u003C/strong\u003E: heerka sinaanta padka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiifka jarista\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJiifka buuxinta\u003C/strong\u003E, sida H:V (2 waxay ka dhigan tahay 2 : 1). Labaduba waa inay ka badnaadaan 0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagga padka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay muuqdaan si tixraac ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qiime kasta ka dib. Khadka iftiinka, dusha la soo jeediyay iyo mugga way cusboonaadaan isla markiiba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobaha hoose, xariiq tusaale ahaan wuxuu akhrinayaa &quot;Khadka iftiinka: 48 khadadka jiifka (20 jarista, 28 buuxinta), ugu fog 31.20 ft dibadda.&quot; Qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa khadka iftiinka iyo khadadka jiifka midab magenta ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-iftiinka-loo-helo\"\u003ESida iftiinka loo helo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadadka jiifku waxay ka baxaan geesta kasta si toosan u jaraan, qiyaastii mid kasta oo ka mid ah labaatanaad cabbirka padka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesaha dibadda waxay ku fidaan 10° kasta, si jiifku u wareego geeska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesaha gudaha hal khad ayaa ku socda bisector-ka, halka jiifyada labada geesood ku kulmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhad kasta wuxuu kor u kacaa jiifka jarista ama hoos u dhacaa jiifka buuxinta ilaa uu dhulka gaarayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiifyada-geesta-kasta-iyo-derbiyada-taageerada\"\u003EJiifyada geesta kasta iyo derbiyada taageerada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha iyo derbiyada taageerada\u003C/strong\u003E ee Guryaha padka, sare-taagga ama berm-ka, geeska kasta waxaa laga sameyn karaa siday rabto. Geeska 1 wuxuu ka socdaa geeska kowaad ee aad riixday ilaa midka labaad, geeska 2 midka labaad ilaa saddexaad, iyo sidaas oo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaan geesaha\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EJiif\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa jiifyada jarista iyo buuxinta ee kore geesaha oo dhan; \u003Cstrong\u003EToosan: derbiyada taageerada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhigaa derbi geesaha oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesta kasta: \u003Cstrong\u003EJiifyada kore\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJiifyadiisa gaarka ah\u003C/strong\u003E (qor jiif jarista iyo buuxinta geeskaas) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EToosan (derbi taageero)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor jiif sida \u003Ccode\u003E3\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E3:1\u003C/code\u003E (H ilaa 1 V), \u003Ccode\u003E33%\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E18.4°\u003C/code\u003E; wuxuu muuqdaa sida H:1. \u003Cstrong\u003EJiifka jarista\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJiifka buuxinta\u003C/strong\u003E ee padka laftiisu isla sidaas ayay qaataan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeeska toosan ma leh dhul-kor: derbi taageero ayaa ku socda geesta, padka ka hoosaysa dhulka jira (buuxinta) ama dhulka ka hoosaysa padka (jarista). \u003Cstrong\u003EBallaca derbiga\u003C/strong\u003E (0.3 m ama 1 ft markii hore) waa masaafada ay dhulku ka kor u kacdo geeska padka ilaa dhulka jira. Mugga jarista iyo buuxinta waxay ka tagaan dhul-korka geeskaas aan mar dambe lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHalka derbi kulmaa geeska jiifka leh, jiifku wuu wareegaa dhammaadka derbiga; labo derbi ayaa kulma gees-gees (mitre).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoobaha hoose: dherer derbiyada, wejiga la arko (joog × dherer), joogga ugu sareeya iyo celceliska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa wejiga dibadda derbi kasta oo ay ku jiraan calaamado gaagaaban, joogeeda labada dhamaadka iyo kan ugu sareeya (lakabka derbiyada taageerada, kaas oo sidoo kale galaa DXF iyo DWG). Aragga 3D wuxuu muujinayaa derbiyada sida jir (Muuji › Derbiyada taageerada), dhoofinta GLB, OBJ iyo USD waxay ka mid yihiin. Qaybaha geesha ku wareegsan waxay muujinayaan tallaabada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDigniinta\u003C/strong\u003E (Guryaha, iyo panel-ka Dhibaatooyinka): derbi ka sarreeya \u003Cstrong\u003EDigniiso ka sare joogga derbiga\u003C/strong\u003E (1.0 m ama 3.3 ft markii hore) &quot;waxay u baahan kartaa derbi injineernimo ama ogolaansho; hubi xeerarka deegaanka&quot;, iyo marka aad qorto \u003Cstrong\u003EJiifka ugu dhaqsaha badan ee ciidda taagan karta\u003C/strong\u003E, geesta kasta oo jiifka jarista ama buuxinta uu ka dhaqsaha badan yahay taas. Waa digniino: grading-ku weli wuu dhisaa. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E u.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaqa-geeskaha\"\u003EDhaqaaqa geeskaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPadka dooro, kadibna jiid qabsaska laba jibbaaran ee geesta. Jiid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo. Geeska ku dari ama ka saar weli lama heli karo: tirtir padka oo mar kale sawir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-aanu-grade-gareyn\"\u003EMarka aanu grade-gareyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuq casaan ah hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EShaqada dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu magacaabaa padka iyo dhibaatada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3 khadadka jiifku ka baxaan dusha ka hor intaysan ku kulmin: padka wuu u dhow yahay geeska dusha ama wuu sarreeyaa/hooseeyaa badan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPadka dhex geli geeska dusha, ama heerkiisa u keen dhulka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka iftiinku isgoyaa (jiifyada geesaha kala duwan ee padka ayaa isku dhacaya). Dib u qaabee padka ama beddel jiifyada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECaadi u ah padyada cidhiidhiga ah ama kuwa L ah jarista qoto dheer ama buuxinta sare. Ballaadhi padka, yaree farqiga, ama jiifyada dhaqso u kac.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka padka wuu isgoyaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha dib u sawir siday u dhacaan wareegga padka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPadka dhibaato leh waa laga tegaa dusha la soo jeediyay iyo mugga ilaa la hagaajiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arag-natiijada\"\u003EArag natiijada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji\u003C/strong\u003E, deji \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELa soo jeediyay (la sameeyay)\u003C/span\u003E. Konturada hadda waxay sinaan ku socdaan padka oo waxay raacaan jiifyada ilaa khadka iftiinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadeeyaha ku dhaqaaqo padka: sadarka xaaladdu wuxuu muujinayaa heerarka \u003Cstrong\u003EDhul\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ELa sameeyay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri jarista iyo buuxinta hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EShaqada dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EMugga shaqada dhulka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPadyada waa la grade-gareeyaa kadib waddooyinka, siday u sawirmeen. Pad dambe wuxuu bedelaa wax kasta oo hore ku jiray khadka iftiinkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirtir-padka\"\u003ETirtir padka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Mac-ka, Fn iyo delete), ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPadyadu waa sinaan: padyo jiifan, khadadka astaanta ee heer kala duwan, benches, iyo grading ilaa masaafo ama heer bartilmaameed weli lama heli karo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Pad waa goob sinaan oo heer hal ah. Laga bilaabo geeskiisa, CivilCraft wuxuu u fidiyaa dibadda jiifka jarista haddii dhulku ka sareeyo padka, iyo jiifka buuxinta haddii uu ka hooseeyo, ilaa jiifku la kulmo dhulka jira. Khadkaas kulanka waa khadka iftiinka. Padka iyo jiifyadiisa waxay bedelaan dhulka jira gudaha khadka iftiinka si ay u sameeyaan dusha la soo jeediyay. Sawir padka Waa inaad marka hore haysataa dusha dhulka jira. Riix G, ama riix Padka kooxda Naqshadda. Calaamaddu waxay tidhi \"Padka: riix geeskiisa. Enter ama labo jeer-riix ayaa dhammeeya, Backspace wuxuu tirtiraa midka ugu dambeeya, Esc wuu joogsadaa.\" Riix geesaha padka siday u dhacaan, dhinac kasta. Khadka buluug ah ayaa raacaa calaamadeeyaha. Riix Enter geeska ugu dambeeya (ugu yaraan saddex). Padka waa la sawiray oo la doortay. Wuxuu ku bilaabmaa heerka dhulka badhkiisa dhexe, oo lagu wareejiyay 0.1, oo leh jiif jarista 2 : 1 iyo jiif buuxinta 3 : 1. Xariga xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa, tusaale ahaan, \"Padka 1 heerka 254.3 (dhulka badhkiisa dhexe), jarista 2:1, buuxinta 3:1. Beddel iyaga Guryaha.\" Dhamee Enter. Labo jeer-riixu sidoo kale wuu dhammeeyaa, laakiin dhismahan wuxuu tirtiraa geeska aad labo jeer riixday. Riix geeska ugu dambeeya hal jeer, kadibna riix Enter. Khadka padka isuma gooyi karo (\"Khadka padka wuu isgoyaa.\"). Dejinta heerka iyo jiifyada Markii padka la doortay, panel-ka midig wuxuu muujinayaa Padka: Magaca. Heerka: heerka sinaanta padka. Jiifka jarista iyo Jiifka buuxinta, sida H:V (2 waxay ka dhigan tahay 2 : 1). Labaduba waa inay ka badnaadaan 0. Aagga padka iyo Geesaha waxay muuqdaan si tixraac ah. Riix Enter qiime kasta ka dib. Khadka iftiinka, dusha la soo jeediyay iyo mugga way cusboonaadaan isla markiiba. Goobaha hoose, xariiq tusaale ahaan wuxuu akhrinayaa \"Khadka iftiinka: 48 khadadka jiifka (20 jarista, 28 buuxinta), ugu fog 31.20 ft dibadda.\" Qorshuhu wuxuu muujinayaa khadka iftiinka iyo khadadka jiifka midab magenta ah. Sida iftiinka loo helo Khadadka jiifku waxay ka baxaan geesta kasta si toosan u jaraan, qiyaastii mid kasta oo ka mid ah labaatanaad cabbirka padka. Geesaha dibadda waxay ku fidaan 10° kasta, si jiifku u wareego geeska. Geesaha gudaha hal khad ayaa ku socda bisector-ka, halka jiifyada labada geesood ku kulmaan. Khad kasta wuxuu kor u kacaa jiifka jarista ama hoos u dhacaa jiifka buuxinta ilaa uu dhulka gaarayo. Jiifyada geesta kasta iyo derbiyada taageerada Hoosta Geesaha iyo derbiyada taageerada ee Guryaha padka, sare-taagga ama berm-ka, geeska kasta waxaa laga sameyn karaa siday rabto. Geeska 1 wuxuu ka socdaa geeska kowaad ee aad riixday ilaa midka labaad, geeska 2 midka labaad ilaa saddexaad, iyo sidaas oo kale. Dhammaan geesaha: Jiif wuxuu isticmaalaa jiifyada jarista iyo buuxinta ee kore geesaha oo dhan; Toosan: derbiyada taageerada wuxuu dhigaa derbi geesaha oo dhan. Geesta kasta: Jiifyada kore, Jiifyadiisa gaarka ah (qor jiif jarista iyo buuxinta geeskaas) ama Toosan (derbi taageero). Qor jiif sida 3 ama 3:1 (H ilaa 1 V), 33% ama 18.4°; wuxuu muuqdaa sida H:1. Jiifka jarista iyo Jiifka buuxinta ee padka laftiisu isla sidaas ayay qaataan. Geeska toosan ma leh dhul-kor: derbi taageero ayaa ku socda geesta, padka ka hoosaysa dhulka jira (buuxinta) ama dhulka ka hoosaysa padka (jarista). Ballaca derbiga (0.3 m ama 1 ft markii hore) waa masaafada ay dhulku ka kor u kacdo geeska padka ilaa dhulka jira. Mugga jarista iyo buuxinta waxay ka tagaan dhul-korka geeskaas aan mar dambe lahayn. Halka derbi kulmaa geeska jiifka leh, jiifku wuu wareegaa dhammaadka derbiga; labo derbi ayaa kulma gees-gees (mitre). Goobaha hoose: dherer derbiyada, wejiga la arko (joog × dherer), joogga ugu sareeya iyo celceliska. Qorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa wejiga dibadda derbi kasta oo ay ku jiraan calaamado gaagaaban, joogeeda labada dhamaadka iyo kan ugu sareeya (lakabka derbiyada taageerada, kaas oo sidoo kale galaa DXF iyo DWG). Aragga 3D wuxuu muujinayaa derbiyada sida jir (Muuji › Derbiyada taageerada), dhoofinta GLB, OBJ iyo USD waxay ka mid yihiin. Qaybaha geesha ku wareegsan waxay muujinayaan tallaabada. Digniinta (Guryaha, iyo panel-ka Dhibaatooyinka): derbi ka sarreeya Digniiso ka sare joogga derbiga (1.0 m ama 3.3 ft markii hore) \"waxay u baahan kartaa derbi injineernimo ama ogolaansho; hubi xeerarka deegaanka\", iyo marka aad qorto Jiifka ugu dhaqsaha badan ee ciidda taagan karta, geesta kasta oo jiifka jarista ama buuxinta uu ka dhaqsaha badan yahay taas. Waa digniino: grading-ku weli wuu dhisaa. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z u. Dhaqaaqa geeskaha Padka dooro, kadibna jiid qabsaska laba jibbaaran ee geesta. Jiid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo. Geeska ku dari ama ka saar weli lama heli karo: tirtir padka oo mar kale sawir. Marka aanu grade-gareyn Sanduuq casaan ah hoosta Shaqada dhulka wuxuu magacaabaa padka iyo dhibaatada: Fariinta Waxa la sameeyo 3 khadadka jiifku ka baxaan dusha ka hor intaysan ku kulmin: padka wuu u dhow yahay geeska dusha ama wuu sarreeyaa/hooseeyaa badan. Padka dhex geli geeska dusha, ama heerkiisa u keen dhulka. Khadka iftiinku isgoyaa (jiifyada geesaha kala duwan ee padka ayaa isku dhacaya). Dib u qaabee padka ama beddel jiifyada. Caadi u ah padyada cidhiidhiga ah ama kuwa L ah jarista qoto dheer ama buuxinta sare. Ballaadhi padka, yaree farqiga, ama jiifyada dhaqso u kac. Khadka padka wuu isgoyaa. Geesaha dib u sawir siday u dhacaan wareegga padka. Padka dhibaato leh waa laga tegaa dusha la soo jeediyay iyo mugga ilaa la hagaajiyo. Arag natiijada Hoosta Muuji, deji Dusha La soo jeediyay (la sameeyay). Konturada hadda waxay sinaan ku socdaan padka oo waxay raacaan jiifyada ilaa khadka iftiinka. Calaamadeeyaha ku dhaqaaqo padka: sadarka xaaladdu wuxuu muujinayaa heerarka Dhul iyo La sameeyay. Akhri jarista iyo buuxinta hoosta Shaqada dhulka; eeg Mugga shaqada dhulka. Padyada waa la grade-gareeyaa kadib waddooyinka, siday u sawirmeen. Pad dambe wuxuu bedelaa wax kasta oo hore ku jiray khadka iftiinkiisa. Tirtir padka Dooro oo riix Delete (Mac-ka, Fn iyo delete), ama riix Delete. Wali lama dhisin Padyadu waa sinaan: padyo jiifan, khadadka astaanta ee heer kala duwan, benches, iyo grading ilaa masaafo ama heer bartilmaameed weli lama heli karo. Eeg Wali lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"volumes","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Mugga dhulka la qodo iyo la buuxiyo","summary":"Akhri mugga la gooyo, la buuxiyo iyo kan net-ka ah ee u dhexeeya dhulka jira iyo dusha la soo jeediyay, pad kasta, koridoor kasta iyo wadarta, oo fahan habka grid ee ka dambeeya.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["mugga","dhulka","gooyn","buuxin","net","gooyn iyo buuxin","tirooyin","habka grid","isbarbardhigga dusha","dusha mugga","yaard saddex-geesood","mitir saddex-geesood"],"headings":[{"id":"meelaha-lagu-akhriyo","text":"Meelaha lagu akhriyo","level":2},{"id":"u-dir-takeoffcraft","text":"U dir TakeoffCraft","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-xisaabiyo","text":"Sida loo xisaabiyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2},{"id":"hubinta-natiijada","text":"Hubinta natiijada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMar kasta oo pad ama koridoor si aan dhibaato lahayn u shaqeeyo, CivilCraft wuxuu barbar dhigaa dusha la soo jeediyay iyo dhulka jira, wuxuuna warbixinayaa gooyn iyo buuxin. Tirooyinku isbeddel kasta waa la cusboonaysiinayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meelaha-lagu-akhriyo\"\u003EMeelaha lagu akhriyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork\u003C/strong\u003E ee panel-ka midig marka waxba la xulan (muuqaalka \u003Cstrong\u003EProject\u003C/strong\u003E), markii ugu yaraan hal pad ama hal koridoor la jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork\u003C/strong\u003E ee panel-ka midig marka pad la xulay (wadarta isku mid ah ee mashruuca oo dhan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESadarka hoose ee dejinta koridoorka, oo leh gooynta iyo buuxinta koridoorkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBlock-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECut\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFill\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ENet\u003C/strong\u003E (oo ay ku xigto &quot;fill&quot; ama &quot;cut&quot;, kii weyn)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esadar kasta marka ka badan tahay mid hal, tusaale: &quot;Pad 1: cut 120.4 cu yd, fill 310.2 cu yd&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esadarka habka: &quot;Grid method: existing ground and the graded surface sampled every 0.5 ft inside the daylight lines (92,891 cells). No swell or shrink applied.&quot; Tarjumaadda: &quot;Habka grid: dhulka jira iyo dusha la hagaaseeyay oo lagu soo qaaday 0.5 ft kasta gudaha jeexyada daylight (92,891 unug). Ma jiro isbeddel kor-u-kac ama hoos-u-dhac la dabaqay.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMugga waxaa lagu qoraa cu yd mashruuc feet ah iyo cu m mashruuc mitir ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dir-takeoffcraft\"\u003EU dir TakeoffCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qiimeyso shaqada dhulka, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dir TakeoffCraft\u003C/span\u003E hoosta block-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork\u003C/strong\u003E. CivilCraft wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl tirooyin (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;site&gt;.quantities.json\u003C/code\u003E) oo leh laba tiro: gooyn iyo buuxin, cu yd (mashruuc feet) ama cu m (mashruuc mitir), isla tirooyinka block-ka, ilaa boqolka. Fur gudaha TakeoffCraft adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cstrong\u003EFur xisaabinta qadarka\u003C/strong\u003E, ama dhig halkaas: waxay noqdaan laba shay oo aad qiimeyn kartaa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/earthwork#cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/earthwork\" data-hash=\"cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\"\u003EGooyn iyo buuxin oo CivilCraft ka timid\u003C/a\u003E). Mar kale dir kadib isbeddel, kadibna fur faylka cusub: shayada isku mid ahi waxay qaadanayaan tirooyinka cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWadarta keliya ayaa la diraa, sidaas awgeed waxba laba jeer lama tirinayo; sadarka faylku wuxuu liistaa gooynta iyo buuxinta pad kasta iyo koridoor kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-xisaabiyo\"\u003ESida loo xisaabiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ehabka grid\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShabakad unugyo labajibbaaran ah ayaa lagu daboolaa meesha ku jirta jeex kasta oo daylight.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBartta unug kasta dhexdeeda, labada dusha ayaa la tijaabiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnug kasta waxaa loo tiriyaa sida prism: farqiga sare-joogga oo lagu dhufto baaxadda unugga. Meesha dusha la soo jeediyay ka hooseyso, waa gooyn; ka sarreyso, waa buuxin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnugyada oo dhan waa la isku geeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirka unugga adiga lagama doorto: wuxuu la falgalaa si uu afar-geesoodka ku wareegsan meelaha la shaqeeyey u qabto ilaa 250,000 unug, oo loo wareejiyay qiime tayo leh (1, 2 ama 5 jeer awood tobanka). Weli ma dooran kartid adigu. Sadarka habku wuxuu sheegayaa cabbirka iyo tirada unugyada. Unugyada yaryar waxay ka saxsan yihiin xuduudaha; unugyada oo dhan ee u dhexeeya dusha siman ee fidsan natiijadu waa sax.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaliya baaxadda gudaha jeexyada daylight ayaa la tiriyaa. Dhulka ka baxsan waa isla sidiisii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPad ama koridoor dhibaato leh lama gooyo, lamana buuxin, wax ku darna ma leh. Haddii block-ka yiraahdo &quot;No volumes yet: a pad needs to grade without problems.&quot;, fiiri sanduuqa cas ee ka sarreeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeelaha ay shayadu isku dhacaan, midda dambe ayaa midda hore ka beddelaa gudaha jeexdeeda daylight, isku dhacuna hal mar ayaa la tiriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa jiro isbeddel kor-u-kac ama hoos-u-dhac la dabaqay. Natiijooyinka isku dhufo haddii aad u baahan tahay mugga bank, loose ama compacted.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQodista dhulka sare, qoto dheerka waddada iyo dhulka hoose, iyo mugga TIN-to-TIN prism weli ma diyaar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta-natiijada\"\u003EHubinta natiijada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu shid \u003Cstrong\u003EProposed (graded)\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhigga\u003C/strong\u003E oo eeg kontuurrada gudaha jeexyada daylight.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMowshirka ku dhaaf meesha la shaqeeyey: status bar-ku wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EGround\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EGraded\u003C/strong\u003E. Farqigu waa qotodheerka gooyn ama buuxin meeshaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoridoor ahaan, sadarka muuqaalka dherer wuxuu muujinayaa gooyn ama buuxin dhexe kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Mar kasta oo pad ama koridoor si aan dhibaato lahayn u shaqeeyo, CivilCraft wuxuu barbar dhigaa dusha la soo jeediyay iyo dhulka jira, wuxuuna warbixinayaa gooyn iyo buuxin. Tirooyinku isbeddel kasta waa la cusboonaysiinayaa. Meelaha lagu akhriyo Earthwork ee panel-ka midig marka waxba la xulan (muuqaalka Project), markii ugu yaraan hal pad ama hal koridoor la jiro. Earthwork ee panel-ka midig marka pad la xulay (wadarta isku mid ah ee mashruuca oo dhan). Sadarka hoose ee dejinta koridoorka, oo leh gooynta iyo buuxinta koridoorkaas. Block-ka Earthwork wuxuu muujinayaa: Cut, Fill iyo Net (oo ay ku xigto \"fill\" ama \"cut\", kii weyn) sadar kasta marka ka badan tahay mid hal, tusaale: \"Pad 1: cut 120.4 cu yd, fill 310.2 cu yd\" sadarka habka: \"Grid method: existing ground and the graded surface sampled every 0.5 ft inside the daylight lines (92,891 cells). No swell or shrink applied.\" Tarjumaadda: \"Habka grid: dhulka jira iyo dusha la hagaaseeyay oo lagu soo qaaday 0.5 ft kasta gudaha jeexyada daylight (92,891 unug). Ma jiro isbeddel kor-u-kac ama hoos-u-dhac la dabaqay.\" Mugga waxaa lagu qoraa cu yd mashruuc feet ah iyo cu m mashruuc mitir ah. U dir TakeoffCraft Si aad qiimeyso shaqada dhulka, dooro U dir TakeoffCraft hoosta block-ka Earthwork. CivilCraft wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl tirooyin (\u003Csite\u003E.quantities.json) oo leh laba tiro: gooyn iyo buuxin, cu yd (mashruuc feet) ama cu m (mashruuc mitir), isla tirooyinka block-ka, ilaa boqolka. Fur gudaha TakeoffCraft adigoo isticmaalaya Fur xisaabinta qadarka, ama dhig halkaas: waxay noqdaan laba shay oo aad qiimeyn kartaa (Gooyn iyo buuxin oo CivilCraft ka timid). Mar kale dir kadib isbeddel, kadibna fur faylka cusub: shayada isku mid ahi waxay qaadanayaan tirooyinka cusub. Wadarta keliya ayaa la diraa, sidaas awgeed waxba laba jeer lama tirinayo; sadarka faylku wuxuu liistaa gooynta iyo buuxinta pad kasta iyo koridoor kasta. Sida loo xisaabiyo CivilCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa habka grid: Shabakad unugyo labajibbaaran ah ayaa lagu daboolaa meesha ku jirta jeex kasta oo daylight. Bartta unug kasta dhexdeeda, labada dusha ayaa la tijaabiyaa. Unug kasta waxaa loo tiriyaa sida prism: farqiga sare-joogga oo lagu dhufto baaxadda unugga. Meesha dusha la soo jeediyay ka hooseyso, waa gooyn; ka sarreyso, waa buuxin. Unugyada oo dhan waa la isku geeyaa. Cabbirka unugga adiga lagama doorto: wuxuu la falgalaa si uu afar-geesoodka ku wareegsan meelaha la shaqeeyey u qabto ilaa 250,000 unug, oo loo wareejiyay qiime tayo leh (1, 2 ama 5 jeer awood tobanka). Weli ma dooran kartid adigu. Sadarka habku wuxuu sheegayaa cabbirka iyo tirada unugyada. Unugyada yaryar waxay ka saxsan yihiin xuduudaha; unugyada oo dhan ee u dhexeeya dusha siman ee fidsan natiijadu waa sax. Waxa aad ogaataa Kaliya baaxadda gudaha jeexyada daylight ayaa la tiriyaa. Dhulka ka baxsan waa isla sidiisii. Pad ama koridoor dhibaato leh lama gooyo, lamana buuxin, wax ku darna ma leh. Haddii block-ka yiraahdo \"No volumes yet: a pad needs to grade without problems.\", fiiri sanduuqa cas ee ka sarreeya. Meelaha ay shayadu isku dhacaan, midda dambe ayaa midda hore ka beddelaa gudaha jeexdeeda daylight, isku dhacuna hal mar ayaa la tiriyaa. Ma jiro isbeddel kor-u-kac ama hoos-u-dhac la dabaqay. Natiijooyinka isku dhufo haddii aad u baahan tahay mugga bank, loose ama compacted. Qodista dhulka sare, qoto dheerka waddada iyo dhulka hoose, iyo mugga TIN-to-TIN prism weli ma diyaar. Hubinta natiijada Ku shid Proposed (graded) ee Bandhigga oo eeg kontuurrada gudaha jeexyada daylight. Mowshirka ku dhaaf meesha la shaqeeyey: status bar-ku wuxuu muujinayaa Ground iyo Graded. Farqigu waa qotodheerka gooyn ama buuxin meeshaas. Koridoor ahaan, sadarka muuqaalka dherer wuxuu muujinayaa gooyn ama buuxin dhexe kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"pipe-network","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Habee shabakadda tuubooyinka xoog-dhaca","summary":"Sawir xariiqyada tuubooyinka storm ama sanitary dhisme-dhisme, deji xeerarkaaga janjeerka, daboolka iyo hoos u dhaca, ka dhig CivilCraft inuu dejiyo hoos u dhacyada, oo hagaaji dhibaatooyinka uu liistaa.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["naqshadda dhismaha","nooca dhismaha","dhisme afar-geesood","godka ururinta","feeme","daboolka","dhumucda darbiga","shayga maktabadda","shabakadda tuubooyinka","storm","sanitary","sewer","dhismayaasha","godaha","afka galinta","hoos u dhaca","daboolka","janjeerka","hoos u dhac","gees","sump","tuubooyinka xoog-dhaca"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-wadada","text":"Sawir wadada","level":2},{"id":"dejinta-xeerarkaaga","text":"Dejinta xeerarkaaga","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-civilcraft-inuu-dejiyo-hoos-u-dhacyada","text":"Ka dhig CivilCraft inuu dejiyo hoos u dhacyada","level":2},{"id":"tafatir-dhismayaasha-iyo-tuubooyinka","text":"Tafatir dhismayaasha iyo tuubooyinka","level":2},{"id":"akhri-oo-hagaaji-dhibaatooyinka","text":"Akhri oo hagaaji dhibaatooyinka","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-dhismaha","text":"Noocyada dhismaha","level":2},{"id":"nooc-la-wadaago-maktabadda","text":"Nooc la wadaago maktabadda","level":3},{"id":"tirtir","text":"Tirtir","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-dhisin","text":"Wali lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMashruuc kasta wuxuu leeyahay hal shabakad tuubooyinka xoog-dhaca, storm ama sanitary. Waxay ka kooban tahay dhismayaal (godaha, afka galinta) iyo tuubooyin toosan oo u dhexeeya. Qulqulku wuxuu socdaa jihada aad sawirto. CivilCraft wuxuu hubiyaa tuubo kasta iyo dhisme kasta saddex xeerar aad dejiso, wuxuuna dejin karaa hoos u dhacyada oo dhan xeerarkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-wadada\"\u003ESawir wadada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sawiri kartaa tuubooyin adigoon dusha lahayn, laakiin geesaha, daboolka iyo hoos u dhacyadu waa in ay leeyihiin dusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubooyinka\u003C/span\u003E qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamaddu waxay leedahay: &quot;Tuubooyinka: guji dhismayaasha laga bilaabo sare ee wadada ilaa hoose (guji mid jira si aad ugu xidho). Enter wuu dhammaysiiyaa.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha dhismaha ee dhinaca sare (upstream) u taal. Dhisme waa la dhigaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dhisme kasta oo xiga oo dhinaca hoose u socda (downstream). Si aad ugu xidho dhisme jira, guji: calaamadda status-ka wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Joined S3.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Tuubooyinka waa la sawiray, hoos u dhacyadooda waxaa lagu dejiyay xeerarka, calaamadda status-ka wuxuu tusaale ahaan leeyahay: &quot;3 tuubo ayaa la sawiray, 12 hoos u dhac ayaa lagu dejiyay xeerarka; hubinta oo dhan way marisay.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismayaasha cusub waxay magacyo ahaan u helaan S1, S2 … oo leh dhexroor 48 in (1200 mm). Tuubooyinka cusub waxay magacyo ahaan u helaan P1, P2 … oo leh dhexroor 12 in (300 mm). Dhexroorka waa inch mashruuca feet ah, millimitir mashruuca mitir ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammee \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Laba jeer guji waa sidoo kale shaqeysa, laakiin marka aad laba jeer gujiso dhisme jira si aad wadada halkaas ugu dhammaysid, xidhidhka waa la tirtiraa: guji mar, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta-xeerarkaaga\"\u003EDejinta xeerarkaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka aan wax la dooran, panel-ka midig (\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruuc\u003C/strong\u003E) wuxuu leeyahay bloog \u003Cstrong\u003EShabakadda tuubooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiimaha bilowga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStorm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo roobka\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo qashin\u003C/span\u003E; waxa loo qoraa LandXML\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJanjeerka ugu yar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.50%\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubo kasta waa inuu hoos u dhacaa ugu yaraan intaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaboolka ugu yar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft (0.6 m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka ilaa qolofka tuubada, dhammaan dhererka tuubada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoos u dhac dhismayaasha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.10 ft (0.03 m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoos u dhaca dhoofinta waa inuu ka hooseeyaa hoos u dhaca afka galinta kasta inta ugu yar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiimayaasha bilowga waa meelo-hayn, ma aha heer.\u003C/strong\u003E Deji qiyamka hay&#039;addaadu ama mashruucu u baahan yahay. Daboolka waxaa lagu qiyaasaa dhulka ilaa qolofka sare (hoos u dhac + dhexroorka gudaha); dhumucda darbiga ma tirinta. Halka pads ama corridors la sawiro, dusha la sawiray waa dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-civilcraft-inuu-dejiyo-hoos-u-dhacyada\"\u003EKa dhig CivilCraft inuu dejiyo hoos u dhacyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejii hoos u dhaca kasta xeerarka\u003C/span\u003E (bloogga \u003Cstrong\u003EShabakadda tuubooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E) wuxuu dejiyaa dhammaan tuubooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejii jooggeeda hoose xeerarka\u003C/span\u003E (marka hal tuubo la doorto) wuxuu dejiyaa tuubadaas oo kaliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIyadoo la socota xeerarka hoose, wad kasta wuxuu bilaabaa daboolka ugu yar ee dhismaha sare, wuxuu hoos u dhacaa janjeerka ugu yar, wuxuu hoos u dhacaa hoos u dhac ilaa afka galinta kasta, wuxuuna ka hooseeyaa meesha dhulku ka hoosaysa tuubada si uusan daboolka ugu yar u dhimin. Hoos u dhacyada waxa lagu dhimaa 0.01, weligiis lagama kiciyo. Calaamadda status-ka wuxuu leeyahay: &quot;Hoos u dhacyada la dejiyay: daboolka ugu yar gees kasta wadada, ugu yaraan janjeerka ugu yar, ugu yaraan hoos u dhaca dhisme kasta.&quot; ama wuxuu magacaabaa waxa aan samayn karin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafatir-dhismayaasha-iyo-tuubooyinka\"\u003ETafatir dhismayaasha iyo tuubooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji dhisme ama tuubo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto panel-ka midig.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhisme\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EGees\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQoto-dheerka sump\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexroorka\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EGees la isticmaalay\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESump\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBariga\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EWoqooyiga\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo tuubooyinka soo galaya iyo kuwa baxaya, iyo hoos u dhacooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa reeb \u003Cstrong\u003EGees\u003C/strong\u003E madhan si aad uga qaadato dusha; sanduuqa ayaa markaas muujinaya qiimaha dusha midab cawl ah. Ku qor qiimo si aad geesta u hagaajiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid gripka dhismaha qorshaha si aad u dhaqaajiso. Tuubooyinkiisu way raacaan; hoos u dhacooda way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen, markaa hubi dhibaatooyinka kadib.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro mid ka mid ah noocyada dhismaha shabakadda (hoos), ama midkoodna haddii aad rabto dhisme wareeg ah oo dhexroorkiisa gaar ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETuubo\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E, dhismayaasha ay u dhexaysa, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexroorka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EHoos u dhaca sare\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EHoos u dhaca hoose\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeer\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDaboolka ugu yar\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kadib qiimo kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-oo-hagaaji-dhibaatooyinka\"\u003EAkhri oo hagaaji dhibaatooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBlock-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EShabakadda tuubooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa dhibaato kasta (ilaa 40); guji mid si aad u doorato tuubada ama dhismaha. Tuubo ama dhisme la doortay wuxuu liistaa midkiisa. Haddii aanu jirin, wuxuu dhahayaa &quot;Tuubo kasta iyo dhisme kasta waa marsadaa xeerarka.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta (tusaale)\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;P2 wuxuu kor u socdaa (-0.40%).&quot; ama &quot;… wuxuu siman yahay …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIs beddel hoos u dhacyada, ama dejii xeerarka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;P2 ee 0.30% way siman tahay marka loo barbardhigo ugu yar 0.50%.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoos u dhig hoos u dhaca downstream, ama kor u qaad kan upstream.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;P3 daboolkiisa dhererka wuxuu yahay 1.40 oo 35 ah, oo ka yar ugu yar 2.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoos u dhig tuubada; dejii hoos u dhacyadeeda xeerarka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;S3 gudaheeda, P4 wuxuu ka baxayaa 245.20, oo ka hooseeya 0.1 P3 oo ka soo gelaya 245.25.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoos u dhig hoos u dhaca sare ee tuubada baxda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Qolofka P1 wuxuu ka sarreeyaa geesha S1.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubadu way sarreysaa dhismaha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;S2 wuxuu leeyahay 2 tuubo oo ka baxaya; shabakadda xoog-dhaca waa inay leedahay hal jid oo ka baxa dhisme kasta.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar tuubo baxda mid, ama dib u sawir jihada saxda ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Tuubooyinka waxay sameeyaan wareeg; qulqulku waa inuu ku dhammaado dhoofinta.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWad ayaa dib loogu soo rogay; tirtir tuubo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;S5 dusha ka baxsan yahay oo ma leh sare-u-kac geesood.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qor gees, ama dhig dhismaha dusha saaran.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;P6 qayb ka baxsan dusha ayay socotaa; daboolka halkaas lama yaqaan.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha ku fidi, ama aqbal in daboolka halkaas aan la hubin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;P7 weli ma lahan hoos u dhac.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qor, ama dejii xeerarka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha dhibaatada leh waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa casaan qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada-dhismaha\"\u003ENoocyada dhismaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca dhismaha waa dhisme laga dhisay cabbirradiisa: godka, afka galinta, sanduuqa isku xirka ama dhoofinta, \u003Cstrong\u003Ewareeg\u003C/strong\u003E (dhexroorka gudaha) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Eafar-geesood\u003C/strong\u003E (ballac iyo dherer gudaha), oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003Edhumucda darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esagxadda sare\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esump\u003C/strong\u003E ka hooseeya tuubada ugu hoose, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Efeeme iyo daboolka\u003C/strong\u003E (furitaan wareeg ama afar-geesood, dherer feeme). Noocyadu waxay ku jiraan shabakadda, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyada dhismaha\u003C/strong\u003E ee Properties-ka mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooc dhisme cusub\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu sawiraa dhismaha qorshaha iyo qaybta isagoo qorayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar nooca\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro dhisme oo dooro nooca hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu qaataa cabbirka iyo sump-ka nooca; sump-keeda gaar ah wali waa la beddeli karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax ka beddel nooc, dhisme kasta oo nooca ahaana cabbirradiisa way raacaan. Tirtir nooc, dhismayaashiisu waxay noqdaan dhismayaal wareeg ah oo isla ballacaas ah. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu dib u celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhisme afar-geesood waxa lagu sawiraa qorshaha, DXF, DWG iyo PDF, iyo 3D sida afar-geesood oo dherkeeda ku taal tuubada baxda; tuubooyinku ka bilaabmaan darbigiisa. LandXML wuxuu u qoraa sida dhisme afar-geesood (\u003Ccode\u003ERectStruct\u003C/code\u003E) oo leh dhumucda darbigiisa, waxayna dib u akhrisaa sida noocyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"nooc-la-wadaago-maktabadda\"\u003ENooc la wadaago maktabadda\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida shay maktabad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa nooca sida shay maktabadda CadCraft (fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E): astaantiisa qorshaha, jidh 3D ilaa qoto-dheer caadi ah, iyo cabbirradiisa oo dhan. Soo rar maktabadda si aad u wadaagto. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur shay maktabad ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrisaa dhismaha laga kaydiyay shabakadda, oo loo beddelay unitiyada mashruuca. Shayada maktabadda ee aan ahayn dhismayaal lagu sameeyay CivilCraft waa la diidaa, sababta la sheegayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirtir\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro tuubo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u tirtirto. Tirtirka dhisme waxa uu sidoo kale tirtiraa tuubooyinka isku xiran. Mac-ka, riix Fn iyo delete, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQulqulka, cabbirrada tuubada iyo khadka heerka biyaha waa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/storm-drainage\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/storm-drainage\"\u003EBiyo-mareenka roobka\u003C/a\u003E. Katalogyada tuubooyinka, tuubooyin aan wareegga ahayn, tuubooyinka muuqaalka dherer, tuubooyin qalloocan iyo shabakado badan oo mashruuc kasta lagu meel-mariyo weli lama heli karo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Mashruuc kasta wuxuu leeyahay hal shabakad tuubooyinka xoog-dhaca, storm ama sanitary. Waxay ka kooban tahay dhismayaal (godaha, afka galinta) iyo tuubooyin toosan oo u dhexeeya. Qulqulku wuxuu socdaa jihada aad sawirto. CivilCraft wuxuu hubiyaa tuubo kasta iyo dhisme kasta saddex xeerar aad dejiso, wuxuuna dejin karaa hoos u dhacyada oo dhan xeerarkaas. Sawir wadada Waxaad sawiri kartaa tuubooyin adigoon dusha lahayn, laakiin geesaha, daboolka iyo hoos u dhacyadu waa in ay leeyihiin dusha. Riix P, ama guji Tuubooyinka qaybta Naqshadda. Calaamaddu waxay leedahay: \"Tuubooyinka: guji dhismayaasha laga bilaabo sare ee wadada ilaa hoose (guji mid jira si aad ugu xidho). Enter wuu dhammaysiiyaa.\" Guji meesha dhismaha ee dhinaca sare (upstream) u taal. Dhisme waa la dhigaa. Guji dhisme kasta oo xiga oo dhinaca hoose u socda (downstream). Si aad ugu xidho dhisme jira, guji: calaamadda status-ka wuxuu leeyahay \"Joined S3.\" Riix Enter. Tuubooyinka waa la sawiray, hoos u dhacyadooda waxaa lagu dejiyay xeerarka, calaamadda status-ka wuxuu tusaale ahaan leeyahay: \"3 tuubo ayaa la sawiray, 12 hoos u dhac ayaa lagu dejiyay xeerarka; hubinta oo dhan way marisay.\" Dhismayaasha cusub waxay magacyo ahaan u helaan S1, S2 … oo leh dhexroor 48 in (1200 mm). Tuubooyinka cusub waxay magacyo ahaan u helaan P1, P2 … oo leh dhexroor 12 in (300 mm). Dhexroorka waa inch mashruuca feet ah, millimitir mashruuca mitir ah. Dhammee Enter. Laba jeer guji waa sidoo kale shaqeysa, laakiin marka aad laba jeer gujiso dhisme jira si aad wadada halkaas ugu dhammaysid, xidhidhka waa la tirtiraa: guji mar, kadibna riix Enter. Dejinta xeerarkaaga Marka aan wax la dooran, panel-ka midig (Mashruuc) wuxuu leeyahay bloog Shabakadda tuubooyinka: Dejinta Qiimaha bilowga Macnaha Nooca Storm Biyo roobka ama Biyo qashin; waxa loo qoraa LandXML Janjeerka ugu yar 0.50% Tuubo kasta waa inuu hoos u dhacaa ugu yaraan intaas Daboolka ugu yar 2 ft (0.6 m) Dhulka ilaa qolofka tuubada, dhammaan dhererka tuubada Hoos u dhac dhismayaasha 0.10 ft (0.03 m) Hoos u dhaca dhoofinta waa inuu ka hooseeyaa hoos u dhaca afka galinta kasta inta ugu yar Qiimayaasha bilowga waa meelo-hayn, ma aha heer. Deji qiyamka hay'addaadu ama mashruucu u baahan yahay. Daboolka waxaa lagu qiyaasaa dhulka ilaa qolofka sare (hoos u dhac + dhexroorka gudaha); dhumucda darbiga ma tirinta. Halka pads ama corridors la sawiro, dusha la sawiray waa dhulka. Ka dhig CivilCraft inuu dejiyo hoos u dhacyada Dejii hoos u dhaca kasta xeerarka (bloogga Shabakadda tuubooyinka) wuxuu dejiyaa dhammaan tuubooyinka. Dejii jooggeeda hoose xeerarka (marka hal tuubo la doorto) wuxuu dejiyaa tuubadaas oo kaliya. Iyadoo la socota xeerarka hoose, wad kasta wuxuu bilaabaa daboolka ugu yar ee dhismaha sare, wuxuu hoos u dhacaa janjeerka ugu yar, wuxuu hoos u dhacaa hoos u dhac ilaa afka galinta kasta, wuxuuna ka hooseeyaa meesha dhulku ka hoosaysa tuubada si uusan daboolka ugu yar u dhimin. Hoos u dhacyada waxa lagu dhimaa 0.01, weligiis lagama kiciyo. Calaamadda status-ka wuxuu leeyahay: \"Hoos u dhacyada la dejiyay: daboolka ugu yar gees kasta wadada, ugu yaraan janjeerka ugu yar, ugu yaraan hoos u dhaca dhisme kasta.\" ama wuxuu magacaabaa waxa aan samayn karin. Tafatir dhismayaasha iyo tuubooyinka Guji dhisme ama tuubo Dooro si aad u aragto panel-ka midig. Dhisme: Magaca, Gees, Qoto-dheerka sump, Dhexroorka, kadibna Gees la isticmaalay, Sump, Bariga iyo Woqooyiga, iyo tuubooyinka soo galaya iyo kuwa baxaya, iyo hoos u dhacooda. Ka reeb Gees madhan si aad uga qaadato dusha; sanduuqa ayaa markaas muujinaya qiimaha dusha midab cawl ah. Ku qor qiimo si aad geesta u hagaajiso. Jiid gripka dhismaha qorshaha si aad u dhaqaajiso. Tuubooyinkiisu way raacaan; hoos u dhacooda way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen, markaa hubi dhibaatooyinka kadib. Nooca: dooro mid ka mid ah noocyada dhismaha shabakadda (hoos), ama midkoodna haddii aad rabto dhisme wareeg ah oo dhexroorkiisa gaar ah. Tuubo: Magaca, dhismayaasha ay u dhexaysa, Dhexroorka, Hoos u dhaca sare, Hoos u dhaca hoose, kadibna Dherer, Janjeer iyo Daboolka ugu yar. Riix Enter kadib qiimo kasta. Akhri oo hagaaji dhibaatooyinka Block-ka Shabakadda tuubooyinka wuxuu liistaa dhibaato kasta (ilaa 40); guji mid si aad u doorato tuubada ama dhismaha. Tuubo ama dhisme la doortay wuxuu liistaa midkiisa. Haddii aanu jirin, wuxuu dhahayaa \"Tuubo kasta iyo dhisme kasta waa marsadaa xeerarka.\" Fariinta (tusaale) Waxa la sameeyo \"P2 wuxuu kor u socdaa (-0.40%).\" ama \"… wuxuu siman yahay …\" Is beddel hoos u dhacyada, ama dejii xeerarka. \"P2 ee 0.30% way siman tahay marka loo barbardhigo ugu yar 0.50%.\" Hoos u dhig hoos u dhaca downstream, ama kor u qaad kan upstream. \"P3 daboolkiisa dhererka wuxuu yahay 1.40 oo 35 ah, oo ka yar ugu yar 2.\" Hoos u dhig tuubada; dejii hoos u dhacyadeeda xeerarka. \"S3 gudaheeda, P4 wuxuu ka baxayaa 245.20, oo ka hooseeya 0.1 P3 oo ka soo gelaya 245.25.\" Hoos u dhig hoos u dhaca sare ee tuubada baxda. \"Qolofka P1 wuxuu ka sarreeyaa geesha S1.\" Tuubadu way sarreysaa dhismaha. \"S2 wuxuu leeyahay 2 tuubo oo ka baxaya; shabakadda xoog-dhaca waa inay leedahay hal jid oo ka baxa dhisme kasta.\" Ka saar tuubo baxda mid, ama dib u sawir jihada saxda ah. \"Tuubooyinka waxay sameeyaan wareeg; qulqulku waa inuu ku dhammaado dhoofinta.\" Wad ayaa dib loogu soo rogay; tirtir tuubo. \"S5 dusha ka baxsan yahay oo ma leh sare-u-kac geesood.\" Ku qor gees, ama dhig dhismaha dusha saaran. \"P6 qayb ka baxsan dusha ayay socotaa; daboolka halkaas lama yaqaan.\" Dusha ku fidi, ama aqbal in daboolka halkaas aan la hubin. \"P7 weli ma lahan hoos u dhac.\" Ku qor, ama dejii xeerarka. Tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha dhibaatada leh waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa casaan qorshaha. Noocyada dhismaha Nooca dhismaha waa dhisme laga dhisay cabbirradiisa: godka, afka galinta, sanduuqa isku xirka ama dhoofinta, wareeg (dhexroorka gudaha) ama afar-geesood (ballac iyo dherer gudaha), oo leh dhumucda darbiga, sagxadda sare, sump ka hooseeya tuubada ugu hoose, iyo feeme iyo daboolka (furitaan wareeg ama afar-geesood, dherer feeme). Noocyadu waxay ku jiraan shabakadda, hoosta Noocyada dhismaha ee Properties-ka mashruuca. Guji Nooc dhisme cusub. Wada-hadalku wuxuu sawiraa dhismaha qorshaha iyo qaybta isagoo qorayo. Guji Ku dar nooca. Dooro dhisme oo dooro nooca hoosta Nooca. Wuxuu qaataa cabbirka iyo sump-ka nooca; sump-keeda gaar ah wali waa la beddeli karaa. Wax ka beddel nooc, dhisme kasta oo nooca ahaana cabbirradiisa way raacaan. Tirtir nooc, dhismayaashiisu waxay noqdaan dhismayaal wareeg ah oo isla ballacaas ah. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z wuu dib u celiyaa. Dhisme afar-geesood waxa lagu sawiraa qorshaha, DXF, DWG iyo PDF, iyo 3D sida afar-geesood oo dherkeeda ku taal tuubada baxda; tuubooyinku ka bilaabmaan darbigiisa. LandXML wuxuu u qoraa sida dhisme afar-geesood (RectStruct) oo leh dhumucda darbigiisa, waxayna dib u akhrisaa sida noocyo. Nooc la wadaago maktabadda U kaydi sida shay maktabad wuxuu qoraa nooca sida shay maktabadda CadCraft (fayl .json): astaantiisa qorshaha, jidh 3D ilaa qoto-dheer caadi ah, iyo cabbirradiisa oo dhan. Soo rar maktabadda si aad u wadaagto. Fur shay maktabad ah wuxuu akhrisaa dhismaha laga kaydiyay shabakadda, oo loo beddelay unitiyada mashruuca. Shayada maktabadda ee aan ahayn dhismayaal lagu sameeyay CivilCraft waa la diidaa, sababta la sheegayo. Tirtir Dooro tuubo oo riix Delete si aad u tirtirto. Tirtirka dhisme waxa uu sidoo kale tirtiraa tuubooyinka isku xiran. Mac-ka, riix Fn iyo delete, ama guji Tirtir. Wali lama dhisin Qulqulka, cabbirrada tuubada iyo khadka heerka biyaha waa Biyo-mareenka roobka. Katalogyada tuubooyinka, tuubooyin aan wareegga ahayn, tuubooyinka muuqaalka dherer, tuubooyin qalloocan iyo shabakado badan oo mashruuc kasta lagu meel-mariyo weli lama heli karo. Eeg Wali lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"storm-drainage","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xisaabi socodka roobka, cabbirka biibaabka iyo khadka heerka biyaha","summary":"Samee dhulka wax-ka-socdaa ee u daadiya kaabkasta, ku dar socodka hoos shabakadda iyadoo la adeegsanayo habka rational-ka, cabbir biibaabka iyadoo la adeegsanayo isla-geedka Manning, oo arag meesha khadka heerka biyaha buuxo ama uu gaaro dusha.","section":"tasks","order":92,"keywords":["roobka","biibaabka roobka","dhulka daadinta","habka rational","isku-darka daadinta","waqtiga isku-urinta","xoogga roobka","idf","manning","cabbirka biibaabka","khadka heerka biyaha","hgl","khadka tamarta","egl","biyo-badnaan","daadin","hoos-biyaha"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-kaabka","text":"Samee kaabka","level":2},{"id":"dhig-roobka-naqshadda","text":"Dhig roobka naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"sida-socodyada-loo-wada-geeyo","text":"Sida socodyada loo wada geeyo","level":2},{"id":"cabbir-biibaabka","text":"Cabbir biibaabka","level":2},{"id":"akhri-khadadka-heerka","text":"Akhri khadadka heerka","level":2},{"id":"wad-roob","text":"Wad roob","level":2},{"id":"lagu-kaydiyo-mashruuca","text":"Lagu kaydiyo mashruuca","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadda roobka waxay ku shaqeysaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/pipe-network\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/pipe-network\"\u003Eshabakadda biibaabka\u003C/a\u003E: marka hore samee shabakadda, kadibna dhulka ay biyuhu ku daadiyaan. Wax walba waxay ku muuqdaan hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ERoobka\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig marka wax aan la dooran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-kaabka\"\u003ESamee kaabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee kaabka\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ERoobka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesaha aagga ee u daadiya hal kaab. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama laba jeer guji ayaa dhammeeya; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka noqdaa geesta u dambaysa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaabka waxa uu u daadiyaa kaab ku jirta, haddii kale kan ugu dhow. \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa furmaya: dhig magaciisa, \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-darka daadinta C\u003C/strong\u003E (qaybta roobka ee daadiya, 0 ilaa 1), \u003Cstrong\u003EWaqtiga isku-urinta\u003C/strong\u003E daqiiqadood, iyo kaabka ay \u003Cstrong\u003Eu daadiso\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESamee kaab kale\u003C/strong\u003E ee Sifooyinkiisa wuxuu bilaabaa mid xiga. Guji gudaha kaab naqshadda si aad u doorato; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa tirtira. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-roobka-naqshadda\"\u003EDhig roobka naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXoogga roobka waa i = a ÷ (tc + b) oo kor loo qaado c, saacad kasta inji ah mashruuca feet-ka, iyo millimitir saacaddii mashruuca mitirka. Ku habee \u003Cstrong\u003EXoogga a\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eb\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ec\u003C/strong\u003E qalooca xoogga-muddada-soo-noqnoqoshada (intensity-duration-frequency) ee aad u naqshadeysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalooca bilowga ah ee xoogga, Manning n (0.013) iyo luminta isgoyska (0.5) waa meel-hayn (placeholder), ma aha caadi. Ku deji xogta roobkaaga iyo shuruudahaaga naqshadeed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaqtiga ugu gaaban ee isku-urinta\u003C/strong\u003E: ma jiro biibaab lagu xisaabiyo waqti ka gaaban (10 daqiiqo bilowga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EManning n\u003C/strong\u003E: jiifka biibaabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuminta isgoyska\u003C/strong\u003E: madaxa lumaya kaabkasta, oo qayb ah xawaaraha-madaxa V²/2g ee biibaabka ka baxaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka biyaha ee dhamaadka\u003C/strong\u003E: hoos-biyaha, halka biibaabka u dambeeya ka madhnaado. Bannaan ka tag marka dhamaadku xor u socdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-socodyada-loo-wada-geeyo\"\u003ESida socodyada loo wada geeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBiibaab kasta wuxuu qaadaa kaabkasta oo ka sarreeya. Q = C × i × A, halka C × A lagu soo koobo shabakadda hoos, i-na uu yahay xoogga waqtiga isku-urinta ee ugu dheer ee biyaha iman kara: waqtiga kaabka laftiisa, ama waqtiga kaabka hore oo lagu daro waqtiga socodka biibaabka (dherer ÷ xawaaraha oo buuxa). Q waa cubic feet per second (A acre) ama cubic meter per second (A hectare).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbir-biibaabka\"\u003ECabbir biibaabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ESocodyada iyo khadadka heerka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu biibaab kasta u muujiyaa socodka, waxa uu qaadayo oo buuxa qalooca dhulka, xawaaraha, heerka madaxa meesha sare iyo hoose, iyo qoto-dheerida uu socdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir biibaabka socodyadan\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu biibaab kasta siiyaa cabbirka caadiga ah ee ugu yar oo qaadi kara socodkiisa qalooca kaabkiisa (12 ilaa 72 in, ama 300 ilaa 1800 mm). Waa hal tallaabo. Heerarka hoos way joogsadaan: haddii cabbirku beddelo, isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EDejii hoos u dhaca kasta xeerarka\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u hayso daboolka, kadibna mar kale eeg miiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-khadadka-heerka\"\u003EAkhri khadadka heerka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadka heerka biyaha (HGL) waxaa laga xisaabiyaa dhamaadka dhanka hore:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBiibaab qayb ahaan buuxa wuxuu HGL-kiisa ku leeyahay dusha biyaha: hoos-u-dhaca oo ku daraysa qotodheerida caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii biyaha hoos ka sarreeyo sare-ka buurta, ama uu qaado wax ka badan intii uu buuxin karo, wuu buuxaa (surcharged) oo HGL-kiisa wuxuu kor u kacaa sida xoogga-saaradda (friction slope) dhererkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaabkasta HGL-kiisa waa HGL-ka sare ee biibaabka ka baxaya oo lagu daro luminta isgoyska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhadka tamarta (EGL) waa HGL oo lagu daro madaxa xawaaraha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBiibaab buuxa waa la liistaa, sidaas oo kale kaabka kasta oo HGL-kiisa ka sarreeya kantarka: biyuhu meesha ayay ku gaaraan dusha, kaabkaasna naqshadda waxaa lagu wareegaa casaan. Dooro biibaab ama kaab si aad u aragto socodkiisa, qoto-dheerida, xawaaraha iyo labada khadka heerka Sifooyinkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wad-roob\"\u003EWad roob\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka rational-ka wuxuu biibaab kasta siiyaa hal dhalaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoute the storm\u003C/span\u003E (hoosta natiijooyinka, Sifooyinka shabakadda) wuxuu xisaabiyaa roobka oo dhan: runoff-ka kaab kasta ee waqtiga, oo lagu qaado biibaabka iyo waqtiga socodkiisa iyo kaydka, oo lagu daro meesha ay isku kulmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa tag \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERain lasts\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERain intensity\u003C/span\u003E madhan si aad u isticmaasho waqtiga isku-urinta ee ugu dheer iyo qalooca roobka kor ku qoran, ama qor kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoute the storm\u003C/span\u003E. Miiska wuxuu liistaa, biibaab kasta, socodka ugu sarreeya ee soo galaya iyo ka baxaya, inta uu hoosaysay dhalaanka ka baxaya, inta uu ka qaadanayo awoodda buuxa ee biibaabka, iyo daqiiqadda uu gaaro sarreeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaad kasta wuxuu helaa jadwal yar oo socod-waqti ah iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload the hydrograph (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaabku wuxuu soo saaraa roobka celceliska ah ee waqtiga isku-urinta, sidaas darteed roob ka gaaban waqtaas wuxuu gaaraa sarreeyo ka hooseeya C × i × A. Biibaab kasta waxaa lagu wadaa habka Muskingum–Cunge, iyadoo la adeegsanayo qoto-dheerida socodka oo habka rational-ku hore u helay. Laba laan oo waqtiyo isku-urinta kala duwan leh ma gaaraan sarreeyo isku mar, sidaas darteed wadarta ayaa ka hooseysa wadarta sarreeyooyinkooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETan ma moodeelayso surcharge, backwater, kaydka kaababka ama daadka. Biibaab ay sarreeyadiisa la wadey ka sarreeyo awoodda buuxa waa la liistaa, biyaheeda waa la gudbiyaa sidii iyagoo ku habboon. Isticmaal si aad u aragto waqtiga iyo yaraynta, ma aha si aad cabbirka biibaabka u dhigto. Waa caawiye xisaab; injineer ayaa hubiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lagu-kaydiyo-mashruuca\"\u003ELagu kaydiyo mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaabyada iyo dejinta roobka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Weli ma ku jiraan PDF-ka qorshaha, DWG ama DXF, ama LandXML: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Naqshadda roobka waxay ku shaqeysaa shabakadda biibaabka: marka hore samee shabakadda, kadibna dhulka ay biyuhu ku daadiyaan. Wax walba waxay ku muuqdaan hoosta Roobka panelka midig marka wax aan la dooran. Samee kaabka Guji Samee kaabka hoosta Roobka. Guji geesaha aagga ee u daadiya hal kaab. Enter ama laba jeer guji ayaa dhammeeya; Backspace wuxuu ka noqdaa geesta u dambaysa, Esc wuu joojiyaa. Kaabka waxa uu u daadiyaa kaab ku jirta, haddii kale kan ugu dhow. Sifooyinkiisa ayaa furmaya: dhig magaciisa, Isku-darka daadinta C (qaybta roobka ee daadiya, 0 ilaa 1), Waqtiga isku-urinta daqiiqadood, iyo kaabka ay u daadiso. Samee kaab kale ee Sifooyinkiisa wuxuu bilaabaa mid xiga. Guji gudaha kaab naqshadda si aad u doorato; Delete ayaa tirtira. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqda. Dhig roobka naqshadda Xoogga roobka waa i = a ÷ (tc + b) oo kor loo qaado c, saacad kasta inji ah mashruuca feet-ka, iyo millimitir saacaddii mashruuca mitirka. Ku habee Xoogga a, b iyo c qalooca xoogga-muddada-soo-noqnoqoshada (intensity-duration-frequency) ee aad u naqshadeysaa. Qalooca bilowga ah ee xoogga, Manning n (0.013) iyo luminta isgoyska (0.5) waa meel-hayn (placeholder), ma aha caadi. Ku deji xogta roobkaaga iyo shuruudahaaga naqshadeed. Waqtiga ugu gaaban ee isku-urinta: ma jiro biibaab lagu xisaabiyo waqti ka gaaban (10 daqiiqo bilowga). Manning n: jiifka biibaabka. Luminta isgoyska: madaxa lumaya kaabkasta, oo qayb ah xawaaraha-madaxa V²/2g ee biibaabka ka baxaya. Heerka biyaha ee dhamaadka: hoos-biyaha, halka biibaabka u dambeeya ka madhnaado. Bannaan ka tag marka dhamaadku xor u socdo. Sida socodyada loo wada geeyo Biibaab kasta wuxuu qaadaa kaabkasta oo ka sarreeya. Q = C × i × A, halka C × A lagu soo koobo shabakadda hoos, i-na uu yahay xoogga waqtiga isku-urinta ee ugu dheer ee biyaha iman kara: waqtiga kaabka laftiisa, ama waqtiga kaabka hore oo lagu daro waqtiga socodka biibaabka (dherer ÷ xawaaraha oo buuxa). Q waa cubic feet per second (A acre) ama cubic meter per second (A hectare). Cabbir biibaabka Miiska hoosta Socodyada iyo khadadka heerka wuxuu biibaab kasta u muujiyaa socodka, waxa uu qaadayo oo buuxa qalooca dhulka, xawaaraha, heerka madaxa meesha sare iyo hoose, iyo qoto-dheerida uu socdo. Cabbir biibaabka socodyadan wuxuu biibaab kasta siiyaa cabbirka caadiga ah ee ugu yar oo qaadi kara socodkiisa qalooca kaabkiisa (12 ilaa 72 in, ama 300 ilaa 1800 mm). Waa hal tallaabo. Heerarka hoos way joogsadaan: haddii cabbirku beddelo, isticmaal Dejii hoos u dhaca kasta xeerarka si aad u hayso daboolka, kadibna mar kale eeg miiska. Akhri khadadka heerka Khadka heerka biyaha (HGL) waxaa laga xisaabiyaa dhamaadka dhanka hore: Biibaab qayb ahaan buuxa wuxuu HGL-kiisa ku leeyahay dusha biyaha: hoos-u-dhaca oo ku daraysa qotodheerida caadiga ah. Markii biyaha hoos ka sarreeyo sare-ka buurta, ama uu qaado wax ka badan intii uu buuxin karo, wuu buuxaa (surcharged) oo HGL-kiisa wuxuu kor u kacaa sida xoogga-saaradda (friction slope) dhererkiisa. Kaabkasta HGL-kiisa waa HGL-ka sare ee biibaabka ka baxaya oo lagu daro luminta isgoyska. Khadka tamarta (EGL) waa HGL oo lagu daro madaxa xawaaraha. Biibaab buuxa waa la liistaa, sidaas oo kale kaabka kasta oo HGL-kiisa ka sarreeya kantarka: biyuhu meesha ayay ku gaaraan dusha, kaabkaasna naqshadda waxaa lagu wareegaa casaan. Dooro biibaab ama kaab si aad u aragto socodkiisa, qoto-dheerida, xawaaraha iyo labada khadka heerka Sifooyinkiisa. Wad roob Habka rational-ka wuxuu biibaab kasta siiyaa hal dhalaan. Route the storm (hoosta natiijooyinka, Sifooyinka shabakadda) wuxuu xisaabiyaa roobka oo dhan: runoff-ka kaab kasta ee waqtiga, oo lagu qaado biibaabka iyo waqtiga socodkiisa iyo kaydka, oo lagu daro meesha ay isku kulmaan. Ka tag Rain lasts iyo Rain intensity madhan si aad u isticmaasho waqtiga isku-urinta ee ugu dheer iyo qalooca roobka kor ku qoran, ama qor kaaga. Riix Route the storm. Miiska wuxuu liistaa, biibaab kasta, socodka ugu sarreeya ee soo galaya iyo ka baxaya, inta uu hoosaysay dhalaanka ka baxaya, inta uu ka qaadanayo awoodda buuxa ee biibaabka, iyo daqiiqadda uu gaaro sarreeyo. Dhamaad kasta wuxuu helaa jadwal yar oo socod-waqti ah iyo Download the hydrograph (CSV). Kaabku wuxuu soo saaraa roobka celceliska ah ee waqtiga isku-urinta, sidaas darteed roob ka gaaban waqtaas wuxuu gaaraa sarreeyo ka hooseeya C × i × A. Biibaab kasta waxaa lagu wadaa habka Muskingum–Cunge, iyadoo la adeegsanayo qoto-dheerida socodka oo habka rational-ku hore u helay. Laba laan oo waqtiyo isku-urinta kala duwan leh ma gaaraan sarreeyo isku mar, sidaas darteed wadarta ayaa ka hooseysa wadarta sarreeyooyinkooda. Tan ma moodeelayso surcharge, backwater, kaydka kaababka ama daadka. Biibaab ay sarreeyadiisa la wadey ka sarreeyo awoodda buuxa waa la liistaa, biyaheeda waa la gudbiyaa sidii iyagoo ku habboon. Isticmaal si aad u aragto waqtiga iyo yaraynta, ma aha si aad cabbirka biibaabka u dhigto. Waa caawiye xisaab; injineer ayaa hubiya. Lagu kaydiyo mashruuca Kaabyada iyo dejinta roobka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Weli ma ku jiraan PDF-ka qorshaha, DWG ama DXF, ama LandXML: eeg Wali lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sanitary-design","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xisaabi socodka naqshadda biyo-qashinka iyo hubi marinka","summary":"Gali dadka iyo aagga ku imanaya god kasta oo shabakada biyo-qashinka ah; CivilCraft wuxuu isku daraa hoosta shabakada, wuxuu xisaabiyaa socodka ugu sarreeya tirada kororka iyo biyaha dhulka galaya, wuxuuna hubiyaa awoodda iyo xawaaraha tuubo kasta.","section":"tasks","order":93,"keywords":["biyo-qashin","marinka biyo-qashinka","biyo-qashin (wastewater)","socodka naqshadda","socodka ugu sarreeya","tirada kororka","harmon","babbitt","biyaha dhulka galaya","dadka","dad halkii qof","boqolkiiba buuxda","is-nadiifin","xawaaraha","cabbirka tuubada","xaashida naqshadda"],"headings":[{"id":"gali-waxa-soo-gala","text":"Gali waxa soo gala","level":2},{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ay-xisaabiso","text":"Waxa ay xisaabiso","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESocodka naqshadda biyo-qashinka wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/pipe-network\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/pipe-network\"\u003Eshabakada tuubooyinka\u003C/a\u003E marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E tahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanitary\u003C/span\u003E. Marka waxba la dooran, panelka midig wuxuu markaas muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESocodka naqshadda biyo-qashinka\u003C/strong\u003E, halka shabakada duufaanka ay muujinto socodka duufaanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gali-waxa-soo-gala\"\u003EGali waxa soo gala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro manhole. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ESocodka naqshadda biyo-qashinka\u003C/strong\u003E, qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPeople entering here\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea entering here\u003C/span\u003E (hectare mashruuc metric ah, acre mashruuc feet ah).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDukaamada, xafiisyada ama warshadaha, qor dadka u dhigma: aagga oo lagu dhufto dadka halkii hectare (ama acre) oo ay hay&#039;addaadu isticmaasho. Aagga wuxuu u tirsan yahay biyaha dhulka galaya labadaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu celi god kasta oo waddo ama lot ku xirma. God aan waxba ku xirnayn waxaa lagu hayaa labadaba 0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuub kasta waxay qaadaa wax kasta oo ku soo galaya manhole-kiisa sare iyo waxa ka sarreeya. Dooro manhole si aad u aragto waxa ka gudba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaheeda\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlow per person\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esocodka celceliska ee hal qof maalin kasta: litir (mashruuc metric) ama US gallon (mashruuc feet)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInfiltration\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebiyaha dhulka ka soo galaya: litir ilbiriqsi hectare kasta, ama gallon maalin acre kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPeaking factor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHarmon, 1 + 14 / (4 + √P), ama Babbitt, 5 / P^0.2, iyadoo P ay tahay dadka oo kun-kun ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPeaking factor at least\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPeaking factor at most\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efactor-ka waa la hayaa labadan dhexdooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EManning n\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eawoodda iyo xawaaraha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeast velocity\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMost velocity\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqoto-dheer tuubada ee socodka ugu sarreeya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMost of full capacity\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esida tuubadu u buuxi karto socodka ugu sarreeya, boqolkiiba awoodda ay qaadi karto markii buuxda socoto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiimaha bilowga ah waa meel-hayn, ma aha heer. Isticmaal qiimaha hay&#039;addaadu daabacdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ay-xisaabiso\"\u003EWaxa ay xisaabiso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuub kasta, marka loo raaco socodka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esocodka ugu sarreeya = dad × socodka hal qof × factor-ka kororka + aag × biyaha dhulka galaya\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eawoodda marka buuxda socoto (isle&#039;egta Manning ee gradient-ka tuubada), iyo sida uu socodka ugu sarreeya u buuxiyo\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqoto-dheer caadi ee socodka ugu sarreeya iyo xawaaraha meeshaas\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska \u003Cstrong\u003ENatiijooyinka biyo-qashinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa dadka tuub kasta, factor-ka kororka, socodka ugu sarreeya (L/s, ama gpm iyo cubic feet per second), boqolkiiba buuxda iyo xawaaraha. Dhibaatooyinka waxaa hoosta lagu liistaa: tuub ka buuxsan xadka, ka gaabsan xawaaraha ugu yar (waxay laga yaabaa inaysan isnadiifin), ka dhakhso badan xawaaraha ugu badan, ama aan hoos-u-dhac lahayn. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize the pipes for these flows\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tuub kasta u dooraa cabbirka caadiga ah ee ugu yar (200 mm ama 8 inches iyo ka weyn) oo qaada socodka ugu sarreeya xadka gudihiisa; hal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa socodka joogtada ah ee ugu sarreeya ee xisaabiya xaashida naqshadda, la hubiyay xaashi naqshadeed la daabacay ilaa xagga la daabacay. Ma aha moodel shabakada waqtiga: ma jiro hydrograph, kaydin, pump ama overflow. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXawaaraha waxay isticmaalaan isle&#039;egta Manning oo leh n isku mid qoto-dheer kasta. Hay&#039;ado qaar waxay ka dhigaan n inuu isbedelo qoto-dheerka, taas oo keenta xawaare yar oo xoogaa ah tuubo buuxda 60 ilaa 70 boqolkiiba (qiyaastii 3 boqolkiiba ka yar).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Socodka naqshadda biyo-qashinka wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa shabakada tuubooyinka marka Type tahay Sanitary. Marka waxba la dooran, panelka midig wuxuu markaas muujinayaa Socodka naqshadda biyo-qashinka, halka shabakada duufaanka ay muujinto socodka duufaanka. Gali waxa soo gala Dooro manhole. Hoosta Socodka naqshadda biyo-qashinka, qor People entering here iyo Area entering here (hectare mashruuc metric ah, acre mashruuc feet ah). Dukaamada, xafiisyada ama warshadaha, qor dadka u dhigma: aagga oo lagu dhufto dadka halkii hectare (ama acre) oo ay hay'addaadu isticmaasho. Aagga wuxuu u tirsan yahay biyaha dhulka galaya labadaba. Ku celi god kasta oo waddo ama lot ku xirma. God aan waxba ku xirnayn waxaa lagu hayaa labadaba 0. Tuub kasta waxay qaadaa wax kasta oo ku soo galaya manhole-kiisa sare iyo waxa ka sarreeya. Dooro manhole si aad u aragto waxa ka gudba. Dejinta Dejinta Macnaheeda Flow per person socodka celceliska ee hal qof maalin kasta: litir (mashruuc metric) ama US gallon (mashruuc feet) Infiltration biyaha dhulka ka soo galaya: litir ilbiriqsi hectare kasta, ama gallon maalin acre kasta Peaking factor Harmon, 1 + 14 / (4 + √P), ama Babbitt, 5 / P^0.2, iyadoo P ay tahay dadka oo kun-kun ah Peaking factor at least / Peaking factor at most factor-ka waa la hayaa labadan dhexdooda Manning n awoodda iyo xawaaraha Least velocity / Most velocity qoto-dheer tuubada ee socodka ugu sarreeya Most of full capacity sida tuubadu u buuxi karto socodka ugu sarreeya, boqolkiiba awoodda ay qaadi karto markii buuxda socoto Qiimaha bilowga ah waa meel-hayn, ma aha heer. Isticmaal qiimaha hay'addaadu daabacdo. Waxa ay xisaabiso Tuub kasta, marka loo raaco socodka: socodka ugu sarreeya = dad × socodka hal qof × factor-ka kororka + aag × biyaha dhulka galaya awoodda marka buuxda socoto (isle'egta Manning ee gradient-ka tuubada), iyo sida uu socodka ugu sarreeya u buuxiyo qoto-dheer caadi ee socodka ugu sarreeya iyo xawaaraha meeshaas Miiska Natiijooyinka biyo-qashinka wuxuu liistaa dadka tuub kasta, factor-ka kororka, socodka ugu sarreeya (L/s, ama gpm iyo cubic feet per second), boqolkiiba buuxda iyo xawaaraha. Dhibaatooyinka waxaa hoosta lagu liistaa: tuub ka buuxsan xadka, ka gaabsan xawaaraha ugu yar (waxay laga yaabaa inaysan isnadiifin), ka dhakhso badan xawaaraha ugu badan, ama aan hoos-u-dhac lahayn. Size the pipes for these flows wuxuu tuub kasta u dooraa cabbirka caadiga ah ee ugu yar (200 mm ama 8 inches iyo ka weyn) oo qaada socodka ugu sarreeya xadka gudihiisa; hal Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqda. Tani waa socodka joogtada ah ee ugu sarreeya ee xisaabiya xaashida naqshadda, la hubiyay xaashi naqshadeed la daabacay ilaa xagga la daabacay. Ma aha moodel shabakada waqtiga: ma jiro hydrograph, kaydin, pump ama overflow. Eeg Wali lama dhisin. Xawaaraha waxay isticmaalaan isle'egta Manning oo leh n isku mid qoto-dheer kasta. Hay'ado qaar waxay ka dhigaan n inuu isbedelo qoto-dheerka, taas oo keenta xawaare yar oo xoogaa ah tuubo buuxda 60 ilaa 70 boqolkiiba (qiyaastii 3 boqolkiiba ka yar).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"water-mains","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Biyo-mareenada: cadaadisyo, socodyo iyo socodka dabka","summary":"Ku sawir shabakad cadaadis oo ah isku-xirka, tangiyada, tuubooyinka, bamba iyo faalfaha hoos u dhigga cadaadiska ee sawirka; CivilCraft wuxuu xisaabinayaa madaxa, cadaadisyada iyo socodyada (Hazen–Williams, shabakado wareegan), socodka la heli karo dab, iyo maalin baahi. Shaqo shaybaar ah; natiijo kasta waxay u baahan tahay hubin injineer.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["biyo","biyo-mareen","shabakadda biyaha","shabakad cadaadis","tuubo cadaadis","shabakad wareegan","hazen-williams","c factor","head loss","cadaadis hadhay","socodka dabka","hidrant","baahi","isku-xir","tanki","bamb","qaabka bambka","faalfo hoos u dhige cadaadiska","prv","faalfo hoos u dhac","muddada kala duwan","epanet","inp","xawaare"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-shabakada","text":"Sawir shabakada","level":2},{"id":"waxa-mid-kasta-macneeyo","text":"Waxa mid kasta macneeyo","level":2},{"id":"akhri-natiijooyinka","text":"Akhri natiijooyinka","level":2},{"id":"socodka-dabka","text":"Socodka dabka","level":2},{"id":"maalin-baahi","text":"Maalin baahi","level":2},{"id":"qoraalka-epanet","text":"Qoraalka EPANET","level":2},{"id":"hidrantyada-faalfaha-iyo-qalabka","text":"Hidrantyada, faalfaha iyo qalabka","level":2},{"id":"sawirka-iyo-faylasha","text":"Sawirka iyo faylasha","level":2},{"id":"waxa-weli-ku-jira","text":"Waxa weli ku jira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBiyo-mareenadu waa dhinaca cadaadiska ee goobta: tuubooyin mar walba buuxsamay, oo biyaha lagu riixayo kaydka, tanki ama bamb. CivilCraft wuxuu xisaabinayaa madaxa iyo cadaadiska isku-xirka kasta, iyo socodka tuubo kasta, oo ay ku jiraan shabakadaha wareegan halkaas oo biyuhu ku leeyihiin wadooyin ka badan. Waxay ku jirtaa shaybaarka inta la hubinayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECaawinta xisaabta keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E Tiro kasta waxay u baahan tahay hubin injineer aqoon leh: jawaabtu waxay ku xidhan tahay baahiyada, sare-joogyada, cabbirrada tuubooyinka iyo qiimayaasha xoogga aad siisay. Moodelka xaaladda joogtada ah ma garanayo water hammer, tayada biyaha, ama habka dhabta ah ee bamba dabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-shabakada\"\u003ESawir shabakada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo-mareenada…\u003C/span\u003E. Daaqaddu way furan tahay intaad ku shaqaynayso sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydka\u003C/span\u003E oo guji sawirka meesha ay ku taal bixinta. Madaxa wuxuu bilaabmaa 100 ft (30 m) ka sarreeya dhulka; ka beddel Properties.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku xirka\u003C/span\u003E oo guji meel kasta oo biyo la qaado ama tuubooyin isku kulmaan. Isku-xirka sare-joogiisa wuxuu ka qaadaa dhulka; ku qor mid kale Properties si aad u dhaafto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubo\u003C/span\u003E, guji nood, kadibna nood kale oo ay ku xirmayso. Qalabku wuu sii jiraa tuubada xigta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBamb\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaalfo hoos u dhige cadaadiska\u003C/span\u003E waxaa lagu sawiraa isla siyaabo, laga bilaabo nood-ka soo-shubka (ama dhinaca hore) ilaa nood-ka gudbinta (ama dhinaca dambe). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETanki\u003C/span\u003E waxaa loo dhigaa sida isku-xirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro isku-xirka oo qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBaahi\u003C/span\u003E (gpm, ama L/s mashruuc mitir ah). Dooro tuubada oo deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhexroor\u003C/span\u003E (in, ama mm) iyo, haddii aad ogtahay, Hazen–Williams C.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo soo celin karo. Tirtir wuxuu tirtiraa nood-ka iyo tuubooyinka ku dhammaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-mid-kasta-macneeyo\"\u003EWaxa mid kasta macneeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETuubo.\u003C/strong\u003E Dherer waxaa lagu cabbiraa sawirka dhexdiisa marka aanad qorin. C waa xoogga Hazen–Williams (130 si uu u bilaabmo; beddel default-ka daaqadda). Dhaawaca K ee isku-dhaca wuxuu ku daraa khasaaraha qalabka iyo xadhkaha. Calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck valve\u003C/strong\u003E tuubo aan biyaha dib u qaadi karin; tuubo \u003Cstrong\u003EClosed\u003C/strong\u003E waxba ma qaadi karto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydka.\u003C/strong\u003E Il madax go&#039;an, heerka biyaha uu haysto ee ka sarreeya datum. Wax kasta oo shabakadu u baahan tahay ayuu bixiyaa ama qaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETanki.\u003C/strong\u003E Heer maalinta oo dhan isbeddelaya. Natiijooyinka joogtada ah waa il heerkiisa hadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBamb.\u003C/strong\u003E Hal qodob naqshadeyn (socod iyo madax) ayaa qaab caadi ah oo curve ku dhex maraa: madaxa socodka eber wuxuu yahay 133 % madaxa naqshadeynta, madaxuna waa eber socodka naqshadeynta ka labo jeer. Bambku weligiis biyaha dib uma riixo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaalfo hoos u dhige cadaadiska.\u003C/strong\u003E Wuxuu hayaa cadaadiska aad dejisay dhinaca hoose intii soo-shubku sarreeyo. Markii soo-shubku hooseeyo wuu furan yahay, wax ma hayo; haddii biyuhu dib u socdaan, wuu xirmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-natiijooyinka\"\u003EAkhri natiijooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqaddu waxay muujinaysaa madax iyo cadaadis nood kasta, iyo socod, xawaare iyo khasaaraha madaxa 1,000 ft kasta (ama km kasta) jeex kasta, iyo isku-xirka oo midabaysan sawirka: cagaarku waa inta u dhexeysa cadaadiskaaga ugu hooseeya iyo ugu sarreeya, casaanku waa ka hooseeya, buniguna waa ka sarreeya. Fallaadhaha socodku waxay muujiyaan jihada. Dooro nood ama tuubo si aad lambarradooda u akhrido Properties.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta miisaska waxaa ah liis waxyaabaha la eego: cadaadis hoose ama sare, tuubo ka dhakhsaysa xaddigaaga, isku-xir ka go&#039;ay dhammaan ilaha, ama xal aan dhicin. Isla natiijooyinkaas waxay ku jiraan panel-ka Dhibaatooyinka. Xuduudaha dejiso daaqadda (20 psi, 100 psi iyo 10 ft/s bilaabmaha; 140 kPa, 700 kPa iyo 3 m/s mashruuc mitir ah).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socodka-dabka\"\u003ESocodka dabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocodka dab damin…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa socod isku-xir hal ah wuxuuna muujinayaa cadaadiska halkaas iyo cadaadiska ugu hooseeya meel kasta shabakadda. Wuxuu sidoo kale helaa socodka isku-xirkaas ee la heli karo intii nood-ka ugu daciifsan ee shabakadda uu hayo cadaadiska hadhay ee aad siisay. Baahiyada kale way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maalin-baahi\"\u003EMaalin baahi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaalin baahi…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu shaqeeyaa shabakadda saac kasta. Qaabka baahida ku qor settings-ka faylka (liis xisaabeed oo soo noqnoqda); tankiyadu way buuxsamaan oo madhaan socodka soo galaya iyo ka baxaya, bambkuna wuxuu raaci karaa qaab on/off. Tanki gaadha heerkiisa ugu sarreeya ama ugu hooseeya waxaa lagu magacaabaa liiska: CivilCraft ma xirayo galkiisa ama baxiisa adiga ku ordan, sidaas awgeed ka akhri &quot;tankigan wuu yaryahay ama bambku wuu weyn yahay&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoraalka-epanet\"\u003EQoraalka EPANET\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida qoraal EPANET (.inp)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa shabakadda qaabka qoraalka fudud ee barnaamijyo badan oo biyaha ah akhrin karaan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qoraal EPANET (.inp)…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa mid. Kaliya waxa CivilCraft moodelayo ayaa u gudba: isku-xirka, kaydka, tankiyada, tuubooyinka, bamba oo leh qaab madax, faalfaha hoos u dhigga cadaadiska, qaababka baahida iyo waqtiyada. Noocyada kale ee faalfaha, bamba oo lagu bixiyo awood, iyo qaababka khasaarah kale waa la magacaabaa, waana la dhaafaa. Faylku waa inuu isticmaalaa isla unugyada mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hidrantyada-faalfaha-iyo-qalabka\"\u003EHidrantyada, faalfaha iyo qalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro isku-xirka oo calaamee \u003Cstrong\u003EHydrant\u003C/strong\u003E si aad hal ku dhigto; dooro tuubo oo riix \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd at the middle\u003C/strong\u003E si aad faalfo, faalfo hawo, blow-off ama meter ugu dhigto. Waa shay shabakadda ah: waxay raacaan iyada, hal tallaabo oo dib loo soo celin karo ayaa ka saaraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabku wuxuu sidoo kale ku jiraa qaabka: CivilCraft wuxuu liisteeyaa iyaga adigoon codsan: \u003Cstrong\u003Etee\u003C/strong\u003E halkii saddex tuubo ay isku kulmaan, \u003Cstrong\u003Ecross\u003C/strong\u003E halkii afar, \u003Cstrong\u003Ebend\u003C/strong\u003E (leh xagasha) halkii laba tuubo ay ku wareegaan 5° ama ka badan, \u003Cstrong\u003Ereducer\u003C/strong\u003E halkii laba cabbir ay isku kulmaan, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ecap\u003C/strong\u003E dhamaadka xidhan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJadwalka qalabka (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa iyaga iyo tuubooyinka cabbirkooda. Tani waa waxa naqshaddu soo jeedinayso, qiyaas aad ku hubin karto faahfaahintaada, ma aha liis aad ku dalbato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuubooyinka waxaa lagu dhigaa dhulka oo ka yar dabool (4 ft ama 1.2 m) si loo sawiro oo loo moodeelo 3D; cadaadisyada kor ku xusan weligood ma ku xirna.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirka-iyo-faylasha\"\u003ESawirka iyo faylasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirka, PDF-ka iyo DWG ama DXF waxay qaadaan tuubooyinka layer-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EC-WATR-MAIN\u003C/strong\u003E oo cabbirradooda ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EC-WATR-TEXT\u003C/strong\u003E, hidrantyada \u003Cstrong\u003EC-WATR-HYDR\u003C/strong\u003E, faalfaha \u003Cstrong\u003EC-WATR-VALV\u003C/strong\u003E iyo qalabka \u003Cstrong\u003EC-WATR-FITT\u003C/strong\u003E. LandXML out wuxuu qoraa shabakad tuubo biyo (qaab nood kasta, tuubo tuubo kasta, hidrantyada oo magac leh); LandXML in wuxuu mar kale akhriyaa sida biyo-mareen, oo aan lahayn baahi, bamb ama faalfo, kuwaas oo LandXML aanu qaadin. Dhoofinta IFC wuxuu qoraa tuubooyinka sida qeybo tuubo, hidrantyo, faalfo iyo qalab hal nidaam biyo ah. Faylashan waxaa lagu hubiyay akhristayaashayada iyo qorayaashayada; isticmaal barnaamijyadaada kale oo na sheeg waxay sheegaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-weli-ku-jira\"\u003EWaxa weli ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETayada biyaha iyo da&#039;doodu, xakamaynta iyo xeerarka ka baxsan qaabka on/off ee bambka, noocyada kale ee faalfaha, baahida ku salaysan cadaadiska, tuubooyin dhexroorkoodu isbeddelo, iyo socodka wasakhda waqtiga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E. Socodyada naqshadeynta sanitary-ka, oo xisaab kale ah, waxaa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sanitary-design\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sanitary-design\"\u003ESocodyada naqshadeynta sanitary-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Biyo-mareenadu waa dhinaca cadaadiska ee goobta: tuubooyin mar walba buuxsamay, oo biyaha lagu riixayo kaydka, tanki ama bamb. CivilCraft wuxuu xisaabinayaa madaxa iyo cadaadiska isku-xirka kasta, iyo socodka tuubo kasta, oo ay ku jiraan shabakadaha wareegan halkaas oo biyuhu ku leeyihiin wadooyin ka badan. Waxay ku jirtaa shaybaarka inta la hubinayo. Caawinta xisaabta keliya. Tiro kasta waxay u baahan tahay hubin injineer aqoon leh: jawaabtu waxay ku xidhan tahay baahiyada, sare-joogyada, cabbirrada tuubooyinka iyo qiimayaasha xoogga aad siisay. Moodelka xaaladda joogtada ah ma garanayo water hammer, tayada biyaha, ama habka dhabta ah ee bamba dabka. Sawir shabakada Hoosta Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah, dooro Biyo-mareenada…. Daaqaddu way furan tahay intaad ku shaqaynayso sawirka. Dooro Kaydka oo guji sawirka meesha ay ku taal bixinta. Madaxa wuxuu bilaabmaa 100 ft (30 m) ka sarreeya dhulka; ka beddel Properties. Dooro Isku xirka oo guji meel kasta oo biyo la qaado ama tuubooyin isku kulmaan. Isku-xirka sare-joogiisa wuxuu ka qaadaa dhulka; ku qor mid kale Properties si aad u dhaafto. Dooro Tuubo, guji nood, kadibna nood kale oo ay ku xirmayso. Qalabku wuu sii jiraa tuubada xigta. Bamb iyo Faalfo hoos u dhige cadaadiska waxaa lagu sawiraa isla siyaabo, laga bilaabo nood-ka soo-shubka (ama dhinaca hore) ilaa nood-ka gudbinta (ama dhinaca dambe). Tanki waxaa loo dhigaa sida isku-xirka. Dooro isku-xirka oo qor Baahi (gpm, ama L/s mashruuc mitir ah). Dooro tuubada oo deji Dhexroor (in, ama mm) iyo, haddii aad ogtahay, Hazen–Williams C. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo soo celin karo. Tirtir wuxuu tirtiraa nood-ka iyo tuubooyinka ku dhammaada. Waxa mid kasta macneeyo Tuubo. Dherer waxaa lagu cabbiraa sawirka dhexdiisa marka aanad qorin. C waa xoogga Hazen–Williams (130 si uu u bilaabmo; beddel default-ka daaqadda). Dhaawaca K ee isku-dhaca wuxuu ku daraa khasaaraha qalabka iyo xadhkaha. Calaamadee Check valve tuubo aan biyaha dib u qaadi karin; tuubo Closed waxba ma qaadi karto. Kaydka. Il madax go'an, heerka biyaha uu haysto ee ka sarreeya datum. Wax kasta oo shabakadu u baahan tahay ayuu bixiyaa ama qaadaa. Tanki. Heer maalinta oo dhan isbeddelaya. Natiijooyinka joogtada ah waa il heerkiisa hadda. Bamb. Hal qodob naqshadeyn (socod iyo madax) ayaa qaab caadi ah oo curve ku dhex maraa: madaxa socodka eber wuxuu yahay 133 % madaxa naqshadeynta, madaxuna waa eber socodka naqshadeynta ka labo jeer. Bambku weligiis biyaha dib uma riixo. Faalfo hoos u dhige cadaadiska. Wuxuu hayaa cadaadiska aad dejisay dhinaca hoose intii soo-shubku sarreeyo. Markii soo-shubku hooseeyo wuu furan yahay, wax ma hayo; haddii biyuhu dib u socdaan, wuu xirmaa. Akhri natiijooyinka Daaqaddu waxay muujinaysaa madax iyo cadaadis nood kasta, iyo socod, xawaare iyo khasaaraha madaxa 1,000 ft kasta (ama km kasta) jeex kasta, iyo isku-xirka oo midabaysan sawirka: cagaarku waa inta u dhexeysa cadaadiskaaga ugu hooseeya iyo ugu sarreeya, casaanku waa ka hooseeya, buniguna waa ka sarreeya. Fallaadhaha socodku waxay muujiyaan jihada. Dooro nood ama tuubo si aad lambarradooda u akhrido Properties. Hoosta miisaska waxaa ah liis waxyaabaha la eego: cadaadis hoose ama sare, tuubo ka dhakhsaysa xaddigaaga, isku-xir ka go'ay dhammaan ilaha, ama xal aan dhicin. Isla natiijooyinkaas waxay ku jiraan panel-ka Dhibaatooyinka. Xuduudaha dejiso daaqadda (20 psi, 100 psi iyo 10 ft/s bilaabmaha; 140 kPa, 700 kPa iyo 3 m/s mashruuc mitir ah). Socodka dabka Socodka dab damin… wuxuu sawiraa socod isku-xir hal ah wuxuuna muujinayaa cadaadiska halkaas iyo cadaadiska ugu hooseeya meel kasta shabakadda. Wuxuu sidoo kale helaa socodka isku-xirkaas ee la heli karo intii nood-ka ugu daciifsan ee shabakadda uu hayo cadaadiska hadhay ee aad siisay. Baahiyada kale way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen. Maalin baahi Maalin baahi… wuxuu shaqeeyaa shabakadda saac kasta. Qaabka baahida ku qor settings-ka faylka (liis xisaabeed oo soo noqnoqda); tankiyadu way buuxsamaan oo madhaan socodka soo galaya iyo ka baxaya, bambkuna wuxuu raaci karaa qaab on/off. Tanki gaadha heerkiisa ugu sarreeya ama ugu hooseeya waxaa lagu magacaabaa liiska: CivilCraft ma xirayo galkiisa ama baxiisa adiga ku ordan, sidaas awgeed ka akhri \"tankigan wuu yaryahay ama bambku wuu weyn yahay\". Qoraalka EPANET Kaydi sida qoraal EPANET (.inp) wuxuu qoraa shabakadda qaabka qoraalka fudud ee barnaamijyo badan oo biyaha ah akhrin karaan, Fur qoraal EPANET (.inp)… wuxuu akhriyaa mid. Kaliya waxa CivilCraft moodelayo ayaa u gudba: isku-xirka, kaydka, tankiyada, tuubooyinka, bamba oo leh qaab madax, faalfaha hoos u dhigga cadaadiska, qaababka baahida iyo waqtiyada. Noocyada kale ee faalfaha, bamba oo lagu bixiyo awood, iyo qaababka khasaarah kale waa la magacaabaa, waana la dhaafaa. Faylku waa inuu isticmaalaa isla unugyada mashruuca. Hidrantyada, faalfaha iyo qalabka Dooro isku-xirka oo calaamee Hydrant si aad hal ku dhigto; dooro tuubo oo riix Add at the middle si aad faalfo, faalfo hawo, blow-off ama meter ugu dhigto. Waa shay shabakadda ah: waxay raacaan iyada, hal tallaabo oo dib loo soo celin karo ayaa ka saaraa. Qalabku wuxuu sidoo kale ku jiraa qaabka: CivilCraft wuxuu liisteeyaa iyaga adigoon codsan: tee halkii saddex tuubo ay isku kulmaan, cross halkii afar, bend (leh xagasha) halkii laba tuubo ay ku wareegaan 5° ama ka badan, reducer halkii laba cabbir ay isku kulmaan, iyo cap dhamaadka xidhan. Jadwalka qalabka (CSV) wuxuu tiriyaa iyaga iyo tuubooyinka cabbirkooda. Tani waa waxa naqshaddu soo jeedinayso, qiyaas aad ku hubin karto faahfaahintaada, ma aha liis aad ku dalbato. Tuubooyinka waxaa lagu dhigaa dhulka oo ka yar dabool (4 ft ama 1.2 m) si loo sawiro oo loo moodeelo 3D; cadaadisyada kor ku xusan weligood ma ku xirna. Sawirka iyo faylasha Sawirka, PDF-ka iyo DWG ama DXF waxay qaadaan tuubooyinka layer-ka C-WATR-MAIN oo cabbirradooda ku jira C-WATR-TEXT, hidrantyada C-WATR-HYDR, faalfaha C-WATR-VALV iyo qalabka C-WATR-FITT. LandXML out wuxuu qoraa shabakad tuubo biyo (qaab nood kasta, tuubo tuubo kasta, hidrantyada oo magac leh); LandXML in wuxuu mar kale akhriyaa sida biyo-mareen, oo aan lahayn baahi, bamb ama faalfo, kuwaas oo LandXML aanu qaadin. Dhoofinta IFC wuxuu qoraa tuubooyinka sida qeybo tuubo, hidrantyo, faalfo iyo qalab hal nidaam biyo ah. Faylashan waxaa lagu hubiyay akhristayaashayada iyo qorayaashayada; isticmaal barnaamijyadaada kale oo na sheeg waxay sheegaan. Waxa weli ku jira Tayada biyaha iyo da'doodu, xakamaynta iyo xeerarka ka baxsan qaabka on/off ee bambka, noocyada kale ee faalfaha, baahida ku salaysan cadaadiska, tuubooyin dhexroorkoodu isbeddelo, iyo socodka wasakhda waqtiga. Eeg Weli lama dhisin. Socodyada naqshadeynta sanitary-ka, oo xisaab kale ah, waxaa ku jira Socodyada naqshadeynta sanitary-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"parcels","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Sawir barcelyada oo qor sharaxaadahooda sharciga","summary":"Barcel sawir adigoo ku bilaabaya geesaha ama geli wicitaanada waraaqda hantida ama plat-ka, hubi sida wicitaanku u xirmayo, calaamee bearing-ka iyo masaafooyinka sawirka, ka dhig qallooy kasta qallooy, oo koobiyee sharciga qoraal ah.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["barcelyo","lot-yo","khadadka hantida","xuduud","waraaq","plat","metes and bounds","bearing","masaafo","xirmid","misclosure","saxnaan","sharaxaadda sharciga","bilowga barcelka","qallooy","radius","aagga","acre"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-barcel","text":"Sawir barcel","level":2},{"id":"geli-wicitaanada-waraaqda","text":"Geli wicitaanada waraaqda","level":2},{"id":"qallooyada","text":"Qallooyada","level":2},{"id":"sharaxaadda-sharciga","text":"Sharaxaadda sharciga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBarcelyadu waxay saaran yihiin sawirka iyo bearing-ka iyo masaafada qallooy kasta oo toosan (qallooyga wuxuu muujinayaa radiyaskiisa, dhererkiisa iyo xagalkiisa dhexe), iyo magacooda iyo aagga dhexdooda. Waxay galaan PDF-ka daabacan iyo dhoofinta DWG iyo DXF, lakabyada \u003Ccode\u003EV-PROP\u003C/code\u003E (khadadka) iyo \u003Ccode\u003EV-PROP-TEXT\u003C/code\u003E (calaamadaha). Dhammaan waxay ku jiraan \u003Cstrong\u003EBarcelyada\u003C/strong\u003E garoonka midig marka wax aan la dooran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-barcel\"\u003ESawir barcel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003ESawir barcel\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geeskada, idinka oo ka bilaaba barta bilowga. Guji u dhow barta sahanka wuxuu qaadaa meeshii saxda ahayd ee bartaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDib u guji geeska koowaad, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, si aad u dhamaysid. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa geeska ugu dambeeya; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa geeskii hadda la sameeyay; mar kale riix si aad qalabka uga baxdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geli-wicitaanada-waraaqda\"\u003EGeli wicitaanada waraaqda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003EGeli wicitaanada waraaqda\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESheeg meesha wicitaanadu ka bilaabanayaan: lambarka barta sahanka, ama northing iyo easting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor ama ku dhaji wicitaanada, mid kasta saf kasta:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Exariiq: bearing iyo masaafo, sida \u003Ccode\u003EN 45°30&#039;15&quot; E 125.50\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003EN45-30-15E\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EN 45 30 15 E\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EN 45.5 E\u003C/code\u003E iyo azimuths (\u003Ccode\u003EAZ 45°30&#039;15&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) way shaqeeyaan, &quot;thence&quot;, commas-ka iyo &quot;feet&quot; waa la iska indha tiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqallooy: \u003Ccode\u003EC R 300 L 52.36 right\u003C/code\u003E (radius iyo dherer qallooy), ama \u003Ccode\u003EC R 300 D 10°00&#039;00&quot; left\u003C/code\u003E (radius iyo xagal dhexe). Qallooyga wuxuu raacaa xariiqa ka horeeya; haddii aanu raacin, ku dar bearing-kiisa chord-ka: \u003Ccode\u003EC R 300 L 52.36 right CB N 50 00 00 E\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu bilaabaa saf faallo ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkaad qorayso, wada-hadalka wuxuu muujinayaa dherer wicitaanada, \u003Cstrong\u003Emisclosure\u003C/strong\u003E (sida ay uga fogaadaan bilowgii iyo jihadooda), \u003Cstrong\u003Eprecision\u003C/strong\u003E (dherer u qaybsan misclosure, 1 : 10,000 iwm.) iyo aagga. Safafka uusan akhrin karin waa la liistaa lambarada safafkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar barcelka\u003C/strong\u003E. Marka wicitaanadu aanay xirmin, barcelku wuxuu xirmaa xariiq toosan oo ku dhex maran furaha: hubi wicitaanada waraaqda. Si aad u kala qaybiso khaladka socodka beerta ee qaybaha, marka hore hagaaji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qallooyada\"\u003EQallooyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHantida barcelka, qallooy kasta wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003ERadius\u003C/strong\u003E. Qor mid si qallooy uga dhigto xariiqa oo isku geesood ah (radius ka yar nus masaafada geeskiiba ma gaadhi karo, sidaas darteed waa la diidaa), oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ERight\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ELeft\u003C/strong\u003E gudaha \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E: qallooy midig wuxuu leeyahay dhexdiisa midig jihada socodka, sida waraaqda. Ka saar radiyaska si uu u noqdo toosan mar kale. Isbedel kasta waa talaabo keliya: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa ka noqotaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sharaxaadda-sharciga\"\u003ESharaxaadda sharciga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHantida barcelka waxaa ku dhamaata sharaxaadda sharciga oo laga qoray sawirka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Laga bilaabo&quot; \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E aad qortay (tusaale ahaan &quot;geeska woqooyi-bari ee Lot 4&quot;), haddii kale northing-ka iyo easting-ka geeska koowaad, ama barta sahanka ee wicitaanadu ka bilaabmeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;thence&quot; qallooy kasta: bearing iyo masaafo, ama qallooy oo leh radiyaskiisa, dherer qallooyga, xagal dhexe, iyo bearing-ka chord-ka iyo masaafadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Oo ballaaran&quot; aagga ee laba-jibbaaran (square feet) iyo acres (square meters iyo hectares mashruuc meter ah).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhigaa clipboard-ka; \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dejiso qoraal\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.txt\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESharaxaadda sharciga waa qabyo ka timid sawirka, ma aha sahan. Surveyor la ansixiyay waa inuu ku hubiyo diiwaanka oo saxeexo kahor intaysan qof isku halleyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji gudaha barcel ku jira sawirka si aad u dooratid; \u003Cstrong\u003EDelete\u003C/strong\u003E key-ga wuu tirtiraa. Barcelyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Barcelyadu waxay saaran yihiin sawirka iyo bearing-ka iyo masaafada qallooy kasta oo toosan (qallooyga wuxuu muujinayaa radiyaskiisa, dhererkiisa iyo xagalkiisa dhexe), iyo magacooda iyo aagga dhexdooda. Waxay galaan PDF-ka daabacan iyo dhoofinta DWG iyo DXF, lakabyada V-PROP (khadadka) iyo V-PROP-TEXT (calaamadaha). Dhammaan waxay ku jiraan Barcelyada garoonka midig marka wax aan la dooran. Sawir barcel Guji Sawir barcel. Guji geeskada, idinka oo ka bilaaba barta bilowga. Guji u dhow barta sahanka wuxuu qaadaa meeshii saxda ahayd ee bartaas. Dib u guji geeska koowaad, ama riix Enter, si aad u dhamaysid. Backspace wuxuu soo celinayaa geeska ugu dambeeya; Esc wuxuu tirtiraa geeskii hadda la sameeyay; mar kale riix si aad qalabka uga baxdo. Geli wicitaanada waraaqda Guji Geli wicitaanada waraaqda. Sheeg meesha wicitaanadu ka bilaabanayaan: lambarka barta sahanka, ama northing iyo easting. Qor ama ku dhaji wicitaanada, mid kasta saf kasta: xariiq: bearing iyo masaafo, sida N 45°30'15\" E 125.50. N45-30-15E, N 45 30 15 E, N 45.5 E iyo azimuths (AZ 45°30'15\") way shaqeeyaan, \"thence\", commas-ka iyo \"feet\" waa la iska indha tiraa. qallooy: C R 300 L 52.36 right (radius iyo dherer qallooy), ama C R 300 D 10°00'00\" left (radius iyo xagal dhexe). Qallooyga wuxuu raacaa xariiqa ka horeeya; haddii aanu raacin, ku dar bearing-kiisa chord-ka: C R 300 L 52.36 right CB N 50 00 00 E. # wuxuu bilaabaa saf faallo ah. Markaad qorayso, wada-hadalka wuxuu muujinayaa dherer wicitaanada, misclosure (sida ay uga fogaadaan bilowgii iyo jihadooda), precision (dherer u qaybsan misclosure, 1 : 10,000 iwm.) iyo aagga. Safafka uusan akhrin karin waa la liistaa lambarada safafkooda. Ku dar barcelka. Marka wicitaanadu aanay xirmin, barcelku wuxuu xirmaa xariiq toosan oo ku dhex maran furaha: hubi wicitaanada waraaqda. Si aad u kala qaybiso khaladka socodka beerta ee qaybaha, marka hore hagaaji. Qallooyada Hantida barcelka, qallooy kasta wuxuu leeyahay Radius. Qor mid si qallooy uga dhigto xariiqa oo isku geesood ah (radius ka yar nus masaafada geeskiiba ma gaadhi karo, sidaas darteed waa la diidaa), oo dooro Right ama Left gudaha Curves: qallooy midig wuxuu leeyahay dhexdiisa midig jihada socodka, sida waraaqda. Ka saar radiyaska si uu u noqdo toosan mar kale. Isbedel kasta waa talaabo keliya: Ctrl+Z waa ka noqotaa. Sharaxaadda sharciga Hantida barcelka waxaa ku dhamaata sharaxaadda sharciga oo laga qoray sawirka: \"Laga bilaabo\" Barta bilowga aad qortay (tusaale ahaan \"geeska woqooyi-bari ee Lot 4\"), haddii kale northing-ka iyo easting-ka geeska koowaad, ama barta sahanka ee wicitaanadu ka bilaabmeen. \"thence\" qallooy kasta: bearing iyo masaafo, ama qallooy oo leh radiyaskiisa, dherer qallooyga, xagal dhexe, iyo bearing-ka chord-ka iyo masaafadiisa. \"Oo ballaaran\" aagga ee laba-jibbaaran (square feet) iyo acres (square meters iyo hectares mashruuc meter ah). Koobiyee wuxuu dhigaa clipboard-ka; Soo dejiso qoraal wuxuu kaydiyaa fayl .txt. Sharaxaadda sharciga waa qabyo ka timid sawirka, ma aha sahan. Surveyor la ansixiyay waa inuu ku hubiyo diiwaanka oo saxeexo kahor intaysan qof isku halleyn. Guji gudaha barcel ku jira sawirka si aad u dooratid; Delete key-ga wuu tirtiraa. Barcelyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"traverse","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Geli jeex oo hagaaji iyada oo loo marayo xeerka compass","summary":"Ku qor xagasha ama jihada iyo masaafooyinka, hubi xidhitaanka xagasha iyo tooska iyo saxnaanta, hagaaji xeerka compass, oo ku dar istaysinnada sidii barooyin sahan dhulka ama wareegga sidii barsel.","section":"tasks","order":96,"keywords":["jeex","jeex xidhan","wareeg","xagasha midig","aragti dambe","jihooyin","masaafooyin","xidhitaan","ka-xidhnaan","saxnaan","xeerka compass","bowditch","hagaynta","sahan dhul"],"headings":[{"id":"meesha-ay-ka-bilaabanto-iyo-ay-ku-dhammaanto","text":"Meesha ay ka bilaabanto iyo ay ku dhammaanto","level":2},{"id":"ku-qor-jeexyada","text":"Ku qor jeexyada","level":2},{"id":"akhri-xidhitaanka","text":"Akhri xidhitaanka","level":2},{"id":"hagaynta","text":"Hagaynta","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-natiijada","text":"Isticmaal natiijada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EJeex waa silsilad jeexyo la cabbiray: barta kasta waxaa jira xagasha (ama jihada) iyo masaafada ilaa barta xigta. Marka wax aan la dooran jirin, guji \u003Cstrong\u003EGeli jeex\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EJeex\u003C/strong\u003E ee panel-ka midig.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-ay-ka-bilaabanto-iyo-ay-ku-dhammaanto\"\u003EMeesha ay ka bilaabanto iyo ay ku dhammaanto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilow barta sahan dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E: lambarkeeda. Ama ku qor waqooyi (northing) iyo bari (easting).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJeexyada oo ah\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EXagasha midig iyo masaafooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EJihooyinka iyo masaafooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXagashaha, sheeg meesha ay ka bilaabmayaan: \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarta sahan dhulka ee aragti dambe\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Easimutkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E (laga bilaabo barta koowaad ee loo jeedo aragtida dambe, saacadda ku wareegta laga bilaabo waqooyi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaadka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003Eku soo noqo bilowga (wareeg)\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarta sahan dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo lambarkeeda (jeex furan oo u dhexeeya barooyin la yaqaan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-qor-jeexyada\"\u003EKu qor jeexyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal jeex hal sadar, kadibna masaafada, kadibna magac istaysinka ay gaadho haddii aad rabto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXagasha midig, oo lagu wareejiyo saacadda ku wareegta barta ay jeexdu ka bilaabanto, laga bilaabo barta gadaasha ilaa barta xigta: \u003Ccode\u003E270°00&#039;10&quot; 125.50 B\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003E270-00-10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E270 00 10\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E270.0028\u003C/code\u003E ayaa sidoo kale shaqeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJihooyinka: \u003Ccode\u003EN 45°30&#039;15&quot; E 125.50 B\u003C/code\u003E, ama asimut oo hal erey ah: \u003Ccode\u003EAZ 45-30-15 125.50 B\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareeg oo xagasho leh, ku dhammayso \u003Ccode\u003Eclose\u003C/code\u003E iyo xagasha bilowga mar kale, oo lagu wareejiyo barta u dambeysa ilaa midda labaad: \u003Ccode\u003Eclose 270°00&#039;05&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Taas ayaa hubisa xagashaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESadaraha aan la akhrin karin waxaa lagu soo bandhigaa lambarada sadarahooda. &quot;feet&quot;, commas iyo sadarada faallada \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E waa fiican yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-xidhitaanka\"\u003EAkhri xidhitaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad qorayso, sanduuqa wada-hadalku wuxuu muujinayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa-xidhnaanta xagasha\u003C/strong\u003E: sida xagashu uga fog yihiin xidhitaan, iyo qaybta xagasha kasta qaadato. Haddii aan xagasho xidhitaan lahayn, xagashaha lama hubinayo, khaladaadka xagashaha waxay ka muuqdaan ka-xidhnaanta tooska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa-xidhnaanta tooska\u003C/strong\u003E: sida jeexdu uga fog tahay meesha ay ku dhammaan lahayd, iyo jihada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaxnaanta\u003C/strong\u003E: dhererka jeexda oo loo qaybiyay ka-xidhnaanta tooska: 1 : 10,000 macnaheedu waa 1 ft in 10,000 ft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIstaysinnada ka dib hagaynta, iyo sida mid kasta uu u dhaqaaqay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hagaynta\"\u003EHagaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hore ka-xidhnaanta xagashaha waxaa si siman loogu kala qaybiyaa xagashaha. Kadibna ka-xidhnaanta tooska waxaa loogu kala qaybiyaa jeexyada xeerka compass (Bowditch): barta kasta waxay ka dhaqaaqdaa ka-xidhnaanta iyada oo loo eegayo dhererka lagu soo maro si ay u gaadho, sidaas darteed jeexdu meesha ay ku dhammaan lahayd ayuu si sax ah ugu dhammaanayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXeerka compass waa hagaynta caadiga ah, ma aha least-squares, mana ka miisaamayo xagashaha iyo masaafooyinka. Saxnaanta inay ku filan tahay waa wax ay go&#039;aamiyaan heerarkaaga iyo waxa dawladdaadu sheegto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-natiijada\"\u003EIsticmaal natiijada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar barooyinka sahan dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E: istaysinnada la hagaaseeyay waxay noqdaan barooyin sahan dhulka magacyadii aad bixisay (haddii kale lambarada xiga ee bilaa), sharaxaad \u003Ccode\u003ETRAV\u003C/code\u003E, aan lahayn sare-joog. Barta u dambeysa ee wareeg waa bilowgeeda, sidaas awgeed lama ku dari laba jeer. Hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar sida barsel\u003C/strong\u003E (wareegyada): istaysinnada la hagaaseeyay waxay noqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/parcels\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/parcels\"\u003Ebarsel\u003C/a\u003E, oo leh calaamadihiisa iyo sharaxaadda sharciga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWarbixin (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E: sadarada xidhitaanka, kadibna jihada, masaafada, koorodinadyada aan la hagaynin iyo kuwa la hagaaseeyay, iyo wax-ka-beddelka mid kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Jeex waa silsilad jeexyo la cabbiray: barta kasta waxaa jira xagasha (ama jihada) iyo masaafada ilaa barta xigta. Marka wax aan la dooran jirin, guji Geli jeex hoosta Jeex ee panel-ka midig. Meesha ay ka bilaabanto iyo ay ku dhammaanto Bilow barta sahan dhulka: lambarkeeda. Ama ku qor waqooyi (northing) iyo bari (easting). Jeexyada oo ah: Xagasha midig iyo masaafooyinka, ama Jihooyinka iyo masaafooyinka. Xagashaha, sheeg meesha ay ka bilaabmayaan: barta sahan dhulka ee aragti dambe, ama asimutkeeda (laga bilaabo barta koowaad ee loo jeedo aragtida dambe, saacadda ku wareegta laga bilaabo waqooyi). Dhammaadka: ku soo noqo bilowga (wareeg), ama barta sahan dhulka iyo lambarkeeda (jeex furan oo u dhexeeya barooyin la yaqaan). Ku qor jeexyada Hal jeex hal sadar, kadibna masaafada, kadibna magac istaysinka ay gaadho haddii aad rabto: Xagasha midig, oo lagu wareejiyo saacadda ku wareegta barta ay jeexdu ka bilaabanto, laga bilaabo barta gadaasha ilaa barta xigta: 270°00'10\" 125.50 B. 270-00-10, 270 00 10 iyo 270.0028 ayaa sidoo kale shaqeeya. Jihooyinka: N 45°30'15\" E 125.50 B, ama asimut oo hal erey ah: AZ 45-30-15 125.50 B. Wareeg oo xagasho leh, ku dhammayso close iyo xagasha bilowga mar kale, oo lagu wareejiyo barta u dambeysa ilaa midda labaad: close 270°00'05\". Taas ayaa hubisa xagashaha. Sadaraha aan la akhrin karin waxaa lagu soo bandhigaa lambarada sadarahooda. \"feet\", commas iyo sadarada faallada # waa fiican yihiin. Akhri xidhitaanka Markaad qorayso, sanduuqa wada-hadalku wuxuu muujinayaa: Ka-xidhnaanta xagasha: sida xagashu uga fog yihiin xidhitaan, iyo qaybta xagasha kasta qaadato. Haddii aan xagasho xidhitaan lahayn, xagashaha lama hubinayo, khaladaadka xagashaha waxay ka muuqdaan ka-xidhnaanta tooska. Ka-xidhnaanta tooska: sida jeexdu uga fog tahay meesha ay ku dhammaan lahayd, iyo jihada. Saxnaanta: dhererka jeexda oo loo qaybiyay ka-xidhnaanta tooska: 1 : 10,000 macnaheedu waa 1 ft in 10,000 ft. Istaysinnada ka dib hagaynta, iyo sida mid kasta uu u dhaqaaqay. Hagaynta Marka hore ka-xidhnaanta xagashaha waxaa si siman loogu kala qaybiyaa xagashaha. Kadibna ka-xidhnaanta tooska waxaa loogu kala qaybiyaa jeexyada xeerka compass (Bowditch): barta kasta waxay ka dhaqaaqdaa ka-xidhnaanta iyada oo loo eegayo dhererka lagu soo maro si ay u gaadho, sidaas darteed jeexdu meesha ay ku dhammaan lahayd ayuu si sax ah ugu dhammaanayaa. Xeerka compass waa hagaynta caadiga ah, ma aha least-squares, mana ka miisaamayo xagashaha iyo masaafooyinka. Saxnaanta inay ku filan tahay waa wax ay go'aamiyaan heerarkaaga iyo waxa dawladdaadu sheegto. Isticmaal natiijada Ku dar barooyinka sahan dhulka: istaysinnada la hagaaseeyay waxay noqdaan barooyin sahan dhulka magacyadii aad bixisay (haddii kale lambarada xiga ee bilaa), sharaxaad TRAV, aan lahayn sare-joog. Barta u dambeysa ee wareeg waa bilowgeeda, sidaas awgeed lama ku dari laba jeer. Hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaysa. Ku dar sida barsel (wareegyada): istaysinnada la hagaaseeyay waxay noqdaan barsel, oo leh calaamadihiisa iyo sharaxaadda sharciga. Warbixin (CSV): sadarada xidhitaanka, kadibna jihada, masaafada, koorodinadyada aan la hagaynin iyo kuwa la hagaaseeyay, iyo wax-ka-beddelka mid kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"building-masses","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Sawir mugyada dhismaha goobta","summary":"Sawir mugga dhismaha qeybta dhulka, ku sii dhowr dabaq iyo dherer dabaq, eeg aagga guud ee dabaqa (gross floor area), dooro sida uu u fadhiyo dhulka jiifka leh, riix oo jiid dherkiisa 3D, oo u dir BimCraft ama ku kaydi fayl IFC ahaan.","section":"tasks","order":96,"keywords":["mass","massing","mugga dhismaha","mug","footprint","dabaq","dherer dabaq","gross floor area","GFA","jiif","podium","goyn iyo buuxin","riix jiid","3D","daraasad goobeed","naqshadeyn hore","IFC","develop","BimCraft","A-MASS"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-mug","text":"Sawir mug","level":2},{"id":"dabaqyada-dherka-iyo-aagga","text":"Dabaqyada, dherka iyo aagga","level":2},{"id":"dhulka-jiifka-leh","text":"Dhulka jiifka leh","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-3d","text":"Muuqaalka 3D","level":2},{"id":"u-dir","text":"U dir","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMugga dhismuhu waa footprint (aagga dhulka ee dhismuhu ku fadhiyo), tiro dabaq iyo dherer dabaq: su&#039;aasha hore &quot;inta dhismo ayaa halkan ku habboon, oolkana maxay ku sameyn doonaa dhulka&quot;. Masses-ku waxay ku sugan yihiin qorshaha magacooda, tirada dabaqyada iyo aagga guud, waxay galaan daabacaadda PDF iyo dhoofinta DWG iyo DXF ee lakabyada \u003Ccode\u003EA-MASS\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EA-MASS-TEXT\u003C/code\u003E, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-mug\"\u003ESawir mug\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E (Sifooyinka), hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EBuilding masses\u003C/strong\u003E (Mugyada dhismaha), guji \u003Cstrong\u003EDraw a mass\u003C/strong\u003E (Sawir mug). (Waxaa kale oo ku jira menu-ga \u003Cstrong\u003EMore\u003C/strong\u003E (Dheeraad) ee qalabka, xaggiisa \u003Cstrong\u003ESurface\u003C/strong\u003E (Dusha).)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesaha footprint-ka. Guji meel u dhow geeska qeybta dhulka ama dhibic sahan ayaa qaadanaysa meeshaas oo sax ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geeska koowaad mar kale, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, si aad u dhammaysato. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa geeska ugu dambeeya; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMug cusub wuxuu leeyahay saddex dabaq iyo dherer dabaq 12 ft (3.6 m), waxaana uu u hoggaansamaa qeybta dhulka ee bartiisa dhexe ku dhacday.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dabaqyada-dherka-iyo-aagga\"\u003EDabaqyada, dherka iyo aagga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji mug si aad u beddesho \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaalka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDabaqyada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer dabaqa\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EQeybta dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDherka\u003C/strong\u003E waa dabaqyada oo lagu dhufto dherer dabaqa: qor dherka, tirada dabaqyada waxay noqonaysaa tirada dabaq ee ugu dhow (ugu yaraan hal). \u003Cstrong\u003EFootprint\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EGross floor area\u003C/strong\u003E (footprint oo lagu dhufto dabaqyada) waa la xisaabiyay adiga oo aan qorin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhulka-jiifka-leh\"\u003EDhulka jiifka leh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhulka hoosta mugga waxa laga akhriyaa dusha: dhulka jira, ama dhulka la simay meesha aad dooratay \u003Cstrong\u003EProposed ground (graded)\u003C/strong\u003E (Dhulka la soo jeediyay (la simay)). \u003Cstrong\u003EOn sloping ground\u003C/strong\u003E (Dhulka jiifka leh) wuxuu sheegayaa meesha uu dabaqa dhulka ku dhigan yahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStepped\u003C/strong\u003E (Heer-heer ah): dhulka celceliska hoosta footprint-ka. Dhinaca hoose waa la buuxiyaa ilaa heerkaas, dhinaca sare waa la jaraa, labadaba waxay u dhowaadaan inay isku miisaan noqdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPodium\u003C/strong\u003E (Podium): dhulka ugu sarreeya. Saldhig adag ayaa buuxiya dhinaca hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECut\u003C/strong\u003E (Goyn): dhulka ugu hooseeya. Dhinaca sare waa la jaraa, gudaha buurta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProperties wuxuu muujinayaa kala duwanaanshaha dhulka hoosta mugga, \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka dabaqa dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo mugga buuxinta iyo goynta u dhexeeya dhulka iyo heerkaas. Qeybta footprint-ka ee ka baxsan dusha waa laga reebay, Properties wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EMuuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMasses-ka waxaa lagu sawiraa muuqaalka goobta 3D, leh xariiq marka dabaq kasta iyo magacyadooda dusha kor. \u003Cstrong\u003EShow\u003C/strong\u003E (Muuji) wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq calaamad ah oo \u003Cstrong\u003EBuilding masses\u003C/strong\u003E. Guji mid si aad u doorato. Marka mug la doortay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ejiid saqafkiisa sare ama hoos si aad u riixdo ama u jiidto dabaq mar kasta, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhaqdhaqaaqa oo dhan waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqon karta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka waddada ee \u003Cstrong\u003EDrive\u003C/strong\u003E (Wadid) wuxuu arkaa masses-ka sidoo kale, \u003Cstrong\u003ESun\u003C/strong\u003E (Qorraxda) wuxuu dhigaa hooskooda dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dir\"\u003EU dir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMasses as IFC\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa mug kasta fayl IFC4 ah: goob, dhis oo leh dabaqyadiisa, iyo mugga oo ah unsur dhis oo tirooyinkiisa ku jira property set-ka \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft_SiteMass\u003C/code\u003E. Marka nidaamka isku-xirka loo dejiyo mashruuca, faylka waxaa lagu dhejiyaa khariidadda oo wuxuu leeyahay latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta; haddii kale ma sheegayo meesha uu ku yaal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDevelop in BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu furaa BimCraft tab cusub oo leh masses-ka. Halkaas, marka mug la doorto waxay muujinaysaa tirooyinkiisa iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDevelop this mass\u003C/strong\u003E (Horumari mugga), kaas oo dhisa darbiyo heer kasta iyo dhul dabaqa hoose footprint-ka, hal tallaabo oo ka noqon karta. Waxba lama shubo: faylku wuxuu u gudbaa labada tab ee brawsarkan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Cstrong\u003EZoning limits\u003C/strong\u003E (Xuduudaha qeybinta dhulka) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESun hours\u003C/strong\u003E (Saacadaha qorraxda).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Mugga dhismuhu waa footprint (aagga dhulka ee dhismuhu ku fadhiyo), tiro dabaq iyo dherer dabaq: su'aasha hore \"inta dhismo ayaa halkan ku habboon, oolkana maxay ku sameyn doonaa dhulka\". Masses-ku waxay ku sugan yihiin qorshaha magacooda, tirada dabaqyada iyo aagga guud, waxay galaan daabacaadda PDF iyo dhoofinta DWG iyo DXF ee lakabyada A-MASS iyo A-MASS-TEXT, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Sawir mug Hoosta Properties (Sifooyinka), hoosta Building masses (Mugyada dhismaha), guji Draw a mass (Sawir mug). (Waxaa kale oo ku jira menu-ga More (Dheeraad) ee qalabka, xaggiisa Surface (Dusha).) Guji geesaha footprint-ka. Guji meel u dhow geeska qeybta dhulka ama dhibic sahan ayaa qaadanaysa meeshaas oo sax ah. Guji geeska koowaad mar kale, ama riix Enter, si aad u dhammaysato. Backspace wuxuu soo celinayaa geeska ugu dambeeya; Esc wuu joojiyaa. Mug cusub wuxuu leeyahay saddex dabaq iyo dherer dabaq 12 ft (3.6 m), waxaana uu u hoggaansamaa qeybta dhulka ee bartiisa dhexe ku dhacday. Dabaqyada, dherka iyo aagga Guji mug si aad u beddesho Magaca, Isticmaalka, Dabaqyada, Dherer dabaqa iyo Qeybta dhulka. Dherka waa dabaqyada oo lagu dhufto dherer dabaqa: qor dherka, tirada dabaqyada waxay noqonaysaa tirada dabaq ee ugu dhow (ugu yaraan hal). Footprint iyo Gross floor area (footprint oo lagu dhufto dabaqyada) waa la xisaabiyay adiga oo aan qorin. Dhulka jiifka leh Dhulka hoosta mugga waxa laga akhriyaa dusha: dhulka jira, ama dhulka la simay meesha aad dooratay Proposed ground (graded) (Dhulka la soo jeediyay (la simay)). On sloping ground (Dhulka jiifka leh) wuxuu sheegayaa meesha uu dabaqa dhulka ku dhigan yahay: Stepped (Heer-heer ah): dhulka celceliska hoosta footprint-ka. Dhinaca hoose waa la buuxiyaa ilaa heerkaas, dhinaca sare waa la jaraa, labadaba waxay u dhowaadaan inay isku miisaan noqdaan. Podium (Podium): dhulka ugu sarreeya. Saldhig adag ayaa buuxiya dhinaca hoose. Cut (Goyn): dhulka ugu hooseeya. Dhinaca sare waa la jaraa, gudaha buurta. Properties wuxuu muujinayaa kala duwanaanshaha dhulka hoosta mugga, Heerka dabaqa dhulka, iyo mugga buuxinta iyo goynta u dhexeeya dhulka iyo heerkaas. Qeybta footprint-ka ee ka baxsan dusha waa laga reebay, Properties wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay. Muuqaalka 3D Masses-ka waxaa lagu sawiraa muuqaalka goobta 3D, leh xariiq marka dabaq kasta iyo magacyadooda dusha kor. Show (Muuji) wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq calaamad ah oo Building masses. Guji mid si aad u doorato. Marka mug la doortay: jiid saqafkiisa sare ama hoos si aad u riixdo ama u jiidto dabaq mar kasta, ama riix Page Up iyo Page Down; dhaqdhaqaaqa oo dhan waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqon karta. Muuqaalka waddada ee Drive (Wadid) wuxuu arkaa masses-ka sidoo kale, Sun (Qorraxda) wuxuu dhigaa hooskooda dhulka. U dir Masses as IFC wuxuu kaydiyaa mug kasta fayl IFC4 ah: goob, dhis oo leh dabaqyadiisa, iyo mugga oo ah unsur dhis oo tirooyinkiisa ku jira property set-ka CadCraft_SiteMass. Marka nidaamka isku-xirka loo dejiyo mashruuca, faylka waxaa lagu dhejiyaa khariidadda oo wuxuu leeyahay latitude iyo longitude-ka goobta; haddii kale ma sheegayo meesha uu ku yaal. Develop in BimCraft wuxuu furaa BimCraft tab cusub oo leh masses-ka. Halkaas, marka mug la doorto waxay muujinaysaa tirooyinkiisa iyo Develop this mass (Horumari mugga), kaas oo dhisa darbiyo heer kasta iyo dhul dabaqa hoose footprint-ka, hal tallaabo oo ka noqon karta. Waxba lama shubo: faylku wuxuu u gudbaa labada tab ee brawsarkan. Eeg sidoo kale Zoning limits (Xuduudaha qeybinta dhulka) iyo Sun hours (Saacadaha qorraxda).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"environment","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Hoosaha, wax-soo-saarka qorraxda iyo raaxada dibedda","summary":"Daraasi hoosta dhismayaasha ay tuuraan maalin ama xilli, eeg farshaxan ee taas, xisaabi inta koronto ee panelada qorraxda ee saqafyada iyo darbiyada ay soo saari karaan sannad caadi ah, eeg sida raaxada waddada ku xigta dhismaha u leedahay (UTCI), oo hel akhris baaritaan oo dabaysha dadka dhulka ku socda.","section":"tasks","order":97,"keywords":["daraasadda hoosta","hoos","saacadaha qorraxda","farshaxan","qorrax","PV","photovoltaic","panelada","wax-soo-saarka","kWh","EPW","faylka cimilada","UTCI","raaxada kulaylka","raaxada dibedda","cadaadiska kulaylka","dabayl"],"headings":[{"id":"soo-gali-faylka-cimilada","text":"Soo gali faylka cimilada","level":2},{"id":"daraasadda-hoosta","text":"Daraasadda hoosta","level":2},{"id":"wax-soo-saarka-qorraxda","text":"Wax-soo-saarka qorraxda","level":2},{"id":"raaxada-dibedda","text":"Raaxada dibedda","level":2},{"id":"dabayl-qiyaas","text":"Dabayl (qiyaas)","level":2},{"id":"dabayl-oo-leh-openfoam-add-on","text":"Dabayl oo leh OpenFOAM (add-on)","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EHoosta\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku jirtaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E ee mass kasta, hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ESaacadaha qorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxay isticmaashaa masaskii aad sawirtay inay yihiin dhismayaasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-gali-faylka-cimilada\"\u003ESoo gali faylka cimilada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro fayl cimilo oo sannad caadi ah (\u003Cstrong\u003E.epw\u003C/strong\u003E) magaaladaada. Waa bilaash waxaana laga helaa goobta cimilada EnergyPlus iyo climate.onebuilding.org. Faylku wuxuu ku sii jiraa browser-kaaga booqashadan. Wax-soo-saarka qorraxda iyo daraasadda raaxada waa loo baahan yahay; daraasadda hoosta waxay shaqaysaa iyada oo aan lahayn marka mashruucu leeyahay nidaam isku-xidhka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daraasadda-hoosta\"\u003EDaraasadda hoosta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro taariikh (ama calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EXilli\u003C/strong\u003E oo dhig taariikh dambe iyo tallaabo maalmo ah) iyo xagga waqtiga, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EBilow daraasadda hoosta\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxaad heshaa khariidad saacadaha qorraxda, ama hoosta, dhulka ku wareegsan masaska; miis muujinaya inta dhulka ay hoos ku jirto maalinta oo dhan; iyo farshaxan maalinta oo aad ciyaari karto ama hal-hal ku socodsiin karto. \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi khariidadda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi jajabyada farshaxanka\u003C/strong\u003E (dhammaanba hal sawir ku jira) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi saacadaha\u003C/strong\u003E (CSV) natiijooyinka way kaydiyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhulka waxa loo qaadanayaa inuu siman yahay oo heerkiisa yahay masska ugu hooseeya. Hoosta dhul jiifka leh, isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003ESaacadaha qorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E, kaas oo akhrisa dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-soo-saarka-qorraxda\"\u003EWax-soo-saarka qorraxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeji waxtarka panelka, inta saqaf kasta iyo darbi kasta ee ay daboolayso, iyo luminta nidaamka, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EBilow wax-soo-saarka qorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E. Saqaf kasta iyo darbi kasta waxaad heshaa korontada mitir labajibaaro panel ah ay sannad caadi ah soo saari lahayd, inta ay masasyada deriska ah qaadaan, iyo wadarta mass kasta. Qaabka waxaa lagu qoray ereyo caadi ah badhanka dhinacisa: waa qiyaas qorshe oo ka soo baxa sannad caadi ah, mana aha damaanad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raaxada-dibedda\"\u003ERaaxada dibedda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilow raaxada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu xisaabiyaa Universal Thermal Climate Index (UTCI) qofka taagan ee dhulka furan iyo ee dhinaca mass-ka ugu horreeya (dhinacyada koonfur, waqooyi, bari iyo galbeed), iyada oo hoosta mass kasta la xisaabiyo. Waxay muujinaysaa inta samada la arko, UTCI-ga celceliska maalinta, iyo saacadaha ka sarreeya 32 (cadaadiska kulaylka) iyo ka hooseeya 0 (cadaadiska qaboobaha).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dabayl-qiyaas\"\u003EDabayl (qiyaas)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilow daraasadda dabaysha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu xalliyaa socodka hawada masaska ku wareegsan hal mar jihada dabaysha kasta oo ku dhaqaaqda faylka cimiladaada (4, 8, 12 ama 16 jihooyin), oo ku wareegsan deriska aad doorato (dal furan, xaafad ama bartamaha magaalada), kadibna wuxuu isku daraa dabaysha saacad walba ee sannadka oo dhan. Khariidaddu dhulka waxay midabeysaa heerka raaxada, cagaar (\u003Cstrong\u003Efadhi\u003C/strong\u003E) ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003Etaagan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esocod\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esocodka\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa casaan (\u003Cstrong\u003Eaan raaxo lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E): firfircoonaanta xadka xawaareheeda (4, 6, 8 iyo 10 m/s) ayaa ka sarreysa wax ka yar 5 % saacadaha. Miiskii labaad wuxuu siinayaa darajada NEN 8100 (A ilaa E) iyada oo ku saleysan qaybta saacadaha dabaysha ka sarreysa 5 m/s. Cabbirka hawo-kaca wuxuu ku dhufaa celceliska saacadeed si uu u helo hawo-kaca dhab ahaan u dhaca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida ay u shaqeyso, ereyo caadi ah: xalliye socodka hawada oo isku-dhafan (lattice-Boltzmann large-eddy) (kan annaga, maktabadda \u003Ccode\u003Elib/wind\u003C/code\u003E) oo ku jira sanduuq masaska ku wareegsan, profile xawaare dabaysha oo kor u kacaya sare marka ay dhererku kordho iyada oo la doortay jilicsanaanta, iyo xawaaraha ku dhow 1.5 m dhulka sare marka la barbardhigo xawaaraha hore ee 10 m. \u003Cstrong\u003EQiyaasta\u003C/strong\u003E waa degdeg oo qiyaas; \u003Cstrong\u003ECaadi\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu adeegsadaa unugyo badan wuuna ku socdaa waqti dheer. Haddii panelku sheego in gridku uu yahay mid qiyaas ah (ka yar 10 unug dhismaha ugu dheer), ama socodku weli isbeddelayo, khariidadda ka rumayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaas maaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Xalliyaha waa la hubiyay socodyo buugga ku qoran (kanaal, koob daboolan), waxaana lagu socodsiiyay kub si loo hubiyo in dabka dambe iyo xawaarihii geesaha ay saxan yihiin. \u003Cstrong\u003ELama xaqiijin\u003C/strong\u003E xisaabaadka tijaabada hawada ee dhismayaasha, sidaas darteed natiijo kasta waa la calaamadiyaa inaysan la xaqiijin. Ha u isticmaalin qiimo naqshad, culeys dabayl, ama shahaado qorshe: injineer dabayl ah ayaa waa inuu sameeyo oo xaqiijiyo daraasad sax ah. Dhulka siman, darbiyada dhismayaasha ee siman, jilicsanaanta ee saamaynta cimilada iyo miisaska diidmada ayaa ah fududeyn; miisaska ayaa laga yaabaa inay ka duwan yihiin shuruudaha maamulkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dabayl-oo-leh-openfoam-add-on\"\u003EDabayl oo leh OpenFOAM (add-on)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXalliyaha dabaysha ee dhexe ee kor ku jira waa tijaabo. Xalliye socod oo sax ah, shid add-on-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EDabaysha dadka dhulka ku socda (OpenFOAM)\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta &gt; Kordhinta\u003C/strong\u003E (wuu damaa ilaa aad shid). Waa software GPL ah oo u gaar ah, oo ka go&#039;an qaybta kale ee CadCraft, mana ku jiro OpenFOAM: adiga ayaa rakibaya. Markaasna \u003Cstrong\u003EMishiinka\u003C/strong\u003E ku jira blockka dabaysha wuxuu muujinayaa OpenFOAM.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa aad diyaarisaa mar keliya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERakib OpenFOAM\u003C/strong\u003E (ESI v-series oo ka yimid openfoam.com; add-on-ka waa la tijaabiyay v2512). Ubuntu ama Debian (sidoo kale gudaha WSL ee Windows): \u003Ccode\u003Ecurl https://dl.openfoam.com/add-debian-repo.sh | sudo bash\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna \u003Ccode\u003Esudo apt install openfoam2512-default\u003C/code\u003E. Wuxuu ku rakibaa \u003Ccode\u003E/usr/lib/openfoam/openfoam2512\u003C/code\u003E. CadCraft wuxuu u baahan yahay \u003Ccode\u003EblockMesh\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EsnappyHexMesh\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EsimpleFoam\u003C/code\u003E si uu u shaqeeyo. (Xirmada duqa ah \u003Ccode\u003Eopenfoam\u003C/code\u003E 1912 ee archive-ka Ubuntu sidoo kale waa shaqeysaa, laakiin function objects-keeda way burburaan; markaasna add-on-ku wuxuu akhriyaa faylasha natiijada naftiisa.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilow caawiyaha\u003C/strong\u003E folder-ka \u003Ccode\u003Erunner\u003C/code\u003E ee add-on-ka Node.js: \u003Ccode\u003Enode cc-openfoam-runner.mjs serve\u003C/code\u003E. Haddii OpenFOAM aanu ku jirin jidka raadinta, ku sii \u003Ccode\u003Erunner.json\u003C/code\u003E yar oo leh jidka \u003Ccode\u003Eetc/bashrc\u003C/code\u003E ee OpenFOAM (\u003Ccode\u003E{ &quot;bashrc&quot;: &quot;/usr/lib/openfoam/openfoam2512/etc/bashrc&quot; }\u003C/code\u003E) oo bilow adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Ccode\u003E--config runner.json\u003C/code\u003E. Caawiyuhu wuxuu dhegaysanayaa kumbiyuutarkan oo keliya wuxuuna muujinayaa token.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dhaji token-ka\u003C/strong\u003E goobaha add-on-ka blockka dabaysha (cinwaanka wuu sii joogaa \u003Ccode\u003Ehttp://127.0.0.1:8765\u003C/code\u003E) oo riix \u003Cstrong\u003EHubi caawiyaha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaas \u003Cstrong\u003EBilow daraasadda dabaysha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay shaqeysaa kiis kasta jihada dabaysha ee faylka cimilada: masaskaaga waxay noqdaan dusha (STL) sanduuq la cabbiray hagaha caadiga ah (5 dhererka dhismaha wareega iyo sare, 10 dhabarka), oo lagu meeshaynayo blockMesh iyo snappyHexMesh, oo lagu orodo sida RANS k-epsilon joogto ah oo leh geli boundary layer cimilo oo ku saleysan jilicsanaanta aad doorato, xawaaraha 1.5 m waa la akhriyaa oo waxaa loo beddelaa heerarka Lawson iyo NEN 8100 ee isku mid ah. Waxba kumbiyuutarkaaga kama baxo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa la hubiyay.\u003C/strong\u003E Qoraalka kor ku jira natiijooyinka ayaa sheegaya si cad, waxayna qayb ka tahay CSV kasta oo la kaydiyo. Qoristii kiiska add-on-ka, akhrinta natiijooyinka iyo silsiladda oo dhan waa la tijaabiyay iyada oo aan OpenFOAM la isticmaalin, kubba keligeed ayaa lagu socodsiiyay OpenFOAM dhab ah saddex cabbir oo mesh ah (tirooyinka waxay ku jiraan xusuusta mashruuca). \u003Cstrong\u003ELama xaqiijin\u003C/strong\u003E xisaabaadka tijaabada hawada ee dhismayaasha. Waa akhris qiyaas ah, mana aha qiimo naqshad ama shahaado. K-epsilon caadi ah wuxuu xad dhaafsan u qiyaasaa turbulence-ka hortiisa dhismayaasha, dhulku waa siman yahay, darbiyadu waa siman yihiin, mana jiro dhul ama geed.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaybta Hoosta waxay ku jirtaa Sifooyinka ee mass kasta, hoos Saacadaha qorraxda. Waxay isticmaashaa masaskii aad sawirtay inay yihiin dhismayaasha. Soo gali faylka cimilada Dooro fayl cimilo oo sannad caadi ah (.epw) magaaladaada. Waa bilaash waxaana laga helaa goobta cimilada EnergyPlus iyo climate.onebuilding.org. Faylku wuxuu ku sii jiraa browser-kaaga booqashadan. Wax-soo-saarka qorraxda iyo daraasadda raaxada waa loo baahan yahay; daraasadda hoosta waxay shaqaysaa iyada oo aan lahayn marka mashruucu leeyahay nidaam isku-xidhka. Daraasadda hoosta Dooro taariikh (ama calaamadee Xilli oo dhig taariikh dambe iyo tallaabo maalmo ah) iyo xagga waqtiga, kadibna Bilow daraasadda hoosta. Waxaad heshaa khariidad saacadaha qorraxda, ama hoosta, dhulka ku wareegsan masaska; miis muujinaya inta dhulka ay hoos ku jirto maalinta oo dhan; iyo farshaxan maalinta oo aad ciyaari karto ama hal-hal ku socodsiin karto. Kaydi khariidadda, Kaydi jajabyada farshaxanka (dhammaanba hal sawir ku jira) iyo Kaydi saacadaha (CSV) natiijooyinka way kaydiyaan. Dhulka waxa loo qaadanayaa inuu siman yahay oo heerkiisa yahay masska ugu hooseeya. Hoosta dhul jiifka leh, isticmaal Saacadaha qorraxda, kaas oo akhrisa dhulka. Wax-soo-saarka qorraxda Deji waxtarka panelka, inta saqaf kasta iyo darbi kasta ee ay daboolayso, iyo luminta nidaamka, kadibna Bilow wax-soo-saarka qorraxda. Saqaf kasta iyo darbi kasta waxaad heshaa korontada mitir labajibaaro panel ah ay sannad caadi ah soo saari lahayd, inta ay masasyada deriska ah qaadaan, iyo wadarta mass kasta. Qaabka waxaa lagu qoray ereyo caadi ah badhanka dhinacisa: waa qiyaas qorshe oo ka soo baxa sannad caadi ah, mana aha damaanad. Raaxada dibedda Bilow raaxada wuxuu xisaabiyaa Universal Thermal Climate Index (UTCI) qofka taagan ee dhulka furan iyo ee dhinaca mass-ka ugu horreeya (dhinacyada koonfur, waqooyi, bari iyo galbeed), iyada oo hoosta mass kasta la xisaabiyo. Waxay muujinaysaa inta samada la arko, UTCI-ga celceliska maalinta, iyo saacadaha ka sarreeya 32 (cadaadiska kulaylka) iyo ka hooseeya 0 (cadaadiska qaboobaha). Dabayl (qiyaas) Bilow daraasadda dabaysha wuxuu xalliyaa socodka hawada masaska ku wareegsan hal mar jihada dabaysha kasta oo ku dhaqaaqda faylka cimiladaada (4, 8, 12 ama 16 jihooyin), oo ku wareegsan deriska aad doorato (dal furan, xaafad ama bartamaha magaalada), kadibna wuxuu isku daraa dabaysha saacad walba ee sannadka oo dhan. Khariidaddu dhulka waxay midabeysaa heerka raaxada, cagaar (fadhi) ilaa taagan, socod, socodka ilaa casaan (aan raaxo lahayn): firfircoonaanta xadka xawaareheeda (4, 6, 8 iyo 10 m/s) ayaa ka sarreysa wax ka yar 5 % saacadaha. Miiskii labaad wuxuu siinayaa darajada NEN 8100 (A ilaa E) iyada oo ku saleysan qaybta saacadaha dabaysha ka sarreysa 5 m/s. Cabbirka hawo-kaca wuxuu ku dhufaa celceliska saacadeed si uu u helo hawo-kaca dhab ahaan u dhaca. Sida ay u shaqeyso, ereyo caadi ah: xalliye socodka hawada oo isku-dhafan (lattice-Boltzmann large-eddy) (kan annaga, maktabadda lib/wind) oo ku jira sanduuq masaska ku wareegsan, profile xawaare dabaysha oo kor u kacaya sare marka ay dhererku kordho iyada oo la doortay jilicsanaanta, iyo xawaaraha ku dhow 1.5 m dhulka sare marka la barbardhigo xawaaraha hore ee 10 m. Qiyaasta waa degdeg oo qiyaas; Caadi wuxuu adeegsadaa unugyo badan wuuna ku socdaa waqti dheer. Haddii panelku sheego in gridku uu yahay mid qiyaas ah (ka yar 10 unug dhismaha ugu dheer), ama socodku weli isbeddelayo, khariidadda ka rumayso. Taas maaha. Xalliyaha waa la hubiyay socodyo buugga ku qoran (kanaal, koob daboolan), waxaana lagu socodsiiyay kub si loo hubiyo in dabka dambe iyo xawaarihii geesaha ay saxan yihiin. Lama xaqiijin xisaabaadka tijaabada hawada ee dhismayaasha, sidaas darteed natiijo kasta waa la calaamadiyaa inaysan la xaqiijin. Ha u isticmaalin qiimo naqshad, culeys dabayl, ama shahaado qorshe: injineer dabayl ah ayaa waa inuu sameeyo oo xaqiijiyo daraasad sax ah. Dhulka siman, darbiyada dhismayaasha ee siman, jilicsanaanta ee saamaynta cimilada iyo miisaska diidmada ayaa ah fududeyn; miisaska ayaa laga yaabaa inay ka duwan yihiin shuruudaha maamulkaaga. Dabayl oo leh OpenFOAM (add-on) Xalliyaha dabaysha ee dhexe ee kor ku jira waa tijaabo. Xalliye socod oo sax ah, shid add-on-ka Dabaysha dadka dhulka ku socda (OpenFOAM) oo ku jira Dejinta \u003E Kordhinta (wuu damaa ilaa aad shid). Waa software GPL ah oo u gaar ah, oo ka go'an qaybta kale ee CadCraft, mana ku jiro OpenFOAM: adiga ayaa rakibaya. Markaasna Mishiinka ku jira blockka dabaysha wuxuu muujinayaa OpenFOAM. Waxa aad diyaarisaa mar keliya: Rakib OpenFOAM (ESI v-series oo ka yimid openfoam.com; add-on-ka waa la tijaabiyay v2512). Ubuntu ama Debian (sidoo kale gudaha WSL ee Windows): curl https://dl.openfoam.com/add-debian-repo.sh | sudo bash, kadibna sudo apt install openfoam2512-default. Wuxuu ku rakibaa /usr/lib/openfoam/openfoam2512. CadCraft wuxuu u baahan yahay blockMesh, snappyHexMesh iyo simpleFoam si uu u shaqeeyo. (Xirmada duqa ah openfoam 1912 ee archive-ka Ubuntu sidoo kale waa shaqeysaa, laakiin function objects-keeda way burburaan; markaasna add-on-ku wuxuu akhriyaa faylasha natiijada naftiisa.) Bilow caawiyaha folder-ka runner ee add-on-ka Node.js: node cc-openfoam-runner.mjs serve. Haddii OpenFOAM aanu ku jirin jidka raadinta, ku sii runner.json yar oo leh jidka etc/bashrc ee OpenFOAM ({ \"bashrc\": \"/usr/lib/openfoam/openfoam2512/etc/bashrc\" }) oo bilow adigoo isticmaalaya --config runner.json. Caawiyuhu wuxuu dhegaysanayaa kumbiyuutarkan oo keliya wuxuuna muujinayaa token. Ku dhaji token-ka goobaha add-on-ka blockka dabaysha (cinwaanka wuu sii joogaa http://127.0.0.1:8765) oo riix Hubi caawiyaha. Markaas Bilow daraasadda dabaysha waxay shaqeysaa kiis kasta jihada dabaysha ee faylka cimilada: masaskaaga waxay noqdaan dusha (STL) sanduuq la cabbiray hagaha caadiga ah (5 dhererka dhismaha wareega iyo sare, 10 dhabarka), oo lagu meeshaynayo blockMesh iyo snappyHexMesh, oo lagu orodo sida RANS k-epsilon joogto ah oo leh geli boundary layer cimilo oo ku saleysan jilicsanaanta aad doorato, xawaaraha 1.5 m waa la akhriyaa oo waxaa loo beddelaa heerarka Lawson iyo NEN 8100 ee isku mid ah. Waxba kumbiyuutarkaaga kama baxo. Waxa la hubiyay. Qoraalka kor ku jira natiijooyinka ayaa sheegaya si cad, waxayna qayb ka tahay CSV kasta oo la kaydiyo. Qoristii kiiska add-on-ka, akhrinta natiijooyinka iyo silsiladda oo dhan waa la tijaabiyay iyada oo aan OpenFOAM la isticmaalin, kubba keligeed ayaa lagu socodsiiyay OpenFOAM dhab ah saddex cabbir oo mesh ah (tirooyinka waxay ku jiraan xusuusta mashruuca). Lama xaqiijin xisaabaadka tijaabada hawada ee dhismayaasha. Waa akhris qiyaas ah, mana aha qiimo naqshad ama shahaado. K-epsilon caadi ah wuxuu xad dhaafsan u qiyaasaa turbulence-ka hortiisa dhismayaasha, dhulku waa siman yahay, darbiyadu waa siman yihiin, mana jiro dhul ama geed.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"zoning-limits","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Hubi tirooyinka marka loo eego xadadka aad qorto","summary":"Qor xadadka dhinaca loo dhowra ee lot-ka xariiq xariiq, xadka dhererka, qorshaha hooska-saamaynta, nisbada aagga dabaqa iyo daboolka; arag qaabka dhismaha ee la dhisi karo qorshaha, oo akhri tirooyinka jebiya xad kasta.","section":"tasks","order":97,"keywords":["qaabeyn","dhinaca loo dhowro","hore","dhinac","dhabar","qaabka","qaabka dhismaha","aagga la dhisi karo","xadka dhererka","qorshaha hooska","nisbada aagga dabaqa","FAR","daboolka","lot","parcel","xeer","hubinta xeerka"],"headings":[{"id":"qor-xadadka","text":"Qor xadadka","level":2},{"id":"qaabka-dhismaha","text":"Qaabka dhismaha","level":2},{"id":"natiijada","text":"Natiijada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECivilCraft ma leh xeer qaabeyn oo gudaha ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma aqoonto xeerarka magaalo kasta ma-na keydiyo maktabad ah. Tirooyinka bogan kasta waa kuwa aad qortid, oo laga soo qaaday xeerkaaga, natiijo kasta wuxuu sheegaa in laga cabbiray xadadka aad qortay. Waa hab aad ku aragto sida xadadka lot-ka u qaabeeyaan dhismaha, ma aha go&#039;aan ah in naqshadda la oggol yahay ama maya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qor-xadadka\"\u003EQor xadadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProperties ku jira, hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ETirooyinka dhismaha\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EParcel\u003C/strong\u003E (ama dooro tiro: xadadka parcel-keeda ayaa ku muuqda hoostiisa). Kadibna buuxi wixii khuseeya; sanduuq madhan wuxuu ka dhigan yahay &quot;xad ma leh&quot;:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadka waddada\u003C/strong\u003E: xadka lot-ka ee waddada. \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca hore ee loo dhowro\u003C/strong\u003E waxay khuseysaa, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca dambe ee loo dhowro\u003C/strong\u003E waxay khuseysaa xadka ugu soo horjeeda, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca loo dhowro\u003C/strong\u003E waxay khuseysaa xadadka kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadka dhererka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha hooska\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhererka xadka lot-ka, wuxuuna kor u kacaa qaddarka aad qortid kasta 1 masaafo gudaha, lagu cabbiray xadka waddada ama xadka lot-ka kasta (2 waxay ka dhigan tahay 2 ilaa 1). Dhererka la oggol yahay barta kasta waa kan ugu hooseeya ee qorshaha iyo xadka dhererka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENisbada aagga dabaqa\u003C/strong\u003E (aagga guud ee dabaqa tiroyinka lot-ka korkiisa oo loo qaybiyo aagga lot-ka) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDaboolka\u003C/strong\u003E (cagahooda loo qaybiyo aagga lot-ka, lagu qoro boqolkiiba).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabka-dhismaha\"\u003EQaabka dhismaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji qaabka dhismaha qorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E si aad ugu sawirto lakabka \u003Ccode\u003EA-MASS-ENVL\u003C/code\u003E. Qaabka dhismaha waa lot-ka laga yareeyo xad kasta oo lot ah masaafadiisa dhinac kasta, xariiqyada yar-yaraha ah oo isku kulma geesaha mitred. Xadka lot-ka oo ka kooban curve wuxuu u qaadan yahay chords gaaban oo ku jira 0.01 curve-ka. Lot-yada laga soo-dhigo iyo kuwa laga soo-dhigo labaduba way shaqeeyaan. Haddii dhinacyada ay isku laaban yihiin (masaafo qoto dheer oo lot cidhiidhi ah ama aad u laga soo dhigay) ma jiro qaabka dhismaha, Properties ayaa sheegta; isku day masaafooyin yar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"natiijada\"\u003ENatiijada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta sanduuqyada, tiro kasta iyo xad kasta wuxuu helaa xariiq, oo leh calaamad saxan ama khalad:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Edhinacyada loo dhowro\u003C/strong\u003E: aagga tirada ee ku dhex jira qaabka dhismaha;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Edhererka\u003C/strong\u003E: dhererka tirada marka loo eego kan ugu badan ee la oggol yahay barta kasta oo ku jirta footprint-keeda (tiro dhererka hal ah waxaa xaddidaya dhererka ugu hooseeya ee la oggol yahay ee geesaha kasta);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Enisbada aagga dabaqa\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Edaboolka\u003C/strong\u003E: dhammaan tirooyinka parcel-ka ku jira oo wada-ku-darsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"CivilCraft ma leh xeer qaabeyn oo gudaha ah. Ma aqoonto xeerarka magaalo kasta ma-na keydiyo maktabad ah. Tirooyinka bogan kasta waa kuwa aad qortid, oo laga soo qaaday xeerkaaga, natiijo kasta wuxuu sheegaa in laga cabbiray xadadka aad qortay. Waa hab aad ku aragto sida xadadka lot-ka u qaabeeyaan dhismaha, ma aha go'aan ah in naqshadda la oggol yahay ama maya. Qor xadadka Properties ku jira, hoos Tirooyinka dhismaha, dooro Parcel (ama dooro tiro: xadadka parcel-keeda ayaa ku muuqda hoostiisa). Kadibna buuxi wixii khuseeya; sanduuq madhan wuxuu ka dhigan yahay \"xad ma leh\": Xadka waddada: xadka lot-ka ee waddada. Dhinaca hore ee loo dhowro waxay khuseysaa, Dhinaca dambe ee loo dhowro waxay khuseysaa xadka ugu soo horjeeda, Dhinaca loo dhowro waxay khuseysaa xadadka kale. Xadka dhererka. Qorshaha hooska: wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhererka xadka lot-ka, wuxuuna kor u kacaa qaddarka aad qortid kasta 1 masaafo gudaha, lagu cabbiray xadka waddada ama xadka lot-ka kasta (2 waxay ka dhigan tahay 2 ilaa 1). Dhererka la oggol yahay barta kasta waa kan ugu hooseeya ee qorshaha iyo xadka dhererka. Nisbada aagga dabaqa (aagga guud ee dabaqa tiroyinka lot-ka korkiisa oo loo qaybiyo aagga lot-ka) iyo Daboolka (cagahooda loo qaybiyo aagga lot-ka, lagu qoro boqolkiiba). Qaabka dhismaha Calaamadi Muuji qaabka dhismaha qorshaha si aad ugu sawirto lakabka A-MASS-ENVL. Qaabka dhismaha waa lot-ka laga yareeyo xad kasta oo lot ah masaafadiisa dhinac kasta, xariiqyada yar-yaraha ah oo isku kulma geesaha mitred. Xadka lot-ka oo ka kooban curve wuxuu u qaadan yahay chords gaaban oo ku jira 0.01 curve-ka. Lot-yada laga soo-dhigo iyo kuwa laga soo-dhigo labaduba way shaqeeyaan. Haddii dhinacyada ay isku laaban yihiin (masaafo qoto dheer oo lot cidhiidhi ah ama aad u laga soo dhigay) ma jiro qaabka dhismaha, Properties ayaa sheegta; isku day masaafooyin yar. Natiijada Hoosta sanduuqyada, tiro kasta iyo xad kasta wuxuu helaa xariiq, oo leh calaamad saxan ama khalad: dhinacyada loo dhowro: aagga tirada ee ku dhex jira qaabka dhismaha; dhererka: dhererka tirada marka loo eego kan ugu badan ee la oggol yahay barta kasta oo ku jirta footprint-keeda (tiro dhererka hal ah waxaa xaddidaya dhererka ugu hooseeya ee la oggol yahay ee geesaha kasta); nisbada aagga dabaqa iyo daboolka: dhammaan tirooyinka parcel-ka ku jira oo wada-ku-darsan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"staking","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Samee warbixinta go'yaasha dhulka","summary":"Liiska go'yaasha dhig dhigida waddada tiro-meerayaasha iyo fogaanta, ama barrooyinka sahanka ee u dhow, oo leh tiro-meer, fogaanta, waqooyiga, bariga, sare-kuhaysiga naqshadda iyo dhulka, iyo goyn ama buuxin, kaydiina warbixinta CSV ama PDF.","section":"tasks","order":97,"keywords":["go'yaasha","staking","warbixinta go'yaasha","jadwalka goynta","jadwalka heerka","tiro-meer","fogaanta","goyn","buuxin","dejinta","go'yaasha dhismaha","sida la dhisay"],"headings":[{"id":"go-yaasha-tiro-meerayaasha-iyo-fogaanta","text":"Go'yaasha tiro-meerayaasha iyo fogaanta","level":2},{"id":"barrooyinka-sahanka-ee-u-dhow-waddada","text":"Barrooyinka sahanka ee u dhow waddada","level":2},{"id":"waxa-warbixinta-ku-jira","text":"Waxa warbixinta ku jira","level":2},{"id":"kaydi","text":"Kaydi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDooro waddo oo guji \u003Cstrong\u003EWarbixinta go&#039;yaasha\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"go-yaasha-tiro-meerayaasha-iyo-fogaanta\"\u003EGo&#039;yaasha tiro-meerayaasha iyo fogaanta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eilaa\u003C/strong\u003E: tiro-meerayaasha la go&#039;ayo (1+50 ama 150).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ekasta\u003C/strong\u003E: farqiga. Go&#039;yaasha waxay ku yaallaan meel kasta oo ah tiro lagu dhufto, labada dhamaadkaba, iyo (sanduuqa la calaamadiyey) meelaha ay curyaannada waddadu ka bilaabanto iyo ka dhammaanto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFogaanta\u003C/strong\u003E: bidix iyo midig ee waddada, marka laga eego tiro-meerka kor: \u003Ccode\u003E12 L, 0, 12 R\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EL12 CL R12\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E-12, 0, 12\u003C/code\u003E (bidixdu waa minus). Waddo leh koridor ayaa ka bilaabmaysa geesaha dusha iyo garbaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirinta ka bilow\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ehor-ku-xirka\u003C/strong\u003E: go&#039;yaasha waxaa loo magacaabi karaa 1, 2, 3, ama S101, S102.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barrooyinka-sahanka-ee-u-dhow-waddada\"\u003EBarrooyinka sahanka ee u dhow waddada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarrooyinka sahanka ee u dhow waddada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo sida ay u dhow tahay. Barta kasta oo ku jirta masaafadaas waxay heshaa tiro-meerkeeda iyo fogaanteeda, naqshadda halkaas, iyo sare-kuhaysteeda oo dhul ah, taas oo ah hubin barrooyin la go&#039;ay ama la sawiray sida la dhisay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-warbixinta-ku-jira\"\u003EWaxa warbixinta ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiirka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu yahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca go&#039;da, ama lambarka barta sahanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStation, Offset\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalka ay ku taal waddada: L bidix, R midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENorthing, Easting\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-xirkeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDesign elev.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha koridorka la qaabeeyay halkaas (laga bilaabo khadka daylight ilaa khadka daylight), haddii kale naqshadda sare ee xarriiqda dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGround elev.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha jirta halkaas, ama sare-kuhaysiga barta sahanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECut/fill\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC markii dhulku naqshadda ka sarreeyo (goyn hoos), F markii ka hooseeyo (buuxin kor), ilaa boqolaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGo&#039; aan sare-kuhaysi naqshad lahayn (ka baxsan koridorka, ama waddo aan lahayn naqshad meel ka fog xarriiqda dhexe) ma leh goyn ama buuxin; daaqaddu waxay sheegtaa inta ay tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECSV\u003C/strong\u003E: sadar cinwaan ah, kadibna tiirarka kor ku qoran, iyo goynta ama buuxinta oo ah tiro calaamad leh (dhulka ka dhig naqshadda), si loo isticmaalo spreadsheet-ka iyo ururiyeyaasha xogta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDF\u003C/strong\u003E: bogagga miiska ee warqadda aad doorato, go&#039; safka kasta, goynta oo oranji ah, buuxinta oo cagaar ah, iyo xarig cinwaanka xaashiyada kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGo&#039;yaasha waxaa laga xisaabiyaa naqshadda mashruuca. Ka hubi qorshayaasha la ansixiyay ka hor intaadan wax dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Dooro waddo oo guji Warbixinta go'yaasha oo ku jirta Sifooyinkeeda. Go'yaasha tiro-meerayaasha iyo fogaanta Ka iyo ilaa: tiro-meerayaasha la go'ayo (1+50 ama 150). kasta: farqiga. Go'yaasha waxay ku yaallaan meel kasta oo ah tiro lagu dhufto, labada dhamaadkaba, iyo (sanduuqa la calaamadiyey) meelaha ay curyaannada waddadu ka bilaabanto iyo ka dhammaanto. Fogaanta: bidix iyo midig ee waddada, marka laga eego tiro-meerka kor: 12 L, 0, 12 R, L12 CL R12 ama -12, 0, 12 (bidixdu waa minus). Waddo leh koridor ayaa ka bilaabmaysa geesaha dusha iyo garbaha. Tirinta ka bilow iyo hor-ku-xirka: go'yaasha waxaa loo magacaabi karaa 1, 2, 3, ama S101, S102. Barrooyinka sahanka ee u dhow waddada Dooro barrooyinka sahanka ee u dhow waddada iyo sida ay u dhow tahay. Barta kasta oo ku jirta masaafadaas waxay heshaa tiro-meerkeeda iyo fogaanteeda, naqshadda halkaas, iyo sare-kuhaysteeda oo dhul ah, taas oo ah hubin barrooyin la go'ay ama la sawiray sida la dhisay. Waxa warbixinta ku jira Tiirka Waxa uu yahay Barta Magaca go'da, ama lambarka barta sahanka Station, Offset Halka ay ku taal waddada: L bidix, R midig Northing, Easting Isku-xirkeeda Design elev. Dusha koridorka la qaabeeyay halkaas (laga bilaabo khadka daylight ilaa khadka daylight), haddii kale naqshadda sare ee xarriiqda dhexe Ground elev. Dusha jirta halkaas, ama sare-kuhaysiga barta sahanka Cut/fill C markii dhulku naqshadda ka sarreeyo (goyn hoos), F markii ka hooseeyo (buuxin kor), ilaa boqolaad Go' aan sare-kuhaysi naqshad lahayn (ka baxsan koridorka, ama waddo aan lahayn naqshad meel ka fog xarriiqda dhexe) ma leh goyn ama buuxin; daaqaddu waxay sheegtaa inta ay tahay. Kaydi CSV: sadar cinwaan ah, kadibna tiirarka kor ku qoran, iyo goynta ama buuxinta oo ah tiro calaamad leh (dhulka ka dhig naqshadda), si loo isticmaalo spreadsheet-ka iyo ururiyeyaasha xogta. PDF: bogagga miiska ee warqadda aad doorato, go' safka kasta, goynta oo oranji ah, buuxinta oo cagaar ah, iyo xarig cinwaanka xaashiyada kale. Go'yaasha waxaa laga xisaabiyaa naqshadda mashruuca. Ka hubi qorshayaasha la ansixiyay ka hor intaadan wax dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sun-hours","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xisaabi saacadaha qorraxda goobta","summary":"Dooro maalin (ama xilli) iyo waqti-aag, oo arag saacadaha qorraxda toosa ah ee gidaar kasta oo jirar kasta iyo dhulka ku wareegsan, dhulka oo lagu muujiyo khariidadda, tirooyinkana CSV.","section":"tasks","order":98,"keywords":["qorrax","saacadaha qorraxda","hooska","helitaanka qorraxda","saacadaha iftiinka","wajiga","gidaarka","xilli","soo-jeedinta qorraxda (solstice)","isku-dheerka (equinox)","waqti-aag","iftiinka-maalmaha","ballaca","dhererka","CSV","raster"],"headings":[{"id":"ka-hor-intaadan-bilaabin","text":"Ka hor intaadan bilaabin","level":2},{"id":"xisaabi","text":"Xisaabi","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-hesho","text":"Waxa aad hesho","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaacadaha qorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa saacadaha qorraxda toosa ah ee gaadha gidaar kasta oo jir dhismeed kasta iyo dhulka ku wareegsan, maalin aad doorato ama celceliska xilli. Jirarka iyo dhulku ayaa hooska keena; waxba kale ma keento (ma jiro geedo, ma jiro deriska aanad sawirin). Iftiinka samada ee aan qorraxda toosa ahayn lama tirinayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-hor-intaadan-bilaabin\"\u003EKa hor intaadan bilaabin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBooska qorraxda wuxuu ka yimaadaa latitude-ka iyo longitude-ka goobta, kuwaas oo ka yimaada \u003Cstrong\u003Enidaamka isku-xirka\u003C/strong\u003E ee mashruuca. Mashruuc aan lahayn waa la diidaa, fariin ayaa la siiyaa: marka hore deji (\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xirka\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jira kooxda GIS). Latitude iyo longitude gacanta lagu qoro waa qiyaas, sidaas darteed ma jiro sanduuq loogu talagalay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xisaabi\"\u003EXisaabi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESifooyinkiisa, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EJirarka dhismaha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESaacadaha qorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMaalinta\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxay ka bilaabataa maalinta qorraxdu ugu hooseyso meesha aad joogto (21 Diseembar, ama 21 Juun gobolka koonfurta). Xilli ahaan, calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaan xilliga\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMaalinta ugu dambeysa\u003C/strong\u003E iyo inta maalmood oo u dhexeeya tijaabinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003EWaqti-aagga\u003C/strong\u003E: magac sida \u003Ccode\u003EAmerica/Mexico_City\u003C/code\u003E, ama farqiga UTC sida \u003Ccode\u003E-6\u003C/code\u003E. Magac wuxuu raacaa sharciyada waqtiga iftiinka ee maalinta; farqiga aad qortay waxaa loo isticmaalaa sida aad qortay, sidaas darteed isticmaal kan ku jira maalintaas. Khadka ku hoos sanduuqa wuxuu kuu sheegayaa farqiga uu helay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro inta jeer ee qorraxda la dhigo (5, 10, 15 ama 30 daqiiqo), kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EXisaabi saacadaha qorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E. Xilli wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa shaqaalaha asalka ah (background); \u003Cstrong\u003EJooji\u003C/strong\u003E wuu joojiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-hesho\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiis ka kala jirka: \u003Cstrong\u003Egidaarka ugu xun\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ecelceliska\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Egidaarka ugu fiican\u003C/strong\u003E, saacad maalintii, iyo miis gidaar kasta oo ah jihada uu u jeedo iyo saacadihiisa dabaq kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhulka ku wareegsan jirarka, lagu muujiyo khariidadda midab madow (qorrax la&#039;aan) ilaa jaalle (ugu badnaan unug kasta helo), iyo furaha. Meelaha hoostaga jirarka waa banaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji dhulka khariidadda\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa damiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGidaarada CSV\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka CSV\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa kaydiya tirooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXilli ahaan, tirooyinka waa celceliska maalintii ee maalmaha la tijaabiyay. Waxba mashruuca ma kaydsana: natiijadu waa mid la eego, mar kale la socodsiiyo mar kale ayaa la sameeyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGidaar wuxuu u tirinayaa daqiiqad inay qorrax leedahay kaliya marka ay u jeedo qorraxda oo aanu wax ka xannibayn. Gidaar u jeeda dhinac ka soo jeeda qorraxda ma helo waxba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhulka waxaa lagu tijaabiyaa shabakad ku xidhan cabirka goobta, iyo booska qorraxda bartamaha kala-soo-dhawaanshaha kasta, sidaas darteed saacadaha waa sax ilaa xaddiga kala-soo-dhawaanshaha aad doorato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBooska qorraxda waa qaacido astronomi oo la daabacay, oo sax u ah ilaa hal daqiiqad qaws (minute of arc).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Saacadaha qorraxda wuxuu tiriyaa saacadaha qorraxda toosa ah ee gaadha gidaar kasta oo jir dhismeed kasta iyo dhulka ku wareegsan, maalin aad doorato ama celceliska xilli. Jirarka iyo dhulku ayaa hooska keena; waxba kale ma keento (ma jiro geedo, ma jiro deriska aanad sawirin). Iftiinka samada ee aan qorraxda toosa ahayn lama tirinayo. Ka hor intaadan bilaabin Booska qorraxda wuxuu ka yimaadaa latitude-ka iyo longitude-ka goobta, kuwaas oo ka yimaada nidaamka isku-xirka ee mashruuca. Mashruuc aan lahayn waa la diidaa, fariin ayaa la siiyaa: marka hore deji (Isku-xirka oo ku jira kooxda GIS). Latitude iyo longitude gacanta lagu qoro waa qiyaas, sidaas darteed ma jiro sanduuq loogu talagalay. Xisaabi Sifooyinkiisa, hoosta Jirarka dhismaha, Saacadaha qorraxda: Dooro Maalinta. Waxay ka bilaabataa maalinta qorraxdu ugu hooseyso meesha aad joogto (21 Diseembar, ama 21 Juun gobolka koonfurta). Xilli ahaan, calaamadi Dhamaan xilliga, dooro Maalinta ugu dambeysa iyo inta maalmood oo u dhexeeya tijaabinta. Qor Waqti-aagga: magac sida America/Mexico_City, ama farqiga UTC sida -6. Magac wuxuu raacaa sharciyada waqtiga iftiinka ee maalinta; farqiga aad qortay waxaa loo isticmaalaa sida aad qortay, sidaas darteed isticmaal kan ku jira maalintaas. Khadka ku hoos sanduuqa wuxuu kuu sheegayaa farqiga uu helay. Dooro inta jeer ee qorraxda la dhigo (5, 10, 15 ama 30 daqiiqo), kadibna Xisaabi saacadaha qorraxda. Xilli wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa shaqaalaha asalka ah (background); Jooji wuu joojiyaa. Waxa aad hesho Miis ka kala jirka: gidaarka ugu xun, celceliska, iyo gidaarka ugu fiican, saacad maalintii, iyo miis gidaar kasta oo ah jihada uu u jeedo iyo saacadihiisa dabaq kasta. Dhulka ku wareegsan jirarka, lagu muujiyo khariidadda midab madow (qorrax la'aan) ilaa jaalle (ugu badnaan unug kasta helo), iyo furaha. Meelaha hoostaga jirarka waa banaan. Muuji dhulka khariidadda ayaa damiya. Gidaarada CSV iyo Dhulka CSV ayaa kaydiya tirooyinka. Xilli ahaan, tirooyinka waa celceliska maalintii ee maalmaha la tijaabiyay. Waxba mashruuca ma kaydsana: natiijadu waa mid la eego, mar kale la socodsiiyo mar kale ayaa la sameeyaa. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado Gidaar wuxuu u tirinayaa daqiiqad inay qorrax leedahay kaliya marka ay u jeedo qorraxda oo aanu wax ka xannibayn. Gidaar u jeeda dhinac ka soo jeeda qorraxda ma helo waxba. Dhulka waxaa lagu tijaabiyaa shabakad ku xidhan cabirka goobta, iyo booska qorraxda bartamaha kala-soo-dhawaanshaha kasta, sidaas darteed saacadaha waa sax ilaa xaddiga kala-soo-dhawaanshaha aad doorato. Booska qorraxda waa qaacido astronomi oo la daabacay, oo sax u ah ilaa hal daqiiqad qaws (minute of arc).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"watercraft","scope":"civilcraft","title":"WaterCraft: baahiyaha, socodka dab-damin, shaqo-joogsiga iyo da'da biyaha","summary":"Add-on-ka WaterCraft ku beddel macaamiisha baahiyo shabakadda tuubooyinka biyahaaga, hubi socodka u dhexeeya hydrant kasta, arag xariiqa joojinta ee ugu dhaawacda, oo raac da'da biyaha iyo kloriinta maalin dhexdeeda.","section":"tasks","order":99,"keywords":["watercraft","qaybinta biyaha","baahiyo","macaamiil","factor-ka kororka","habka baahiyaha","socodka dab-damin","hydrant","cadaadiska hadhaaga","khatarta","shaqo-joogsi","qayb valve leh","da'da biyaha","kloriin","hadhaaga","raadinta isha","dhamaad xidhan","csv","add-on"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"xusuusin","text":"Xusuusin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWaterCraft waa add-on oo shaqeeya shabakadda biyaha ee horay u sawirtay qalabka Tuubooyinka biyaha. Waxa uu ku daraa tab garabka midig oo leh afar qaybood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab xisaabin oo keliya. Waxa lagu hubiyay jawaabo gacanta ah shabakado la sameeyay, ma aha model dhab ah oo shirkad biyo ah. Injineer biyo ah ayaa hal natiijo kasta hubin kara. Xaaladaha, xeerarka xakamaynta, valve-yada iyo akhrinta goobta mawduucyo gaar ah bay leeyihiin, &quot;Xaaladaha&quot; iyo &quot;Daraasadaha&quot;, caawinta add-on-ka WaterCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMacaamiisha ku dhig shabakadda baahi ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHydrant-yada ka yar socodka aad u baahan tahay ka hel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuubooyinka khasaarahoodu ugu muhiimsan ka hel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBiyaha duugga ah iyo kloriinta hooseysa ka hel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E oo shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaterCraft (qaybinta biyaha)\u003C/span\u003E. Tab \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaterCraft\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka soo muuqanaya garabka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka hore kaydka, isgoysyada iyo tuubooyinka qalabka Tuubooyinka biyaha ku sawir (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/water-mains\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/water-mains\"\u003ETuubooyinka biyaha\u003C/a\u003E). Shabakad la&#039;aantii tab-ku wuxuu kugu sheegaa inaad taas samayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBaahiyaha\u003C/span\u003E, ku dheji mid kasta macaamil safafkiisa kasta: aqoonsi, x, y, nooc, qadar. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirada kororka ugu sarreeya\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka saacadlaha\u003C/span\u003E (maalinta deegaanka, maalinta ganacsiga, siman, ama ku hay habka sidiisa). Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto macaamil kasta meesha uu ku dhacayo (isgoysha ugu dhow), kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli shabakadda\u003C/span\u003E. Ka noqo ayaa baahiyaha dib u qaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocodka dab-damin\u003C/span\u003E, dejii socodka loo baahan yahay iyo cadaadiska hadhaaga, dooro haddii hadhaaga la hayo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHydrant-ka keliya\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeel kasta nidaamka ku jira (adag)\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E. Hydrant kasta waxa lagu liistaa kan ugu xumaa marka hore, sida buuxsamay ama gaaban.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubada ugu muhiimsan\u003C/span\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ehal tuubo mar kasta\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ehal qayb oo valve leh mar kasta\u003C/span\u003E kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E. Shaqo-joogsi kasta wuxuu tusaa baahiga la gooyey, isgoysyada la gooyey, isgoysyada cusub ee cadaadiska hoose ee ugu yar, iyo cadaadiska ugu hooseeya ee hadhay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDa&#039;da biyaha iyo kloriinta\u003C/span\u003E, dooro wixii la raaco (da&#039;da biyaha, kloriinta ama raadinta isha), dejii saacadaha la shaqeeyo iyo xadka aad rabto, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E. Isgoysyada xadkaaga ka baxsan ayaa la liistaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida CSV\u003C/span\u003E hoosta miis kasta si aad u kaydiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xusuusin\"\u003EXusuusin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESocodka dab-damin ee loo baahan yahay iyo isticmaalka guri kasta ama acre kasta waa qiyam bilow ah, ma aha heer caadi. Isticmaal lambarada shirkaddaada biyaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuubo qayb ka mid ah valve-ku gooyey waa la xidhaa oo dhan, sidaas darteed shaqo-joogsiga la muujiyey wuxuu ka xun yahay wax yar oo dhabta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta tayada biyaha ku shaqee wakhti ku filan habka maalinta inuu soo noqnoqdo ka hor intaadan akhrin maalinta ugu dambeysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhamaystiraa shaqo dheer hore; liiska markaas wuxuu tusaa wixii la sameeyay oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShabakaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa mashruucan iyo kombiyuutarkan. Waxba meel uma dirmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"WaterCraft waa add-on oo shaqeeya shabakadda biyaha ee horay u sawirtay qalabka Tuubooyinka biyaha. Waxa uu ku daraa tab garabka midig oo leh afar qaybood. Qalab xisaabin oo keliya. Waxa lagu hubiyay jawaabo gacanta ah shabakado la sameeyay, ma aha model dhab ah oo shirkad biyo ah. Injineer biyo ah ayaa hal natiijo kasta hubin kara. Xaaladaha, xeerarka xakamaynta, valve-yada iyo akhrinta goobta mawduucyo gaar ah bay leeyihiin, \"Xaaladaha\" iyo \"Daraasadaha\", caawinta add-on-ka WaterCraft. Waxa aad samayn doontid Macaamiisha ku dhig shabakadda baahi ahaan. Hydrant-yada ka yar socodka aad u baahan tahay ka hel. Tuubooyinka khasaarahoodu ugu muhiimsan ka hel. Biyaha duugga ah iyo kloriinta hooseysa ka hel. Tallaabooyinka Ka fur Dejinta › Kordhinno oo shid WaterCraft (qaybinta biyaha). Tab WaterCraft ayaa ka soo muuqanaya garabka midig. Marka hore kaydka, isgoysyada iyo tuubooyinka qalabka Tuubooyinka biyaha ku sawir (eeg Tuubooyinka biyaha). Shabakad la'aantii tab-ku wuxuu kugu sheegaa inaad taas samayso. Hoosta Baahiyaha, ku dheji mid kasta macaamil safafkiisa kasta: aqoonsi, x, y, nooc, qadar. Dooro Tirada kororka ugu sarreeya iyo Habka saacadlaha (maalinta deegaanka, maalinta ganacsiga, siman, ama ku hay habka sidiisa). Riix Hubi si aad u aragto macaamil kasta meesha uu ku dhacayo (isgoysha ugu dhow), kadibna Geli shabakadda. Ka noqo ayaa baahiyaha dib u qaadaa. Hoosta Socodka dab-damin, dejii socodka loo baahan yahay iyo cadaadiska hadhaaga, dooro haddii hadhaaga la hayo Hydrant-ka keliya ama Meel kasta nidaamka ku jira (adag), kadibna riix Dherer. Hydrant kasta waxa lagu liistaa kan ugu xumaa marka hore, sida buuxsamay ama gaaban. Hoosta Tuubada ugu muhiimsan, dooro hal tuubo mar kasta ama hal qayb oo valve leh mar kasta kadibna riix Dherer. Shaqo-joogsi kasta wuxuu tusaa baahiga la gooyey, isgoysyada la gooyey, isgoysyada cusub ee cadaadiska hoose ee ugu yar, iyo cadaadiska ugu hooseeya ee hadhay. Hoosta Da'da biyaha iyo kloriinta, dooro wixii la raaco (da'da biyaha, kloriinta ama raadinta isha), dejii saacadaha la shaqeeyo iyo xadka aad rabto, kadibna riix Dherer. Isgoysyada xadkaaga ka baxsan ayaa la liistaa. Riix Kaydi sida CSV hoosta miis kasta si aad u kaydiso. Xusuusin Socodka dab-damin ee loo baahan yahay iyo isticmaalka guri kasta ama acre kasta waa qiyam bilow ah, ma aha heer caadi. Isticmaal lambarada shirkaddaada biyaha. Tuubo qayb ka mid ah valve-ku gooyey waa la xidhaa oo dhan, sidaas darteed shaqo-joogsiga la muujiyey wuxuu ka xun yahay wax yar oo dhabta ah. Qaybta tayada biyaha ku shaqee wakhti ku filan habka maalinta inuu soo noqnoqdo ka hor intaadan akhrin maalinta ugu dambeysa. Jooji wuxuu dhamaystiraa shaqo dheer hore; liiska markaas wuxuu tusaa wixii la sameeyay oo keliya. Shabakaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa mashruucan iyo kombiyuutarkan. Waxba meel uma dirmo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"landxml","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Isweydaarsashada LandXML","summary":"Ka fur LandXML ka software kale oo civil ah sida mashruuc cusub, dhoofi barooyinka, dusha, toosinta, muuqaalka iyo shabakada tuubooyinka sida LandXML 1.2, oo ogow waxa aan ka dhicin safarka.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["landxml","xml","soo-geli","dhoofin","isweydaarsasho","tin","dusha","toosin","muuqaalka","shabakada tuubooyinka","is-kaashi","isweydaarsashada xogta"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-fayl-landxml","text":"Fur fayl LandXML","level":2},{"id":"dhoofi-landxml","text":"Dhoofi LandXML","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-ka-dhicin-safarka","text":"Waxa aan ka dhicin safarka","level":2},{"id":"wareegyada","text":"Wareegyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELandXML waa qaab furan oo isweydaarsasho oo barnaamijyada civil ee badankood akhriyaan oo qoraan. CivilCraft wuxuu akhriyaa oo qoraa LandXML 1.2. Haddii aad Civil 3D isticmaashay, daaqadaha soo-geli iyo dhoofinta LandXML-ka ayaa ku dhow. Halkan ma jiraan doorasho aad sameyso; faahfaahinta ayaa kuu sheegaysa waxa laga reebay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-fayl-landxml\"\u003EFur fayl LandXML\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo dooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.xml\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.landxml\u003C/code\u003E, ama ku ridi qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii mashruuca hadda jira uu leeyahay isbeddel aan la kaydin, CivilCraft ayaa marka hore weydiin doona. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave a copy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDon’t save\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruuc cusub\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa la sameeyaa. Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa la akhriyay, tusaale ahaan &quot;Waa la furay site.xml: 412 barood, 2 dusha, 3 toosin.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg sanduuqa ku hoos jira xogta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu liistaa wax kasta oo la reebay ama la beddelay, tusaale ahaan:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Dusha koowaad (&quot;EG&quot;) oo keliya ayaa la furay; faylka waxa uu leeyahay 1 oo kale.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Toosinta &quot;Ramp A&quot; waxa ku jira elementiyo CivilCraft aan weli xariiq ahaan u sawiri karin (ma aha xariiqyo, qaansoyo ama spiral-yo clothoid ah); waa la reebay.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Xeerarka shabakada tuubooyinka ma ku jirin faylka; placeholder-yada ayaa la isticmaalayaa — dejiso kaaga Mashruuca ku jira.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa noqda waxa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka gudihiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECivilCraft gudihiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit-yada (Imperial ama Metric)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnit-yada\u003C/strong\u003E mashruuca (cagaha ama mitirka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECgPoints\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyinka mashruuca; sharraxaadda (ama code-ka) waxay bixisaa kooxda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETIN-ka koowaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka jira, sida uu yahay (&quot;Surface (from LandXML)&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToosin kasta oo xariiqyo, qaansoyo iyo clothoid spirals\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToosin leh PI-yadeeda, radius-yadeeda iyo dhererka spiral-ka dib loo dhisay curve-yada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka naqshadda ee koowaad ee toosin kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka naqshaddiisa, leh dhuuntada parabolic-ka ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakada koowaad ee tuubooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakada tuubooyinka, oo leh rim-yadeeda, sump-yadeeda iyo invert-yadeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhad muuqaalka xariiqyada iyo qaansoyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka muuqaalka, qaansoyada oo la xaajiyay; kuwa app kale ka yimid waxay ku bilaabmaan \u003Cstrong\u003EKaliya la sawiray\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska buuxa ee elementiyada iyo sifooyinka waa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landxml-reference\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landxml-reference\"\u003ELandXML: waxa la akhriyo oo la qoro\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha laga akhriyay LandXML lama dib u dhisin marka aad beddesho kooxaha barooyinka ama aad xariiqyo jaajuul ah sawirto. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERebuild the surface from the points\u003C/span\u003E qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E si aad uga dhisto barooyinka halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd (ayaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E soo celinaysa dusha LandXML).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofi-landxml\"\u003EDhoofi LandXML\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandXML\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofinta\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrowser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.xml\u003C/code\u003E. Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa gudihiisa galay, tusaale ahaan &quot;Waa la dhoofiyay LandXML 1.2: 276 barood, 2 dusha, 1 toosin, shabakada tuubooyinka. Pad-yada ma ku jiraan LandXML halkan; dusha sare-u-qaadan ayaa ku jira.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylku wuxuu leeyahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnit-yada\u003C/strong\u003E: cagaha survey-ka Mareykanka ama mitirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECgPoints\u003C/strong\u003E: barta kasta oo lambarkeeda magac u ah, sharraxaaddeeda iyo kooxdeeda code u ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESurfaces\u003C/strong\u003E: dhulka jira sida TIN, oo leh xariiqyadiisa jajabka iyo xuduudka dibadda sida xogta isha; iyo, marka pad-yada ama corridor-yada sare-u-qaadaan, dusha TIN ee labaad oo lagu magacaabay &quot;Proposed&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlignments\u003C/strong\u003E: xariiqyo, qaansoyo iyo clothoid spirals oo leh stations-kooda, mid kasta leh muuqaal ku jira dhulka jira ee la tusaalayo iyo muuqaalka naqshadda (PVI-yada iyo dhuuntada parabolic-ka) marka uu leeyahay ugu yaraan laba PVI.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPipeNetworks\u003C/strong\u003E: qalabka oo leh rim-yadooda, sump-yadooda iyo invert tuubo kasta, iyo tuubooyinka oo leh diameter, dherer iyo slope.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPlanFeatures\u003C/strong\u003E: khad muuqaal kasta oo ah xariiqyo iyo qaansoyo oo leh dhererka dhammaadka kasta iyo waxa loo isticmaalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-ka-dhicin-safarka\"\u003EWaxa aan ka dhicin safarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPad-yada iyo corridor-yada sida shay. Natiijadooda waxay ku jirtaa dusha &quot;Proposed&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToosinta leh khaladaad (tusaale ahaan qaansoyo isku-dhacaya): waa la reebay, waxaana lagu tiriyaa fariinta status-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuubooyinka aan labada invert lahayn, iyo shabakadaha ka yar laba qalab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERim-ka laga qaatay dusha waxa loo qoraa rim go&#039;an. Marka dib loo furo, qalabku wuxuu hayaa lambaraas xitaa haddii dusha isbeddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXeerarka shabakada (slope-ka ugu yar, daboolka, hoos-u-dhicid): LandXML ma leh meel loogu talagalay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejinta muuqaalka iyo doorashooyinka dusha ee kooxaha barooyinka: u kaydi mashruuca CivilCraft sidaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka la furayo, CivilCraft ma akhrin karo spiral-yo aan clothoid ahayn, dusha grid-ka, barooyin kaliya tixraacaya barooyin kale, parcels, spiral-yo khad muuqaal ah, roadways ama xogta sahanka. Mid kasta waa la xusayaa fariimaha, waana aan la male-awaaynin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wareegyada\"\u003EWareegyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad shaqada u siiso qof isticmaalaya software civil kale oo aad mar kale hesho, dhoofi LandXML, ha u sahlo inuu tafatiro, kadibna fur LandXML-kiisa sida mashruuc cusub. Sii hay \u003Ccode\u003E.civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E adigu, sababtoo ah waa faylka keliya ee wax kasta oo CivilCraft yaqaan kaydiya.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"LandXML waa qaab furan oo isweydaarsasho oo barnaamijyada civil ee badankood akhriyaan oo qoraan. CivilCraft wuxuu akhriyaa oo qoraa LandXML 1.2. Haddii aad Civil 3D isticmaashay, daaqadaha soo-geli iyo dhoofinta LandXML-ka ayaa ku dhow. Halkan ma jiraan doorasho aad sameyso; faahfaahinta ayaa kuu sheegaysa waxa laga reebay. Fur fayl LandXML Guji Open (ama riix Ctrl+O) oo dooro faylka .xml ama .landxml, ama ku ridi qorshaha. Haddii mashruuca hadda jira uu leeyahay isbeddel aan la kaydin, CivilCraft ayaa marka hore weydiin doona. Dooro Save a copy, Don’t save ama Cancel. Mashruuc cusub ayaa la sameeyaa. Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa la akhriyay, tusaale ahaan \"Waa la furay site.xml: 412 barood, 2 dusha, 3 toosin.\" Eeg sanduuqa ku hoos jira xogta Dusha. Wuxuu liistaa wax kasta oo la reebay ama la beddelay, tusaale ahaan: \"Dusha koowaad (\"EG\") oo keliya ayaa la furay; faylka waxa uu leeyahay 1 oo kale.\" \"Toosinta \"Ramp A\" waxa ku jira elementiyo CivilCraft aan weli xariiq ahaan u sawiri karin (ma aha xariiqyo, qaansoyo ama spiral-yo clothoid ah); waa la reebay.\" \"Xeerarka shabakada tuubooyinka ma ku jirin faylka; placeholder-yada ayaa la isticmaalayaa — dejiso kaaga Mashruuca ku jira.\" Waxa noqda waxa: Faylka gudihiisa CivilCraft gudihiisa Unit-yada (Imperial ama Metric) Unit-yada mashruuca (cagaha ama mitirka) Magaca mashruuca Magaca mashruuca CgPoints Barooyinka mashruuca; sharraxaadda (ama code-ka) waxay bixisaa kooxda TIN-ka koowaad Dhulka jira, sida uu yahay (\"Surface (from LandXML)\") Toosin kasta oo xariiqyo, qaansoyo iyo clothoid spirals Toosin leh PI-yadeeda, radius-yadeeda iyo dhererka spiral-ka dib loo dhisay curve-yada Muuqaalka naqshadda ee koowaad ee toosin kasta Muuqaalka naqshaddiisa, leh dhuuntada parabolic-ka ah Shabakada koowaad ee tuubooyinka Shabakada tuubooyinka, oo leh rim-yadeeda, sump-yadeeda iyo invert-yadeeda Khad muuqaalka xariiqyada iyo qaansoyada Khadadka muuqaalka, qaansoyada oo la xaajiyay; kuwa app kale ka yimid waxay ku bilaabmaan Kaliya la sawiray Liiska buuxa ee elementiyada iyo sifooyinka waa ku jira LandXML: waxa la akhriyo oo la qoro. Dusha laga akhriyay LandXML lama dib u dhisin marka aad beddesho kooxaha barooyinka ama aad xariiqyo jaajuul ah sawirto. Guji Rebuild the surface from the points qaybta Dusha si aad uga dhisto barooyinka halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd (ayaa Ctrl+Z soo celinaysa dusha LandXML). Dhoofi LandXML Guji LandXML kooxda Dhoofinta. Browser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cname\u003E.xml. Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa gudihiisa galay, tusaale ahaan \"Waa la dhoofiyay LandXML 1.2: 276 barood, 2 dusha, 1 toosin, shabakada tuubooyinka. Pad-yada ma ku jiraan LandXML halkan; dusha sare-u-qaadan ayaa ku jira.\" Faylku wuxuu leeyahay: Unit-yada: cagaha survey-ka Mareykanka ama mitirka. CgPoints: barta kasta oo lambarkeeda magac u ah, sharraxaaddeeda iyo kooxdeeda code u ah. Surfaces: dhulka jira sida TIN, oo leh xariiqyadiisa jajabka iyo xuduudka dibadda sida xogta isha; iyo, marka pad-yada ama corridor-yada sare-u-qaadaan, dusha TIN ee labaad oo lagu magacaabay \"Proposed\". Alignments: xariiqyo, qaansoyo iyo clothoid spirals oo leh stations-kooda, mid kasta leh muuqaal ku jira dhulka jira ee la tusaalayo iyo muuqaalka naqshadda (PVI-yada iyo dhuuntada parabolic-ka) marka uu leeyahay ugu yaraan laba PVI. PipeNetworks: qalabka oo leh rim-yadooda, sump-yadooda iyo invert tuubo kasta, iyo tuubooyinka oo leh diameter, dherer iyo slope. PlanFeatures: khad muuqaal kasta oo ah xariiqyo iyo qaansoyo oo leh dhererka dhammaadka kasta iyo waxa loo isticmaalo. Waxa aan ka dhicin safarka Pad-yada iyo corridor-yada sida shay. Natiijadooda waxay ku jirtaa dusha \"Proposed\". Toosinta leh khaladaad (tusaale ahaan qaansoyo isku-dhacaya): waa la reebay, waxaana lagu tiriyaa fariinta status-ka. Tuubooyinka aan labada invert lahayn, iyo shabakadaha ka yar laba qalab. Rim-ka laga qaatay dusha waxa loo qoraa rim go'an. Marka dib loo furo, qalabku wuxuu hayaa lambaraas xitaa haddii dusha isbeddesho. Xeerarka shabakada (slope-ka ugu yar, daboolka, hoos-u-dhicid): LandXML ma leh meel loogu talagalay. Dejinta muuqaalka iyo doorashooyinka dusha ee kooxaha barooyinka: u kaydi mashruuca CivilCraft sidaas. Marka la furayo, CivilCraft ma akhrin karo spiral-yo aan clothoid ahayn, dusha grid-ka, barooyin kaliya tixraacaya barooyin kale, parcels, spiral-yo khad muuqaal ah, roadways ama xogta sahanka. Mid kasta waa la xusayaa fariimaha, waana aan la male-awaaynin. Wareegyada Si aad shaqada u siiso qof isticmaalaya software civil kale oo aad mar kale hesho, dhoofi LandXML, ha u sahlo inuu tafatiro, kadibna fur LandXML-kiisa sida mashruuc cusub. Sii hay .civilcraft.json adigu, sababtoo ah waa faylka keliya ee wax kasta oo CivilCraft yaqaan kaydiya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dxf-export","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhoofi qorshaha DXF","summary":"Ku qor xarriiqyada qorshaha DXF R12 ah oo leh lakabyo magac leh, kontuurada heerarkooda, iyo xarriiqyada jabinta 3D, si barnaamij CAD kasta u akhrin karo.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["dxf","dwg","cad","dhoofin","xarriiqyo","r12","2000","2004","2007","2010","2013","2018","lakabyo","kontuur","isweydaarsiga naqshadaha","khariidadda asaasiga ah","asal"],"headings":[{"id":"dhoofin","text":"Dhoofin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-jira-faylka","text":"Waxa ku jira faylka","level":2},{"id":"cabbirka-calaamadaha","text":"Cabbirka calaamadaha","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-lagu-dhoofin","text":"Waxa aan lagu dhoofin","level":2},{"id":"dwg","text":"DWG","level":2},{"id":"lakabyada-khariidadda-ee-dwg-ga","text":"Lakabyada khariidadda ee DWG-ga","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa waxa qorshuhu muujinayo oo ah fayl DXF, qaabka R12, kaas oo barnaamij CAD kasta furi karo. Haddii aad AutoCAD ama Civil 3D isticmaashay, u fur ama geli sida aad DXF kasta u furi lahayd.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofin\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshaha u deji sida naqshadda aad rabto: hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dusha (jirta ama la soo jeediyay), fogaanta kontuurka, iyo waxyaabaha la daaro (kontuurada, calaamadaha, barooyinka, calaamadaha barooyinka, saddexagallada, xarriiqyada jabinta, cidhifka dusha, tuubooyinka, falaarta jiifka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG/DXF\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF (R12, qoraal) — faylka isweydaarsiga fudud\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrowser-ka wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.dxf\u003C/code\u003E. Status bar-ka wuxuu tusaale ahaan sheegaa &quot;Waa la dhoofiyay DXF R12: 2,140 shay; calaamadaha loo cabbiray 1&quot; = 40&#039;&quot;. Heerarka dhererka lama dhoofin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-xidhka waxaa lagu qoraa unugyada mashruucaaga, qiimayaashooda dhabta ah (isku-xidhka state plane wuxuu sidiisa ku sii jiraa). Waxba lama cabbiro ama lama guuro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-jira-faylka\"\u003EWaxa ku jira faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EShay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnuga DXF\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELakab\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurada yar iyo kuwa weyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn 2D oo heerkooda ku jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-MINR, C-TOPO-MAJR\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha kontuurka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-TEXT\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddexagallada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-TINN\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiqyada jabinta iyo xadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-BRKL\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECidhifka dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-BNDY\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFalaarta jiifka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-SLOP\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyinka sahanka iyo calaamadahooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyin (oo leh dhererka), qoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EV-NODE, V-NODE-TEXT\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiqyada koodhadhka xarriiqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EV-NODE-LINE\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexe-xarriiqyada khadka waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiqyo iyo qaansooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-CNTR\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha istaashiyanka iyo calaamadahooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn, qoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-STAN\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECidhifyada koridorka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-CORR\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiqyada muunadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-SCTN\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPadyada, xarriiqyada iftiinka dhulka, xarriiqyada jiifka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-GRAD-PADS, C-GRAD-DAYL, C-GRAD-SLOP\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/feature-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/feature-lines\"\u003EXarriiqyada muhiimka ah\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn 3D (qaansooyinka qaybo ku jira 0.01 dhexdooda; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/feature-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/feature-lines\"\u003EXarriiqyada muhiimka ah\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-GRAD-FEAT\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaddooyinka wareegga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn, qoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-SWPT\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka, qaab-dhismeedyada, calaamadahooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn, qoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-STRM-PIPE, C-STRM-STRC, C-STRM-TEXT\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismeedyada dhibaato leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolilayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-STRM-PROB\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELakab walba midab baa leh. Liistada oo dhan waxay ku jirtaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plan-layers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plan-layers\"\u003ELakabyada qorshaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirka-calaamadaha\"\u003ECabbirka calaamadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoraalku waa inuu leeyahay cabbir unugyada naqshadda. CivilCraft wuxuu u cabbiraa calaamadaha miisaanka uu qorshaha oo dhan ku habboon yahay xaashi Tabloid ah (fiit) ama xaashi A3 ah (mitir), wuxuuna sheegaa miisaanka fariinta status-ka. Haddii aad miisaan kale ku daabacdo barnaamijka CAD-kaaga, qoraalka halkaas miisaan ku samee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-lagu-dhoofin\"\u003EWaxa aan lagu dhoofin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHeerarka dhererka (shaashadda kaliya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka profile-ka. Profile-yada waxa lagu dhoofiyaa LandXML, mana aha naqshad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha laftiisa oo ah shay 3D. Isticmaal LandXML si aad TIN-ka u hesho, ama shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETriangles\u003C/span\u003E si aad cidhifkeeda xarriiqyo ugu hesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax kasta oo aad ku damisay hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dwg\"\u003EDWG\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG/DXF\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xarriiqyada isku mid ah sidoo kale u qoraa naqshad DWG ah. Wadahadalkeeda wuxuu weydiinayaa qaabka: DXF, ama DWG 2000, 2004, 2007, 2010, 2013 ama 2018. 2000 waxay furmaa barnaamijyada CAD ee badankood, kuwa duq iyo kuwa cusub. Dooro mid cusub markii qofka helaya naqshadda uu weydiisto. Doorashadaada browser-kan ayaa lagu xasuustaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EFormat\u003C/strong\u003E oo riix \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload DWG\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrowser-ka wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.dwg\u003C/code\u003E. Status bar-ka wuxuu sheegaa waxa gashay, tusaale ahaan &quot;Waa la dhoofiyay DWG (qaabka 2018): 12 polilayn, 40 calaamad oo ku jira 9 lakab&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDWG-ga wuxuu leeyahay lakabyada isku mid ah, midabyada, kontuurada (sida polilayn heerkooda), xarriiqyada jabinta 3D, calaamadaha iyo barooyinka DXF-ka oo kale, iyo isku-xidhka isku mid ah. Magacyada lakabka oo DWG aanu qaadi karin waa la beddelaa, fariinta status-ka ayaa sheegta. CivilCraft wuxuu DWG ku qoraa koodkiisa, markaasna wax kastaba kumbiyuutarkaaga kama baxaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"lakabyada-khariidadda-ee-dwg-ga\"\u003ELakabyada khariidadda ee DWG-ga\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshad DWG ah sawir gudaheeda kuma qaadi karto: barnaamijyada CAD waxay muujiyaan sawir u taagan naqshadda dhinaceeda. Marka lakabyada khariidaddu muuqdaan, wadahadalku wuxuu soo jeedinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada khariidadda sida sawir naqshadda dhinaceeda\u003C/strong\u003E. Marka la calaamadiyo, soo dejintu waa \u003Ccode\u003E.zip\u003C/code\u003E ku jira \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.dwg\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;-map.png\u003C/code\u003E (lakabyada khariidadda naqshadda oo dhan dushooda, ilaa 4,096 pikseel ballaadhka) iyo \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;-map.pgw\u003C/code\u003E (faylka adduunka, barnaamijyada GIS). Naqshaddu sawirka wuxuu u muujinayaa sida sawir ku jira lakabka G-MAP-IMAG, meeshiisa. Faylasha ku fur hal gal, oo isku hay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"DXF wuxuu qoraa waxa qorshuhu muujinayo oo ah fayl DXF, qaabka R12, kaas oo barnaamij CAD kasta furi karo. Haddii aad AutoCAD ama Civil 3D isticmaashay, u fur ama geli sida aad DXF kasta u furi lahayd. Dhoofin Qorshaha u deji sida naqshadda aad rabto: hoos Bandhig dooro dusha (jirta ama la soo jeediyay), fogaanta kontuurka, iyo waxyaabaha la daaro (kontuurada, calaamadaha, barooyinka, calaamadaha barooyinka, saddexagallada, xarriiqyada jabinta, cidhifka dusha, tuubooyinka, falaarta jiifka). Riix DWG/DXF kooxda Dhoofi oo dooro DXF (R12, qoraal) — faylka isweydaarsiga fudud, kadibna Download. Browser-ka wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cname\u003E.dxf. Status bar-ka wuxuu tusaale ahaan sheegaa \"Waa la dhoofiyay DXF R12: 2,140 shay; calaamadaha loo cabbiray 1\" = 40'\". Heerarka dhererka lama dhoofin. Isku-xidhka waxaa lagu qoraa unugyada mashruucaaga, qiimayaashooda dhabta ah (isku-xidhka state plane wuxuu sidiisa ku sii jiraa). Waxba lama cabbiro ama lama guuro. Waxa ku jira faylka Shay Unuga DXF Lakab Kontuurada yar iyo kuwa weyn Polilayn 2D oo heerkooda ku jira C-TOPO-MINR, C-TOPO-MAJR Calaamadaha kontuurka Qoraal C-TOPO-TEXT Saddexagallada Polilayn C-TOPO-TINN Xarriiqyada jabinta iyo xadka Polilayn 3D C-TOPO-BRKL Cidhifka dusha Polilayn C-TOPO-BNDY Falaarta jiifka Polilayn C-TOPO-SLOP Barooyinka sahanka iyo calaamadahooda Barooyin (oo leh dhererka), qoraal V-NODE, V-NODE-TEXT Xarriiqyada koodhadhka xarriiqa Polilayn 3D V-NODE-LINE Dhexe-xarriiqyada khadka waddada Xarriiqyo iyo qaansooyin C-ROAD-CNTR Calaamadaha istaashiyanka iyo calaamadahooda Polilayn, qoraal C-ROAD-STAN Cidhifyada koridorka Polilayn C-ROAD-CORR Xarriiqyada muunadda Polilayn C-ROAD-SCTN Padyada, xarriiqyada iftiinka dhulka, xarriiqyada jiifka Polilayn C-GRAD-PADS, C-GRAD-DAYL, C-GRAD-SLOP Xarriiqyada muhiimka ah Polilayn 3D (qaansooyinka qaybo ku jira 0.01 dhexdooda; eeg Xarriiqyada muhiimka ah) C-GRAD-FEAT Waddooyinka wareegga Polilayn, qoraal C-ROAD-SWPT Tuubooyinka, qaab-dhismeedyada, calaamadahooda Polilayn, qoraal C-STRM-PIPE, C-STRM-STRC, C-STRM-TEXT Tuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismeedyada dhibaato leh Polilayn C-STRM-PROB Lakab walba midab baa leh. Liistada oo dhan waxay ku jirtaa Lakabyada qorshaha. Cabbirka calaamadaha Qoraalku waa inuu leeyahay cabbir unugyada naqshadda. CivilCraft wuxuu u cabbiraa calaamadaha miisaanka uu qorshaha oo dhan ku habboon yahay xaashi Tabloid ah (fiit) ama xaashi A3 ah (mitir), wuxuuna sheegaa miisaanka fariinta status-ka. Haddii aad miisaan kale ku daabacdo barnaamijka CAD-kaaga, qoraalka halkaas miisaan ku samee. Waxa aan lagu dhoofin Heerarka dhererka (shaashadda kaliya). Muuqaalka profile-ka. Profile-yada waxa lagu dhoofiyaa LandXML, mana aha naqshad. Dusha laftiisa oo ah shay 3D. Isticmaal LandXML si aad TIN-ka u hesho, ama shid Triangles si aad cidhifkeeda xarriiqyo ugu hesho. Wax kasta oo aad ku damisay hoos Bandhig. DWG DWG/DXF wuxuu xarriiqyada isku mid ah sidoo kale u qoraa naqshad DWG ah. Wadahadalkeeda wuxuu weydiinayaa qaabka: DXF, ama DWG 2000, 2004, 2007, 2010, 2013 ama 2018. 2000 waxay furmaa barnaamijyada CAD ee badankood, kuwa duq iyo kuwa cusub. Dooro mid cusub markii qofka helaya naqshadda uu weydiisto. Doorashadaada browser-kan ayaa lagu xasuustaa. Riix DWG kooxda Dhoofi. Dooro Format oo riix Download DWG. Browser-ka wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cname\u003E.dwg. Status bar-ka wuxuu sheegaa waxa gashay, tusaale ahaan \"Waa la dhoofiyay DWG (qaabka 2018): 12 polilayn, 40 calaamad oo ku jira 9 lakab\". DWG-ga wuxuu leeyahay lakabyada isku mid ah, midabyada, kontuurada (sida polilayn heerkooda), xarriiqyada jabinta 3D, calaamadaha iyo barooyinka DXF-ka oo kale, iyo isku-xidhka isku mid ah. Magacyada lakabka oo DWG aanu qaadi karin waa la beddelaa, fariinta status-ka ayaa sheegta. CivilCraft wuxuu DWG ku qoraa koodkiisa, markaasna wax kastaba kumbiyuutarkaaga kama baxaan. Lakabyada khariidadda ee DWG-ga Naqshad DWG ah sawir gudaheeda kuma qaadi karto: barnaamijyada CAD waxay muujiyaan sawir u taagan naqshadda dhinaceeda. Marka lakabyada khariidaddu muuqdaan, wadahadalku wuxuu soo jeedinayaa Lakabyada khariidadda sida sawir naqshadda dhinaceeda. Marka la calaamadiyo, soo dejintu waa .zip ku jira \u003Cname\u003E.dwg, \u003Cname\u003E-map.png (lakabyada khariidadda naqshadda oo dhan dushooda, ilaa 4,096 pikseel ballaadhka) iyo \u003Cname\u003E-map.pgw (faylka adduunka, barnaamijyada GIS). Naqshaddu sawirka wuxuu u muujinayaa sida sawir ku jira lakabka G-MAP-IMAG, meeshiisa. Faylasha ku fur hal gal, oo isku hay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"units-on-import","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Unugyada markii la soo dhoofinayo: faylku wuxuu sheegaa unugyadiisa, ama waa la weydiinayaa marka hore","summary":"Marka sawir ama mesh aad keentid mashruuc uu sheegayo unugyadiisa, CivilCraft wuu beddelaa oo wuu sheegaa. Marka aanu sheegin, CivilCraft wuu weydiiyaa ka hor intaanu akhrin, wuuna xasuusanayaa jawaabtaada faylkaas.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["unugyo","soo dhoofin","DWG","DXF","STL","OBJ","sahan dhul","feet","US survey feet","mitirro","millimitir","miisaan","cabbir khaldan","weyn","yar","weydii","la xasuusto","INSUNITS","unugyada sawirka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"faylasha-sheegaya-unugyadooda","text":"Faylasha sheegaya unugyadooda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka mashruuc gelii oo ka dhig inuu yimaado cabbirka saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur faylka sida caadiga ah: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E, dhig faylka sawirka, ama amarka sawirka CAD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii faylku sheegayo unugyadiisa, wax lama weydiinayo: sanduuqa soo dhoofinta wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EAs the drawing says\u003C/strong\u003E (sida sawirku sheegayo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aanu sheegin, sanduuq wuxuu weydiinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada\u003C/strong\u003E faylka ka hor intaanu furmin sanduuqa soo dhoofinta. Dooro waxa hal unug uu ka yahay faylka oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal cutubyadan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuu dhaafaa faylka. Waxba ka mid ah lama akhrinayo mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-sheegaya-unugyadooda\"\u003EFaylasha sheegaya unugyadooda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG iyo DXF\u003C/strong\u003E: unugyada geli-goobta sawirka (\u003Ccode\u003E$INSUNITS\u003C/code\u003E). Fayl aan lahayn waa la weydiinayaa. Liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EDrawing units\u003C/strong\u003E ee sanduuqa soo dhoofinta wuxuu ka bilaabmaa jawaabtaada, wuuna beddeli karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTL iyo OBJ\u003C/strong\u003E (qaabab dhulka xor ah): weligood ma sheegaan unugyada. Waa la weydiinayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiisaska barooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E (CSV, TXT) iyo liisaska sahan-socodka: liis sheega unugga sadarihiisa ugu horreeya waa la beddelaa, status line-kuna wuu sheegaa. Mid aan sheegin waa la weydiinayaa markaad riixdo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, ka hor intaan barooyinka la geliin. Tiirarka latitude iyo longitude waxay mari doonaan nidaamka koorodinadyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd-on-ka Point clouds\u003C/strong\u003E: wuu weydiiyaa markaad dhisayso daruur ay faylkeedu aan unug sheegin, wuxuuna calaamadeeyaa lambarrada daruurta unugga ay leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIFC iyo LandXML\u003C/strong\u003E: waxay sheegaan kuwooda; waa la beddelaa unugyada mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELAS, LAZ iyo raster-ka korkaca\u003C/strong\u003E: waxaa lagu meeleeyaa nidaamka koorodinadyadooda; sanduuqa dhulka wuxuu weydiiyaa unugga korkaca marka faylku aanu sheegin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJawaabta waa la xasuusanayaa faylkaas kombiyuutarkan, app kasta oo CadCraft ah. Marka dambe ma la weydiinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi dib loo weydiiyo: paleti-ka amarka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cstrong\u003EMar kale weydii unugyada faylalka la soo dhoofiyay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnugga liis sheego waxaa laga akhriyaa siddeed sadar ee ugu horreeya: sadar sida \u003Ccode\u003Eunits: ft\u003C/code\u003E, ama madax tiirar oo dhammaantood isku unug ku qoran qaboojin sida \u003Ccode\u003EElevation (m)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Faylka mashruuc gelii oo ka dhig inuu yimaado cabbirka saxda ah. Tallaabooyin Fur faylka sida caadiga ah: Fur, dhig faylka sawirka, ama amarka sawirka CAD. Haddii faylku sheegayo unugyadiisa, wax lama weydiinayo: sanduuqa soo dhoofinta wuxuu muujinayaa As the drawing says (sida sawirku sheegayo). Haddii aanu sheegin, sanduuq wuxuu weydiinayaa Unugyada faylka ka hor intaanu furmin sanduuqa soo dhoofinta. Dooro waxa hal unug uu ka yahay faylka oo guji Isticmaal cutubyadan. Jooji (ama Esc) wuu dhaafaa faylka. Waxba ka mid ah lama akhrinayo mashruuca. Faylasha sheegaya unugyadooda DWG iyo DXF: unugyada geli-goobta sawirka ($INSUNITS). Fayl aan lahayn waa la weydiinayaa. Liiska Drawing units ee sanduuqa soo dhoofinta wuxuu ka bilaabmaa jawaabtaada, wuuna beddeli karaa. STL iyo OBJ (qaabab dhulka xor ah): weligood ma sheegaan unugyada. Waa la weydiinayaa. Liisaska barooyinka (CSV, TXT) iyo liisaska sahan-socodka: liis sheega unugga sadarihiisa ugu horreeya waa la beddelaa, status line-kuna wuu sheegaa. Mid aan sheegin waa la weydiinayaa markaad riixdo Soo dhoofi, ka hor intaan barooyinka la geliin. Tiirarka latitude iyo longitude waxay mari doonaan nidaamka koorodinadyada. Add-on-ka Point clouds: wuu weydiiyaa markaad dhisayso daruur ay faylkeedu aan unug sheegin, wuxuuna calaamadeeyaa lambarrada daruurta unugga ay leedahay. IFC iyo LandXML: waxay sheegaan kuwooda; waa la beddelaa unugyada mashruuca. LAS, LAZ iyo raster-ka korkaca: waxaa lagu meeleeyaa nidaamka koorodinadyadooda; sanduuqa dhulka wuxuu weydiiyaa unugga korkaca marka faylku aanu sheegin. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan Jawaabta waa la xasuusanayaa faylkaas kombiyuutarkan, app kasta oo CadCraft ah. Marka dambe ma la weydiinayo. Si dib loo weydiiyo: paleti-ka amarka (Ctrl+K) › Mar kale weydii unugyada faylalka la soo dhoofiyay. Unugga liis sheego waxaa laga akhriyaa siddeed sadar ee ugu horreeya: sadar sida units: ft, ama madax tiirar oo dhammaantood isku unug ku qoran qaboojin sida Elevation (m).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"plot-pdf","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qorshaha PDF-ka ku soo saar","summary":"Qorshaha oo dhan ama muuqaalka hadda u soo saar PDF vector ah oo ku jira warqad caadi ah oo miisaan injineer ama metric ah, midabka lakabka ama madow.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["soo saar","daabac","pdf","warqad","miisaan","cabbirka warqadda","qorshaha warqadda","xarriiqda cinwaanka","fallaadha waqooyiga","xarriiqda miisaanka"],"headings":[{"id":"soo-saar","text":"Soo saar","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xaashiga-ku-jira","text":"Waxa xaashiga ku jira","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aan-la-soo-saarin","text":"Waxa aan la soo saarin","level":2},{"id":"daabacaadda-warqadda","text":"Daabacaadda warqadda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo saaraa qorshaha PDF vector ah oo ku jira hal xaashi, oo leh xarriiqda cinwaanka, fallaadha waqooyiga iyo xarriiqda miisaanka. PDF-ka waxa lagu sameeyaa browser-ka oo la soo dejiyaa; ma mari karo wada-hadalka daabacaadda ee browser-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-saar\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejiso qorshaha ku \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E: dusha la muujinayo, fogaanta kontuurka iyo waxyaabaha la shido. Soo saarku wuxuu raacaa dejintaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad doonayso qayb kaliya oo goobta ah, zoom iyo pan qorshaha ilaa halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofinta\u003C/strong\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command P\"\u003E⌘P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Wada-hadalka \u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha ku soo saar PDF\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa furmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EBed\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat is on screen\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EPaper\u003C/strong\u003E: Letter, Tabloid, ANSI D, ARCH D, ISO A4, A3 ama A1. Mashruuca feet wuxuu ka bilaabmaa Tabloid, mashruuca metre-ka wuxuu ka bilaabmaa A3. Xaashiyadu had iyo jeer waa jiifsan (landscape).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan\u003C/strong\u003E. Liistu wuxuu calaamadeeyaa miisaanka ugu weyn ee ku habboona &quot;(fits)&quot; wuxuuna doortaa.\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFeet: 1&quot; = 5&#039;, 10&#039;, 20&#039;, 30&#039;, 40&#039;, 50&#039;, 60&#039;, 100&#039;, 200&#039;, 300&#039;, 400&#039;, 500&#039;, 1000&#039;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMetres: 1:50, 1:100, 1:200, 1:250, 1:500, 1:1000, 1:2000, 1:2500, 1:5000, 1:10000.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003ERinjiga\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayer colors\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBlack\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri sadarka hoosta doorashooyinka. Wuxuu sheegayaa cabbirka aagga warqadda iyo cabbirka xaashiga, tusaale: &quot;Aagga waa 297 × 222 mm ee 1&quot; = 40&#039; ee xaashi 432 × 279 mm (jiifsan).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload PDF\u003C/span\u003E. Browser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.pdf\u003C/code\u003E. Xariiqda xaaladda waxay leedahay &quot;La soo saaray &lt;name&gt;.pdf ee 1&quot; = 40&#039;.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aagga uu ka weyn yahay xaashiga miisaanka aad dooratay, qorshaha waa dhex-dhexaadiyaa, cidhifyadana waa la jaraa. Dooro miisaanka lagu calaamadeeyay &quot;(fits)&quot; ama xaashi ka weyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xaashiga-ku-jira\"\u003EWaxa xaashiga ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshaha, dhex-dhexaad ku yaal aagga sawirka, sida vector run ah: kontuurrada, calaamadaha, khadadka waddada oo leh istaysinka, kooridorada, padyada iyo khadadka daylight, tuubooyinka, barta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqda khadadka: khadadka waddada, padyada iyo tuubooyinka waa culus; saddexagallada iyo kontuurrada yar waa khafiif.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarriiqda cinwaanka hoosta: magaca mashruuca \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E, miisaanka, fariinta fogaanta kontuurka iyo dusha (jira ama la-shaqaynaya), iyo taariikhda iyo dhismaha midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFallaadha waqooyiga oo ku taal kooxda midig ee sare (qorshaha waqooyigu waa sare), iyo xarriiqda miisaanka ee xarriiqda cinwaanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada khariidadda ee hoosta qorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E (sawir, tiles ama adeeg khariidad) marka la calaamadeeyo: waxay u sawiran sawir keliya oo ah aagga oo dhan oo 150 dots per inch ah, hoosta khadadka; attribution-ka khariidadda waxa ku jira xarriiqda cinwaanka. CivilCraft wuxuu sugaa ilaa 8 ilbiriqsi sawirrada khariidadda ee weli iman; haddii qaarkood weli maqan yihiin, xariiqda xaaladda way sheegtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoraalku wuxuu isticmaalaa Helvetica ee PDF-ka ku dhex jirta. Jilayaasha ka baxsan Western European set-ka (Windows-1252) waxay daabacmaan sida &quot;?&quot;, fariinta xaaladdana way tirisaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aan-la-soo-saarin\"\u003EWaxa aan la soo saarin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybaha dhererka (Elevation bands).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka profiilka. Soo saarida profiilada weli lama heli karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn ka badan hal xaashi (aagga khadka waddada, isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plan-profile-sheets\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plan-profile-sheets\"\u003Exaashiyada qorshaha iyo profiilka\u003C/a\u003E), viewports, block-ka cinwaanka gaarka ah ama xaashiyada portrait.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa in fallaadaha naqaska ay yihiin oo keliya shaashadda. Dhismahan, fallaadaha naqaska ee la shido ku \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E waa la soo saaraa (oo loo dhoofiyaa DXF). Ka hor soo saarista, dami haddii aadan rabin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daabacaadda-warqadda\"\u003EDaabacaadda warqadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur PDF-ka la soo dejiyay PDF viewer kasta oo aad doonto, oo daabac 100% (cabbirka dhabta ah) si miisaanku u sax ahaado. &quot;Ku habee bogga&quot; wuxuu beddelaa miisaanka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"PDF wuxuu soo saaraa qorshaha PDF vector ah oo ku jira hal xaashi, oo leh xarriiqda cinwaanka, fallaadha waqooyiga iyo xarriiqda miisaanka. PDF-ka waxa lagu sameeyaa browser-ka oo la soo dejiyaa; ma mari karo wada-hadalka daabacaadda ee browser-ka. Soo saar Dejiso qorshaha ku Bandhig: dusha la muujinayo, fogaanta kontuurka iyo waxyaabaha la shido. Soo saarku wuxuu raacaa dejintaas. Haddii aad doonayso qayb kaliya oo goobta ah, zoom iyo pan qorshaha ilaa halkaas. Guji PDF kooxda Dhoofinta, ama riix Ctrl+P. Wada-hadalka Qorshaha ku soo saar PDF ayaa furmaa. Dooro Bed: Everything ama What is on screen. Dooro Paper: Letter, Tabloid, ANSI D, ARCH D, ISO A4, A3 ama A1. Mashruuca feet wuxuu ka bilaabmaa Tabloid, mashruuca metre-ka wuxuu ka bilaabmaa A3. Xaashiyadu had iyo jeer waa jiifsan (landscape). Dooro Miisaan. Liistu wuxuu calaamadeeyaa miisaanka ugu weyn ee ku habboona \"(fits)\" wuxuuna doortaa. Feet: 1\" = 5', 10', 20', 30', 40', 50', 60', 100', 200', 300', 400', 500', 1000'. Metres: 1:50, 1:100, 1:200, 1:250, 1:500, 1:1000, 1:2000, 1:2500, 1:5000, 1:10000. Dooro Rinjiga: Layer colors ama Black. Akhri sadarka hoosta doorashooyinka. Wuxuu sheegayaa cabbirka aagga warqadda iyo cabbirka xaashiga, tusaale: \"Aagga waa 297 × 222 mm ee 1\" = 40' ee xaashi 432 × 279 mm (jiifsan).\" Guji Download PDF. Browser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cname\u003E.pdf. Xariiqda xaaladda waxay leedahay \"La soo saaray \u003Cname\u003E.pdf ee 1\" = 40'.\" Haddii aagga uu ka weyn yahay xaashiga miisaanka aad dooratay, qorshaha waa dhex-dhexaadiyaa, cidhifyadana waa la jaraa. Dooro miisaanka lagu calaamadeeyay \"(fits)\" ama xaashi ka weyn. Waxa xaashiga ku jira Qorshaha, dhex-dhexaad ku yaal aagga sawirka, sida vector run ah: kontuurrada, calaamadaha, khadadka waddada oo leh istaysinka, kooridorada, padyada iyo khadadka daylight, tuubooyinka, barta. Xariiqda khadadka: khadadka waddada, padyada iyo tuubooyinka waa culus; saddexagallada iyo kontuurrada yar waa khafiif. Xarriiqda cinwaanka hoosta: magaca mashruuca Magaca, miisaanka, fariinta fogaanta kontuurka iyo dusha (jira ama la-shaqaynaya), iyo taariikhda iyo dhismaha midig. Fallaadha waqooyiga oo ku taal kooxda midig ee sare (qorshaha waqooyigu waa sare), iyo xarriiqda miisaanka ee xarriiqda cinwaanka. Lakabyada khariidadda ee hoosta qorshaha (sawir, tiles ama adeeg khariidad) marka la calaamadeeyo: waxay u sawiran sawir keliya oo ah aagga oo dhan oo 150 dots per inch ah, hoosta khadadka; attribution-ka khariidadda waxa ku jira xarriiqda cinwaanka. CivilCraft wuxuu sugaa ilaa 8 ilbiriqsi sawirrada khariidadda ee weli iman; haddii qaarkood weli maqan yihiin, xariiqda xaaladda way sheegtaa. Qoraalku wuxuu isticmaalaa Helvetica ee PDF-ka ku dhex jirta. Jilayaasha ka baxsan Western European set-ka (Windows-1252) waxay daabacmaan sida \"?\", fariinta xaaladdana way tirisaa. Waxa aan la soo saarin Qaybaha dhererka (Elevation bands). Muuqaalka profiilka. Soo saarida profiilada weli lama heli karo. In ka badan hal xaashi (aagga khadka waddada, isticmaal xaashiyada qorshaha iyo profiilka), viewports, block-ka cinwaanka gaarka ah ama xaashiyada portrait. Wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa in fallaadaha naqaska ay yihiin oo keliya shaashadda. Dhismahan, fallaadaha naqaska ee la shido ku Bandhig waa la soo saaraa (oo loo dhoofiyaa DXF). Ka hor soo saarista, dami haddii aadan rabin. Daabacaadda warqadda Fur PDF-ka la soo dejiyay PDF viewer kasta oo aad doonto, oo daabac 100% (cabbirka dhabta ah) si miisaanku u sax ahaado. \"Ku habee bogga\" wuxuu beddelaa miisaanka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"site-3d","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Goobta ka eeg 3D","summary":"Fur muuqaalka 3D, wareeg, ku dhaqaaq iyo zoom samee, deji weynaynta toosa iyo midabka, dooro waxa muuqda, oo riix jid-hagaha, padka, khadka muuqaalka, khadadka-jeexa, tuubooyinka, dhismayaasha iyo barta si aad u doorato.","section":"tasks","order":125,"keywords":["calaamadaha","calaamadaha 3d","billboard","calaamadaha u jeeda kamarada","calaamadaha saldhigga","calaamadaha kontuurka","calaamadaha barta","drape","aerial","lakabyada khariidadda ee dusha","3d","saddex-geesood","muuqaalka 3d","kubka muuqaalka","qutub-tilmaame","wareeg","orbit","perspective","parallel","isometric","iso","weynaynta toosa","dhul","moodel","moodeelka goobta","muuqaal","render","tuubooyinka 3d","dhismayaasha","manholes","koridorka 3d","waddada 3d","dusha waddada","dariiqyada","geedaha 3d","shrubs","hedges","landscape 3d","sallaalmo 3d","tallaabooyinka","darbiyada","paving","hardscape 3d"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-muuqaalka-3d","text":"Fur muuqaalka 3D","level":2},{"id":"ku-wareeg","text":"Ku wareeg","level":2},{"id":"kubka-muuqaalka","text":"Kubka muuqaalka","level":2},{"id":"weynee-sare-dhaadheerka","text":"Weynee sare-dhaadheerka","level":2},{"id":"midabee-dusha","text":"Midabee dusha","level":2},{"id":"dooro-waxa-muuqda","text":"Dooro waxa muuqda","level":2},{"id":"tuubooyinka-iyo-dhismayaasha","text":"Tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha","level":2},{"id":"ka-dooro-muuqaalka-3d","text":"Ka dooro muuqaalka 3D","level":2},{"id":"wado-jid-hagaha-dhexdiisa","text":"Wado jid-hagaha dhexdiisa","level":2},{"id":"iftiinka-qorraxda","text":"Iftiinka qorraxda","level":2},{"id":"soo-dhoofi-muuqaalka-3d","text":"Soo dhoofi muuqaalka 3D","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka 3D wuxuu muujinayaa goobta moodel keli ah: dhulka jira iyo dusha la sagaaday, kontuurrada lagu daray, khadadka-jeexa iyo geesaha dusha, jid-hagaha kasta oo ku taal qorshaha naqshadda leh calaamadaha saldhigga, khadadka muuqaalka koridorka iyo waddada laftiisa (xariiqyada, garabka, daadka, curbs, xariijimada iyo dariiqyada oo midabkooda gaarka ah), padka leh khadadka iftiinka, shabakada tuubooyinka leh tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha sare-dhaadheerkooda dhabta ah, iyo Landscape workspace-ka geedaha, paving-ka, dariiqyada, darbiyada, kerbs, ramps iyo steps. Waxay akhrisaa isla mashruuca sida qorshaha, sidaas darteed tafatir kasta waxay muuqataa labadaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EFur muuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur barta sahanka (ama LandXML ama fayl mashruuc) si uu u jiro dusha. Geedaha, paving-ka ama ramps oo keliya ayaa kafiya si loo furo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E ee toolbar-ka. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu ku furmaa qorshaha, isagoo eegaya goobta oo dhan laga soo bilaabo koonfur-bari. Markii ugu horreysay, wuxuu qaataa wakhti si uu u soo raro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E mar kale, si aad ugu noqoto qorshaha. Doorashada qalab sawir sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlignment\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPad\u003C/span\u003E waxay sidoo kale ku celinaysaa qorshaha, sababtoo ah sawirku wuxuu ka dhacaa halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-wareeg\"\u003EKu wareeg\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad u\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiido batanka bidix ama dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhaqaaq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiido batanka midig, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiido\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZoom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji wheel-ka; wuxuu u zoom-aa dhinaca cursor-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg trackpad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhaq labada far (swipe) (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo swipe wuu ku dhaqaaqaa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZoom trackpad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaabasho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal far wuu wareegaa; laba far pinch ayaa zoom, iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa ku dhaqaaqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurayaasha (muuqaalka uu xoogga leeyahay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wareeg, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku dhaqaaq; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zoom\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBar-ka ka sarreeya muuqaalka wuxuu leeyahay kuwa kale:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska muuqaalka: \u003Cstrong\u003EIso\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESare\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EHoos\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EHore\u003C/strong\u003E (u eeg waqooyiga), \u003Cstrong\u003EDambe\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBidix\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMidig\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspective\u003C/span\u003E: la riixay waa muuqaal perspective; riix si aad u hesho projection isku-dhowaan (ma jiro foreshortening).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtents\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu dib u muujiyaa wax kasta. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sidaas oo kale ayaa sameeya inta muuqaalka 3D furan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kubka-muuqaalka\"\u003EKubka muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKubka muuqaalka ee geesta midig sare wuxuu wareegaa muuqaalka. Riix dhinac, qaybta ama geesta si aad uga eegto goobta meeshaas (kameraha si tartiib ah ayuu u wareegaa, haddii nidaamkaagu aanu dalbanayn dhaqdhaqaaq yar). Jiido kubka si aad u wareegto. Wareegga qutub-tilmaameedka ee hoosta ayaa muujinaya waqooyiga (waqooyiga khariidadda, +Y): jiido wareega si aad u wareejiso goobta toosa, ama riix N, E, S ama W si aad uga eegto dhinacaas. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E, guriga yar ee geeska bidix sare, wuxuu ku laabanayaa muuqaalka iso ee goobta oo dhan. Kiiboodhka: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa kubka, falaadhadu waxay doortaa dhinac, qaybta ama geesta, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka eegaa meeshaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshaha kubka isku mid ahi wuxuu muujinayaa sare. Riix geesta, qaybta ama dhinac kale (ama jiido) si aad u furto muuqaalka 3D oo ka eegaya halkaas: tanu waa jidka ugu dhaqsaha badan ee loo galo 3D jihada gaarka ah. Si aad u beddesho kubka calaamad aaxa yar, ama u qariso, eeg \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda geeska\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weynee-sare-dhaadheerka\"\u003EWeynee sare-dhaadheerka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobaha badanaa way ballaaran yihiin intaysan sarreeyn, sidaas darteed sare-dhaadheerka waxaa lagu fidiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003E2×\u003C/strong\u003E bilowga. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003E1×\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003E2×\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003E3×\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003E5×\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003E10×\u003C/strong\u003E liiska bar-ka, ama hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003E3D vertical exaggeration\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E (labadaba hal dejin). Muuqaalka kaliya ayaa isbedela: mugga, profile-yada iyo soo dhoofinta waxay ahaadaan cabbir sax ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midabee-dusha\"\u003EMidabee dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EElevation bands\u003C/strong\u003E: isla bands-ka iyo midabka bands-ka sare-dhaadheerka qorshaha (tirada bands waa la dejiyaa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDisplay\u003C/strong\u003E panelka bidix). Xuduud kasta oo band ah waxaa laga jaraa sare-dhaadheerkiisa dhab ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOne colour\u003C/strong\u003E: dhulka jira iyo dusha la sagaaday mid kasta midab fudud.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMap layers\u003C/strong\u003E: lakabyada khariidadda ee hoosta qorshaha lagu muujiyo (sawir georeferenced, tiles ee khariidadda ama adeeg khariidad; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/map-layers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/map-layers\"\u003ELakabyada khariidadda\u003C/a\u003E) waxaa lagu rogaa dusha sida xaashi, si sawirka hawada uu buuraha ugu muuqdo. Sawirada weli imanaya way buuxsamaan markay yimaadaan. Haddii aanu lakab khariidad muuqan, dusha wuxuu hayaa bands-kiisa sare-dhaadheerka, muuqaalkuna wuu sheegaa. Sawirku waa shaashadda kaliya: GLB iyo OBJ soo dhoofinta ma qaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka labada dusha la muujiyo, dhulka jira waa qarsoon yahay ka sarreeya dusha la sagaaday, si aad u aragto jarka (dhulka ka sarreeya naqshadda) iyo buuxinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-waxa-muuqda\"\u003EDooro waxa muuqda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka oo calaamadi ama ka saar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EShay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaa maxay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha laga dhisay barta sahanka (ama laga akhriyay LandXML)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha la sagaaday\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka jira oo koridorada iyo padadka la sagaaday (kaliya haddii ay jiraan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuduudaha saddex-geesoodka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha TIN oo dhan, sida xariiqyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurada yar iyo weyn ee dusha kasta la muujiyay, qiyaasta qorshaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadka dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadka dibada ee dusha kasta la muujiyay, sare-dhaadheerkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka-jeexa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadad-jeexa kasta, sare-dhaadheerkooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJid-hagaha iyo saldhigyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJid-hagaha kasta oo ku taal qorshaha naqshadda (dhulka haddii aanu qorshe lahayn), oo leh calaamado 50 ft ama 20 m kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka muuqaalka koridorka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadka dahaarka, garabka iyo iftiinka labada dhinac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaddada koridor kasta dhisaysa, laga bilaabo qaabkeeda: xariiqyada, garabka, gutters, curbs, strips iyo sidewalks, midkiiba midab gaar ah, dusha la sagaaday\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeedaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeed kasta, iyo geedaha beerta iyo xaaxada, oo ah qaabab fudud oo cabbiraha laga qaado liiska geedaha: geedku waa gees iyo tuuf wareeg ah (kubad ah conifer-ka, jilbo ah geedka dheer ee bambooga); shrubs, geedaha xaaxada, perennials iyo groundcovers waa domes, cawska waa tufts, climbers waa columns khafiif ah. Waxay taagan yihiin dusha la sagaaday (ama dhulka jira) cabbirka qorshuhu muujinayo: buuxda ama markii la beeray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHardscape\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPaving iyo dariiqyo leh hoos-u-dhacyadooda, darbiyo, kerbs, tallaabooyin, iyo ramps oo kor u kaca socodyo leh buundooyin siman oo u dhexeeya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPadka iyo iftiinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab-dhismeed kasta oo padka ah sare-dhaadheerkiisa iyo khadka iftiinkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka sida tuubooyin wareeg ah oo u dhexeeya invert-yadooda, dhismayaasha ka rim ilaa sump\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta sahanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibic ku taal barta kasta oo leh sare-dhaadheer (damqsan bilowga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabyada GIS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabyada GIS ee qorshaha lagu muujiyo, midabkooda: khadad iyo qaabab leh sare-dhaadheerkooda, kuwa kale waxay ku dhex-jiraan dhulka jira (si sax ah ayay ula socdaan); barta sida xaashaan yaryar. Qaababka aan sare-dhaadheer lahayn ee ka baxsan dusha waa la reebaa, muuqaalkuna wuu sheegaa inta ay tahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagacyo iyo qiyamo had iyo jeer kaaga muuqda: magaca jid-hagaha kasta bilowga, iyo saldhigyadiisa 100 ft (ama 100 m) kasta, sare-dhaadheerka kontuur weyn kasta, padka, khadadka muuqaalka iyo dhismayaasha magacooda, iyo haddii \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta sahanka\u003C/strong\u003E la calaamadiyo, lambarka iyo sare-dhaadheerka barta kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha isla cabbirka ayay ahaan doonaan, toosan ayay ahaan doonaan siduu u wareego ama zoom sameyso, buurta ka hortaga calaamadda ayaa qariysa. Meelaha ay isku dhowaadaan, kuwa ugu muhiimsan ayaa muuqda, kuwa kale waxay sugayaan ilaa aad zoom sameyso: jid-hagaha marka hore, kadibna dhismayaasha, padadka, khadadka muuqaalka, saldhigyada, kontuurada iyo barta, kuwa dhow marka hore. Waxay ku jiraan shaashadda oo keliya; soo dhoofinta iyo daabacadaha way ka reebaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDoorashooyinkaaga, weynaynta toosa iyo midabaynta waa la xusuustaa browser-kan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaddo waxaa lagu dhisaa dhulka jira. Jid-hagaha iyo koridorka oo aanan barta sahanka ama dusha lahayn, waddada waxaa lagu sawiraa dhul istaag ah oo siman hadda: sare-dhaadheerka celceliska qorshaha naqshaddeeda, ama heer 0 haddii aanu qorshe lahayn. Digniin hoosta muuqaalka 3D iyo sifooyinka koridorka ayaa sheegta taas. Waa sawir keliya: ma jiro mugga ama jarka oo ka timaada. Fur barta sahanka ama dusha, waddada ayaa iskood ugu guurta dhulka dhabta ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeynaynta toosa waxay fidisaa dhulka, ma aha geedaha: waxay taagan yihiin dhulka la weynaaday sare-dhaadheerkooda dhabta ah iyo baaxaddooda, sidaas darteed geed wuxuu u eeg yahay geed mid kasta oo dejin ah. Geedaha waa qaabab fudud, ma aha moodelo faahfaahsan: kumanaan ka mid ah ayaa dhakhso u wareegaya oo zoom-aa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tuubooyinka-iyo-dhismayaasha\"\u003ETuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuub waxaa lagu sawiraa iyada oo hoosteeda ay tahay invert-yada aad dejisay, sareeda (crown) hoosta ka sarreeya dhexroor gudaha mid. Dhexroorada waxay ahaadaan inch-yo mashruuc feet ah iyo millimitir mashruuc metric ah, sida panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhismuhu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa rim-kiisa (la qoro, ama dusha) oo wuxuu u dhacaa sump-kiisa (invert-ka ugu hoosaysa ka dhimma qoto-dheer sump). Invert-ka la&#039;aan, waxaa lagu sawiraa 5 ft (1.5 m) qoto-dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha dhibaato leh (eeg network check ee panelka midig) waxay ku sawirmaan cas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETuub aan invert lahayn lama sawiro; qoraal hoosta muuqaalka wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dooro-muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EKa dooro muuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix jid-hagaha (ama waddadiisa), padka, khadka muuqaalka, tuubada, dhismaha, barta sahanka, geedka, rampka ama hardscape kale. Waa la doortaa sida haddii aad ku riixday qorshaha: sifooyinkiisa waxay furmaan panelka midig, halkaas oo aad ka tafatiri karto, waana la sawiraa midabka doorashada oo ka sarreeya wax kasta 3D-ga. Waxa aad doorato qorshaha waxaa sidoo kale lagu iftiimiyaa 3D. Talo ku dhow cursor-ka ayaa magacaabaysa waxa aad riixday, iyo bariga, waqooyiga iyo sare-dhaadheerkiisa. Tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha waa la riixi karaa xitaa meesha ay dhulka hoosteeda ku jiraan; khad ka qarsoon buur ma laga riixi karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix khadka-jeexa si aad u ogaato waa kee: waa la iftiimiyaa, status bar-kana magacaabaa (khadadka-jeexa ma leeyihiin sifooyin gaar ah).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix dhulka si aad u akhrisato bariga, waqooyiga iyo sare-dhaadheerka halkaas talada ku jirta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wado-jid-hagaha-dhexdiisa\"\u003EWado jid-hagaha dhexdiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003EWado\u003C/strong\u003E bar-ka 3D oo dooro jid-hagaha. Muuqaalku wuxuu u guuraa kursiga darawalka: 3.5 ft (1.07 m) ka sarreeya waddada, qorshaha naqshaddeeda (dhulka jira ee xariiqda dhexe haddii aanu weli lahayn), isagoo eegaya hore meesha socdaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPlay\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu wadaa xawaare aad doorato (10 ilaa 65 mph, ama 15 ilaa 100 km/h); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale wuu joojiyaa. Dhamaadka wuu joogsadaa; \u003Cstrong\u003EPlay\u003C/strong\u003E markaas wuxuu bilaabaa mar kale bilowga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESlider-ku wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa saldhig kasta; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay u tallaabaan 10 ft (5 m) dib iyo horay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiidista muuqaalka waxay joojisaa oo waxay oggolaanaysaa inaad eegto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStop\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa muuqaalka meesha uu ku jiray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeynaynta toosa ayaa sidoo kale socota markaad wadaneyso: dejiso 1× si aad u aragto waddada sida ay noqon doonto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iftiinka-qorraxda\"\u003EIftiinka qorraxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EQorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E bar-ka 3D oo calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EIftiinka qorraxda\u003C/strong\u003E. Sii taariikh, saacadda iyo time zone-kiisa (farqiga UTC: xagaaga, kii iftiinka-kaydinta), iyo ballaca iyo dhererka goobta. Marka mashruucu leeyahay nidaamka isku-xirka, waa la buuxiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobta waxaa markaas iftiimaya meesha qorraxdu ku taal, \u003Cstrong\u003EHooska\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa dhulka, koridorka iyo padadka ku dul yaal; liiska wuxuu sheegayaa azimuth-ka qorraxda iyo sida ay u sarreyso, ama inay ka hooseyso horizon-ka. Booska waxay ka yimaadaan isle&#039;egta qorraxda ee NOAA. Hooska waxay ku dhacaan jihada saxda ah weynaynta kasta, laakiin way joogsadaan xadka goobta: buuro iyo dhismayaal ka baxsan xadkaas ma tuurin hooska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-dhoofi-muuqaalka-3d\"\u003ESoo dhoofi muuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOBJ\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka. Waxa muuqaalku muujinayo waa la kaydiyaa, cabbir sax ah (ma jiro weynayn), meeter, Y oo kor u kacaysa. Faahfaahin: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/export-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/export-3d\"\u003ESoo dhoofi goobta 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu muujinayaa goobta moodel keli ah: dhulka jira iyo dusha la sagaaday, kontuurrada lagu daray, khadadka-jeexa iyo geesaha dusha, jid-hagaha kasta oo ku taal qorshaha naqshadda leh calaamadaha saldhigga, khadadka muuqaalka koridorka iyo waddada laftiisa (xariiqyada, garabka, daadka, curbs, xariijimada iyo dariiqyada oo midabkooda gaarka ah), padka leh khadadka iftiinka, shabakada tuubooyinka leh tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha sare-dhaadheerkooda dhabta ah, iyo Landscape workspace-ka geedaha, paving-ka, dariiqyada, darbiyada, kerbs, ramps iyo steps. Waxay akhrisaa isla mashruuca sida qorshaha, sidaas darteed tafatir kasta waxay muuqataa labadaba. Fur muuqaalka 3D Fur barta sahanka (ama LandXML ama fayl mashruuc) si uu u jiro dusha. Geedaha, paving-ka ama ramps oo keliya ayaa kafiya si loo furo. Riix D, ama riix 3D kooxda View ee toolbar-ka. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu ku furmaa qorshaha, isagoo eegaya goobta oo dhan laga soo bilaabo koonfur-bari. Markii ugu horreysay, wuxuu qaataa wakhti si uu u soo raro. Riix D mar kale, ama 3D mar kale, si aad ugu noqoto qorshaha. Doorashada qalab sawir sida Alignment ama Pad waxay sidoo kale ku celinaysaa qorshaha, sababtoo ah sawirku wuxuu ka dhacaa halkaas. Ku wareeg Si aad u Samee tan Wareeg Jiido batanka bidix ama dhexe Ku dhaqaaq Jiido batanka midig, ama Shift iyo jiido Zoom Wareeji wheel-ka; wuxuu u zoom-aa dhinaca cursor-ka Wareeg trackpad Ku dhaq labada far (swipe) (Shift iyo swipe wuu ku dhaqaaqaa) Zoom trackpad Pinch Taabasho Hal far wuu wareegaa; laba far pinch ayaa zoom, iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa ku dhaqaaqa Furayaasha (muuqaalka uu xoogga leeyahay) ← → ↑ ↓ wareeg, Shift ku dhaqaaq; + iyo − zoom Bar-ka ka sarreeya muuqaalka wuxuu leeyahay kuwa kale: Liiska muuqaalka: Iso, Sare, Hoos, Hore (u eeg waqooyiga), Dambe, Bidix, Midig. Perspective: la riixay waa muuqaal perspective; riix si aad u hesho projection isku-dhowaan (ma jiro foreshortening). Extents: wuxuu dib u muujiyaa wax kasta. F sidaas oo kale ayaa sameeya inta muuqaalka 3D furan yahay. Kubka muuqaalka Kubka muuqaalka ee geesta midig sare wuxuu wareegaa muuqaalka. Riix dhinac, qaybta ama geesta si aad uga eegto goobta meeshaas (kameraha si tartiib ah ayuu u wareegaa, haddii nidaamkaagu aanu dalbanayn dhaqdhaqaaq yar). Jiido kubka si aad u wareegto. Wareegga qutub-tilmaameedka ee hoosta ayaa muujinaya waqooyiga (waqooyiga khariidadda, +Y): jiido wareega si aad u wareejiso goobta toosa, ama riix N, E, S ama W si aad uga eegto dhinacaas. Home, guriga yar ee geeska bidix sare, wuxuu ku laabanayaa muuqaalka iso ee goobta oo dhan. Kiiboodhka: Tab ilaa kubka, falaadhadu waxay doortaa dhinac, qaybta ama geesta, Enter wuxuu ka eegaa meeshaas. Qorshaha kubka isku mid ahi wuxuu muujinayaa sare. Riix geesta, qaybta ama dhinac kale (ama jiido) si aad u furto muuqaalka 3D oo ka eegaya halkaas: tanu waa jidka ugu dhaqsaha badan ee loo galo 3D jihada gaarka ah. Si aad u beddesho kubka calaamad aaxa yar, ama u qariso, eeg Calaamadda geeska ee Dejinta CivilCraft. Weynee sare-dhaadheerka Goobaha badanaa way ballaaran yihiin intaysan sarreeyn, sidaas darteed sare-dhaadheerka waxaa lagu fidiyaa 2× bilowga. Dooro 1×, 2×, 3×, 5× ama 10× liiska bar-ka, ama hoosta 3D vertical exaggeration ee Dejinta CivilCraft (labadaba hal dejin). Muuqaalka kaliya ayaa isbedela: mugga, profile-yada iyo soo dhoofinta waxay ahaadaan cabbir sax ah. Midabee dusha Elevation bands: isla bands-ka iyo midabka bands-ka sare-dhaadheerka qorshaha (tirada bands waa la dejiyaa hoosta Display panelka bidix). Xuduud kasta oo band ah waxaa laga jaraa sare-dhaadheerkiisa dhab ahaan. One colour: dhulka jira iyo dusha la sagaaday mid kasta midab fudud. Map layers: lakabyada khariidadda ee hoosta qorshaha lagu muujiyo (sawir georeferenced, tiles ee khariidadda ama adeeg khariidad; eeg Lakabyada khariidadda) waxaa lagu rogaa dusha sida xaashi, si sawirka hawada uu buuraha ugu muuqdo. Sawirada weli imanaya way buuxsamaan markay yimaadaan. Haddii aanu lakab khariidad muuqan, dusha wuxuu hayaa bands-kiisa sare-dhaadheerka, muuqaalkuna wuu sheegaa. Sawirku waa shaashadda kaliya: GLB iyo OBJ soo dhoofinta ma qaadaan. Marka labada dusha la muujiyo, dhulka jira waa qarsoon yahay ka sarreeya dusha la sagaaday, si aad u aragto jarka (dhulka ka sarreeya naqshadda) iyo buuxinta. Dooro waxa muuqda Riix Show bar-ka oo calaamadi ama ka saar: Shay Waa maxay Dhulka jira Dusha laga dhisay barta sahanka (ama laga akhriyay LandXML) Dusha la sagaaday Dhulka jira oo koridorada iyo padadka la sagaaday (kaliya haddii ay jiraan) Xuduudaha saddex-geesoodka Geesaha TIN oo dhan, sida xariiqyo Kontuurada Kontuurada yar iyo weyn ee dusha kasta la muujiyay, qiyaasta qorshaha Xadka dusha Xadka dibada ee dusha kasta la muujiyay, sare-dhaadheerkiisa Khadadka-jeexa Khadad-jeexa kasta, sare-dhaadheerkooda Jid-hagaha iyo saldhigyada Jid-hagaha kasta oo ku taal qorshaha naqshadda (dhulka haddii aanu qorshe lahayn), oo leh calaamado 50 ft ama 20 m kasta Khadadka muuqaalka koridorka Xadka dahaarka, garabka iyo iftiinka labada dhinac Dusha waddada Waddada koridor kasta dhisaysa, laga bilaabo qaabkeeda: xariiqyada, garabka, gutters, curbs, strips iyo sidewalks, midkiiba midab gaar ah, dusha la sagaaday Geedaha Geed kasta, iyo geedaha beerta iyo xaaxada, oo ah qaabab fudud oo cabbiraha laga qaado liiska geedaha: geedku waa gees iyo tuuf wareeg ah (kubad ah conifer-ka, jilbo ah geedka dheer ee bambooga); shrubs, geedaha xaaxada, perennials iyo groundcovers waa domes, cawska waa tufts, climbers waa columns khafiif ah. Waxay taagan yihiin dusha la sagaaday (ama dhulka jira) cabbirka qorshuhu muujinayo: buuxda ama markii la beeray Hardscape Paving iyo dariiqyo leh hoos-u-dhacyadooda, darbiyo, kerbs, tallaabooyin, iyo ramps oo kor u kaca socodyo leh buundooyin siman oo u dhexeeya Padka iyo iftiinka Qaab-dhismeed kasta oo padka ah sare-dhaadheerkiisa iyo khadka iftiinkiisa Tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha Tuubooyinka sida tuubooyin wareeg ah oo u dhexeeya invert-yadooda, dhismayaasha ka rim ilaa sump Barta sahanka Dhibic ku taal barta kasta oo leh sare-dhaadheer (damqsan bilowga) Lakabyada GIS Lakabyada GIS ee qorshaha lagu muujiyo, midabkooda: khadad iyo qaabab leh sare-dhaadheerkooda, kuwa kale waxay ku dhex-jiraan dhulka jira (si sax ah ayay ula socdaan); barta sida xaashaan yaryar. Qaababka aan sare-dhaadheer lahayn ee ka baxsan dusha waa la reebaa, muuqaalkuna wuu sheegaa inta ay tahay Calaamadaha Magacyo iyo qiyamo had iyo jeer kaaga muuqda: magaca jid-hagaha kasta bilowga, iyo saldhigyadiisa 100 ft (ama 100 m) kasta, sare-dhaadheerka kontuur weyn kasta, padka, khadadka muuqaalka iyo dhismayaasha magacooda, iyo haddii Barta sahanka la calaamadiyo, lambarka iyo sare-dhaadheerka barta kasta Calaamadaha isla cabbirka ayay ahaan doonaan, toosan ayay ahaan doonaan siduu u wareego ama zoom sameyso, buurta ka hortaga calaamadda ayaa qariysa. Meelaha ay isku dhowaadaan, kuwa ugu muhiimsan ayaa muuqda, kuwa kale waxay sugayaan ilaa aad zoom sameyso: jid-hagaha marka hore, kadibna dhismayaasha, padadka, khadadka muuqaalka, saldhigyada, kontuurada iyo barta, kuwa dhow marka hore. Waxay ku jiraan shaashadda oo keliya; soo dhoofinta iyo daabacadaha way ka reebaan. Doorashooyinkaaga, weynaynta toosa iyo midabaynta waa la xusuustaa browser-kan. Waddo waxaa lagu dhisaa dhulka jira. Jid-hagaha iyo koridorka oo aanan barta sahanka ama dusha lahayn, waddada waxaa lagu sawiraa dhul istaag ah oo siman hadda: sare-dhaadheerka celceliska qorshaha naqshaddeeda, ama heer 0 haddii aanu qorshe lahayn. Digniin hoosta muuqaalka 3D iyo sifooyinka koridorka ayaa sheegta taas. Waa sawir keliya: ma jiro mugga ama jarka oo ka timaada. Fur barta sahanka ama dusha, waddada ayaa iskood ugu guurta dhulka dhabta ah. Weynaynta toosa waxay fidisaa dhulka, ma aha geedaha: waxay taagan yihiin dhulka la weynaaday sare-dhaadheerkooda dhabta ah iyo baaxaddooda, sidaas darteed geed wuxuu u eeg yahay geed mid kasta oo dejin ah. Geedaha waa qaabab fudud, ma aha moodelo faahfaahsan: kumanaan ka mid ah ayaa dhakhso u wareegaya oo zoom-aa. Tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha Tuub waxaa lagu sawiraa iyada oo hoosteeda ay tahay invert-yada aad dejisay, sareeda (crown) hoosta ka sarreeya dhexroor gudaha mid. Dhexroorada waxay ahaadaan inch-yo mashruuc feet ah iyo millimitir mashruuc metric ah, sida panelka midig. Dhismuhu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa rim-kiisa (la qoro, ama dusha) oo wuxuu u dhacaa sump-kiisa (invert-ka ugu hoosaysa ka dhimma qoto-dheer sump). Invert-ka la'aan, waxaa lagu sawiraa 5 ft (1.5 m) qoto-dheer. Tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha dhibaato leh (eeg network check ee panelka midig) waxay ku sawirmaan cas. Tuub aan invert lahayn lama sawiro; qoraal hoosta muuqaalka wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay. Ka dooro muuqaalka 3D Riix jid-hagaha (ama waddadiisa), padka, khadka muuqaalka, tuubada, dhismaha, barta sahanka, geedka, rampka ama hardscape kale. Waa la doortaa sida haddii aad ku riixday qorshaha: sifooyinkiisa waxay furmaan panelka midig, halkaas oo aad ka tafatiri karto, waana la sawiraa midabka doorashada oo ka sarreeya wax kasta 3D-ga. Waxa aad doorato qorshaha waxaa sidoo kale lagu iftiimiyaa 3D. Talo ku dhow cursor-ka ayaa magacaabaysa waxa aad riixday, iyo bariga, waqooyiga iyo sare-dhaadheerkiisa. Tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha waa la riixi karaa xitaa meesha ay dhulka hoosteeda ku jiraan; khad ka qarsoon buur ma laga riixi karo. Riix khadka-jeexa si aad u ogaato waa kee: waa la iftiimiyaa, status bar-kana magacaabaa (khadadka-jeexa ma leeyihiin sifooyin gaar ah). Riix dhulka si aad u akhrisato bariga, waqooyiga iyo sare-dhaadheerka halkaas talada ku jirta. Wado jid-hagaha dhexdiisa Riix Wado bar-ka 3D oo dooro jid-hagaha. Muuqaalku wuxuu u guuraa kursiga darawalka: 3.5 ft (1.07 m) ka sarreeya waddada, qorshaha naqshaddeeda (dhulka jira ee xariiqda dhexe haddii aanu weli lahayn), isagoo eegaya hore meesha socdaalka. Play ama Space wuxuu wadaa xawaare aad doorato (10 ilaa 65 mph, ama 15 ilaa 100 km/h); Space mar kale wuu joojiyaa. Dhamaadka wuu joogsadaa; Play markaas wuxuu bilaabaa mar kale bilowga. Slider-ku wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa saldhig kasta; ← iyo → waxay u tallaabaan 10 ft (5 m) dib iyo horay. Jiidista muuqaalka waxay joojisaa oo waxay oggolaanaysaa inaad eegto. Stop ama Esc wuxuu soo celinayaa muuqaalka meesha uu ku jiray. Weynaynta toosa ayaa sidoo kale socota markaad wadaneyso: dejiso 1× si aad u aragto waddada sida ay noqon doonto. Iftiinka qorraxda Fur Qorraxda bar-ka 3D oo calaamadi Iftiinka qorraxda. Sii taariikh, saacadda iyo time zone-kiisa (farqiga UTC: xagaaga, kii iftiinka-kaydinta), iyo ballaca iyo dhererka goobta. Marka mashruucu leeyahay nidaamka isku-xirka, waa la buuxiyaa. Goobta waxaa markaas iftiimaya meesha qorraxdu ku taal, Hooska ayaa dhulka, koridorka iyo padadka ku dul yaal; liiska wuxuu sheegayaa azimuth-ka qorraxda iyo sida ay u sarreyso, ama inay ka hooseyso horizon-ka. Booska waxay ka yimaadaan isle'egta qorraxda ee NOAA. Hooska waxay ku dhacaan jihada saxda ah weynaynta kasta, laakiin way joogsadaan xadka goobta: buuro iyo dhismayaal ka baxsan xadkaas ma tuurin hooska. Soo dhoofi muuqaalka 3D Riix GLB ama OBJ bar-ka. Waxa muuqaalku muujinayo waa la kaydiyaa, cabbir sax ah (ma jiro weynayn), meeter, Y oo kor u kacaysa. Faahfaahin: Soo dhoofi goobta 3D.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"export-3d","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhoofi goobta 3D ahaan","summary":"Waxa muujinaya muuqaalka 3D u kaydi fayl GLB ama OBJ ah barnaamijyada 3D kale, mitirro iyo Y kor, iyada oo asal maxalli ah oo fayshu diiwaangeliyo.","section":"tasks","order":126,"keywords":["glb","gltf","obj","dhoofinta 3D","dhoofinta 3D","dhoofinta moodeelka","mishiinka ciyaarta","muujinta","daawaha 3D","mitirro","Y kor","asal","asal maxalli ah","state plane"],"headings":[{"id":"dhoofin","text":"Dhoofin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-faylalku-ku-jiraan","text":"Waxa faylalku ku jiraan","level":2},{"id":"cabbirka-tirooyinka-iyo-asalka","text":"Cabbirka, tirooyinka iyo asalka","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka 3D wuxuu dhoofiyaa waxa muujinayo sida moodel 3D ah oo barnaamij kale furi karo: daawaha 3D, moodelke, mishiinka ciyaarta ama qalabka muujinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofin\"\u003EDhoofin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur muuqaalka 3D (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo dooro waxa muuqda adiga oo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow\u003C/span\u003E. Waxa qarsan lama dhoofin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOBJ\u003C/span\u003E barta. Faylka waxa uu soo dejiyaa magaca &quot;\u003Cem\u003Emagaca mashruuca\u003C/em\u003E-3d.glb&quot; ama &quot;-3d.obj&quot;, status bar-kana wuxuu sheegaa asalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-faylalku-ku-jiraan\"\u003EWaxa faylalku ku jiraan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGLB\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOBJ\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeshes oo leh normals iyo midabyada heerka ama dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeshes oo leh normals (midab la&#039;aan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismeedyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeshes goobo, kuwa dhibaatada leh oo casaan ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeshes goobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurada, xarriiqyada jabinta, khadadka waddada, calaamadaha, xarriiqyada koridorka iyo padka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiqyo, set kasta midabkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiiwaanno xarriiqyo (\u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyinka sahanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiiwaanno barood (\u003Ccode\u003Ep\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESet kasta wuxuu hayaa magacisa (&quot;Dhulka jira&quot;, &quot;Tuubooyinka&quot;, &quot;Kontuurada weyn&quot; iyo kuwa kale), si aad u qarsan karto ama u qaabeyn karto barnaamijka kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirka-tirooyinka-iyo-asalka\"\u003ECabbirka, tirooyinka iyo asalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMitir.\u003C/strong\u003E Mashruuc fiit ah waxa loo beddelaa fiit US survey (1 ft = 1200/3937 m).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EY kor\u003C/strong\u003E, sida caadiga ah ee qaababkan: bari wuxuu noqdaa +X, dhererka +Y, woqooyina −Z.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan dhab ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Ballaadhinta dhererka ee muuqaalka lama dabaqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsal maxalli ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Isku-xidhyada state plane waa malaayiin fiit, oo waaweyn marka loo eego lambarrada dhaqdhaqaaqa ah ee qaababkan kaydiya, sidaas darteed faylku waa la qoraa iyada oo laga eegayo asal dhow: asalka dhulka jira ee bari iyo woqooyiga, iyo dhererka ugu hooseeya ee la hoos u dhigay. Asalka, unugyada mashruuca ku jira, waa la diiwaangeliyaa faylka: GLB-ga \u003Ccode\u003Eextras\u003C/code\u003E ahaan scene-ka iyo node-ka sare, OBJ-ga xarriiq faallo ah oo u dhow bilowga (\u003Ccode\u003E# origin easting … northing … elevation …\u003C/code\u003E). Si aad moodelka dib ugu geesiso isku-xidhyada mashruuca, ku dar asalka (kadib markaad mitirrada dib ugu beddesho fiit haddii mashruuca uu fiit yahay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhoofinta muuqaalka ballaadhsan, ama dhoofinta unugyada mashruuca halkii mitirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeksachar, faylka alaabta OBJ (.mtl) iyo sifooyinka shay kasta (magacyada tuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismeedyada waxa kaliya ku jira CivilCraft).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhoofinta koridorka oo ah jirmo kala goosan, ama muuqaalka profile-ka 3D ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu dhoofiyaa waxa muujinayo sida moodel 3D ah oo barnaamij kale furi karo: daawaha 3D, moodelke, mishiinka ciyaarta ama qalabka muujinta. Dhoofin Fur muuqaalka 3D (D) oo dooro waxa muuqda adiga oo isticmaalaya Show. Waxa qarsan lama dhoofin. Riix GLB ama OBJ barta. Faylka waxa uu soo dejiyaa magaca \"magaca mashruuca-3d.glb\" ama \"-3d.obj\", status bar-kana wuxuu sheegaa asalka. Waxa faylalku ku jiraan GLB OBJ Dusha Meshes oo leh normals iyo midabyada heerka ama dusha Meshes oo leh normals (midab la'aan) Tuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismeedyada Meshes goobo, kuwa dhibaatada leh oo casaan ah Meshes goobo Kontuurada, xarriiqyada jabinta, khadadka waddada, calaamadaha, xarriiqyada koridorka iyo padka Xarriiqyo, set kasta midabkiisa Diiwaanno xarriiqyo (l) Barooyinka sahanka Barooyin Diiwaanno barood (p) Set kasta wuxuu hayaa magacisa (\"Dhulka jira\", \"Tuubooyinka\", \"Kontuurada weyn\" iyo kuwa kale), si aad u qarsan karto ama u qaabeyn karto barnaamijka kale. Cabbirka, tirooyinka iyo asalka Mitir. Mashruuc fiit ah waxa loo beddelaa fiit US survey (1 ft = 1200/3937 m). Y kor, sida caadiga ah ee qaababkan: bari wuxuu noqdaa +X, dhererka +Y, woqooyina −Z. Miisaan dhab ah. Ballaadhinta dhererka ee muuqaalka lama dabaqo. Asal maxalli ah. Isku-xidhyada state plane waa malaayiin fiit, oo waaweyn marka loo eego lambarrada dhaqdhaqaaqa ah ee qaababkan kaydiya, sidaas darteed faylku waa la qoraa iyada oo laga eegayo asal dhow: asalka dhulka jira ee bari iyo woqooyiga, iyo dhererka ugu hooseeya ee la hoos u dhigay. Asalka, unugyada mashruuca ku jira, waa la diiwaangeliyaa faylka: GLB-ga extras ahaan scene-ka iyo node-ka sare, OBJ-ga xarriiq faallo ah oo u dhow bilowga (# origin easting … northing … elevation …). Si aad moodelka dib ugu geesiso isku-xidhyada mashruuca, ku dar asalka (kadib markaad mitirrada dib ugu beddesho fiit haddii mashruuca uu fiit yahay). Weli lama dhisin Dhoofinta muuqaalka ballaadhsan, ama dhoofinta unugyada mashruuca halkii mitirka. Teksachar, faylka alaabta OBJ (.mtl) iyo sifooyinka shay kasta (magacyada tuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismeedyada waxa kaliya ku jira CivilCraft). Dhoofinta koridorka oo ah jirmo kala goosan, ama muuqaalka profile-ka 3D ahaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"ifc","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhoofinta iyo soo dhoofinta IFC","summary":"Kaydi mashruuca oo dhan hal fayl IFC oo IFC 4.3, IFC4 ama IFC2x3 ah (xariiqyada, waddooyinka, shaqada dhulka, dusha, derbiyada, tuubooyinka), oo fur fayllada IFC si aad xariiqyada iyo dusha uga soo qaaddo.","section":"tasks","order":127,"keywords":["ifc","ifc 4.3","ifc4x3","ifc4","ifc2x3","openbim","bim","xariiq","ifcalignment","waddo","ifcroad","shaqada dhulka","tin","wax la gudbiyo","la-iibsiga","dhoofi ifc","soo dhoofi ifc"],"headings":[{"id":"dhoofinta","text":"Dhoofinta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-qaab-kasta-ku-hayo","text":"Waxa qaab kasta ku hayo","level":2},{"id":"cabbirrada-iyo-isku-xidhka","text":"Cabbirrada iyo isku-xidhka","level":2},{"id":"soo-dhoofinta","text":"Soo dhoofinta","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIFC waa qaabka isweydaarsiga furan ee macaamiil badan oo dadweyne ay weydiistaan inuu yahay wax la gudbiyo. CivilCraft wuxuu mashruuca oo dhan ku qoraa hal fayl IFC, wuxuuna xariiqyada iyo dusha dib uga akhriyaa fayllada IFC.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofinta\"\u003EDhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi\u003C/strong\u003E (qaababka ribbon-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax soo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaabka (schema). \u003Cstrong\u003EIFC 4.3 ADD2\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa kowaad ah oo caadi ah: waa nooca leh xariiqyada, waddooyinka iyo shaqada dhulka. Dooro IFC4 ama IFC2x3 kaliya marka barnaamijka qaataha uusan akhrin karin 4.3.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa faylku ku hayn doono iyo waxa qaabka la doortay ka reebayo. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi IFC\u003C/span\u003E. Faylku wuxuu soo degaa sida &quot;\u003Cem\u003Emagaca mashruuca\u003C/em\u003E-ifc4x3.ifc&quot;, &quot;-ifc4.ifc&quot; ama &quot;-ifc2x3.ifc&quot;. CivilCraft wuxuu xasuustaa qaabkii aad ugu dambaysay doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-qaab-kasta-ku-hayo\"\u003EWaxa qaab kasta ku hayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIFC 4.3 ADD2\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIFC4\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIFC2x3\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcAlignment oo leh qaabkeeda jiifka (xariiqyo, qalooca wareegsan, spiral-ka clothoid) iyo qaabkeeda toosan (janjeerro, qalooca parabolic), curves-keeda (IfcCompositeCurve, IfcGradientCurve), station-ka bilowga iyo dhacdooyinka superelevation\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolyline 3D oo ku saaran walxaha civil\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolyline 3D oo ku saaran proxy\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECorridors\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcRoad oo leh qaybaha waddada; dariiqyada, garabka waddada, marinka biyaha iyo jidadka socodka sida IfcPavement, dhagaxa xadka sida IfcKerb, xariiqyada beerta; lakab kasta oo dhulka adag sida IfcCourse oo leh dherer, agab iyo mug; janjeerrada dhinacyada sida IfcEarthworksCut iyo IfcEarthworksFill oo leh mugaha jarista iyo buuxinta; xawaaraha naqshadda iyo heerka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxaha civil oo loo magacaabay waxa ay yihiin, oo lagu kooxeeyay waddo kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProxy-yo, lagu kooxeeyay waddo kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcGeographicElement TERRAIN oo leh shabakad saddexagal ah oo isku xidhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakado wajiyo saddexagal ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeelo dusha oo wajiyo ku salaysan (faylal waaweyn)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPadyada iyo derbiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha padka, janjeerkiisa sida shaqada dhulka, derbiyada taageeraya sida IfcWall RETAININGWALL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla, derbiga oo ah nooc derbi oo user-defined\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla, nooca derbiga ObjectType\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakadaha tuubooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcPipeSegment iyo IfcDistributionChamberElement gudaha IfcDistributionSystem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcFlowSegment iyo qolalka gudaha IfcSystem\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobaynta khariidada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIfcProjectedCRS iyo IfcMapConversion\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EePSet_ProjectedCRS iyo ePSet_MapConversion meesha site-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETren\u003C/strong\u003E (xariiq leh Railway oo shidan) wuxuu galaa IFC 4.3 sida IfcRailway: isbeddelladiisa nooc u gaar ah (clothoid, cubic parabola, Bloss, Helmert, sine half-wave sida cosine curve, sine), janjeerka dhinacyada sida IfcAlignmentCant, iyo jidkiisa sida makhaadyada, khadadka hoose iyo sariirta dhagaxa, oo leh lakabka hoose ee ka hooseeya. IFC4 iyo IFC2x3 waxay helaan qaybaha isku mid ah sida walxaha civil ama proxy-yo. Markii la furo tren IFC 4.3 isbeddelladiisa iyo janjeerka ayuu dib u soo celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFayl kasta waxa kale oo ku jira parcel-yada (raadka), dhirta iyo dhulka adag ee goobta beerta, iyo jidhka dhismayaasha (mid kasta waa IfcBuilding oo leh dabaqyadiisa), dhammaantood hal goob. Qaybaha sifooyinku waxay qabtaan waxa aad naqshadeysay: istaysiyada, assembly-ga, janjeerrada jarista iyo buuxinta, ballaca iyo tirada dariiqa, invert-ka, rim-ka, dherarka derbiyada; tirooyinka (dherarka, aagagga, mugaha) waa qaybaha IfcElementQuantity.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirrada-iyo-isku-xidhka\"\u003ECabbirrada iyo isku-xidhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylku waxa uu ku jiraa cutubka dherarka mashruuca (mitir, ama feet-ka sahanka Mareykanka); aagagga iyo mugaha waa mitir laba-geesood iyo saddex-geesood. Haddii nidaam isku-xidhka (GIS › Isku-xidhka) ku jiro, faylku wuxuu khariidadda ku dhigmaa: bari iyo waqooyiga asalkiisa, iyo wareejinta iyo cabbirka nidaamka dhulka (local), waxay ku jiraan beddelka khariidadda. Haddii aanu jirin, faylku wuxuu duubayaa asalkiisa gudaha ee set-ka sifooyinka oo ma dhigmo khariidad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-dhoofinta\"\u003ESoo dhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur fayl .ifc \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E ama ku tuur qorshaha. Wada-hadalka soo dhoofinta wuxuu sheegayaa waxa faylku ku hayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyada\u003C/strong\u003E IFC 4.3 (qaabka toosan iyo kan sare) iyo qalooca xariiqyada IFC 4x1 waxay noqdaan xariiqyo CivilCraft leh PI-yadooda, radiyaskooda, dherarka spiral-ka iyo PVI-yadooda. Xariiq aan qaabka PI ee CivilCraft ku hayn karin (qalooca isku dhegan, spiral-ka u dhexeeya laba qalooc, mid ku bilaabma ama ku dhammaada qalooc) lama soo dhoofin, wada-hadalkuna wuxuu sheegayaa sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro midka noqonaya dhulka jira, ama ku hay kii mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax kale oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E (iyo dusha kale) waxaa lagu muuji karaa muuqaalka 3D sida tixraac. Walxaha tixraacu way jiraan intii mashruuca furan yahay; ma kaydsana faylka mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFayl uu CivilCraft ku qoray IFC4 ama IFC2x3 xariiqyadiisa wuxuu dib u soo celiyaa si sax ah set-yada sifooyinkooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESuperelevation-ka waddada waxa loo qoraa sida dhacdooyinka superelevation iyo dusha waddada (janjeerka (cant) waa tren-ka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta walxaha tixraacu fayl mashruuca gudihiisa, iyo soo dhoofinta shabakadaha tuubooyinka ama padyada IFC sida walxo la tafatiri karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"IFC waa qaabka isweydaarsiga furan ee macaamiil badan oo dadweyne ay weydiistaan inuu yahay wax la gudbiyo. CivilCraft wuxuu mashruuca oo dhan ku qoraa hal fayl IFC, wuxuuna xariiqyada iyo dusha dib uga akhriyaa fayllada IFC. Dhoofinta Riix IFC kooxda Dhoofi (qaababka ribbon-ka: Wax soo saar › Dhoofi › IFC). Dooro qaabka (schema). IFC 4.3 ADD2 ayaa kowaad ah oo caadi ah: waa nooca leh xariiqyada, waddooyinka iyo shaqada dhulka. Dooro IFC4 ama IFC2x3 kaliya marka barnaamijka qaataha uusan akhrin karin 4.3. Wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa faylku ku hayn doono iyo waxa qaabka la doortay ka reebayo. Riix Dhoofi IFC. Faylku wuxuu soo degaa sida \"magaca mashruuca-ifc4x3.ifc\", \"-ifc4.ifc\" ama \"-ifc2x3.ifc\". CivilCraft wuxuu xasuustaa qaabkii aad ugu dambaysay doortay. Waxa qaab kasta ku hayo IFC 4.3 ADD2 IFC4 IFC2x3 Xariiqyada IfcAlignment oo leh qaabkeeda jiifka (xariiqyo, qalooca wareegsan, spiral-ka clothoid) iyo qaabkeeda toosan (janjeerro, qalooca parabolic), curves-keeda (IfcCompositeCurve, IfcGradientCurve), station-ka bilowga iyo dhacdooyinka superelevation Polyline 3D oo ku saaran walxaha civil Polyline 3D oo ku saaran proxy Corridors IfcRoad oo leh qaybaha waddada; dariiqyada, garabka waddada, marinka biyaha iyo jidadka socodka sida IfcPavement, dhagaxa xadka sida IfcKerb, xariiqyada beerta; lakab kasta oo dhulka adag sida IfcCourse oo leh dherer, agab iyo mug; janjeerrada dhinacyada sida IfcEarthworksCut iyo IfcEarthworksFill oo leh mugaha jarista iyo buuxinta; xawaaraha naqshadda iyo heerka Walxaha civil oo loo magacaabay waxa ay yihiin, oo lagu kooxeeyay waddo kasta Proxy-yo, lagu kooxeeyay waddo kasta Dusha IfcGeographicElement TERRAIN oo leh shabakad saddexagal ah oo isku xidhan Shabakado wajiyo saddexagal ah Moodeelo dusha oo wajiyo ku salaysan (faylal waaweyn) Padyada iyo derbiyada Dusha padka, janjeerkiisa sida shaqada dhulka, derbiyada taageeraya sida IfcWall RETAININGWALL Isla, derbiga oo ah nooc derbi oo user-defined Isla, nooca derbiga ObjectType Shabakadaha tuubooyinka IfcPipeSegment iyo IfcDistributionChamberElement gudaha IfcDistributionSystem Isla IfcFlowSegment iyo qolalka gudaha IfcSystem Goobaynta khariidada IfcProjectedCRS iyo IfcMapConversion Isla ePSet_ProjectedCRS iyo ePSet_MapConversion meesha site-ka Tren (xariiq leh Railway oo shidan) wuxuu galaa IFC 4.3 sida IfcRailway: isbeddelladiisa nooc u gaar ah (clothoid, cubic parabola, Bloss, Helmert, sine half-wave sida cosine curve, sine), janjeerka dhinacyada sida IfcAlignmentCant, iyo jidkiisa sida makhaadyada, khadadka hoose iyo sariirta dhagaxa, oo leh lakabka hoose ee ka hooseeya. IFC4 iyo IFC2x3 waxay helaan qaybaha isku mid ah sida walxaha civil ama proxy-yo. Markii la furo tren IFC 4.3 isbeddelladiisa iyo janjeerka ayuu dib u soo celiyaa. Fayl kasta waxa kale oo ku jira parcel-yada (raadka), dhirta iyo dhulka adag ee goobta beerta, iyo jidhka dhismayaasha (mid kasta waa IfcBuilding oo leh dabaqyadiisa), dhammaantood hal goob. Qaybaha sifooyinku waxay qabtaan waxa aad naqshadeysay: istaysiyada, assembly-ga, janjeerrada jarista iyo buuxinta, ballaca iyo tirada dariiqa, invert-ka, rim-ka, dherarka derbiyada; tirooyinka (dherarka, aagagga, mugaha) waa qaybaha IfcElementQuantity. Cabbirrada iyo isku-xidhka Faylku waxa uu ku jiraa cutubka dherarka mashruuca (mitir, ama feet-ka sahanka Mareykanka); aagagga iyo mugaha waa mitir laba-geesood iyo saddex-geesood. Haddii nidaam isku-xidhka (GIS › Isku-xidhka) ku jiro, faylku wuxuu khariidadda ku dhigmaa: bari iyo waqooyiga asalkiisa, iyo wareejinta iyo cabbirka nidaamka dhulka (local), waxay ku jiraan beddelka khariidadda. Haddii aanu jirin, faylku wuxuu duubayaa asalkiisa gudaha ee set-ka sifooyinka oo ma dhigmo khariidad. Soo dhoofinta Fur fayl .ifc Fur ama ku tuur qorshaha. Wada-hadalka soo dhoofinta wuxuu sheegayaa waxa faylku ku hayo: Xariiqyada IFC 4.3 (qaabka toosan iyo kan sare) iyo qalooca xariiqyada IFC 4x1 waxay noqdaan xariiqyo CivilCraft leh PI-yadooda, radiyaskooda, dherarka spiral-ka iyo PVI-yadooda. Xariiq aan qaabka PI ee CivilCraft ku hayn karin (qalooca isku dhegan, spiral-ka u dhexeeya laba qalooc, mid ku bilaabma ama ku dhammaada qalooc) lama soo dhoofin, wada-hadalkuna wuxuu sheegayaa sababta. Dusha: dooro midka noqonaya dhulka jira, ama ku hay kii mashruuca. Wax kale oo dhan (iyo dusha kale) waxaa lagu muuji karaa muuqaalka 3D sida tixraac. Walxaha tixraacu way jiraan intii mashruuca furan yahay; ma kaydsana faylka mashruuca. Fayl uu CivilCraft ku qoray IFC4 ama IFC2x3 xariiqyadiisa wuxuu dib u soo celiyaa si sax ah set-yada sifooyinkooda. Weli lama dhisin Superelevation-ka waddada waxa loo qoraa sida dhacdooyinka superelevation iyo dusha waddada (janjeerka (cant) waa tren-ka). Kaydinta walxaha tixraacu fayl mashruuca gudihiisa, iyo soo dhoofinta shabakadaha tuubooyinka ama padyada IFC sida walxo la tafatiri karo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"coordinate-systems","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Deji nidaamka koordinaatada mashruuca","summary":"Sheeg nidaamka koordinaatada sahanka, si CivilCraft u muujiyo latitude iyo longitude, u dhigo faylasha GIS iyo layers-ka khariidadda, oo u qoro faylasha .prj. Dooro koodka, magaca, koordinaatada laftooda ama fayl .prj.","section":"tasks","order":130,"keywords":["nidaamka koordinaatada","crs","epsg","srid","state plane","spcs","utm","nad83","wgs 84","projection","prj","wkt","datum","latitude","longitude","lat long","juqraafi","grid","georeference","georeferencing","deji nidaamka koordinaatada"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-nidaamka","text":"Dooro nidaamka","level":2},{"id":"beddel-ama-ka-saar-nidaamka","text":"Beddel ama ka saar nidaamka","level":2},{"id":"latitude-iyo-longitude-bar-xaaladda","text":"Latitude iyo longitude bar-xaaladda","level":2},{"id":"sida-uga-wanaagsan-tahay-isbeddelka-datum-ka","text":"Sida uga wanaagsan tahay isbeddelka datum-ka","level":2},{"id":"faylasha-isbeddelka-shabakadda","text":"Faylasha isbeddelka shabakadda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-hubiyay","text":"Waxa la hubiyay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKoordinaatada mashruuca waa tiro caadi ah ilaa aad sheegto waxay macnaheeda yihiin. Dejinta nidaamka koordinaatada \u003Cstrong\u003Eweligeed ma dhaqaajiso wax\u003C/strong\u003E: waxay u sheegtaa CivilCraft in, tusaale ahaan, E 6,150,000 N 2,080,000 yihiin koordinaatada state plane ee California aagga 6 oo ku qoran fiit sahan oo US ah. Markay taas garato:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebar-xaaladdu waxay muujinaysaa latitude iyo longitude ee tusaha,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Efaylasha GIS ee nidaamyo kale (shapefiles, GeoJSON, GeoPackage, shabakadaha dhererka, LiDAR) waxaa loo beddelaa mashruuca markay furmaan,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elayers-ka khariidadda ayaa lagu sawiri karaa hoosta qorshaha (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/map-layers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/map-layers\"\u003EMuuji layers-ka khariidadda hoosta qorshaha\u003C/a\u003E),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhoofinta qaababka GIS waxay qaadaa nidaamka (\u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E shapefiles-ka, koodka EPSG ee GeoPackage iyo GeoTIFF).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-nidaamka\"\u003EDooro nidaamka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-xirka\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGIS\u003C/span\u003E ee toolbar-ka. Wada-hadalka \u003Cstrong\u003ENidaamka koordinaatada\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa furmaa. Sare waxay sheegaysaa nidaamka mashruucu hadda ku jiro, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMidna — koordinaatadu waa tiro oo keliya\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHel nidaamka mid ka mid ah siyaabahan:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi\u003C/strong\u003E: ku qor koodka EPSG (\u003Ccode\u003E2277\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EEPSG:2277\u003C/code\u003E) ama erayo ka mid ah magaca (\u003Ccode\u003Etexas central\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eutm 14n\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elambert-93\u003C/code\u003E). Koodhadhku waxay ka bilaabmaan kii aad qortay; erayadu waxay soo bandhigaan nidaamyada magacooda ku leh erayada oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENidaamyada koordinaatadani ku habboon yihiin\u003C/span\u003E (marka mashruucu leeyahay barood ama dusha): CivilCraft wuxuu akhrisaa dhexda mashruucaaga nidaam kasta oo ka mid ah qoyska cutubka mashruuca, kana liiskeeya kuwa aagooda isticmaalka uu ku jiro. Koordinaatada state plane badanaa waxay ku habboon yihiin kaliya meelo yar: mashruuc ku yaal Texas oo ah E 3,115,000 N 10,070,000 fiit sahan oo US ah wuxuu ku habboon yahay afarta nooc ee Texas Central (NAD83, NAD83(2011), HARN, NSRS2007). Qoraal kasta wuxuu muujinayaa halka dhexda mashruucaaga ku dhacdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAg ku dhow (lat, long)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo jeedi\u003C/span\u003E: ku qor meesha goobtu ku taal, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E30.27, -97.74\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E30°16′N 97°44′W\u003C/code\u003E, CivilCraft wuxuu liiskeeyaa nidaamyada mashruuca aagooda ku jira, shabakadaha qaranka iyo gobolka ayaa hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAkhri fayl .prj…\u003C/span\u003E: fur \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E ku timid shapefile ama naqshad. CivilCraft wuxuu ku isbarbardhigaa liistiisa xisaabta isbeddelka (haddii \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E uu datum kale magac ku siiyo, weli wuu helaa nidaamka saxda ah) wuxuuna sheegayaa kan uu yahay; haddii midna aanu si sax ah u iswaafaqin, waxaa la isticmaalaa sharaxaadda faylka laftiisa. Waxaad sidoo kale dhigi kartaa \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E wada-hadalka, ama fur ama dhig qorshaha keligiis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji nidaam liiska ku jira. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ELa doortay\u003C/strong\u003E waxay muujinaysaa magaca, koodka EPSG, cutubka, sida datum-kiisu ugu xidhan yahay WGS 84, aagga isticmaalka ee latitude iyo longitude, iyo meesha dhexda mashruucaaga ku dhacdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa tag \u003Cstrong\u003EShabakad\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooran (inta badan mashruucyada; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ground-and-local-coordinates\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ground-and-local-coordinates\"\u003EDhulka iyo koordinaatada maxalliga ah\u003C/a\u003E kuwa kale) oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBar-xaaladda hadda waxay muujinaysaa latitude iyo longitude ee tusaha, oo ku xiga E iyo N. Dejinta nidaamka waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECutubyadu waa inay isku mid noqdaan: mashruuc fiit ah wuxuu qaataa nidaamyo fiit sahan oo US ah ama fiit caalami ah; mashruuc mitir ah wuxuu qaataa nidaamyo mitir ah. CivilCraft wuxuu sharxaa diidmada (\\&quot;Mashruucu waa fiit, laakiin nidaamkan waa mitir…\\&quot;). Mashruuc fiit ah oo leh nidaam fiit sahan oo US ah wuxuu isticmaalaa fiit sahan: \\&quot;ft\\&quot; ee mashruuca waxay macnaheedu tahay fiitka nidaamka. Nidaamyada juqraafiga (latitude iyo longitude, sida WGS 84 laftiisa) ma noqon karaan nidaamka mashruuca: naqshadaha waxay u baahan yihiin bari iyo waqooyi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-ama-ka-saar-nidaamka\"\u003EBeddel ama ka saar nidaamka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMar kale fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-xirka\u003C/span\u003E, dooro nidaam kale oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E. Marka mashruucu leeyahay barood ama naqshad, CivilCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EKoordinaatadu horay ma ku jiraan …?\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHaa — wax ma guuraan\u003C/span\u003E: tirooyinku way sidoodaan ahaadaan, oo kaliya macnahoodu wuu beddelaa. Isticmaal markii nidaamkii hore si khalad ah loo doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaya — beddel\u003C/span\u003E: barta sahan kasta, khadka jebinta, xuduudka, PI-ga jidka, geeska pad-ka iyo qaab-dhismeed waxaa loo beddelaa nidaamkii hore oo ku cusub, hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Dusha laga akhriyay LandXML oo saddexagallo ah lama beddeli karo; marka hore ka dhis barahaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar nidaamka\u003C/span\u003E waxay nidaamka ka saartaa (wax ma guuraan). Layers-ka GIS ee horay ugu jiray mashruuca waxay ku sii jiraan meeshooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"latitude-iyo-longitude-bar-xaaladda\"\u003ELatitude iyo longitude bar-xaaladda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInta mashruucu nidaam leeyahay, bar-xaaladdu waxay muujinaysaa latitude iyo longitude ee tusaha ee WGS 84, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E30°18′00.00″ N  97°42′00.00″ W\u003C/code\u003E. Dooro darajooyin tobanle halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ELatitude iyo longitude\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E). Koordinaatada dhulka ama maxalliga ah marka tahay, akhriska marka hore wuxuu maraa tallaabadaas, sidaas darteed waa sax barta hoosta tusaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-uga-wanaagsan-tahay-isbeddelka-datum-ka\"\u003ESida uga wanaagsan tahay isbeddelka datum-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELatitude, longitude, GeoJSON iyo layers-ka khariidadda dhammaantood waxay ku yaallaan WGS 84. Xidhiidhka nidaam kasta ee WGS 84 wuxuu muuqdaa wada-hadalka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWixii wada-hadalku sheegayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay micnaheedu yahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWGS 84 laftiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbeddel ma jiro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENAD83 waxaa loo qaadaa sidii WGS 84\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabadoodu waxay kala duwan yihiin mitir ama laba inta badan Waqooyiga Ameerika, ugu badnaan dhowr mitir. Waa wanaagsan layers-ka khariidadda iyo xaaladda goobta; ma aha xakameynta sahanka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la yaqaan ilaa \u003Cem\u003En\u003C/em\u003E m (qiimaha EPSG)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbeddel la daabacay; layers-ka khariidadda iyo GeoJSON way ka dhex dhacaan sidaas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDatum-kan lama yaqaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbeddel la daabacay ma jiro iyada oo aan fayl shabakad lahayn: layers-ka khariidadda iyo GeoJSON waxay ka dhex dhaci karaan boqolaal mitir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka isbeddelka shabakadda …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl isbeddel shabakad ayaa la isticmaalayaa (hoos): dhawr 10 cm oo NAD83 gudaha shabakadda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoordinaatadaada mashruuca ma mari doonaan isbeddel datum: kaliya waxa loo beddelo latitude iyo longitude ama laga beddelo. Datum-yada toosan iyo moodelada geoid ma la maaraynayo (dhererka weligood ma la beddelo). Meel ay isbeddelka ugu fiican u baahan tahay fayl shabakad, liiska waxa uu leeyahay isbeddel la daabacay oo qiyaas ah, wada-hadalkuna wuxuu muujinayaa saxnaanteeda (tusaale ahaan nidaamyada NAD27 qiyaastii 20 m), ilaa aad ku darto shabakadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-isbeddelka-shabakadda\"\u003EFaylasha isbeddelka shabakadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENidaam NAD27 ah, \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka isbeddelka shabakadda\u003C/strong\u003E ee wada-hadalka nidaamka wuxuu latitude iyo longitude, faylasha GIS iyo layers-ka khariidadda u geliyaa dhawr 10 cm oo NAD83 halkii ay ka ahaayeen qiyaastii 20 m:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo deji\u003C/strong\u003E shabakadda ay soo jeedinayso aagga nidaamka (NADCON5 Mareykanka isku xiran, NADCON Alaska, NTv2 Kanada) cdn.proj.org, server-ka shabakadaha dadweynaha ee PROJ. Magaca faylka shabakadda ayaa keliya la diraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar fayl shabakad…\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aad hore u haysatid: NTv2 (\u003Ccode\u003E.gsb\u003C/code\u003E) ama shabakadda PROJ GeoTIFF (\u003Ccode\u003E.tif\u003C/code\u003E), ilaa 20 MB.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShabakadda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca, sidaas darteed wuu raacaa mashruuca. Qaybtu waxay sheegaysaa in dhexda mashruucu gudaha shabakadda ku jirto iyo in kale: dibadda midkood, isbeddel ma la codsado, sidaas darteed isticmaal shabakad goobta daboolaysa. \u003Cstrong\u003EJooji isticmaalka shabakadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dib ugu celinayaa isbeddelka qiyaasta ah. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqoonaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayers-ka GIS ee horay ugu jiray mashruuca way sii jiraan meeshooda marka shabakaddu beddelto; dib u soo dhoof si aad ugu dhigto shabakadda. Koordinaatada mashruuca weligood ma dhaqaaqdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-hubiyay\"\u003EWaxa la hubiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddelaad kasta waxaa loo barbardhigay PROJ (pyproj 3.7.1 oo leh PROJ 9.5.1), maktabadda koordinaatada ee inta badan barnaamijyada GIS isticmaalaan, oo ku saabsan in ka badan 330 nidaam: state plane fiit sahan oo US ah iyo fiit, UTM waqooyi iyo koonfur, Lambert-93, British National Grid, GDA2020 MGA, New Zealand Transverse Mercator iyo web Mercator oo ka mid ah. Bari iyo waqooyiga waxay ku heshiiyaan 1 cm isla isbeddelka datum-ka (inta badan ka hooseeya 1 mm), xisaabaadka projection-ka ayaa heshiiya qeexidda PROJ 1 cm ilaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E ee PROJ qoray labada qaab ee caadiga ah (ESRI iyo OGC) ayaa dib loo akhriyay 105 nidaam: 208 ka 210 waxay iswaafaqeen koodkooda EPSG ee saxda ah, labada kale nidaam leh xisaab isku mid ah oo ellipsoid isku mid ah. Faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E ee CivilCraft qoro PROJ ayaa akhrisa nidaam isku mid ah. Faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E ESRI ee nidaamyada polar stereographic (UPS, Alaska polar) ma akhrin karaan; dooro nidaamyadaas koodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELatitude iyo longitude bar-xaaladda ayaa iswaafaqay PROJ ilaa 0.01″ browser-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Koordinaatada mashruuca waa tiro caadi ah ilaa aad sheegto waxay macnaheeda yihiin. Dejinta nidaamka koordinaatada weligeed ma dhaqaajiso wax: waxay u sheegtaa CivilCraft in, tusaale ahaan, E 6,150,000 N 2,080,000 yihiin koordinaatada state plane ee California aagga 6 oo ku qoran fiit sahan oo US ah. Markay taas garato: bar-xaaladdu waxay muujinaysaa latitude iyo longitude ee tusaha, faylasha GIS ee nidaamyo kale (shapefiles, GeoJSON, GeoPackage, shabakadaha dhererka, LiDAR) waxaa loo beddelaa mashruuca markay furmaan, layers-ka khariidadda ayaa lagu sawiri karaa hoosta qorshaha (Muuji layers-ka khariidadda hoosta qorshaha), dhoofinta qaababka GIS waxay qaadaa nidaamka (.prj shapefiles-ka, koodka EPSG ee GeoPackage iyo GeoTIFF). Dooro nidaamka Dooro Isku-xirka kooxda GIS ee toolbar-ka. Wada-hadalka Nidaamka koordinaatada ayaa furmaa. Sare waxay sheegaysaa nidaamka mashruucu hadda ku jiro, ama Midna — koordinaatadu waa tiro oo keliya. Hel nidaamka mid ka mid ah siyaabahan: Raadi: ku qor koodka EPSG (2277, EPSG:2277) ama erayo ka mid ah magaca (texas central, utm 14n, lambert-93). Koodhadhku waxay ka bilaabmaan kii aad qortay; erayadu waxay soo bandhigaan nidaamyada magacooda ku leh erayada oo dhan. Nidaamyada koordinaatadani ku habboon yihiin (marka mashruucu leeyahay barood ama dusha): CivilCraft wuxuu akhrisaa dhexda mashruucaaga nidaam kasta oo ka mid ah qoyska cutubka mashruuca, kana liiskeeya kuwa aagooda isticmaalka uu ku jiro. Koordinaatada state plane badanaa waxay ku habboon yihiin kaliya meelo yar: mashruuc ku yaal Texas oo ah E 3,115,000 N 10,070,000 fiit sahan oo US ah wuxuu ku habboon yahay afarta nooc ee Texas Central (NAD83, NAD83(2011), HARN, NSRS2007). Qoraal kasta wuxuu muujinayaa halka dhexda mashruucaaga ku dhacdo. Ag ku dhow (lat, long) iyo Soo jeedi: ku qor meesha goobtu ku taal, tusaale ahaan 30.27, -97.74 ama 30°16′N 97°44′W, CivilCraft wuxuu liiskeeyaa nidaamyada mashruuca aagooda ku jira, shabakadaha qaranka iyo gobolka ayaa hore. Akhri fayl .prj…: fur .prj ku timid shapefile ama naqshad. CivilCraft wuxuu ku isbarbardhigaa liistiisa xisaabta isbeddelka (haddii .prj uu datum kale magac ku siiyo, weli wuu helaa nidaamka saxda ah) wuxuuna sheegayaa kan uu yahay; haddii midna aanu si sax ah u iswaafaqin, waxaa la isticmaalaa sharaxaadda faylka laftiisa. Waxaad sidoo kale dhigi kartaa .prj wada-hadalka, ama fur ama dhig qorshaha keligiis. Guji nidaam liiska ku jira. Hoosta La doortay waxay muujinaysaa magaca, koodka EPSG, cutubka, sida datum-kiisu ugu xidhan yahay WGS 84, aagga isticmaalka ee latitude iyo longitude, iyo meesha dhexda mashruucaaga ku dhacdo. Ka tag Shabakad oo dooran (inta badan mashruucyada; eeg Dhulka iyo koordinaatada maxalliga ah kuwa kale) oo dooro Codso. Bar-xaaladda hadda waxay muujinaysaa latitude iyo longitude ee tusaha, oo ku xiga E iyo N. Dejinta nidaamka waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo: Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaysa. Cutubyadu waa inay isku mid noqdaan: mashruuc fiit ah wuxuu qaataa nidaamyo fiit sahan oo US ah ama fiit caalami ah; mashruuc mitir ah wuxuu qaataa nidaamyo mitir ah. CivilCraft wuxuu sharxaa diidmada (\\\"Mashruucu waa fiit, laakiin nidaamkan waa mitir…\\\"). Mashruuc fiit ah oo leh nidaam fiit sahan oo US ah wuxuu isticmaalaa fiit sahan: \\\"ft\\\" ee mashruuca waxay macnaheedu tahay fiitka nidaamka. Nidaamyada juqraafiga (latitude iyo longitude, sida WGS 84 laftiisa) ma noqon karaan nidaamka mashruuca: naqshadaha waxay u baahan yihiin bari iyo waqooyi. Beddel ama ka saar nidaamka Mar kale fur Isku-xirka, dooro nidaam kale oo dooro Codso. Marka mashruucu leeyahay barood ama naqshad, CivilCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa Koordinaatadu horay ma ku jiraan …? Haa — wax ma guuraan: tirooyinku way sidoodaan ahaadaan, oo kaliya macnahoodu wuu beddelaa. Isticmaal markii nidaamkii hore si khalad ah loo doortay. Maya — beddel: barta sahan kasta, khadka jebinta, xuduudka, PI-ga jidka, geeska pad-ka iyo qaab-dhismeed waxaa loo beddelaa nidaamkii hore oo ku cusub, hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Dusha laga akhriyay LandXML oo saddexagallo ah lama beddeli karo; marka hore ka dhis barahaaga. Ka saar nidaamka waxay nidaamka ka saartaa (wax ma guuraan). Layers-ka GIS ee horay ugu jiray mashruuca waxay ku sii jiraan meeshooda. Latitude iyo longitude bar-xaaladda Inta mashruucu nidaam leeyahay, bar-xaaladdu waxay muujinaysaa latitude iyo longitude ee tusaha ee WGS 84, tusaale ahaan 30°18′00.00″ N 97°42′00.00″ W. Dooro darajooyin tobanle halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd hoosta Dejinta, CivilCraft, Latitude iyo longitude (Dejinta CivilCraft). Koordinaatada dhulka ama maxalliga ah marka tahay, akhriska marka hore wuxuu maraa tallaabadaas, sidaas darteed waa sax barta hoosta tusaha. Sida uga wanaagsan tahay isbeddelka datum-ka Latitude, longitude, GeoJSON iyo layers-ka khariidadda dhammaantood waxay ku yaallaan WGS 84. Xidhiidhka nidaam kasta ee WGS 84 wuxuu muuqdaa wada-hadalka: Wixii wada-hadalku sheegayo Waxa ay micnaheedu yahay WGS 84 laftiisa Isbeddel ma jiro. NAD83 waxaa loo qaadaa sidii WGS 84 Labadoodu waxay kala duwan yihiin mitir ama laba inta badan Waqooyiga Ameerika, ugu badnaan dhowr mitir. Waa wanaagsan layers-ka khariidadda iyo xaaladda goobta; ma aha xakameynta sahanka. Waa la yaqaan ilaa n m (qiimaha EPSG) Isbeddel la daabacay; layers-ka khariidadda iyo GeoJSON way ka dhex dhacaan sidaas. Datum-kan lama yaqaan Isbeddel la daabacay ma jiro iyada oo aan fayl shabakad lahayn: layers-ka khariidadda iyo GeoJSON waxay ka dhex dhaci karaan boqolaal mitir. Faylka isbeddelka shabakadda … Fayl isbeddel shabakad ayaa la isticmaalayaa (hoos): dhawr 10 cm oo NAD83 gudaha shabakadda. Koordinaatadaada mashruuca ma mari doonaan isbeddel datum: kaliya waxa loo beddelo latitude iyo longitude ama laga beddelo. Datum-yada toosan iyo moodelada geoid ma la maaraynayo (dhererka weligood ma la beddelo). Meel ay isbeddelka ugu fiican u baahan tahay fayl shabakad, liiska waxa uu leeyahay isbeddel la daabacay oo qiyaas ah, wada-hadalkuna wuxuu muujinayaa saxnaanteeda (tusaale ahaan nidaamyada NAD27 qiyaastii 20 m), ilaa aad ku darto shabakadda. Faylasha isbeddelka shabakadda Nidaam NAD27 ah, Faylka isbeddelka shabakadda ee wada-hadalka nidaamka wuxuu latitude iyo longitude, faylasha GIS iyo layers-ka khariidadda u geliyaa dhawr 10 cm oo NAD83 halkii ay ka ahaayeen qiyaastii 20 m: Soo deji shabakadda ay soo jeedinayso aagga nidaamka (NADCON5 Mareykanka isku xiran, NADCON Alaska, NTv2 Kanada) cdn.proj.org, server-ka shabakadaha dadweynaha ee PROJ. Magaca faylka shabakadda ayaa keliya la diraa. Ama Ku dar fayl shabakad… haddii aad hore u haysatid: NTv2 (.gsb) ama shabakadda PROJ GeoTIFF (.tif), ilaa 20 MB. Shabakadda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca, sidaas darteed wuu raacaa mashruuca. Qaybtu waxay sheegaysaa in dhexda mashruucu gudaha shabakadda ku jirto iyo in kale: dibadda midkood, isbeddel ma la codsado, sidaas darteed isticmaal shabakad goobta daboolaysa. Jooji isticmaalka shabakadda wuxuu dib ugu celinayaa isbeddelka qiyaasta ah. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqoonaysa. Layers-ka GIS ee horay ugu jiray mashruuca way sii jiraan meeshooda marka shabakaddu beddelto; dib u soo dhoof si aad ugu dhigto shabakadda. Koordinaatada mashruuca weligood ma dhaqaaqdo. Waxa la hubiyay Beddelaad kasta waxaa loo barbardhigay PROJ (pyproj 3.7.1 oo leh PROJ 9.5.1), maktabadda koordinaatada ee inta badan barnaamijyada GIS isticmaalaan, oo ku saabsan in ka badan 330 nidaam: state plane fiit sahan oo US ah iyo fiit, UTM waqooyi iyo koonfur, Lambert-93, British National Grid, GDA2020 MGA, New Zealand Transverse Mercator iyo web Mercator oo ka mid ah. Bari iyo waqooyiga waxay ku heshiiyaan 1 cm isla isbeddelka datum-ka (inta badan ka hooseeya 1 mm), xisaabaadka projection-ka ayaa heshiiya qeexidda PROJ 1 cm ilaa. Faylasha .prj ee PROJ qoray labada qaab ee caadiga ah (ESRI iyo OGC) ayaa dib loo akhriyay 105 nidaam: 208 ka 210 waxay iswaafaqeen koodkooda EPSG ee saxda ah, labada kale nidaam leh xisaab isku mid ah oo ellipsoid isku mid ah. Faylasha .prj ee CivilCraft qoro PROJ ayaa akhrisa nidaam isku mid ah. Faylasha .prj ESRI ee nidaamyada polar stereographic (UPS, Alaska polar) ma akhrin karaan; dooro nidaamyadaas koodka. Latitude iyo longitude bar-xaaladda ayaa iswaafaqay PROJ ilaa 0.01″ browser-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"ground-and-local-coordinates","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Koordinates-ka dhulka iyo kuwa maxalliga ah","summary":"Ka shaqee koordinates-ka dhulka (dusha) oo laga qaaday shabakadda iyada oo loo jeediyay isku dhafan-ka cabbirka ee aad qortid ama aad xisaabiso dhibic, ama shabakad goob la malaynayo oo la xidhiidhsan nidaamka laba dhibcood oo xakameyn ah.","section":"tasks","order":131,"keywords":["koordinates-ka dhulka","koordinates-ka dusha","shabakad ilaa dhul","isku dhafan-ka cabbirka","csf","isku dhafan","cabbirka shabakadda","cabbirka dhererka","cabbirka badda","convergence","geesta khariidaynta","cabbirka","koordinates-ka la malaynayo","koordinates-ka maxalliga ah","shabakadda goobta","5000 5000","dhibcaha xakameynta","localization","calibration","laba-dhibic","misclosure"],"headings":[{"id":"koordinates-ka-dhulka","text":"Koordinates-ka dhulka","level":2},{"id":"koordinates-ka-maxalliga-ah-la-malaynayo","text":"Koordinates-ka maxalliga ah (la malaynayo)","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-hubiyay","text":"Waxa la hubiyay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKoordinates-ka state plane iyo UTM waa koordinates \u003Cstrong\u003Eshabakad\u003C/strong\u003E: saadaasha khariidadu way ballaadhisaa ama yareysaa masaafooyinka yar (tobanaan qaybood halkii milyan), oo meesha sare ee goobta ay tahay, masaafada dhulka la cabbiray way ka duwan tahay tan shabakadda. Sidaas darteed sahamiyo badani waxay gaarsiiyaan koordinates-ka \u003Cstrong\u003Edhulka\u003C/strong\u003E, oo la cabbiray si masaafooyinka qorshaha ay ula mid noqdaan masaafooyinka dhulka lagu cabbiray, ama shabakad goob \u003Cstrong\u003Ela malaynayo\u003C/strong\u003E (5000, 5000 dhibic xakameyn). CivilCraft wuxuu ilaaliyaa tirooyinkaaga siday yihiin wuxuuna diiwaan geliyaa siday ula xidhiidhaan shabakadda, sidaas darteed latitude iyo longitude, faylasha GIS iyo lakabyada khariidadda weli meesha saxda ah ayay ku dhacaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-xirka\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGIS\u003C/span\u003E, dooro (ama ilaali) nidaamka, kadibna dooro hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EShabakad, dhul ama koordinates maxalli ah\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorasho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKoordinates-kaagu waa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESida ay ula xidhiidhaan shabakadda\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShabakad\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENidaamka laftiisa (bilowga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirooyin isku mid ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhul\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir loo beddelay masaafooyinka dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Egrid = base + combined factor × (ground − base)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGudaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakad goob la malaynayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaaqay, wareegay oo cabbir loo beddelay shabakadda laba dhibcood oo xakameyn ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxkasta oo aad dooratid waa la kaydiyaa mashruuca waana hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo; waxba ma dhaqaaqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koordinates-ka-dhulka\"\u003EKoordinates-ka dhulka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhul\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku dhafan-ka cabbirka\u003C/strong\u003E sahanka ka yimid (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E0.99987\u003C/code\u003E), ama xisaabi:\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EXisaabi cabbirka dhibic\u003C/strong\u003E, dhibicu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa badhka dhexe ee mashruuca. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro barta qorshaha\u003C/span\u003E oo riix meesha (riix ku dhow dhibic sahan wuxuu qaadaa dhibcaas), ama qor E iyo N.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhererka waxa uu ka yimaadaa dusha halkaas; qor mid kale haddii loo baahdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXisaabi\u003C/span\u003E. CivilCraft wuxuu muujinayaa:\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka shabakadda k\u003C/strong\u003E: sida saadaasha khariidadu u fidiso masaafooyinka halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka dhererka\u003C/strong\u003E: sida masaafooyinka ellipsoid-ka uga gaaban yihiin dhererkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku dhafan\u003C/strong\u003E = k × cabbirka dhererka: masaafada shabakadda = masaafada dhulka × tan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EConvergence\u003C/strong\u003E: xagga u dhexeeya waqooyiga shabakadda iyo waqooyiga run halkaas (azimuth-ka geodetic = azimuth-ka shabakadda + convergence).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal\u003C/span\u003E ee tirooyinka hoosta si isku dhafanka uu u galo sanduuqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta saldhigga\u003C/strong\u003E, halkaas oo koordinates-ka dhulka iyo shabakadda isku mid yihiin. Wuxuu ka bilaabmaa 0, 0: badi gobolada ku daabacaya koordinates-ka dhulka waxay cabbiraan iyagoo ku saleysan bilowga, sidaas darteed koordinates-ka dhulka waxay sii dhowaadaan kuwa shabakadda. Sahamiyo qaarkood waxay cabbiraan barta xakameynta mashruuca: isticmaal waxa sahanku sheegayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhererka waxa loo qaataa sida dhererka ka sare ellipsoid-ka. CivilCraft ma laha moodel geoid, sidaas darteed halka geoid-ku 30 m (100 ft) hoosaysa ama sarreeyo ellipsoid-ka, cabbirka dhererku wuxuu ka dhaadheer yahay qiyaastii 5 ppm. Marka sahanku sheego isku dhafankiisa, qor kaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koordinates-ka-maxalliga-ah-la-malaynayo\"\u003EKoordinates-ka maxalliga ah (la malaynayo)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGudaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibcaha xakameynta \u003Cstrong\u003E1\u003C/strong\u003E, qor lambarka dhibcaha sahanka (ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E oo riix qorshaha). Koordinates-ka maxalliga ah waxay ku muuqdaan dhinaciisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003Eshabakadda\u003C/strong\u003E E iyo N, ama latitude iyo longitude-kiisa sanduuqa saddexaad (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E30.2672, -97.7431\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee sidaas dhibcaha xakameynta \u003Cstrong\u003E2\u003C/strong\u003E, kolka ugu fog ee ugu dhow ee koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJeexjeexa\u003C/strong\u003E la helay, wuxuuna xusuusinayaa: \u003Cstrong\u003ELaba dhibic had iyo jeer si sax ah ayay ku habboonaadaan — hubi saddexaad.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibic \u003Cstrong\u003Ehubinta\u003C/strong\u003E ku sii si la mid ah. CivilCraft wuxuu muujinayaa inta ay ku fogaato koordinates-ka shabakadda aad qortay (misclosure-ka, cutubyada mashruuca iyo qaybo halkii milyan). Misclosure weyn waxay ka dhigan tahay dhibic qaldan, qalad qorista, ama koordinates cutub kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbir ka fog 1 (ka baxsan 0.5 ilaa 2) waa la diidaa: hubi dhibcaha iyo cutubyadooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-hubiyay\"\u003EWaxa la hubiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbirka iyo convergence-ka waxay la mid yihiin PROJ (pyproj 3.7.1 oo leh PROJ 9.5.1), maktabadda koordinates-ka ee barnaamijyada GIS badan isticmaalaan, ilaa 1 qayb halkii bilyan oo ku saabsan in ka badan 300 nidaam oo leh saadaalin conformal (state plane, UTM, transverse Mercator, Lambert conformal conic), iyo browser-ka dhibic laga doortay qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETillaabooyinka dhulka iyo kuwa maxalliga ah waxay u beddelaan dhinac ilaa dhinac ilaa 1 qayb halkii bilyan; laba dhibcood xakameyn waxay soo celinayaan cabbirka iyo jeexjeexa ay ku abuurmeen; dhibic hubin 0.05 ft ka fog waxay muujinayaa misclosure 0.05 ft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Koordinates-ka state plane iyo UTM waa koordinates shabakad: saadaasha khariidadu way ballaadhisaa ama yareysaa masaafooyinka yar (tobanaan qaybood halkii milyan), oo meesha sare ee goobta ay tahay, masaafada dhulka la cabbiray way ka duwan tahay tan shabakadda. Sidaas darteed sahamiyo badani waxay gaarsiiyaan koordinates-ka dhulka, oo la cabbiray si masaafooyinka qorshaha ay ula mid noqdaan masaafooyinka dhulka lagu cabbiray, ama shabakad goob la malaynayo (5000, 5000 dhibic xakameyn). CivilCraft wuxuu ilaaliyaa tirooyinkaaga siday yihiin wuxuuna diiwaan geliyaa siday ula xidhiidhaan shabakadda, sidaas darteed latitude iyo longitude, faylasha GIS iyo lakabyada khariidadda weli meesha saxda ah ayay ku dhacaan. Fur Isku-xirka kooxda GIS, dooro (ama ilaali) nidaamka, kadibna dooro hoosta Shabakad, dhul ama koordinates maxalli ah: Doorasho Koordinates-kaagu waa Sida ay ula xidhiidhaan shabakadda Shabakad Nidaamka laftiisa (bilowga) Tirooyin isku mid ah Dhul Cabbir loo beddelay masaafooyinka dhulka grid = base + combined factor × (ground − base) Gudaha Shabakad goob la malaynayo Dhaqaaqay, wareegay oo cabbir loo beddelay shabakadda laba dhibcood oo xakameyn ah Waxkasta oo aad dooratid waa la kaydiyaa mashruuca waana hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo; waxba ma dhaqaaqo. Koordinates-ka dhulka Dooro Dhul. Qor Isku dhafan-ka cabbirka sahanka ka yimid (tusaale ahaan 0.99987), ama xisaabi: Hoosta Xisaabi cabbirka dhibic, dhibicu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa badhka dhexe ee mashruuca. Dooro Dooro barta qorshaha oo riix meesha (riix ku dhow dhibic sahan wuxuu qaadaa dhibcaas), ama qor E iyo N. Dhererka waxa uu ka yimaadaa dusha halkaas; qor mid kale haddii loo baahdo. Dooro Xisaabi. CivilCraft wuxuu muujinayaa: Cabbirka shabakadda k: sida saadaasha khariidadu u fidiso masaafooyinka halkaas. Cabbirka dhererka: sida masaafooyinka ellipsoid-ka uga gaaban yihiin dhererkaas. Isku dhafan = k × cabbirka dhererka: masaafada shabakadda = masaafada dhulka × tan. Convergence: xagga u dhexeeya waqooyiga shabakadda iyo waqooyiga run halkaas (azimuth-ka geodetic = azimuth-ka shabakadda + convergence). Dooro badhanka Isticmaal ee tirooyinka hoosta si isku dhafanka uu u galo sanduuqa. Deji Barta saldhigga, halkaas oo koordinates-ka dhulka iyo shabakadda isku mid yihiin. Wuxuu ka bilaabmaa 0, 0: badi gobolada ku daabacaya koordinates-ka dhulka waxay cabbiraan iyagoo ku saleysan bilowga, sidaas darteed koordinates-ka dhulka waxay sii dhowaadaan kuwa shabakadda. Sahamiyo qaarkood waxay cabbiraan barta xakameynta mashruuca: isticmaal waxa sahanku sheegayo. Dooro Codso. Dhererka waxa loo qaataa sida dhererka ka sare ellipsoid-ka. CivilCraft ma laha moodel geoid, sidaas darteed halka geoid-ku 30 m (100 ft) hoosaysa ama sarreeyo ellipsoid-ka, cabbirka dhererku wuxuu ka dhaadheer yahay qiyaastii 5 ppm. Marka sahanku sheego isku dhafankiisa, qor kaas. Koordinates-ka maxalliga ah (la malaynayo) Dooro Gudaha. Dhibcaha xakameynta 1, qor lambarka dhibcaha sahanka (ama dooro Dooro oo riix qorshaha). Koordinates-ka maxalliga ah waxay ku muuqdaan dhinaciisa. Qor shabakadda E iyo N, ama latitude iyo longitude-kiisa sanduuqa saddexaad (tusaale ahaan 30.2672, -97.7431). Samee sidaas dhibcaha xakameynta 2, kolka ugu fog ee ugu dhow ee koowaad. CivilCraft wuxuu muujinayaa Cabbirka iyo Jeexjeexa la helay, wuxuuna xusuusinayaa: Laba dhibic had iyo jeer si sax ah ayay ku habboonaadaan — hubi saddexaad. Dhibic hubinta ku sii si la mid ah. CivilCraft wuxuu muujinayaa inta ay ku fogaato koordinates-ka shabakadda aad qortay (misclosure-ka, cutubyada mashruuca iyo qaybo halkii milyan). Misclosure weyn waxay ka dhigan tahay dhibic qaldan, qalad qorista, ama koordinates cutub kale. Dooro Codso. Cabbir ka fog 1 (ka baxsan 0.5 ilaa 2) waa la diidaa: hubi dhibcaha iyo cutubyadooda. Waxa la hubiyay Cabbirka iyo convergence-ka waxay la mid yihiin PROJ (pyproj 3.7.1 oo leh PROJ 9.5.1), maktabadda koordinates-ka ee barnaamijyada GIS badan isticmaalaan, ilaa 1 qayb halkii bilyan oo ku saabsan in ka badan 300 nidaam oo leh saadaalin conformal (state plane, UTM, transverse Mercator, Lambert conformal conic), iyo browser-ka dhibic laga doortay qorshaha. Tillaabooyinka dhulka iyo kuwa maxalliga ah waxay u beddelaan dhinac ilaa dhinac ilaa 1 qayb halkii bilyan; laba dhibcood xakameyn waxay soo celinayaan cabbirka iyo jeexjeexa ay ku abuurmeen; dhibic hubin 0.05 ft ka fog waxay muujinayaa misclosure 0.05 ft.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"map-layers","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Muuji lakabyada khariidadda hoosta qorshaha","summary":"Dhig sawir juqraafi ahaan lagu xidhay, dhajinta khariidadda, server WMS ama WMTS, ama adeeg khariidad sida xaaladda goobta, iyadoo la dejinayo internetka, iftiinka, kala horreynta iyo tixraaca ilaha.","section":"tasks","order":135,"keywords":["lakabyada khariidadda","basemap","saldhigga khariidadda","background","sawirka dayax-gacmeedka","orthophoto","sawir","satellite","raster","world file","pgw","jgw","tfw","wld","geotiff","sawir juqraafi ahaan lagu xidhay","xyz","tiles","slippy map","wms","wmts","getcapabilities","adeeg khariidad","rest","mapserver","imageserver","usgs","national map","tixraac","iftiin"],"headings":[{"id":"dejinta-internetka","text":"Dejinta internetka","level":2},{"id":"sawir-juqraafi-ahaan-lagu-xidhay-internet-la-aan-ayuu-shaqeeyaa","text":"Sawir juqraafi ahaan lagu xidhay (internet la'aan ayuu shaqeeyaa)","level":2},{"id":"tiles-wms-wmts-iyo-adeegyada-khariidadda","text":"Tiles, WMS, WMTS iyo adeegyada khariidadda","level":2},{"id":"sida-lakabyada-loo-sawiro","text":"Sida lakabyada loo sawiro","level":2},{"id":"beddel-kala-horreyn-iyo-ka-saar-lakabyada","text":"Beddel, kala horreyn iyo ka saar lakabyada","level":2},{"id":"marka-lakab-aanu-wax-muujin","text":"Marka lakab aanu wax muujin","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-hubiyay","text":"Waxa la hubiyay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELakabyada khariidadda waa sawirro laga sawiro hoosta naqshaddaada: sawir dayax-gacmeed oo leh world file-kiisa, ama khariidado ka timid server-yada internetka. Waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eaan\u003C/strong\u003E ku jirin PDF plots, DXF ama DWG exports, ama muuqaalka 3D; waa macluumaad goobeed oo kaliya shaashadda lagu arko.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMap\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGIS\u003C/span\u003E. Daaqada \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada khariidadda\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa liisanaysa lakabyada mashruuca oo ku darta kuwa cusub. Lakabyada khariidadda waxay u baahan yihiin nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coordinate-systems\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coordinate-systems\"\u003EDeji nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E), marka laga reebo sawir uu world file-kiisu isticmaalo isku-xirka mashruuca gaarka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta-internetka\"\u003EDejinta internetka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft waligiis ma weydiiyo server-ka khariidadda wax ilaa aad ogolaato: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada khariidadda internetka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EDamsan\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EFuran\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka uu furan yahay, CivilCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa server-yada aad ku darto sawirrada goobta shaashadda. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa kombuutarkan; server-ku wuxuu arkaa goobta iyo cinwaanka internetka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntii uu damsan yahay, lakabyada internetka waxay ku liisan yihiin daaqada laakiin waa lagu dhex-madoobeeyay, sababta ayaa la sheegay, wax kasta oo la sawiro ama la weydiiyo ma jiro. Furidda mashruuc oo magacyada server-yada ku qoran ma xiriirto iyaga. Sawir faylka ka yimid wuu shaqeeyaa labadaba. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen Settings\u003C/span\u003E ee daaqada ayaa kuu geeya meeshaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-juqraafi-ahaan-lagu-xidhay-internet-la-aan-ayuu-shaqeeyaa\"\u003ESawir juqraafi ahaan lagu xidhay (internet la&#039;aan ayuu shaqeeyaa)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar lakab\u003C/strong\u003E, hay \u003Cstrong\u003ESawir juqraafi ahaan lagu xidhay\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro faylalka: sawirka (PNG ama JPEG) \u003Cstrong\u003Eiyo\u003C/strong\u003E world file-kiisa (\u003Ccode\u003E.pgw\u003C/code\u003E PNG-ga, \u003Ccode\u003E.jgw\u003C/code\u003E JPEG-ga, ama \u003Ccode\u003E.wld\u003C/code\u003E) iyo, haddii uu jiro, \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E-kiisa. Waxaad sidoo kale ku ridi kartaa qorshaha hal mar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E aanu jirin, CivilCraft wuxuu weydiin doonaa nidaamka uu world file-ku isticmaalo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe project’s system\u003C/span\u003E (ugu badan), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick a system…\u003C/span\u003E, ama, mashruuc aan nidaam lahayn, \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xirka mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirka wuxuu ka muuqdaa qorshaha hoosteeda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeoTIFF RGB (sawir dayax-gacmeed oo loo kaydiyay GeoTIFF) wuxuu leeyahay goobtiisa iyo nidaamkiisa: fura keligiis. Sawirka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Egudaha faylka mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E (ilaa 25 MB); mid ka weyn waa la diidaa, cabbirkiisa ayaa la sheegaa, sidaas darteed kaydi nuqul yar (pixel yar, ama JPEG).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiles-wms-wmts-iyo-adeegyada-khariidadda\"\u003ETiles, WMS, WMTS iyo adeegyada khariidadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hore \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada khariidadda internetka\u003C/strong\u003E shaqee. Kadibna, \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar lakab\u003C/strong\u003E ku:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la dhejiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa CivilCraft sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EURL-ka tile-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETemplate oo leh \u003Ccode\u003E{z}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{x}\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E{y}\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E{-y}\u003C/code\u003E), iyo \u003Ccode\u003E{s}\u003C/code\u003E oo ah xaraf server; tusaale, \u003Ccode\u003Ehttps://tile.example.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png\u003C/code\u003E. Bixi magac iyo tixraacdeeda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiles web Mercator goobta iyo weynaynta shaashadda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EServer WMS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECinwaanka server-ka, ama xidhiidhka GetCapabilities. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGet the layers\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna lakabka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal sawir oo goobta shaashadda ah, oo la weydiiyo koodka EPSG ee mashruuca marka server-ku bixiyo; haddii kale web Mercator ama WGS 84.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EServer WMTS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECinwaanka server-ka, ama \u003Ccode\u003EWMTSCapabilities.xml\u003C/code\u003E. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGet the layers\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna lakabka iyo tile matrix set-ka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiles ka set-ka nidaamka mashruuca marka uu jiro; haddii kale web Mercator.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArcGIS map service (REST)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EURL oo ku dhammaanaya \u003Ccode\u003E/MapServer\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E/ImageServer\u003C/code\u003E. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERead the service\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdeegyada web Mercator ee kaydsan waxaa laga sawiraa tilesyadooda; kuwa kale waxaa loo weydiiyaa hal sawir oo goobta shaashadda ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EServer ma jiraan oo hore loo dejiyay. Tusaalooyin dadweyne, dhammaantood USGS National Map (xuquuq dadweyne):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWMS: \u003Ccode\u003Ehttps://basemap.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/services/USGSTopo/MapServer/WMSServer\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWMTS: \u003Ccode\u003Ehttps://basemap.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSTopo/MapServer/WMTS/1.0.0/WMTSCapabilities.xml\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdeeg khariidad: \u003Ccode\u003Ehttps://basemap.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSTopo/MapServer\u003C/code\u003E (sidoo kale \u003Ccode\u003EUSGSImageryOnly\u003C/code\u003E sawirrada dayax-gacmeedka)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXafiisyo badan oo GIS-ka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka ayaa daabaca WMS ama adeegyadooda khariidadda; bogagooda GIS-ka ayaa siiya cinwaankooda. Server-ka oo weydiiya gelitaan ama fure ma shaqeeyo: CivilCraft ma diro magacyo isticmaaleed, erayo sir ah ama furayaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-lakabyada-loo-sawiro\"\u003ESida lakabyada loo sawiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirrada nidaam ka duwan kan mashruuca waxaa lagu wareejiyaa gudaha: sawirka waxaa loo jeexaa qaybo, mid kastaa wuxuu ku yaal meel ka fog ugu badnaan robaqa pixel-ka shaashadda oo ka mid ah meesha isbeddel sax ah geeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiles waxaa la doortaa goobta shaashadda iyo weynaynta: ugu badnaan 64 muuqaal kasta, 6 mar kasta. Marka aad wareejiso ama weyneyso, codsiyada muuqaalka hore waa la joojiyaa. Qiyaastii 200 tiles ayaa xusuusta lagu hayaa (waxba lama kaydiyo diskka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirka WMS ama adeegga khariidadda waa la weydiiyaa markii muuqaalku joogsado; ilaa uu imaado, midka hore ayaa meeshiisa ku sii jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETixraaca lakab kasta ee shaashadda ayaa yar ku muuqda qorshaha hoose-midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-kala-horreyn-iyo-ka-saar-lakabyada\"\u003EBeddel, kala horreyn iyo ka saar lakabyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqada lakab kastaa wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq calaamad ah oo muujinaya ama qarinaya, jiid-ah \u003Cstrong\u003EOpacity\u003C/strong\u003E (iftiinka), fallaadho ah oo u dhigaya hoose (hore) ama dambe (korka), badhanka weynaynta (sawirrada) iyo badhanka ka saarista. Lakabka ugu horreeya liiska ayaa lagu sawiraa hoose. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-lakab-aanu-wax-muujin\"\u003EMarka lakab aanu wax muujin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESababtu mar ayay ka muuqataa status-khaddka, waxayna ku sii jirtaa magaca lakabka daaqada hoosteeda:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDamsan: lakabyada khariidadda internetka waa damsan yihiin Dejinta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShaqee \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada khariidadda internetka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay u baahan tahay nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDeji hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECoordinates\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EServer-ku ma oggolayn bogan inuu isticmaalo sawirradiisa (CORS), ama lama gaari karo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EServer-ku ma oggolayo bogagga webka inay isticmaalaan sawirradiisa, ama wuu hoos yimid. Afar diidmo ka dib CivilCraft wuu joojiyaa weydiinta; qari oo muuji lakabka si aad dib isku daydo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EServer-ku wuxuu ku jawaabay 404 … / Server-ku wuxuu diray text/xml, mana aha sawir: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EURL-ka, lakabka ama habka waa khalad, ama fariinta server-ku waxay sheegaysaa waxa uu rabo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabkan lama bixin nidaamka mashruuca, web Mercator ama WGS 84\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EServer-ku ma gelin karo meesha CivilCraft ku dhejin karo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-hubiyay\"\u003EWaxa la hubiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELambarada tiles-ka waxaa lagu hubiyay nidaamka caadiga ah ee web Mercator; jawaabaha WMS 1.1.1 iyo 1.3.0, WMTS iyo adeegga khariidadda waxaa laga akhriyay faylal gacanta lagu qoray iyo jawaabo dhab ah oo laga kaydiyay USGS National Map iyo server-yada OpenStreetMap ee terrestris; WMS 1.3.0 codsiyada waxay dhigaan latitude-ka marka hore EPSG:4326, sida heerku sheegayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareejinta waxaa lagu barbardhigay isbeddel sax ah oo pixel kasta, oo ku salaysan tirooyinka PROJ: dhow 0.13 px tiles, sawirrada WMS iyo sawir cabbirkiisu yahay degmo, cabbirka goobta iyo marka laga fogeeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir leh world file-kiisa iyo GeoTIFF RGB uu GDAL qoray (rasterio ku dhex) waxay sawiro meesha ay tilmaamayso, oo browser-ka lagu hubiyay pixel kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrowser-ka, server-ka tusaalaha ah ee kombuutarka tijaabada: tiles waxay ku dhacaan tile-ka PROJ dhigayo barta kasta; sawirka WMS wuxuu ku dhacaa 2 px dhexdeeda; ugu badnaan 6 codsi ayaa socda mar kasta; dejinta damsan, codsi kasta oo bogga ka baxa ma baxo. Adeegga khariidadda ee USGS National Map ee kor lagu sheegay waa la akhriyay oo browser-ka laga sawiray hal mar (tiles-kiisii way yimaadeen oo la sawiray, iyo qoraalkiisa xuquuqda); server-yada dadweynaha kale waxaa laga akhriyay jawaabo kaydsan oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Lakabyada khariidadda waa sawirro laga sawiro hoosta naqshaddaada: sawir dayax-gacmeed oo leh world file-kiisa, ama khariidado ka timid server-yada internetka. Waa aan ku jirin PDF plots, DXF ama DWG exports, ama muuqaalka 3D; waa macluumaad goobeed oo kaliya shaashadda lagu arko. Dooro Map kooxda GIS. Daaqada Lakabyada khariidadda ayaa liisanaysa lakabyada mashruuca oo ku darta kuwa cusub. Lakabyada khariidadda waxay u baahan yihiin nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca (Deji nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca), marka laga reebo sawir uu world file-kiisu isticmaalo isku-xirka mashruuca gaarka ah. Dejinta internetka CivilCraft waligiis ma weydiiyo server-ka khariidadda wax ilaa aad ogolaato: Settings, CivilCraft, Lakabyada khariidadda internetka: Damsan (bilowga) ama Furan. Marka uu furan yahay, CivilCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa server-yada aad ku darto sawirrada goobta shaashadda. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa kombuutarkan; server-ku wuxuu arkaa goobta iyo cinwaanka internetka. Intii uu damsan yahay, lakabyada internetka waxay ku liisan yihiin daaqada laakiin waa lagu dhex-madoobeeyay, sababta ayaa la sheegay, wax kasta oo la sawiro ama la weydiiyo ma jiro. Furidda mashruuc oo magacyada server-yada ku qoran ma xiriirto iyaga. Sawir faylka ka yimid wuu shaqeeyaa labadaba. Badhanka Open Settings ee daaqada ayaa kuu geeya meeshaas. Sawir juqraafi ahaan lagu xidhay (internet la'aan ayuu shaqeeyaa) Ku Ku dar lakab, hay Sawir juqraafi ahaan lagu xidhay oo dooro faylalka: sawirka (PNG ama JPEG) iyo world file-kiisa (.pgw PNG-ga, .jgw JPEG-ga, ama .wld) iyo, haddii uu jiro, .prj-kiisa. Waxaad sidoo kale ku ridi kartaa qorshaha hal mar. Haddii .prj aanu jirin, CivilCraft wuxuu weydiin doonaa nidaamka uu world file-ku isticmaalo: The project’s system (ugu badan), Pick a system…, ama, mashruuc aan nidaam lahayn, Isku-xirka mashruuca. Sawirka wuxuu ka muuqdaa qorshaha hoosteeda, Fit wuxuu ku daraa. GeoTIFF RGB (sawir dayax-gacmeed oo loo kaydiyay GeoTIFF) wuxuu leeyahay goobtiisa iyo nidaamkiisa: fura keligiis. Sawirka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka mashruuca (ilaa 25 MB); mid ka weyn waa la diidaa, cabbirkiisa ayaa la sheegaa, sidaas darteed kaydi nuqul yar (pixel yar, ama JPEG). Tiles, WMS, WMTS iyo adeegyada khariidadda Marka hore Lakabyada khariidadda internetka shaqee. Kadibna, Ku dar lakab ku: Ka Waxa la dhejiyo Waxa CivilCraft sameeyo URL-ka tile-ka Template oo leh {z}, {x} iyo {y} (ama {-y}), iyo {s} oo ah xaraf server; tusaale, https://tile.example.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png. Bixi magac iyo tixraacdeeda. Tiles web Mercator goobta iyo weynaynta shaashadda. Server WMS Cinwaanka server-ka, ama xidhiidhka GetCapabilities. Dooro Get the layers, kadibna lakabka. Hal sawir oo goobta shaashadda ah, oo la weydiiyo koodka EPSG ee mashruuca marka server-ku bixiyo; haddii kale web Mercator ama WGS 84. Server WMTS Cinwaanka server-ka, ama WMTSCapabilities.xml. Dooro Get the layers, kadibna lakabka iyo tile matrix set-ka. Tiles ka set-ka nidaamka mashruuca marka uu jiro; haddii kale web Mercator. ArcGIS map service (REST) URL oo ku dhammaanaya /MapServer ama /ImageServer. Dooro Read the service. Adeegyada web Mercator ee kaydsan waxaa laga sawiraa tilesyadooda; kuwa kale waxaa loo weydiiyaa hal sawir oo goobta shaashadda ah. Server ma jiraan oo hore loo dejiyay. Tusaalooyin dadweyne, dhammaantood USGS National Map (xuquuq dadweyne): WMS: https://basemap.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/services/USGSTopo/MapServer/WMSServer WMTS: https://basemap.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSTopo/MapServer/WMTS/1.0.0/WMTSCapabilities.xml Adeeg khariidad: https://basemap.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSTopo/MapServer (sidoo kale USGSImageryOnly sawirrada dayax-gacmeedka) Xafiisyo badan oo GIS-ka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka ayaa daabaca WMS ama adeegyadooda khariidadda; bogagooda GIS-ka ayaa siiya cinwaankooda. Server-ka oo weydiiya gelitaan ama fure ma shaqeeyo: CivilCraft ma diro magacyo isticmaaleed, erayo sir ah ama furayaal. Sida lakabyada loo sawiro Sawirrada nidaam ka duwan kan mashruuca waxaa lagu wareejiyaa gudaha: sawirka waxaa loo jeexaa qaybo, mid kastaa wuxuu ku yaal meel ka fog ugu badnaan robaqa pixel-ka shaashadda oo ka mid ah meesha isbeddel sax ah geeyo. Tiles waxaa la doortaa goobta shaashadda iyo weynaynta: ugu badnaan 64 muuqaal kasta, 6 mar kasta. Marka aad wareejiso ama weyneyso, codsiyada muuqaalka hore waa la joojiyaa. Qiyaastii 200 tiles ayaa xusuusta lagu hayaa (waxba lama kaydiyo diskka). Sawirka WMS ama adeegga khariidadda waa la weydiiyaa markii muuqaalku joogsado; ilaa uu imaado, midka hore ayaa meeshiisa ku sii jira. Tixraaca lakab kasta ee shaashadda ayaa yar ku muuqda qorshaha hoose-midig. Beddel, kala horreyn iyo ka saar lakabyada Daaqada lakab kastaa wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq calaamad ah oo muujinaya ama qarinaya, jiid-ah Opacity (iftiinka), fallaadho ah oo u dhigaya hoose (hore) ama dambe (korka), badhanka weynaynta (sawirrada) iyo badhanka ka saarista. Lakabka ugu horreeya liiska ayaa lagu sawiraa hoose. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah. Marka lakab aanu wax muujin Sababtu mar ayay ka muuqataa status-khaddka, waxayna ku sii jirtaa magaca lakabka daaqada hoosteeda: Fariinta Waxa la sameeyo Damsan: lakabyada khariidadda internetka waa damsan yihiin Dejinta. Shaqee Lakabyada khariidadda internetka. Waxay u baahan tahay nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca Deji hoos Coordinates. Server-ku ma oggolayn bogan inuu isticmaalo sawirradiisa (CORS), ama lama gaari karo. Server-ku ma oggolayo bogagga webka inay isticmaalaan sawirradiisa, ama wuu hoos yimid. Afar diidmo ka dib CivilCraft wuu joojiyaa weydiinta; qari oo muuji lakabka si aad dib isku daydo. Server-ku wuxuu ku jawaabay 404 … / Server-ku wuxuu diray text/xml, mana aha sawir: … URL-ka, lakabka ama habka waa khalad, ama fariinta server-ku waxay sheegaysaa waxa uu rabo. Lakabkan lama bixin nidaamka mashruuca, web Mercator ama WGS 84 Server-ku ma gelin karo meesha CivilCraft ku dhejin karo. Waxa la hubiyay Lambarada tiles-ka waxaa lagu hubiyay nidaamka caadiga ah ee web Mercator; jawaabaha WMS 1.1.1 iyo 1.3.0, WMTS iyo adeegga khariidadda waxaa laga akhriyay faylal gacanta lagu qoray iyo jawaabo dhab ah oo laga kaydiyay USGS National Map iyo server-yada OpenStreetMap ee terrestris; WMS 1.3.0 codsiyada waxay dhigaan latitude-ka marka hore EPSG:4326, sida heerku sheegayo. Wareejinta waxaa lagu barbardhigay isbeddel sax ah oo pixel kasta, oo ku salaysan tirooyinka PROJ: dhow 0.13 px tiles, sawirrada WMS iyo sawir cabbirkiisu yahay degmo, cabbirka goobta iyo marka laga fogeeyo. Sawir leh world file-kiisa iyo GeoTIFF RGB uu GDAL qoray (rasterio ku dhex) waxay sawiro meesha ay tilmaamayso, oo browser-ka lagu hubiyay pixel kasta. Browser-ka, server-ka tusaalaha ah ee kombuutarka tijaabada: tiles waxay ku dhacaan tile-ka PROJ dhigayo barta kasta; sawirka WMS wuxuu ku dhacaa 2 px dhexdeeda; ugu badnaan 6 codsi ayaa socda mar kasta; dejinta damsan, codsi kasta oo bogga ka baxa ma baxo. Adeegga khariidadda ee USGS National Map ee kor lagu sheegay waa la akhriyay oo browser-ka laga sawiray hal mar (tiles-kiisii way yimaadeen oo la sawiray, iyo qoraalkiisa xuquuqda); server-yada dadweynaha kale waxaa laga akhriyay jawaabo kaydsan oo keliya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhoofi goobta 3D ee USD ahaan","summary":"Qor muuqaalka goobta 3D (dusha, jeexyada, jeexyada jidka, tuubooyinka iyo barooyinka sahan dhulka) USD ahaan, iyada oo saxda ah tirada iyo koorodinadaha.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usda","usdc","usdz","openusd","dhoofin","3d","goob","dusha","jeexa","jeexyada jidka","barooyinka sahan dhulka","koorodinado","isku-dhis qaabka"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka 3D, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E oo ku taal dhinaca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOBJ\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa waxa muuqaalku muujinayo oo USD ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur muuqaalka 3D oo dooro waxa aad muujinayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EText (.usda)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBinary (.usdc)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPackage (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylku wuxuu ku jiraa tiro saxda ah (xad-dhaafka sare ee sare-joogga waa la soo celiyay), mitir ahaan, Z oo kor u taagan. Goobtu waxay ku taal bariga, waqooyiga iyo sare-joogyada mashruucaaga, waana sheegtaa nidaamka koorodinadyada marka mashruucu leeyahay. Dusha, tuubooyinka iyo qaababku waa mesh-yo leh midabkooda; kontuurrada, xarriiqyada jabinta iyo jeexyada koridoorka waa xarriiqyo; jeex kasta oo jid ah waa xarriiq gaar ah oo magaceeda ku dul jirta; barooyinka sahan dhulka waxay haystaan lambarradooda.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Muuqaalka 3D, USD oo ku taal dhinaca GLB iyo OBJ wuxuu qoraa waxa muuqaalku muujinayo oo USD ah. Fur muuqaalka 3D oo dooro waxa aad muujinayso. Fur USD oo dooro Text (.usda), Binary (.usdc) ama Package (.usdz). Faylku wuxuu ku jiraa tiro saxda ah (xad-dhaafka sare ee sare-joogga waa la soo celiyay), mitir ahaan, Z oo kor u taagan. Goobtu waxay ku taal bariga, waqooyiga iyo sare-joogyada mashruucaaga, waana sheegtaa nidaamka koorodinadyada marka mashruucu leeyahay. Dusha, tuubooyinka iyo qaababku waa mesh-yo leh midabkooda; kontuurrada, xarriiqyada jabinta iyo jeexyada koridoorka waa xarriiqyo; jeex kasta oo jid ah waa xarriiq gaar ah oo magaceeda ku dul jirta; barooyinka sahan dhulka waxay haystaan lambarradooda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"gis-import","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Soo dhoofi xogta GIS","summary":"Soo geli shapefile, GeoJSON iyo GeoPackage mashruuc ahaan lakabyo GIS, ku dhig nidaamka koordinates-ka saxda ah, eeg sifooyinkooda, oo isticmaal dusha.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["gis","calaamadee goobaha","sifooyinka qorshaha","kml","kmz","google earth","shapefile","shp","dbf","prj","zip","geojson","geopackage","gpkg","soo dhoofin","lakabyada","sifooyinka","nidaamka koordinates-ka","epsg","latitude","longitude","konturada","qaybaha dhulka","breaklines","xuduudda"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-faylasha","text":"Fur faylasha","level":2},{"id":"nidaamka-koordinates-ka","text":"Nidaamka koordinates-ka","level":2},{"id":"lakabyada-gis","text":"Lakabyada GIS","level":2},{"id":"calaamadee-goobaha-sifo-ka-mid-ah","text":"Calaamadee goobaha sifo ka mid ah","level":2},{"id":"eeg-goob","text":"Eeg goob","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-dusha","text":"Isticmaal dusha","level":2},{"id":"faylasha-dhibcaha-leh-latitude-iyo-longitude","text":"Faylasha dhibcaha leh latitude iyo longitude","level":2},{"id":"faylasha-landxml-ee-sheegaya-nidaam-koordinates-ka","text":"Faylasha LandXML ee sheegaya nidaam koordinates-ka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-hubiyay","text":"Waxa la hubiyay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXafiisyada GIS ee magaalada iyo degmada waxay siiyaan xogta deegaanka sida faylasha GIS: qaybaha dhulka, xaqa-maro, konturada, adeegyada, xakamaynta sahanka. CivilCraft wuxuu furaa saddex nooc oo ka mid ah \u003Cstrong\u003Elakabyo GIS\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jira naqshadaada qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la furo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShapefile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.shp\u003C/code\u003E oo ay weheliyaan \u003Ccode\u003E.shx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dbf\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.cpg\u003C/code\u003E (dhammaantood dooro), ama \u003Ccode\u003E.zip\u003C/code\u003E ay ku yimaadeen. Zip ku jira shapefile badan wuxuu siiyaa lakabyo badan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeoJSON\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka \u003Ccode\u003E.geojson\u003C/code\u003E (fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E oo sadarkiisa \u003Ccode\u003EFeatureCollection\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EFeature\u003C/code\u003E ku qoran bal sidoo kale shaqeeya).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeoPackage\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka \u003Ccode\u003E.gpkg\u003C/code\u003E. Miis kasta oo goob ku jira waa la liistaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKML ama KMZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka \u003Ccode\u003E.kml\u003C/code\u003E (Google Earth ama khariidad webka), ama \u003Ccode\u003E.kmz\u003C/code\u003E oo zipped. Folder kasta wuxuu noqdaa lakab (wuxuu kala go&#039;aa dhibcaha, xariiqyada iyo poligonada haddii ay dhowr nooc ku jiraan); magaca, sharraxaadda iyo xogta dheeraadka ah ee placemark-ka waxay noqdaan sifooyinkiisa. Dhererrada waa mitir, latitude iyo longitude, sida GeoJSON.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha, dhibco badan, xariiqyada, poligonada godad leh iyo qaabab qaybo badan leh waa la akhriyaa, dhererradooda (z) haddii faylku leeyahay. Qiimaha cabbirka (M) waa la iska tago. Shabakadaha heerarka iyo LiDAR waxay u furmaan sidii oo kale: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/elevation-grids-and-lidar\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/elevation-grids-and-lidar\"\u003EShabakadaha heerarka iyo LiDAR\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-faylasha\"\u003EFur faylasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EGIS\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E), dooro faylasha, ama ku rid qorshaha. Faylasha waxaa lagu akhriyaa kombiyuutarkan; waxba lama soo dirayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWada-hadalka \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi xogta GIS\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa lakabyo kasta la helay: nooceeda, inta goob (iyo inta aan geometry lahayn), inta goob sifo ah, iyo nidaamka koordinates-ka ee faylku sheegayo. Ka saar lakabyada aanad doonin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003ENidaamka koordinates-ka\u003C/strong\u003E (hoos) iyo xarriiqda \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa dhici doona\u003C/strong\u003E, kadib riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELakabyada waxay soo muuqan doonaan qorshaha iyo hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada GIS\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca bidix. Soo dhoofintu waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu soo celinayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFayl weyn wuxuu muujiyaa xariiq horumar ah qorshaha korkiisa, leh badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nidaamka-koordinates-ka\"\u003ENidaamka koordinates-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylasha GIS waxay sheegaan meesha ay ku yaallaan nidaam koordinates-ka (\u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E shapefile-ka, miiska tixraaca goobta GeoPackage; GeoJSON wuxuu weligiis yahay latitude iyo longitude). CivilCraft wuxuu lakab kasta uga beddelaa nidaamkiisa oo gaar ah kan mashruuca. Weligeed ma qiyaaso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruucu wuxuu leeyahay nidaam koordinates\u003C/strong\u003E (lagu dejiyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECoordinates\u003C/span\u003E): lakab kasta oo leh nidaam gaar ah waa la beddelaa ilaa mashruuca, oo ay ku jiraan dhul ama maxalli ah. Fayl aan \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E lahayn wuxuu helaa laba ikhtiyaar: \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku mid mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E (tirooyinkiisa waa la soo rarayaa sidooda) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro nidaamka faylka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruucu ma laha, faylku wuxuu ku jiraa nidaam la saadaalin oo ah cutubyada mashruucaaga\u003C/strong\u003E (aagga state plane ee fiit sahan Mareykan ah ee mashruuc fiitka, tusaale ahaan): wada-hadalku wuxuu soo bandhigayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal nidaamkaas sida nidaamka koordinates-ka ee mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa la dejiyaa isla hal tallaabada soo dhoofinta. Waxba mashruuca kuma dhaqaaqo; nidaamku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa tirooyinku ka dhigan yihiin. Waxaad dooran kartaa nidaam kale oo mashruuca ah, lakabyadana waa la beddelayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruucu ma laha, faylku wuxuu ku jiraa latitude iyo longitude\u003C/strong\u003E (GeoJSON kasta) \u003Cstrong\u003Eama cutubyo kale\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E waa aan la dooran karin ilaa aad dooratid nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca. Doorasho-wadaha wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meel ku dhow xogta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruuc iyo faylal midkoodna ma sheegaan nidaam\u003C/strong\u003E: tirooyinka waa la soo rarayaa sidooda, wada-hadalkuna wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhererradana waa la beddelaa: dhererrada GeoJSON waa mitir (heerka GeoJSON wuu sheegaa); dhererrada faylalka kale waxaa la qaadaa cutubka nidaamkooda gaarka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBooska faylka GeoJSON ee ka baxsan longitude ±180° ama latitude ±90° ma aha latitude iyo longitude. Goobahaas waa la iska tago, wada-hadalkuna wuxuu sheegaa tirada. Faylka noocaas badanaa waa fayl la saadaalin oo nidaamkiisa aan lagu kaydin; dib u weydii, ama weydii shapefile oo leh \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENAD83 waxa loo qaataa sida WGS 84 (nidaamka GeoJSON isticmaalo); labadaba waxay kala duwan yihiin dhowr mitir Waqooyiga Ameerika, sidaas darteed xogta GeoJSON waxay ku kala duwaan kartaa qadarkaas. Halka isbeddelka ugu fiican u baahan yahay fayl shabakad (tusaale ahaan NADCON ee NAD27), CivilCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa isbeddel qiyaas ah oo la daabacay, wada-hadalka nidaamka koordinates-ka wuxuu muujinayaa inta qiyaasku yahay (NAD27 ku dhawaad 20 m), ilaa aad ku darto shabakadda: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coordinate-systems\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coordinate-systems\"\u003EFaylasha isbeddelka shabakadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lakabyada-gis\"\u003ELakabyada GIS\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka kasta oo ku hoos yaal \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada GIS\u003C/strong\u003E waxa uu leeyahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ecalaamad sanduuq si lakabka loo muujiyo ama loo qariyo (lakabyada qarsan lama doorto mana jiraan);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emidabkiisa, oo laga doortay liiska;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eliis (saddex dhibic) oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeynee ilaa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal dusha…\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagac u beddel…\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuujinta, qarinta, midab-beddelka, magac-beddelka iyo ka saaridda waa tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo. Lakabyada GIS waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca oo markaad furto ayay soo noqdaan. Waxay sidoo kale ku baxaan qorshaha PDF plot-kiisa iyo soo dhoofinta DXF iyo DWG, mid kasta lakab la magacaabay \u003Ccode\u003EGIS-\u003C/code\u003E iyo lambarkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadee-goobaha-sifo-ka-mid-ah\"\u003ECalaamadee goobaha sifo ka mid ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska lakabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E (saddex dhibic oo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabyada GIS\u003C/strong\u003E), dooro goob hoos yaal \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadee iyadoo\u003C/strong\u003E: goob kasta wuxuu muujinayaa qiimihiisa qorshaha, midabka lakabka. Dhibcaha waxaa lagu calaamadeeyaa dhinaca dhibcaha, xariiqyada dhexda qaybtooda ugu dheer (la rogay si aad ugu akhrisato bidix ilaa midig), poligonada bartamaha. Tirooyinku waxay muujiyaan ilaa saddex meel oo kasoo horreysa. Calaamadaha waxay ahaan doonaan 1.8 mm dhererka warqadda cabbir kasta, waxayna galaan PDF plot, DXF iyo DWG. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamad la&#039;aan\u003C/strong\u003E si aad uga saarto; isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu soo celinayaa). Lakab wuxuu calaamadeeyaa ugu badnaan 5,000 goob.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-goob\"\u003EEeg goob\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E uu shaqaynayo, riix goob. \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa lakabkiisa, goobta ay tahay, qaabkeeda (qaybaha, godadka, geesaha), dhererradeeda, faylka ka yimid iyo nidaamka koordinates-ka faylkaas, kadib sifo kasta miis ku jira. Sifooyinka waa kuwo keliya-akhris: CivilCraft wuxuu muujiyaa xogta GIS sidii ay ahayd, ma tafatiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha ayaa ka mudan xariiqyada markii labadaba ay hoos yaalliin calaamadeeyaha; gudaha poligon, poligonka ugu yar ayaa la doortaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-dusha\"\u003EIsticmaal dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur liiska lakabka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal dusha…\u003C/span\u003E (ama badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E). Waxa la soo bandhigayo waxaa ku xidhan lakabka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELakabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu noqon karaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo leh dhererro (xariiqyo 3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka jejebinta oo leh dhererradooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo aan dhererro lahayn laakiin leh goob tiro ah (konturo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka jejebinta oo leh dhererka goobta aad dooratid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoligonada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuduudda dusha (poligonka la doortay, ama kan ugu weyn), ama khadadka jejebinta geesahooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha leh dhererro, ama leh goob dhererka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha sahanka, oo lagu sharraxay magaca lakabka si ay u sameeyaan koox dhibco\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo oo geometry-ga mashruuca ku koobiyaysa; lakabka laftiisu sidii uu ahaa ayuu sii joogaa. Dhererradu waxa la qaadaa cutubyada mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-dhibcaha-leh-latitude-iyo-longitude\"\u003EFaylasha dhibcaha leh latitude iyo longitude\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFayl dhibcaha kaas madaxa (header) uu magacaabo tiirarka \u003Cstrong\u003Elatitude\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Elongitude\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Elat\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elatitude\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elon\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elong\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elongitude\u003C/code\u003E) waxa loo akhriyaa darajo, ma aha waqooyi iyo bari. Wada-hadalka soo dhoofinta ayaa sidaas sheegaa. Markii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, dhibcaha waa la beddelaa nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca; mashruuc aan lahayn wuxuu ku weyddiinayaa inaad dooratid marka hore. Darajooyinka weligood ma la soo rarayo sida fiit. Safafka ka baxsan latitude ±90° ama longitude ±180° waa la diidaa, sababtana waa la sheegayaa. Tiirka dhererka waxa la qaadaa sida uu yahay, cutubyada mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-landxml-ee-sheegaya-nidaam-koordinates-ka\"\u003EFaylasha LandXML ee sheegaya nidaam koordinates-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii faylka LandXML aad furto uu leeyahay curiyaha \u003Ccode\u003ECoordinateSystem\u003C/code\u003E (koodka EPSG, sharaxaadda WKT ama magaca nidaamka), CivilCraft wuxuu u soo bandhigayaa inuu noqdo nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca. Waxba ma dhaqaaqo haddii aad aqbasho; nidaamku wuxuu kaliya sheegayaa waxa tirooyinku ka dhigan yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-hubiyay\"\u003EWaxa la hubiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhristaha kasta waxaa loo barbar dhigay GDAL, maktabadda GIS badan u isticmaashaan si ay faylashan u akhriyaan, faylal GDAL qoray: shapefile-yo dhammaan noocyada leh iyo aan dhererro lahayn, xariiqyo qaybo badan leh, poligonada godad leh, geometry madhan, qoraal, tiro, taariikh iyo run/been sifooyin, qoraal UTF-8 iyo Windows-1252 oo leh iyo aan \u003Ccode\u003E.cpg\u003C/code\u003E lahayn, zip oo shapefile badan, GeoJSON nooc kasta oo geometry leh, iyo GeoPackage afar miis leh. Geometry kasta, dhererro iyo sifo ayaa iswaafaqay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBooska laga beddelay latitude iyo longitude, iyo UTM, waxay la mid ahaayeen PROJ (maktabadda saadaasha ee GDAL ka dambaysa) ilaa 3 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylal dillaacay (gaaban, cabbirradooda beenta ah, zip xumaad, GeoPackage xumaad) waxay siiyaan hal fariin oo fudud; waxba ma joogsado.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba halkan lagama furin barnaamijyo GIS kale weli, geodatabases-ka faylalka, KML iyo KMZ weli lama akhrin (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Xafiisyada GIS ee magaalada iyo degmada waxay siiyaan xogta deegaanka sida faylasha GIS: qaybaha dhulka, xaqa-maro, konturada, adeegyada, xakamaynta sahanka. CivilCraft wuxuu furaa saddex nooc oo ka mid ah lakabyo GIS oo ku jira naqshadaada qorshaha. Faylka Waxa la furo Shapefile .shp oo ay weheliyaan .shx, .dbf, .prj iyo .cpg (dhammaantood dooro), ama .zip ay ku yimaadeen. Zip ku jira shapefile badan wuxuu siiyaa lakabyo badan. GeoJSON Faylka .geojson (fayl .json oo sadarkiisa FeatureCollection ama Feature ku qoran bal sidoo kale shaqeeya). GeoPackage Faylka .gpkg. Miis kasta oo goob ku jira waa la liistaa. KML ama KMZ Faylka .kml (Google Earth ama khariidad webka), ama .kmz oo zipped. Folder kasta wuxuu noqdaa lakab (wuxuu kala go'aa dhibcaha, xariiqyada iyo poligonada haddii ay dhowr nooc ku jiraan); magaca, sharraxaadda iyo xogta dheeraadka ah ee placemark-ka waxay noqdaan sifooyinkiisa. Dhererrada waa mitir, latitude iyo longitude, sida GeoJSON. Dhibcaha, dhibco badan, xariiqyada, poligonada godad leh iyo qaabab qaybo badan leh waa la akhriyaa, dhererradooda (z) haddii faylku leeyahay. Qiimaha cabbirka (M) waa la iska tago. Shabakadaha heerarka iyo LiDAR waxay u furmaan sidii oo kale: eeg Shabakadaha heerarka iyo LiDAR. Fur faylasha Riix Soo dhoofi kooxda GIS (ama Fur), dooro faylasha, ama ku rid qorshaha. Faylasha waxaa lagu akhriyaa kombiyuutarkan; waxba lama soo dirayo. Wada-hadalka Soo dhoofi xogta GIS wuxuu liistaa lakabyo kasta la helay: nooceeda, inta goob (iyo inta aan geometry lahayn), inta goob sifo ah, iyo nidaamka koordinates-ka ee faylku sheegayo. Ka saar lakabyada aanad doonin. Akhri qaybta Nidaamka koordinates-ka (hoos) iyo xarriiqda Waxa dhici doona, kadib riix Soo dhoofi. Lakabyada waxay soo muuqan doonaan qorshaha iyo hoosta Lakabyada GIS dhinaca bidix. Soo dhoofintu waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z wuu soo celinayaa. Fayl weyn wuxuu muujiyaa xariiq horumar ah qorshaha korkiisa, leh badhanka Jooji. Nidaamka koordinates-ka Faylasha GIS waxay sheegaan meesha ay ku yaallaan nidaam koordinates-ka (.prj shapefile-ka, miiska tixraaca goobta GeoPackage; GeoJSON wuxuu weligiis yahay latitude iyo longitude). CivilCraft wuxuu lakab kasta uga beddelaa nidaamkiisa oo gaar ah kan mashruuca. Weligeed ma qiyaaso: Mashruucu wuxuu leeyahay nidaam koordinates (lagu dejiyay Coordinates): lakab kasta oo leh nidaam gaar ah waa la beddelaa ilaa mashruuca, oo ay ku jiraan dhul ama maxalli ah. Fayl aan .prj lahayn wuxuu helaa laba ikhtiyaar: Isku mid mashruuca (tirooyinkiisa waa la soo rarayaa sidooda) ama Dooro nidaamka faylka. Mashruucu ma laha, faylku wuxuu ku jiraa nidaam la saadaalin oo ah cutubyada mashruucaaga (aagga state plane ee fiit sahan Mareykan ah ee mashruuc fiitka, tusaale ahaan): wada-hadalku wuxuu soo bandhigayaa Isticmaal nidaamkaas sida nidaamka koordinates-ka ee mashruuca. Waa la dejiyaa isla hal tallaabada soo dhoofinta. Waxba mashruuca kuma dhaqaaqo; nidaamku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa tirooyinku ka dhigan yihiin. Waxaad dooran kartaa nidaam kale oo mashruuca ah, lakabyadana waa la beddelayaa. Mashruucu ma laha, faylku wuxuu ku jiraa latitude iyo longitude (GeoJSON kasta) ama cutubyo kale: Soo dhoofi waa aan la dooran karin ilaa aad dooratid nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca. Doorasho-wadaha wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meel ku dhow xogta. Mashruuc iyo faylal midkoodna ma sheegaan nidaam: tirooyinka waa la soo rarayaa sidooda, wada-hadalkuna wuu sheegaa. Dhererradana waa la beddelaa: dhererrada GeoJSON waa mitir (heerka GeoJSON wuu sheegaa); dhererrada faylalka kale waxaa la qaadaa cutubka nidaamkooda gaarka ah. Booska faylka GeoJSON ee ka baxsan longitude ±180° ama latitude ±90° ma aha latitude iyo longitude. Goobahaas waa la iska tago, wada-hadalkuna wuxuu sheegaa tirada. Faylka noocaas badanaa waa fayl la saadaalin oo nidaamkiisa aan lagu kaydin; dib u weydii, ama weydii shapefile oo leh .prj. NAD83 waxa loo qaataa sida WGS 84 (nidaamka GeoJSON isticmaalo); labadaba waxay kala duwan yihiin dhowr mitir Waqooyiga Ameerika, sidaas darteed xogta GeoJSON waxay ku kala duwaan kartaa qadarkaas. Halka isbeddelka ugu fiican u baahan yahay fayl shabakad (tusaale ahaan NADCON ee NAD27), CivilCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa isbeddel qiyaas ah oo la daabacay, wada-hadalka nidaamka koordinates-ka wuxuu muujinayaa inta qiyaasku yahay (NAD27 ku dhawaad 20 m), ilaa aad ku darto shabakadda: eeg Faylasha isbeddelka shabakadda. Lakabyada GIS Safka kasta oo ku hoos yaal Lakabyada GIS waxa uu leeyahay: calaamad sanduuq si lakabka loo muujiyo ama loo qariyo (lakabyada qarsan lama doorto mana jiraan); midabkiisa, oo laga doortay liiska; liis (saddex dhibic) oo leh Weynee ilaa, Isticmaal dusha…, Magac u beddel… iyo Ka saar. Muujinta, qarinta, midab-beddelka, magac-beddelka iyo ka saaridda waa tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo. Lakabyada GIS waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca oo markaad furto ayay soo noqdaan. Waxay sidoo kale ku baxaan qorshaha PDF plot-kiisa iyo soo dhoofinta DXF iyo DWG, mid kasta lakab la magacaabay GIS- iyo lambarkiisa. Calaamadee goobaha sifo ka mid ah Liiska lakabka Wax dheeraad ah (saddex dhibic oo ku jira Lakabyada GIS), dooro goob hoos yaal Calaamadee iyadoo: goob kasta wuxuu muujinayaa qiimihiisa qorshaha, midabka lakabka. Dhibcaha waxaa lagu calaamadeeyaa dhinaca dhibcaha, xariiqyada dhexda qaybtooda ugu dheer (la rogay si aad ugu akhrisato bidix ilaa midig), poligonada bartamaha. Tirooyinku waxay muujiyaan ilaa saddex meel oo kasoo horreysa. Calaamadaha waxay ahaan doonaan 1.8 mm dhererka warqadda cabbir kasta, waxayna galaan PDF plot, DXF iyo DWG. Dooro Calaamad la'aan si aad uga saarto; isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo (Ctrl+Z wuu soo celinayaa). Lakab wuxuu calaamadeeyaa ugu badnaan 5,000 goob. Eeg goob Markii Dooro uu shaqaynayo, riix goob. Guryaha wuxuu muujinayaa lakabkiisa, goobta ay tahay, qaabkeeda (qaybaha, godadka, geesaha), dhererradeeda, faylka ka yimid iyo nidaamka koordinates-ka faylkaas, kadib sifo kasta miis ku jira. Sifooyinka waa kuwo keliya-akhris: CivilCraft wuxuu muujiyaa xogta GIS sidii ay ahayd, ma tafatiro. Dhibcaha ayaa ka mudan xariiqyada markii labadaba ay hoos yaalliin calaamadeeyaha; gudaha poligon, poligonka ugu yar ayaa la doortaa. Isticmaal dusha Fur liiska lakabka oo dooro Isticmaal dusha… (ama badhanka Guryaha). Waxa la soo bandhigayo waxaa ku xidhan lakabka: Lakabka Wuxuu noqon karaa Xariiqyo leh dhererro (xariiqyo 3D) Khadadka jejebinta oo leh dhererradooda Xariiqyo aan dhererro lahayn laakiin leh goob tiro ah (konturo) Khadadka jejebinta oo leh dhererka goobta aad dooratid Poligonada Xuduudda dusha (poligonka la doortay, ama kan ugu weyn), ama khadadka jejebinta geesahooda Dhibcaha leh dhererro, ama leh goob dhererka Dhibcaha sahanka, oo lagu sharraxay magaca lakabka si ay u sameeyaan koox dhibco Isticmaal kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo oo geometry-ga mashruuca ku koobiyaysa; lakabka laftiisu sidii uu ahaa ayuu sii joogaa. Dhererradu waxa la qaadaa cutubyada mashruuca. Faylasha dhibcaha leh latitude iyo longitude Fayl dhibcaha kaas madaxa (header) uu magacaabo tiirarka latitude iyo longitude (lat, latitude, lon, long, longitude) waxa loo akhriyaa darajo, ma aha waqooyi iyo bari. Wada-hadalka soo dhoofinta ayaa sidaas sheegaa. Markii Soo dhoofi, dhibcaha waa la beddelaa nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca; mashruuc aan lahayn wuxuu ku weyddiinayaa inaad dooratid marka hore. Darajooyinka weligood ma la soo rarayo sida fiit. Safafka ka baxsan latitude ±90° ama longitude ±180° waa la diidaa, sababtana waa la sheegayaa. Tiirka dhererka waxa la qaadaa sida uu yahay, cutubyada mashruuca. Faylasha LandXML ee sheegaya nidaam koordinates-ka Markii faylka LandXML aad furto uu leeyahay curiyaha CoordinateSystem (koodka EPSG, sharaxaadda WKT ama magaca nidaamka), CivilCraft wuxuu u soo bandhigayaa inuu noqdo nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca. Waxba ma dhaqaaqo haddii aad aqbasho; nidaamku wuxuu kaliya sheegayaa waxa tirooyinku ka dhigan yihiin. Waxa la hubiyay Akhristaha kasta waxaa loo barbar dhigay GDAL, maktabadda GIS badan u isticmaashaan si ay faylashan u akhriyaan, faylal GDAL qoray: shapefile-yo dhammaan noocyada leh iyo aan dhererro lahayn, xariiqyo qaybo badan leh, poligonada godad leh, geometry madhan, qoraal, tiro, taariikh iyo run/been sifooyin, qoraal UTF-8 iyo Windows-1252 oo leh iyo aan .cpg lahayn, zip oo shapefile badan, GeoJSON nooc kasta oo geometry leh, iyo GeoPackage afar miis leh. Geometry kasta, dhererro iyo sifo ayaa iswaafaqay. Booska laga beddelay latitude iyo longitude, iyo UTM, waxay la mid ahaayeen PROJ (maktabadda saadaasha ee GDAL ka dambaysa) ilaa 3 mm. Faylal dillaacay (gaaban, cabbirradooda beenta ah, zip xumaad, GeoPackage xumaad) waxay siiyaan hal fariin oo fudud; waxba ma joogsado. Waxba halkan lagama furin barnaamijyo GIS kale weli, geodatabases-ka faylalka, KML iyo KMZ weli lama akhrin (eeg Wali lama dhisin).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"gis-export","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhoofi xogta dhismaha dhabta ah ee GIS","summary":"Dhoofi barta sahanka, konturada, khadadka, padka, tuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismaha xafiiska magaalada ama degmada shapefile, GeoPackage, GeoJSON ama KML, oo ku jira shabakad koordinates-ka nidaamka mashruuca.","section":"tasks","order":141,"keywords":["gis","dhoofin","kml","kmz","google earth","as-built","asbuilt","shapefile","shp","zip","geopackage","gpkg","geojson","tuubooyin","qaab-dhismo","adeegyada","magaalo","degmo","shabakad","dhul","epsg","prj"],"headings":[{"id":"ka-hor-inta-aadan-dhoofin","text":"Ka hor inta aadan dhoofin","level":2},{"id":"dhoofinta","text":"Dhoofinta","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-kasta-waxa-uu-hayaa","text":"Noocyada kasta waxa uu hayaa","level":2},{"id":"qaababka","text":"Qaababka","level":2},{"id":"shabakad-ma-aha-dhul","text":"Shabakad, ma aha dhul","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-hubiyay","text":"Waxa la hubiyay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMagaalooyin badan iyo degmooyin waxay weydiiyaan xogta dhismaha dhabta ah ee qaabka GIS markii mashruucu xirmo: meesha ay tuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismaha ku aadeen, heerarka ugu dambeeya, xariiqda dhulka waddada. \u003Cstrong\u003EGIS › Dhoofi\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoraa waxa CivilCraft hayo sida lakabyada GIS, hal lakab oo ah nooc kasta oo shay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-hor-inta-aadan-dhoofin\"\u003EKa hor inta aadan dhoofin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejiso nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECoordinates\u003C/span\u003E. Waaxda GIS waa inay ogaataa meesha tirooyinku ku yaalliin; nidaam la&#039;aan, faylasha waxay qaadan doonaan tirooyinka mashruuca keligood, mana magacaabayaan wax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi dusha, khadadka, padka iyo shabakadda tuubooyinka sida aad rabto in la gaarsiiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeydii waaxda qaabka iyo nidaamka koordinates-ka ee ay rabaan. Qaar badan wali waxay weydiistaan shapefile oo ku jira aagga state plane ee maxalliga ah; nidaamyada cusub waxay qaataan GeoPackage.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofinta\"\u003EDhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EGIS\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadi noocyada la dirayo. Mid kasta wuxuu muujiyaa inta shay ee uu leeyahay; noocyada aan weli wax lahayn waa lagu caddeeyay (ma dooran karto).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ESida\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro qaabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri xusuusta ku saabsan isku xirka iyo cabbirka, kadib riix badhanka soo dejinta. Sadarka xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa waxa gudaha galay, iyo magacyada goobaha la gaabiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqaddan waxa kaloo ku jira dhoofinta shabakadda heerarka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha sida shabakadda heerarka GeoTIFF\u003C/span\u003E); eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/elevation-grids-and-lidar\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/elevation-grids-and-lidar\"\u003EShabakadaha heerarka iyo LiDAR\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada-kasta-waxa-uu-hayaa\"\u003ENoocyada kasta waxa uu hayaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoobaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha sahanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha leh dhererka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E lambarka dhibcaha, \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E waqooyi (northing), \u003Ccode\u003EE\u003C/code\u003E bari (easting), \u003Ccode\u003EZ\u003C/code\u003E dhererka, \u003Ccode\u003ED\u003C/code\u003E sharraxaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonturada dhulka jira, ee dusha la sameeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo heerkooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EELEV\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka jejebinta (breaklines)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo leh heerar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENAME\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuduudda dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoligon (xuduudda la sawiray, haddii kale geedka dusha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENAME\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka jihaynta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENAME\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ELENGTH\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ESTA_START\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ESTA_END\u003C/code\u003E (saldhigyada tirooyin fudud)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPadyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoligonada heerka padka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENAME\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EELEV\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EAREA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka iftiinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo leh heerar (padyada iyo waddooyinka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENAME\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo heerar leh: dhexe, geesaha dhulka jilicsan, garbaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENAME\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECODE\u003C/code\u003E (CL, EOP_L, EOP_R, SH_L, SH_R)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo ka bilaabma inverta sare ilaa inverta hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENAME\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EFROM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ETO\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EDIA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EDIA_UNIT\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EINV_UP\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EINV_DN\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ESLOPE\u003C/code\u003E (boqolkiiba), \u003Ccode\u003ELENGTH\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ENETWORK\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab-dhismaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha ku yaal bartamaha afka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENAME\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ERIM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EINVERT\u003C/code\u003E (inverta tuubada ugu hooseysa halkaas), \u003Ccode\u003ESUMP\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EDIA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EDIA_UNIT\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakab kasta oo GIS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida la soo dhoofiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobaheeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDherer, saldhig iyo dhererka waxay ku jiraan cutubyada mashruuca (fiit sahan Mareykan ah ama mitir). Dhexroorka tuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismaha waa inji mashruucyada fiitka, iyo millimitir mashruucyada mitirka; \u003Ccode\u003EDIA_UNIT\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sheegaa kii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaababka\"\u003EQaababka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShapefile\u003C/strong\u003E: hal \u003Ccode\u003E.zip\u003C/code\u003E oo ku jira shapefile nooc kasta (\u003Ccode\u003E.shp\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.shx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.dbf\u003C/code\u003E), fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.cpg\u003C/code\u003E oo sheegaya qoraalku waa UTF-8, iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E oo magacaabaya nidaamka koordinates-ka. Qaababka leh dhererro waxaa loo qoraa noocyada Z ee shapefile-ka. Magacyada goobaha ka dheer 10 xaraf waa la gaabiyay, sida qaabku shardi ku yahay, sadarka xaaladdu waa liistaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeoPackage\u003C/strong\u003E: hal fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.gpkg\u003C/code\u003E oo leh miis nooc kasta, nidaamka koordinates-ka oo lagu kaydiyay koodkiisa EPSG. Hal fayl halkii laga bixin lahaa badan, magacyada goobaha dheer waa la hayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKML\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EKMZ\u003C/strong\u003E (KML oo zipped): hal fayl oo latitude iyo longitude ah oo loogu talagalay Google Earth iyo khariidadaha webka, folder nooc kasta, mid walba waa placemark oo magaciisa ka yimid goobta NAME oo leh goob kasta sida xog dheeraad ah; dhererrada waa mitir (altitude mode absolute). Sida GeoJSON, wuxuu u baahan yahay nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeoJSON\u003C/strong\u003E: hal fayl oo latitude iyo longitude ah (heerka GeoJSON ma oggolaado wax kale), mid walba wuxuu leeyahay hanti \u003Ccode\u003Ekind\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Epipes\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estructures\u003C/code\u003E, …) si qaataha loo kala saaro. Dhererrada waxa loo beddelaa mitir sida heerku doonayo; waxay ku sii jiraan darajadaada dhererka mashruuca (CivilCraft ma laha moodel geoid). Mashruuc aan nidaam koordinates lahayn ma dhoofin karo GeoJSON, daaqaddana way sheegtaa sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shabakad-ma-aha-dhul\"\u003EShabakad, ma aha dhul\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaaxaha GIS xogtooda waxay ku hayaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eshabakad\u003C/strong\u003E koordinates-ka nidaam koordinates. Haddii mashruucaagu isticmaalo koordinates dhul ama maxalli ah (lagu dejiyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECoordinates\u003C/span\u003E), koordinates kasta waxa dib loogu beddelaa shabakad markii la dhoofinayo: tirooyinka faylasha waxay ka duwan yihiin kuwa qorshaha iyadoo la adeegsanayo cabbirkaaga (iyo jeexjeexa, nidaamka maxalliga ah). Goobaha dhibcaha \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EE\u003C/code\u003E waxay haystaan qiimaha shabakadda sidoo kale. Daaqaddu way xasuusinaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylasha la socdo ku dir qoraal gaaban: nidaamka koordinates-ka iyo koodkiisa EPSG, datum-ka dhererka ee dhererkaaga, cutubyada, iyo waxa fayl kasta yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-hubiyay\"\u003EWaxa la hubiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFayl kasta oo la qoray ayaa GDAL akhriyay, maktabadda ay GIS badan u isticmaalaan si ay faylashan u akhriyaan: qaab kasta, dherer iyo sifo, tirada goobaha, iyo nidaamka koordinates-ka sida koodkiisa EPSG (\u003Ccode\u003E.prj\u003C/code\u003E iyo GeoPackage). Akhristayaashayada ayaa isla sidaas u akhriyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylasha GeoJSON waxay raacaan RFC 7946: longitude ka hor latitude, ma jiro xubin \u003Ccode\u003Ecrs\u003C/code\u003E, goobaha dibadda waxay ka soo wareegaan wareegga ka soo horjeedda saacadda, godadka wareegga saacadda; booska waxa uu la mid ahaa PROJ ilaa 2 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMashruuc koordinates dhul ah ayaa la dhoofiyay, dhibic kasta waa la hubiyay koordinates-ka shabakadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba halkan lagama furin barnaamijyo GIS kale weli. Marka hore gaarsiinta hubi waaxda ka hor intaadan isku hallayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Magaalooyin badan iyo degmooyin waxay weydiiyaan xogta dhismaha dhabta ah ee qaabka GIS markii mashruucu xirmo: meesha ay tuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismaha ku aadeen, heerarka ugu dambeeya, xariiqda dhulka waddada. GIS › Dhoofi wuxuu qoraa waxa CivilCraft hayo sida lakabyada GIS, hal lakab oo ah nooc kasta oo shay. Ka hor inta aadan dhoofin Dejiso nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca ee Coordinates. Waaxda GIS waa inay ogaataa meesha tirooyinku ku yaalliin; nidaam la'aan, faylasha waxay qaadan doonaan tirooyinka mashruuca keligood, mana magacaabayaan wax. Hubi dusha, khadadka, padka iyo shabakadda tuubooyinka sida aad rabto in la gaarsiiyo. Weydii waaxda qaabka iyo nidaamka koordinates-ka ee ay rabaan. Qaar badan wali waxay weydiistaan shapefile oo ku jira aagga state plane ee maxalliga ah; nidaamyada cusub waxay qaataan GeoPackage. Dhoofinta Riix Dhoofi kooxda GIS. Hoosta Waxa, calaamadi noocyada la dirayo. Mid kasta wuxuu muujiyaa inta shay ee uu leeyahay; noocyada aan weli wax lahayn waa lagu caddeeyay (ma dooran karto). Hoosta Sida, dooro qaabka. Akhri xusuusta ku saabsan isku xirka iyo cabbirka, kadib riix badhanka soo dejinta. Sadarka xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa waxa gudaha galay, iyo magacyada goobaha la gaabiyay. Daaqaddan waxa kaloo ku jira dhoofinta shabakadda heerarka (Dusha sida shabakadda heerarka GeoTIFF); eeg Shabakadaha heerarka iyo LiDAR. Noocyada kasta waxa uu hayaa Nooca Qaabka Goobaha Dhibcaha sahanka Dhibcaha leh dhererka P lambarka dhibcaha, N waqooyi (northing), E bari (easting), Z dhererka, D sharraxaad Konturada dhulka jira, ee dusha la sameeyay Xariiqyo heerkooda ELEV Khadadka jejebinta (breaklines) Xariiqyo leh heerar NAME Xuduudda dusha Poligon (xuduudda la sawiray, haddii kale geedka dusha) NAME Khadadka jihaynta Khadadka dhexe NAME, LENGTH, STA_START, STA_END (saldhigyada tirooyin fudud) Padyada Poligonada heerka padka NAME, ELEV, AREA Khadadka iftiinka Xariiqyo leh heerar (padyada iyo waddooyinka) NAME Khadadka waddada Xariiqyo heerar leh: dhexe, geesaha dhulka jilicsan, garbaha NAME, CODE (CL, EOP_L, EOP_R, SH_L, SH_R) Tuubooyinka Xariiqyo ka bilaabma inverta sare ilaa inverta hoose NAME, FROM, TO, DIA, DIA_UNIT, INV_UP, INV_DN, SLOPE (boqolkiiba), LENGTH, NETWORK Qaab-dhismaha Dhibcaha ku yaal bartamaha afka NAME, RIM, INVERT (inverta tuubada ugu hooseysa halkaas), SUMP, DIA, DIA_UNIT Lakab kasta oo GIS Sida la soo dhoofiyay Goobaheeda Dherer, saldhig iyo dhererka waxay ku jiraan cutubyada mashruuca (fiit sahan Mareykan ah ama mitir). Dhexroorka tuubooyinka iyo qaab-dhismaha waa inji mashruucyada fiitka, iyo millimitir mashruucyada mitirka; DIA_UNIT wuxuu sheegaa kii. Qaababka Shapefile: hal .zip oo ku jira shapefile nooc kasta (.shp, .shx, .dbf), fayl .cpg oo sheegaya qoraalku waa UTF-8, iyo .prj oo magacaabaya nidaamka koordinates-ka. Qaababka leh dhererro waxaa loo qoraa noocyada Z ee shapefile-ka. Magacyada goobaha ka dheer 10 xaraf waa la gaabiyay, sida qaabku shardi ku yahay, sadarka xaaladdu waa liistaa. GeoPackage: hal fayl .gpkg oo leh miis nooc kasta, nidaamka koordinates-ka oo lagu kaydiyay koodkiisa EPSG. Hal fayl halkii laga bixin lahaa badan, magacyada goobaha dheer waa la hayaa. KML ama KMZ (KML oo zipped): hal fayl oo latitude iyo longitude ah oo loogu talagalay Google Earth iyo khariidadaha webka, folder nooc kasta, mid walba waa placemark oo magaciisa ka yimid goobta NAME oo leh goob kasta sida xog dheeraad ah; dhererrada waa mitir (altitude mode absolute). Sida GeoJSON, wuxuu u baahan yahay nidaamka koordinates-ka mashruuca. GeoJSON: hal fayl oo latitude iyo longitude ah (heerka GeoJSON ma oggolaado wax kale), mid walba wuxuu leeyahay hanti kind (pipes, structures, …) si qaataha loo kala saaro. Dhererrada waxa loo beddelaa mitir sida heerku doonayo; waxay ku sii jiraan darajadaada dhererka mashruuca (CivilCraft ma laha moodel geoid). Mashruuc aan nidaam koordinates lahayn ma dhoofin karo GeoJSON, daaqaddana way sheegtaa sababta. Shabakad, ma aha dhul Waaxaha GIS xogtooda waxay ku hayaan shabakad koordinates-ka nidaam koordinates. Haddii mashruucaagu isticmaalo koordinates dhul ama maxalli ah (lagu dejiyay Coordinates), koordinates kasta waxa dib loogu beddelaa shabakad markii la dhoofinayo: tirooyinka faylasha waxay ka duwan yihiin kuwa qorshaha iyadoo la adeegsanayo cabbirkaaga (iyo jeexjeexa, nidaamka maxalliga ah). Goobaha dhibcaha N iyo E waxay haystaan qiimaha shabakadda sidoo kale. Daaqaddu way xasuusinaysaa. Faylasha la socdo ku dir qoraal gaaban: nidaamka koordinates-ka iyo koodkiisa EPSG, datum-ka dhererka ee dhererkaaga, cutubyada, iyo waxa fayl kasta yahay. Waxa la hubiyay Fayl kasta oo la qoray ayaa GDAL akhriyay, maktabadda ay GIS badan u isticmaalaan si ay faylashan u akhriyaan: qaab kasta, dherer iyo sifo, tirada goobaha, iyo nidaamka koordinates-ka sida koodkiisa EPSG (.prj iyo GeoPackage). Akhristayaashayada ayaa isla sidaas u akhriyay. Faylasha GeoJSON waxay raacaan RFC 7946: longitude ka hor latitude, ma jiro xubin crs, goobaha dibadda waxay ka soo wareegaan wareegga ka soo horjeedda saacadda, godadka wareegga saacadda; booska waxa uu la mid ahaa PROJ ilaa 2 mm. Mashruuc koordinates dhul ah ayaa la dhoofiyay, dhibic kasta waa la hubiyay koordinates-ka shabakadda. Waxba halkan lagama furin barnaamijyo GIS kale weli. Marka hore gaarsiinta hubi waaxda ka hor intaadan isku hallayn.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"gis-analysis","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Falanqee lakabyada GIS","summary":"Buffer, overlay (intersect, union, erase, dissolve), spatial join, dooro sifada ku salaysan iyo qiyaas lakabyada GIS ee mashruuca, mid kasta oo ah lakab cusub oo aad ka noqon karto.","section":"tasks","order":142,"keywords":["gis","falanqeyn","buffer","overlay","intersect","union","erase","clip","dissolve","spatial join","join","dooro sifada","baaritaan","where","expression","tirakoob","bed","dherer","perimeter","qiyaas","qaybaha dhulka","easement","setback","shapefile","geopackage","miiska sifooyinka"],"headings":[{"id":"buffer","text":"Buffer","level":2},{"id":"dul-saar-overlay","text":"Dul-saar (Overlay)","level":2},{"id":"ku-biirinta-join","text":"Ku biirinta (Join)","level":2},{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"qiyaas","text":"Qiyaas","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka mashruucu lakabyo GIS leeyahay (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-import\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-import\"\u003ESoo dhoofi xogta GIS\u003C/a\u003E), badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003EFalanqee\u003C/strong\u003E ee kooxda GIS (lagu qoro \u003Ccode\u003EGISANALYSIS\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EANALYZE\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EBUFFER\u003C/code\u003E) wuxuu furaa daaqad leh shan tab. Waxay ku sii jirtaa dhinaca qorshaha, sidaas darteed waxa aad dooratid waxaa lagu muujinayaa qorshaha intaad ku shaqeynayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab kasta oo wax soo saara \u003Cstrong\u003Ewuxuu ku daraa lakab cusub\u003C/strong\u003E oo wuxuu uga tagaa lakabyada uu akhriyay sida ay ahaayeen. Mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda (ama Ctrl+Z) wuxuu tirtiraa lakabka cusub. Natiijada u dhoofi sida lakab kasta oo ah \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-export\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-export\"\u003EDhoofi xogta dhismaha dhabta ah ee GIS\u003C/a\u003E oo ah shapefile, GeoJSON ama GeoPackage.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska buuxa ee lakab, oo leh habaynta, tafatirka iyo xisaabiyaha goobta, waxa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-table\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-table\"\u003EKa shaqee miiska sifooyinka lakabka\u003C/a\u003E; midabaynta goob ka saaran waxa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-symbology\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-symbology\"\u003EQaab lakab sifo ku salaysan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax walba qorshaha ayaa lagu shaqeeyaa, cutubyada mashruuca (fiit ama mitir). Mashruucu had iyo jeer wuxuu ku jiraa nidaam la saadaalin ama maxalli ah, sidaas darteed masaafada 50 waxay ka dhigan tahay 50 fiit ama 50 mitir, weligeed ma aha darajo. Dhererka (z) natiijooyinka lama hayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buffer\"\u003EBuffer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu sawiraa aag masaafo la dejiyay oo ku wareegsan qalab kasta, oo ah lakab poligon cusub. Dhibcaha waxay noqdaan goobo, xariiqyadu waxay noqdaan waddo leh dhamaadyo go&#039;an, poligonadu way weynaadaan. Masaafo \u003Cstrong\u003Etaban\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa poligonada yareeya (murabbac 100 ku 100 oo lagu yareeyay 5 wuxuu noqdaa 90 ku 90; haddii lagu yareeyo 60 waxba ma harto, daaqaddana way sheegtaa). Masaafada ka qaado goob tiro ah si qalab kasta u helo mid u gaar ah, ama calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku dar dhammaan buffer-yada hal qaab\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u milmiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha go&#039;an waa qaybo toosan oo lagu sawiray dhinaca gudaha ee khadka go&#039;an ee run ah, sidaas darteed buffer-ku wuxuu ka yar yahay wareegga saxda ah dhudhun yar: ku dhawaad 0.6 % aagga habaynta caadiga ah, 0.16 % marka la doorto Fine. Waxa aad cabbirayso oo dhan isticmaal Fine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dul-saar-overlay\"\u003EDul-saar (Overlay)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIntersect\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha halka lakabka soo gelinta uu isku kulmo poligonada dul-saarka, mid walba leh goobaha labada lakab. Xariiqyada iyo dhibcaha waa lagu gooyaa poligonada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnion\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabada lakab ee poligon oo midba kan kale gees ahaan u gooyay: qaybaha wadaagga ah waxay leeyihiin goobaha labada lakab, kuwa kale mid lakab keliya (goobaha kale way madhan yihiin).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EErase\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoligonada soo gelinta oo laga saaray poligonada dul-saarka. Goobaha waxay ku sii jiraan soo gelinta. Qalab si buuxda loo tirtiray waa la iska tago (guddiga wuu tiriyaa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDissolve\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu milmiyaa poligonada taabanaya ama isku dhaafsiinaya, dhammaantood ama hal qaab qiimo kasta oo goob ah. Wuxuu ku daraa \u003Ccode\u003ECOUNT\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EAREA\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagaca goob ay labada lakab leeyihiin waxaa loo hayaa lakabka koowaad, goobta lakabka labaad waxaa lagu qoraa \u003Ccode\u003E_2\u003C/code\u003E. Qalabka gudaha hal lakab waa inaysan isku dhaafsiin: meelaha ay isku dhaafsiin yihiin, Union waxay tirinaysaa isku dhaafsiinta labadaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-biirinta-join\"\u003EKu biirinta (Join)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu biirinta goobta ee meelaha (spatial join) waxay ku koobiyaysaa sifooyinka lakabka \u003Cstrong\u003Eisha\u003C/strong\u003E hal hal ah dhibcaha \u003Cstrong\u003Ebartilmaameedka\u003C/strong\u003E ee isku kulma, waxayna siinaysaa lakab cusub oo leh qaabka bartilmaameedka. Dooro goorta ay isku kulmaan: taabanaya ama isku dhaafsiinaya, bartilmaameedka oo ku jira poligon isha gudihiisa, bartilmaameedka oo qabta goobta isha, goobta isha ugu dhow (xadka ikhtiyaari ah), ama goob kasta oo isha ah masaafo gudaheeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka goobo badan oo isha ah isku mid yihiin waxaad qaadanaysaa sifooyinka midka kowaad (kan ugu dhow, ku biirinta ugu dhow iyo masaafada; \u003Ccode\u003EDISTANCE\u003C/code\u003E waa la darayaa), ama \u003Cstrong\u003Etiri iyaga oo wadar ku samee goobaha tirooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003ECOUNT\u003C/code\u003E, iyo \u003Ccode\u003ESUM_\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EMEAN_\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EMIN_\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EMAX_\u003C/code\u003E goob tiro kasta. Ka saar calaamadda \u003Cstrong\u003EKu hay goobaha bartilmaameedka aan wax la helin\u003C/strong\u003E si aad uga tagto kuwaas. Goobaha la biiriyay waxay madhan yihiin meelaha wax aan la helin, daaqaddana way tirisaa kuwa aan la helin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQor su&#039;aal ku saabsan sifooyinka ama qaabka, riix \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E, goobaha waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha iyo tiradooda, miis, iyo wadarta aagga, dherer ama tirada. Kadib ka dhig lakab u gaar ah, ku weynee ilaa iyaga ama nadiifi xulashada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad qori kartaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETusaale\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoob magaceeda; isticmaal &quot;xigasho&quot; ama [xidhmo] haddii magaca ku jiro meel bannaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EVALUE\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;Lot Number&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirooyin, &#039;qoraal&#039;, true, false, null\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse_ = &#039;Res&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E!=\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;&gt;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;=\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E&gt;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E&gt;=\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EVALUE &gt;= 250\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Econtains\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003Estartswith\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003Eendswith\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003Elike\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003Eilike\u003C/code\u003E (qoraalku ma xisaabiyo xarfaha weyn/yar; \u003Ccode\u003Elike\u003C/code\u003E-ta, \u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E waa xariiq kasta, \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E waa hal xaraf)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENotes contains &#039;corner&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eis null\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eis not null\u003C/code\u003E (qiimo madhan waxaa loo tiriyaa null)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ENotes is null\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ein (…)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enot in (…)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ebetween … and …\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse_ in (&#039;Com&#039;, &#039;Ind&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E iyo xidhmooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EVALUE / 2 &gt; 100\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eand\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enot\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse_ = &#039;Res&#039; and VALUE &gt; 200\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaha qaabka \u003Ccode\u003E$area\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E$perimeter\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E$length\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E$x\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E$y\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E$vertices\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E$area &gt; 5000\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESu&#039;aal aan dhammaystirnayn ama magac goob lakabku ma lahan waa la diidaa, iyadoo jumlad sheegta meesha ay ku sugan tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaas\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu muujinayaa wadarta aagga iyo perimeter-ka, dherer ama tirada lakabka, wuxuuna \u003Cstrong\u003Eku daraa goobo\u003C/strong\u003E lakabka: \u003Ccode\u003EAREA\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EPERIMETER\u003C/code\u003E poligonada, \u003Ccode\u003ELENGTH\u003C/code\u003E xariiqyada (dherer qorshaha), \u003Ccode\u003EX\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EY\u003C/code\u003E dhibcaha. Goob hore u jirtay ma la qori doono: kan cusub waxa loo magacaabaa \u003Ccode\u003EAREA_2\u003C/code\u003E. Tani waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo. \u003Cstrong\u003ETirakoob\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu siinayaa tirada, wadarta, celceliska, ugu yar iyo ugu badan ee goob tiro ah, si ikhtiyaari ah goob kasta oo qiime kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubinta ka dambaysa qalabkan waxaa lagu sameeyay gacanta imtixaanka (\u003Ccode\u003Enode bin/test-civilcraft-gisanalysis.mjs\u003C/code\u003E): tusaale ahaan qaybo dhul ah 100 ku 100 oo hoostooda aag 100 ku 80 ah wuxuu isgoysaa 3,000 oo ku dar 3,000, iyo xariiq dheer 100 oo buffer lagu sameeyay 10 waa 2,000 iyo goobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Marka mashruucu lakabyo GIS leeyahay (eeg Soo dhoofi xogta GIS), badhanka Falanqee ee kooxda GIS (lagu qoro GISANALYSIS, ANALYZE ama BUFFER) wuxuu furaa daaqad leh shan tab. Waxay ku sii jirtaa dhinaca qorshaha, sidaas darteed waxa aad dooratid waxaa lagu muujinayaa qorshaha intaad ku shaqeynayso. Qalab kasta oo wax soo saara wuxuu ku daraa lakab cusub oo wuxuu uga tagaa lakabyada uu akhriyay sida ay ahaayeen. Mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo: Ka noqo daaqadda (ama Ctrl+Z) wuxuu tirtiraa lakabka cusub. Natiijada u dhoofi sida lakab kasta oo ah Dhoofi xogta dhismaha dhabta ah ee GIS oo ah shapefile, GeoJSON ama GeoPackage. Miiska buuxa ee lakab, oo leh habaynta, tafatirka iyo xisaabiyaha goobta, waxa ku jira Ka shaqee miiska sifooyinka lakabka; midabaynta goob ka saaran waxa ku jira Qaab lakab sifo ku salaysan. Wax walba qorshaha ayaa lagu shaqeeyaa, cutubyada mashruuca (fiit ama mitir). Mashruucu had iyo jeer wuxuu ku jiraa nidaam la saadaalin ama maxalli ah, sidaas darteed masaafada 50 waxay ka dhigan tahay 50 fiit ama 50 mitir, weligeed ma aha darajo. Dhererka (z) natiijooyinka lama hayo. Buffer Wuxuu sawiraa aag masaafo la dejiyay oo ku wareegsan qalab kasta, oo ah lakab poligon cusub. Dhibcaha waxay noqdaan goobo, xariiqyadu waxay noqdaan waddo leh dhamaadyo go'an, poligonadu way weynaadaan. Masaafo taban ayaa poligonada yareeya (murabbac 100 ku 100 oo lagu yareeyay 5 wuxuu noqdaa 90 ku 90; haddii lagu yareeyo 60 waxba ma harto, daaqaddana way sheegtaa). Masaafada ka qaado goob tiro ah si qalab kasta u helo mid u gaar ah, ama calaamadee Isku dar dhammaan buffer-yada hal qaab si aad u milmiso. Qaybaha go'an waa qaybo toosan oo lagu sawiray dhinaca gudaha ee khadka go'an ee run ah, sidaas darteed buffer-ku wuxuu ka yar yahay wareegga saxda ah dhudhun yar: ku dhawaad 0.6 % aagga habaynta caadiga ah, 0.16 % marka la doorto Fine. Waxa aad cabbirayso oo dhan isticmaal Fine. Dul-saar (Overlay) Qalabka Waxa aad hesho Intersect Qaybaha halka lakabka soo gelinta uu isku kulmo poligonada dul-saarka, mid walba leh goobaha labada lakab. Xariiqyada iyo dhibcaha waa lagu gooyaa poligonada. Union Labada lakab ee poligon oo midba kan kale gees ahaan u gooyay: qaybaha wadaagga ah waxay leeyihiin goobaha labada lakab, kuwa kale mid lakab keliya (goobaha kale way madhan yihiin). Erase Poligonada soo gelinta oo laga saaray poligonada dul-saarka. Goobaha waxay ku sii jiraan soo gelinta. Qalab si buuxda loo tirtiray waa la iska tago (guddiga wuu tiriyaa). Dissolve Wuxuu milmiyaa poligonada taabanaya ama isku dhaafsiinaya, dhammaantood ama hal qaab qiimo kasta oo goob ah. Wuxuu ku daraa COUNT iyo AREA. Magaca goob ay labada lakab leeyihiin waxaa loo hayaa lakabka koowaad, goobta lakabka labaad waxaa lagu qoraa _2. Qalabka gudaha hal lakab waa inaysan isku dhaafsiin: meelaha ay isku dhaafsiin yihiin, Union waxay tirinaysaa isku dhaafsiinta labadaba. Ku biirinta (Join) Ku biirinta goobta ee meelaha (spatial join) waxay ku koobiyaysaa sifooyinka lakabka isha hal hal ah dhibcaha bartilmaameedka ee isku kulma, waxayna siinaysaa lakab cusub oo leh qaabka bartilmaameedka. Dooro goorta ay isku kulmaan: taabanaya ama isku dhaafsiinaya, bartilmaameedka oo ku jira poligon isha gudihiisa, bartilmaameedka oo qabta goobta isha, goobta isha ugu dhow (xadka ikhtiyaari ah), ama goob kasta oo isha ah masaafo gudaheeda. Marka goobo badan oo isha ah isku mid yihiin waxaad qaadanaysaa sifooyinka midka kowaad (kan ugu dhow, ku biirinta ugu dhow iyo masaafada; DISTANCE waa la darayaa), ama tiri iyaga oo wadar ku samee goobaha tirooyinka: COUNT, iyo SUM_, MEAN_, MIN_, MAX_ goob tiro kasta. Ka saar calaamadda Ku hay goobaha bartilmaameedka aan wax la helin si aad uga tagto kuwaas. Goobaha la biiriyay waxay madhan yihiin meelaha wax aan la helin, daaqaddana way tirisaa kuwa aan la helin. Dooro Qor su'aal ku saabsan sifooyinka ama qaabka, riix Dooro, goobaha waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha iyo tiradooda, miis, iyo wadarta aagga, dherer ama tirada. Kadib ka dhig lakab u gaar ah, ku weynee ilaa iyaga ama nadiifi xulashada. Waxaad qori kartaa Tusaale Goob magaceeda; isticmaal \"xigasho\" ama [xidhmo] haddii magaca ku jiro meel bannaan VALUE, \"Lot Number\" Tirooyin, 'qoraal', true, false, null Use_ = 'Res' = != \u003C\u003E \u003C \u003C= \u003E \u003E= VALUE \u003E= 250 contains startswith endswith like ilike (qoraalku ma xisaabiyo xarfaha weyn/yar; like-ta, % waa xariiq kasta, _ waa hal xaraf) Notes contains 'corner' is null, is not null (qiimo madhan waxaa loo tiriyaa null) Notes is null in (…), not in (…), between … and … Use_ in ('Com', 'Ind') + - * / iyo xidhmooyin VALUE / 2 \u003E 100 and, or, not Use_ = 'Res' and VALUE \u003E 200 Qiimaha qaabka $area $perimeter $length $x $y $vertices $area \u003E 5000 Su'aal aan dhammaystirnayn ama magac goob lakabku ma lahan waa la diidaa, iyadoo jumlad sheegta meesha ay ku sugan tahay. Qiyaas Wuxuu muujinayaa wadarta aagga iyo perimeter-ka, dherer ama tirada lakabka, wuxuuna ku daraa goobo lakabka: AREA iyo PERIMETER poligonada, LENGTH xariiqyada (dherer qorshaha), X iyo Y dhibcaha. Goob hore u jirtay ma la qori doono: kan cusub waxa loo magacaabaa AREA_2. Tani waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo. Tirakoob wuxuu siinayaa tirada, wadarta, celceliska, ugu yar iyo ugu badan ee goob tiro ah, si ikhtiyaari ah goob kasta oo qiime kale. Hubinta ka dambaysa qalabkan waxaa lagu sameeyay gacanta imtixaanka (node bin/test-civilcraft-gisanalysis.mjs): tusaale ahaan qaybo dhul ah 100 ku 100 oo hoostooda aag 100 ku 80 ah wuxuu isgoysaa 3,000 oo ku dar 3,000, iyo xariiq dheer 100 oo buffer lagu sameeyay 10 waa 2,000 iyo goobo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"gis-table","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Ka shaqee miiska sifooyinka lakabka","summary":"Eeg goob kasta oo lakab GIS ah sida miis, habee oo shaandhee, dooro safafka iyo goobaha, hagaaji qiimayaasha, ku dar goobo, xisaabi qiyamka cusub, oo kaydi miiska sida CSV.","section":"tasks","order":143,"keywords":["miiska sifooyinka","miis","goobo","tiirar","safaf","habayn","shaandhayn","expression","dooro","tafatir","xisaabiyaha goobta","xisaabi","ku dar goob","magac u beddel goob","ka saar goob","csv","dhoofin","gis","shapefile","geopackage","qaab"],"headings":[{"id":"habayn-shaandhee-iyo-dooro","text":"Habayn, shaandhee iyo dooro","level":2},{"id":"hagaaji-qiimayaasha","text":"Hagaaji qiimayaasha","level":2},{"id":"goobaha","text":"Goobaha","level":2},{"id":"xisaabiyaha-goobta","text":"Xisaabiyaha goobta","level":2},{"id":"dhoofinta","text":"Dhoofinta","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadyo","text":"Xaddidaadyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur miiska lakab ka \u003Cstrong\u003Esaddex dhibic\u003C/strong\u003E liiska lakabyada GIS (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiska sifooyinka…\u003C/span\u003E), ka Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiska sifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E, ama ku qor \u003Ccode\u003EATTRIBUTES\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EATTTABLE\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003ETABLE\u003C/code\u003E. Miiska wuxuu furmaa dhinaca qorshaha wuuna sii joogaa intaad ku shaqeynayso. Safafka aad aragto oo keliya ayaa la sawiraa, sidaas darteed lakab leh kun-kun goob wuu furmaa oo wuu si degdeg ah u dhaqaaqaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habayn-shaandhee-iyo-dooro\"\u003EHabayn, shaandhee iyo dooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabayn:\u003C/strong\u003E riix cinwaanka tiirka. Riix labaad wuu rogaa, saddexaad wuxuu soo celinayaa amarka faylka. Qiimayaasha madhan had iyo jeer waxay ku sii jiraan hoose. Habaynta waxay beddeshaa wixii aad aragto oo keliya, lakabka ma beddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShaandhee:\u003C/strong\u003E ku qor sanduuqa shaandhaynta. Expression sida \u003Ccode\u003EAREA &gt; 500 and USE = &#039;Res&#039;\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu hayaa safafka ay run tahay (erayada isku mid ah ee tabka Dooro ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-analysis\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-analysis\"\u003EFalanqee lakabyada GIS\u003C/a\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elike\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Econtains\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eis null\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ein\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ebetween\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eand\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E$area\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E$length\u003C/code\u003E). Wax aan expression ahayn, sida \u003Ccode\u003Eoak maple\u003C/code\u003E, ayaa erayadaas ka raadiya tiir kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooro safafka:\u003C/strong\u003E riix safka. Ctrl+riix wuxuu ku daraa ama wuu ka saaraa mid, Shift+riix wuxuu doortaa silsilad, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro safafka la muujiyay\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa safaf kasta oo shaandhaha sii dhaafa. Goobaha la doortay waxa lagu sawiraa qorshaha, riix goob qorshaha ku jirta wuxuu doortaa safkeeda halkan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii safafka la doortay, waxaad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeynee\u003C/span\u003E ilaa iyaga, samayn kartaa \u003Cstrong\u003Elakab xulashada ka\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ka akhrisan kartaa wadarta aagga ama dhererka sadarka xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hagaaji-qiimayaasha\"\u003EHagaaji qiimayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix laba jeer unugga (ama u gudub arrow keys oo riix Enter), qor qiimaha cusub oo riix Enter. Escape wuxuu ka tagayaa sidii ay ahayd. Qiimuhu waa inuu ku habboonaado tiirka: tirooyinka sida tirooyin, taariikhaha sida \u003Ccode\u003EYYYY-MM-DD\u003C/code\u003E, haa/maya sida yes, no, true ama false. Qiime aan ku habboonayn waa la diidaa, sabab-sheegidda, wixna ma beddelmo. Sanduuq madhan ayaa qiimaha madhan dhigaysa. Tafatir kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E waa hoosta miiska, Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goobaha\"\u003EGoobaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EGoobaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxaad ku dari kartaa goob (qoraal, tiro, taariikh ama haa/maya), magac u beddeli kartaa mid, ama ka saari kartaa mid. Goob cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa madhan. Magac-beddelku wuu raacaa: goobta calaamadda iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-symbology\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-symbology\"\u003Eqaabka sifada ku salaysan\u003C/a\u003E ee lakabka ayaa u gudba magaca cusub, iyo goob ka saaridda waxay tirtiraysaa calaamadda iyo qaabka ku isticmaalay. Mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo oo wax walba soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xisaabiyaha-goobta\"\u003EXisaabiyaha goobta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu qori qiime safaf kasta (ama safafka la doortay oo keliya) iyada oo laga qaadayo goobaha kale ee safka, qaabkiisa iyo shaqooyin yar. Dooro goob jirta ama \u003Cstrong\u003EGoob cusub…\u003C/strong\u003E oo siiso magac iyo nooc. Waxba lama fuliyo sida code: expression-ka waxa akhrisa falanqeeye yar oo leh liis go&#039;an oo shaqooyin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKoox\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EErayada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E, xidhmooyin, \u003Ccode\u003Eabs round(x, digits) floor ceil sqrt pow min max\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eupper lower trim len substr(text, from, count) left right replace concat\u003C/code\u003E (qoraalku wuxuu galaa &#039;xigasho hoose&#039;; magaca goob meel bannaan ku jiro wuxuu galaa &quot;xigasho laba jibbaaran&quot; ama [xidhmo jibbaaran])\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoorasho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eif(test, then, else)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecoalesce(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enum(x)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estr(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaariikhaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eyear month day\u003C/code\u003E oo ah qiime \u003Ccode\u003EYYYY-MM-DD\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeometry\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E$area $perimeter $length $x $y $vertices\u003C/code\u003E, cutubyada mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijo aan lagu kaydin karin nooca goobta (qoraal goob tiro ah) waa madhan tahay oo wuxuu tirin fariinta. Qaybinta eber wuxuu siiyaa qiime madhan. Tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003Eround($area / 43560, 2)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu qoraa acre-yada laga bilaabo fiit laba jibbaaran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofinta\"\u003EDhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa safafka aad aragto (kadib shaandhaha iyo habaynta) sida faylka CSV ee UTF-8 leh magacyada goobaha sadarka koowaad. Qoraal ku bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu helaa apostrophe horteeda si spreadsheet-ku uusan u fulin sida formula. Si aad lakabka laftiisa u kaydiso, isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-export\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-export\"\u003EDhoofi xogta dhismaha dhabta ah ee GIS\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadyo\"\u003EXaddidaadyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska wuxuu muujinayaa lakabka hal amar habayn iyo hal shaandhe mar kasta. Safafka halkan lama dari karo ama lama tirtiri karo (ku samee lakab cusub xulasho ka), geometry-ga lama tafatiro, nooca goob lama beddeli karo markii la sameeyo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur miiska lakab ka saddex dhibic liiska lakabyada GIS (Miiska sifooyinka…), ka Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Miiska sifooyinka, ama ku qor ATTRIBUTES, ATTTABLE ama TABLE. Miiska wuxuu furmaa dhinaca qorshaha wuuna sii joogaa intaad ku shaqeynayso. Safafka aad aragto oo keliya ayaa la sawiraa, sidaas darteed lakab leh kun-kun goob wuu furmaa oo wuu si degdeg ah u dhaqaaqaa. Habayn, shaandhee iyo dooro Habayn: riix cinwaanka tiirka. Riix labaad wuu rogaa, saddexaad wuxuu soo celinayaa amarka faylka. Qiimayaasha madhan had iyo jeer waxay ku sii jiraan hoose. Habaynta waxay beddeshaa wixii aad aragto oo keliya, lakabka ma beddesho. Shaandhee: ku qor sanduuqa shaandhaynta. Expression sida AREA \u003E 500 and USE = 'Res' wuxuu hayaa safafka ay run tahay (erayada isku mid ah ee tabka Dooro ee Falanqee lakabyada GIS: =, \u003C, like, contains, is null, in, between, and, or, not, $area, $length). Wax aan expression ahayn, sida oak maple, ayaa erayadaas ka raadiya tiir kasta. Dooro safafka: riix safka. Ctrl+riix wuxuu ku daraa ama wuu ka saaraa mid, Shift+riix wuxuu doortaa silsilad, Dooro safafka la muujiyay wuxuu qaadaa safaf kasta oo shaandhaha sii dhaafa. Goobaha la doortay waxa lagu sawiraa qorshaha, riix goob qorshaha ku jirta wuxuu doortaa safkeeda halkan. Markii safafka la doortay, waxaad Weynee ilaa iyaga, samayn kartaa lakab xulashada ka, oo ka akhrisan kartaa wadarta aagga ama dhererka sadarka xaaladda. Hagaaji qiimayaasha Riix laba jeer unugga (ama u gudub arrow keys oo riix Enter), qor qiimaha cusub oo riix Enter. Escape wuxuu ka tagayaa sidii ay ahayd. Qiimuhu waa inuu ku habboonaado tiirka: tirooyinka sida tirooyin, taariikhaha sida YYYY-MM-DD, haa/maya sida yes, no, true ama false. Qiime aan ku habboonayn waa la diidaa, sabab-sheegidda, wixna ma beddelmo. Sanduuq madhan ayaa qiimaha madhan dhigaysa. Tafatir kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo: Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale waa hoosta miiska, Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa qorshaha. Goobaha Hoosta Goobaha waxaad ku dari kartaa goob (qoraal, tiro, taariikh ama haa/maya), magac u beddeli kartaa mid, ama ka saari kartaa mid. Goob cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa madhan. Magac-beddelku wuu raacaa: goobta calaamadda iyo qaabka sifada ku salaysan ee lakabka ayaa u gudba magaca cusub, iyo goob ka saaridda waxay tirtiraysaa calaamadda iyo qaabka ku isticmaalay. Mid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo noqdo oo wax walba soo celinaysa. Xisaabiyaha goobta Wuxuu qori qiime safaf kasta (ama safafka la doortay oo keliya) iyada oo laga qaadayo goobaha kale ee safka, qaabkiisa iyo shaqooyin yar. Dooro goob jirta ama Goob cusub… oo siiso magac iyo nooc. Waxba lama fuliyo sida code: expression-ka waxa akhrisa falanqeeye yar oo leh liis go'an oo shaqooyin. Koox Erayada Tirooyin + - * /, xidhmooyin, abs round(x, digits) floor ceil sqrt pow min max Qoraal upper lower trim len substr(text, from, count) left right replace concat (qoraalku wuxuu galaa 'xigasho hoose'; magaca goob meel bannaan ku jiro wuxuu galaa \"xigasho laba jibbaaran\" ama [xidhmo jibbaaran]) Doorasho if(test, then, else), coalesce(a, b, …), num(x), str(x) Taariikhaha year month day oo ah qiime YYYY-MM-DD Geometry $area $perimeter $length $x $y $vertices, cutubyada mashruuca Natiijo aan lagu kaydin karin nooca goobta (qoraal goob tiro ah) waa madhan tahay oo wuxuu tirin fariinta. Qaybinta eber wuxuu siiyaa qiime madhan. Tusaale ahaan round($area / 43560, 2) wuxuu qoraa acre-yada laga bilaabo fiit laba jibbaaran. Dhoofinta Dhoofi CSV wuxuu kaydiyaa safafka aad aragto (kadib shaandhaha iyo habaynta) sida faylka CSV ee UTF-8 leh magacyada goobaha sadarka koowaad. Qoraal ku bilaabma =, +, - ama @ wuxuu helaa apostrophe horteeda si spreadsheet-ku uusan u fulin sida formula. Si aad lakabka laftiisa u kaydiso, isticmaal Dhoofi xogta dhismaha dhabta ah ee GIS. Xaddidaadyo Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa lakabka hal amar habayn iyo hal shaandhe mar kasta. Safafka halkan lama dari karo ama lama tirtiri karo (ku samee lakab cusub xulasho ka), geometry-ga lama tafatiro, nooca goob lama beddeli karo markii la sameeyo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"gis-symbology","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qaab lakab sifo ku salaysan","summary":"Midabee goobaha lakab GIS qiyamka goob (hal midab qiime kasta, ama dhexdhexaad tirooyinka), dhibcaha cabbir tiro ahaan, midabka poligonada, iyo calaamad qorshaha ku muuji.","section":"tasks","order":144,"keywords":["symbology","qaab","midab","color","qaybo","heer-heer","qiimo gaar ah","dhexdhexaad isku mid ah","quantile","jeexjeexyada dabiiciga ah","jenks","jeex","indha-cadaanta midabka","calaamad","cabbir","dhibcaha","choropleth","fasallada","gis"],"headings":[{"id":"saddex-qaab","text":"Saddex qaab","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-gooyo-heerarka","text":"Sida loo gooyo heerarka","level":2},{"id":"midabyada","text":"Midabyada","level":2},{"id":"cabbir-buuxin-iyo-calaamad","text":"Cabbir, buuxin iyo calaamad","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003Esaddex dhibic\u003C/strong\u003E liiska lakabyada GIS oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaab sifada ku salaysan…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saddex-qaab\"\u003ESaddex qaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamad mid ah:\u003C/strong\u003E midabka lakabka, sidii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha:\u003C/strong\u003E hal midab qiime kasta oo gooni ah oo goob kasta. Ilaa sideed qiime waxay helaan sideed midab Okabe-Ito (lagu doortay si ay u kala fogaadaan noocyada caadiga ah ee indha-cadaanta midabka); qiimo ka badan intaas, toddoba ugu caansan midab kasta ayay helaan, kuwa kale waxay wadaagaan fasal \u003Cstrong\u003EKale\u003C/strong\u003E oo cad. Goobaha aan qiime lahayn waa cad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeer-heer:\u003C/strong\u003E goob tiro ah waxa loo gooyaa 2 ilaa 9 heer, mid walbana midab ka yimid jeex. Qiime ku taal xadka wuxuu galaa heerka hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-gooyo-heerarka\"\u003ESida loo gooyo heerarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXadadka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexdhexaad isku mid ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeerka qiimaha ugu yar ilaa ugu weyn oo loo kala qaybiyay ballacyo isku mid ah. Qiimaha 0 ilaa 30 saddex heer: 0, 10, 20, 30.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantile\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhawaad tiro isku mid ah oo goob heer kasta. Xadadka waxa laga akhriyaa qiyamka la kala soortay, iyada oo la adeegsanayo interpolation-ka toosan ee caadiga ah: 1 ilaa 10 labo heer, xadku waa 5.5.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJeexjeexyada dabiiciga ah (Jenks)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGooyinta ay ka soo baxdo kala firdhin ugu yar heer kasta gudihiisa, si qiyamka isku eg ay isku dhex jiraan. Ka badan 1,500 qiime wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa 1,500 oo si siman u fogaysan, wuuna sheegaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midabyada\"\u003EMidabyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EViridis iyo Cividis waxay ka socdaan mugdi ilaa iftiin oo isbeddel joogto ah oo iftiinka ah, sidaas darteed amarka heerarka waa la akhrin karaa xataa cad ama indha-cadaanta midabka. Blues waa iftiin ilaa mugdi. Casaan ilaa buluug waa jeex laba-jihaysan oo qiyamka dhexdhexaad ku wareegsan. \u003Cstrong\u003EMidabka rog\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu wareejiyaa midkoodna. Wada-hadalku wuxuu liistaa heerarka iyo tirada goob kasta ka hor intaadan codsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbir-buuxin-iyo-calaamad\"\u003ECabbir, buuxin iyo calaamad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka dhibcaha\u003C/strong\u003E goob tiro ah ayaa ka dhigta laba jibbaaran dhibac kasta mid weyn sida qiimuhu weyn yahay, inta u dhexaysa labada cabbir aad bixiso (badhka dhinaca, mm warqadda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMidabka gudaha poligonada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa poligon kasta midabka fasalkiisa (godadku waa madhan yihiin). Midabku waa shaashadda; plots iyo DXF/DWG waxay muujinayaan geesaha midabka leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamad qorshaha ku muuji\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sawiraa fasallada, tiradooda iyo heerka cabbirka dhinaca hoose ee bidix ee qorshaha. Calaamaddu waa shaashadda; ma ku jirto plot.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad goobaha ugu calaamadayso goob, isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadee iyadoo\u003C/strong\u003E liiska isla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Dhismaha aan qaababka aqoon wuxuu furaa faylka midabka lakabka. Plots, DXF iyo DWG waxay qaadaan fasallada lakab kala gooh magaca lakabka iyo fasalka, midabka ugu dhow ee sagaashan midab oo CAD-ka aasaasiga ah. Lakab ka badan 200,000 goob waxa lagu sawiraa hal midab.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur saddex dhibic liiska lakabyada GIS oo dooro Qaab sifada ku salaysan…. Saddex qaab Calaamad mid ah: midabka lakabka, sidii hore. Qaybaha: hal midab qiime kasta oo gooni ah oo goob kasta. Ilaa sideed qiime waxay helaan sideed midab Okabe-Ito (lagu doortay si ay u kala fogaadaan noocyada caadiga ah ee indha-cadaanta midabka); qiimo ka badan intaas, toddoba ugu caansan midab kasta ayay helaan, kuwa kale waxay wadaagaan fasal Kale oo cad. Goobaha aan qiime lahayn waa cad. Heer-heer: goob tiro ah waxa loo gooyaa 2 ilaa 9 heer, mid walbana midab ka yimid jeex. Qiime ku taal xadka wuxuu galaa heerka hoose. Sida loo gooyo heerarka Habka Xadadka Dhexdhexaad isku mid ah Heerka qiimaha ugu yar ilaa ugu weyn oo loo kala qaybiyay ballacyo isku mid ah. Qiimaha 0 ilaa 30 saddex heer: 0, 10, 20, 30. Quantile Ku dhawaad tiro isku mid ah oo goob heer kasta. Xadadka waxa laga akhriyaa qiyamka la kala soortay, iyada oo la adeegsanayo interpolation-ka toosan ee caadiga ah: 1 ilaa 10 labo heer, xadku waa 5.5. Jeexjeexyada dabiiciga ah (Jenks) Gooyinta ay ka soo baxdo kala firdhin ugu yar heer kasta gudihiisa, si qiyamka isku eg ay isku dhex jiraan. Ka badan 1,500 qiime wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa 1,500 oo si siman u fogaysan, wuuna sheegaa. Midabyada Viridis iyo Cividis waxay ka socdaan mugdi ilaa iftiin oo isbeddel joogto ah oo iftiinka ah, sidaas darteed amarka heerarka waa la akhrin karaa xataa cad ama indha-cadaanta midabka. Blues waa iftiin ilaa mugdi. Casaan ilaa buluug waa jeex laba-jihaysan oo qiyamka dhexdhexaad ku wareegsan. Midabka rog wuxuu wareejiyaa midkoodna. Wada-hadalku wuxuu liistaa heerarka iyo tirada goob kasta ka hor intaadan codsan. Cabbir, buuxin iyo calaamad Cabbirka dhibcaha goob tiro ah ayaa ka dhigta laba jibbaaran dhibac kasta mid weyn sida qiimuhu weyn yahay, inta u dhexaysa labada cabbir aad bixiso (badhka dhinaca, mm warqadda). Midabka gudaha poligonada wuxuu buuxiyaa poligon kasta midabka fasalkiisa (godadku waa madhan yihiin). Midabku waa shaashadda; plots iyo DXF/DWG waxay muujinayaan geesaha midabka leh. Calaamad qorshaha ku muuji wuxuu sawiraa fasallada, tiradooda iyo heerka cabbirka dhinaca hoose ee bidix ee qorshaha. Calaamaddu waa shaashadda; ma ku jirto plot. Si aad goobaha ugu calaamadayso goob, isticmaal Calaamadee iyadoo liiska isla. Qaabka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Dhismaha aan qaababka aqoon wuxuu furaa faylka midabka lakabka. Plots, DXF iyo DWG waxay qaadaan fasallada lakab kala gooh magaca lakabka iyo fasalka, midabka ugu dhow ee sagaashan midab oo CAD-ka aasaasiga ah. Lakab ka badan 200,000 goob waxa lagu sawiraa hal midab.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"work-live","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Naqshad goob midkeenna ah oo Live TeamWork ah","summary":"Waxa isbedela CivilCraft intaad ku jirto Live TeamWork session CadCraft Studio: dhibcaha, alignment-ka, pad-ka iyo parcel-ka oo dhan mashruuc keliya, dusha la dhisay daaqad kasta, iyo furashada shaqadaada, iyo ku biirida browser ka isku shabakad.","section":"tasks","order":145,"keywords":["live","live teamwork","studio live","wada","iskaashi","session","wadaag live","ku biir","dhibcaha","alignment","dusha","tin","kursor","nuqul","arag midkeen","magacyada","midabka","doorashada","ka noqo","martida"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontaa","text":"Waxa aad baran doontaa","level":2},{"id":"dhammaantood-waxay-shaqeeyaan-isku-mar","text":"Dhammaantood waxay shaqeeyaan isku mar","level":2},{"id":"isku-arag","text":"Isku arag","level":2},{"id":"ka-noqoshada-waxaad-sameysay-keliya","text":"Ka noqoshada waxaad sameysay keliya","level":2},{"id":"ku-biir-browser-ka","text":"Ku biir browser-ka","level":2},{"id":"marka-session-ku-dhammaado","text":"Marka session-ku dhammaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontaa\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa dhaca mashruuca marka dhowr qof ay isku mar ku shaqeeyaan. CadCraft Studio wuxuu bilaabaa oo wuxuu ku biiraa Live TeamWork session-ka (Wadaag Live, Ku biir); bogaggan wuxuu ka hadlayaa mashruuca laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhammaantood-waxay-shaqeeyaan-isku-mar\"\u003EDhammaantood waxay shaqeeyaan isku mar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha iyo naqshadda martiga ayaa u imanaysa qof kasta oo ku biira. Dhibcaha wax ka beddel, sawir alignment-yo, pad-yo, feature line-yo iyo parcel-yo sida caadiga ah. Wax ka beddelkaaga wuu soo muuqdaa isla markiiba; kuwa kale wax ka beddelkooda wuxuu soo muuqdaa wakhti yar kadib markay sameeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibcaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay mid mid isku dhex-gelaan: laba qof oo laba dhibac u dhaqaajinaya labaduba wax ka beddelkooda way hayaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlignment-yada, pad-yada, feature line-yada iyo parcel-yada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay isku dhex-gelaan sida shay iyo dejin kasta; dejinta isku mid ah waxay u tagtaa isbeddelka dambe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu dhisaa daaqad kasta isla dhibcaha iyo breaklines-ka, sidaas darteed contours-ka iyo mugga way isku khilaafsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa wadaagmaan session-ka: dusha lagu soo rarey fayl grid, feature-yada lakabyada GIS, sawirada khariidadda iyo faylalka grid shift. Waxay ku sii jiraan daaqadda ay ka furmeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-arag\"\u003EIsku arag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQof kasta oo session-ka ku jira wuxuu leeyahay midab u gaar ah. Khariidadda waxaad aragtaa kursoor kasta oo qofka ah sida fallaadh midabkiisa leh, magaciisana wuu ku dhinac yaal, iyo sanduuq jajab ah oo midabkiisa ah oo ku wareegsan dhibcaha iyo shayga uu doortay. Haddii aragga 3D uu ku furan yahay khariidadda, kursoorada way sugayaan ilaa aad xirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKursoorada, magacyada iyo doorashooyinka waa kuwo session-ka oo keliya: waligood lama kaydiyo faylka, waligood ma gashaan ka noqoshada qof kasta. Waxay u dhaqaaqaan meesha qof kasta joogo, sidaas darteed way fudud yihiin xitaa xiriir gaabis ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-noqoshada-waxaad-sameysay-keliya\"\u003EKa noqoshada waxaad sameysay keliya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka noqdaa wax ka beddelkaagii ugu dambeeyey oo keliya, kuwa kalena wuu ka tagaa. Haddii qof kale wax isku mid ah isbedelay tan ka dib, wax lama ka noqdo, status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa qofka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-biir-browser-ka\"\u003EKu biir browser-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaaxiib aan Studio haysan ayaa sawirka ku hoos kood martiga ka sawiri kara taleefan, tablet ama kombuutar ku jira isla shabakad. CivilCraft wuxuu furmaa browser-ka oo wuxuu buuxmaa mashruuca martiga marka martigu ogolaado. Link martiyeed ayaa u ogolaanaya qof ku biirto shabakad kale: martiga wuxuu u baahan yahay kursi Team Cloud Plan barnaamijka, qofka kale wuu ku biiri karaa bilaash, linkiguna wuxuu shaqeeyaa keliya intaan session-ka martiga furan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-session-ku-dhammaado\"\u003EMarka session-ku dhammaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMartiga keliya ayaa kaydiya mashruuca. Qofka kale wuxuu hayaa nuqul aan la kaydin: kaydi haddii aad rabto inaad hayso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontaa Waxa dhaca mashruuca marka dhowr qof ay isku mar ku shaqeeyaan. CadCraft Studio wuxuu bilaabaa oo wuxuu ku biiraa Live TeamWork session-ka (Wadaag Live, Ku biir); bogaggan wuxuu ka hadlayaa mashruuca laftiisa. Dhammaantood waxay shaqeeyaan isku mar Dhibcaha iyo naqshadda martiga ayaa u imanaysa qof kasta oo ku biira. Dhibcaha wax ka beddel, sawir alignment-yo, pad-yo, feature line-yo iyo parcel-yo sida caadiga ah. Wax ka beddelkaaga wuu soo muuqdaa isla markiiba; kuwa kale wax ka beddelkooda wuxuu soo muuqdaa wakhti yar kadib markay sameeyaan. Dhibcaha waxay mid mid isku dhex-gelaan: laba qof oo laba dhibac u dhaqaajinaya labaduba wax ka beddelkooda way hayaan. Alignment-yada, pad-yada, feature line-yada iyo parcel-yada waxay isku dhex-gelaan sida shay iyo dejin kasta; dejinta isku mid ah waxay u tagtaa isbeddelka dambe. Dusha waxaa lagu dhisaa daaqad kasta isla dhibcaha iyo breaklines-ka, sidaas darteed contours-ka iyo mugga way isku khilaafsan. Ma wadaagmaan session-ka: dusha lagu soo rarey fayl grid, feature-yada lakabyada GIS, sawirada khariidadda iyo faylalka grid shift. Waxay ku sii jiraan daaqadda ay ka furmeen. Isku arag Qof kasta oo session-ka ku jira wuxuu leeyahay midab u gaar ah. Khariidadda waxaad aragtaa kursoor kasta oo qofka ah sida fallaadh midabkiisa leh, magaciisana wuu ku dhinac yaal, iyo sanduuq jajab ah oo midabkiisa ah oo ku wareegsan dhibcaha iyo shayga uu doortay. Haddii aragga 3D uu ku furan yahay khariidadda, kursoorada way sugayaan ilaa aad xirto. Kursoorada, magacyada iyo doorashooyinka waa kuwo session-ka oo keliya: waligood lama kaydiyo faylka, waligood ma gashaan ka noqoshada qof kasta. Waxay u dhaqaaqaan meesha qof kasta joogo, sidaas darteed way fudud yihiin xitaa xiriir gaabis ah. Ka noqoshada waxaad sameysay keliya Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqdaa wax ka beddelkaagii ugu dambeeyey oo keliya, kuwa kalena wuu ka tagaa. Haddii qof kale wax isku mid ah isbedelay tan ka dib, wax lama ka noqdo, status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa qofka. Ku biir browser-ka Saaxiib aan Studio haysan ayaa sawirka ku hoos kood martiga ka sawiri kara taleefan, tablet ama kombuutar ku jira isla shabakad. CivilCraft wuxuu furmaa browser-ka oo wuxuu buuxmaa mashruuca martiga marka martigu ogolaado. Link martiyeed ayaa u ogolaanaya qof ku biirto shabakad kale: martiga wuxuu u baahan yahay kursi Team Cloud Plan barnaamijka, qofka kale wuu ku biiri karaa bilaash, linkiguna wuxuu shaqeeyaa keliya intaan session-ka martiga furan yahay. Marka session-ku dhammaado Martiga keliya ayaa kaydiya mashruuca. Qofka kale wuxuu hayaa nuqul aan la kaydin: kaydi haddii aad rabto inaad hayso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"landscape","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Shaqada beerta","summary":"Qorshayaasha geedaha, sare-u-qaadista, dhagax-dhigista, darbiyada, tallaabooyinka, biyo-qulqulka iyo xaashiyada beerta isla goobta, isla dusha iyo isla faylka sida shaqada dhulka.","section":"tasks","order":150,"keywords":["beerta","naqshadda beerta","beerdhigga","beer","geedaha","geedo","sare-u-qaadista","dhagax-dhigis","biyo-qulqulka","sprinkler","shaqada","naqshadda beerta","qorshaha beerta"],"headings":[{"id":"fur","text":"Fur","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-jira-kooxda-beerta","text":"Waxa ku jira kooxda Beerta","level":2},{"id":"hal-dusha-wax-kasta","text":"Hal dusha wax kasta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EShaqada beerta waxay qalabka naqshadda beerta ku dhejisaa goobta CivilCraft ee aad haysato: isla barooyinka sahanka, isla dhulka jira, isla dusha la soo jeediyay iyo isla faylka mashruuca sida shaqada dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur\"\u003EFur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurface\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandscape workspace\u003C/span\u003E. Qalabka sare ayaa markaas muujinaya doorasho \u003Cstrong\u003EShaqada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo koox \u003Cstrong\u003EBeerta\u003C/strong\u003E, Dhulka, Naqshadda iyo GIS-ka ayaa dhinac u durugaya si loogu bixiyo meel. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka\u003C/strong\u003E hoos Shaqada si aad dib ugu noqoto. CivilCraft wuxuu xusaa shaqada aad isticmaashay ugu dambeysay kombuutarkan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBidix-panelka wuxuu ku daraa saddex qayb sare:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeedaha\u003C/strong\u003E: liiska geedaha, si aad u raadiso oo u doorato waxa aad dhigayso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plant-list\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plant-list\"\u003ELiiska geedaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubinta sare-u-qaadista\u003C/strong\u003E: falanqaynta janjeerka, fallaadaha socodka iyo biyo-ururka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-grading\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-grading\"\u003ESare-u-qaadista\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/strong\u003E: madasha iyo tuubooyinka aad dhigayso xiga, dejinta isha biyaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/irrigation\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/irrigation\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-jira-kooxda-beerta\"\u003EWaxa ku jira kooxda Beerta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMawduuca\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeed\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBeer\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EXaleen\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeedo keligood, beero beerdhig ah oo lagu buuxiyo masaafada geedaha, xaleen khad dheer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/planting\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/planting\"\u003EBeerdhigga\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESare-u-qaadis\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadalo, berm-yo, swale-yo, aagagga sare-u-qaadista oo leh barooyinka meel-gaarka ah iyo konturro, hubinta janjeerka iyo socodka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-grading\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-grading\"\u003ESare-u-qaadista\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhul adag\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhagax-dhigis, waddooyin, darbiyo, kerb-yo, jid-dhaafyo iyo tallaabooyin oo raacaya dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/hardscape\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/hardscape\"\u003EDhul adag\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAagagga\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagagga beerta: cawska, beeraha, daaqyada iyo dhul-daboolka oo leh dahaadh, oo lagu jarayo hareeraha dhul adag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/planted-areas\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/planted-areas\"\u003EAagagga beerta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka oo ah shayada qaabeeya dhulka oo leh jarista iyo buuxinta, dabaqa, heerarka meel-gaar, fallaadaha janjeerka, qaybaha khadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ground-modifiers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ground-modifiers\"\u003EWax-beddelayaasha dhulka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-sections\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-sections\"\u003EQaybaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadasha, tuubooyinka, valvo-yada, khadadka qulqulka, isha bixinta, daboolka iyo hubinta hydraulic-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/irrigation\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/irrigation\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka laga sameeyay (shayada khadadka lagu xidho), jadwalka geedaha, diiwaanka geedaha, xaashiyada shaqada, sawirrada geedaha, shayada xoriga ah, xaashiyada beerta iyo kooxda daabacaadda, dhoofinta IFC-ga beerta, cabbirka geedaha iyo calaamadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/objects-from-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/objects-from-lines\"\u003EShayada khadadka laga sameeyay\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plant-records\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plant-records\"\u003EDiiwaanada geedaha\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/worksheets\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/worksheets\"\u003EXaashiyada shaqada\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-sheets\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-sheets\"\u003EXaashiyada beerta\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/freeform-objects\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/freeform-objects\"\u003EShayada xoriga ah\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax kasta oo aad ku darto waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Waxaana lagu sawiraa qorshaha lakabyada loo magacaabay \u003Ccode\u003EL-PLNT-…\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EL-GRAD-…\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EL-HARD-…\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EL-IRRG-…\u003C/code\u003E, si dhoofinta DXF, DWG iyo PDF ay u qaadaan sidoo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-dusha-wax-kasta\"\u003EHal dusha wax kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhagax-dhigista, waddooyinka, berm-yada, swale-yada, aagagga sare-u-qaadista iyo dhagax-dhigista waxaa loo sare-u-qaadaa \u003Cstrong\u003Edusha la soo jeediyay\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ah isku mid kan ay ku shaqeeyaan jidadka iyo pad-yada. \u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka jira\u003C/strong\u003E weligiis ma bedelmo. Geedaha waxay saaran yihiin dhulka ku hoos jira, sidaas darteed way u guuraan marka sare-u-qaadistu isbeddesho. Shaqada dhulka, sare-u-qaadista beerta oo dhan ayaa lagu tiriyaa wixii kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECusub tahay? \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-walkthrough\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-walkthrough\"\u003EBeer naqshadee, bilow ilaa dhammaad\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu kuu sharxayaa shaqada beerta oo dhan goobta tusaalaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Shaqada beerta waxay qalabka naqshadda beerta ku dhejisaa goobta CivilCraft ee aad haysato: isla barooyinka sahanka, isla dhulka jira, isla dusha la soo jeediyay iyo isla faylka mashruuca sida shaqada dhulka. Fur Dooro Surface › More › Landscape workspace. Qalabka sare ayaa markaas muujinaya doorasho Shaqada iyo koox Beerta, Dhulka, Naqshadda iyo GIS-ka ayaa dhinac u durugaya si loogu bixiyo meel. Dooro Dhulka hoos Shaqada si aad dib ugu noqoto. CivilCraft wuxuu xusaa shaqada aad isticmaashay ugu dambeysay kombuutarkan. Bidix-panelka wuxuu ku daraa saddex qayb sare: Geedaha: liiska geedaha, si aad u raadiso oo u doorato waxa aad dhigayso. Eeg Liiska geedaha. Hubinta sare-u-qaadista: falanqaynta janjeerka, fallaadaha socodka iyo biyo-ururka. Eeg Sare-u-qaadista. Biyo-qulqulka: madasha iyo tuubooyinka aad dhigayso xiga, dejinta isha biyaha. Eeg Biyo-qulqulka. Waxa ku jira kooxda Beerta Qalab Waxa uu sameeyo Mawduuca Geed, Beer, Xaleen Geedo keligood, beero beerdhig ah oo lagu buuxiyo masaafada geedaha, xaleen khad dheer Beerdhigga Sare-u-qaadis Madalo, berm-yo, swale-yo, aagagga sare-u-qaadista oo leh barooyinka meel-gaarka ah iyo konturro, hubinta janjeerka iyo socodka Sare-u-qaadista Dhul adag Dhagax-dhigis, waddooyin, darbiyo, kerb-yo, jid-dhaafyo iyo tallaabooyin oo raacaya dhulka Dhul adag Aagagga Aagagga beerta: cawska, beeraha, daaqyada iyo dhul-daboolka oo leh dahaadh, oo lagu jarayo hareeraha dhul adag Aagagga beerta Heerarka Dhulka oo ah shayada qaabeeya dhulka oo leh jarista iyo buuxinta, dabaqa, heerarka meel-gaar, fallaadaha janjeerka, qaybaha khadka Wax-beddelayaasha dhulka, Qaybaha Biyo-qulqulka Madasha, tuubooyinka, valvo-yada, khadadka qulqulka, isha bixinta, daboolka iyo hubinta hydraulic-ka Biyo-qulqulka Wax dheeraad ah Khadka laga sameeyay (shayada khadadka lagu xidho), jadwalka geedaha, diiwaanka geedaha, xaashiyada shaqada, sawirrada geedaha, shayada xoriga ah, xaashiyada beerta iyo kooxda daabacaadda, dhoofinta IFC-ga beerta, cabbirka geedaha iyo calaamadaha Shayada khadadka laga sameeyay, Diiwaanada geedaha, Xaashiyada shaqada, Xaashiyada beerta, Shayada xoriga ah Wax kasta oo aad ku darto waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Waxaana lagu sawiraa qorshaha lakabyada loo magacaabay L-PLNT-…, L-GRAD-…, L-HARD-… iyo L-IRRG-…, si dhoofinta DXF, DWG iyo PDF ay u qaadaan sidoo kale. Hal dusha wax kasta Dhagax-dhigista, waddooyinka, berm-yada, swale-yada, aagagga sare-u-qaadista iyo dhagax-dhigista waxaa loo sare-u-qaadaa dusha la soo jeediyay, oo ah isku mid kan ay ku shaqeeyaan jidadka iyo pad-yada. Dhulka jira weligiis ma bedelmo. Geedaha waxay saaran yihiin dhulka ku hoos jira, sidaas darteed way u guuraan marka sare-u-qaadistu isbeddesho. Shaqada dhulka, sare-u-qaadista beerta oo dhan ayaa lagu tiriyaa wixii kale. Cusub tahay? Beer naqshadee, bilow ilaa dhammaad wuxuu kuu sharxayaa shaqada beerta oo dhan goobta tusaalaha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"plant-list","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Liiska geedka","summary":"Ku saabsan ilaa 420 geed oo caadi ah oo kulaylka dhexe iyo Mediterranean ah, oo leh cabbirradooda, adkaysiga, iftiinka iyo biyaha, lagu raadin karo luqad kasta, iyo liiskaaga geedka oo lagu kaydiyo mashruuca.","section":"tasks","order":151,"keywords":["liiska geedka","database-ka geedka","noocyada","magaca botanical","magaca caadiga ah","palette-ka geedka","liiska beerta","aagga adkaysiga","csv","soo dhoof geedka","soo dhoofi geedka","geedkayga","liiska geedka","geedo","maktabadda geedka"],"headings":[{"id":"raadi-iyo-sifee","text":"Raadi iyo sifee","level":2},{"id":"waxa-geed-kasta-leeyahay","text":"Waxa geed kasta leeyahay","level":2},{"id":"geedkaaga","text":"Geedkaaga","level":2},{"id":"barnaamijyada-kale-ee-geedka","text":"Barnaamijyada kale ee geedka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EGeedaha\u003C/strong\u003E ee panel-ka bidix waxa ku liistaa geed kasta oo aad dhigi karto. Riix mid si aad u aragto cabbirradiisa oo aad uga dhigto geedka ay \u003Cstrong\u003EGeed\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBeer\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EXaleen\u003C/strong\u003E isticmaalaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-iyo-sifee\"\u003ERaadi iyo sifee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu qor \u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi\u003C/strong\u003E: erey kasta oo ka mid ah magaca geedka luqad kasta (Ingiriisi, Isbaanish, Burtqiis), magaca botanical, nooca ama erey ku jira qoraalkiisa. Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqaa, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003Equercus evergreen\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu helaa geedka oakka cagaaran ee had iyo jeer cagaaran. Calaamadaha xarfaha (accents) ma muhiimka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska ku yari \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIftiinka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBiyaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EAagga adkaysiga\u003C/strong\u003E (aagga USDA ee goobtaadu ku taal: geed waa la liistaa marka aagga uu ku jiro kala duwanaanshaha geedka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-geed-kasta-leeyahay\"\u003EWaxa geed kasta leeyahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoob\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeed weyn, geed hoose, xaleen, cawl (cawska lawns oo ay ku jiraan), dhir ku noolaata sanno badan, dhir dhulka faafa ama dhir ku kacda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka uu koro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer iyo ballaca geedka oo lagu koray beer ama waddo, metrado\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka la dhigo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka uu ku dhigmo, iyo weelkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexe-ilaa-dhexe beer ama dhinaca xaleen\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga adkaysiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagagga USDA ee uu caadi ahaan ku adkaysto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiinka, biyaha, ciidda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa uu u baahan yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraallo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaalka iyo digniinta, sida qaybaha sunta ah ama geed faafa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska dhismaha waxa loo qoray CadCraft iyada oo laga soo qaatay aqoonta beeranimada guud: cabbirrada caadiga ah, oo la wareejiyay. Ma aha katalogga beer kasta. Cabbirrada iyo adkaysiga la hubi beerta deegaanka. Geedaha ugu caansan ee faafa ee Iberia iyo dhulka kulaylka dhexe ee badan waa laga tagay si ula kac ah, qaar kale oo meel kale faafa ayaa leh qoraal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geedkaaga\"\u003EGeedkaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar liiska mashruucan\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa geed liiska mashruuca, oo lagu kaydiyo mashruuca. Geed ku jira liistaada ayaa beddela kan dhismaha ee furaha isku mid ah, sidaas darteed waad beddeli kartaa cabbirradiisa gobolkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoof liiska geedka…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa CSV (ama fayl geed). CSV-gu wuxuu u baahan yahay tiir magaca botanical leh, iyo haddii la rabo, nooca, dherer iyo ballac; magacyada tiirarka ee erayadaada waa la aqbalaa (tusaale: Latin, Common name, Height, Spread, Width, Zone). Waxa la akhriyaa comma-yada, semicolon-yada iyo tab-yada, iyo comma-yada tobanaadka. Cabbirrada beerinta ee madhan, masaafada iyo weelka waxay helaan qiyaasyo caqli-galaa oo nooca loo dhigay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi sida CSV\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa liistaada (ama, haddii ay madhan tahay, geedka raadintu muujinayso) si aad ugu furtid spreadsheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska geedka waxa loo akhriyaa sida faylal kasta oo dibada ka yimid: wax kasta oo aan la isticmaali karin waa la iska tagaa, tirinaana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamijyada-kale-ee-geedka\"\u003EBarnaamijyada kale ee geedka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska geedka waa hal maktabad oo ah barnaamij kasta oo CadCraft ah: BimCraft iyo ModelCraft waxay leeyihiin isla liistaas, laakiin Dhig ka maktabadda (Place from library) ee ay leeyihiin weli geedo ma bixinayaan. Maanta geedka wuxuu gaaraa moodel BIM iyada oo loo marayo IFC-ga beerta ee CivilCraft (geed kasta waa \u003Ccode\u003EIfcGeographicElement\u003C/code\u003E). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/planting#ifc\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/planting\" data-hash=\"ifc\"\u003EBeeristaanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaybta Geedaha ee panel-ka bidix waxa ku liistaa geed kasta oo aad dhigi karto. Riix mid si aad u aragto cabbirradiisa oo aad uga dhigto geedka ay Geed, Beer iyo Xaleen isticmaalaan. Raadi iyo sifee Ku qor Raadi: erey kasta oo ka mid ah magaca geedka luqad kasta (Ingiriisi, Isbaanish, Burtqiis), magaca botanical, nooca ama erey ku jira qoraalkiisa. Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqaa, sidaas darteed quercus evergreen wuxuu helaa geedka oakka cagaaran ee had iyo jeer cagaaran. Calaamadaha xarfaha (accents) ma muhiimka. Liiska ku yari Nooca, Iftiinka, Biyaha iyo Aagga adkaysiga (aagga USDA ee goobtaadu ku taal: geed waa la liistaa marka aagga uu ku jiro kala duwanaanshaha geedka). Waxa geed kasta leeyahay Goob Macnaha Nooca Geed weyn, geed hoose, xaleen, cawl (cawska lawns oo ay ku jiraan), dhir ku noolaata sanno badan, dhir dhulka faafa ama dhir ku kacda Marka uu koro Dherer iyo ballaca geedka oo lagu koray beer ama waddo, metrado Marka la dhigo Cabbirka uu ku dhigmo, iyo weelkiisa Masaafada Dhexe-ilaa-dhexe beer ama dhinaca xaleen Aagga adkaysiga Aagagga USDA ee uu caadi ahaan ku adkaysto Iftiinka, biyaha, ciidda Waxa uu u baahan yahay Qoraallo Isticmaalka iyo digniinta, sida qaybaha sunta ah ama geed faafa Liiska dhismaha waxa loo qoray CadCraft iyada oo laga soo qaatay aqoonta beeranimada guud: cabbirrada caadiga ah, oo la wareejiyay. Ma aha katalogga beer kasta. Cabbirrada iyo adkaysiga la hubi beerta deegaanka. Geedaha ugu caansan ee faafa ee Iberia iyo dhulka kulaylka dhexe ee badan waa laga tagay si ula kac ah, qaar kale oo meel kale faafa ayaa leh qoraal. Geedkaaga Ku dar liiska mashruucan wuxuu koobiyeeyaa geed liiska mashruuca, oo lagu kaydiyo mashruuca. Geed ku jira liistaada ayaa beddela kan dhismaha ee furaha isku mid ah, sidaas darteed waad beddeli kartaa cabbirradiisa gobolkaaga. Soo dhoof liiska geedka… wuxuu akhrinayaa CSV (ama fayl geed). CSV-gu wuxuu u baahan yahay tiir magaca botanical leh, iyo haddii la rabo, nooca, dherer iyo ballac; magacyada tiirarka ee erayadaada waa la aqbalaa (tusaale: Latin, Common name, Height, Spread, Width, Zone). Waxa la akhriyaa comma-yada, semicolon-yada iyo tab-yada, iyo comma-yada tobanaadka. Cabbirrada beerinta ee madhan, masaafada iyo weelka waxay helaan qiyaasyo caqli-galaa oo nooca loo dhigay. Dhoofi sida CSV wuxuu kaydiyaa liistaada (ama, haddii ay madhan tahay, geedka raadintu muujinayso) si aad ugu furtid spreadsheet. Liiska geedka waxa loo akhriyaa sida faylal kasta oo dibada ka yimid: wax kasta oo aan la isticmaali karin waa la iska tagaa, tirinaana. Barnaamijyada kale ee geedka Liiska geedka waa hal maktabad oo ah barnaamij kasta oo CadCraft ah: BimCraft iyo ModelCraft waxay leeyihiin isla liistaas, laakiin Dhig ka maktabadda (Place from library) ee ay leeyihiin weli geedo ma bixinayaan. Maanta geedka wuxuu gaaraa moodel BIM iyada oo loo marayo IFC-ga beerta ee CivilCraft (geed kasta waa IfcGeographicElement). Eeg Beeristaanka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"planting","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qorshayaasha beeristaanka iyo jadwalada","summary":"Geed keligiis dhig, beero beeristaanka oo lagu buuxiyo masaafada geedka iyo geedo isku-dhafan oo boqolley, iyo xaleenno; calaamadee; tiri jadwalka geedka si aad spreadsheet ama TakeoffCraft ugu isticmaasho.","section":"tasks","order":152,"keywords":["qorshaha beeristaanka","jadwalka geedka","beerta beeristaanka","beeristaanka dhan","xaleen","geed weyn","geedka hoose","dhir ku kacda","masaafada","masaafada saddex-geesood","tirinta geedka","qadarka","calaamadaha","ifc","takeoff"],"headings":[{"id":"geedka-dhig","text":"Geedka dhig","level":2},{"id":"beeraha-beeristaanka","text":"Beeraha beeristaanka","level":2},{"id":"xaleenno","text":"Xaleenno","level":2},{"id":"calaamadaha","text":"Calaamadaha","level":2},{"id":"jadwalka-geedka","text":"Jadwalka geedka","level":2},{"id":"ifc","text":"IFC","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"geedka-dhig\"\u003EGeedka dhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro geed qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EGeedaha\u003C/strong\u003E ee bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji qorshaha: guji kasta wuxuu dhigaa hal geed. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda geedka waxa lagu sawiraa ballaca uu gaaro marka uu weynaado; More › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow at planting size\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa geed kasta cabbirka uu ku dhigmo. Geedka weyn wuxuu ku sugan yahay dhulka hoosteeda: marka aad dambe dhulka hagaajiso, way raacaan. Si aad geed u dhigto heer go&#039;an, ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EElevation\u003C/strong\u003E ee Guryaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beeraha-beeristaanka\"\u003EBeeraha beeristaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro geedka ugu weyn, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBed\u003C/span\u003E, oo guji geesaha beerta. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama guji geeska koowaad mar kale) si aad u xidhto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeerta waxay ku buuxmaysaa geedkaas masaafadiisa, qaab \u003Cstrong\u003Esaddex-geesood\u003C/strong\u003E (caadiga ah: geed kasta waa isla masaafada laga leeyahay lix kale), nus masaafo ka gudaha cidhifka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cstrong\u003EGuryaha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar geed\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isku darayaa geedka lagu doortay bidix. Dejiso \u003Cstrong\u003EQayb %\u003C/strong\u003E geed kasta: beerta waxay qaadataa tiradaas oo kale mid kasta, oo lagu kala firdhiyay. \u003Cstrong\u003EDib u isku qas\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dib u shuubaa meelaha ay ku dhigan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii \u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada\u003C/strong\u003E ay madhan tahay, waxa loo isticmaalaa masaafada geedka laftiisa (oo lagu miisaanay qaybahooda); qor mid si aad ugu isticmaasho geed kasta. \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu noqon karaa labajibbaaran, \u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka ku wareeg\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leexiyaa safafka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaleenno\"\u003EXaleenno\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro geedka xaleenka, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHedge\u003C/span\u003E, guji dhinaca xaleenka oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Geedku wuxuu u dhacaa khadka masaafadooda, dhexdhexaad si labada dhamaad ay isku mid ugu leeyihiin. Xaleen wuxuu noqon karaa \u003Cstrong\u003Elaba safood, isku-dhaaf\u003C/strong\u003E, masaafo go&#039;an oo u dhexaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadaha\"\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeedka keligiis waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa dejinta calaamadda (\u003Ccode\u003E{name}\u003C/code\u003E ayaa caadi ah); calaamad gaar ah geed kasta ku qor Guryaha. Beeraha waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa tirada geed kasta, xaleennada tirada iyadooda. More › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant labels\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu shidaa ama damiyaa calaamadaha. Goobaha calaamadda: \u003Ccode\u003E{name}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{botanical}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{size}\u003C/code\u003E (weelka), \u003Ccode\u003E{qty}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{height}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{spread}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{container}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jadwalka-geedka\"\u003EJadwalka geedka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMore › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant schedule…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa geed kasta noocyada, oo ka yimid geedka keligiis, beerta iyo xaleennada wada-jirka, iyo cabbirka beerinta. Kaydi sida \u003Cstrong\u003ECSV\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EXLSX\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EU dir TakeoffCraft\u003C/strong\u003E: faylka qadarka oo TakeoffCraft furaya si uu u qiimeeyo geedka (oo ay ku dhinac yihiin qadarka hardscape-ka iyo biyaha ku-shubista).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifc\"\u003EIFC\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMore › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport landscape IFC\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa beerta sida fayl IFC (IFC 4.3) oo moodel BIM ku hayn kara: geed kasta waa \u003Ccode\u003EIfcGeographicElement\u003C/code\u003E oo nooca VEGETATION ah, lagu magacaabay noocyadiisa, oo leh guryaha geedka (magaca botanical, cabbirrada, adkaysiga, biyaha, iftiinka); beer kasta iyo xaleen kasta waa hal shay oo leh tiradooda, goobta. BimCraft wuxuu ku furaa dhinaca dhismaha.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Geedka dhig Dooro geed qaybta Geedaha ee bidix. Guji Plant, kadibna guji qorshaha: guji kasta wuxuu dhigaa hal geed. Riix Esc si aad u joojiso. Calaamadda geedka waxa lagu sawiraa ballaca uu gaaro marka uu weynaado; More › Show at planting size wuxuu sawiraa geed kasta cabbirka uu ku dhigmo. Geedka weyn wuxuu ku sugan yahay dhulka hoosteeda: marka aad dambe dhulka hagaajiso, way raacaan. Si aad geed u dhigto heer go'an, ku qor Elevation ee Guryaha. Beeraha beeristaanka Dooro geedka ugu weyn, guji Bed, oo guji geesaha beerta. Riix Enter (ama guji geeska koowaad mar kale) si aad u xidhto. Beerta waxay ku buuxmaysaa geedkaas masaafadiisa, qaab saddex-geesood (caadiga ah: geed kasta waa isla masaafada laga leeyahay lix kale), nus masaafo ka gudaha cidhifka. Ku Guryaha, Ku dar geed wuxuu isku darayaa geedka lagu doortay bidix. Dejiso Qayb % geed kasta: beerta waxay qaadataa tiradaas oo kale mid kasta, oo lagu kala firdhiyay. Dib u isku qas wuxuu dib u shuubaa meelaha ay ku dhigan yihiin. Haddii Masaafada ay madhan tahay, waxa loo isticmaalaa masaafada geedka laftiisa (oo lagu miisaanay qaybahooda); qor mid si aad ugu isticmaasho geed kasta. Qaabka wuxuu noqon karaa labajibbaaran, Safafka ku wareeg wuxuu leexiyaa safafka. Xaleenno Dooro geedka xaleenka, guji Hedge, guji dhinaca xaleenka oo riix Enter. Geedku wuxuu u dhacaa khadka masaafadooda, dhexdhexaad si labada dhamaad ay isku mid ugu leeyihiin. Xaleen wuxuu noqon karaa laba safood, isku-dhaaf, masaafo go'an oo u dhexaysa. Calaamadaha Geedka keligiis waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa dejinta calaamadda ({name} ayaa caadi ah); calaamad gaar ah geed kasta ku qor Guryaha. Beeraha waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa tirada geed kasta, xaleennada tirada iyadooda. More › Plant labels wuxuu shidaa ama damiyaa calaamadaha. Goobaha calaamadda: {name}, {botanical}, {size} (weelka), {qty}, {height}, {spread}, {container}. Jadwalka geedka More › Plant schedule… wuxuu tiriyaa geed kasta noocyada, oo ka yimid geedka keligiis, beerta iyo xaleennada wada-jirka, iyo cabbirka beerinta. Kaydi sida CSV ama XLSX, ama U dir TakeoffCraft: faylka qadarka oo TakeoffCraft furaya si uu u qiimeeyo geedka (oo ay ku dhinac yihiin qadarka hardscape-ka iyo biyaha ku-shubista). IFC More › Export landscape IFC wuxuu kaydiyaa beerta sida fayl IFC (IFC 4.3) oo moodel BIM ku hayn kara: geed kasta waa IfcGeographicElement oo nooca VEGETATION ah, lagu magacaabay noocyadiisa, oo leh guryaha geedka (magaca botanical, cabbirrada, adkaysiga, biyaha, iftiinka); beer kasta iyo xaleen kasta waa hal shay oo leh tiradooda, goobta. BimCraft wuxuu ku furaa dhinaca dhismaha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"landscape-grading","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Simaynta dhulka beerta","summary":"Madallo, buuro, dhuunooyin iyo simayn xor ah oo leh heerarka meel-gaar iyo konturro aad jiidi karto, jarista iyo buuxinta firfircoon, falanqaynta janjeerka, fallaadaha socodka iyo biyo-ururka, dhammaan dusha la soo jeediyay ee CivilCraft.","section":"tasks","order":153,"keywords":["derbi taageeraya","derbiyada taageeraya","cidhifka toosan","derbi halkii janjeer","janjeerka dhinacyada","buur-dhul","simayn","simaynta beerta","madal","teras","pad","buur","tuulo","dhuun","heerka meel-gaar","konturro","tafatir konturro","jarista iyo buuxinta","shaqada dhulka","falanqaynta janjeerka","marin-habaabin","janjeer adag","fallaadaha socodka","biyo-mareen","biyo-ururka"],"headings":[{"id":"madallada","text":"Madallada","level":2},{"id":"janjeerada-dhinac-kasta-iyo-derbiyada-taageeraya","text":"Janjeerada dhinac kasta iyo derbiyada taageeraya","level":2},{"id":"buuraha","text":"Buuraha","level":2},{"id":"dhuunooyinka","text":"Dhuunooyinka","level":2},{"id":"sare-geedka-meel-gaar-iyo-konturrada","text":"Sare-geedka meel-gaar iyo konturrada","level":2},{"id":"jarista-iyo-buuxinta-firfircoon","text":"Jarista iyo buuxinta, firfircoon","level":2},{"id":"hubinta-simaynta","text":"Hubinta simaynta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWax kasta oo halkan ah waxa lagu simaa \u003Cstrong\u003Edusha la soo jeediyay\u003C/strong\u003E isla simaynta padyada iyo corridor-yada. \u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka jira\u003C/strong\u003E weligiis ma bedelmo, Shaqada Dhulka ayaa tirinaysa dhammaan. Menu-ga Simaynta waxa uu ku jiraa kooxda Beerta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"madallada\"\u003EMadallada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimaynta dhulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMadal\u003C/span\u003E, ka dib riix geesaha oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Madalku wuxuu ku bilaabmaa celceliska sare-geedka dhulka hoostiisa; qor \u003Cstrong\u003ESare-geed\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u dejiso, ama madhan ka dhig si uu mar kale u raaco dhulka. \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeer\u003C/strong\u003E % ah iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJihada janjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E darajooyin ah (0 = bari, 90 = waqooyi) ayaa janjeeriya. Dhinacyadiisa waxaa lagu simaa dhulka ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka jarista\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka buuxinta\u003C/strong\u003E (sare ilaa 1).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"janjeerada-dhinac-kasta-iyo-derbiyada-taageeraya\"\u003EJanjeerada dhinac kasta iyo derbiyada taageeraya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinacyada iyo derbiyada taageeraya\u003C/strong\u003E ee Sifooyinka padka, madal ama buur, dhinac kasta waxa lagu simi karaa siyaabaheeda. Dhinaca 1 wuxuu ka ordayaa geedka koowaad ee aad riixday ilaa labaad, dhinaca 2 labaad ilaa saddexaad, iyo sidaas aad u sii socota.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhinacyada oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeer\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa janjeerada jarista iyo buuxinta ee kor ku jira dhinac kasta; \u003Cstrong\u003EToosan: derbiyada taageeraya\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhigaa derbi dhinac kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinac kasta: \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerada kor ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeeradiisa\u003C/strong\u003E (qor janjeer jarista iyo buuxinta dhinacaas) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EToosan (derbi taageeraya)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor janjeer sida \u003Ccode\u003E3\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E3:1\u003C/code\u003E (jiifka ilaa 1 toos ah), \u003Ccode\u003E33%\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E18.4°\u003C/code\u003E; wuxuu muuqdaa sida H:1. \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka jarista\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka buuxinta\u003C/strong\u003E ee padka ayaa isla siyaabaha qaata.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca toosan ma leh buur-dhul: derbi taageeraya wuxuu ku socdaa geesta, padka ilaa dhulka jira (buuxinta) ama dhulka ilaa padka (jarista). \u003Cstrong\u003EDhumucda derbiga\u003C/strong\u003E (0.3 m ama 1 ft bilowga) waa intee ka fog ee dhulku uga kor u kaco geesta padka ilaa dhulka jira. Mugaha jarista iyo buuxinta ma ku jiraan buur-dhulka dhinaca aan mar dambe lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha derbi ku kulmo dhinac janjeeran, janjeerku wuxuu ku wareegaa dhamaadka derbiga; labo derbi waxay isku kulmaan miitar (xagal 45°) ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoosan goobaha hoose: dherarka derbiyada, wejiga la arko (joog × dherer), joogta ugu sarreysa iyo celceliska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa wejiga dibadda derbi kasta oo leh calaamado gaaban oo ku dhaadhacaya, iyo joogtiisa labada dhamaadood iyo meesha ugu sarreysa (layer-ka derbiyada taageeraya, kaas oo sidoo kale galaa DXF iyo DWG). Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu muujiyaa derbiyada sida jidh adag (Muuji › Derbiyada taageeraya), oo GLB, OBJ iyo USD dhoofinta ayaa ku jira. Qaybaha geesta u gudba waxay muujiyaan tallaabada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDigniinta\u003C/strong\u003E (Sifooyinka, iyo Guddiga Dhibaatooyinka): derbi ka sarreeya \u003Cstrong\u003EDigniin haddii joogta derbiga ka sarreyso\u003C/strong\u003E (1.0 m ama 3.3 ft bilowga) &quot;wuxuu u baahan karaa derbi injineer ah ama ogolaansho; hubi xeerarka maxalliga ah&quot;, iyo, markaad qortid \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka ugu adag ee ciidda taagan karta\u003C/strong\u003E, dhinac kasta oo janjeerkiisa jarista ama buuxinta ka adag tan. Waa digniin: simaynta wali way dhisaa. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buuraha\"\u003EBuuraha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimaynta dhulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuur\u003C/span\u003E: buur sare u taagan \u003Cstrong\u003EJoogtiisa\u003C/strong\u003E ka sarreeya celceliska dhulka hoostiisa, dhinacyadeeda la simay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhuunooyinka\"\u003EDhuunooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimaynta dhulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhuun\u003C/span\u003E, ka dib riix dhinaca dhuunta \u003Cstrong\u003Esiyaabaha biyuhu u socdaan\u003C/strong\u003E oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Deji \u003Cstrong\u003EQoto\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBallaca hoose\u003C/strong\u003E (0 waa V) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeerka dhinaca\u003C/strong\u003E. Haddii aan \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjeer\u003C/strong\u003E lahayn, hoosteeda waxay raacaa dhulka, qotodheeraheeda hoosteeda, weligeedna kama kacdo kor; qor janjeer si uu u helo mid joogto ah bilowgiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sare-geedka-meel-gaar-iyo-konturrada\"\u003ESare-geedka meel-gaar iyo konturrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimaynta dhulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAagga simaynta\u003C/span\u003E: riix dhinaca aagga aad rabto inaad qaabeyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimaynta dhulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare-u-taagga barta\u003C/span\u003E: riix gudaha aagga. Qor sare-geedkeeda Sifooyinka, ama isticmaal badhamada ▲ ▼.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimaynta dhulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel kontuur\u003C/span\u003E: riix kontuur gudaha aagga si aad u qaadato xariiq aad dib u qaabeyn karto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro barta ama kontuurka oo \u003Cstrong\u003Ejiid\u003C/strong\u003E (ama barooyinkeeda) qorshaha: dusha ayaa raacaa markaad sii daayo, hal tallaabo ka noqosho. Gudaha aagga dhulka waxa dib loo dhisaa geestiisa (meesha uu ku kulmo dhulka jira), sare-geedka meel-gaarka iyo konturada la wax ka beddelay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jarista-iyo-buuxinta-firfircoon\"\u003EJarista iyo buuxinta, firfircoon\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESifooyinka shay kasta oo simayn ah waxay muujiyaan \u003Cstrong\u003EJarista\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBuuxinta\u003C/strong\u003E oo iyo kan goobta oo dhan, iyada oo loo marayo habka shabakadda ee Shaqada Dhulka isticmaasho, intaad isbeddelinayso. Dhibaatooyinka (ka baxsan dusha, geesta is-gooysa) halkaas ayaa liistaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta-simaynta\"\u003EHubinta simaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EHubinta simaynta\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca bidix:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFalanqaynta janjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu midabeeyaa dusha sida janjeerka: ilaa xadka tayo, u dhexeeya, iyo ka adag xadka adag (5 % iyo 33.3 % bilowga: caadiga 1:20 jidadka helitaanka iyo 1:3 jarista beerta). Sharaxaaddu waxay sheegaysaa inta aagga ah ee ku dhacda mid kasta. Aagagga adag xaashiyada ayaa sidoo kale lagu daabacaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFallaadaha socodka iyo biyo-ururka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sawiraa jihada biyuhu socdaan iyo wareegyo meel kasta oo biyuhu ururi lahaayeen, oo leh qotodheeraheeda; qaybtu waxay sheegaysaa meelaha intee leeg, kuwa ugu qotodheer iyo biyaha ay hayaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubinta waxay akhrisaa dusha la soo jeediyay haddii wax la simay, haddii kale dhulka jira.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Wax kasta oo halkan ah waxa lagu simaa dusha la soo jeediyay isla simaynta padyada iyo corridor-yada. Dhulka jira weligiis ma bedelmo, Shaqada Dhulka ayaa tirinaysa dhammaan. Menu-ga Simaynta waxa uu ku jiraa kooxda Beerta. Madallada Simaynta dhulka › Madal, ka dib riix geesaha oo riix Enter. Madalku wuxuu ku bilaabmaa celceliska sare-geedka dhulka hoostiisa; qor Sare-geed si aad u dejiso, ama madhan ka dhig si uu mar kale u raaco dhulka. Janjeer % ah iyo Jihada janjeerka darajooyin ah (0 = bari, 90 = waqooyi) ayaa janjeeriya. Dhinacyadiisa waxaa lagu simaa dhulka ilaa Janjeerka jarista iyo Janjeerka buuxinta (sare ilaa 1). Janjeerada dhinac kasta iyo derbiyada taageeraya Hoosta Dhinacyada iyo derbiyada taageeraya ee Sifooyinka padka, madal ama buur, dhinac kasta waxa lagu simi karaa siyaabaheeda. Dhinaca 1 wuxuu ka ordayaa geedka koowaad ee aad riixday ilaa labaad, dhinaca 2 labaad ilaa saddexaad, iyo sidaas aad u sii socota. Dhinacyada oo dhan: Janjeer wuxuu isticmaalaa janjeerada jarista iyo buuxinta ee kor ku jira dhinac kasta; Toosan: derbiyada taageeraya wuxuu dhigaa derbi dhinac kasta. Dhinac kasta: Janjeerada kor ku jira, Janjeeradiisa (qor janjeer jarista iyo buuxinta dhinacaas) ama Toosan (derbi taageeraya). Qor janjeer sida 3 ama 3:1 (jiifka ilaa 1 toos ah), 33% ama 18.4°; wuxuu muuqdaa sida H:1. Janjeerka jarista iyo Janjeerka buuxinta ee padka ayaa isla siyaabaha qaata. Dhinaca toosan ma leh buur-dhul: derbi taageeraya wuxuu ku socdaa geesta, padka ilaa dhulka jira (buuxinta) ama dhulka ilaa padka (jarista). Dhumucda derbiga (0.3 m ama 1 ft bilowga) waa intee ka fog ee dhulku uga kor u kaco geesta padka ilaa dhulka jira. Mugaha jarista iyo buuxinta ma ku jiraan buur-dhulka dhinaca aan mar dambe lahayn. Meesha derbi ku kulmo dhinac janjeeran, janjeerku wuxuu ku wareegaa dhamaadka derbiga; labo derbi waxay isku kulmaan miitar (xagal 45°) ah. Goosan goobaha hoose: dherarka derbiyada, wejiga la arko (joog × dherer), joogta ugu sarreysa iyo celceliska. Qorshuhu wuxuu sawiraa wejiga dibadda derbi kasta oo leh calaamado gaaban oo ku dhaadhacaya, iyo joogtiisa labada dhamaadood iyo meesha ugu sarreysa (layer-ka derbiyada taageeraya, kaas oo sidoo kale galaa DXF iyo DWG). Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu muujiyaa derbiyada sida jidh adag (Muuji › Derbiyada taageeraya), oo GLB, OBJ iyo USD dhoofinta ayaa ku jira. Qaybaha geesta u gudba waxay muujiyaan tallaabada. Digniinta (Sifooyinka, iyo Guddiga Dhibaatooyinka): derbi ka sarreeya Digniin haddii joogta derbiga ka sarreyso (1.0 m ama 3.3 ft bilowga) \"wuxuu u baahan karaa derbi injineer ah ama ogolaansho; hubi xeerarka maxalliga ah\", iyo, markaad qortid Janjeerka ugu adag ee ciidda taagan karta, dhinac kasta oo janjeerkiisa jarista ama buuxinta ka adag tan. Waa digniin: simaynta wali way dhisaa. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho Ctrl+Z. Buuraha Simaynta dhulka › Buur: buur sare u taagan Joogtiisa ka sarreeya celceliska dhulka hoostiisa, dhinacyadeeda la simay. Dhuunooyinka Simaynta dhulka › Dhuun, ka dib riix dhinaca dhuunta siyaabaha biyuhu u socdaan oo riix Enter. Deji Qoto, Ballaca hoose (0 waa V) iyo Janjeerka dhinaca. Haddii aan Janjeer lahayn, hoosteeda waxay raacaa dhulka, qotodheeraheeda hoosteeda, weligeedna kama kacdo kor; qor janjeer si uu u helo mid joogto ah bilowgiisa. Sare-geedka meel-gaar iyo konturrada Simaynta dhulka › Aagga simaynta: riix dhinaca aagga aad rabto inaad qaabeyso. Simaynta dhulka › Sare-u-taagga barta: riix gudaha aagga. Qor sare-geedkeeda Sifooyinka, ama isticmaal badhamada ▲ ▼. Simaynta dhulka › Wax ka beddel kontuur: riix kontuur gudaha aagga si aad u qaadato xariiq aad dib u qaabeyn karto. Dooro barta ama kontuurka oo jiid (ama barooyinkeeda) qorshaha: dusha ayaa raacaa markaad sii daayo, hal tallaabo ka noqosho. Gudaha aagga dhulka waxa dib loo dhisaa geestiisa (meesha uu ku kulmo dhulka jira), sare-geedka meel-gaarka iyo konturada la wax ka beddelay. Jarista iyo buuxinta, firfircoon Sifooyinka shay kasta oo simayn ah waxay muujiyaan Jarista iyo Buuxinta oo iyo kan goobta oo dhan, iyada oo loo marayo habka shabakadda ee Shaqada Dhulka isticmaasho, intaad isbeddelinayso. Dhibaatooyinka (ka baxsan dusha, geesta is-gooysa) halkaas ayaa liistaa. Hubinta simaynta Qaybta Hubinta simaynta dhinaca bidix: Falanqaynta janjeerka wuxuu midabeeyaa dusha sida janjeerka: ilaa xadka tayo, u dhexeeya, iyo ka adag xadka adag (5 % iyo 33.3 % bilowga: caadiga 1:20 jidadka helitaanka iyo 1:3 jarista beerta). Sharaxaaddu waxay sheegaysaa inta aagga ah ee ku dhacda mid kasta. Aagagga adag xaashiyada ayaa sidoo kale lagu daabacaa. Fallaadaha socodka iyo biyo-ururka wuxuu sawiraa jihada biyuhu socdaan iyo wareegyo meel kasta oo biyuhu ururi lahaayeen, oo leh qotodheeraheeda; qaybtu waxay sheegaysaa meelaha intee leeg, kuwa ugu qotodheer iyo biyaha ay hayaan. Hubinta waxay akhrisaa dusha la soo jeediyay haddii wax la simay, haddii kale dhulka jira.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"hardscape","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Sagxadaynta, darbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka","summary":"Sagxadaynta oo leh hoos-u-dhac ilaa biyo-qaad ama jeexjeex dhinac, qaabkeeda iyo dhismaha; jidad raaca dhulka; darbiyada dhulka celiya iyo kuwa go'an oo leh aasaas tallaabo tallaabo ah; kerbiyada; jiidaha iyo tallaabooyinka oo xadkooda la hubiyay; IFC oo dibadda u dhoofa.","section":"tasks","order":154,"keywords":["dhul adag","sagxadaynta","dhagaxyada sagxadda","patio","teras","hoos-u-dhac","biyo-qaad","jeexjeex dhinac","herringbone","stretcher bond","jid","waddo socod","darbi dhulka celiya","darbi beer","aasaas","daboolka","kerbi","xuduud","jiid","helitaanka","tallaabooyin","jaranjaro","kor-tallaabo","sagxadda tallaabada","sagxad-fadhi"],"headings":[{"id":"sagxadaynta","text":"Sagxadaynta","level":2},{"id":"jidadka","text":"Jidadka","level":2},{"id":"darbiyada","text":"Darbiyada","level":2},{"id":"kerbiyada","text":"Kerbiyada","level":2},{"id":"jiidaha","text":"Jiidaha","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"ka-baxsan-civilcraft","text":"Ka baxsan CivilCraft","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDhul adag mar kasta dib ayaa looga shaqeeyaa dhulka, sidaas darteed wuxuu raacaa dhulka wuuna dib u dhisaa marka dhulka ama khadkiisu isbedelo. Geedaha ku jira qorshaha jiid sida khad kasta. Ka fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhul adag\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Beerta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sagxadaynta\"\u003ESagxadaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji geedaha oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Sifooyinka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka\u003C/strong\u003E: madhan = dhulka celceliska ah ee hoostiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHoos-u-dhac\u003C/strong\u003E: heer, \u003Cstrong\u003Ejeexjeex dhinac\u003C/strong\u003E (% u jeeda jihada) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ebiyo-qaad\u003C/strong\u003E: CivilCraft wuxuu kugu weydiinayaa inaad riixdo meesha biyo-qaadku yahay, markaas geed kasta wuxuu kor uga kacaa biyo-qaadka hoos-u-dhaca. Fallaadhadu qorshaha ayay tusaan hoos-u-dhacyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka\u003C/strong\u003E (grid, stretcher bond, herringbone) oo leh cabbirka unugga, isku-xidhka iyo xagga; \u003Cstrong\u003EXadka\u003C/strong\u003E ballacdiisa. Xaashi dhexdiisa, isku-xidhka ka yar hal millimitir waa la reebaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESagxadaynta waa qayb ka mid ah dusha la soo jeediyay. Lakabyadeeda (dhagaxyada sagxadda, jiifka, saldhiga) waxay galaan IFC iyo tirooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidadka\"\u003EJidadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji dhinaca jidka oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Wuxuu raacaa dhulka, \u003Cstrong\u003EJeexjeex dhinac\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u jeedaa dhinaca midig. Jid ka jiidh badan \u003Cstrong\u003EUgu jiidh badan ee la ogol yahay\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E!\u003C/code\u003E qorshaha meesha uu joogo, sifooyinkuna waxay sheegaan inta uu u jiidh badan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeesha jidku la kulmo waddo ay kooridor dhisay, wuxuu ku joogsadaa cidlada dibadda ee waddada, isagoo heer la ah waddo socodka ama garabka meeshaas, dusha la soo jeediyay iyo muuqaalka 3D dhexdiisa. Jid waddo isgoysa waa la jeexjeexaa oo waxaa lagu muujiyaa laba qaybood, dhamaad ku sawiran ilaa laba jeer ballaca jidka oo ka gaaban waddada ayaa lagu sii wadaa cidlada. Qorshuhu wali wuxuu tusaa jidka sida aad u sawirtay, dhererka iyo ballaca gadaasheeda waxay tiraan khadka oo dhan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor\"\u003EWareeji kooridor waddo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"darbiyada\"\u003EDarbiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji dhinaca darbiga oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Darbi waa \u003Cstrong\u003Edhulka celiya\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ego&#039;an\u003C/strong\u003E. Haddii aan \u003Cstrong\u003ESare\u003C/strong\u003E la siin, waxay taagan tahay \u003Cstrong\u003EJoogteeda\u003C/strong\u003E dhulka sare ee dhererka oo dhan; sare ku qor si ay u sinaantahay. \u003Cstrong\u003EAasaaskeeda\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku jirtaa qoto dhulka hoostiisa, waxayna tallaabo tallaabo ugu dhacdaa tirooyin oo dhan, si ay u sinaantahay dhexdooda. Sifooyinku waxay siiyaan dhererkeeda, joogteeda, aagga wejiga iyo tallaabooyinka aasaaska; qorshuhu wuxuu calaamadiyaa sare iyo hoosta darbiga (TW / BW) labada dhamaadba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDarbi dhulka celiya oo ka sarreeya 1.2 m (4 ft) calaamad ayaa lagu saaraa: injineer ayaa naqshadeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kerbiyada\"\u003EKerbiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji dhinaca kerbiga oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; dejii ballaceeda iyo sare-kaceeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiidaha\"\u003EJiidaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji laga bilaabo hoose ilaa sare oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Heerarka waxay ka imanayaan dhulka labada dhamaad haddii aadan qorin. Jiid kasta waxa uu helaa sagxad-fadhi kasta 750 mm (2.5 ft) kor u kaca, waxaana lagu hubiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EUgu jiidh badan ee la ogol yahay\u003C/strong\u003E (1:12 bilowga) iyo ballac ugu yar; sifooyinku waxay sheegaan inta dheer ee uu u baahan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji geedka hore ee tallaabada hoose, ka dibna meesha tallaabooyinka sare gaarayaan, oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Tirada kor-tallaabooyinka waxay ka timaadaa joogta iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKor-tallaabada ugu weyn\u003C/strong\u003E; socodka waxaa laga helaa xeerka raaxada 2R + G ≈ 630 mm, weligiis kuma hoos jirto \u003Cstrong\u003ESocodka ugu yar\u003C/strong\u003E; sagxad-fadhi kasta \u003Cstrong\u003EKor-tallaabooyinka hal jeex ugu badnaan\u003C/strong\u003E. Sifooyinku waxay sheegaan inay ku habboonyihiin labada barood ama inta ay u baahan yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXadka jiidaha iyo tallaabooyinka waa qiyam caadi ah oo la calaamadeeyay. Dejii kuwa koodhka dhismahaaga u baahan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-baxsan-civilcraft\"\u003EKa baxsan CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax dheeraad ah › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi beerta IFC\u003C/span\u003E: sagxadaynta iyo jidadka sida \u003Ccode\u003EIfcPavement\u003C/code\u003E, darbiyada sida \u003Ccode\u003EIfcWall\u003C/code\u003E (darbiyada dhulka celiya sida RETAININGWALL) oo leh lakabyadooda, kerbiyada sida \u003Ccode\u003EIfcKerb\u003C/code\u003E, jiidaha sida \u003Ccode\u003EIfcRamp\u003C/code\u003E, tallaabooyinka sida \u003Ccode\u003EIfcStair\u003C/code\u003E oo leh kor-tallaabooyinkooda iyo sagxadahooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EU dir TakeoffCraft\u003C/strong\u003E jadwalka dhirta wuxuu qaadaa aagga sagxadaynta iyo mugga lakabyada, aagga iyo dhererka wejiga darbiyada, dhererka kerbiyada iyo tirada tallaabooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiga faahfaahinta wuxuu sawiraa qaybta darbi kasta, dhismaha sagxadaynta kasta iyo jeer kasta oo tallaabo ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-sheets\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-sheets\"\u003EXaashiyada beerta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Dhul adag mar kasta dib ayaa looga shaqeeyaa dhulka, sidaas darteed wuxuu raacaa dhulka wuuna dib u dhisaa marka dhulka ama khadkiisu isbedelo. Geedaha ku jira qorshaha jiid sida khad kasta. Ka fur Dhul adag kooxda Beerta. Sagxadaynta Guji geedaha oo riix Enter. Sifooyinka: Heerka: madhan = dhulka celceliska ah ee hoostiisa. Hoos-u-dhac: heer, jeexjeex dhinac (% u jeeda jihada) ama biyo-qaad: CivilCraft wuxuu kugu weydiinayaa inaad riixdo meesha biyo-qaadku yahay, markaas geed kasta wuxuu kor uga kacaa biyo-qaadka hoos-u-dhaca. Fallaadhadu qorshaha ayay tusaan hoos-u-dhacyada. Qaabka (grid, stretcher bond, herringbone) oo leh cabbirka unugga, isku-xidhka iyo xagga; Xadka ballacdiisa. Xaashi dhexdiisa, isku-xidhka ka yar hal millimitir waa la reebaa. Sagxadaynta waa qayb ka mid ah dusha la soo jeediyay. Lakabyadeeda (dhagaxyada sagxadda, jiifka, saldhiga) waxay galaan IFC iyo tirooyinka. Jidadka Guji dhinaca jidka oo riix Enter. Wuxuu raacaa dhulka, Jeexjeex dhinac wuxuu u jeedaa dhinaca midig. Jid ka jiidh badan Ugu jiidh badan ee la ogol yahay waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa ! qorshaha meesha uu joogo, sifooyinkuna waxay sheegaan inta uu u jiidh badan yahay. Meesha jidku la kulmo waddo ay kooridor dhisay, wuxuu ku joogsadaa cidlada dibadda ee waddada, isagoo heer la ah waddo socodka ama garabka meeshaas, dusha la soo jeediyay iyo muuqaalka 3D dhexdiisa. Jid waddo isgoysa waa la jeexjeexaa oo waxaa lagu muujiyaa laba qaybood, dhamaad ku sawiran ilaa laba jeer ballaca jidka oo ka gaaban waddada ayaa lagu sii wadaa cidlada. Qorshuhu wali wuxuu tusaa jidka sida aad u sawirtay, dhererka iyo ballaca gadaasheeda waxay tiraan khadka oo dhan. Eeg Wareeji kooridor waddo. Darbiyada Guji dhinaca darbiga oo riix Enter. Darbi waa dhulka celiya ama go'an. Haddii aan Sare la siin, waxay taagan tahay Joogteeda dhulka sare ee dhererka oo dhan; sare ku qor si ay u sinaantahay. Aasaaskeeda waxay ku jirtaa qoto dhulka hoostiisa, waxayna tallaabo tallaabo ugu dhacdaa tirooyin oo dhan, si ay u sinaantahay dhexdooda. Sifooyinku waxay siiyaan dhererkeeda, joogteeda, aagga wejiga iyo tallaabooyinka aasaaska; qorshuhu wuxuu calaamadiyaa sare iyo hoosta darbiga (TW / BW) labada dhamaadba. Darbi dhulka celiya oo ka sarreeya 1.2 m (4 ft) calaamad ayaa lagu saaraa: injineer ayaa naqshadeeya. Kerbiyada Guji dhinaca kerbiga oo riix Enter; dejii ballaceeda iyo sare-kaceeda. Jiidaha Guji laga bilaabo hoose ilaa sare oo riix Enter. Heerarka waxay ka imanayaan dhulka labada dhamaad haddii aadan qorin. Jiid kasta waxa uu helaa sagxad-fadhi kasta 750 mm (2.5 ft) kor u kaca, waxaana lagu hubiyaa Ugu jiidh badan ee la ogol yahay (1:12 bilowga) iyo ballac ugu yar; sifooyinku waxay sheegaan inta dheer ee uu u baahan yahay. Tallaabooyinka Guji geedka hore ee tallaabada hoose, ka dibna meesha tallaabooyinka sare gaarayaan, oo riix Enter. Tirada kor-tallaabooyinka waxay ka timaadaa joogta iyo Kor-tallaabada ugu weyn; socodka waxaa laga helaa xeerka raaxada 2R + G ≈ 630 mm, weligiis kuma hoos jirto Socodka ugu yar; sagxad-fadhi kasta Kor-tallaabooyinka hal jeex ugu badnaan. Sifooyinku waxay sheegaan inay ku habboonyihiin labada barood ama inta ay u baahan yihiin. Xadka jiidaha iyo tallaabooyinka waa qiyam caadi ah oo la calaamadeeyay. Dejii kuwa koodhka dhismahaaga u baahan yahay. Ka baxsan CivilCraft Wax dheeraad ah › Dhoofi beerta IFC: sagxadaynta iyo jidadka sida IfcPavement, darbiyada sida IfcWall (darbiyada dhulka celiya sida RETAININGWALL) oo leh lakabyadooda, kerbiyada sida IfcKerb, jiidaha sida IfcRamp, tallaabooyinka sida IfcStair oo leh kor-tallaabooyinkooda iyo sagxadahooda. U dir TakeoffCraft jadwalka dhirta wuxuu qaadaa aagga sagxadaynta iyo mugga lakabyada, aagga iyo dhererka wejiga darbiyada, dhererka kerbiyada iyo tirada tallaabooyinka. Xaashiga faahfaahinta wuxuu sawiraa qaybta darbi kasta, dhismaha sagxadaynta kasta iyo jeer kasta oo tallaabo ah. Eeg Xaashiyada beerta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"irrigation","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Naqshadda biyo-qulqulka","summary":"Qalab xisaabin, maaha naqshad la sahansay: madaxyada, tuubooyinka dhinaca, tuubada weyn, faalfoyada iyo xariiqyada dhibicda goobta; aagagga oo laga helay tuubooyinka; lumista cadaadiska ee Hazen–Williams, madaxa ugu xun, socodka iyo cadaadiska ee la barbardhigo bixinta, xawaaraha saridda, heerka roobka, waqtiyada socodka, dabool iyo liiska alaabta.","section":"tasks","order":155,"keywords":["biyo-qulqulka","sprinkler","sprinklers","spray","rotor","nozzle wareega","bubbler","dhibic","dripline","emitter","faalfo","aag","saldhig","kontarool","tuubada weyn","tuubada dhinaca","barta xiriirka","bixinta biyaha","cadaadis","psi","kpa","socod","gpm","lumis xoog","Hazen–Williams","heerka roobka","waqtiga socodka","dabool","madax ilaa madax","liiska alaabta"],"headings":[{"id":"habee-nidaamka","text":"Habee nidaamka","level":2},{"id":"dhibicda","text":"Dhibicda","level":2},{"id":"hubinta","text":"Hubinta","level":2},{"id":"dabool","text":"Dabool","level":2},{"id":"madaxyada","text":"Madaxyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa qalab xisaabin, maaha naqshad la sahansay: naqshadeeyaha biyo-qulqulka wuxuu hubiyaa natiijo kasta ka hor inta aan wax la dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habee-nidaamka\"\u003EHabee nidaamka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca bidix, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMadaxa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQaansada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo meesha uu qaanso ka bilaabmo, iyo cabbirrada tuubooyinka dhinacyada iyo tuubada weyn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarta xiriirka\u003C/span\u003E: riix meesha bixinta biyuhu ku biiraan. Deji \u003Cstrong\u003Ecadaadiskiisa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esocodka la heli karo\u003C/strong\u003E iyo lumista mitirka iyo dib-u-socodka ee Sifooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaalfo\u003C/span\u003E: riix meesha faalfo kasta aagiisa uu galo. Faalfo wuxuu bilaabaa aag.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMadax\u003C/span\u003E: riix si aad madaxyada u dhigto; riix kasta wuxuu dhigaa mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubada dhinaca\u003C/span\u003E: riix faalfo ka bilaabo oo madaxyadiisa maro, ka dibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubada weyn\u003C/span\u003E: barta xiriirka ilaa faalfo kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhamaadyada tuubooyinka waxay ku dhegaan madaxyada, faalfoyada, bixinta iyo dhamaadyada kale ee tuubooyinka, sidaas darteed shabakaddu way isku xirmaysaa. Aag waa wax kasta oo laga gaaro faalfadiisa dhinacyada dhexdooda; tuubada weyn waxay qaadaa hal aag mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibicda\"\u003EDhibicda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiqda dhibicda\u003C/span\u003E: riix dhinaca xariiqda, adigoo ka bilaabanaya meesha uu ka quudanayo (dhamaadka dhinaca ama faalfo). Deji \u003Cstrong\u003Esocodka emitter-ka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Emasaafada\u003C/strong\u003E Sifooyinka; socodkiisu waa emitter-yada ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta\"\u003EHubinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi nidaamka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa aag kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiir\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESidee loo xisaabiyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocod\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodyada madaxyada (iyo kuwa xariiqyada dhibicda) oo la isku geeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaalfada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadaadiska shaqada ee madaxa ugu xun oo ku daraysan lumista tuubooyinka ilaa halkaas (Hazen–Williams, dhexroorka gudaha tuubada, isbeddelka sare-geedka) iyo lumista faalfada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBixinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla oo ku daraysan lumista tuubada weyn ee qaadaysa aagaas, iyo lumista mitirka iyo dib-u-socodka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERoobka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodka madaxyada oo ku qaybsan aagga ay biyo siiyaan masaafada madax-ilaa-madax\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaqiiqado toddobaadkiiba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESi loo codsado dejinta \u003Cstrong\u003EBiyo toddobaadkiiba\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXawaaraha oo ka sarreeya xadka, madax ka baxsan xadka cadaadiskiisa, sprays iyo rotors hal faalfo, cadaadis ama socod aan ku filnayn bixinta, madaxyo aan aag lahayn, wareegyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro faalfo si aad u aragto tirooyinka aagiisa iyo madaxa ugu xun oo ay goobaha ku hareereeyso qorshaha. Liiska alaabta wuxuu tiriyaa madaxyada noocooda iyo qaansadooda, tuubooyinka cabbirkooda, faalfooyinka, xariiqa dhibicda iyo emitter-yada, iyo saldhigyada kontarool-ka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida CSV\u003C/span\u003E labadaba wuu kaydiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qaybta Biyo-qulqulka: \u003Cstrong\u003EHazen–Williams C\u003C/strong\u003E (150 tuubo plastik cusub), \u003Cstrong\u003Esocodka ugu dhakhsaha badan\u003C/strong\u003E ee tuubada (1.5 m/s), \u003Cstrong\u003Elumista faalfada\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ebiyo toddobaadkiiba\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa caadiyaan la calaamadeeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dabool\"\u003EDabool\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dabool\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa inta aagga ah ee madaxyadu ka tagaan engegan, inta labo ama ka badan madax biyo siiyaan, iyo madaxyada aan gaarin deriskooda (masaafada madax-ilaa-madax).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"madaxyada\"\u003EMadaxyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMadaxyada la liistay waa noocyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eguud\u003C/strong\u003E oo ay CadCraft qortay iyadoo laga soo qaadayo heerarka roobka ee naqshadda (sprays-ka go&#039;an, nozzle-ka wareega, rotor-ka giraanta, bubbler-ka, micro-spray-ka, emitter-ka), oo aan ahayn alaabta wax soo saarayaal kasta. \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar madaxyo fayl ka…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa madaxyadaada (liis JSON ah oo leh ballaca tuurista, socodka ama heerka roobka iyo kala duwanaanshaha cadaadiska madax kasta); waa la kaydiyaa mashruuca. Xogta la daabacay ee wax soo saaraha waxaa lagu geliyaa kaliya marka uu wax soo saaruhu ogolaado oo ogolaansho la diiwaan geliyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta madaxyada guud liiska wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003Emadaxyo caadi ah\u003C/strong\u003E (magacyadooda waxaa ku dhamaada &quot;qiyamka caadiga ah&quot;): cabbirrada nozzle-ka ee sprays-ka go&#039;an, nozzle-ka wareega iyo rotor-ka giraanta, micro-spray-ka, bubbler-ka iyo emitter-ka, oo leh radius, socod iyo kala duwanaansho cadaadis. Waxaa CadCraft ku xisaabiyaa xisaabta la daabacay (isla&#039;egta orifice-ka socodka, miisaanka tuurista jet-ka ee radius-ka) iyo fasalada socodka magacaaban, oo keliya ilaha furan; ma koobiyeyno miis wax soo saare kasta. Dooro mid oo doorasho muujinaysa aasaaskiisa iyo liisanka. Mashruuc isticmaala mid wuxuu ku hayaa madaxa iyo ilihiisa faylka mashruuca. Waxay u yihiin qorshaynta; ka hor inta aan la dhisin xogta madaxa dhabta ah hubi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tani waa qalab xisaabin, maaha naqshad la sahansay: naqshadeeyaha biyo-qulqulka wuxuu hubiyaa natiijo kasta ka hor inta aan wax la dhisin. Habee nidaamka Qaybta Biyo-qulqulka dhinaca bidix, dooro Madaxa, Qaansada iyo meesha uu qaanso ka bilaabmo, iyo cabbirrada tuubooyinka dhinacyada iyo tuubada weyn. Biyo-qulqulka › Barta xiriirka: riix meesha bixinta biyuhu ku biiraan. Deji cadaadiskiisa, socodka la heli karo iyo lumista mitirka iyo dib-u-socodka ee Sifooyinka. Biyo-qulqulka › Faalfo: riix meesha faalfo kasta aagiisa uu galo. Faalfo wuxuu bilaabaa aag. Biyo-qulqulka › Madax: riix si aad madaxyada u dhigto; riix kasta wuxuu dhigaa mid. Biyo-qulqulka › Tuubada dhinaca: riix faalfo ka bilaabo oo madaxyadiisa maro, ka dibna riix Enter. Tuubada weyn: barta xiriirka ilaa faalfo kasta. Dhamaadyada tuubooyinka waxay ku dhegaan madaxyada, faalfoyada, bixinta iyo dhamaadyada kale ee tuubooyinka, sidaas darteed shabakaddu way isku xirmaysaa. Aag waa wax kasta oo laga gaaro faalfadiisa dhinacyada dhexdooda; tuubada weyn waxay qaadaa hal aag mar. Dhibicda Biyo-qulqulka › Xariiqda dhibicda: riix dhinaca xariiqda, adigoo ka bilaabanaya meesha uu ka quudanayo (dhamaadka dhinaca ama faalfo). Deji socodka emitter-ka iyo masaafada Sifooyinka; socodkiisu waa emitter-yada ku jira. Hubinta Biyo-qulqulka › Hubi nidaamka… wuxuu liistaa aag kasta: Tiir Sidee loo xisaabiyaa Socod Socodyada madaxyada (iyo kuwa xariiqyada dhibicda) oo la isku geeyay Faalfada Cadaadiska shaqada ee madaxa ugu xun oo ku daraysan lumista tuubooyinka ilaa halkaas (Hazen–Williams, dhexroorka gudaha tuubada, isbeddelka sare-geedka) iyo lumista faalfada Bixinta Isla oo ku daraysan lumista tuubada weyn ee qaadaysa aagaas, iyo lumista mitirka iyo dib-u-socodka Roobka Socodka madaxyada oo ku qaybsan aagga ay biyo siiyaan masaafada madax-ilaa-madax Daqiiqado toddobaadkiiba Si loo codsado dejinta Biyo toddobaadkiiba Dhibaatooyin Xawaaraha oo ka sarreeya xadka, madax ka baxsan xadka cadaadiskiisa, sprays iyo rotors hal faalfo, cadaadis ama socod aan ku filnayn bixinta, madaxyo aan aag lahayn, wareegyo Dooro faalfo si aad u aragto tirooyinka aagiisa iyo madaxa ugu xun oo ay goobaha ku hareereeyso qorshaha. Liiska alaabta wuxuu tiriyaa madaxyada noocooda iyo qaansadooda, tuubooyinka cabbirkooda, faalfooyinka, xariiqa dhibicda iyo emitter-yada, iyo saldhigyada kontarool-ka. Kaydi sida CSV labadaba wuu kaydiyaa. Dejinta qaybta Biyo-qulqulka: Hazen–Williams C (150 tuubo plastik cusub), socodka ugu dhakhsaha badan ee tuubada (1.5 m/s), lumista faalfada, iyo biyo toddobaadkiiba. Waa caadiyaan la calaamadeeyay. Dabool Biyo-qulqulka › Muuji dabool wuxuu sheegayaa inta aagga ah ee madaxyadu ka tagaan engegan, inta labo ama ka badan madax biyo siiyaan, iyo madaxyada aan gaarin deriskooda (masaafada madax-ilaa-madax). Madaxyada Madaxyada la liistay waa noocyo guud oo ay CadCraft qortay iyadoo laga soo qaadayo heerarka roobka ee naqshadda (sprays-ka go'an, nozzle-ka wareega, rotor-ka giraanta, bubbler-ka, micro-spray-ka, emitter-ka), oo aan ahayn alaabta wax soo saarayaal kasta. Ku dar madaxyo fayl ka… wuxuu akhrinayaa madaxyadaada (liis JSON ah oo leh ballaca tuurista, socodka ama heerka roobka iyo kala duwanaanshaha cadaadiska madax kasta); waa la kaydiyaa mashruuca. Xogta la daabacay ee wax soo saaraha waxaa lagu geliyaa kaliya marka uu wax soo saaruhu ogolaado oo ogolaansho la diiwaan geliyay. Hoosta madaxyada guud liiska wuxuu leeyahay madaxyo caadi ah (magacyadooda waxaa ku dhamaada \"qiyamka caadiga ah\"): cabbirrada nozzle-ka ee sprays-ka go'an, nozzle-ka wareega iyo rotor-ka giraanta, micro-spray-ka, bubbler-ka iyo emitter-ka, oo leh radius, socod iyo kala duwanaansho cadaadis. Waxaa CadCraft ku xisaabiyaa xisaabta la daabacay (isla'egta orifice-ka socodka, miisaanka tuurista jet-ka ee radius-ka) iyo fasalada socodka magacaaban, oo keliya ilaha furan; ma koobiyeyno miis wax soo saare kasta. Dooro mid oo doorasho muujinaysa aasaaskiisa iyo liisanka. Mashruuc isticmaala mid wuxuu ku hayaa madaxa iyo ilihiisa faylka mashruuca. Waxay u yihiin qorshaynta; ka hor inta aan la dhisin xogta madaxa dhabta ah hubi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"landscape-sheets","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xaashiyada beerta","summary":"Qorshayaasha beerdhigga, sare-u-qaadista iyo biyo-qulqulka oo leh sharraxaadahooda, iyo xaashi faahfaahin ah oo darbiyada, dahaadhka dhagax-dhigista iyo tallaabooyinka, oo ah hal PDF laga sameeyay xaashiyada CivilCraft laftiisa.","section":"tasks","order":156,"keywords":["xaashiyada beerta","qorshaha beerdhigga","qorshaha sare-u-qaadista","qorshaha biyo-qulqulka","sharraxaad","jadwalka geedaha","faahfaahin","qayb darbi","faahfaahinta dhagax-dhigista","tallaabooyin","pdf","daabac","kooxda naqshadda"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBeerta › Wax dheeraad ah › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandscape sheets…\u003C/span\u003E waxay samaysaa hal PDF oo leh xaashiyada aad calaamadiso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXaashi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESharraxaad\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha beerdhigga\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeedaha, beeraha, xaraha iyo dhagax-dhigista dusha dhulka ku dul-taal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJadwalka geedaha oo leh calaamad kasta, magacyada botaanikada iyo caadiga ah, weelka iyo tirada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha sare-u-qaadista\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKonturrada, heerarka meel-gaar, astaamaha sare-u-qaadista, meelaha ku dhow, fallaadaha socodka iyo balliyada, heerarka dhagax-dhigista\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa calaamad kasta macneeyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha biyo-qulqulka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadasha leh calaamadooda nooca iyo qowsiga, tuubooyinka sida cabbirka, valvo-yada, isha bixinta, oo ku dul-taal dhagax-dhigista iyo khadadka beerta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadasha sida nooca iyo qowsiga, tuubada sida cabbirka, valvo-yada, socodka iyo cadaadiska aag kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaahfaahinta\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb darbi kasta meesha ugu sarreysa (dhulka, aasaaska, darbiga, koping-ka, lakabka biyo-ka-saarka), dahaadhka dhagax-dhigis kasta, dabaqa tallaabooyin kasta muuqaal ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaahfaahin kasta waxay magacaabaa miisaankeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003Ewarqadda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Emiisaanka\u003C/strong\u003E (kan ku habboon ayaa adiga laguu doortaa) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Emidabka\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Emadow oo keliya\u003C/strong\u003E. Qorshe kasta waa qorshaha goobta oo leh lakabyada shaqooyinka kale laga reebay, si wixii aad shaashadda ku aragto ay u daabacmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESare-u-qaadista waddooyinka iyo khadadka waxaa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sections\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sections\"\u003EQaybaha\u003C/a\u003E; qorshaha xaashi ee goobta oo dhan waa Fayl › PDF.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Beerta › Wax dheeraad ah › Landscape sheets… waxay samaysaa hal PDF oo leh xaashiyada aad calaamadiso: Xaashi Waxa ku jira Sharraxaad Qorshaha beerdhigga Geedaha, beeraha, xaraha iyo dhagax-dhigista dusha dhulka ku dul-taal Jadwalka geedaha oo leh calaamad kasta, magacyada botaanikada iyo caadiga ah, weelka iyo tirada Qorshaha sare-u-qaadista Konturrada, heerarka meel-gaar, astaamaha sare-u-qaadista, meelaha ku dhow, fallaadaha socodka iyo balliyada, heerarka dhagax-dhigista Waxa calaamad kasta macneeyo Qorshaha biyo-qulqulka Madasha leh calaamadooda nooca iyo qowsiga, tuubooyinka sida cabbirka, valvo-yada, isha bixinta, oo ku dul-taal dhagax-dhigista iyo khadadka beerta Madasha sida nooca iyo qowsiga, tuubada sida cabbirka, valvo-yada, socodka iyo cadaadiska aag kasta Faahfaahinta Qayb darbi kasta meesha ugu sarreysa (dhulka, aasaaska, darbiga, koping-ka, lakabka biyo-ka-saarka), dahaadhka dhagax-dhigis kasta, dabaqa tallaabooyin kasta muuqaal ahaan Faahfaahin kasta waxay magacaabaa miisaankeeda Dooro warqadda, miisaanka (kan ku habboon ayaa adiga laguu doortaa) iyo midabka ama madow oo keliya. Qorshe kasta waa qorshaha goobta oo leh lakabyada shaqooyinka kale laga reebay, si wixii aad shaashadda ku aragto ay u daabacmaan. Sare-u-qaadista waddooyinka iyo khadadka waxaa ku jira Qaybaha; qorshaha xaashi ee goobta oo dhan waa Fayl › PDF.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"freeform-objects","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Shayada xor ah","summary":"Keen qaab laga sameeyay app kale (STL, OBJ ama shay maktabad) dhulka; wuxuu fadhiyaa dhulka dushiisa ama wuxuu gooyaa dhulka gudihiisa, mugga, bannaanka iyo meesha uu ku qabsado waa la tiriyaa sida kuwa kale.","section":"tasks","order":157,"keywords":["xor-ah","shay gaar ah","farshaxan","beer-dhir","fadhi","mesh","stl","obj","shay maktabad","dhulka ogaanaya","raac dhulka","gal dhulka","tiro","mugga","ifc"],"headings":[{"id":"saldhigiisa","text":"Saldhigiisa","level":2},{"id":"waa-la-tiriyaa","text":"Waa la tiriyaa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHal mar ah oo gaar ah (beer-dhir, derbi fadhi, farshaxan, buur ciyaar) waxa lagu sameyn karaa ModelCraft ama PartCraft, lagana dhigi karaa halkan si ay ugu jirto isla moodelka iyo jadwalka wax kasta oo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhul-qurxin › Wax dheeraad ah › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFreeform object…\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro fayl \u003Cstrong\u003ESTL\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ\u003C/strong\u003E (unugyada mashruuca ku jira: fiit mashruuc fiit ah, mitir mashruuc mitir ah) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Eshay maktabad\u003C/strong\u003E CadCraft (\u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E) oo leh jirka mesh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha ay tagayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saldhigiisa\"\u003ESaldhigiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaaca dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E: dhererkiisa ugu hooseeya wuxuu fadhiyaa dhulka ugu hooseeya ee ku hoos jira qorkiisa, sidaas darteed waxba ma ka dhaco. Sifooyinka waxay qiyaasaan inta hoos u dhacda dhulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGooya dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E: saldhigiisa dhererka waa lagu dejiyaa, dhulka qorkiisa gudihiisana waa la jiidaa jiifka iftiinka, waana la tiriyaa Dhulka-sare sida dhul saaran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu leff \u003Cstrong\u003ELeffsan\u003C/strong\u003E, dhaqaaqi qorshaha si aad u guurto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-la-tiriyaa\"\u003EWaa la tiriyaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESifooyinka waxa ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003Emugga\u003C/strong\u003E (jirka xidhan), \u003Cstrong\u003Ebannaanka dusha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eqorka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Edhererka\u003C/strong\u003E, oo la cabbiray mesh-ka. Dhoofinta IFC waxay ku qortaa \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca IFC\u003C/strong\u003E aad doorato iyo tirooyinkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQorka waa qolofta ugu weyn ee qaabka: qaab aan toos ahayn (beer-dhir L-qaab ah) waxa loo jiidaa sida la buuxiyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Hal mar ah oo gaar ah (beer-dhir, derbi fadhi, farshaxan, buur ciyaar) waxa lagu sameyn karaa ModelCraft ama PartCraft, lagana dhigi karaa halkan si ay ugu jirto isla moodelka iyo jadwalka wax kasta oo kale. Dhul-qurxin › Wax dheeraad ah › Freeform object… oo dooro fayl STL ama OBJ (unugyada mashruuca ku jira: fiit mashruuc fiit ah, mitir mashruuc mitir ah) ama shay maktabad CadCraft (.json) oo leh jirka mesh. Guji meesha ay tagayso. Saldhigiisa Raaca dhulka: dhererkiisa ugu hooseeya wuxuu fadhiyaa dhulka ugu hooseeya ee ku hoos jira qorkiisa, sidaas darteed waxba ma ka dhaco. Sifooyinka waxay qiyaasaan inta hoos u dhacda dhulka. Gooya dhulka: saldhigiisa dhererka waa lagu dejiyaa, dhulka qorkiisa gudihiisana waa la jiidaa jiifka iftiinka, waana la tiriyaa Dhulka-sare sida dhul saaran. Ku leff Leffsan, dhaqaaqi qorshaha si aad u guurto. Waa la tiriyaa Sifooyinka waxa ku jira mugga (jirka xidhan), bannaanka dusha, qorka iyo dhererka, oo la cabbiray mesh-ka. Dhoofinta IFC waxay ku qortaa Nooca IFC aad doorato iyo tirooyinkaas. Qorka waa qolofta ugu weyn ee qaabka: qaab aan toos ahayn (beer-dhir L-qaab ah) waxa loo jiidaa sida la buuxiyay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"landscape-walkthrough","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Beer naqshadee, bilow ilaa dhammaad","summary":"Tallaabooyinka tobanka ah ee naqshadeeyaha beerta, ka bilaabma sahanka ilaa kooxda la daabacay, iyo waxa shaqada beerta u samayso tallaabo kasta hadda iyo waxa aanay weli sameynin.","section":"tasks","order":158,"keywords":["casharka","tilmaamo","sida loo sameeyo","naqshadda beerta","naqshadda beerta","tusaale","tallaabo tallaabo","sahan","khadad","dhulka","beerdhigga","jadwal","xaashiyo","daabac","hal mashruuc"],"headings":[{"id":"1-soo-geli-sahanka","text":"1. Soo geli sahanka","level":2},{"id":"2-sawirro-gacmeed","text":"2. Sawirro gacmeed","level":2},{"id":"3-sawir-oo-u-beddel-khadad","text":"3. Sawir oo u beddel khadad","level":2},{"id":"4-dhulka-la-soo-jeediyay","text":"4. Dhulka la soo jeediyay","level":2},{"id":"5-dhagax-dhigis-iyo-aagagga-beerta","text":"5. Dhagax-dhigis iyo aagagga beerta","level":2},{"id":"6-heerarka-janjeeraha-iyo-isku-xidhka","text":"6. Heerarka, janjeeraha iyo isku-xidhka","level":2},{"id":"7-beerdhigga","text":"7. Beerdhigga","level":2},{"id":"8-tirooyinka-iyo-jadwallada","text":"8. Tirooyinka iyo jadwallada","level":2},{"id":"9-naqshadaha-iyo-xaashiyada","text":"9. Naqshadaha iyo xaashiyada","level":2},{"id":"10-daabac","text":"10. Daabac","level":2},{"id":"beddel-hal-shay-jid-tallaabooyinka","text":"Beddel hal shay: jid-tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadda beerta way wareegtaa: sahan, sawir, khadad, dhul, aagag, heerar, beerdhig, jadwallo, xaashiyo, kadibna mar kale. Kuwani waa tobanka tallaabo, iyo waxa loo helo tallaabo kasta. Meel tallaabo ka mid ah ay ku liidato, waa la magacaabaa \u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/strong\u003E dhamaadka, ma aha in lagu qariyo tallaabada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaad raaci kartaa goobta tusaalaha ah, ama sahankaaga naqshadda. Haddii aad leedahay sahankaaga, ka bilow tallaabada 1.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"1-soo-geli-sahanka\"\u003E1. Soo geli sahanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurface\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinework from a drawing…\u003C/span\u003E, dooro naqshadda sahanka (DWG 2000–2018 ama DXF). Hubi unit-yada, qaado konturrada, khadadka 3D ee polilaynka iyo xuduudka dusha, iyo bloogyada barooyinka sida barooyinka sahanka. Qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka sahanka iyo hubinta\u003C/strong\u003E waxay akhrisaa heerarka qoraal ama sifo ahaan qoran oo liistaa waxa ay u eg tahay khaldan (unit-yada, nidaamka isku-xirka, masaafada ka soo laga bilaabo eber, konturro siman, heerar aan caadi ahayn, barooyin laba-jibbaaran) ka hor intaadan wax ku darin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/survey-check\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/survey-check\"\u003EHubinta naqshadda sahanka markii la soo gelinayo\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/open-dwg-dxf\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/open-dwg-dxf\"\u003EFur DWG ama DXF sida khadad\u003C/a\u003E. Dejinta nidaamka isku-xirka waxaa lagu sameeyaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECoordinate system…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"2-sawirro-gacmeed\"\u003E2. Sawirro gacmeed\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashi ku qoran warqad, sida sahan hore ama daabac calaamad ku qoran, waxaa lagu soo gelinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScan…\u003C/span\u003E (Bilow sawir skaan ah): waxaa loo dhigaa cabbir ama isku-xirka la yaqaan qorshaha hoosteeda, waxaana laga raad-raacin karaa khadad. ModelCraft wuxuu akhrin karaa sawir sawir gacmeed (Fayl › Soo geli sawir gacmeed…). CivilCraft laftiisa ma leh qalab sawir gacmeed: dhig xaashiga qorshaha hoosteeda oo ku sawir isagoo ku dul-taal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3-sawir-oo-u-beddel-khadad\"\u003E3. Sawir oo u beddel khadad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu sawir khadadka muuqaalka iyo khadadka dhulka sahanka dushiisa CivilCraft, ama ku sawir naqshadda 2D. Beerta › Wax dheeraad ah › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a line\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xariiq u beddelaa dahaadh dhagax-dhigis, geed-goob, darbi, tallaabooyin, khad muuqaal iyo wax kale, oo xidhan: xariiqda dhaqaajiso, shayga ayuu raaci doonaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/objects-from-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/objects-from-lines\"\u003EShayada khadadka laga sameeyay\u003C/a\u003E. SuperCad Studio gudihiis, furo goobta, naqshadda iyo moodeelka dhismaha hal mashruuc: shaqada \u003Cstrong\u003EBeerta\u003C/strong\u003E waxay leedahay qalabka dhammaantood, xariiq la doortay naqshadda 2D ayaa noqon kara shay beerta oo raacaya (Ctrl+K, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandscape object from the picked drawing line\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"4-dhulka-la-soo-jeediyay\"\u003E4. Dhulka la soo jeediyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurface\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandscape workspace\u003C/span\u003E. Dhulka la soo jeediyay ku dhis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlatform\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBerm\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwale\u003C/span\u003E iyo aagagga sare-u-qaadista oo leh heerar meel-gaar iyo konturro; dhagax-dhigista, waddooyinka, darbiyada, jid-dhaafyada iyo tallaabooyinka aad ku darto waxay ku dhex dhacaan dusha la soo jeediyay ee isku mid ah. Dhulka jira weligiisba ma bedelmo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevels\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGround modifiers…\u003C/span\u003E waxay liistaa wax kasta oo qaabeeya dhulka hal amar, oo leh jarista iyo buuxinta mid kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-grading\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-grading\"\u003ESare-u-qaadista\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ground-modifiers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ground-modifiers\"\u003EWax-beddelayaasha dhulka iyo heerarka toosan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"5-dhagax-dhigis-iyo-aagagga-beerta\"\u003E5. Dhagax-dhigis iyo aagagga beerta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHardscape\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaving\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWall\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKerb\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERamp\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESteps\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAreas\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa beer cawska ah, beer geedaha, daaq ama dhul-daboolka leh dahaadhkiisa; wuxuu iska jarayaa hareeraha dhagax-dhigista, darbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBed\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa aag masaafada geedaha, oo ka samaysan isku-darka geedaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/hardscape\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/hardscape\"\u003EDhagax-dhigis\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/planted-areas\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/planted-areas\"\u003EAagagga beerta\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/planting\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/planting\"\u003EBeerdhigga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"6-heerarka-janjeeraha-iyo-isku-xidhka\"\u003E6. Heerarka, janjeeraha iyo isku-xidhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EHubinta sare-u-qaadista\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EFalanqaynta janjeerka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EFallaadaha socodka iyo biyo-ururka\u003C/strong\u003E. Haddii biyo uga soo ururaan teras, ku dar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwale\u003C/span\u003E wareegteeda. Sifooyinku waxay kuu sheegaan tirada kor-u-kaca tallaabooyinka u baahan yihiin iyo haddii ay ku habboonaadaan, iyo meesha waddadu ka janjeersan tahay xadkeeda. Panelka Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu liistaa meelaha shayada ay si xun isugu kulmaan: darbi ka sarreeya, beer ka sarreeya dhagax-dhigista, tallaabooyin ka maqan dhagaxa-fadhiga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpot level\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGradient arrow\u003C/span\u003E waxay calaamadiyaan dhulka oo iskood u cusboonaadaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"7-beerdhigga\"\u003E7. Beerdhigga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu \u003Cstrong\u003EGeedaha\u003C/strong\u003E, raadi liiska geedaha (dhowr boqol nooc, ama liistaadaada), dooro mid, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBed\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHedge\u003C/span\u003E. Dejiso cabbirka geedka iyo calaamadaha Wax dheeraad ahaan. Wax dheeraad › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant table\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wax ka beddelaa diiwaanadaada: noocyada, cabbirrada la bixiyo, cufnaanta, qoraallada shuruudaha. Diiwaan kasta wuxuu qaadan karaa calaamaddiisa iyo moodeelkiisa 3D (OBJ, STL ama GLB), iyo wax dheeraad › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant graphics\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geedaha ka sawiraa si fudud cabbirrada hoosaadka ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plant-list\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plant-list\"\u003ELiiska geedaha\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plant-records\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plant-records\"\u003EDiiwaanada geedaha\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plant-graphics\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plant-graphics\"\u003ESawirrada geedaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"8-tirooyinka-iyo-jadwallada\"\u003E8. Tirooyinka iyo jadwallada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax dheeraad › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorksheets\u003C/span\u003E: jadwallada geedaha iyo dhagax-dhigista, iyo kuwa aad lahaato, waxay ku xiran yihiin shayada; waxaad u kaydin kartaa CSV ama XLSX ama waxaad ku dhigi kartaa xaashiyada (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/worksheets\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/worksheets\"\u003EXaashiyada shaqada\u003C/a\u003E). Wax dheeraad › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant schedule…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tirooyinka u diraa TakeoffCraft. Tirooyinka dhagax-dhigista waxay ku jiraan Sifooyinka dahaadhka, darbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka. Biyo-qulqulku wuxuu leeyahay liiskiisa alaabta: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIrrigation\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EHubi nidaamka…\u003C/strong\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/irrigation\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/irrigation\"\u003EBiyo-qulqulka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"9-naqshadaha-iyo-xaashiyada\"\u003E9. Naqshadaha iyo xaashiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax dheeraad › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandscape sheets…\u003C/span\u003E: qorshayaasha beerdhigga, sare-u-qaadista iyo biyo-qulqulka, oo leh faahfaahin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevels\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection line\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa qaybaha dhulka, darbiyada, dahaadhka, tallaabooyinka iyo geedaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-sheets\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-sheets\"\u003EXaashiyada beerta\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-sections\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-sections\"\u003EQaybaha iyo kooxda daabacaadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"10-daabac\"\u003E10. Daabac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPublish set (.zip)\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda xaashiyada ayaa samaysa hal PDF oo leh liiska xaashiyada iyo DWG xaashi kasta. Wax dheeraad › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport landscape IFC\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu BimCraft siinayaa geedaha iyo dhagax-dhigista. Kaydi mashruuca: wax kasta waxay ku jiraan hal fayl.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-hal-shay-jid-tallaabooyinka\"\u003EBeddel hal shay: jid-tallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESababta aad wax kasta ugu hayso hal mashruuc waa in isbeddel kasta uu gaadho meel kasta. Isku day tan jid tallaabooyin oo u dhexeeya laba teras:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqda jidka sawir sida khad muuqaal (ama xariiq naqshadda ku jira), kadibna Beerta › Wax dheeraad › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom a line\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESteps\u003C/span\u003E. Sifooyinka tallaabooyinka ku calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeeya dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E, oo deji heerarka hoose iyo sare ee laba terasyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sawir beer geed ah oo ku dhow oo hoos u jidka tallaabooyinka ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAreas\u003C/span\u003E wax ku, iyo dhagax-dhigis terasyada korkooda. Beerta waxay iska jari doontaa tallaabooyinka iyo dhagax-dhigista, jadwalka geedaha wuxuu tiriyaa oo kaliya waxa la beertay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKor u qaad heerka sare ee jidka Sifooyinka. Dhulka la soo jeediyay, heerarka meel-gaar, fallaadaha janjeerka iyo jarista iyo buuxinta ayaa isla markiiba isbeddelaya. Haddii jidku aanu mar dambe ku kulmin teraska sare, Panelka Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay ka tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaaji xariiqda jidka. Tallaabooyinku waxay raacaan xariiqooda isla tallaabada ka noqoshada; beerta mar kale way iska jarta oo dib ayaa loo tiraa, xaashiyada iyo jadwallada waxay muujinayaan tirooyinka cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix Ctrl+Z hal mar: xariiqda, tallaabooyinka, dhulka iyo beerta ayaa isla mar dib u noqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ground-modifiers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ground-modifiers\"\u003EWax-beddelayaasha dhulka iyo heerarka toosan\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/planted-areas\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/planted-areas\"\u003EAagagga beerta\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/worksheets\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/worksheets\"\u003EXaashiyada shaqada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa la weydiiyay, laakiin ma ku jiraan dhismahan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDarbiyo qaabeeya dhulka (waxay sheegaan meesha ay ku kulmaan, oo saxankooda ayay raaci karaan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETafatirka liiskaaga maktabadda geedaha ee app-ka gudihiisa (wax ka beddel liiska mashruuca oo kaydi sida faylka geedaha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeexturada iyo midabka moodelada GLB ee geedahaaga (qaabka ayaa la akhriyaa; midabka geedka ayaa la isticmaalaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape\"\u003EShaqada beerta\u003C/a\u003E si aad u aragto qalab kasta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Naqshadda beerta way wareegtaa: sahan, sawir, khadad, dhul, aagag, heerar, beerdhig, jadwallo, xaashiyo, kadibna mar kale. Kuwani waa tobanka tallaabo, iyo waxa loo helo tallaabo kasta. Meel tallaabo ka mid ah ay ku liidato, waa la magacaabaa Weli lama dhisin dhamaadka, ma aha in lagu qariyo tallaabada. Waad raaci kartaa goobta tusaalaha ah, ama sahankaaga naqshadda. Haddii aad leedahay sahankaaga, ka bilow tallaabada 1. 1. Soo geli sahanka Surface › Linework from a drawing…, dooro naqshadda sahanka (DWG 2000–2018 ama DXF). Hubi unit-yada, qaado konturrada, khadadka 3D ee polilaynka iyo xuduudka dusha, iyo bloogyada barooyinka sida barooyinka sahanka. Qaybta Heerarka sahanka iyo hubinta waxay akhrisaa heerarka qoraal ama sifo ahaan qoran oo liistaa waxa ay u eg tahay khaldan (unit-yada, nidaamka isku-xirka, masaafada ka soo laga bilaabo eber, konturro siman, heerar aan caadi ahayn, barooyin laba-jibbaaran) ka hor intaadan wax ku darin. Eeg Hubinta naqshadda sahanka markii la soo gelinayo iyo Fur DWG ama DXF sida khadad. Dejinta nidaamka isku-xirka waxaa lagu sameeyaa Coordinate system…. 2. Sawirro gacmeed Xaashi ku qoran warqad, sida sahan hore ama daabac calaamad ku qoran, waxaa lagu soo gelinayaa Scan… (Bilow sawir skaan ah): waxaa loo dhigaa cabbir ama isku-xirka la yaqaan qorshaha hoosteeda, waxaana laga raad-raacin karaa khadad. ModelCraft wuxuu akhrin karaa sawir sawir gacmeed (Fayl › Soo geli sawir gacmeed…). CivilCraft laftiisa ma leh qalab sawir gacmeed: dhig xaashiga qorshaha hoosteeda oo ku sawir isagoo ku dul-taal. 3. Sawir oo u beddel khadad Ku sawir khadadka muuqaalka iyo khadadka dhulka sahanka dushiisa CivilCraft, ama ku sawir naqshadda 2D. Beerta › Wax dheeraad ah › From a line wuxuu xariiq u beddelaa dahaadh dhagax-dhigis, geed-goob, darbi, tallaabooyin, khad muuqaal iyo wax kale, oo xidhan: xariiqda dhaqaajiso, shayga ayuu raaci doonaa. Eeg Shayada khadadka laga sameeyay. SuperCad Studio gudihiis, furo goobta, naqshadda iyo moodeelka dhismaha hal mashruuc: shaqada Beerta waxay leedahay qalabka dhammaantood, xariiq la doortay naqshadda 2D ayaa noqon kara shay beerta oo raacaya (Ctrl+K, Landscape object from the picked drawing line). 4. Dhulka la soo jeediyay Fur Surface › More › Landscape workspace. Dhulka la soo jeediyay ku dhis Platform, Berm, Swale iyo aagagga sare-u-qaadista oo leh heerar meel-gaar iyo konturro; dhagax-dhigista, waddooyinka, darbiyada, jid-dhaafyada iyo tallaabooyinka aad ku darto waxay ku dhex dhacaan dusha la soo jeediyay ee isku mid ah. Dhulka jira weligiisba ma bedelmo. Levels › Ground modifiers… waxay liistaa wax kasta oo qaabeeya dhulka hal amar, oo leh jarista iyo buuxinta mid kasta. Eeg Sare-u-qaadista iyo Wax-beddelayaasha dhulka iyo heerarka toosan. 5. Dhagax-dhigis iyo aagagga beerta Hardscape › Paving, Path, Wall, Kerb, Ramp iyo Steps. Areas wuxuu sawiraa beer cawska ah, beer geedaha, daaq ama dhul-daboolka leh dahaadhkiisa; wuxuu iska jarayaa hareeraha dhagax-dhigista, darbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka. Bed wuxuu buuxiyaa aag masaafada geedaha, oo ka samaysan isku-darka geedaha. Eeg Dhagax-dhigis, Aagagga beerta iyo Beerdhigga. 6. Heerarka, janjeeraha iyo isku-xidhka Hoosta Hubinta sare-u-qaadista, calaamadi Falanqaynta janjeerka iyo Fallaadaha socodka iyo biyo-ururka. Haddii biyo uga soo ururaan teras, ku dar Swale wareegteeda. Sifooyinku waxay kuu sheegaan tirada kor-u-kaca tallaabooyinka u baahan yihiin iyo haddii ay ku habboonaadaan, iyo meesha waddadu ka janjeersan tahay xadkeeda. Panelka Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu liistaa meelaha shayada ay si xun isugu kulmaan: darbi ka sarreeya, beer ka sarreeya dhagax-dhigista, tallaabooyin ka maqan dhagaxa-fadhiga. Spot level iyo Gradient arrow waxay calaamadiyaan dhulka oo iskood u cusboonaadaan. 7. Beerdhigga Ku Geedaha, raadi liiska geedaha (dhowr boqol nooc, ama liistaadaada), dooro mid, kadibna Plant, Bed ama Hedge. Dejiso cabbirka geedka iyo calaamadaha Wax dheeraad ahaan. Wax dheeraad › Plant table wuxuu wax ka beddelaa diiwaanadaada: noocyada, cabbirrada la bixiyo, cufnaanta, qoraallada shuruudaha. Diiwaan kasta wuxuu qaadan karaa calaamaddiisa iyo moodeelkiisa 3D (OBJ, STL ama GLB), iyo wax dheeraad › Plant graphics wuxuu geedaha ka sawiraa si fudud cabbirrada hoosaadka ah. Eeg Liiska geedaha, Diiwaanada geedaha iyo Sawirrada geedaha. 8. Tirooyinka iyo jadwallada Wax dheeraad › Worksheets: jadwallada geedaha iyo dhagax-dhigista, iyo kuwa aad lahaato, waxay ku xiran yihiin shayada; waxaad u kaydin kartaa CSV ama XLSX ama waxaad ku dhigi kartaa xaashiyada (eeg Xaashiyada shaqada). Wax dheeraad › Plant schedule… wuxuu tirooyinka u diraa TakeoffCraft. Tirooyinka dhagax-dhigista waxay ku jiraan Sifooyinka dahaadhka, darbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka. Biyo-qulqulku wuxuu leeyahay liiskiisa alaabta: Irrigation › Hubi nidaamka…. Eeg Biyo-qulqulka. 9. Naqshadaha iyo xaashiyada Wax dheeraad › Landscape sheets…: qorshayaasha beerdhigga, sare-u-qaadista iyo biyo-qulqulka, oo leh faahfaahin. Levels › Section line wuxuu sawiraa qaybaha dhulka, darbiyada, dahaadhka, tallaabooyinka iyo geedaha. Eeg Xaashiyada beerta iyo Qaybaha iyo kooxda daabacaadda. 10. Daabac Publish set (.zip) daaqadda xaashiyada ayaa samaysa hal PDF oo leh liiska xaashiyada iyo DWG xaashi kasta. Wax dheeraad › Export landscape IFC wuxuu BimCraft siinayaa geedaha iyo dhagax-dhigista. Kaydi mashruuca: wax kasta waxay ku jiraan hal fayl. Beddel hal shay: jid-tallaabooyinka Sababta aad wax kasta ugu hayso hal mashruuc waa in isbeddel kasta uu gaadho meel kasta. Isku day tan jid tallaabooyin oo u dhexeeya laba teras: Xariiqda jidka sawir sida khad muuqaal (ama xariiq naqshadda ku jira), kadibna Beerta › Wax dheeraad › From a line › Steps. Sifooyinka tallaabooyinka ku calaamadi Qaabeeya dhulka, oo deji heerarka hoose iyo sare ee laba terasyada. Ku sawir beer geed ah oo ku dhow oo hoos u jidka tallaabooyinka ah Areas wax ku, iyo dhagax-dhigis terasyada korkooda. Beerta waxay iska jari doontaa tallaabooyinka iyo dhagax-dhigista, jadwalka geedaha wuxuu tiriyaa oo kaliya waxa la beertay. Kor u qaad heerka sare ee jidka Sifooyinka. Dhulka la soo jeediyay, heerarka meel-gaar, fallaadaha janjeerka iyo jarista iyo buuxinta ayaa isla markiiba isbeddelaya. Haddii jidku aanu mar dambe ku kulmin teraska sare, Panelka Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay ka tahay. Dhaqaaji xariiqda jidka. Tallaabooyinku waxay raacaan xariiqooda isla tallaabada ka noqoshada; beerta mar kale way iska jarta oo dib ayaa loo tiraa, xaashiyada iyo jadwallada waxay muujinayaan tirooyinka cusub. Riix Ctrl+Z hal mar: xariiqda, tallaabooyinka, dhulka iyo beerta ayaa isla mar dib u noqda. Eeg Wax-beddelayaasha dhulka iyo heerarka toosan, Aagagga beerta iyo Xaashiyada shaqada. Weli lama dhisin Kuwani waa la weydiiyay, laakiin ma ku jiraan dhismahan: Darbiyo qaabeeya dhulka (waxay sheegaan meesha ay ku kulmaan, oo saxankooda ayay raaci karaan). Tafatirka liiskaaga maktabadda geedaha ee app-ka gudihiisa (wax ka beddel liiska mashruuca oo kaydi sida faylka geedaha). Teexturada iyo midabka moodelada GLB ee geedahaaga (qaabka ayaa la akhriyaa; midabka geedka ayaa la isticmaalaa). Eeg Shaqada beerta si aad u aragto qalab kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"plant-records","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Rekoodyada geedka, noocyada iyo cabbirrada la bixiyo","summary":"Liiska geedka mashruucaaga sida miis: cultivars, cabbirrada la bixiyo (weel, rootball, girth, clear stem), kacaan, qoraallada qeexidda, CSV gelinta iyo dhoofinta; geed kasta oo la dhigay wuxuu magacaabaa cabbir; calaamadaha geedka miisaan ahaan iyo calaamadahaaga iyo moodelada 3D.","section":"tasks","order":159,"keywords":["miiska geedka","database-ka geedka","cultivar","kala-duwanaanshaha","cabbirka la bixiyo","weel","rootball","root ball","bare root","girth","clear stem","kacaan","geed halkii m²","qeexid","qoraallada qeexidda","calaamadda geedka","bloog","calaamad u gaar ah","geed 3d","heerka faahfaahinta","miisaan"],"headings":[{"id":"tiirarka","text":"Tiirarka","level":2},{"id":"liiska-geedka-maktabada-ee-gaarka-ah","text":"Liiska geedka maktabada ee gaarka ah","level":2},{"id":"geed-kasta-wuxuu-magacaabaa-cabbir","text":"Geed kasta wuxuu magacaabaa cabbir","level":2},{"id":"calaamadaha-geedka-miisaan-ahaan","text":"Calaamadaha geedka miisaan ahaan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant table\u003C/span\u003E oo ka yimid menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda Beerta, ama qaybta Geedaha. Safafka kasta waa rekoord geed oo ku jira liiska mashruucan (rekoord ka liiska geedka ayaa la koobiyeeyaa marka aad ku darto). Wax kasta oo aad wax ka beddeshid waa la hubiyaa siduu faylka la soo dhoofiyay, waana hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiirarka\"\u003ETiirarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca botanical\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca caadiga ah\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBallac\u003C/strong\u003E marka uu gaaro (metrado).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpacing\u003C/strong\u003E (dhexe-ilaa-dhexe) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDensity\u003C/strong\u003E (geed halkii m²). Beer oo leh rekoord kacaan oo aan masaafo lahayn waa la buuxiyaa kacaankaas, qaabkiisa gaarka ah (saddex-geesood ama labajibbaaran).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada la bixiyo\u003C/strong\u003E: hal qoraal halkii cabbir, oo lagu kala saaray \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E. Qoraal kasta waa id, nooc (\u003Ccode\u003Econtainer\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erootball\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewrapped\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ebareroot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eplug\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eseed\u003C/code\u003E), markaasna mid ka mid ah: mugga \u003Ccode\u003E10L\u003C/code\u003E, dherer \u003Ccode\u003Eh0.6\u003C/code\u003E, ballac \u003Ccode\u003Es0.4\u003C/code\u003E, girth \u003Ccode\u003Eg14-16\u003C/code\u003E (cm), clear stem \u003Ccode\u003Est1.8\u003C/code\u003E. Tusaale: \u003Ccode\u003Ec10 container 10L h0.6; rb rootball h3 g14-16 st1.8\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECultivars\u003C/strong\u003E: magacyada lagu kala saaray \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E. Cultivar kasta wuxuu hayaa cabbirradiisa iyo qoraalladiisa marka faylka aad soo dhoofisay ay lahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraallada qeexidda\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa safka magac cusub; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as CSV\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as a plants file\u003C/span\u003E waxay qoraan liiska (safafka CSV ee cultivars waxay hoos yimaadaan noocooda, oo leh \u003Ccode\u003Ecultivar_of\u003C/code\u003E). Soo dhoofinta CSV ama faylka geedka waxay ku biraysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"liiska-geedka-maktabada-ee-gaarka-ah\"\u003ELiiska geedka maktabada ee gaarka ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu soo gal akoonkaaga CadCraft (Dejinta, Kordhinnadaada, Soo gal) miiska geedka wuxuu isticmaali karaa liiska aad ku haysato maktabada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom my Library list\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo qaadaa alaabooyinkaaga geedka gaarka ah (oo ay ku jiraan kuwa weli sugaya hubinta). Geed aad horey halkan u leedahay waa la cusboonaysiiyaa maktabada; cultivar-yada, cabbirrada la bixiyo, kacaanka iyo qoraallada qeexidda aad halkan ku darteen waa la kaydiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as a plant list\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa safaf kasta sida alaab geed gaar ah maktabada, hal alaab halkii nooc: geed cusub waa alaab cusub, geed la beddelay waa nooc cusub, geed aan la beddelin waa la iska tagaa. Marka hore calaamee sanduuqa: kaydinta waxay siisaa geedka dadweynaha hoostiisa CC0. Upload dadweyne oo ugu horreeya oo ka yimid qof aan weli la aaminin waxa hubiya qof ka hor inta uusan soo muuqan, sida upload kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaktabadu waxay hayn rekoodka geedka aasaasiga ah. Cultivars, cabbirrada la bixiyo, kacaanka iyo qoraallada qeexidda waxay ku sii jiraan mashruucan iyo faylka geedka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as a plants file\u003C/span\u003E); wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegaa inta safaf ah oo ay saamaynayso mar kasta oo aad kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geed-kasta-wuxuu-magacaabaa-cabbir\"\u003EGeed kasta wuxuu magacaabaa cabbir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro geed, xaleen, ama safka isku-darka beer ama dhul beeran: marka rekoordku leeyahay cultivars ama cabbirro la bixiyo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECultivar and size\u003C/span\u003E ayaa mid doorta. Jadwalka geedka markaas wuxuu tiriyaa noocyada, cultivar-ka iyo cabbirka, calaamadaduna waxay muujin karaan: \u003Ccode\u003E{botanical} &#039;{cultivar}&#039; {size}\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E{full}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadaha-geedka-miisaan-ahaan\"\u003ECalaamadaha geedka miisaan ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant graphics\u003C/span\u003E (Beerta › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu dejiyaa sida geedka qorshaha loo sawiro: \u003Cstrong\u003Esi toos ah\u003C/strong\u003E (miisaanka 1:500 ka hooseeya wareeg ballaca geedka, 1:200 iyo 1:500 dhexdooda qaab-hareer leh dhexe, ka sarreeya calaamad faahfaahsan; labada miisaan waa la beddeli karaa) ama hal heer oo miisaan kasta. Xaashiyada wada-hadalku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EFaahfaahinta geedka qorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E u gaar ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda geedka oo laga dooranayo qaybta Geedaha, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOwn symbol…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa SVG, ama bloog ka mid ah sawir DXF/DWG, wuxuuna sawiraa ballaca geedka heerka faahfaahinta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOwn 3D model…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa OBJ, STL ama GLB; Plant graphics dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelka u gaar ah ee rekoord kasta\u003C/strong\u003E si aad ugu aragto 3D. Faylalku waa la xaddidaa (512 KB oo SVG, 2000 qaab, 50 000 saddexagallo) waxayna ku sii jiraan mashruuca. Transforms-ka SVG lama dabaqo (waa la kuu sheegayaa marka faylku leeyahay). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plant-graphics\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plant-graphics\"\u003ESawirrada geedka miisaan ahaan, calaamadahaaga iyo geedka 3D\u003C/a\u003E heerarka, xaddidaadyada iyo waxa GLB ku jiri kara.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur Plant table oo ka yimid menu-ga More ee kooxda Beerta, ama qaybta Geedaha. Safafka kasta waa rekoord geed oo ku jira liiska mashruucan (rekoord ka liiska geedka ayaa la koobiyeeyaa marka aad ku darto). Wax kasta oo aad wax ka beddeshid waa la hubiyaa siduu faylka la soo dhoofiyay, waana hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo ah. Tiirarka Magaca botanical, Magaca caadiga ah, Nooca, Dherer iyo Ballac marka uu gaaro (metrado). Spacing (dhexe-ilaa-dhexe) ama Density (geed halkii m²). Beer oo leh rekoord kacaan oo aan masaafo lahayn waa la buuxiyaa kacaankaas, qaabkiisa gaarka ah (saddex-geesood ama labajibbaaran). Cabbirrada la bixiyo: hal qoraal halkii cabbir, oo lagu kala saaray ;. Qoraal kasta waa id, nooc (container, rootball, wrapped, bareroot, plug, seed), markaasna mid ka mid ah: mugga 10L, dherer h0.6, ballac s0.4, girth g14-16 (cm), clear stem st1.8. Tusaale: c10 container 10L h0.6; rb rootball h3 g14-16 st1.8. Cultivars: magacyada lagu kala saaray ;. Cultivar kasta wuxuu hayaa cabbirradiisa iyo qoraalladiisa marka faylka aad soo dhoofisay ay lahaayeen. Qoraallada qeexidda. Duplicate wuxuu koobiyeeyaa safka magac cusub; Save as CSV iyo Save as a plants file waxay qoraan liiska (safafka CSV ee cultivars waxay hoos yimaadaan noocooda, oo leh cultivar_of). Soo dhoofinta CSV ama faylka geedka waxay ku biraysaa. Liiska geedka maktabada ee gaarka ah Ku soo gal akoonkaaga CadCraft (Dejinta, Kordhinnadaada, Soo gal) miiska geedka wuxuu isticmaali karaa liiska aad ku haysato maktabada: From my Library list wuxuu soo qaadaa alaabooyinkaaga geedka gaarka ah (oo ay ku jiraan kuwa weli sugaya hubinta). Geed aad horey halkan u leedahay waa la cusboonaysiiyaa maktabada; cultivar-yada, cabbirrada la bixiyo, kacaanka iyo qoraallada qeexidda aad halkan ku darteen waa la kaydiyaa. Save as a plant list wuxuu kaydiyaa safaf kasta sida alaab geed gaar ah maktabada, hal alaab halkii nooc: geed cusub waa alaab cusub, geed la beddelay waa nooc cusub, geed aan la beddelin waa la iska tagaa. Marka hore calaamee sanduuqa: kaydinta waxay siisaa geedka dadweynaha hoostiisa CC0. Upload dadweyne oo ugu horreeya oo ka yimid qof aan weli la aaminin waxa hubiya qof ka hor inta uusan soo muuqan, sida upload kasta. Maktabadu waxay hayn rekoodka geedka aasaasiga ah. Cultivars, cabbirrada la bixiyo, kacaanka iyo qoraallada qeexidda waxay ku sii jiraan mashruucan iyo faylka geedka (Save as a plants file); wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegaa inta safaf ah oo ay saamaynayso mar kasta oo aad kaydiso. Geed kasta wuxuu magacaabaa cabbir Dooro geed, xaleen, ama safka isku-darka beer ama dhul beeran: marka rekoordku leeyahay cultivars ama cabbirro la bixiyo, Cultivar and size ayaa mid doorta. Jadwalka geedka markaas wuxuu tiriyaa noocyada, cultivar-ka iyo cabbirka, calaamadaduna waxay muujin karaan: {botanical} '{cultivar}' {size} ama {full}. Calaamadaha geedka miisaan ahaan Plant graphics (Beerta › More) wuxuu dejiyaa sida geedka qorshaha loo sawiro: si toos ah (miisaanka 1:500 ka hooseeya wareeg ballaca geedka, 1:200 iyo 1:500 dhexdooda qaab-hareer leh dhexe, ka sarreeya calaamad faahfaahsan; labada miisaan waa la beddeli karaa) ama hal heer oo miisaan kasta. Xaashiyada wada-hadalku wuxuu leeyahay Faahfaahinta geedka qorshaha u gaar ah. Calaamadda geedka oo laga dooranayo qaybta Geedaha, Own symbol… wuxuu akhrinayaa SVG, ama bloog ka mid ah sawir DXF/DWG, wuxuuna sawiraa ballaca geedka heerka faahfaahinta. Own 3D model… wuxuu akhrinayaa OBJ, STL ama GLB; Plant graphics dooro Moodelka u gaar ah ee rekoord kasta si aad ugu aragto 3D. Faylalku waa la xaddidaa (512 KB oo SVG, 2000 qaab, 50 000 saddexagallo) waxayna ku sii jiraan mashruuca. Transforms-ka SVG lama dabaqo (waa la kuu sheegayaa marka faylku leeyahay). Eeg Sawirrada geedka miisaan ahaan, calaamadahaaga iyo geedka 3D heerarka, xaddidaadyada iyo waxa GLB ku jiri kara.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"plant-graphics","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Sawirrada geedka miisaan ahaan, calaamadahaaga iyo geedka 3D","summary":"Sida geedka qorshaha loo sawiro miisaan kasta iyo heer faahfaahin kasta, iyo sida rekoodka geed u helo calaamaddaaga (SVG, ama bloog DXF/DWG) iyo moodelkaaga 3D (OBJ, STL ama GLB).","section":"tasks","order":160,"keywords":["sawirrada geedka","calaamadda geedka","calaamad miisaan ahaan","heerka faahfaahinta","faahfaahin","wareeg fudud","qaab-hareer","calaamad faahfaahsan","calaamad u gaar ah","bloog","svg","dxf","dwg","geed 3d","moodel 3d u gaar ah","obj","stl","glb","gltf","moodelka geedka","geedka 3d"],"headings":[{"id":"calaamadaha-qorshaha-miisaan-ahaan","text":"Calaamadaha qorshaha miisaan ahaan","level":2},{"id":"calaamaddaaga","text":"Calaamaddaaga","level":2},{"id":"geedkaaga-3d","text":"Geedkaaga 3D","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadaha-qorshaha-miisaan-ahaan\"\u003ECalaamadaha qorshaha miisaan ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeerta › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlant graphics\u003C/span\u003E waxa uu dejiyaa sida geedka qorshaha loo sawiro. \u003Cstrong\u003ESi toos ah, sida miisaanka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu doortaa mid ka mid ah saddex heer oo ka yimid miisaanka sawirka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg fudud\u003C/strong\u003E (miisaanka 1:500 ka hooseeya): wareeg ballaca geedka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaab-hareer leh dhexe\u003C/strong\u003E (1:500 ilaa 1:200): wareegga iyo jiiro dhexe oo yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamad faahfaahsan\u003C/strong\u003E (1:200 ka sarreeya): calaamada geedka haddii uu leeyahay, haddii kale calaamada dhismaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba miisaan ayaa lagu beddeli karaa \u003Cstrong\u003EFudud laga bilaabo 1:\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EQaab-hareer laga bilaabo 1:\u003C/strong\u003E, ama dooro hal heer oo miisaan kasta. Xaashi kasta oo ku jirta wada-hadalka xaashiyada wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EFaahfaahinta geedka qorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E u gaar ah, sidaas darteed qorshaha goobta 1:500 iyo qorshaha beerinta 1:100 way kala duwanaan karaan. Dejinta waxa lagu kaydiyaa mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamaddaaga\"\u003ECalaamaddaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro geed qaybta Geedaha oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOwn symbol…\u003C/span\u003E. Waxa uu akhrinayaa SVG, ama bloog ka mid ah sawir DXF ama DWG (haddii sawirku leeyahay bloogyo badan, waad dooratay mid). Calaamadda waxa lagu habeeyaa ballaca geedka, waxana lagu sawiraa heerka faahfaahinta. Waxa lagu kaydiyaa mashruuca, sidaas darteed faylku waa la socdaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESVG waxa loo akhriyaa xariiqyadiisa, polylines, polygons, rectangles, circles, ellipses iyo paths. Scripts, styles, links iyo sawirrada ku jira looma eego. Transforms lama codsado: waa la kuu sheegayaa marka faylku leeyahay, sidaas darteed marka hore ku jiid (flatten) barnaamijka naqshadaada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaddidaadyada: 512 KB oo SVG iyo 2000 qaab. Fayl ka weyn waa la diidayaa, sababta oo la sheegayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geedkaaga-3d\"\u003EGeedkaaga 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOwn 3D model…\u003C/span\u003E isla rekoodkaas wuxuu akhrinayaa faylka \u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESTL\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EGLB\u003C/strong\u003E. Kadib, Plant graphics, dejinta \u003Cstrong\u003EPlants in 3D\u003C/strong\u003E u beddel \u003Cstrong\u003EMoodelka u gaar ah ee rekoord kasta\u003C/strong\u003E: geed kasta oo rekoordkaas ah wuxuu muujinayaa moodelkaaga, oo lagu cabbiray dhererka iyo ballaca. Rekoodyada aan moodel u gaar ah lahayn waxay haystaan qaababkii dhismaha. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabab fudud\u003C/strong\u003E dhaqdhaqaaqa degdega ah ee goobaha waaweyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGLB waxa loo akhriyaa qaabkiisa keliya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax walba oo moodelku u baahan yahay waa inay ku jiraan faylka .glb. Moodel u tilmaamaya faylal kale (bin kale, ama sawirro ciwaan ahaan) waa la diidaa: waxba lagama soo dejiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeometry la isku dhejiyay ama la yareeyay (Draco, meshopt, quantized positions) lama akhrin. Ku soo saar iyada oo aan la isku dhejin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeksaroyada iyo midabyada faylka lama isticmaalo: moodelka waxa lagu sawiraa midabka geedka. Teksaroyada waa la hubiyaa, teksaro ka weyn 4096 pixel dhinac kasta waa la diidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaddidaadyo: fayl 32 MB, 50 000 saddexagallo (oo lagu tiriyo nuqul kasta oo qayb ah oo dhowr jeer la dhigay), 64 sawir iyo 16 MB oo sawirro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaddidaad kasta faylka way diidaa, sababta oo la sheegayo; wax qayb ahaan ah lama kaydiyo. Hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo ayaa rekoordka siinaya calaamadiisa ama moodelkiisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove own symbol\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove own 3D model\u003C/span\u003E ayaa mar kale ka saara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plant-records\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plant-records\"\u003ERekoodyada geedka\u003C/a\u003E rekoodka laftiisa, iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/site-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/site-3d\"\u003EArag goobta 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Calaamadaha qorshaha miisaan ahaan Beerta › More › Plant graphics waxa uu dejiyaa sida geedka qorshaha loo sawiro. Si toos ah, sida miisaanka wuxuu doortaa mid ka mid ah saddex heer oo ka yimid miisaanka sawirka: Wareeg fudud (miisaanka 1:500 ka hooseeya): wareeg ballaca geedka. Qaab-hareer leh dhexe (1:500 ilaa 1:200): wareegga iyo jiiro dhexe oo yar. Calaamad faahfaahsan (1:200 ka sarreeya): calaamada geedka haddii uu leeyahay, haddii kale calaamada dhismaha. Laba miisaan ayaa lagu beddeli karaa Fudud laga bilaabo 1: iyo Qaab-hareer laga bilaabo 1:, ama dooro hal heer oo miisaan kasta. Xaashi kasta oo ku jirta wada-hadalka xaashiyada wuxuu leeyahay Faahfaahinta geedka qorshaha u gaar ah, sidaas darteed qorshaha goobta 1:500 iyo qorshaha beerinta 1:100 way kala duwanaan karaan. Dejinta waxa lagu kaydiyaa mashruuca. Calaamaddaaga Dooro geed qaybta Geedaha oo riix Own symbol…. Waxa uu akhrinayaa SVG, ama bloog ka mid ah sawir DXF ama DWG (haddii sawirku leeyahay bloogyo badan, waad dooratay mid). Calaamadda waxa lagu habeeyaa ballaca geedka, waxana lagu sawiraa heerka faahfaahinta. Waxa lagu kaydiyaa mashruuca, sidaas darteed faylku waa la socdaa. SVG waxa loo akhriyaa xariiqyadiisa, polylines, polygons, rectangles, circles, ellipses iyo paths. Scripts, styles, links iyo sawirrada ku jira looma eego. Transforms lama codsado: waa la kuu sheegayaa marka faylku leeyahay, sidaas darteed marka hore ku jiid (flatten) barnaamijka naqshadaada. Xaddidaadyada: 512 KB oo SVG iyo 2000 qaab. Fayl ka weyn waa la diidayaa, sababta oo la sheegayo. Geedkaaga 3D Own 3D model… isla rekoodkaas wuxuu akhrinayaa faylka OBJ, STL ama GLB. Kadib, Plant graphics, dejinta Plants in 3D u beddel Moodelka u gaar ah ee rekoord kasta: geed kasta oo rekoordkaas ah wuxuu muujinayaa moodelkaaga, oo lagu cabbiray dhererka iyo ballaca. Rekoodyada aan moodel u gaar ah lahayn waxay haystaan qaababkii dhismaha. Dooro Qaabab fudud dhaqdhaqaaqa degdega ah ee goobaha waaweyn. GLB waxa loo akhriyaa qaabkiisa keliya: Wax walba oo moodelku u baahan yahay waa inay ku jiraan faylka .glb. Moodel u tilmaamaya faylal kale (bin kale, ama sawirro ciwaan ahaan) waa la diidaa: waxba lagama soo dejiyo. Geometry la isku dhejiyay ama la yareeyay (Draco, meshopt, quantized positions) lama akhrin. Ku soo saar iyada oo aan la isku dhejin. Teksaroyada iyo midabyada faylka lama isticmaalo: moodelka waxa lagu sawiraa midabka geedka. Teksaroyada waa la hubiyaa, teksaro ka weyn 4096 pixel dhinac kasta waa la diidaa. Xaddidaadyo: fayl 32 MB, 50 000 saddexagallo (oo lagu tiriyo nuqul kasta oo qayb ah oo dhowr jeer la dhigay), 64 sawir iyo 16 MB oo sawirro. Xaddidaad kasta faylka way diidaa, sababta oo la sheegayo; wax qayb ahaan ah lama kaydiyo. Hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo ayaa rekoordka siinaya calaamadiisa ama moodelkiisa, Remove own symbol ama Remove own 3D model ayaa mar kale ka saara. Eeg Rekoodyada geedka rekoodka laftiisa, iyo Arag goobta 3D.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"power-lines","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Shaqada xariiqyada korontada","summary":"Xariiqyada sare iyo kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa ee goobtaada, oo leh maktabadahaaga, hoos-u-dhaca iyo culeyska iyadoo loo eegayo xaaladaha culeyska, hubinta fogaanshaha iyo xoogga, miiskooyinka isku xirka, tirooyinka, xaashiyada iyo dhoofinta GIS.","section":"tasks","order":160,"keywords":["xariiq korontada","xariiq sare","korontada","qaybinta","tiirarka","xadhig","sag","xoog","isku xirka","fogaanshaha","kaabal dhulka hoostiisa","jid","shaqada","utility"],"headings":[{"id":"fur","text":"Fur","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-jira-kooxda-xariiqyada-korontada","text":"Waxa ku jira kooxda Xariiqyada korontada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EShaqada Xariiqyada korontada waxay xariiqyada sare iyo kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa ku dhigaysaa goobta CivilCraft ee aad horay u haysatay: isla dhibcaha goobta, isla dhulka, isla faylka mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab naqshadeed. Shaqadu waxay xisaabisaa hoos-u-dhaca, xoogga, fogaanshaha iyo culeyska iyadoo loo eegayo \u003Cstrong\u003Exaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadyadaada\u003C/strong\u003E; ma jiro heer dal oo lagu dhisay. Injineer ayaa hubiya natiijo kasta iyadoo loo eegayo heerka khuseeya ka hor intaan wax la dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur\"\u003EFur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaqada xariiqyada korontada\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyada korontada\u003C/strong\u003E hoos ta Meel-shaqo. Kadib qalabka sare waxa uu muujinayaa kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyada korontada\u003C/strong\u003E; kooxaha Naqshadeynta iyo GIS way ka dhaqaaqaan. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ECivil\u003C/strong\u003E hoos ta Meel-shaqo si aad dib ugu noqoto. CivilCraft wuxuu kombiyuutarkan ku xasuustaa meel-shaqada ugu dambaysay ee aad isticmaashay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka bidix wuxuu helayaa laba qaybood oo sare:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyada korontada\u003C/strong\u003E: xaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadyadaada, xariiqyada iyo kaablaha mashruuca ku jira, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EHubin\u003C/strong\u003E, oo had iyo jeer cusub. Riix hubin si aad u doorato waxa ay khuseyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabad\u003C/strong\u003E: xadhigyadaada, kaablahaaga, tiirarkaaga, qalabkaaga iyo noocyada jidka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-library\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-library\"\u003EMaktabadda xariiqyada korontadaada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-jira-kooxda-xariiqyada-korontada\"\u003EWaxa ku jira kooxda Xariiqyada korontada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMawduuc\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXariiq\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq sare: riix tiir kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/overhead-line\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/overhead-line\"\u003ESamee xariiq sare\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiir\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar tiir masaafo kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/overhead-line\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/overhead-line\"\u003ESamee xariiq sare\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaabal\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERoute kaabal dhulka hoostiisa ee jid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/underground-cables\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/underground-cables\"\u003EKaablaha dhulka hoostiisa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalab\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKabineeti, transformer, isku-xidhid, ama ilaha shabakadda lagu quudiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/underground-cables\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/underground-cables\"\u003EKaablaha dhulka hoostiisa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECaqabad\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax xariiq ku gudba: waddo, dhismo, xariiq kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-checks\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-checks\"\u003EHubinta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaal dherer\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka dherer ee xariiqda: dhulka, tiirarka iyo xadhigga xaaladaha culeyska kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/overhead-line#the-line-profile\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/overhead-line\" data-hash=\"the-line-profile\"\u003ESamee xariiq sare\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadyada, miiskooyinka isku xirka, tirooyinka, xaashiyada iyo warbixinta, GIS, faylalka daraasadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sag-and-tension\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sag-and-tension\"\u003EFogaanshaha iyo xoogga\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-outputs\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-outputs\"\u003ENatiijooyinka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-study-file\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-study-file\"\u003EFaylalka daraasadda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax kasta oo aad ku darto waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha layers-ka magacyadoodu yihiin \u003Ccode\u003EC-POWR-…\u003C/code\u003E, si dhoofinta DXF, DWG iyo PDF ay u qaadaan sidoo kale.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Shaqada Xariiqyada korontada waxay xariiqyada sare iyo kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa ku dhigaysaa goobta CivilCraft ee aad horay u haysatay: isla dhibcaha goobta, isla dhulka, isla faylka mashruuca. Qalab naqshadeed. Shaqadu waxay xisaabisaa hoos-u-dhaca, xoogga, fogaanshaha iyo culeyska iyadoo loo eegayo xaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadyadaada; ma jiro heer dal oo lagu dhisay. Injineer ayaa hubiya natiijo kasta iyadoo loo eegayo heerka khuseeya ka hor intaan wax la dhisin. Fur Dooro Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Shaqada xariiqyada korontada, ama Xariiqyada korontada hoos ta Meel-shaqo. Kadib qalabka sare waxa uu muujinayaa kooxda Xariiqyada korontada; kooxaha Naqshadeynta iyo GIS way ka dhaqaaqaan. Dooro Civil hoos ta Meel-shaqo si aad dib ugu noqoto. CivilCraft wuxuu kombiyuutarkan ku xasuustaa meel-shaqada ugu dambaysay ee aad isticmaashay. Panelka bidix wuxuu helayaa laba qaybood oo sare: Xariiqyada korontada: xaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadyadaada, xariiqyada iyo kaablaha mashruuca ku jira, iyo Hubin, oo had iyo jeer cusub. Riix hubin si aad u doorato waxa ay khuseyso. Maktabad: xadhigyadaada, kaablahaaga, tiirarkaaga, qalabkaaga iyo noocyada jidka. Eeg Maktabadda xariiqyada korontadaada. Waxa ku jira kooxda Xariiqyada korontada Qalab Waxa uu sameeyo Mawduuc Xariiq Xariiq sare: riix tiir kasta Samee xariiq sare Tiir Ku dar tiir masaafo kasta Samee xariiq sare Kaabal Route kaabal dhulka hoostiisa ee jid Kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa Qalab Kabineeti, transformer, isku-xidhid, ama ilaha shabakadda lagu quudiyo Kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa Caqabad Wax xariiq ku gudba: waddo, dhismo, xariiq kale Hubinta Muuqaal dherer Muuqaalka dherer ee xariiqda: dhulka, tiirarka iyo xadhigga xaaladaha culeyska kasta Samee xariiq sare Wax dheeraad ah Xaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadyada, miiskooyinka isku xirka, tirooyinka, xaashiyada iyo warbixinta, GIS, faylalka daraasadda Fogaanshaha iyo xoogga, Natiijooyinka, Faylalka daraasadda Wax kasta oo aad ku darto waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca. Waxaa lagu sawiraa qorshaha layers-ka magacyadoodu yihiin C-POWR-…, si dhoofinta DXF, DWG iyo PDF ay u qaadaan sidoo kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"planted-areas","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Aagagga beeran: cawlaha, beeraha, buuraha, dhulka faafa","summary":"Aagagga beeran oo ah shay leh dhismo dusha (ciid sare, mulch, membrane, xad), isku-dar geed iyo heer dhammaystiran oo ikhtiyaari ah; waxay iska gooyaan dhulka, derbiyada iyo tallaabooyinka, waxayna bixiyaan aagga saafi ah, mugga, dhererka xadka iyo tirada geedka.","section":"tasks","order":161,"keywords":["aagga beeran","cawl","cawsho","beer","xad","beer-cawl","dhul faafa","ciid sare","mulch","membrane","maro-cawska","xadka","heerka dhammaystiran","qadarka","aagga saafi ah","gooyo"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-uu-haysta","text":"Waxa uu haysta","level":2},{"id":"tirinta","text":"Tirinta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAreas\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jirta kooxda Beerta wuxuu sawiraa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecawl\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ebeer geedka lagu beeray\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ebuur\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Edhulka faafa\u003C/strong\u003E: guji geesaha, oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Beer ama dhulka faafa wuxuu ku bilaabmaa geedka lagu doortay qaybta Geedaha; cawl ma leh geedo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-haysta\"\u003EWaxa uu haysta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhismaha\u003C/strong\u003E: qoto dheer ciidda sare, qoto dheer mulch, membrane maro-cawska, iyo xad (bir, alwaax, dhagax, kaanaad, plastik ama midna). Qotooyinka caadiga ah ayaa la buuxiyay; dejinta kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dar\u003C/strong\u003E: noocyada (oo leh cultivar iyo cabbir) iyo qaybahooda, oo loo buuxiyay sida beer masaafada ama kacaanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka dhammaystiran\u003C/strong\u003E: ka tag madhan, aagguna wuxuu raacaa dhulka; ku sii heer, aagguna wuxuu noqonayaa beddelaha dhulka (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ground-modifiers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ground-modifiers\"\u003EBeddelayaasha dhulka iyo heerarka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EClip around paving, walls and steps\u003C/strong\u003E (waa shaqeeya caadi ahaan): meel kasta oo dhagaxa jiid, waddo, derbi, kerb, rampa ama tallaabo ay isku dhacaan aagga, qaybtaas waa la iska tagaa. Geed lagama dhigo hoostooda ama dhow-dhow masaafo nus ah cidhifkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirinta\"\u003ETirinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EBed\u003C/strong\u003E saafi ah (kadib gooyidda, si sax ah loo cabbiray), \u003Cstrong\u003Ewareegga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Edherer-ka cidhifka\u003C/strong\u003E (oo keliya cidhifka aagga laftiisa, ma aha meelaha hardscape-ku jaro), mugga ciidda sare iyo mulch, aagga membrane iyo tirada geedka safka isku-darka kasta. Jadwalka geedku wuxuu tiriyaa geedaha aagga; faylka qadarka ee TakeoffCraft wuxuu helaa aagga, ciidda sare, mulch, membrane iyo xadka; IFC-ga beerta wuxuu qoraa IfcGeographicElement oo leh qaybta qadarka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Areas oo ku jirta kooxda Beerta wuxuu sawiraa cawl, beer geedka lagu beeray, buur ama dhulka faafa: guji geesaha, oo riix Enter. Beer ama dhulka faafa wuxuu ku bilaabmaa geedka lagu doortay qaybta Geedaha; cawl ma leh geedo. Waxa uu haysta Dhismaha: qoto dheer ciidda sare, qoto dheer mulch, membrane maro-cawska, iyo xad (bir, alwaax, dhagax, kaanaad, plastik ama midna). Qotooyinka caadiga ah ayaa la buuxiyay; dejinta kaaga. Isku-dar: noocyada (oo leh cultivar iyo cabbir) iyo qaybahooda, oo loo buuxiyay sida beer masaafada ama kacaanka. Heerka dhammaystiran: ka tag madhan, aagguna wuxuu raacaa dhulka; ku sii heer, aagguna wuxuu noqonayaa beddelaha dhulka (eeg Beddelayaasha dhulka iyo heerarka). Clip around paving, walls and steps (waa shaqeeya caadi ahaan): meel kasta oo dhagaxa jiid, waddo, derbi, kerb, rampa ama tallaabo ay isku dhacaan aagga, qaybtaas waa la iska tagaa. Geed lagama dhigo hoostooda ama dhow-dhow masaafo nus ah cidhifkooda. Tirinta Properties wuxuu muujinayaa Bed saafi ah (kadib gooyidda, si sax ah loo cabbiray), wareegga, dherer-ka cidhifka (oo keliya cidhifka aagga laftiisa, ma aha meelaha hardscape-ku jaro), mugga ciidda sare iyo mulch, aagga membrane iyo tirada geedka safka isku-darka kasta. Jadwalka geedku wuxuu tiriyaa geedaha aagga; faylka qadarka ee TakeoffCraft wuxuu helaa aagga, ciidda sare, mulch, membrane iyo xadka; IFC-ga beerta wuxuu qoraa IfcGeographicElement oo leh qaybta qadarka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"power-line-library","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Maktabadda xariiqyada korontadaada","summary":"Samee alaabtaada, xadhigyada korontada, kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa, tiirarka, qalabka iyo noocyada jidka, oo ku dhex jira qaybo aad magacdarto, oo ku wadaag sida faylal.","section":"tasks","order":161,"keywords":["maktabad","xadhig","kaabal","tiir","tiir-taageere","kaabal-dhexe","qalab xidhid","jir-kaabbe","transformer","kabineeti","isku-xidhid","jid","qaybta","csv","soo dhoofi","dhoofi"],"headings":[{"id":"saddex-nooc-oo-alaabta-ah","text":"Saddex nooc oo alaabta ah","level":2},{"id":"samee-alaab","text":"Samee alaab","level":2},{"id":"wadaag","text":"Wadaag","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabad\u003C/strong\u003E ee Xariiqyada korontada waxay haysaa dhammaan alaabta xariiq ama kaabal kasta ay isticmaali karto. Waxba ku xidhan maaha dal ama soo saare gaar ah: alaabta aad shaqaysid ayaad samaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saddex-nooc-oo-alaabta-ah\"\u003ESaddex nooc oo alaabta ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha ay ku nool tahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMa beddeli kartaa?\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETusaalooyin\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaa lagu soo daray CivilCraft, leh tirooyin guud oo aan ka xisaabinnay hantida alaabta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya: marka hore \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee maktabaddayda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMashruuca gudihiisa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay ku timid faylka mashruuca aad furtay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya: marka hore \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee maktabaddayda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAnigu\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaabtaada, oo lagu kaydiyo browser-kan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa, isbeddelladuna isla markiiba way kaydsamaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMashruuc kasta wuxuu hayaa nuqul alaab kasta oo uu isticmaalo, si mashruucu ugu furmo kombiyuutar kasta xadhigyadiisa iyo tiirarkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlaabta tusaalaha ah waa tusaalooyin: hubi tiro kasta xogta alaabta iibiyahaaga. Kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa ma leh cabbir korontada oo la isku hallayn karo, sababtoo ah waxay kuxirantahay sida loo dhigay kaabalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-alaab\"\u003ESamee alaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha \u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabad\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E (xadhigyada sare, kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa, tiirarka, qalabka ama noocyada jidka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay cusub\u003C/span\u003E, ama dooro tusaale oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee maktabaddayda\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee nuqul\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuuxi goobahaaga. Goobaha leh \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E waa kuwa hubinta u baahan tahay; alaab ay ka maqan tahay mid waxay leedahay \u003Ccode\u003E!\u003C/code\u003E waxayna ku jirtaa liiska hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EHubin\u003C/strong\u003E marka xariiq ay isticmaasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESiiso \u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta\u003C/strong\u003E, adigoo \u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E u dhexeeya heerarka: \u003Ccode\u003EOverhead/LV/Bundled\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ESupports/Concrete/12 m\u003C/code\u003E. Geedka waxaa raacaa qaybahaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa nooc kasta u baahan yahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELoo baahan yahay hubinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadhig sare\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqaybta cross-section, dhexroorka, miisaanka mitir kasta, xoogga jebinta, modulus-ka elastic-ka, ballaarinta kulaylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaabal dhulka hoostiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Exariiqyada, qaybta cross-section, korontada, dhexroorka, iska-caabbinta, cabbirka korontada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edhererka guud, culeyska magacaabani (la qiyaaso barta ka hoosaysa sareeyaha), qoto-dheerka dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalab\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enooca; culeyska la qiimeeyay ee kaabalada, qalabka xidhka iyo jir-kaabbeyada; masaafada safafka iyo hoos-u-dhaca kaabalada dhidibka-tiirka; dherer kaabalada xidhka; xagasha jir-kaabbeyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca jidka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqoto-dheer, ballac, dabool ka sarreeya kaablaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wadaag\"\u003EWadaag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi maktabaddayda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa alaabtaada oo dhan hal fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.cclines.json\u003C/code\u003E ah; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur maktabad…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mar kale akhrisaa (alaabta furaha isku mid ah ayaa la beddelaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa nooca aad eegayso sida spreadsheet; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur maktabad…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrisaa CSV oo nooca ah mar kale. Tiirarka waxay iman karaan siday u kala horreeyaan; faylka leh kala-soocaha semicolon wuxuu isticmaali karaa comma tobanaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qaybta Maktabad ee Xariiqyada korontada waxay haysaa dhammaan alaabta xariiq ama kaabal kasta ay isticmaali karto. Waxba ku xidhan maaha dal ama soo saare gaar ah: alaabta aad shaqaysid ayaad samaysaa. Saddex nooc oo alaabta ah Nooca Meesha ay ku nool tahay Ma beddeli kartaa? Tusaalooyin Waxaa lagu soo daray CivilCraft, leh tirooyin guud oo aan ka xisaabinnay hantida alaabta Maya: marka hore Koobiyee maktabaddayda Mashruuca gudihiisa Waxay ku timid faylka mashruuca aad furtay Maya: marka hore Koobiyee maktabaddayda Anigu Alaabtaada, oo lagu kaydiyo browser-kan Haa, isbeddelladuna isla markiiba way kaydsamaan Mashruuc kasta wuxuu hayaa nuqul alaab kasta oo uu isticmaalo, si mashruucu ugu furmo kombiyuutar kasta xadhigyadiisa iyo tiirarkiisa. Alaabta tusaalaha ah waa tusaalooyin: hubi tiro kasta xogta alaabta iibiyahaaga. Kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa ma leh cabbir korontada oo la isku hallayn karo, sababtoo ah waxay kuxirantahay sida loo dhigay kaabalka. Samee alaab Gudaha Maktabad, dooro Nooca (xadhigyada sare, kaablaha dhulka hoostiisa, tiirarka, qalabka ama noocyada jidka). Riix Shay cusub, ama dooro tusaale oo riix Koobiyee maktabaddayda ama Samee nuqul. Buuxi goobahaaga. Goobaha leh * waa kuwa hubinta u baahan tahay; alaab ay ka maqan tahay mid waxay leedahay ! waxayna ku jirtaa liiska hoos Hubin marka xariiq ay isticmaasho. Siiso Qaybta, adigoo / u dhexeeya heerarka: Overhead/LV/Bundled, Supports/Concrete/12 m. Geedka waxaa raacaa qaybahaaga. Waxa nooc kasta u baahan yahay: Nooca Loo baahan yahay hubinta Xadhig sare qaybta cross-section, dhexroorka, miisaanka mitir kasta, xoogga jebinta, modulus-ka elastic-ka, ballaarinta kulaylka Kaabal dhulka hoostiisa xariiqyada, qaybta cross-section, korontada, dhexroorka, iska-caabbinta, cabbirka korontada Tiir dhererka guud, culeyska magacaabani (la qiyaaso barta ka hoosaysa sareeyaha), qoto-dheerka dhulka Qalab nooca; culeyska la qiimeeyay ee kaabalada, qalabka xidhka iyo jir-kaabbeyada; masaafada safafka iyo hoos-u-dhaca kaabalada dhidibka-tiirka; dherer kaabalada xidhka; xagasha jir-kaabbeyada Nooca jidka qoto-dheer, ballac, dabool ka sarreeya kaablaha Wadaag Kaydi maktabaddayda wuxuu kaydiyaa alaabtaada oo dhan hal fayl .cclines.json ah; Fur maktabad… wuxuu mar kale akhrisaa (alaabta furaha isku mid ah ayaa la beddelaa). Kaydi sida CSV wuxuu kaydiyaa nooca aad eegayso sida spreadsheet; Fur maktabad… wuxuu akhrisaa CSV oo nooca ah mar kale. Tiirarka waxay iman karaan siday u kala horreeyaan; faylka leh kala-soocaha semicolon wuxuu isticmaali karaa comma tobanaad.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"overhead-line","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Sawir xariiq korantada sare","summary":"Ku dhig tiirarka qorshaha, u oggolow CivilCraft inuu ogaado doorka tiir kasta iyo fidinta u dhexaysa dhamaadyada, oo ku dhaqaaji tiirarka qorshaha ama muuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa.","section":"tasks","order":162,"keywords":["xariiq korantada sare","tiir","fidin","goyn","dhamaad","xagal","dhaadhac","muuqaal dherer","dherer","qalab-tiir","xidh","xidh-tiir","dhamaad-dhimasho"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir","text":"Sawir","level":2},{"id":"xariiqa-properties-ka","text":"Xariiqa Properties-ka","level":2},{"id":"tiirarka","text":"Tiirarka","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-dherer-ee-xariiqa","text":"Muuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir\"\u003ESawir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaa in uu jiraa dusha: dhulka hoosteeda xariiqa wuxuu ka imanayaa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EDhis dusha\u003C/a\u003E). Tiir aan dhulka hoosteeda lahayn waxa lagu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EHubinta\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta; ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EHeerka dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E Properties-ka halkii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiq\u003C/span\u003E qaybta Xariiqyada korantada oo guji tiir kasta qorshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer guji kan ugu dambeeya, ama riix Enter.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqu wuxuu helaa silig, tiir iyo qalab aad ugu dambeyntii isticmaashay kombiyuutarkan (markii ugu horreysay: tusaalooyin maktabadda). Beddel Properties-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xariiqa-properties-ka\"\u003EXariiqa Properties-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro xariiqa (guji fidin) si aad u dejiso \u003Cstrong\u003ESilig\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESiligga wareeg kasta\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWareegyada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EVoltage\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EXeerka masaafada\u003C/strong\u003E uu dhulka ku hayo, iyo qalabka \u003Cstrong\u003ETiir kasta\u003C/strong\u003E (xarago, insulators, fittings). Miiska wuxuu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybahiisa\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh fidinta xukunka, xoogga caadiga ah, iyo xaaladda culeyska ee maamusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiirarka\"\u003ETiirarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji tiir si aad u doorato. Properties-ka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiir\u003C/strong\u003E: shayga maktabadda. Marka ay daciif tahay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal …\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geliyaa tiirka ugu yar ee isla walxaha maktabaddaada ee qaada culeyska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDoorka\u003C/strong\u003E: Si toos ah, Dhaadhac, Xagal ama Dhamaad. Si toos ah waxay ka dhigan tahay: tiirarka koowaad iyo kan ugu dambeeya waa dhamaad; wareeg ka sarreeya xagasha xeerka ayaa samaysa tiir xagal; wareeg ka weyn waa dhamaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJoogga ka sare dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E: madhan ayaa qaada cabbirka shayga maktabadda (dherkiisa laga jaray qoto-dheerka dhulka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiirkan oo kale\u003C/strong\u003E: qalab dheeraad ah, sida \u003Cstrong\u003Exidh\u003C/strong\u003E (guy). Tiir xidhan wuxuu xidhka u gudbiyaa xoogga xariiqa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiir jira\u003C/strong\u003E: waa la hubiyaa sida kuwa kale laakiin tirinta laga reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa tiir fidinta ugu dhow guujaaggaaga. Jiid tiir qorshaha si aad u dhaqaajiso. Tirtir wuxuu tirtiraa (xariiqu waa inuu haystaa ugu yaraan laba).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha waxay u dhexeeyaan dhamaadyada dhimasho: gudaha qayb silig-ku si xor ah ugu socdaa qabsiyada dhaadhaca, marka hal xoog ayuu qayb oo dhan hayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-dherer-ee-xariiqa\"\u003EMuuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal dherer\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaal dherer\u003C/strong\u003E ee Properties-ka xariiqa). Panel-ka hoosta qorshaha wuxuu muujinayaa dhulka dhinaca xariiqa, tiir kasta ilaa sare, silig-ka ugu hooseeya marka xaaladda culeyska aad doorato \u003Cstrong\u003EXaaladda culeyska\u003C/strong\u003E ay tahay, iyo masaafada xariiqu u baahan yahay oo ah khad jajab ah. Fidin fashilmaysa waa casaan; lambarka hoosta fidin kasta waa masaafadiisa ugu yar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXariiq\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu doortaa xariiqa korantada sare ee la tusayo. Doorashada xariiq kale, ama tiir kasta qorshaha, waxay muuqaalka u beddelaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca hoose ee calaamadda muuqaalka: khad hage ayaa raacaa, calaamaduna waxay akhrisaa masaafada dhimasho xariiqa, dhulka, silig-ka iyo masaafada halkaas (waxay sheegtaa marka masaafadu ka hooseyso xeerka xariiqa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E qalabka muuqaalka: guji laba barood si aad u hesho masaafada u dhexaysa, farqiga dhererka, masaafada toosan iyo janjeerka. Guji u dhow dhulka, silig-ka ama qolofka sare ee tiir wuu u hoos-jiidaa. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E mar kale si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxyaabaha xariiqu gudbo waxay ka istaagaan dhulka: kuwa la sawiray sida xarriiq, dhirta Landscape sida qolofkeeda, darbiyada sida xarriiq (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-checks#clearances\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-checks\" data-hash=\"clearances\"\u003EHubinta xariiqa korantada\u003C/a\u003E). Tuubooyinka iyo kabalyada xariiqa gudbaysa waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa hoosta dhulka sare-kooda, magacooda la socda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid tiir si cidhib ah si aad ugu dhaqaajiso xariiqa dhinaceeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid qolofkeeda sare kor u kac ama hoos u dhac si aad u dejiso joogga ka sare dhulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Sawir Waa in uu jiraa dusha: dhulka hoosteeda xariiqa wuxuu ka imanayaa (Dhis dusha). Tiir aan dhulka hoosteeda lahayn waxa lagu liistaa Hubinta hoosta; ku qor Heerka dhulka Properties-ka halkii. Guji Xariiq qaybta Xariiqyada korantada oo guji tiir kasta qorshaha. Laba jeer guji kan ugu dambeeya, ama riix Enter. Xariiqu wuxuu helaa silig, tiir iyo qalab aad ugu dambeyntii isticmaashay kombiyuutarkan (markii ugu horreysay: tusaalooyin maktabadda). Beddel Properties-ka. Xariiqa Properties-ka Dooro xariiqa (guji fidin) si aad u dejiso Silig, Siligga wareeg kasta, Wareegyada, Voltage, Xeerka masaafada uu dhulka ku hayo, iyo qalabka Tiir kasta (xarago, insulators, fittings). Miiska wuxuu liistaa qaybahiisa oo leh fidinta xukunka, xoogga caadiga ah, iyo xaaladda culeyska ee maamusha. Tiirarka Guji tiir si aad u doorato. Properties-ka: Tiir: shayga maktabadda. Marka ay daciif tahay, Isticmaal … wuxuu geliyaa tiirka ugu yar ee isla walxaha maktabaddaada ee qaada culeyska. Doorka: Si toos ah, Dhaadhac, Xagal ama Dhamaad. Si toos ah waxay ka dhigan tahay: tiirarka koowaad iyo kan ugu dambeeya waa dhamaad; wareeg ka sarreeya xagasha xeerka ayaa samaysa tiir xagal; wareeg ka weyn waa dhamaad. Joogga ka sare dhulka: madhan ayaa qaada cabbirka shayga maktabadda (dherkiisa laga jaray qoto-dheerka dhulka). Tiirkan oo kale: qalab dheeraad ah, sida xidh (guy). Tiir xidhan wuxuu xidhka u gudbiyaa xoogga xariiqa. Tiir jira: waa la hubiyaa sida kuwa kale laakiin tirinta laga reebay. Tiir wuxuu ku daraa tiir fidinta ugu dhow guujaaggaaga. Jiid tiir qorshaha si aad u dhaqaajiso. Tirtir wuxuu tirtiraa (xariiqu waa inuu haystaa ugu yaraan laba). Qaybaha waxay u dhexeeyaan dhamaadyada dhimasho: gudaha qayb silig-ku si xor ah ugu socdaa qabsiyada dhaadhaca, marka hal xoog ayuu qayb oo dhan hayaa. Muuqaalka dherer ee xariiqa Guji Muuqaal dherer (ama Muuqaal dherer ee Properties-ka xariiqa). Panel-ka hoosta qorshaha wuxuu muujinayaa dhulka dhinaca xariiqa, tiir kasta ilaa sare, silig-ka ugu hooseeya marka xaaladda culeyska aad doorato Xaaladda culeyska ay tahay, iyo masaafada xariiqu u baahan yahay oo ah khad jajab ah. Fidin fashilmaysa waa casaan; lambarka hoosta fidin kasta waa masaafadiisa ugu yar. Xariiq wuxuu doortaa xariiqa korantada sare ee la tusayo. Doorashada xariiq kale, ama tiir kasta qorshaha, waxay muuqaalka u beddelaa. Dhinaca hoose ee calaamadda muuqaalka: khad hage ayaa raacaa, calaamaduna waxay akhrisaa masaafada dhimasho xariiqa, dhulka, silig-ka iyo masaafada halkaas (waxay sheegtaa marka masaafadu ka hooseyso xeerka xariiqa). Qiyaas qalabka muuqaalka: guji laba barood si aad u hesho masaafada u dhexaysa, farqiga dhererka, masaafada toosan iyo janjeerka. Guji u dhow dhulka, silig-ka ama qolofka sare ee tiir wuu u hoos-jiidaa. Guji Qiyaas mar kale si aad u joojiso. Waxyaabaha xariiqu gudbo waxay ka istaagaan dhulka: kuwa la sawiray sida xarriiq, dhirta Landscape sida qolofkeeda, darbiyada sida xarriiq (eeg Hubinta xariiqa korantada). Tuubooyinka iyo kabalyada xariiqa gudbaysa waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa hoosta dhulka sare-kooda, magacooda la socda. Jiid tiir si cidhib ah si aad ugu dhaqaajiso xariiqa dhinaceeda. Jiid qolofkeeda sare kor u kac ama hoos u dhac si aad u dejiso joogga ka sare dhulka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"ground-modifiers","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Wax-beddelayaasha dhulka iyo heerarka firfircoon","summary":"Wax kasta oo qaabeeya dhulka la soo jeediyay oo ku jira liis kala horreeya (kii dambe ayaa guuleysta meelaha isku qabsada), jarista iyo buuxinta mid kasta, hubinta isku xirka ee Guddiga Dhibaatooyinka, iyo heerarka meel-gaar iyo fallaadaha janjeerka ee akhriya dhulka si toos ah.","section":"tasks","order":162,"keywords":["wax-beddelayaasha dhulka","dalabka","kala horreynta","dhulka la soo jeediyay","dhulka jira","isku qabsashada","jarista iyo buuxinta","isku xirka","derbi taageeraya","cidhifka dhulka adag","heerka hoosaadka","tallaabo balaadh","heer meel-gaar","sare-u-taagga barta","fallaadha janjeerka","calaamadda janjeerka","hoos u dhac"],"headings":[{"id":"liiska","text":"Liiska","level":2},{"id":"hubinta-isku-xirka","text":"Hubinta isku xirka","level":2},{"id":"derbi-taageeraya-oo-qaabeeya-dhulka","text":"Derbi taageeraya oo qaabeeya dhulka","level":2},{"id":"heerarka-meel-gaar-iyo-fallaadaha-janjeerka","text":"Heerarka meel-gaar iyo fallaadaha janjeerka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDhulka la soo jeediyay = dhulka jira + wax-beddelayaasha, si loo kala horreeyo. Dhulka jira weligiis ma bedelmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"liiska\"\u003ELiiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerarka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax-beddelayaasha dhulka…\u003C/span\u003E waxay liisanaysaa dhammaan walxaha qaabeeya dhulka: madallada, buuraha, dhuunooyinka, aagagga simaynta, dhulka adag iyo jidadka, aagagga beerta leh heer dhammaystiran, iyo tallaabooyinka iyo jidadka janjeeran ee sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeeya dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E la calaamadeeyay (oo leh heerarkooda hoose iyo sare). Meel isku qabsada labo, kii \u003Cstrong\u003Edambe\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa guuleysta. Safka jiid, ama isticmaal fallaadaha, si aad u beddesho dalabka; dhulka mar dhow ayaa dib loo dhisaa. Safka kasta wuxuu muujinayaa jaristiisa iyo buuxinteeda (waxa uu qaabeeyo kadib kuwa ka sarreeya), wadarta ayaa hoosta liiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta-isku-xirka\"\u003EHubinta isku xirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuddiga Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu liistaa, oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003Etag\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ederbi u dhow dhinaceeda sare ka sarreeya saddexdeeda sare (ciid ka sarreysa derbiga), ama kaas oo dhinaceeda hoose muujinaya aasaaskiisa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eaag beer lagu beeray oo heerkeeda dhammaystiran ka sarreeya cidhifka dhulka adag ee ay la kulanto, ama in ka badan 150 mm oo hoos ka ah sida caadiga ah;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etallaabooyin kuwaas oo hoosteeda ama sareedu aanay la kulmin dhulka adag ee ay ku dhacaan;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elabo wax-beddeleyaal isku qabsada (kii dambe ayaa halkaas guuleysta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDerbi taageeraya wuxuu sare u raaci karaa dhinaca sare ee dhulka: dherkiisa mar kasta dib ayaa loo xisaabiyaa marka dhulku isbeddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"derbi-taageeraya-oo-qaabeeya-dhulka\"\u003EDerbi taageeraya oo qaabeeya dhulka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro derbi taageeraya oo calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeeya dhulka\u003C/strong\u003E. Xariiqda hoosta derbiga (ballaadhin u dhiganta dhumucda derbiga) ayaa ku biirta liiska wax-beddelaha ahaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ecidhifka \u003Cstrong\u003Edhinaca sare\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu hayaa dhulka halkaas, meel-meel, si sare ee derbigu u raaco dhinaca sare (oo leh dahaarka sare korkiisa). Ku qor heerka \u003Cstrong\u003ESare\u003C/strong\u003E oo markaa dhinaca sare ayuu ku hayaa heerkaas oo ka dhimaya dahaarka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ecidhifka \u003Cstrong\u003Edhinaca hoose\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu hayaa heerka \u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka lagu hayo dhinaca hoose\u003C/strong\u003E ee aad qorto, ama haddii madhan yahay, dhulka halkaas;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhinaca sare waa dhinaca dhulkiisu ka sarreeyo derbiga oo dhan, sidaas darteed weligiis kama rogmado derbiga dhexdiisa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhulka ka baxsan xariiqda lama bedelo, dhulka jirana weligiis ma bedelmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida wax-beddel kasta oo kale, wuxuu liiska ku jiraa, wax-beddel liiskiisa ka dambeeya ayaa guuleysta meelaha isku qabsada. Derbi kaas oo heerka uu ku hayo dhamaadka uu ka badan yahay 150 mm sida caadiga ah ka dhanka dhulka jira halkaas, digniin ayaa loo siiyaa Guddiga Dhibaatooyinka (oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003Etag\u003C/strong\u003E). Derbi go&#039;an ma qaabeeyo dhulka. Sanduuqa waa la damiyaa faylalka dhismayaasha hore, sidaas darteed way furmaan sidii ay ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerarka-meel-gaar-iyo-fallaadaha-janjeerka\"\u003EHeerarka meel-gaar iyo fallaadaha janjeerka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeer meel-gaar\u003C/span\u003E (hal riix) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFallaadaha janjeerka\u003C/span\u003E (laba riix) mar kasta akhriyaan dhulka markii la sawirayo: obyect la dhaqaajiyo ama dib loo heerkeeyo, calaamadaha way raacaan. Sifooyinka ku dooro in calaamaddu akhrinayso dhulka la soo jeediyay mise dhulka jira; calaamadaha dhulka jira waxaa lagu muujiyaa qaws. Fallaadahu waxay u tilmaamaan hoos u dhac oo waxay leeyihiin \u003Ccode\u003E1:20 (5.0 %)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dhulka la soo jeediyay = dhulka jira + wax-beddelayaasha, si loo kala horreeyo. Dhulka jira weligiis ma bedelmo. Liiska Heerarka › Wax-beddelayaasha dhulka… waxay liisanaysaa dhammaan walxaha qaabeeya dhulka: madallada, buuraha, dhuunooyinka, aagagga simaynta, dhulka adag iyo jidadka, aagagga beerta leh heer dhammaystiran, iyo tallaabooyinka iyo jidadka janjeeran ee sanduuqa Qaabeeya dhulka la calaamadeeyay (oo leh heerarkooda hoose iyo sare). Meel isku qabsada labo, kii dambe ayaa guuleysta. Safka jiid, ama isticmaal fallaadaha, si aad u beddesho dalabka; dhulka mar dhow ayaa dib loo dhisaa. Safka kasta wuxuu muujinayaa jaristiisa iyo buuxinteeda (waxa uu qaabeeyo kadib kuwa ka sarreeya), wadarta ayaa hoosta liiska. Hubinta isku xirka Guddiga Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu liistaa, oo leh tag: derbi u dhow dhinaceeda sare ka sarreeya saddexdeeda sare (ciid ka sarreysa derbiga), ama kaas oo dhinaceeda hoose muujinaya aasaaskiisa; aag beer lagu beeray oo heerkeeda dhammaystiran ka sarreeya cidhifka dhulka adag ee ay la kulanto, ama in ka badan 150 mm oo hoos ka ah sida caadiga ah; tallaabooyin kuwaas oo hoosteeda ama sareedu aanay la kulmin dhulka adag ee ay ku dhacaan; labo wax-beddeleyaal isku qabsada (kii dambe ayaa halkaas guuleysta). Derbi taageeraya wuxuu sare u raaci karaa dhinaca sare ee dhulka: dherkiisa mar kasta dib ayaa loo xisaabiyaa marka dhulku isbeddelo. Derbi taageeraya oo qaabeeya dhulka Dooro derbi taageeraya oo calaamadee Qaabeeya dhulka. Xariiqda hoosta derbiga (ballaadhin u dhiganta dhumucda derbiga) ayaa ku biirta liiska wax-beddelaha ahaan: cidhifka dhinaca sare waxaa lagu hayaa dhulka halkaas, meel-meel, si sare ee derbigu u raaco dhinaca sare (oo leh dahaarka sare korkiisa). Ku qor heerka Sare oo markaa dhinaca sare ayuu ku hayaa heerkaas oo ka dhimaya dahaarka; cidhifka dhinaca hoose waxaa lagu hayaa heerka Dhulka lagu hayo dhinaca hoose ee aad qorto, ama haddii madhan yahay, dhulka halkaas; dhinaca sare waa dhinaca dhulkiisu ka sarreeyo derbiga oo dhan, sidaas darteed weligiis kama rogmado derbiga dhexdiisa; dhulka ka baxsan xariiqda lama bedelo, dhulka jirana weligiis ma bedelmo. Sida wax-beddel kasta oo kale, wuxuu liiska ku jiraa, wax-beddel liiskiisa ka dambeeya ayaa guuleysta meelaha isku qabsada. Derbi kaas oo heerka uu ku hayo dhamaadka uu ka badan yahay 150 mm sida caadiga ah ka dhanka dhulka jira halkaas, digniin ayaa loo siiyaa Guddiga Dhibaatooyinka (oo leh tag). Derbi go'an ma qaabeeyo dhulka. Sanduuqa waa la damiyaa faylalka dhismayaasha hore, sidaas darteed way furmaan sidii ay ahaayeen. Heerarka meel-gaar iyo fallaadaha janjeerka Heer meel-gaar (hal riix) iyo Fallaadaha janjeerka (laba riix) mar kasta akhriyaan dhulka markii la sawirayo: obyect la dhaqaajiyo ama dib loo heerkeeyo, calaamadaha way raacaan. Sifooyinka ku dooro in calaamaddu akhrinayso dhulka la soo jeediyay mise dhulka jira; calaamadaha dhulka jira waxaa lagu muujiyaa qaws. Fallaadahu waxay u tilmaamaan hoos u dhac oo waxay leeyihiin 1:20 (5.0 %).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sag-and-tension","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Hoos-u-dhac iyo tension","summary":"Xaaladaha culeyska (heerkulka, dabaysha, barafka) iyo xaddidaadda tension-ka, sida CivilCraft u xisaabiyo tension-ka qayb kasta, iyo miisaska isku-xirka.","section":"tasks","order":163,"keywords":["sag","tension","xaalad culeys","heerkulka","dabaysha","barafka","barafka dhinac-kaliya","ruling span","equivalent span","isbedelka xaaladda","catenary","miiska isku-xirka","xoogga jabinta","xoogga caadiga ah"],"headings":[{"id":"xaaladaha-culeyska-iyo-xaddidaadda","text":"Xaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadda","level":2},{"id":"packs-xeerarka-iyo-maktabad-dal-ah","text":"Packs: xeerarka iyo maktabad dal ah","level":2},{"id":"sida-tension-ka-loo-xisaabiyo","text":"Sida tension-ka loo xisaabiyo","level":2},{"id":"miisaska-isku-xirka","text":"Miisaska isku-xirka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"xaaladaha-culeyska-iyo-xaddidaadda\"\u003EXaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoad cases and limits…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tafatiraa xeerarka uu mid kasta oo mashruuca ku jira raacayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELoad cases\u003C/strong\u003E: heer (temperature), cadaadis dabaysha ee conductor-ka (Pa), iyo barafka radial-ka (mm, iyo cufnaanteeda). Kiiska koowaad waa tixraaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETension limits\u003C/strong\u003E: qayb ka mid ah xoogga jabinta ee conductor-ka, tension-ka dhexe ama tension-ka ugu weyn ee tiirka, hal xaalad culeys. Ama siiso tension-ka dhexe adigu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EClearances\u003C/strong\u003E: masaafada ay conductor-ku ka hayso dhulka, waddada, dhismaha iwm. Ku dar, magac beddel, ka saar: kuwaagu waa kaaga. Hoosta, dooro xeerarka \u003Cstrong\u003ELandscape plants under a line\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ELandscape walls under a line\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EUnderground crossings\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECases the checks use\u003C/strong\u003E: kiiska ku bixiya hoos-u-dhaca ugu weyn (kulul), beddelka insulator-ka (dabaysha), barafka, iyo barafka dhinac kasta oo tiir ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFactors\u003C/strong\u003E: factor-ka fogaanshaha phase k, beddelka insulator-ka ugu weyn, factor culeyska tiirka iyo fittings, xagasha leexashada ee tiirka xagasha iyo dead-end, daboolka ugu yar ee kaablooyinka hoosta, iyo hoos-u-dhaca voltage-ka ugu weyn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"packs-xeerarka-iyo-maktabad-dal-ah\"\u003EPacks: xeerarka iyo maktabad dal ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxba xeerar dal ah lagu dhisin CivilCraft ma jiraan. \u003Cstrong\u003EPack\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa xeer-jeeg iyo maktabad isku fayl ah (\u003Ccode\u003E.cclinepack.json\u003C/code\u003E), dal, shirkad hawlgal ama shirkad:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi sida pack…\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoad cases and limits…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta wuxuu qoraa xeer-jeeggii la muujiyay iyo maktabaddaada (ama, haddii maktabaddaadu weli madhan tahay, shayada mashruucan isticmaalo). Marka hore qor \u003Cstrong\u003EDal ama gobol\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFur xeer-jeeg ama pack…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa pack, fayl xeer, ama fayl maktabad. Xeerarka pack-ka waa la muujiyaa wada-hadalka (riix \u003Cstrong\u003ECodso\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u isticmaasho), shayadiisana waxay galaan maktabaddaada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPacks-ka kuwa kale la wadaagaan waxaa lagu liistaa bogga kordhinta hoose ee \u003Cstrong\u003EPower line packs\u003C/strong\u003E. Laba pack oo tusaale ah ayaa qaabka tusaaya; ma aha xeerarka dal kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPack kasta waa la hubiyaa marka la furo, sida fayl kasta. Qiime kasta ka hubi heerka khuseeya ka hor intaadan wax dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba xeer-jeeg oo tusaale ah ayaa jira si aad uga bilaabato: \u003Cstrong\u003ETusaale: cimilada qaboow\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ETusaale: cimilada dhexdhexaad\u003C/strong\u003E. Tirooyinkoodu ma ka iman heer kasta: dejiso qiyamka heerkaaga siiyo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave rules\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen rules…\u003C/span\u003E waxay la wadaagaan xeer-jeeg fayl ahaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-tension-ka-loo-xisaabiyo\"\u003ESida tension-ka loo xisaabiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb kasta oo u dhexeeya dead-end-ka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERuling span\u003C/strong\u003E waa √(ΣL³ ÷ ΣL) ee bannaanadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXad kasta waxaa loo beddelaa tension dhexe oo kiiska tixraaca ah, isla-miisaan isbedelka xaaladda ee ruling span-ka: H₂²·(H₂ − H₁ + EA·w₁²L²/(24H₁²) + EA·α·(t₂ − t₁)) = EA·w₂²L²/24. Kan ugu adag ayaa dejiya tension-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETension-ka kiis kasta culeys wuxuu raacaa kaas, bannaan kasta qaabkeeda waa catenary sax ah oo mara labada barta lagu xiro (bannaanada buuraha ku jira ayaa la daba-galay): hoos-u-dhaca laga qaaday chord-ka, dhererka, iyo tension-ka labada dhamaadba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECuleyska mitir kasta kiis kasta: miisaanka iyo barafka (aagga barafka × cufnaanta × g) si toosan; cadaadiska dabaysha × dhexroorka barafka si siman.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaska-isku-xirka\"\u003EMiisaska isku-xirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStringing tables…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa, qayb kasta, tension-ka dhexe iyo hoos-u-dhaca bannaan kasta heerkulka kasta ee xeerarka (−5 °C ilaa 40 °C, 5 °C kasta marka laga bilaabo), hawada aan dhaqdhaqaaqin. Keydi, iyo miiska tiirarka, CSV ahaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELama xisaabin: creep-ka conductor-ka sanadaha, iyo fidinta conductor cusub. Ku dar iyagoo heerkulka kaga dhex mara meelaha aad ku xidhayso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Xaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadda More › Load cases and limits… wuxuu tafatiraa xeerarka uu mid kasta oo mashruuca ku jira raacayo. Load cases: heer (temperature), cadaadis dabaysha ee conductor-ka (Pa), iyo barafka radial-ka (mm, iyo cufnaanteeda). Kiiska koowaad waa tixraaca. Tension limits: qayb ka mid ah xoogga jabinta ee conductor-ka, tension-ka dhexe ama tension-ka ugu weyn ee tiirka, hal xaalad culeys. Ama siiso tension-ka dhexe adigu. Clearances: masaafada ay conductor-ku ka hayso dhulka, waddada, dhismaha iwm. Ku dar, magac beddel, ka saar: kuwaagu waa kaaga. Hoosta, dooro xeerarka Landscape plants under a line, Landscape walls under a line iyo Underground crossings. Cases the checks use: kiiska ku bixiya hoos-u-dhaca ugu weyn (kulul), beddelka insulator-ka (dabaysha), barafka, iyo barafka dhinac kasta oo tiir ah. Factors: factor-ka fogaanshaha phase k, beddelka insulator-ka ugu weyn, factor culeyska tiirka iyo fittings, xagasha leexashada ee tiirka xagasha iyo dead-end, daboolka ugu yar ee kaablooyinka hoosta, iyo hoos-u-dhaca voltage-ka ugu weyn. Packs: xeerarka iyo maktabad dal ah Waxba xeerar dal ah lagu dhisin CivilCraft ma jiraan. Pack wuxuu hayaa xeer-jeeg iyo maktabad isku fayl ah (.cclinepack.json), dal, shirkad hawlgal ama shirkad: Kaydi sida pack… Load cases and limits… hoosta wuxuu qoraa xeer-jeeggii la muujiyay iyo maktabaddaada (ama, haddii maktabaddaadu weli madhan tahay, shayada mashruucan isticmaalo). Marka hore qor Dal ama gobol. Fur xeer-jeeg ama pack… wuxuu akhrinayaa pack, fayl xeer, ama fayl maktabad. Xeerarka pack-ka waa la muujiyaa wada-hadalka (riix Codso si aad u isticmaasho), shayadiisana waxay galaan maktabaddaada. Packs-ka kuwa kale la wadaagaan waxaa lagu liistaa bogga kordhinta hoose ee Power line packs. Laba pack oo tusaale ah ayaa qaabka tusaaya; ma aha xeerarka dal kasta. Pack kasta waa la hubiyaa marka la furo, sida fayl kasta. Qiime kasta ka hubi heerka khuseeya ka hor intaadan wax dhisin. Laba xeer-jeeg oo tusaale ah ayaa jira si aad uga bilaabato: Tusaale: cimilada qaboow iyo Tusaale: cimilada dhexdhexaad. Tirooyinkoodu ma ka iman heer kasta: dejiso qiyamka heerkaaga siiyo. Save rules iyo Open rules… waxay la wadaagaan xeer-jeeg fayl ahaan. Sida tension-ka loo xisaabiyo Qayb kasta oo u dhexeeya dead-end-ka: Ruling span waa √(ΣL³ ÷ ΣL) ee bannaanadiisa. Xad kasta waxaa loo beddelaa tension dhexe oo kiiska tixraaca ah, isla-miisaan isbedelka xaaladda ee ruling span-ka: H₂²·(H₂ − H₁ + EA·w₁²L²/(24H₁²) + EA·α·(t₂ − t₁)) = EA·w₂²L²/24. Kan ugu adag ayaa dejiya tension-ka. Tension-ka kiis kasta culeys wuxuu raacaa kaas, bannaan kasta qaabkeeda waa catenary sax ah oo mara labada barta lagu xiro (bannaanada buuraha ku jira ayaa la daba-galay): hoos-u-dhaca laga qaaday chord-ka, dhererka, iyo tension-ka labada dhamaadba. Culeyska mitir kasta kiis kasta: miisaanka iyo barafka (aagga barafka × cufnaanta × g) si toosan; cadaadiska dabaysha × dhexroorka barafka si siman. Miisaska isku-xirka More › Stringing tables… wuxuu liistaa, qayb kasta, tension-ka dhexe iyo hoos-u-dhaca bannaan kasta heerkulka kasta ee xeerarka (−5 °C ilaa 40 °C, 5 °C kasta marka laga bilaabo), hawada aan dhaqdhaqaaqin. Keydi, iyo miiska tiirarka, CSV ahaan. Lama xisaabin: creep-ka conductor-ka sanadaha, iyo fidinta conductor cusub. Ku dar iyagoo heerkulka kaga dhex mara meelaha aad ku xidhayso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"objects-from-lines","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Shayada laga sameeyo khadadka, oo xiriirka la haayo","summary":"Sameeyo dhagax-saarka, goob dhir lagu beeray, jiko, geed-xidh, jid, derbi, kurbad, tallaabooyin, jid-kor, meel-sare, wadi-biyo ama khad muuqaal laga sameeyo khad; wuu raacaa marka khadku dhaqaajiyo, ilaa aad jebiso xiriirka.","section":"tasks","order":163,"keywords":["ka khad","khadad","xiriir","xiriirka","raac","dib u soo saar","jebi xiriirka","khad muuqaal","khad muuqaal oo khadad ka mid ah","layer la soo geliyey","xuduud","SuperCad Studio","khadka naqshadda"],"headings":[{"id":"khad-muuqaal-oo-laga-sameeyay-xariiq","text":"Khad muuqaal oo laga sameeyay xariiq","level":2},{"id":"gudaha-supercad-studio","text":"Gudaha SuperCad Studio","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiq ka\u003C/span\u003E (Beerta › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E): guji khad muuqaal, ama xariiq ama xuduud layer DWG/DXF ah oo la soo geliyey. Khad xidhan wuxuu samayn karaa dhagax-saar, dhir-cagaar, goob dhir lagu beeray, buuro, dhulka-daboolka, jiko, ama meel-sare; khad furan wuxuu samayn karaa jid yar, derbi, kurbad, tallaabooyin (barta koowaad iyo tan ugu dambeysa), jid-kor, geed-xidh ama wadi-biyo. Labada nooc mid kasta wuxuu samayn karaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekhad muuqaal\u003C/strong\u003E, marka laga reebo khad muuqaal laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khad-muuqaal-oo-laga-sameeyay-xariiq\"\u003EKhad muuqaal oo laga sameeyay xariiq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhad muuqaal oo laga sameeyay xariiq wuxuu qaataa barooyinkiisa, xidhan haddii xariiqii xidhnaa. Heerarkiisa waxa lagu dhejiyaa dhulka jira (0 haddii aan weli jirin), isticmaalkiisana waa \u003Cstrong\u003EOff\u003C/strong\u003E: ma qaabeeyo dhulka ilaa aad doorato isticmaal oo aad dejiso heerarkiisa Properties-ka. Marka xariiqu dhaqaajiyo, khad muuqaal leh tiro barooyin isku mid ah wuu xajiyaa heer kasta oo aad dejisay; marka xariiqu kordhiyo ama yareeyo barooyin, heerarka waa la dhejiyaa dhulka mar kale. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/feature-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/feature-lines\"\u003EKhadadka muuqaalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShayga cusub wuxuu hayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exiriir\u003C/strong\u003E oo xariiqiisa ku xidhan. Marka xariiqu dhaqaajiyo (adigoo jiidaya barooyinkiisa, ama naqshadda la dhaqaajiyo ama dib loo akhriyo), shayga wuxuu qaataa qaabka cusub isla tallaabada undo, dhulka la soo jeediyay wuxuuna raacaa iyada oo loo marayo beddelayaasha dhulka. Properties wuxuu sheegayaa waxa uu ku xidhan yahay; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJebi xiriirka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa mid xor ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqyada waa la hubiyaa marka hore: xariiq waa inuu leeyahay ugu yaraan 2 barood (3 xuduudda), ugu badnaan 5000, lambarro dhab ah, xuduudna waa inuu xidhnaadaa oo aanu isgoyn. Xariiq fashilmaya ma isticmaalmo: shayga wuu sii joogaa sidii hore, panel-ka Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu sheegaa sababta. Haddii xariiqa la tirtiro shayga wuu sii joogaa, panel-ka Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu ku xusaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gudaha-supercad-studio\"\u003EGudaha SuperCad Studio\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur goobta iyo naqshadda 2D mashruuc isku mid ah. Dooro hal xariiq ama polilayn naqshadda 2D, riix Ctrl+K oo socodsii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShay beerta laga sameeyay khadka naqshadda la doortay\u003C/span\u003E: CivilCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa waxa la sameeyo, sida kor, shayguna wuxuu ku xidhan yahay xariiqaas naqshadda. Marka aad khadadka naqshadda beddesho, Ctrl+K \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusbooneysii beerta naqshadda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa in shayaadku raacaan, tallaabo undo mid kasta xariiq. Faylka xiriirka mashruuca wuxuu duubayaa shayga raacaya xariiqa. Caawinta SuperCad Studio waxay leedahay mawduuc Landscape.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Xariiq ka (Beerta › Wax dheeraad ah): guji khad muuqaal, ama xariiq ama xuduud layer DWG/DXF ah oo la soo geliyey. Khad xidhan wuxuu samayn karaa dhagax-saar, dhir-cagaar, goob dhir lagu beeray, buuro, dhulka-daboolka, jiko, ama meel-sare; khad furan wuxuu samayn karaa jid yar, derbi, kurbad, tallaabooyin (barta koowaad iyo tan ugu dambeysa), jid-kor, geed-xidh ama wadi-biyo. Labada nooc mid kasta wuxuu samayn karaa khad muuqaal, marka laga reebo khad muuqaal laftiisa. Khad muuqaal oo laga sameeyay xariiq Khad muuqaal oo laga sameeyay xariiq wuxuu qaataa barooyinkiisa, xidhan haddii xariiqii xidhnaa. Heerarkiisa waxa lagu dhejiyaa dhulka jira (0 haddii aan weli jirin), isticmaalkiisana waa Off: ma qaabeeyo dhulka ilaa aad doorato isticmaal oo aad dejiso heerarkiisa Properties-ka. Marka xariiqu dhaqaajiyo, khad muuqaal leh tiro barooyin isku mid ah wuu xajiyaa heer kasta oo aad dejisay; marka xariiqu kordhiyo ama yareeyo barooyin, heerarka waa la dhejiyaa dhulka mar kale. Eeg Khadadka muuqaalka. Shayga cusub wuxuu hayaa xiriir oo xariiqiisa ku xidhan. Marka xariiqu dhaqaajiyo (adigoo jiidaya barooyinkiisa, ama naqshadda la dhaqaajiyo ama dib loo akhriyo), shayga wuxuu qaataa qaabka cusub isla tallaabada undo, dhulka la soo jeediyay wuxuuna raacaa iyada oo loo marayo beddelayaasha dhulka. Properties wuxuu sheegayaa waxa uu ku xidhan yahay; Jebi xiriirka wuxuu ka dhigaa mid xor ah. Xariiqyada waa la hubiyaa marka hore: xariiq waa inuu leeyahay ugu yaraan 2 barood (3 xuduudda), ugu badnaan 5000, lambarro dhab ah, xuduudna waa inuu xidhnaadaa oo aanu isgoyn. Xariiq fashilmaya ma isticmaalmo: shayga wuu sii joogaa sidii hore, panel-ka Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu sheegaa sababta. Haddii xariiqa la tirtiro shayga wuu sii joogaa, panel-ka Dhibaatooyinka wuxuu ku xusaa. Gudaha SuperCad Studio Fur goobta iyo naqshadda 2D mashruuc isku mid ah. Dooro hal xariiq ama polilayn naqshadda 2D, riix Ctrl+K oo socodsii Shay beerta laga sameeyay khadka naqshadda la doortay: CivilCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa waxa la sameeyo, sida kor, shayguna wuxuu ku xidhan yahay xariiqaas naqshadda. Marka aad khadadka naqshadda beddesho, Ctrl+K Cusbooneysii beerta naqshadda wuxuu sameeyaa in shayaadku raacaan, tallaabo undo mid kasta xariiq. Faylka xiriirka mashruuca wuxuu duubayaa shayga raacaya xariiqa. Caawinta SuperCad Studio waxay leedahay mawduuc Landscape.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"power-line-checks","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Hubinta xariiqyada korontada","summary":"Waxa CivilCraft hubiyo xariiq kasta iyo kable kasta, had iyo jeer cusub: fogaanshaha, masaafada u dhexeysa, dhaqdhaqaaqa, kor-u-kac, culeyska tiirarka iyo cabbirka, xidhiidhyada, culeyska xad-dhaafka ah, xogta maqan, iyo hoos-u-dhaca korontada.","section":"tasks","order":164,"keywords":["hubin","fogaan","fogaanshaha dhulka","caqabad","isgoyn","masaafada u dhexeysa safafka","dhaqdhaqaaqa xadhigga","kor-u-kac","culeyska tiirka","culeyska caadiga ah","cabbir","aasaas","xidh","guy","qalab xidhid","jir-kaabbe","hoos-u-dhac korontada","xad-dhaaf","xog maqan","kala-go'"],"headings":[{"id":"fogaanshaha","text":"Fogaanshaha","level":2},{"id":"fogaanshaha-iyo-dhaqdhaqaaqa","text":"Fogaanshaha iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa","level":2},{"id":"culeyska-tiirarka-iyo-cabbirka","text":"Culeyska tiirarka iyo cabbirka","level":2},{"id":"xogta-xidhiidhyada-iyo-koronto","text":"Xogta, xidhiidhyada iyo koronto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubin\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jira qaybta Xariiqyada korontada wuxuu liistaa dhammaan dhibcaha, oo casaan u ah wixii fashilmaya iyo cagaar-caseri u ah digniinta. Riix mid kasta si aad u doorato xariiqda, tiirka, kaabalka ama qalabka ay khuseyso; tiirarka iyo masaafooyinka fashilmaya waxay ku wareegan yihiin casaan qorshaha inta workspace-ku furan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab naqshadeed: kuwani waa hubinta naqshadaada iyadoo loo eegayo xeerarkaaga, ma aha shahaado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fogaanshaha\"\u003EFogaanshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha ugu hooseeya ee xariiqda ayaa laga raacaa masaafo kasta, culeyska kasta. Fogaanshihiisa ugu hooseeya dhulka waa inuu gaadho \u003Cstrong\u003EXeerka fogaanshaha\u003C/strong\u003E ee xariiqda. Halka masaafada ay isgoyso \u003Cstrong\u003Ecaqabad\u003C/strong\u003E (oo lagu sawiro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaqabad\u003C/span\u003E: dhib ama xariiq, oo leh dhererkeeda dhulka ka sarreeya iyo xeerkeeda fogaanshaha gaarka ah), fogaanshaha ka sarreeya saxanka caqabadda ayaa la hubiyaa isla sidaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWixii workspace-ka Dhulka ka sarreeya ayaa sidoo kale tirinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhirta keligeed (dhirta ka sarreysa ee cabbirka koritaanka iyo dhererka dhamaadka), xaashiyada beeraha iyo meelaha beerta (dhirta ugu sarreysa ee ku jirta) iyo darbiyada (sare-kooban) waa caqabado xariiq hoostiisa, iyada oo aan mar kale la sawirin. Waxay haystaan xeerarka laga dhigay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadda…\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EDhirta dhulka ee xariiqda hoostooda\u003C/strong\u003E (tusaale ahaan qaabka \u003Cem\u003EGeedaha iyo dhirta\u003C/em\u003E, 3 m) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada dhulka ee xariiqda hoostooda\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cem\u003EDhismaha\u003C/em\u003E); dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ELama hubin\u003C/strong\u003E si aad uga reebto. Fogaanshaha waxaa laga qiyaasaa toos ahaan sare, laga bilaabo sare-kooba dhirta ama darbiga ilaa xadhigga markii masaafadu gudubto; masaafada dhinac-dhinac ee taajka dhinaca xariiqda lama hubiyo. Geed la dhaqaajiyo ama darbi la kor u qaadiyo ayaa hubinta isla markiiba beddelaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXeerarka fogaanshahaaga waa kuwaaga; furo oo ka dhig \u003Cstrong\u003EXeerarka…\u003C/strong\u003E ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXeerka fogaanshaha\u003C/span\u003E kasta (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadda…\u003C/span\u003E) si aad u ku darto, u magacdarto, u beddesho ama u tirtirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fogaanshaha-iyo-dhaqdhaqaaqa\"\u003EFogaanshaha iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada u dhexeysa safafka\u003C/strong\u003E ee loo baahan yahay: k·√(sag + dhererka kaabalka) + U/150, iyadoo sag-ka xaaladda kulaylka iyo voltage-ka U oo kV ah lagu xisaabinayo (qaab caadi ah; k waa kan nidaamka xeerkaaga). Waxaa lagu barbardhigaa masaafada u dhexeysa safafka ee dhidibka-tiirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqdhaqaaqa kaabalka\u003C/strong\u003E tiirarka la xirayo, culeyska dabaysha ayaa lagu xisaabinayaa: atan(culeyska dhinaca ÷ culeyska toosan), waxaana lagu barbardhigaa dhaqdhaqaaqa ugu weyn ee xeerka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKor-u-kac\u003C/strong\u003E: tiir la xirayo oo ka hooseeya tiirarka ku xeeran ayaa qabow lagu kici karaa; waa la calaamadiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"culeyska-tiirarka-iyo-cabbirka\"\u003ECuleyska tiirarka iyo cabbirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiir kasta iyo culeyska kasta, iyada oo leeyihiin xariiqda oo dhan ka dhex jiraan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac-ku-hoose\u003C/strong\u003E: dabaysha culeyska mitir kasta × masaafada dabaysha (badhka labada masaafo), oo lagu daro 2·H·sin(jeex ÷ 2) meel jeexdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqda dhererkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E: farqiga xadhigyada labada dhinac meel dhammaad-xidhan ama xagal; tiir la xirayo waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa oo keliya barafta dhinac kaliya (masaafo kasta si gooni ah loo shaqeeyaa, taas oo ka dhigan dhinaca badbaadada).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EToosan\u003C/strong\u003E: culeyska toosan mitir kasta × masaafada miisaanka (u dhexeysa barta ugu hooseeya labada dhinac) iyo qalabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECuleyska heerka waxaa loo gudbiyaa barta magacaabani ee tiirka (culeyska u dhigma = culeyska × dhererka lifaaqa ÷ dhererka barta magacaabani), waxaana lagu barbardhigaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eculeyska magacaabani\u003C/strong\u003E oo lagu dhufto cabbirka xeerka. Haddii uu daciif yahay, tiirka ugu yar ee isla maaddada ee maktabaddaada ku jira oo qaadi karta ayaa la soo jeediyaa. Tiir leh \u003Cstrong\u003Ejir-kaabbe\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa culeyska heerka u gudbiya jir-kaabbe, oo qaadaa culeyska ÷ sin(xagasha jir-kaabbe), waxaana lagu hubiyaa xoogiisa gaarka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka (qabaadka, kaabalada, xarkaha) waxaa lagu hubiyaa culeyskooda la qiimeeyay: qalabka xidhka wuxuu qaadaa xadhigga xadhigga, qalabka kaabalka wuxuu qaadaa qaybtiisa culeyska toosan iyo dhinaca. \u003Cstrong\u003EAasaaska\u003C/strong\u003E la muujiyo waa qoto-dheerka tiirka dhulka hoostiisa iyo god ka ballaadhan sida ballaadhka ugu saldhigga ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xogta-xidhiidhyada-iyo-koronto\"\u003EXogta, xidhiidhyada iyo koronto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay ay ku jirto goob loo baahan yahay oo madhan, ama fure aan maktabadda ku jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaadka route-ka kaabalka, ama qalab, oo aan wax la xidhin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHoos-u-dhaca korontada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ekorontada\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa kasta ilaa (qalabka lagu calaamadiyay ilaha) ilaa culeyska (kW iyo xoojinta awoodda qalabka), iyada oo laga maro safafka ee sare iyo kaablaha: √3·I·L·(R cos φ + X sin φ), oo R ah 20 °C. Waxaa calaamadiyaa wax ka badan cabbirka korontada kaabalka, ama hoos-u-dhac ka badan kan uu xeerku oggol yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Hubin oo ku jira qaybta Xariiqyada korontada wuxuu liistaa dhammaan dhibcaha, oo casaan u ah wixii fashilmaya iyo cagaar-caseri u ah digniinta. Riix mid kasta si aad u doorato xariiqda, tiirka, kaabalka ama qalabka ay khuseyso; tiirarka iyo masaafooyinka fashilmaya waxay ku wareegan yihiin casaan qorshaha inta workspace-ku furan yahay. Qalab naqshadeed: kuwani waa hubinta naqshadaada iyadoo loo eegayo xeerarkaaga, ma aha shahaado. Fogaanshaha Dhibcaha ugu hooseeya ee xariiqda ayaa laga raacaa masaafo kasta, culeyska kasta. Fogaanshihiisa ugu hooseeya dhulka waa inuu gaadho Xeerka fogaanshaha ee xariiqda. Halka masaafada ay isgoyso caqabad (oo lagu sawiro Caqabad: dhib ama xariiq, oo leh dhererkeeda dhulka ka sarreeya iyo xeerkeeda fogaanshaha gaarka ah), fogaanshaha ka sarreeya saxanka caqabadda ayaa la hubiyaa isla sidaas. Wixii workspace-ka Dhulka ka sarreeya ayaa sidoo kale tirinta. Dhirta keligeed (dhirta ka sarreysa ee cabbirka koritaanka iyo dhererka dhamaadka), xaashiyada beeraha iyo meelaha beerta (dhirta ugu sarreysa ee ku jirta) iyo darbiyada (sare-kooban) waa caqabado xariiq hoostiisa, iyada oo aan mar kale la sawirin. Waxay haystaan xeerarka laga dhigay Xaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadda…: Dhirta dhulka ee xariiqda hoostooda (tusaale ahaan qaabka Geedaha iyo dhirta, 3 m) iyo Darbiyada dhulka ee xariiqda hoostooda (Dhismaha); dooro Lama hubin si aad uga reebto. Fogaanshaha waxaa laga qiyaasaa toos ahaan sare, laga bilaabo sare-kooba dhirta ama darbiga ilaa xadhigga markii masaafadu gudubto; masaafada dhinac-dhinac ee taajka dhinaca xariiqda lama hubiyo. Geed la dhaqaajiyo ama darbi la kor u qaadiyo ayaa hubinta isla markiiba beddelaa. Xeerarka fogaanshahaaga waa kuwaaga; furo oo ka dhig Xeerarka… ku xiga Xeerka fogaanshaha kasta (ama Xaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadda…) si aad u ku darto, u magacdarto, u beddesho ama u tirtirto. Fogaanshaha iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa Masaafada u dhexeysa safafka ee loo baahan yahay: k·√(sag + dhererka kaabalka) + U/150, iyadoo sag-ka xaaladda kulaylka iyo voltage-ka U oo kV ah lagu xisaabinayo (qaab caadi ah; k waa kan nidaamka xeerkaaga). Waxaa lagu barbardhigaa masaafada u dhexeysa safafka ee dhidibka-tiirka. Dhaqdhaqaaqa kaabalka tiirarka la xirayo, culeyska dabaysha ayaa lagu xisaabinayaa: atan(culeyska dhinaca ÷ culeyska toosan), waxaana lagu barbardhigaa dhaqdhaqaaqa ugu weyn ee xeerka. Kor-u-kac: tiir la xirayo oo ka hooseeya tiirarka ku xeeran ayaa qabow lagu kici karaa; waa la calaamadiyaa. Culeyska tiirarka iyo cabbirka Tiir kasta iyo culeyska kasta, iyada oo leeyihiin xariiqda oo dhan ka dhex jiraan: Dhinac-ku-hoose: dabaysha culeyska mitir kasta × masaafada dabaysha (badhka labada masaafo), oo lagu daro 2·H·sin(jeex ÷ 2) meel jeexdo. Xariiqda dhererkeeda: farqiga xadhigyada labada dhinac meel dhammaad-xidhan ama xagal; tiir la xirayo waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa oo keliya barafta dhinac kaliya (masaafo kasta si gooni ah loo shaqeeyaa, taas oo ka dhigan dhinaca badbaadada). Toosan: culeyska toosan mitir kasta × masaafada miisaanka (u dhexeysa barta ugu hooseeya labada dhinac) iyo qalabka. Culeyska heerka waxaa loo gudbiyaa barta magacaabani ee tiirka (culeyska u dhigma = culeyska × dhererka lifaaqa ÷ dhererka barta magacaabani), waxaana lagu barbardhigaa culeyska magacaabani oo lagu dhufto cabbirka xeerka. Haddii uu daciif yahay, tiirka ugu yar ee isla maaddada ee maktabaddaada ku jira oo qaadi karta ayaa la soo jeediyaa. Tiir leh jir-kaabbe ayaa culeyska heerka u gudbiya jir-kaabbe, oo qaadaa culeyska ÷ sin(xagasha jir-kaabbe), waxaana lagu hubiyaa xoogiisa gaarka ah. Qalabka (qabaadka, kaabalada, xarkaha) waxaa lagu hubiyaa culeyskooda la qiimeeyay: qalabka xidhka wuxuu qaadaa xadhigga xadhigga, qalabka kaabalka wuxuu qaadaa qaybtiisa culeyska toosan iyo dhinaca. Aasaaska la muujiyo waa qoto-dheerka tiirka dhulka hoostiisa iyo god ka ballaadhan sida ballaadhka ugu saldhigga ah. Xogta, xidhiidhyada iyo koronto Shay ay ku jirto goob loo baahan yahay oo madhan, ama fure aan maktabadda ku jirin. Dhamaadka route-ka kaabalka, ama qalab, oo aan wax la xidhin. Hoos-u-dhaca korontada iyo korontada ilaa kasta ilaa (qalabka lagu calaamadiyay ilaha) ilaa culeyska (kW iyo xoojinta awoodda qalabka), iyada oo laga maro safafka ee sare iyo kaablaha: √3·I·L·(R cos φ + X sin φ), oo R ah 20 °C. Waxaa calaamadiyaa wax ka badan cabbirka korontada kaabalka, ama hoos-u-dhac ka badan kan uu xeerku oggol yahay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"worksheets","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xaashiyada: jadwalo ku xidhan hantida","summary":"Xaashiyo la kaydiyey oo leh safafka geedaha, aagagga beeraha, dhul adag, derbiyo, tallaabooyin, wax-dhaqdhaqaaqa dhulka ama dhammaan tirooyinka; tiirar iyo qaacidooyin aad leedahay, kooxo iyo wadarro; CSV, XLSX iyo miis ku jira xaashiyada, had iyo jeer cusub.","section":"tasks","order":164,"keywords":["xaashi","jadwal","jadwalka geedaha","jadwalka dhul adag","tirooyinka","tiirarka","qaacido","wadar","isku-dar","tiro","kooxda","shaandhee","csv","xlsx","miiska","miiska xaashiga"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/span\u003E (Beerta › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu furaa xaashiyada mashruucan. Markii ugu horeysay, \u003Cstrong\u003Ejadwalka geedaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ejadwalka dhul adag iyo aagagga\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa lagu sameeyaa adiga oo aan wax samayn. Xaashi waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa hantida mar kasta oo la muujinayo, la qoro ama lagu dhigo xaashi: beer kasta oo aad beddesho tirooyinkeeda waxay isbeddelaan meel kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka ka soo bilaabma\u003C/strong\u003E: geedaha (hal safar oo noocyada, cultivar iyo cabbirka kasta), aagagga la beeray, dhul adag, derbiyo, tallaabooyin, wax-dhaqdhaqaaqa dhulka (goyn iyo buuxin), ama dhammaan tirooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E: magac goob (sida \u003Ccode\u003Eqty\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earea\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ebotanical\u003C/code\u003E, ama magac xidhan sida \u003Ccode\u003E[Net area]\u003C/code\u003E) ama qaacido: \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * / ^ %\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&amp;\u003C/code\u003E si qoraal loo isku xidho, \u003Ccode\u003E= &lt;&gt; &lt; &lt;= &gt; &gt;=\u003C/code\u003E, iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esqrt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emax\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eif\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eand\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Econcat\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eupper\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elower\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elen\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etext\u003C/code\u003E. Qaacido aan la xisaabin karin ayaa muujisa \u003Ccode\u003E#ERR\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E#DIV/0\u003C/code\u003E) unugeeda. Qaacidooyinka waxaa akhrisa parser-ka CadCraft; waxba ka mid ah lama socodsiiyo sida code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadar\u003C/strong\u003E tiir kasta (wadar, tiro, celceli, ugu yar, ugu weyn), \u003Cstrong\u003EKooxda\u003C/strong\u003E (wadarro kooxda kasta), iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKeliya safafka halkay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida CSV\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi XLSX ahaan\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhig xaashigan xaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E (Xaashiyada › Xaashiyada wuxuu ku sawiraa miis, oo ku faafa xaashiyo badan sida loo baahdo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha geedaha iyo aagagga waxay isticmaalaan magacyada goobaha isku mid ah (\u003Ccode\u003E{botanical}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{cultivar}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{size}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{qty}\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Xaashiyada (Beerta › Wax dheeraad ah) wuxuu furaa xaashiyada mashruucan. Markii ugu horeysay, jadwalka geedaha iyo jadwalka dhul adag iyo aagagga ayaa lagu sameeyaa adiga oo aan wax samayn. Xaashi waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa hantida mar kasta oo la muujinayo, la qoro ama lagu dhigo xaashi: beer kasta oo aad beddesho tirooyinkeeda waxay isbeddelaan meel kasta. Safafka ka soo bilaabma: geedaha (hal safar oo noocyada, cultivar iyo cabbirka kasta), aagagga la beeray, dhul adag, derbiyo, tallaabooyin, wax-dhaqdhaqaaqa dhulka (goyn iyo buuxin), ama dhammaan tirooyinka. Tiirarka: magac goob (sida qty, area, botanical, ama magac xidhan sida [Net area]) ama qaacido: + - * / ^ %, & si qoraal loo isku xidho, = \u003C\u003E \u003C \u003C= \u003E \u003E=, iyo round, ceil, floor, abs, sqrt, min, max, if, and, or, not, concat, upper, lower, len, text. Qaacido aan la xisaabin karin ayaa muujisa #ERR (ama #DIV/0) unugeeda. Qaacidooyinka waxaa akhrisa parser-ka CadCraft; waxba ka mid ah lama socodsiiyo sida code. Wadar tiir kasta (wadar, tiro, celceli, ugu yar, ugu weyn), Kooxda (wadarro kooxda kasta), iyo Keliya safafka halkay. Kaydi sida CSV, Kaydi XLSX ahaan, iyo Dhig xaashigan xaashiyada (Xaashiyada › Xaashiyada wuxuu ku sawiraa miis, oo ku faafa xaashiyo badan sida loo baahdo). Calaamadaha geedaha iyo aagagga waxay isticmaalaan magacyada goobaha isku mid ah ({botanical}, {cultivar}, {size}, {qty}).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"underground-cables","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Kaablaha hoosta ku jira","summary":"Waddooyinka kaabalka ee tuubooyinka ka dhexeeya taageeraha iyo qalabka, daboolka iyo isgoysyada, isku-xirka sida dhererka drum-ka, iyo tirooyinka tuubada iyo kaabalka.","section":"tasks","order":165,"keywords":["kaabal hoose","waddada kaabalka","tuubo","duct","dabool","isgoys","isgoyska tuubada","isku-xir","drum","kabinet","transformer","il","hoos-u-dhaca voltage"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-waddada-kaabalka","text":"Samee waddada kaabalka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-hubiyo","text":"Waxa la hubiyo","level":2},{"id":"qalabka","text":"Qalabka","level":2},{"id":"tirooyinka","text":"Tirooyinka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-waddada-kaabalka\"\u003ESamee waddada kaabalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka hore qalabka dhig haddii kaabalku ku dhammaado kabinet, transformer ama isku-xir: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaabal\u003C/span\u003E oo guji waddada; bilow iyo dhammaad taageer ama qalab ku xidh si aad ugu xidho. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dhammaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProperties-ka dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKaabalka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENooca tuubada\u003C/strong\u003E, tirada \u003Cstrong\u003Ekaabalada isku-dhinac ah\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eslack\u003C/strong\u003E (%). Waddadu waxay muujinaysaa dhererkeeda, meesha ay ka bilaabanto iyo ku dhammaanto, iyo korontada ay qaadato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-hubiyo\"\u003EWaxa la hubiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabool\u003C/strong\u003E: sare-ka kaabalka oo hoosta dhulka dhinaca waddada, marka la barbar dhigo dabool nooca tuubada (ama heerka ugu yar ee xeerka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoysyada\u003C/strong\u003E: meesha waddadu ku gooyso tuubo CivilCraft ama kaabal kale, farqiga ka dhexeeya iyaga marka la barbar dhigo xeerka fogaanta: \u003Cstrong\u003EFogaanta isgoyska\u003C/strong\u003E ee waddada (Properties) marka aad doorato mid, haddii kale xeerka \u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoysyada hoosta\u003C/strong\u003E ee habka xeerarka (habka tusaalaha wuxuu isticmaalaa \u003Cem\u003EIsgoyska hoosta\u003C/em\u003E, 0.3 m), haddii kale farqiga nooca tuubada ee adeegyada kale. Laba kaabal oo is-gooyaya waxay qaadanayaan kan weyn. Laynka sare ee la gooyo waxaa lagu liis-gareeyaa macluumaad ahaan, kaabalkuna wuxuu ka muuqdaa muuqaalka dherer ee laynkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xirka\u003C/strong\u003E: hal mar dhererka drum kasta ee kaabalka (oo leh dheerayn), marka shayga kaabalka uu siiyo dhererka drum-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabku wuxuu leeyahay shay maktabad, \u003Cstrong\u003Eculeyska\u003C/strong\u003E (kW) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Exaddiga awoodda\u003C/strong\u003E (power factor), wuxuuna noqon karaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eil\u003C/strong\u003E: shabakadu waxaa laga quudinayaa halkaas. Voltage-ka ilku wuxuu ka imanayaa shayga maktabadda, ama laynka ama kaabalka uu quudiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirooyinka\"\u003ETirooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tiriyaa kaabalka (dhererka waddada × (1 + dheerayn) × kaabalada isku-dhinac ah + kor-u-kaca dhamaad kasta), tuubada nooca ahaan, qodista, hoos-u-saarista, buuxinta dib-u-celinta, ducts iyo isku-xirka, iyo kaabalka korka ah ee taageerayaasha iyo qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Samee waddada kaabalka Marka hore qalabka dhig haddii kaabalku ku dhammaado kabinet, transformer ama isku-xir: Qalabka, kadibna guji. Guji Kaabal oo guji waddada; bilow iyo dhammaad taageer ama qalab ku xidh si aad ugu xidho. Enter ayaa dhammaysa. Properties-ka dooro Kaabalka, Nooca tuubada, tirada kaabalada isku-dhinac ah, iyo slack (%). Waddadu waxay muujinaysaa dhererkeeda, meesha ay ka bilaabanto iyo ku dhammaanto, iyo korontada ay qaadato. Waxa la hubiyo Dabool: sare-ka kaabalka oo hoosta dhulka dhinaca waddada, marka la barbar dhigo dabool nooca tuubada (ama heerka ugu yar ee xeerka). Isgoysyada: meesha waddadu ku gooyso tuubo CivilCraft ama kaabal kale, farqiga ka dhexeeya iyaga marka la barbar dhigo xeerka fogaanta: Fogaanta isgoyska ee waddada (Properties) marka aad doorato mid, haddii kale xeerka Isgoysyada hoosta ee habka xeerarka (habka tusaalaha wuxuu isticmaalaa Isgoyska hoosta, 0.3 m), haddii kale farqiga nooca tuubada ee adeegyada kale. Laba kaabal oo is-gooyaya waxay qaadanayaan kan weyn. Laynka sare ee la gooyo waxaa lagu liis-gareeyaa macluumaad ahaan, kaabalkuna wuxuu ka muuqdaa muuqaalka dherer ee laynkaas. Isku-xirka: hal mar dhererka drum kasta ee kaabalka (oo leh dheerayn), marka shayga kaabalka uu siiyo dhererka drum-ka. Qalabka Qalabku wuxuu leeyahay shay maktabad, culeyska (kW) iyo xaddiga awoodda (power factor), wuxuuna noqon karaa il: shabakadu waxaa laga quudinayaa halkaas. Voltage-ka ilku wuxuu ka imanayaa shayga maktabadda, ama laynka ama kaabalka uu quudiyo. Tirooyinka Wax dheeraad ah › Tirooyinka… wuxuu tiriyaa kaabalka (dhererka waddada × (1 + dheerayn) × kaabalada isku-dhinac ah + kor-u-kaca dhamaad kasta), tuubada nooca ahaan, qodista, hoos-u-saarista, buuxinta dib-u-celinta, ducts iyo isku-xirka, iyo kaabalka korka ah ee taageerayaasha iyo qalabka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"landscape-sections","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qaybaha beerta iyo kooxda daabacaadda","summary":"Khadadka qaybta ee dhulka jira iyo dhulka la soo jeediyay, darbiyada leh aasaaskooda, dahaadhka dhagax-dhigista iyo beerta, tallaabooyinka iyo geedaha cabbirkooda buuxa, oo ku yaal xaashiyo gooni ah; hal kooxda daabacaadda oo leh liiska xaashiyada, PDF iyo DWG xaashi kasta.","section":"tasks","order":165,"keywords":["qayb","qayb-jarka","muuqaal dhinac","calaamadda qaybta","khadka qaybta","daabac","kooxda xaashiyada","liiska xaashiyada","diiwaanka naqshadda","kooxda pdf","dwg xaashi kasta"],"headings":[{"id":"kooxda-daabacaadda","text":"Kooxda daabacaadda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevels\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection line\u003C/span\u003E: guji bilowga iyo dhammaadka. Qaybaha waxaa loo magacaabaa A, B, C… (magacyada ku beddel Sifooyinka). Qayb kastaa wuxuu khadkiisa dhexdiisa sawiraa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhulka jira (xariiq jajab ah) iyo dhulka la soo jeediyay;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edarbiyada iyo aasaaskooda, meesha khadku ka gudbo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edahaadhka dhagax-dhigista iyo waddooyinka, iyo dahaadhka iyo ciidda sare ee meelaha beerta (ka dib jarista), oo ka hooseeya dusha dhammaatay;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etallaabooyinka muuqaal ahaan;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Egeedaha khadka masaafada la dejiyay ku dhow, siluyeet ahaan cabbirkooda buuxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESifooyinka ayaa dejiya masaafadaas iyo weyneynta toosan. Daaqadda Xaashiyada, \u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa dhigta xaashi gooni ah, ilaa afar qayb xaashi kasta, mid kasta miisaan caadi ah oo ku habboon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kooxda-daabacaadda\"\u003EKooxda daabacaadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPublish set (.zip)\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda Xaashiyada ayaa samaysa, hal .zip ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehal PDF oo ku furmaya \u003Cstrong\u003Eliiska xaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna xaashi kasta oo beerta ah, oo lambarkoodu yahay L-1, L-2… (beerdhigga, sare-u-qaadista, biyo-qulqulka, faahfaahinta, qaybaha, xaashiyada shaqada);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG xaashi qorshe kasta\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh lakabyadeeda (magacyada \u003Ccode\u003EL-*\u003C/code\u003E la ilaaliyaa) iyo DWG qayb-naqshad kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhad qayb kasta oo ku jira qorshaha wuxuu sheegayaa xaashiga uu ku yaal (\u003Ccode\u003EA / L-5\u003C/code\u003E). Lambarka mar walba waxaa laga xisaabiyaa kooxda, sidaas darteed darbi-ku-dartida, ka-saarista ama magac-bedelka qaybaha ayaa lambarada dib u tiriya.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Levels › Section line: guji bilowga iyo dhammaadka. Qaybaha waxaa loo magacaabaa A, B, C… (magacyada ku beddel Sifooyinka). Qayb kastaa wuxuu khadkiisa dhexdiisa sawiraa: dhulka jira (xariiq jajab ah) iyo dhulka la soo jeediyay; darbiyada iyo aasaaskooda, meesha khadku ka gudbo; dahaadhka dhagax-dhigista iyo waddooyinka, iyo dahaadhka iyo ciidda sare ee meelaha beerta (ka dib jarista), oo ka hooseeya dusha dhammaatay; tallaabooyinka muuqaal ahaan; geedaha khadka masaafada la dejiyay ku dhow, siluyeet ahaan cabbirkooda buuxa. Sifooyinka ayaa dejiya masaafadaas iyo weyneynta toosan. Daaqadda Xaashiyada, Qaybaha ayaa dhigta xaashi gooni ah, ilaa afar qayb xaashi kasta, mid kasta miisaan caadi ah oo ku habboon. Kooxda daabacaadda Publish set (.zip) daaqadda Xaashiyada ayaa samaysa, hal .zip ah: hal PDF oo ku furmaya liiska xaashiyada, kadibna xaashi kasta oo beerta ah, oo lambarkoodu yahay L-1, L-2… (beerdhigga, sare-u-qaadista, biyo-qulqulka, faahfaahinta, qaybaha, xaashiyada shaqada); DWG xaashi qorshe kasta oo leh lakabyadeeda (magacyada L-* la ilaaliyaa) iyo DWG qayb-naqshad kasta. Khad qayb kasta oo ku jira qorshaha wuxuu sheegayaa xaashiga uu ku yaal (A / L-5). Lambarka mar walba waxaa laga xisaabiyaa kooxda, sidaas darteed darbi-ku-dartida, ka-saarista ama magac-bedelka qaybaha ayaa lambarada dib u tiriya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"power-line-outputs","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Miiskooyinka xariiqyada korontada, tirooyinka, xaashiyada iyo GIS","summary":"Miiskooyinka isku xirka iyo tiirarka, tirooyinka alaabta spreadsheet ama TakeoffCraft, xaashiyada qorshaha iyo muuqaalka dherer iyo warbixin daraasad oo PDF keliya, iyo layers-ka GIS oo leh xogta tiir kasta.","section":"tasks","order":166,"keywords":["miiska isku xirka","miiska tiirarka","tirooyinka","liiska alaabta","takeoffcraft","xaashiyada","warbixin","pdf","xaashiga muuqaalka dherer","gis","geopackage","shapefile","geojson","kml"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWixii halkan ku jira oo dhan waxaa laga helaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Xariiqyada korontada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiijada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad heleysid\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiskooyinka isku xirka…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha kasta, xoogga toosan ee dhulka iyo hoos-u-dhaca safka kasta heerkulka kasta; kaydi sida CSV. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi miisaska taageerooyinka (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E: doorka tiir kasta, alaabteeda, dhulka, lifaaqa, culeyska ugu weyn, magacaabani, OK, soo jeedinta, aasaaska, dhaqdhaqaaqa, kor-u-kac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirooyinka…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadhigga (dhererka isku xirka × xadhigyada × wareegyada + 2 % kaabal-dhexeeyaha iyo dhammaad-xidhan), tiirarka iyo qalabka oo alaabta maktabada; kaabalka, jidka, qodista, dhuumaha, isku xirka. CSV, Excel, ama faylka tirooyinka TakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiyada iyo warbixinta…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal PDF: qorshaha; xaashi muuqaalka dherer oo loogu talagalay xariiq kasta, oo xadhigga leh culeyska aad doorato iyo xariiq dherer safafka, dhererka, hoosaha iyo fogaanshaha ugu hooseeya; iyo warbixin daraasad (xeerka, qaybaha, miiskooyinka isku xirka, tiirarka, hubin kasta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi GIS…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiirarka, safafka, route-yada kaabalka, qalabka iyo caqabadaha sida layers leh xogtooda (dherer, culeyska, hoosaha, fogaanshaha, wixii fashilma), sida GeoPackage, shapefiles, GeoJSON, KML ama KMZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeoJSON iyo KML waxay u baahan yihiin nidaamka kala-sarrayn ee mashruuca (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coordinate-systems\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coordinate-systems\"\u003ENidaamyada kala-sarrayn\u003C/a\u003E); aanu jirin, GeoPackage iyo shapefiles waxay qaadaan tirooyinka mashruuca gudihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Wixii halkan ku jira oo dhan waxaa laga helaa Wax dheeraad ah kooxda Xariiqyada korontada. Natiijada Waxa aad heleysid Miiskooyinka isku xirka… Qaybaha kasta, xoogga toosan ee dhulka iyo hoos-u-dhaca safka kasta heerkulka kasta; kaydi sida CSV. Kaydi miisaska taageerooyinka (CSV): doorka tiir kasta, alaabteeda, dhulka, lifaaqa, culeyska ugu weyn, magacaabani, OK, soo jeedinta, aasaaska, dhaqdhaqaaqa, kor-u-kac Tirooyinka… Xadhigga (dhererka isku xirka × xadhigyada × wareegyada + 2 % kaabal-dhexeeyaha iyo dhammaad-xidhan), tiirarka iyo qalabka oo alaabta maktabada; kaabalka, jidka, qodista, dhuumaha, isku xirka. CSV, Excel, ama faylka tirooyinka TakeoffCraft Xaashiyada iyo warbixinta… Hal PDF: qorshaha; xaashi muuqaalka dherer oo loogu talagalay xariiq kasta, oo xadhigga leh culeyska aad doorato iyo xariiq dherer safafka, dhererka, hoosaha iyo fogaanshaha ugu hooseeya; iyo warbixin daraasad (xeerka, qaybaha, miiskooyinka isku xirka, tiirarka, hubin kasta) Dhoofi GIS… Tiirarka, safafka, route-yada kaabalka, qalabka iyo caqabadaha sida layers leh xogtooda (dherer, culeyska, hoosaha, fogaanshaha, wixii fashilma), sida GeoPackage, shapefiles, GeoJSON, KML ama KMZ GeoJSON iyo KML waxay u baahan yihiin nidaamka kala-sarrayn ee mashruuca (Nidaamyada kala-sarrayn); aanu jirin, GeoPackage iyo shapefiles waxay qaadaan tirooyinka mashruuca gudihiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"power-line-study-file","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Faylalka daraasadda barnaamij kale oo xariiqyada (.DON)","summary":"Kaydi hal xariiq oo overhead ah sida fayl daraasad .DON, ama akhri tiirarka mid ka mid ah xariiq cusub. Barnaamijka akhrisa lagama tijaabin.","section":"tasks","order":167,"keywords":["don",".don","faylka daraasadda","xml","dhoofi","soo dhoofi","barnaamijka xariiqyada sare","isku-xirka","canton"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-fayl-daraasad","text":"Kaydi fayl daraasad","level":2},{"id":"akhri-fayl-daraasad","text":"Akhri fayl daraasad","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBarnaamijyada xariiqyada sare qaarkood daraasadda waxay ku kaydiyaan fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.DON\u003C/code\u003E (qoraal XML ah). CivilCraft wuxuu hal xariiq ku qori karaa sida faylkaas, wuxuuna akhrin karaa tiirarka mid ka mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELama tijaabin.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxaan ku dhisnay liis magacyada goobaha qaabka oo isticmaale uu wadaagay, ma aha fayl dhab ah, mana aanaan furin faylashayada barnaamijka akhrisa. Halkaas ku fur faylka oo hubi qiimo kasta ka hor intaadan isticmaalin. Haddii aad wadaagi karto fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.DON\u003C/code\u003E (oo macluumaadka macmiilka laga saaray), waa caawin weyn inaan saxno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-fayl-daraasad\"\u003EKaydi fayl daraasad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqda ku sii xadhig oo hubi inay leedahay natiijooyin (ma jirto &quot;not worked out&quot; ee Properties-ka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi fayl daraasad (.DON)…\u003C/span\u003E, dooro xariiqda, ku dar sharraxaad iyo lambarka shaqada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi faylka barashada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylku wuxuu ka kooban yahay tiirarka xariiqda (isku-xirka, dhulka, dherer, doorka, dhinac-ku-hoose, tiirka la ilaaliyay ama la soo jeediyay, culeyska mid kasta oo culeyska, aasaaska), qayb kasta oo u dhexeysa dhammaad-xidhanka (xadhiga, voltage-ka, ruling span, safafka, xoogga iyo parameter-ka catenary, xoogga ugu weyn ee culeyska kasta) iyo miiskooyinka isku xirka. Dherer waxaa lagu qoraa mitir, xoogga daN; qoraalka waxaa lagu qoraa Latin-1, sidaas darteed xaraf kasta oo ka baxsan waxaa loo beddelaa \u003Ccode\u003E?\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-fayl-daraasad\"\u003EAkhri fayl daraasad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur fayl daraasad (.DON)…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrisaa tiirarka xariiq cusub ah. Xadhigga, tiirarka iyo dhinaca-ku-hoose waxaa lagu daraa maktabaddaada magacyadooda; wixii aan la helin waxaa laga tagaa inaad dooratid Properties-ka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Barnaamijyada xariiqyada sare qaarkood daraasadda waxay ku kaydiyaan fayl .DON (qoraal XML ah). CivilCraft wuxuu hal xariiq ku qori karaa sida faylkaas, wuxuuna akhrin karaa tiirarka mid ka mid ah. Lama tijaabin. Waxaan ku dhisnay liis magacyada goobaha qaabka oo isticmaale uu wadaagay, ma aha fayl dhab ah, mana aanaan furin faylashayada barnaamijka akhrisa. Halkaas ku fur faylka oo hubi qiimo kasta ka hor intaadan isticmaalin. Haddii aad wadaagi karto fayl .DON (oo macluumaadka macmiilka laga saaray), waa caawin weyn inaan saxno. Kaydi fayl daraasad Xariiqda ku sii xadhig oo hubi inay leedahay natiijooyin (ma jirto \"not worked out\" ee Properties-ka). Wax dheeraad ah › Kaydi fayl daraasad (.DON)…, dooro xariiqda, ku dar sharraxaad iyo lambarka shaqada. Kaydi faylka barashada. Faylku wuxuu ka kooban yahay tiirarka xariiqda (isku-xirka, dhulka, dherer, doorka, dhinac-ku-hoose, tiirka la ilaaliyay ama la soo jeediyay, culeyska mid kasta oo culeyska, aasaaska), qayb kasta oo u dhexeysa dhammaad-xidhanka (xadhiga, voltage-ka, ruling span, safafka, xoogga iyo parameter-ka catenary, xoogga ugu weyn ee culeyska kasta) iyo miiskooyinka isku xirka. Dherer waxaa lagu qoraa mitir, xoogga daN; qoraalka waxaa lagu qoraa Latin-1, sidaas darteed xaraf kasta oo ka baxsan waxaa loo beddelaa ?. Akhri fayl daraasad Wax dheeraad ah › Fur fayl daraasad (.DON)… wuxuu akhrisaa tiirarka xariiq cusub ah. Xadhigga, tiirarka iyo dhinaca-ku-hoose waxaa lagu daraa maktabaddaada magacyadooda; wixii aan la helin waxaa laga tagaa inaad dooratid Properties-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"solar-arrays","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dhig safmaalka qorraxda dhulka","summary":"Dhig miisaska qorraxda ee dhulka lagu rakibo gudaha farqad ama aas, iyadoo safafka loo kala fogeeyay dhulka ay mid kasta si dhab ah ugu taagan tahay, dhulka janjeerka leh oo banaan, tamarta sanadka la xisaabiyo, miisaskana khariidadda iyo 3D lagu muujiyo.","section":"tasks","order":190,"keywords":["qorrax","pv","photovoltaic","safmaal","dhulka lagu rakibo","miisaska","safafka","fogaanta safafka","hooska","dhulka","janjeerka","tiirarka","wax soo saar","kWp","tamarta","bannaanka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontid","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid","level":2},{"id":"dhig-miisaska","text":"Dhig miisaska","level":2},{"id":"safafku-waxay-u-kala-fogaadaan-dhulka","text":"Safafku waxay u kala fogaadaan dhulka","level":2},{"id":"tamarta-sanadka","text":"Tamarta sanadka","level":2},{"id":"kaydi","text":"Kaydi","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-dhisin","text":"Wali lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida loo dhigo goob miisaska qorraxda ah dhul aan siman, iyo waxa tirooyinka ka dhigan yihiin. Ka furo Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Safmaalka qorraxda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-miisaska\"\u003EDhig miisaska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMeesha\u003C/strong\u003E: farqad ama aas ka mid ah mashruuca, ama qor geesaha aagga. Calaamadi farqad kasta ama aas kasta oo ku tiirsan inay \u003Cstrong\u003Ebanaan\u003C/strong\u003E ahaato (dhismo, balli).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003Elatitude iyo longitude\u003C/strong\u003E ee goobta. Qorraxdu way ku xidhan tahay iyaga; wax lagu male-yeeyo ma jiro. Haddii mashruucu leeyahay nidaamka isku-xirka, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa qaado nidaamka isku-xirka\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa buuxin doona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji janjeerka, u jeedka (meel bannaan waxay u jeedaa khadka dhexe), inta module ay miis ka dhigan tahay, iyo awoodda iyo cabirka module-ka. Tirooyinka module-ka waxay ka bilaabmaan qiyam guud, oo sidaas loo calaamadiyey; ku qor kuwaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003EDhig miisaska\u003C/strong\u003E. Daaqaddu waxay siinaysaa tirada miisaska iyo module-ka, cabirka kWp, iyo masaafada safka ilaa safka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiis kasta waa tiir ku jirta aagga, oo laga bilaabo hore loo dhigo, dabadeedna dib loo socodsiiyo. Miis waxaa lagu dhigi karaa oo kaliya meel ay dhulka hoostiisa ku jiro xadka janjeerka, gudaha aagga iyo masaafada laga dhowro xadka, iyo meel ay tiirarkeeda u baahan tahay aanay ka sarreyn xadka aad dejisay. Meelaha fashilma waa la reebaa, daaqaddana waxay sheegaysaa inta ay yihiin iyo sababta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"safafku-waxay-u-kala-fogaadaan-dhulka\"\u003ESafafku waxay u kala fogaadaan dhulka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhul siman, safafku waxay u kala fogaadaan xeerka caadiga ah ee aan hooska lahayn: hooska safka duhurka xilliga qaboobaha (winter solstice) ma gaarayo geeska hoose ee safka ka dambeeya. Janjeer ah, CivilCraft wuxuu xeerkaas ku dabaqaa dhulka uu safka xiga si dhab ah ugu taagan yahay. Meel dhulku ka kor kacayo miis ka dambeeya, safafku way isku dhowaan karaan; meel uu ka hooseeyo, way ka fogaadaan. Daaqaddu waxay muujinaysaa masaafada ugu dhow, ugu fogsan iyo celceliska safafka, iyo masaafada dhul siman, si aad u aragto waxa dhulku sameeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha miiska waxaa lagu kor qaadaa tiirarka ilaa tusaale kasta oo hoostiisa ku jira uu dhulka ka sarreeyo fogaanta aad dejisay. Tiirka ugu dheer ayaa natiijada ku muuqda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tamarta-sanadka\"\u003ETamarta sanadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETamarta sanadka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu xisaabiyaa iftiinka dusha janjeertay maalin matalaysa bil kasta, heerkulka unugga, hoos-u-dhaca aad qortay, miisaska oo isku hooshaya, iyo buuraha bannaanka ku jira oo qorraxda qaadaya ee ay qarinayaan. Cirku waa cir cad, sidaas darteed jawaabtu waa xadka sare; cimilada dhabta ah way ka yaraan. Waa qiyaas hore-naqshadeed, ma aha warbixin wax soo saarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa gelinta iyo tirooyinka faylka mashruuca; miisaska waxaa dib dhulka laga xisaabiyaa marka faylka la furo, sidaas darteed dusha la beddelo ayaa wuu dhaqaajiyaa. Waxay muuqdaan khariidadda iyo 3D (Muuji › Safmaalka qorraxda). Liiska miisaska wuxuu soo dejiyaa CSV. Hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho ayaa ka saara ama soo celinaysa hal safmaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXogta cimilada halkii cirka cad, miisaska u raacaya dhulka jihada bari-galbeed, socodsiiyeyaasha (trackers), iyo naqshadeynta korontada (xadhkaha, waayirka, inverter-ka) ee CivilCraft. Pane-ka Solar PV ee BimCraft wuxuu leeyahay xadhkaha iyo khadka hal (one-line) ee saqafyada.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid Sida loo dhigo goob miisaska qorraxda ah dhul aan siman, iyo waxa tirooyinka ka dhigan yihiin. Ka furo Dusha › Wax dheeraad ah › Safmaalka qorraxda. Dhig miisaska Dooro Meesha: farqad ama aas ka mid ah mashruuca, ama qor geesaha aagga. Calaamadi farqad kasta ama aas kasta oo ku tiirsan inay banaan ahaato (dhismo, balli). Qor latitude iyo longitude ee goobta. Qorraxdu way ku xidhan tahay iyaga; wax lagu male-yeeyo ma jiro. Haddii mashruucu leeyahay nidaamka isku-xirka, Ka qaado nidaamka isku-xirka ayaa buuxin doona. Deji janjeerka, u jeedka (meel bannaan waxay u jeedaa khadka dhexe), inta module ay miis ka dhigan tahay, iyo awoodda iyo cabirka module-ka. Tirooyinka module-ka waxay ka bilaabmaan qiyam guud, oo sidaas loo calaamadiyey; ku qor kuwaaga. Riix Dhig miisaska. Daaqaddu waxay siinaysaa tirada miisaska iyo module-ka, cabirka kWp, iyo masaafada safka ilaa safka. Miis kasta waa tiir ku jirta aagga, oo laga bilaabo hore loo dhigo, dabadeedna dib loo socodsiiyo. Miis waxaa lagu dhigi karaa oo kaliya meel ay dhulka hoostiisa ku jiro xadka janjeerka, gudaha aagga iyo masaafada laga dhowro xadka, iyo meel ay tiirarkeeda u baahan tahay aanay ka sarreyn xadka aad dejisay. Meelaha fashilma waa la reebaa, daaqaddana waxay sheegaysaa inta ay yihiin iyo sababta. Safafku waxay u kala fogaadaan dhulka Dhul siman, safafku waxay u kala fogaadaan xeerka caadiga ah ee aan hooska lahayn: hooska safka duhurka xilliga qaboobaha (winter solstice) ma gaarayo geeska hoose ee safka ka dambeeya. Janjeer ah, CivilCraft wuxuu xeerkaas ku dabaqaa dhulka uu safka xiga si dhab ah ugu taagan yahay. Meel dhulku ka kor kacayo miis ka dambeeya, safafku way isku dhowaan karaan; meel uu ka hooseeyo, way ka fogaadaan. Daaqaddu waxay muujinaysaa masaafada ugu dhow, ugu fogsan iyo celceliska safafka, iyo masaafada dhul siman, si aad u aragto waxa dhulku sameeyay. Dusha miiska waxaa lagu kor qaadaa tiirarka ilaa tusaale kasta oo hoostiisa ku jira uu dhulka ka sarreeyo fogaanta aad dejisay. Tiirka ugu dheer ayaa natiijada ku muuqda. Tamarta sanadka Tamarta sanadka wuxuu xisaabiyaa iftiinka dusha janjeertay maalin matalaysa bil kasta, heerkulka unugga, hoos-u-dhaca aad qortay, miisaska oo isku hooshaya, iyo buuraha bannaanka ku jira oo qorraxda qaadaya ee ay qarinayaan. Cirku waa cir cad, sidaas darteed jawaabtu waa xadka sare; cimilada dhabta ah way ka yaraan. Waa qiyaas hore-naqshadeed, ma aha warbixin wax soo saarka. Kaydi Kaydi mashruuca wuxuu kaydiyaa gelinta iyo tirooyinka faylka mashruuca; miisaska waxaa dib dhulka laga xisaabiyaa marka faylka la furo, sidaas darteed dusha la beddelo ayaa wuu dhaqaajiyaa. Waxay muuqdaan khariidadda iyo 3D (Muuji › Safmaalka qorraxda). Liiska miisaska wuxuu soo dejiyaa CSV. Hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho ayaa ka saara ama soo celinaysa hal safmaal. Wali lama dhisin Xogta cimilada halkii cirka cad, miisaska u raacaya dhulka jihada bari-galbeed, socodsiiyeyaasha (trackers), iyo naqshadeynta korontada (xadhkaha, waayirka, inverter-ka) ee CivilCraft. Pane-ka Solar PV ee BimCraft wuxuu leeyahay xadhkaha iyo khadka hal (one-line) ee saqafyada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Ka timid software kale oo dhismaha dhulka","summary":"Sida nidaamyada naqshadeynta dhismaha dhulka ee caadiga ah ula mid yihiin CivilCraft, iyo kala duwanaanshaha ku dhaca isticmaalayaasha waayo-aragnimada leh saacadda ugu horreysa.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["beddelka","u guurid","caadi","kala duwanaansho","nidaamka shaqada","amarrada","khariidad","cogo","corridor","simaynta dhulka","pipe network","qaababka","command line"],"headings":[{"id":"khariidadda-shaqada","text":"Khariidadda shaqada","level":2},{"id":"kala-duwanaanshaha-dadka-ku-dhacaya","text":"Kala duwanaanshaha dadka ku dhacaya","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ka-maqan","text":"Waxa ka maqan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad isticmaashay Civil 3D, waad ogtahay fikradaha CivilCraft: dhibcaha iyo kooxyada dhibcaha, dusha TIN oo leh xariiqyada jebinta iyo xuduudaha, jid-hagayaasha PI-yada, muuqaalka dherer ee PVI-yada, assemblies oo lagu kala saaray corridor-ka, simaynta dhulka ilaa daylight, shabakadda tuubooyinka xagga-dhaqaajinta, LandXML. Waxa kala duwan waa intii ku wareegsan oo dhan: ma jiro faylka naqshadda, ma jiro sadar amar (marka aadan dooran qaabka menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting classic\u003C/span\u003E), ma jiro qaababka, ma jiro Prospector, iyo ma jiro daaqadaha dejinta. CivilCraft waa qalab yar oo xoog leh oo ku jira brawsar, oo nooca hadda uu sameeyo qayb yar oo ka mid ah wixii shaqada dhismaha dhulka buuxa sameeyaa. Bogaggan wuxuu ku qabanqaabinayaa waxa aad og tahay meesha uu ku yaal halkan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad jeceshahay ribbon-ka Civil 3D, dooro qaabka menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECivil ribbon\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E: tabs-ka Home, Surfaces, Modify, Geolocation, View iyo Output, badhanka dhexe wuu dul marayaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh badhanka dhexe wuu wareegaa muuqaalka 3D. Haddii aad qorto amarro, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting classic\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa command line (ALIGNMENT, PAD, PROFILE, ZOOM …). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khariidadda-shaqada\"\u003EKhariidadda shaqada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad rabto inaad samayso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHabka caadiga ah\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo geli dhibcaha sahanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo geli dhibcaha qaab fayl dhibic\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E, ka dib hubi tirtirka tiirarka \u003Cstrong\u003EImport points\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003ESoo geli dhibcaha sahanka\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKala saar dhibcaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxyada dhibcaha, furayaasha sharaxaadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxyo toos ah oo ku salaysan ereyga koowaad ee sharaxaadda; ma jiraan furayaal sharaxaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir dhibic\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatiraha dhibcaha, gacmo-qabasho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji oo ku qor Properties, ama jiid (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/edit-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/edit-points\"\u003ETafatir dhibic sahan\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhis dhulka jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee dusha, ku dar kooxyada dhibcaha xog ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToos: dusha waa dib loo dhisayaa marka aan gelinta isbeddelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar xariiqyada jebinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar xariiqyada jebinta polylines ama feature lines ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDejin kooxda dhibcaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreakline\u003C/span\u003E, ama guji dhibcaha qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreakline\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJar dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadka dibadda, xadka qarsan, dherer saddex-geesle oo ugu weyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBoundary\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, dibadda keliya) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ELongest outside edge\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuji xariiqyada heerka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDisplay\u003C/strong\u003E ee dhinaca bidix: waqtiga u dhexeeya, major every, labels, bands, falaadhaha jiifka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorso xariiqa dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka abuurista jid-hagaha, dejinta wareega iyo spiraalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlignment\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): guji PI-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; radius-ka iyo dherarka spiraalka miiska PI\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee muuqaal dherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWizard-ka muuqaalka dherer, bands\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProfile\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): hal muuqaal dherer oo ka hooseeya qorshaha, had iyo jeer la habeeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadee heerka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka qorshaha heerka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart from the ground\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd PVIs\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), jiid PVI-yada, qor \u003Cstrong\u003ECurve L\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhis waddo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssembly, subassemblies, corridor, targets, regions\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003ESweep an assembly along the design profile\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta jid-hagaha; xariiq, garbaha iyo jiif kasta dhinac, ama dhinac kasta oo laga dhisay qaybo (gutter, curb, sidewalk …)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESimaynta pad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeature lines, kooxaha simaynta, shuruudaha simaynta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPad\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): pad fidsan oo leh jiifka goynta iyo buuxinta ilaa daylight\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXisaabi shaqada dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVolume surfaces, dashboard-ka mugga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca midig, habka grid, wuu cusboonaadaa isla markiiba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorso storm ama sanitary\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakadda tuubada oo leh liis qaybaha, xeerarka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPipes\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): guji qaab-dhismeedyada downstream; saddex xeerar oo aad dejiso; inverts-ka otomaatig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIs-weydaarso xogta kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELandXML soo geli iyo dhoofin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E faylka LandXML; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandXML\u003C/span\u003E si aad u dhoofiso (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landxml\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landxml\"\u003EIs-weydaarso LandXML\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDir xariiqyada CAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofin DWG\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG\u003C/span\u003E (qaabka 2000 ilaa 2018) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF\u003C/span\u003E (R12)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaabac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELayouts, viewports, sheet sets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E: hal xaashi oo dhererka qorshaha ah oo miisaan la doortay; qorshaha iyo goynta xaashiyada PDF ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadaag shaqada faylalka kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EData shortcuts, references\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jirto: hal mashruuc hal fayl\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUndo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, 200 tallaabo; dejinta bandhigga ma aha tallaabo ka noqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-duwanaanshaha-dadka-ku-dhacaya\"\u003EKala duwanaanshaha dadka ku dhacaya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro command line\u003C/strong\u003E marka aadan dooran qaabka menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting classic\u003C/span\u003E. Qalabyadu waa badhamo toolbar iyo xarfo keliya: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jid-hagaha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pad, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tuubooyin, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xariiqa jebinta, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xadka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E muuqaal dherer, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku dar PVI, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dooro, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E fit. Qaabka menu-ga kale, qorista magaca amarka waxba ma samayso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEnter wuu dhammaysiiyaa; laba jeer guji waa khatar.\u003C/strong\u003E Guji dhibicda ugu dambeysa hal mar, ka dibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Daabacaadan laba jeer guji ayaa sidoo kale dhammaysta, laakiin wuxuu tirtiraa dhibicda aad laba jeer gujisay. Guji midig ma dhammaysto ama ma ku celinayo, waxay kaliya dul mariyaa marka aad jiidayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa oo dhan waa firfircoon, mar walba.\u003C/strong\u003E Beddel kooxda dhibcaha, radius, PVI ama jiifka pad, dusha, contours, corridor, daylight lines iyo mugyadu isla markiiba way cusboonaadaan. Ma jiro wax dib loo dhisaa, ma jirto wax duugoobay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba ma aha shay naqshad.\u003C/strong\u003E Qorshuhu waa muuqaal naqshadeyn, ma aha naqshad aad ku tafatiri karto amarrada CAD. Ma ku dari kartid xariiq ama qoraal, ma beddeli kartid midabka lakabka, ma jebin kartid wax. Dhoofi DXF oo dhammaystir naqshada barnaamij CAD ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro qaababka.\u003C/strong\u003E Midabyada, khadadka culeyska, cabbirrada labels-ka iyo magacyada lakabyada waa go&#039;an yihiin (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plan-layers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plan-layers\"\u003ELakabyada qorshaha\u003C/a\u003E). Paper iyo Model ee app bar-ka waxay u beddelaan shaashad iftiin ah iyo mid mugdi ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMid kasta hal.\u003C/strong\u003E Hal dusha dhulka jira, hal natiijo simayn, hal shabakad tuubooyin mashruuc kasta. Jid-hagayaal iyo pad badan waa wanaagsan yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnit-yadu waa calaamado.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooranaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUS feet\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMetres\u003C/span\u003E ma beddelo wax. Ma jiro miisaan naqshad. Nidaamka isku-xirka waa ikhtiyaari: deji hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECoordinates\u003C/span\u003E oo waxba ma dhaqdhaqaaqo, kaliya wuxuu sheegaa macnaha lambarrada (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coordinate-systems\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coordinate-systems\"\u003EDejinta nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E). Feet waxaa loo tixgeliyaa feet sahan US ah markii lagu qorayo LandXML.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKooxaha xariiqa jebinta waxay ku biiraan tirada dhibicda.\u003C/strong\u003E Kooxda loo dejiyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreakline\u003C/span\u003E waxay noqotaa hal xariiq oo dhan dhibcahooda, tirada ay leeyihiin. Koodyo wadaag ah (laba xariiq socod oo labaduba la yiraahdo &quot;FL&quot;) waxay sameeyaan hal xariiq zig-zag; kuwaas gacanta ku sawir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStations-ku waa isku mid, mitirku waa kala duwan.\u003C/strong\u003E Feet waxay isticmaalaan stations 100 ft ah (12+34.56); mitirka waxay isticmaalaan stations 1000 m ah (1+234.567).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtirka Mac-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Furaha Mac-ka oo lagu sheegay delete waa Backspace brawsarka. Isticmaal Fn iyo delete, ama badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E, si aad u tirtirto wax la doortay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylashu waa soo dejin.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E mar kasta; ma jiro &quot;kaydi ku qor faylka furan&quot;. Nuqul soo kabasho oo shaqada aan la kaydin ayaa lagu kaydiyaa brawsarkan (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003ESoo kabso shaqada aan la kaydin\u003C/a\u003E). Furidda faylka dhibcaha waxay beddeshaa dhibcaha adigoon la weydiinin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/files\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/files\"\u003EFaylalka aad furi, kaydi iyo dhoofin karto\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXeerarku waa kaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Xeerarka shabakadda tuubooyinka iyo assembly-ga corridor-ka waxay ku bilaabmaan qiyam placeholder ah oo aan caadi ahayn. Dejiso kuwaaga ka hor intaadan isku halayn hubin kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMugyadu waxay ku saleysan yihiin grid-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Goynta iyo buuxinta waxay ka imanayaan grid nadiif ah oo u dhexeeya labada dusha, gudaha xariiqyada daylight, iyada oo aan swell ama shrink jirin. Waxay u dhow yihiin laakiin ma aha isku mid TIN-to-TIN.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ka-maqan\"\u003EWaxa ka maqan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESpiraalyo aan clothoid ahayn, assemblies oo isbeddelaya jidka dhexdiisa, pad-yada jiifka, awoodda sooca iyo kaydinta, catalogs-ka qaybaha, tuubooyinka muuqaalka dherer, naqshadaha qeybta dhulka iyo cabbirka lot, isku-dheelitirka least-squares iyo kaydka sahanka, furidda DWG, iyo wax kale oo badan. Liiska dhamaystiran, iyo waxa loo baahan yahay maanta, waa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli ma la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Haddii aad isticmaashay Civil 3D, waad ogtahay fikradaha CivilCraft: dhibcaha iyo kooxyada dhibcaha, dusha TIN oo leh xariiqyada jebinta iyo xuduudaha, jid-hagayaasha PI-yada, muuqaalka dherer ee PVI-yada, assemblies oo lagu kala saaray corridor-ka, simaynta dhulka ilaa daylight, shabakadda tuubooyinka xagga-dhaqaajinta, LandXML. Waxa kala duwan waa intii ku wareegsan oo dhan: ma jiro faylka naqshadda, ma jiro sadar amar (marka aadan dooran qaabka menu-ga Drafting classic), ma jiro qaababka, ma jiro Prospector, iyo ma jiro daaqadaha dejinta. CivilCraft waa qalab yar oo xoog leh oo ku jira brawsar, oo nooca hadda uu sameeyo qayb yar oo ka mid ah wixii shaqada dhismaha dhulka buuxa sameeyaa. Bogaggan wuxuu ku qabanqaabinayaa waxa aad og tahay meesha uu ku yaal halkan. Haddii aad jeceshahay ribbon-ka Civil 3D, dooro qaabka menu-ga Civil ribbon ee Settings › CivilCraft › Menus, keys and mouse: tabs-ka Home, Surfaces, Modify, Geolocation, View iyo Output, badhanka dhexe wuu dul marayaa, Shift oo leh badhanka dhexe wuu wareegaa muuqaalka 3D. Haddii aad qorto amarro, Drafting classic wuxuu ku daraa command line (ALIGNMENT, PAD, PROFILE, ZOOM …). Eeg Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Khariidadda shaqada Waxa aad rabto inaad samayso Habka caadiga ah CivilCraft Soo geli dhibcaha sahanka Soo geli dhibcaha qaab fayl dhibic Open, ka dib hubi tirtirka tiirarka Import points (Soo geli dhibcaha sahanka) Kala saar dhibcaha Kooxyada dhibcaha, furayaasha sharaxaadda Kooxyo toos ah oo ku salaysan ereyga koowaad ee sharaxaadda; ma jiraan furayaal sharaxaad Tafatir dhibic Tafatiraha dhibcaha, gacmo-qabasho Guji oo ku qor Properties, ama jiid (Tafatir dhibic sahan) Dhis dhulka jira Samee dusha, ku dar kooxyada dhibcaha xog ahaan Toos: dusha waa dib loo dhisayaa marka aan gelinta isbeddelo Ku dar xariiqyada jebinta Ku dar xariiqyada jebinta polylines ama feature lines ka Dejin kooxda dhibcaha Breakline, ama guji dhibcaha qalabka Breakline (B) Jar dusha Xadka dibadda, xadka qarsan, dherer saddex-geesle oo ugu weyn Boundary (O, dibadda keliya) iyo Longest outside edge Muuji xariiqyada heerka Qaabka dusha Display ee dhinaca bidix: waqtiga u dhexeeya, major every, labels, bands, falaadhaha jiifka Qorso xariiqa dhexe Qalabka abuurista jid-hagaha, dejinta wareega iyo spiraalka Alignment (A): guji PI-yada, Enter; radius-ka iyo dherarka spiraalka miiska PI Samee muuqaal dherer Wizard-ka muuqaalka dherer, bands Profile (R): hal muuqaal dherer oo ka hooseeya qorshaha, had iyo jeer la habeeyay Naqshadee heerka Qalabka qorshaha heerka Start from the ground, Add PVIs (I), jiid PVI-yada, qor Curve L Dhis waddo Assembly, subassemblies, corridor, targets, regions Calaamadi Sweep an assembly along the design profile hoosta jid-hagaha; xariiq, garbaha iyo jiif kasta dhinac, ama dhinac kasta oo laga dhisay qaybo (gutter, curb, sidewalk …) Simaynta pad Feature lines, kooxaha simaynta, shuruudaha simaynta Pad (G): pad fidsan oo leh jiifka goynta iyo buuxinta ilaa daylight Xisaabi shaqada dhulka Volume surfaces, dashboard-ka mugga Earthwork dhinaca midig, habka grid, wuu cusboonaadaa isla markiiba Qorso storm ama sanitary Shabakadda tuubada oo leh liis qaybaha, xeerarka Pipes (P): guji qaab-dhismeedyada downstream; saddex xeerar oo aad dejiso; inverts-ka otomaatig Is-weydaarso xogta kale LandXML soo geli iyo dhoofin Open faylka LandXML; LandXML si aad u dhoofiso (Is-weydaarso LandXML) Dir xariiqyada CAD Dhoofin DWG DWG (qaabka 2000 ilaa 2018) ama DXF (R12) Daabac Layouts, viewports, sheet sets PDF: hal xaashi oo dhererka qorshaha ah oo miisaan la doortay; qorshaha iyo goynta xaashiyada PDF ahaan Wadaag shaqada faylalka kale Data shortcuts, references Ma jirto: hal mashruuc hal fayl Ka noqo Undo Ctrl+Z iyo Ctrl+Y, 200 tallaabo; dejinta bandhigga ma aha tallaabo ka noqo Kala duwanaanshaha dadka ku dhacaya Ma jiro command line marka aadan dooran qaabka menu-ga Drafting classic. Qalabyadu waa badhamo toolbar iyo xarfo keliya: A jid-hagaha, G pad, P tuubooyin, B xariiqa jebinta, O xadka, R muuqaal dherer, I ku dar PVI, V dooro, F fit. Qaabka menu-ga kale, qorista magaca amarka waxba ma samayso. Eeg Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Enter wuu dhammaysiiyaa; laba jeer guji waa khatar. Guji dhibicda ugu dambeysa hal mar, ka dibna riix Enter. Daabacaadan laba jeer guji ayaa sidoo kale dhammaysta, laakiin wuxuu tirtiraa dhibicda aad laba jeer gujisay. Guji midig ma dhammaysto ama ma ku celinayo, waxay kaliya dul mariyaa marka aad jiidayso. Waxa oo dhan waa firfircoon, mar walba. Beddel kooxda dhibcaha, radius, PVI ama jiifka pad, dusha, contours, corridor, daylight lines iyo mugyadu isla markiiba way cusboonaadaan. Ma jiro wax dib loo dhisaa, ma jirto wax duugoobay. Waxba ma aha shay naqshad. Qorshuhu waa muuqaal naqshadeyn, ma aha naqshad aad ku tafatiri karto amarrada CAD. Ma ku dari kartid xariiq ama qoraal, ma beddeli kartid midabka lakabka, ma jebin kartid wax. Dhoofi DXF oo dhammaystir naqshada barnaamij CAD ah. Ma jiro qaababka. Midabyada, khadadka culeyska, cabbirrada labels-ka iyo magacyada lakabyada waa go'an yihiin (eeg Lakabyada qorshaha). Paper iyo Model ee app bar-ka waxay u beddelaan shaashad iftiin ah iyo mid mugdi ah. Mid kasta hal. Hal dusha dhulka jira, hal natiijo simayn, hal shabakad tuubooyin mashruuc kasta. Jid-hagayaal iyo pad badan waa wanaagsan yihiin. Unit-yadu waa calaamado. Dooranaya US feet ama Metres ma beddelo wax. Ma jiro miisaan naqshad. Nidaamka isku-xirka waa ikhtiyaari: deji hoosta Coordinates oo waxba ma dhaqdhaqaaqo, kaliya wuxuu sheegaa macnaha lambarrada (eeg Dejinta nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca). Feet waxaa loo tixgeliyaa feet sahan US ah markii lagu qorayo LandXML. Kooxaha xariiqa jebinta waxay ku biiraan tirada dhibicda. Kooxda loo dejiyay Breakline waxay noqotaa hal xariiq oo dhan dhibcahooda, tirada ay leeyihiin. Koodyo wadaag ah (laba xariiq socod oo labaduba la yiraahdo \"FL\") waxay sameeyaan hal xariiq zig-zag; kuwaas gacanta ku sawir. Stations-ku waa isku mid, mitirku waa kala duwan. Feet waxay isticmaalaan stations 100 ft ah (12+34.56); mitirka waxay isticmaalaan stations 1000 m ah (1+234.567). Tirtirka Mac-ka. Furaha Mac-ka oo lagu sheegay delete waa Backspace brawsarka. Isticmaal Fn iyo delete, ama badhanka Delete, si aad u tirtirto wax la doortay. Faylashu waa soo dejin. Save wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl .civilcraft.json mar kasta; ma jiro \"kaydi ku qor faylka furan\". Nuqul soo kabasho oo shaqada aan la kaydin ayaa lagu kaydiyaa brawsarkan (Soo kabso shaqada aan la kaydin). Furidda faylka dhibcaha waxay beddeshaa dhibcaha adigoon la weydiinin. Eeg Faylalka aad furi, kaydi iyo dhoofin karto. Xeerarku waa kaaga. Xeerarka shabakadda tuubooyinka iyo assembly-ga corridor-ka waxay ku bilaabmaan qiyam placeholder ah oo aan caadi ahayn. Dejiso kuwaaga ka hor intaadan isku halayn hubin kasta. Mugyadu waxay ku saleysan yihiin grid-ka. Goynta iyo buuxinta waxay ka imanayaan grid nadiif ah oo u dhexeeya labada dusha, gudaha xariiqyada daylight, iyada oo aan swell ama shrink jirin. Waxay u dhow yihiin laakiin ma aha isku mid TIN-to-TIN. Waxa ka maqan Spiraalyo aan clothoid ahayn, assemblies oo isbeddelaya jidka dhexdiisa, pad-yada jiifka, awoodda sooca iyo kaydinta, catalogs-ka qaybaha, tuubooyinka muuqaalka dherer, naqshadaha qeybta dhulka iyo cabbirka lot, isku-dheelitirka least-squares iyo kaydka sahanka, furidda DWG, iyo wax kale oo badan. Liiska dhamaystiran, iyo waxa loo baahan yahay maanta, waa Weli ma la dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","summary":"Gaabinta furayaasha iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa mouse, trackpad iyo taabashada ee CivilCraft oo dhan, kooxaha loo dhigay, iyo farqiga browser-ka iyo nidaamka.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["furayaasha","gaabinta","hotkeys","furayaasha","mouse","trackpad","taabashada","pan","zoom","pinch","wheel","right-click","mac","furaha command"],"headings":[{"id":"faylasha-iyo-tafatirka","text":"Faylasha iyo tafatirka","level":2},{"id":"qalabka","text":"Qalabka","level":2},{"id":"intii-aad-sawirayso","text":"Intii aad sawirayso","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-qorshaha","text":"Muuqaalka qorshaha","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-profile","text":"Muuqaalka profile","level":2},{"id":"shaashadda-iyo-caawimaadda","text":"Shaashadda iyo caawimaadda","level":2},{"id":"mouse-trackpad-iyo-taabasho","text":"Mouse, trackpad iyo taabasho","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-browser-ku-ku-guuleysto","text":"Furayaasha browser-ku ku guuleysto","level":2},{"id":"halka-guuri-ku-jirto","text":"Halka Guuri ku jirto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha xarfa keliya ayaa shaqeeya marka aadan ku qorin sanduuq. Gaabinta leh \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay isticmaalaan Command Mac-ka iyo Ctrl meelaha kale. Eeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha browser-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-iyo-tafatirka\"\u003EFaylasha iyo tafatirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFicilka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur fayl barta, LandXML ama mashruuc\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi mashruuca (wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command P\"\u003E⌘P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorshaha ku rasm PDF (wuxuu furaa wada-hadalka rasmka, ma aha daabacaadda browser-ka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir barooyinka sahanka la doortay, xariiqda, padka, qaabka, tuubada ama PVI\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee barooyinka sahanka la doortay (sidoo kale safafka barta ee spreadsheet-ka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJar barooyinka sahanka la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji barooyinka: waxay raacaan taliska, riix meesha ay tagayaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji meeshaas: isku-xidhka barooyinka laftooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul ka samee barooyinka la doortay: nuqulku wuxuu raacaa taliska\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro barooyinka sahan kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidna ma dooro (oo joojin dhajinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command P\"\u003E⌘P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E way shaqeeyaan xitaa intaad sanduuq ku qorayso. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sanduuqa qorista waxay ka noqdaan qorista aad qortay halkii, sida caadiga ah, sidaas oo kale \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: sanduuqa waxay nuqulaan, jaraan, dhajiyaan oo dooran qoraalkiisa. Qoraal la doortay bogga (panel-ka) \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu nuqulaa qoraalkaas. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wax ma sameeyo CivilCraft: isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFuraha Mac ee lagu calaamadeeyay \u003Cstrong\u003Edelete\u003C/strong\u003E browser-ka wuxuu u yahay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Si aad u tirtirto xulasho, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Fn iyo delete), ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E menu-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka sare.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/span\u003E: masaafooyin, aagag iyo janjeerro qorshaha (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/measure\"\u003EQiyaas\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJid-hagaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPadka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETuubooyinka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXadka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuji ama qari muuqaalka profile-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShid ama dami \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar PVI-yo\u003C/span\u003E (wuxuu furaa muuqaalka profile-ka haddii la xirey)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E: muuji wax walba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E: muuji goobta 3D, ama dib u noqo qorshaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuji ama qari janjeerrada iyo sare-geedka xariiq kasta (shaashadda oo keliya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMar kale furaha qalabka firfircoon riix, dib ayuu ugu noqdaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E. Xarfaha leh Shift wax ma sameeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"intii-aad-sawirayso\"\u003EIntii aad sawirayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFicilka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammee jid-hagaha, padka, tuubada, xariiqa jabinta ama xadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar barta ugu dambaysa ee la riixay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqda sifada: shid ama dami qalooca (ka dib geesta, riix barta qalooca, kadibna dhamaadkiisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJooji sawirka (ama dhajinta); mar labaad la riixo (ama wax la sawirin), dib u noqo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E oo nadiifi xulashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-qorshaha\"\u003EMuuqaalka qorshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha ama ficil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiija\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWheel-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee ama yaree taliska ku yaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid meel bannaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaaqi (qalab kasta; riix gaaban wali waa riix; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo la hayo wuxuu sawiraa sanduuq xulasho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaaqi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaaqi (liis ma furmo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaaqi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro (adiga oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E), ama dhig barta (qalab sawir)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo riix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar barta sahanka xulashada, ama ka saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir sanduuq: barooyinka sahanka gudahooda waa lagu daraa xulashada. Ku jiid goobahooda si aad u hesho \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/lasso-selection\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/lasso-selection\"\u003Elasso\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E intii lasso la sawirayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqad, markaas isgoyn, markaas xayndaab\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix intii la dhajinayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig barooyinka dhajiska meeshaas (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dhigaa isku-xidhkooda laftooda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid gripka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaaqi PI, geesta padka ama qaabka (hal tallaabo ka noqosho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaaqi, marka qorshuhu xoogga leeyahay (marka hore riix)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee iyo yaree dhexda, marka qorshuhu xoogga leeyahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFuraha = wuxuu weynaysaa sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, sidaas darteed uma baahnid Shift.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-profile\"\u003EMuuqaalka profile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFicil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiija\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar PVI-yo\u003C/span\u003E oo shidan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar PVI meeshaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix PVI\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid PVI\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaaqi (hal tallaabo ka noqosho)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar PVI la doortay (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kaliya marka muuqaalka profile-ku xoogga leeyahay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka profile-ku ma weynaado ma dhaqaaqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashadda-iyo-caawimaadda\"\u003EShaashadda iyo caawimaadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFicilka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur ama xir caawimaadan (dhinaca); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawimaad\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare wuxuu sameeyaa isla\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXir panel-ka caawimaadda marka uu furan yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg hab-shaashadaha: shaashad buuxa, shaashad buuxa oo xariijimaha qarsan, caadi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa bax shaashad buuxa (furaha browser-ka laftiisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu gaaraa caawimaadda ka hor inta CivilCraft aanu arkin, sidaas darteed waxay shaqeysaa qalab kasta. Kiiboodhka Mac badankiisa, riix fn oo F1, ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawimaad\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa furaha Control nidaam kasta, oo ay ku jiro Mac. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/help\" data-topic=\"basics/help\"\u003EIsticmaalka caawimaadda\u003C/a\u003E si aad uga raadiso caawimaadan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-trackpad-iyo-taabasho\"\u003EMouse, trackpad iyo taabasho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWheel-ku wuxuu weynaysaa taliska hortiisa. Mouse oo wheel-kiisu si xor ah u wareegaayo wuu si degdeg ah u weynaysaa: u sii wareegyo gaaban.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaaqi jiid kasta oo meel bannaan ah, badhanka dhexe, badhanka midig, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETrackpad-ka Mac-ka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiidista laba farood \u003Cstrong\u003Eweynaysa\u003C/strong\u003E (ma dhaqaaqo), iyo cabbirka ku-qabsashada ayaa sidoo kale weynaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u dhaqaaqdo, riix oo jiid meel bannaan oo hal farood, ama hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix laba farood (riix midig) ma furo liis, mana samayso wax keligiis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaashadda taabashada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabashada koowaad badhamada iyo safafka liiska waxay noqdaan cabbir farood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo si aad u doorato ama aad u dhigto barta; hal farood oo jiidaysa meel bannaan wuu dhaqaajiyaa. Taabashadu way ka gariiri kartaa yar: waxay dhaqaajinaysaa kaliya marka farooshu ku dhaqaaqo qiyaastii 10 pixels.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba farood ku qabso si aad u weynaysid, oo ku dhaqaaq wada si aad u dhaqaajiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid grip ama PVI hal farood. Gripku wuxuu qaadaa ballaca farood oo ku wareegsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad sawirayso jid-hagaha, padka, xariiqa jabinta, xadka, tuubada, xariiqa sifada ama parcel-ka, bar ku yaal qorshaha ayaa soo bandhigaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammee\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo dhibicda\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Riix dheer (nus ilbiriqsi oo aan dhaqaajin) ayaa sidoo kale dhammeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E dhexdeeda, riix dheer barta sahanka ayaa ku darta xulashada, ama ka saara, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+riix sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka 3D, hal farood wareegi, laba farood ku qabso oo dhaqaajiyo, taabashadu waxay doortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabashada ma jirto hover, sidaas darteed akhrinta sadarka xaaladda waxay cusboonaysiiyaa kaliya intaad farooshu hoos u taagan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-browser-ku-ku-guuleysto\"\u003EFurayaasha browser-ku ku guuleysto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha qaarkood waxay yihiin browser-ka oo marna CivilCraft ma gaaraan, tusaale ahaan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (xir tab), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (tab cusub), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (daaqad cusub) iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F11\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (shaashad buuxa browser-yada Windows iyo Linux). CivilCraft ma isticmaalo. Haddii gaabintu wax kale ku furto browser-ka, riix qorshaha hal mar si bogga xoogga u yeesho, kadibna isku day mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-guuri-ku-jirto\"\u003EHalka Guuri ku jirto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa jiro amar Guuri: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E oo jiid barta ama geesta, ama tafatir isku-xidhkeeda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/edit-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/edit-points\"\u003ETafatir barooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Furayaasha xarfa keliya ayaa shaqeeya marka aadan ku qorin sanduuq. Gaabinta leh Ctrl waxay isticmaalaan Command Mac-ka iyo Ctrl meelaha kale. Eeg sidoo kale Furayaasha browser-ka. Faylasha iyo tafatirka Furaha Ficilka Ctrl+O Fur fayl barta, LandXML ama mashruuc Ctrl+S Kaydi mashruuca (wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl .civilcraft.json) Ctrl+P Qorshaha ku rasm PDF (wuxuu furaa wada-hadalka rasmka, ma aha daabacaadda browser-ka) Ctrl+Z Ka noqo Ctrl+Y Samee mar kale Delete Tirtir barooyinka sahanka la doortay, xariiqda, padka, qaabka, tuubada ama PVI Ctrl+C Koobiyee barooyinka sahanka la doortay (sidoo kale safafka barta ee spreadsheet-ka) Ctrl+X Jar barooyinka sahanka la doortay Ctrl+V Dhaji barooyinka: waxay raacaan taliska, riix meesha ay tagayaan Ctrl+Shift+V Dhaji meeshaas: isku-xidhka barooyinka laftooda Ctrl+D Nuqul ka samee barooyinka la doortay: nuqulku wuxuu raacaa taliska Ctrl+A Dooro barooyinka sahan kasta Esc Midna ma dooro (oo joojin dhajinta) Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O iyo Ctrl+P way shaqeeyaan xitaa intaad sanduuq ku qorayso. Ctrl+Z iyo Ctrl+Y sanduuqa qorista waxay ka noqdaan qorista aad qortay halkii, sida caadiga ah, sidaas oo kale Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V iyo Ctrl+A: sanduuqa waxay nuqulaan, jaraan, dhajiyaan oo dooran qoraalkiisa. Qoraal la doortay bogga (panel-ka) Ctrl+C wuxuu nuqulaa qoraalkaas. Ctrl+Shift+Z wax ma sameeyo CivilCraft: isticmaal Ctrl+Y ama badhanka Samee mar kale. Furaha Mac ee lagu calaamadeeyay delete browser-ka wuxuu u yahay Backspace. Si aad u tirtirto xulasho, riix Delete (Fn iyo delete), ama dooro Tirtir menu-ka Wax dheeraad ah ee qalabka sare. Qalabka Furaha Qalabka V Dooro M Qiyaas: masaafooyin, aagag iyo janjeerro qorshaha (Qiyaas) A Jid-hagaha G Padka P Tuubooyinka B Xarriiqa jabinta O Xadka R Muuji ama qari muuqaalka profile-ka I Shid ama dami Ku dar PVI-yo (wuxuu furaa muuqaalka profile-ka haddii la xirey) F Ku habee: muuji wax walba D 3D: muuji goobta 3D, ama dib u noqo qorshaha E Muuji ama qari janjeerrada iyo sare-geedka xariiq kasta (shaashadda oo keliya) Mar kale furaha qalabka firfircoon riix, dib ayuu ugu noqdaa Dooro. Xarfaha leh Shift wax ma sameeyaan. Intii aad sawirayso Furaha Ficilka Enter Dhammee jid-hagaha, padka, tuubada, xariiqa jabinta ama xadka Backspace Ka saar barta ugu dambaysa ee la riixay C Xariiqda sifada: shid ama dami qalooca (ka dib geesta, riix barta qalooca, kadibna dhamaadkiisa) Esc Jooji sawirka (ama dhajinta); mar labaad la riixo (ama wax la sawirin), dib u noqo Dooro oo nadiifi xulashada Muuqaalka qorshaha Furaha ama ficil Natiija Wheel-ka Weynee ama yaree taliska ku yaal Jiid meel bannaan Dhaqaaqi (qalab kasta; riix gaaban wali waa riix; Shift oo la hayo wuxuu sawiraa sanduuq xulasho) Jiid badhanka dhexe Dhaqaaqi Jiid badhanka midig Dhaqaaqi (liis ma furmo) Space iyo jiid Dhaqaaqi Riix Dooro (adiga oo Dooro), ama dhig barta (qalab sawir) Shift iyo riix Ku dar barta sahanka xulashada, ama ka saar Shift iyo jiid Sawir sanduuq: barooyinka sahanka gudahooda waa lagu daraa xulashada. Ku jiid goobahooda si aad u hesho lasso Space intii lasso la sawirayo Daaqad, markaas isgoyn, markaas xayndaab Riix intii la dhajinayo Dhig barooyinka dhajiska meeshaas (Enter wuxuu dhigaa isku-xidhkooda laftooda) Jiid gripka Dhaqaaqi PI, geesta padka ama qaabka (hal tallaabo ka noqosho) ↑ ↓ ← → Dhaqaaqi, marka qorshuhu xoogga leeyahay (marka hore riix) + iyo − Weynee iyo yaree dhexda, marka qorshuhu xoogga leeyahay Furaha = wuxuu weynaysaa sida +, sidaas darteed uma baahnid Shift. Muuqaalka profile Ficil Natiija Riix Ku dar PVI-yo oo shidan Ku dar PVI meeshaas Riix PVI Dooro Jiid PVI Dhaqaaqi (hal tallaabo ka noqosho) Delete ama Backspace Ka saar PVI la doortay (Backspace kaliya marka muuqaalka profile-ku xoogga leeyahay) Muuqaalka profile-ku ma weynaado ma dhaqaaqo. Shaashadda iyo caawimaadda Furaha Ficilka F1 Fur ama xir caawimaadan (dhinaca); Caawimaad qalabka sare wuxuu sameeyaa isla Esc Xir panel-ka caawimaadda marka uu furan yahay Ctrl+Shift+F Wareeg hab-shaashadaha: shaashad buuxa, shaashad buuxa oo xariijimaha qarsan, caadi Esc Ka bax shaashad buuxa (furaha browser-ka laftiisa) F1 wuxuu gaaraa caawimaadda ka hor inta CivilCraft aanu arkin, sidaas darteed waxay shaqeysaa qalab kasta. Kiiboodhka Mac badankiisa, riix fn oo F1, ama riix Caawimaad. Ctrl+Shift+F wuxuu isticmaalaa furaha Control nidaam kasta, oo ay ku jiro Mac. Eeg Isticmaalka caawimaadda si aad uga raadiso caawimaadan. Mouse, trackpad iyo taabasho Wheel-ku wuxuu weynaysaa taliska hortiisa. Mouse oo wheel-kiisu si xor ah u wareegaayo wuu si degdeg ah u weynaysaa: u sii wareegyo gaaban. Dhaqaaqi jiid kasta oo meel bannaan ah, badhanka dhexe, badhanka midig, ama Space iyo jiid. Trackpad-ka Mac-ka: Jiidista laba farood weynaysa (ma dhaqaaqo), iyo cabbirka ku-qabsashada ayaa sidoo kale weynaysa. Si aad u dhaqaaqdo, riix oo jiid meel bannaan oo hal farood, ama hay Space oo jiid. Riix laba farood (riix midig) ma furo liis, mana samayso wax keligiis. Shaashadda taabashada: Taabashada koowaad badhamada iyo safafka liiska waxay noqdaan cabbir farood. Taabo si aad u doorato ama aad u dhigto barta; hal farood oo jiidaysa meel bannaan wuu dhaqaajiyaa. Taabashadu way ka gariiri kartaa yar: waxay dhaqaajinaysaa kaliya marka farooshu ku dhaqaaqo qiyaastii 10 pixels. Laba farood ku qabso si aad u weynaysid, oo ku dhaqaaq wada si aad u dhaqaajiso. Jiid grip ama PVI hal farood. Gripku wuxuu qaadaa ballaca farood oo ku wareegsan. Intaad sawirayso jid-hagaha, padka, xariiqa jabinta, xadka, tuubada, xariiqa sifada ama parcel-ka, bar ku yaal qorshaha ayaa soo bandhigaya Dhammee (Enter), Ka noqo dhibicda (Backspace) iyo Jooji (Esc). Riix dheer (nus ilbiriqsi oo aan dhaqaajin) ayaa sidoo kale dhammeeya. Dooro dhexdeeda, riix dheer barta sahanka ayaa ku darta xulashada, ama ka saara, sida Shift+riix sameeyo. Muuqaalka 3D, hal farood wareegi, laba farood ku qabso oo dhaqaajiyo, taabashadu waxay doortaa. Taabashada ma jirto hover, sidaas darteed akhrinta sadarka xaaladda waxay cusboonaysiiyaa kaliya intaad farooshu hoos u taagan tahay. Furayaasha browser-ku ku guuleysto Furayaasha qaarkood waxay yihiin browser-ka oo marna CivilCraft ma gaaraan, tusaale ahaan Ctrl+W (xir tab), Ctrl+T (tab cusub), Ctrl+N (daaqad cusub) iyo F11 (shaashad buuxa browser-yada Windows iyo Linux). CivilCraft ma isticmaalo. Haddii gaabintu wax kale ku furto browser-ka, riix qorshaha hal mar si bogga xoogga u yeesho, kadibna isku day mar kale. Halka Guuri ku jirto Ma jiro amar Guuri: dooro Dooro oo jiid barta ama geesta, ama tafatir isku-xidhkeeda Sifooyinka. Eeg Tafatir barooyinka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","summary":"Dooro habka menyuga ee ku habboon sida aad hore u shaqeyso, siiso amar kasta furaha gaarka ah, u wareeji amarrada tabbada ribbon-ka, oo deji waxa dabka iyo badhamada mouse-ka ay sameeyaan sawirka iyo 3D.","section":"reference","order":12,"keywords":["habka menyuga","menyuyaasha","ribbon","ribbon-ka dhismaha","qalabka sare","sadarka amarka","qorista qadiimiga ah","furayaasha gaboodka","furayaasha","habayn","dib u habayn","mouse","dabka","badhanka dhexe","badhanka midig","guuri","wareeg","dhoofi","soo deji","hoos u dhac","jihada weynaynta","ku caadaysan"],"headings":[{"id":"saddexda-habka","text":"Saddexda habka","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-mid-adiga","text":"Ka dhig mid adiga","level":2},{"id":"mouse","text":"Mouse","level":2},{"id":"iska-qaado","text":"Iska qaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmarrada CivilCraft waxay isku mid yihiin hab kasta oo aad ku gaadhid. \u003Cstrong\u003EHabka menyuga\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaliya go&#039;aaminayaa meesha ay ku taallo shaashadda, magaca ay ku leeyihiin halkaas iyo furayaasha ay socodsiiyaan, si aad u sii haysato dabeecadaha aad hore u leedahay. Dooro mid ku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/span\u003E; isbeddelku wuu degdegaa, browserkan wuu xasuustaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saddexda-habka\"\u003ESaddexda habka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad heleysid\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka sare ee CivilCraft (Faylka, Dhoofi, Dusha, Naqshadeyn, Tafatir, GIS, Muuqaal) iyo furayaasha keli ah: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E khadka waddada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pad, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tuubooyinka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E khadka jejebinta, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xuduudda, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E khadka muuqaalka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E muuqaal dherer, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E goynta, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E simaynta, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E 3D, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku habee, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dooro. Bilowga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorista qadiimiga ah\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERibbon yar (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuriga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax soo saar\u003C/span\u003E) iyo sadar amar, oo loogu talagalay dadka amarrada qoraa: ALIGNMENT, PAD, PIPE, FEATURELINE, BREAKLINE, PROFILE, SECTIONS, U (ka noqo), ZOOM, 3D, PLOT, LANDXML, XATTACH, MAPIMPORT, HELP. Bilow qorista meel kasta, xarfaha waxay u gudbaan sadarka amarka; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu socodsiiyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka aan wax la dooran wuxuu soo celinayaa amarkii u dambeeyay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu nadiifiyaa. Badhanka dhexe wuu guuraa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon-ka dhismaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETabyo oo badho waaweyn ah sida naqshadaha dhismaha ee bardaamaha ee u kooxeeya qalabkooda: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuriga\u003C/span\u003E (xogta dhulka, abuur naqshad, muuqaalka dherer iyo goynta), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDushyada\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJuqraafiga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax soo saar\u003C/span\u003E, oo leh menyu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E iyo badho dhakhso ah midig. Furayaasha keli ah way sii jiraan. Badhanka dhexe wuxuu guuraa sawirka; 3D badhanka dhexe wuu guuraa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh badhanka dhexe wuxuu wareegaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka kasta wuxuu hayaa furayaasha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command P\"\u003E⌘P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur ku jira qaabka CivilCraft oo habkaaga loo siiyay amar kale ma samaynayso wax, xariiqa xaaladdana wuxuu sheegaa meesha amarkiisa u gudbay (\\&quot;Furayaashayda, Pad waa Ctrl+Alt+G\\&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo fallaadhaha had iyo jeer way hayaan macnahooda, furayaashuna xariiqa aad sawireyso barooyinkeeda way hayaan (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-mid-adiga\"\u003EKa dhig mid adiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro habka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabayn…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo menyuyaasha\u003C/span\u003E, hel amar (sanduuqa raadinta ayaa caawiya). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar fur\u003C/span\u003E oo riix furaha, ama laba fur oo isku xigta si aad u hesho fur laba xaraf ah. Guji fur si aad uga saarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERibbon ahaan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeesha ay ku taal\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu amarka u guurinayaa tab iyo panel kale, menyuga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha oo keliya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMouse\u003C/span\u003E, deji shubiska, badhamada guuraya sawirka, iyo wixii badhan kasta uu sameeyo muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii magac oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta habka dhex-jira waxay samaysaa nuqul gaar ah (\\&quot;Ribbon-kayga dhismaha\\&quot;); habka dhex-jira weligiisba ma beddelo. Fur loo siiyay laba amar, ama fur ka horreeya in fur laba xaraf ah la qori karo, waxaa lagu muujiyaa casaan, waana in la saxo ka hor intaadan kaydin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse\"\u003EMouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabka mouse-ka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu weynayaa\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu yareeyaa\u003C/span\u003E, iyo sida dhakhsaha leh, sawirka iyo 3D. Pinch-ka trackpad-ka had iyo jeer wuxuu weynaynayaa sida faraha aad u dhaqaajiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirka guuri adigoo isticmaalaya\u003C/strong\u003E: badhanka dhexe, badhanka midig, ama labaduba. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiidasho ayaa sidoo kale guuraya. Badhanka bidix had iyo jeer wuu doortaa oo wuu sawiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid muuqaalka 3D\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal kasta oo gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa badhamada CivilCraft (bidix wareegaa, midig guuraa). Ama deji badhan kasta inuu wareego, guuro, weynaado ama aan waxba samayn; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh badhanka wuxuu is beddelaa wareegga iyo guuritaanka. Guji aan jiidasho lahayn wuli wuu doortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iska-qaado\"\u003EIska qaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu habka isticmaalka ku kaydiyaa fayl yar oo \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa mid kombiyuutar kale ama saaxiibkaa ka timid. Fayl la keenay wuxuu kaliya tilmaami karaa amarrada CivilCraft; wax kale oo ku jira waa la reebaa, xariiqa xaaladdana way tirisaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir qaabkan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa mid aad leedahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta kuwan waxay ku sii jiraan browserkan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal qaabkan app kasta\u003C/span\u003E hoosta kaararka habka wuxuu ka dhigaa app kasta inuu ku furmo habkiisa ku habboon (qalabkiisa, ribbon ama Qorista qadiimiga ah), isbeddellada aad ku samaysay app kasta. CivilCraft ma leh habka menu-bar-ka; marka menu-bar-ka app kale loo doorto app kasta, CivilCraft wuxuu hayaa qalabkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELa xiriira: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKiiboodhka iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKa imaatinka software-ka kale ee dhismaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amarrada CivilCraft waxay isku mid yihiin hab kasta oo aad ku gaadhid. Habka menyuga wuxuu kaliya go'aaminayaa meesha ay ku taallo shaashadda, magaca ay ku leeyihiin halkaas iyo furayaasha ay socodsiiyaan, si aad u sii haysato dabeecadaha aad hore u leedahay. Dooro mid ku Dejinta (Ctrl+,) › CivilCraft › Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka; isbeddelku wuu degdegaa, browserkan wuu xasuustaa. Saddexda habka Habka Waxa aad heleysid CivilCraft Qalabka sare ee CivilCraft (Faylka, Dhoofi, Dusha, Naqshadeyn, Tafatir, GIS, Muuqaal) iyo furayaasha keli ah: A khadka waddada, G pad, P tuubooyinka, B khadka jejebinta, O xuduudda, L khadka muuqaalka, R muuqaal dherer, X goynta, E simaynta, D 3D, F ku habee, V dooro. Bilowga. Qorista qadiimiga ah Ribbon yar (Guriga, Geli, Wax soo saar) iyo sadar amar, oo loogu talagalay dadka amarrada qoraa: ALIGNMENT, PAD, PIPE, FEATURELINE, BREAKLINE, PROFILE, SECTIONS, U (ka noqo), ZOOM, 3D, PLOT, LANDXML, XATTACH, MAPIMPORT, HELP. Bilow qorista meel kasta, xarfaha waxay u gudbaan sadarka amarka; Enter wuu socodsiiyaa, Enter marka aan wax la dooran wuxuu soo celinayaa amarkii u dambeeyay, Esc wuu nadiifiyaa. Badhanka dhexe wuu guuraa. Ribbon-ka dhismaha Tabyo oo badho waaweyn ah sida naqshadaha dhismaha ee bardaamaha ee u kooxeeya qalabkooda: Guriga (xogta dhulka, abuur naqshad, muuqaalka dherer iyo goynta), Dushyada, Beddel, Juqraafiga, Muuqaal iyo Wax soo saar, oo leh menyu Faylka iyo badho dhakhso ah midig. Furayaasha keli ah way sii jiraan. Badhanka dhexe wuxuu guuraa sawirka; 3D badhanka dhexe wuu guuraa, Shift oo leh badhanka dhexe wuxuu wareegaa. Habka kasta wuxuu hayaa furayaasha Ctrl: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+P, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D, Ctrl+A. Fur ku jira qaabka CivilCraft oo habkaaga loo siiyay amar kale ma samaynayso wax, xariiqa xaaladdana wuxuu sheegaa meesha amarkiisa u gudbay (\\\"Furayaashayda, Pad waa Ctrl+Alt+G\\\"). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space iyo fallaadhaha had iyo jeer way hayaan macnahooda, furayaashuna xariiqa aad sawireyso barooyinkeeda way hayaan (Backspace, Enter). Ka dhig mid adiga Dooro habka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna guji Habayn…. Ku Furayaasha iyo menyuyaasha, hel amar (sanduuqa raadinta ayaa caawiya). Ku dar fur oo riix furaha, ama laba fur oo isku xigta si aad u hesho fur laba xaraf ah. Guji fur si aad uga saarto. Ribbon ahaan, Meesha ay ku taal wuxuu amarka u guurinayaa tab iyo panel kale, menyuga Faylka, ama Furayaasha oo keliya. Ku Mouse, deji shubiska, badhamada guuraya sawirka, iyo wixii badhan kasta uu sameeyo muuqaalka 3D. Ku sii magac oo guji Kaydi. Kaydinta habka dhex-jira waxay samaysaa nuqul gaar ah (\\\"Ribbon-kayga dhismaha\\\"); habka dhex-jira weligiisba ma beddelo. Fur loo siiyay laba amar, ama fur ka horreeya in fur laba xaraf ah la qori karo, waxaa lagu muujiyaa casaan, waana in la saxo ka hor intaadan kaydin. Mouse Dabka mouse-ka: Shubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu weynayaa (bilowga) ama Shubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu yareeyaa, iyo sida dhakhsaha leh, sawirka iyo 3D. Pinch-ka trackpad-ka had iyo jeer wuxuu weynaynayaa sida faraha aad u dhaqaajiyaan. Sawirka guuri adigoo isticmaalaya: badhanka dhexe, badhanka midig, ama labaduba. Space iyo jiidasho ayaa sidoo kale guuraya. Badhanka bidix had iyo jeer wuu doortaa oo wuu sawiraa. Jiid muuqaalka 3D: Muuqaal kasta oo gaar ah wuxuu hayaa badhamada CivilCraft (bidix wareegaa, midig guuraa). Ama deji badhan kasta inuu wareego, guuro, weynaado ama aan waxba samayn; Shift oo leh badhanka wuxuu is beddelaa wareegga iyo guuritaanka. Guji aan jiidasho lahayn wuli wuu doortaa. Iska qaado Dhoofi wuxuu habka isticmaalka ku kaydiyaa fayl yar oo .ccinput.json; Soo deji… wuxuu ku daraa mid kombiyuutar kale ama saaxiibkaa ka timid. Fayl la keenay wuxuu kaliya tilmaami karaa amarrada CivilCraft; wax kale oo ku jira waa la reebaa, xariiqa xaaladdana way tirisaa. Tirtir qaabkan wuxuu ka saaraa mid aad leedahay. Dejinta kuwan waxay ku sii jiraan browserkan. Isticmaal qaabkan app kasta hoosta kaararka habka wuxuu ka dhigaa app kasta inuu ku furmo habkiisa ku habboon (qalabkiisa, ribbon ama Qorista qadiimiga ah), isbeddellada aad ku samaysay app kasta. CivilCraft ma leh habka menu-bar-ka; marka menu-bar-ka app kale loo doorto app kasta, CivilCraft wuxuu hayaa qalabkiisa. La xiriira: Kiiboodhka iyo mouse-ka · Dejinta CivilCraft · Ka imaatinka software-ka kale ee dhismaha","lang":"so"},{"slug":"toolbar","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Tixraaca toolbar-ka","summary":"Badhanka toolbar kasta oo CivilCraft ku jira, waxa uu sameeyo, furihiisa, iyo markuu damiyo ama diido.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["toolbar","badhamada","amarrada","qalabka","fayl","dhoofin","dusha","naqshad","tafatir","muuqaal","menu"],"headings":[{"id":"file","text":"File","level":2},{"id":"dhoofi","text":"Dhoofi","level":2},{"id":"dusha","text":"Dusha","level":2},{"id":"naqshad","text":"Naqshad","level":2},{"id":"tafatir","text":"Tafatir","level":2},{"id":"gis","text":"GIS","level":2},{"id":"muuqaal","text":"Muuqaal","level":2},{"id":"badhamada-daaqadaha","text":"Badhamada daaqadaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EToolbar-ku wuxuu ku socdaa sare-ka app-ka, oo ku qeybsan toddobo kooxood. Badhan kasta wuxuu muujiyaa tooltip-kiisa iyo furahiisa markaad kursorka ku dul-dhigto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"file\"\u003EFile\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu bilaabaa mashruuc madhan. Marka hore wuu weydiiyaa haddii isbeddel aan la kaydin jiro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furaa fayl barta (CSV, TXT), LandXML ama mashruuca CivilCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu soo dejiyaa mashruuca sida \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofi\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELandXML\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.xml\u003C/code\u003E: barrooyinka, dusha, alignment-ka, profile-yada iyo shabakadda tuubooyinka sida LandXML 1.2. &quot;Weli wax la dhoofin karo ma jiro.&quot; markuu mashruucu madhan yahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.dxf\u003C/code\u003E: xarriiqyada naqshadda sida R12 DXF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command P\"\u003E⌘P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furaa \u003Cstrong\u003EQorso qorshaha PDF-ka\u003C/strong\u003E. &quot;Weli wax la qorsan karo ma jiro.&quot; markuu mashruucu madhan yahay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha\"\u003EDusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreakline\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji barrooyinka sahanka dalbadoodii, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammaysato. Breakline-ku wuxuu qaadaa heerarka barrooyinka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBoundary\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji geesaha xadka dibadda, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammaysato. Wuxuu beddelaa xad kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabadaba waxay leeyihiin &quot;Weli dusha ma jiro: marka hore fur barrooyinka sahanka.&quot; markay dusha jirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshad\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlignment\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji PI-yada dalbadoodii, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammaysato.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPad\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji geesaha padka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammaysato. Sida qalabyada dusha, wuu digayaa marka dusha aan jirin; pad-ku wuxuu u dhaqmaa kaliya dusha dushiisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPipes\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji qaababka laga bilaabo sare ilaa hoose (guji mid jira si aad ugu biirto), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhammaysato.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProfile\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuujinaya ama qarinaya muuqaalka dherer ee hoosta naqshadda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafatir\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ka noqdaa isbeddelka u dambeeya (ilaa 200). Waa la damiyaa marka wax la ka noqon karo ma jiro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu sameeyaa mar kale waxa laga noqday. Waa la damiyaa marka wax dib loo samayn karo ma jiro.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu nuqul ka sameeyaa barrooyinka sahanka la doortay, oo wuxuu ku dhigaa clipboard-ka sida safafka barta ee spreadsheet-ku aqbali karo. Waa la damiyaa ilaa barro la doorto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu dhajiyaa barrooyinka: waxay raacaan kursorka, guji kasta wuxuu dhigaa iyagoo leh lambarro barro kale aanay lahayn. Safafka barta ee laga nuqulay spreadsheet-ka ayaa sidoo kale la dhajiyaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furaa liiska hoose.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu nuqulaa barrooyinka la doortay oo tirtiraa (hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu dhajiyaa barrooyinka isku-xirkooda, lambarro barro kale aanay lahayn.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul barrooyinka la doortay wuxuu raacaa kursorka; guji meesha ay tagayso. Clipboard-ka lama taaban.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu tirtiraa barrooyinka sahanka la doortay, ama alignment-ka, padka, qaabka (iyo tuubooyinkiisa), tuubada ama PVI-ga la doortay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all points\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu doortaa barrooyinka sahanka oo dhan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa aan wax ku qabsan karin hadda waa la damiyaa, tooltip-kiisuna wuxuu sheegaa sababta. Faahfaahin: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/copy-paste-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/copy-paste-points\"\u003EDooro, nuqul iyo dhaji barrooyinka sahanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa noqosho wuxuu daboolaa wax ka beddelka naqshadda, dejinta dusha iyo barrooyinka sahanka (dhajin, goyn, nuqul, tirtir). Ma daboolo dejinta muuqaalka, furidda ama soo dhoofinta fayl kasta ayaa tirtirta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gis\"\u003EGIS\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECoordinates\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furaa daaqadda \u003Cstrong\u003ENidaamka isku-xirka\u003C/strong\u003E: sheeg nidaamka mashruucu ku jiro, ama isticmaal isku-xirka dhulka ama kan gudaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coordinate-systems\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coordinate-systems\"\u003EDeji nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ground-and-local-coordinates\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ground-and-local-coordinates\"\u003EIsku-xirka dhulka iyo gudaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu soo dhoofiyaa xogta GIS: shapefile, GeoJSON, GeoPackage, gridka korka iyo LiDAR. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-import\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-import\"\u003ESoo dhoofi xogta GIS\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu dhoofiyaa xogta sida la dhisay waaxda GIS. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-export\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-export\"\u003EDhoofi xogta sida la dhisay ee GIS\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnalyze\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furaa panelka falanqaynta GIS: buffer, overlay, spatial join, dooro sifo ahaan, cabbir. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-analysis\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-analysis\"\u003EFalanqee layer-yada GIS\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAttribute table\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu jirta Dusha › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E. Wuxuu furaa miiska sifooyinka layer-ka GIS: kala-sooc, shaandheyn, dooro, tafatir, ku dar goobo, xisaabi, kaydi sida CSV. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-table\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-table\"\u003EKa shaqee miiska sifooyinka layer-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMap\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ema jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furaa daaqadda \u003Cstrong\u003ELayer-yada khariidadda\u003C/strong\u003E: sawir leh meel-geyn dhulka, ama server-ada khariidadda aad ku darto, oo hoosta qorshaha lagu muujiyo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/map-layers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/map-layers\"\u003EMuuji layer-yada khariidadda hoosta qorshaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabyada GIS waxay soo kordhaan markii ugu horreysay ee aad isticmaasho mid ka mid ah badhamadan, aad furto fayl GIS, ama aad furto mashruuc leh nidaam isku-xirka ama layer-yada GIS.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaal\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji si aad u doorato jid-hagaha, padka, qaababka, tuubooyinka iyo barrooyinka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo guji ama jiid ayaa ku daraa barrooyin); jiid meelaha gacanta si aad u dhaqaajiso PI-yada, geesaha padka iyo qaababka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu weyneeyaa qorshaha si uu u muujiyo dusha, barrooyinka, jid-hagaha iyo padka (muuqaalka 3D: wax walba ayuu muujiyaa).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu muujiyaa goobta 3D oo ka sarreysa qorshaha, ama wuu ku noqdaa qorshaha. Bar-ka ka sarreeya muuqaalka 3D wuxuu dejiyaa muuqaalka, weynaynta, midabaynta iyo waxa muuqda, wuxuuna dhoofiyaa GLB ama OBJ. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/site-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/site-3d\"\u003EArag goobta 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhamada-daaqadaha\"\u003EBadhamada daaqadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the sample site\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuqa ku jira qorshe madhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu soo rogaa sahanka tusaalaha (wuxuu u baahan yahay xiriir, marka CivilCraft aan loo kaydin isticmaal laynka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove the boundary\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanelka bidix, Dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ka saaraa xadka dibadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove drawn breaklines\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanelka bidix, Dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu tirtiraa breakline kasta oo qalabka lagu sawiray (ma aha kooxaha breakline-ka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERebuild the surface from the points\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanelka bidix, Dusha (dusha LandXML kaliya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu tirtiraa TIN-ka LandXML oo wuxuu dhisaa barrooyinka; lama soo celin karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart from the ground\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanelka midig, Jid-hagaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu bilaabaa profile naqshad oo leh PVI dhulka dhammaan labada dhamaadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProfile view\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanelka midig, Jid-hagaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu furaa muuqaalka dherer ee jid-hagahan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd PVIs\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar-ka muuqaalka dherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta la riixo, guji profile-ka wuxuu ku daraa PVI\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESet every invert from the rules\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanelka midig, Shabakadda tuubooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu dejiyaa hoos u dhaca tuubo kasta xeerarka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESet its inverts from the rules\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanelka midig, Tuubada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu dejiyaa hoos u dhaca tuubadan xeerarka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Toolbar-ku wuxuu ku socdaa sare-ka app-ka, oo ku qeybsan toddobo kooxood. Badhan kasta wuxuu muujiyaa tooltip-kiisa iyo furahiisa markaad kursorka ku dul-dhigto. File Badhan Furaha Waxa uu sameeyo New ma jiro Wuxuu bilaabaa mashruuc madhan. Marka hore wuu weydiiyaa haddii isbeddel aan la kaydin jiro. Open Ctrl+O Wuxuu furaa fayl barta (CSV, TXT), LandXML ama mashruuca CivilCraft. Save Ctrl+S Wuxuu soo dejiyaa mashruuca sida \u003Cname\u003E.civilcraft.json. Dhoofi Badhan Furaha Waxa uu sameeyo LandXML ma jiro Wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cname\u003E.xml: barrooyinka, dusha, alignment-ka, profile-yada iyo shabakadda tuubooyinka sida LandXML 1.2. \"Weli wax la dhoofin karo ma jiro.\" markuu mashruucu madhan yahay. DXF ma jiro Wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cname\u003E.dxf: xarriiqyada naqshadda sida R12 DXF. PDF Ctrl+P Wuxuu furaa Qorso qorshaha PDF-ka. \"Weli wax la qorsan karo ma jiro.\" markuu mashruucu madhan yahay. Dusha Badhan Furaha Waxa uu sameeyo Breakline B Guji barrooyinka sahanka dalbadoodii, Enter si aad u dhammaysato. Breakline-ku wuxuu qaadaa heerarka barrooyinka. Boundary O Guji geesaha xadka dibadda, Enter si aad u dhammaysato. Wuxuu beddelaa xad kasta. Labadaba waxay leeyihiin \"Weli dusha ma jiro: marka hore fur barrooyinka sahanka.\" markay dusha jirin. Naqshad Badhan Furaha Waxa uu sameeyo Alignment A Guji PI-yada dalbadoodii, Enter si aad u dhammaysato. Pad G Guji geesaha padka, Enter si aad u dhammaysato. Sida qalabyada dusha, wuu digayaa marka dusha aan jirin; pad-ku wuxuu u dhaqmaa kaliya dusha dushiisa. Pipes P Guji qaababka laga bilaabo sare ilaa hoose (guji mid jira si aad ugu biirto), Enter si aad u dhammaysato. Profile R Muujinaya ama qarinaya muuqaalka dherer ee hoosta naqshadda. Tafatir Badhan Furaha Waxa uu sameeyo Undo Ctrl+Z Wuxuu ka noqdaa isbeddelka u dambeeya (ilaa 200). Waa la damiyaa marka wax la ka noqon karo ma jiro. Redo Ctrl+Y Wuxuu sameeyaa mar kale waxa laga noqday. Waa la damiyaa marka wax dib loo samayn karo ma jiro. Copy Ctrl+C Wuxuu nuqul ka sameeyaa barrooyinka sahanka la doortay, oo wuxuu ku dhigaa clipboard-ka sida safafka barta ee spreadsheet-ku aqbali karo. Waa la damiyaa ilaa barro la doorto. Paste Ctrl+V Wuxuu dhajiyaa barrooyinka: waxay raacaan kursorka, guji kasta wuxuu dhigaa iyagoo leh lambarro barro kale aanay lahayn. Safafka barta ee laga nuqulay spreadsheet-ka ayaa sidoo kale la dhajiyaa. More ma jiro Wuxuu furaa liiska hoose. Liiska More: Waxa Furaha Waxa uu sameeyo Cut Ctrl+X Wuxuu nuqulaa barrooyinka la doortay oo tirtiraa (hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho). Copy Ctrl+C Sida badhanka Copy. Paste Ctrl+V Sida badhanka Paste. Paste in place Ctrl+Shift+V Wuxuu dhajiyaa barrooyinka isku-xirkooda, lambarro barro kale aanay lahayn. Duplicate Ctrl+D Nuqul barrooyinka la doortay wuxuu raacaa kursorka; guji meesha ay tagayso. Clipboard-ka lama taaban. Delete Delete Wuxuu tirtiraa barrooyinka sahanka la doortay, ama alignment-ka, padka, qaabka (iyo tuubooyinkiisa), tuubada ama PVI-ga la doortay. Select all points Ctrl+A Wuxuu doortaa barrooyinka sahanka oo dhan. Select none Esc Wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada. Waxa aan wax ku qabsan karin hadda waa la damiyaa, tooltip-kiisuna wuxuu sheegaa sababta. Faahfaahin: Dooro, nuqul iyo dhaji barrooyinka sahanka. Ka noqosho wuxuu daboolaa wax ka beddelka naqshadda, dejinta dusha iyo barrooyinka sahanka (dhajin, goyn, nuqul, tirtir). Ma daboolo dejinta muuqaalka, furidda ama soo dhoofinta fayl kasta ayaa tirtirta. GIS Badhan Furaha Waxa uu sameeyo Coordinates ma jiro Wuxuu furaa daaqadda Nidaamka isku-xirka: sheeg nidaamka mashruucu ku jiro, ama isticmaal isku-xirka dhulka ama kan gudaha. Eeg Deji nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca iyo Isku-xirka dhulka iyo gudaha. Import ma jiro Wuxuu soo dhoofiyaa xogta GIS: shapefile, GeoJSON, GeoPackage, gridka korka iyo LiDAR. Eeg Soo dhoofi xogta GIS. Export ma jiro Wuxuu dhoofiyaa xogta sida la dhisay waaxda GIS. Eeg Dhoofi xogta sida la dhisay ee GIS. Analyze ma jiro Wuxuu furaa panelka falanqaynta GIS: buffer, overlay, spatial join, dooro sifo ahaan, cabbir. Eeg Falanqee layer-yada GIS. Attribute table ma jiro Ku jirta Dusha › More. Wuxuu furaa miiska sifooyinka layer-ka GIS: kala-sooc, shaandheyn, dooro, tafatir, ku dar goobo, xisaabi, kaydi sida CSV. Eeg Ka shaqee miiska sifooyinka layer-ka. Map ma jiro Wuxuu furaa daaqadda Layer-yada khariidadda: sawir leh meel-geyn dhulka, ama server-ada khariidadda aad ku darto, oo hoosta qorshaha lagu muujiyo. Eeg Muuji layer-yada khariidadda hoosta qorshaha. Qalabyada GIS waxay soo kordhaan markii ugu horreysay ee aad isticmaasho mid ka mid ah badhamadan, aad furto fayl GIS, ama aad furto mashruuc leh nidaam isku-xirka ama layer-yada GIS. Muuqaal Badhan Furaha Waxa uu sameeyo Select V ama Esc Guji si aad u doorato jid-hagaha, padka, qaababka, tuubooyinka iyo barrooyinka (Shift iyo guji ama jiid ayaa ku daraa barrooyin); jiid meelaha gacanta si aad u dhaqaajiso PI-yada, geesaha padka iyo qaababka. Fit F Wuxuu weyneeyaa qorshaha si uu u muujiyo dusha, barrooyinka, jid-hagaha iyo padka (muuqaalka 3D: wax walba ayuu muujiyaa). 3D D Wuxuu muujiyaa goobta 3D oo ka sarreysa qorshaha, ama wuu ku noqdaa qorshaha. Bar-ka ka sarreeya muuqaalka 3D wuxuu dejiyaa muuqaalka, weynaynta, midabaynta iyo waxa muuqda, wuxuuna dhoofiyaa GLB ama OBJ. Eeg Arag goobta 3D. Badhamada daaqadaha Badhan Meesha Waxa uu sameeyo Open the sample site Sanduuqa ku jira qorshe madhan Wuxuu soo rogaa sahanka tusaalaha (wuxuu u baahan yahay xiriir, marka CivilCraft aan loo kaydin isticmaal laynka) Remove the boundary Panelka bidix, Dusha Wuxuu ka saaraa xadka dibadda Remove drawn breaklines Panelka bidix, Dusha Wuxuu tirtiraa breakline kasta oo qalabka lagu sawiray (ma aha kooxaha breakline-ka) Rebuild the surface from the points Panelka bidix, Dusha (dusha LandXML kaliya) Wuxuu tirtiraa TIN-ka LandXML oo wuxuu dhisaa barrooyinka; lama soo celin karo Start from the ground Panelka midig, Jid-hagaha Wuxuu bilaabaa profile naqshad oo leh PVI dhulka dhammaan labada dhamaadka Profile view Panelka midig, Jid-hagaha Wuxuu furaa muuqaalka dherer ee jid-hagahan Add PVIs Bar-ka muuqaalka dherer Inta la riixo, guji profile-ka wuxuu ku daraa PVI Set every invert from the rules Panelka midig, Shabakadda tuubooyinka Wuxuu dejiyaa hoos u dhaca tuubo kasta xeerarka Set its inverts from the rules Panelka midig, Tuubada Wuxuu dejiyaa hoos u dhaca tuubadan xeerarka","lang":"so"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Dejinta CivilCraft","summary":"Dooro habka tiirarka ee sadarrada barta la koobiyeeyay iyo la dhaqay, iyo sida faylka tiirarkiisa loo qiyaaso; sida barta la dhaqay loo lambarayo, waxa calaamadaha barta muujiyaan, calaamadda geeska, weynaynta toosa ee 3D, sida ballaca iyo dhererka loo muujiyo, iyo in lakabyada khariidadda ay internet ka yimaadaan mise.","section":"reference","order":25,"keywords":["dejin","doorashooyin","pnezd","penzd","habka tiirarka","sadarrada barta","dib-u-lambar","lambarada barta","lambarka bilaabidda","calaamadaha barta","calaamadaha","sharaxaad","sare-dhaadheer","kub muuqaal","calaamadda aaxa","calaamadda geeska","qutub-tilmaame","weynaynta toosa","3d","ballaca (latitude)","dhererka (longitude)","dms","darajooyinka tobanle","lakabyada khariidadda","internet","asturnaan"],"headings":[{"id":"sadarrada-barta","text":"Sadarrada barta","level":2},{"id":"lambarada-barta-la-dhaqay","text":"Lambarada barta la dhaqay","level":2},{"id":"calaamadaha-barta","text":"Calaamadaha barta","level":2},{"id":"calaamadda-geeska","text":"Calaamadda geeska","level":2},{"id":"weynaynta-toosa-ee-3d","text":"Weynaynta toosa ee 3D","level":2},{"id":"ballaca-iyo-dhererka","text":"Ballaca iyo dhererka","level":2},{"id":"lakabyada-khariidadda-internet-ka","text":"Lakabyada khariidadda internet-ka","level":2},{"id":"kaaliyeyaasha","text":"Kaaliyeyaasha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKu fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E oo ah gudiga ku yaal app bar-ka ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Tabka koowaad, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/span\u003E, wuxuu haystaa dejinta app-kan; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu haystaa midka dhammaan app-yada CadCraft ay wadaagaan (mawduuca, toolbar-ka, panelada). Dejinta CivilCraft waxay ku jirtaa app-ka oo keliya: halkan ayaad ku beddeshaa, browser-kanna wuu xusuustaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset CivilCraft settings\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib u dejiyaa dejinta oo dhan bilowgeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sadarrada-barta\"\u003ESadarrada barta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EP, N, E, Z, D\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EP, E, N, Z, D\u003C/strong\u003E: barta, waqooyiga (N), bariga (E), sare (Z), sharaxaadda (D), ama bariga ka hor waqooyiga. Waxaa loo isticmaalaa seddex meelood:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECopy\u003C/strong\u003E: sadarrada CivilCraft ku dhejiyo system clipboard-ka spreadsheet-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaste\u003C/strong\u003E: sadarrada laga soo koobiyeeyay spreadsheet ama qoraal aan safka madaxa lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImport\u003C/strong\u003E: qiyaasta wada-hadalka \u003Cstrong\u003EImport points\u003C/strong\u003E marka faylku safka madaxa lahayn (fayl afar tiir ah wuxuu akhrisanayaa PENZ, saddex ah ENZ). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/point-file-formats\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/point-file-formats\"\u003EQaababka faylalka barta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka madaxa oo magacaabaa tiirarkiisa had iyo jeer ayuu ka adkaadaa, sidaas oo kale ikhtiyaarka liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EColumns\u003C/strong\u003E ee wada-hadalka import-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lambarada-barta-la-dhaqay\"\u003ELambarada barta la dhaqay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep free numbers\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga): barta la dhaqay waxay hayaa lambarkeeda haddii aanu barta kale haysan; barta isku dhacda oo keliya ayaa lambar cusub helaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlways new numbers\u003C/strong\u003E: barta kasta oo la dhaqay waxay helaysaa lambar cusub, xitaa haddii lambarkeedu madhan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENew numbers start at\u003C/strong\u003E: ka tag madhan si uu u tiriyo hal ka sare lambarka ugu sarreeya ee la isticmaalo. Qor lambar, tusaale 5000, si barta cusub lambarro u bilaabato 5000; lambarada hore loo isticmaalay waa la dhaafaa. Labada barood ma wadaagaan lambar, habka kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/copy-paste-points#point-numbers-never-clash\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/copy-paste-points\" data-hash=\"point-numbers-never-clash\"\u003EDooro, koobiyee oo dhaq barta sahanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadaha-barta\"\u003ECalaamadaha barta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa calaamadda barta muujinayso marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoint labels\u003C/span\u003E la shido hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDisplay\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003ENumber\u003C/strong\u003E (lambarka), \u003Cstrong\u003ENumber and elevation\u003C/strong\u003E (lambarka iyo sare-dhaadheerka), ama \u003Cstrong\u003ENumber, elevation and description\u003C/strong\u003E (lambarka, sare-dhaadheerka iyo sharaxaadda) (bilowga). DXF, DWG iyo PDF ee soo dhoofinta waxay muujinayaan calaamadaha isku mid ah sida shaashadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadda-geeska\"\u003ECalaamadda geeska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ku jira geeska qorshaha iyo muuqaalka 3D: \u003Cstrong\u003EView cube\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga), \u003Cstrong\u003EAxis icon\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ENone\u003C/strong\u003E (midkood).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EView cube\u003C/strong\u003E (midig sare). Qorshaha wuxuu muujinayaa sare, iyo wareega qutub-tilmaameedka: N waa waqooyiga khariidadda (sare qorshaha). Riix geesta, qaybta ama dhinac kale oo kubka ah, ama jiido, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/site-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/site-3d\"\u003Emuuqaalka 3D\u003C/a\u003E ayaa furmaya oo ka eegaya meeshaas. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E kubka qorshaha wuxuu qorshaha ku buuxiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka 3D kubku wuu wareegaa muuqaalka: riix dhinac, qaybta ama geesta si aad uga eegto; jiido kubka si aad u wareegto; jiido wareega qutub-tilmaameedka si aad u wareejiso dhinaca toosa; riix xarfta si aad uga eegto dhinacaas; isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E muuqaalka iso ee goobta oo dhan. Marka aad si toos ah ugu eegto dhinac, falaadho yaryar ayaa u gudbaya dhinaca xiga, falaadho wareegsan ayaa wareejiya muuqaalka rubuc wareeg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAxis icon\u003C/strong\u003E (hoose bidix): calaamad yar oo X (bari) iyo Y (waqooyi) qorshaha, X, Y iyo Z (sare) 3D-ga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weynaynta-toosa-ee-3d\"\u003EWeynaynta toosa ee 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida muuqaalka 3D u weynaysto sare-dhaadheerka: \u003Cstrong\u003E1×\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003E2×\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga), \u003Cstrong\u003E3×\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003E5×\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003E10×\u003C/strong\u003E. Liiska bar-ka muuqaalka 3D waa isla dejinta, sidaas darteed midka aad beddesho labadaba way beddelaan. Mugga, profile-yada iyo soo dhoofinta 3D waxay ahaadaan cabbir sax ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ballaca-iyo-dhererka\"\u003EBallaca iyo dhererka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida status bar-ku muujiyo latitude-ka iyo longitude-ka cursorka marka mashruucu leeyahay nidaamka isku-xirka: \u003Cstrong\u003Edegrees, minutes and seconds\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E30°18′00.00″ N\u003C/code\u003E) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Edecimal degrees\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E30.300000° N\u003C/code\u003E). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coordinate-systems#latitude-and-longitude-in-the-status-bar\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coordinate-systems\" data-hash=\"latitude-and-longitude-in-the-status-bar\"\u003EDejinta nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lakabyada-khariidadda-internet-ka\"\u003ELakabyada khariidadda internet-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOff\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EOn\u003C/strong\u003E. Marka la shido, CivilCraft wuxuu weydiiyaa server-yada khariidadda aad ku dartay sawirro aagga shaashadda ku jira. Sawirkaagu wuu ku sii jiraa kombiyuutarkan; server-ku wuxuu arkaa aagga iyo cinwaanka internet-kaaga. Intii ay damaqday, ma jiro server khariidadeed oo wax la weydiiyo, xitaa haddii mashruuc aad furto magacaabo mid; sawirka georeferenced ee faylka waa shaqeeya labadaba. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/map-layers\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/map-layers\"\u003EMuuji lakabyada khariidadda qorshaha hoosteeda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaaliyeyaasha\"\u003EKaaliyeyaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOgolow kaaliyeyaasha AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan CivilCraft\u003C/strong\u003E (damaqday bilowga) wuxuu u oggolaanayaa kaaliye kombiyuutarkaaga inuu gaaro goobta furan iyada oo loo marayo CadCraft Studio: \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sharaxaa goobta oo wuxuu siiyaa barta, sare-dhaadheerka dhulka, saldhigyada, profile-yada, mugga iyo parcel-ka; \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u oggolaanayaa inuu dooro oo ku daro barta sahanka; \u003Cstrong\u003ESave\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u oggolaanayaa inuu kaydiyo mashruuca oo qoro LandXML ama DWG. \u003Cstrong\u003EFolders it may use\u003C/strong\u003E (Studio) waa meelaha uu kaydin iyo soo dhoofin karo. \u003Cstrong\u003EActivity\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa wicitaankiisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/assistants\"\u003EKaaliye AI u shaqeeyo goobtaada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ku fur Settings oo ah gudiga ku yaal app bar-ka ama Ctrl+,. Tabka koowaad, CivilCraft, wuxuu haystaa dejinta app-kan; General wuxuu haystaa midka dhammaan app-yada CadCraft ay wadaagaan (mawduuca, toolbar-ka, panelada). Dejinta CivilCraft waxay ku jirtaa app-ka oo keliya: halkan ayaad ku beddeshaa, browser-kanna wuu xusuustaa. Reset CivilCraft settings wuxuu dib u dejiyaa dejinta oo dhan bilowgeeda. Sadarrada barta P, N, E, Z, D (bilowga) ama P, E, N, Z, D: barta, waqooyiga (N), bariga (E), sare (Z), sharaxaadda (D), ama bariga ka hor waqooyiga. Waxaa loo isticmaalaa seddex meelood: Copy: sadarrada CivilCraft ku dhejiyo system clipboard-ka spreadsheet-ka. Paste: sadarrada laga soo koobiyeeyay spreadsheet ama qoraal aan safka madaxa lahayn. Import: qiyaasta wada-hadalka Import points marka faylku safka madaxa lahayn (fayl afar tiir ah wuxuu akhrisanayaa PENZ, saddex ah ENZ). Eeg Qaababka faylalka barta. Safka madaxa oo magacaabaa tiirarkiisa had iyo jeer ayuu ka adkaadaa, sidaas oo kale ikhtiyaarka liiska Columns ee wada-hadalka import-ka. Lambarada barta la dhaqay Keep free numbers (bilowga): barta la dhaqay waxay hayaa lambarkeeda haddii aanu barta kale haysan; barta isku dhacda oo keliya ayaa lambar cusub helaysa. Always new numbers: barta kasta oo la dhaqay waxay helaysaa lambar cusub, xitaa haddii lambarkeedu madhan yahay. New numbers start at: ka tag madhan si uu u tiriyo hal ka sare lambarka ugu sarreeya ee la isticmaalo. Qor lambar, tusaale 5000, si barta cusub lambarro u bilaabato 5000; lambarada hore loo isticmaalay waa la dhaafaa. Labada barood ma wadaagaan lambar, habka kasta. Eeg Dooro, koobiyee oo dhaq barta sahanka. Calaamadaha barta Waxa calaamadda barta muujinayso marka Point labels la shido hoosta Display: Number (lambarka), Number and elevation (lambarka iyo sare-dhaadheerka), ama Number, elevation and description (lambarka, sare-dhaadheerka iyo sharaxaadda) (bilowga). DXF, DWG iyo PDF ee soo dhoofinta waxay muujinayaan calaamadaha isku mid ah sida shaashadda. Calaamadda geeska Waxa ku jira geeska qorshaha iyo muuqaalka 3D: View cube (bilowga), Axis icon ama None (midkood). View cube (midig sare). Qorshaha wuxuu muujinayaa sare, iyo wareega qutub-tilmaameedka: N waa waqooyiga khariidadda (sare qorshaha). Riix geesta, qaybta ama dhinac kale oo kubka ah, ama jiido, muuqaalka 3D ayaa furmaya oo ka eegaya meeshaas. Home kubka qorshaha wuxuu qorshaha ku buuxiyaa. Muuqaalka 3D kubku wuu wareegaa muuqaalka: riix dhinac, qaybta ama geesta si aad uga eegto; jiido kubka si aad u wareegto; jiido wareega qutub-tilmaameedka si aad u wareejiso dhinaca toosa; riix xarfta si aad uga eegto dhinacaas; isticmaal Home muuqaalka iso ee goobta oo dhan. Marka aad si toos ah ugu eegto dhinac, falaadho yaryar ayaa u gudbaya dhinaca xiga, falaadho wareegsan ayaa wareejiya muuqaalka rubuc wareeg. Axis icon (hoose bidix): calaamad yar oo X (bari) iyo Y (waqooyi) qorshaha, X, Y iyo Z (sare) 3D-ga. Weynaynta toosa ee 3D Sida muuqaalka 3D u weynaysto sare-dhaadheerka: 1×, 2× (bilowga), 3×, 5× ama 10×. Liiska bar-ka muuqaalka 3D waa isla dejinta, sidaas darteed midka aad beddesho labadaba way beddelaan. Mugga, profile-yada iyo soo dhoofinta 3D waxay ahaadaan cabbir sax ah. Ballaca iyo dhererka Sida status bar-ku muujiyo latitude-ka iyo longitude-ka cursorka marka mashruucu leeyahay nidaamka isku-xirka: degrees, minutes and seconds (bilowga, tusaale 30°18′00.00″ N) ama decimal degrees (30.300000° N). Eeg Dejinta nidaamka isku-xirka mashruuca. Lakabyada khariidadda internet-ka Off (bilowga) ama On. Marka la shido, CivilCraft wuxuu weydiiyaa server-yada khariidadda aad ku dartay sawirro aagga shaashadda ku jira. Sawirkaagu wuu ku sii jiraa kombiyuutarkan; server-ku wuxuu arkaa aagga iyo cinwaanka internet-kaaga. Intii ay damaqday, ma jiro server khariidadeed oo wax la weydiiyo, xitaa haddii mashruuc aad furto magacaabo mid; sawirka georeferenced ee faylka waa shaqeeya labadaba. Eeg Muuji lakabyada khariidadda qorshaha hoosteeda. Kaaliyeyaasha Ogolow kaaliyeyaasha AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan CivilCraft (damaqday bilowga) wuxuu u oggolaanayaa kaaliye kombiyuutarkaaga inuu gaaro goobta furan iyada oo loo marayo CadCraft Studio: Read wuxuu sharaxaa goobta oo wuxuu siiyaa barta, sare-dhaadheerka dhulka, saldhigyada, profile-yada, mugga iyo parcel-ka; Edit wuxuu u oggolaanayaa inuu dooro oo ku daro barta sahanka; Save iyo Export wuxuu u oggolaanayaa inuu kaydiyo mashruuca oo qoro LandXML ama DWG. Folders it may use (Studio) waa meelaha uu kaydin iyo soo dhoofin karo. Activity wuxuu liistaa wicitaankiisa. Eeg Kaaliye AI u shaqeeyo goobtaada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"point-file-formats","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qaababka faylalka barta","summary":"Habka tiirarka ee CivilCraft akhristo, sida uu u helo kala-soocaha iyo safka madaxa, magacyada madaxa ee uu aqoonsado, iyo sida safafka loo hubiyo.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["pnezd","penzd","pnez","penz","nezd","enzd","nez","enz","csv","txt","pnt","xyz","qaabka faylka barta","tiirarka","madaxa","kala-soocaha"],"headings":[{"id":"habka-tiirarka","text":"Habka tiirarka","level":2},{"id":"kala-soocayaasha","text":"Kala-soocayaasha","level":2},{"id":"safka-madaxa","text":"Safka madaxa","level":2},{"id":"qiyaasta-tirada-tiirarka","text":"Qiyaasta tirada tiirarka","level":2},{"id":"sida-safafka-loo-hubiyo","text":"Sida safafka loo hubiyo","level":2},{"id":"kooxaha-barta","text":"Kooxaha barta","level":2},{"id":"qorista-dhibcaha","text":"Qorista dhibcaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFayl barta waa qoraal fudud, hal bar safka kasta. CivilCraft wuu akhrisaa browser-ka; waxba lama soo rarin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habka-tiirarka\"\u003EHabka tiirarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarfaha waxay magacabinayaan tiirarka laga bilaabo bidix ilaa midig: \u003Cstrong\u003EP\u003C/strong\u003E lambarka ama magaca barta, \u003Cstrong\u003EN\u003C/strong\u003E woqooyi-koorsi (northing), \u003Cstrong\u003EE\u003C/strong\u003E bari-galbeed (easting), \u003Cstrong\u003EZ\u003C/strong\u003E sare-joogga (elevation), \u003Cstrong\u003ED\u003C/strong\u003E sharraxaadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiirarka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETusaale safka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPNEZD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebarta, woqooyi-koorsi, bari-galbeed, sare-joog, sharraxaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E101,2080000.00,6150000.00,250.00,GRD\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPENZD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebarta, bari-galbeed, woqooyi-koorsi, sare-joog, sharraxaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E101,6150000.00,2080000.00,250.00,GRD\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPNEZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebarta, woqooyi-koorsi, bari-galbeed, sare-joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E101,2080000.00,6150000.00,250.00\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPENZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebarta, bari-galbeed, woqooyi-koorsi, sare-joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E101,6150000.00,2080000.00,250.00\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENEZD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewoqooyi-koorsi, bari-galbeed, sare-joog, sharraxaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2080000.00,6150000.00,250.00,GRD\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EENZD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebari-galbeed, woqooyi-koorsi, sare-joog, sharraxaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6150000.00,2080000.00,250.00,GRD\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENEZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewoqooyi-koorsi, bari-galbeed, sare-joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2080000.00 6150000.00 250.00\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EENZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ebari-galbeed, woqooyi-koorsi, sare-joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6150000.00 2080000.00 250.00\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHababka aan P lahayn waxay dhibcaha lambarkeenayaan 1, 2, 3 … sida ay fayl ku jiraan. X waa bari-galbeed, Y waa woqooyi-koorsi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-soocayaasha\"\u003EKala-soocayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu eegaa 20 safka ugu horreeya, wuxuuna doortaa kii ugu horreeya ee ku dhaca ugu yaraan 60% dhammaantood: comma, tab, semicolon. Haddii kale wuxuu kala-jajabiyaa meelaha bannaan oo isku xiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylalka comma, tab iyo semicolon, goobta ku dhex jirta xigashooyin laba-geesood ah ayaa ku jiri kara kala-soocaha (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;FL, NORTH&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;&quot;\u003C/code\u003E gudaha xigashooyinka waa hal calaamad xigasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylalka meel-bannaanka lagu kala-soocayo, sharraxaadda ku dhammaanta safka waxay ku jiri kartaa meelo bannaan: wax kasta oo ka dambeeya tiirka ugu dambeeya ee isku-xidhka waa sharraxaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafafka ku bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E//\u003C/code\u003E, iyo safafka banaan waa la dhaafaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadda bilowga faylka (byte-order mark) waa la iska dhaafaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"safka-madaxa\"\u003ESafka madaxa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka koowaad waxaa loo tixgeliyaa madax marka ka yar laba goob oo ka mid ah ay yihiin tirooyin. Haddii goob kasta oo madaxa ah uu yahay magac uu CivilCraft aqoonsado, habka tiirarka wuxuu ka imanayaa (&quot;safka madaxa ka soo baxa&quot;). Magacyada waxaa la isku dhigaa iyadoo aan loo eegin xarfaha weyn-yar, meelaha bannaan, dhibcaha, hoosta-hoosta, iyo xidhka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETiir\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMagacyada la aqoonsado\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ept, pnt, point, point no, point number, number, no, id, name, pt#, point#, #\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EN\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003En, north, northing, y, y coord, lat, latitude\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EE\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ee, east, easting, x, x coord, lon, long, longitude\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ez, elev, elevation, el, height, h, z coord, rl\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ED\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ed, desc, description, code, raw description, full description, note, notes, feature\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii magac madax aan la aqoonsan, ama magacyadu aanay mid ka mid ah siddeedda habab sameyn, madaxa waa la dhaafaa, habka tiirarkana waxaa loo qiyaasaa tirada tiirarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMadax leh magac latitude (\u003Ccode\u003Elat\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elatitude\u003C/code\u003E) iyo magac longitude (\u003Ccode\u003Elon\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elong\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elongitude\u003C/code\u003E) labaduba waxaa loo akhriyaa darajo, ma aha woqooyi-koorsi iyo bari-galbeed. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E dhibcaha waxaa loo beddelaa nidaamka kala-sarrayn ee mashruuca, mashruuc aan lahayn wuxuu marka hore kuu weydiin doonaa inaad doorato. Safafka ka baxsan ±90° latitude ama ±180° longitude waa la diidaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-import#point-files-with-latitude-and-longitude\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-import\" data-hash=\"point-files-with-latitude-and-longitude\"\u003ESoo dhoofi xogta GIS\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaasta-tirada-tiirarka\"\u003EQiyaasta tirada tiirarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii madax lagu isticmaali karo ma jiro oo \u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E uu weli ku joogo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOgaag\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E5 ama ka badan tiirar: PNEZD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E4 tiirar: PNEZ marka tiirka koowaad yahay lambar oo dhan safka kasta la qaaday, tiirka afaraadna yahay tiro; haddii kale NEZD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E3 tiirar: NEZ.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPNEZD iyo PENZD lama kala saari karo tirooyinka. Qiyaasta waxay raacdaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka barta\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E: P, N, E, Z, D bilowga, ama P, E, N, Z, D (markaas afar tiir waxaa loo akhriyaa PENZ, saddex tiirna ENZ). Wada-hadalku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;qiyaasta tirada tiirarka — hubi in woqooyi-koorsi iyo bari-galbeed aanay is-beddelin&quot;. Haddii muuqaalku khaldan yahay, dooro habka saxda ah \u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E hoose.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-safafka-loo-hubiyo\"\u003ESida safafka loo hubiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafku wuu ka saari karaa sharraxaadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWoqooyi-koorsi iyo bari-galbeed waa inay noqdaan tirooyin. Sare-joogga wuu madhan karaa (barta way ka soo kaydsan tahay laakiin uma adeegsanto dusha sare).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELambarka barta wuxuu noqon karaa qoraal kasta (xarfo ayaa ku jiri kara, sida \u003Ccode\u003ECP1\u003C/code\u003E), laakiin waa inuu ku jirtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii lambarka barta uu soo noqnoqdo, safka hore ayaa la hayaa, kuwa kalena waxaa lagu liis gareeyaa sida aan la akhrin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESharraxaadaha waxa la hayaa ilaa 200 xaraf; xarfaha xakamaynta waxay noqdaan meelo bannaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlaa 200 safaf aan la akhrin ayaa la hayaa wada-hadalka (25 ayaa la muujiyaa), dhammaantoodna waa la tiriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kooxaha-barta\"\u003EKooxaha barta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda barta waa ereyga koowaad ee sharraxaaddeeda oo weyn. &quot;GRD&quot;, &quot;grd shot&quot; iyo &quot;Grd&quot; dhammaantood waa kooxda GRD. Barta aan sharraxaad lahayn waxay ku jirtaa &quot;(no description)&quot;. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003ESoo dhoofi dhibcaha sahanka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorista-dhibcaha\"\u003EQorista dhibcaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft weli ma dhoofiyo fayl qoraal oo barta ah. Dhibcaha waxaa loo dhoofiyaa LandXML (sida CgPoints), faylka mashruuca, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E GIS sida shapefile, GeoPackage ama GeoJSON oo leh goobaha P, N, E, Z iyo D (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-export\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-export\"\u003EDhoofi xogta as-built ee GIS\u003C/a\u003E). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fayl barta waa qoraal fudud, hal bar safka kasta. CivilCraft wuu akhrisaa browser-ka; waxba lama soo rarin. Habka tiirarka Xarfaha waxay magacabinayaan tiirarka laga bilaabo bidix ilaa midig: P lambarka ama magaca barta, N woqooyi-koorsi (northing), E bari-galbeed (easting), Z sare-joogga (elevation), D sharraxaadda. Habka Tiirarka Tusaale safka PNEZD barta, woqooyi-koorsi, bari-galbeed, sare-joog, sharraxaad 101,2080000.00,6150000.00,250.00,GRD PENZD barta, bari-galbeed, woqooyi-koorsi, sare-joog, sharraxaad 101,6150000.00,2080000.00,250.00,GRD PNEZ barta, woqooyi-koorsi, bari-galbeed, sare-joog 101,2080000.00,6150000.00,250.00 PENZ barta, bari-galbeed, woqooyi-koorsi, sare-joog 101,6150000.00,2080000.00,250.00 NEZD woqooyi-koorsi, bari-galbeed, sare-joog, sharraxaad 2080000.00,6150000.00,250.00,GRD ENZD bari-galbeed, woqooyi-koorsi, sare-joog, sharraxaad 6150000.00,2080000.00,250.00,GRD NEZ woqooyi-koorsi, bari-galbeed, sare-joog 2080000.00 6150000.00 250.00 ENZ bari-galbeed, woqooyi-koorsi, sare-joog 6150000.00 2080000.00 250.00 Hababka aan P lahayn waxay dhibcaha lambarkeenayaan 1, 2, 3 … sida ay fayl ku jiraan. X waa bari-galbeed, Y waa woqooyi-koorsi. Kala-soocayaasha CivilCraft wuxuu eegaa 20 safka ugu horreeya, wuxuuna doortaa kii ugu horreeya ee ku dhaca ugu yaraan 60% dhammaantood: comma, tab, semicolon. Haddii kale wuxuu kala-jajabiyaa meelaha bannaan oo isku xiga. Faylalka comma, tab iyo semicolon, goobta ku dhex jirta xigashooyin laba-geesood ah ayaa ku jiri kara kala-soocaha (\"FL, NORTH\"), \"\" gudaha xigashooyinka waa hal calaamad xigasho. Faylalka meel-bannaanka lagu kala-soocayo, sharraxaadda ku dhammaanta safka waxay ku jiri kartaa meelo bannaan: wax kasta oo ka dambeeya tiirka ugu dambeeya ee isku-xidhka waa sharraxaad. Safafka ku bilaabma #, ; ama //, iyo safafka banaan waa la dhaafaa. Calaamadda bilowga faylka (byte-order mark) waa la iska dhaafaa. Safka madaxa Safka koowaad waxaa loo tixgeliyaa madax marka ka yar laba goob oo ka mid ah ay yihiin tirooyin. Haddii goob kasta oo madaxa ah uu yahay magac uu CivilCraft aqoonsado, habka tiirarka wuxuu ka imanayaa (\"safka madaxa ka soo baxa\"). Magacyada waxaa la isku dhigaa iyadoo aan loo eegin xarfaha weyn-yar, meelaha bannaan, dhibcaha, hoosta-hoosta, iyo xidhka: Tiir Magacyada la aqoonsado P pt, pnt, point, point no, point number, number, no, id, name, pt#, point#, # N n, north, northing, y, y coord, lat, latitude E e, east, easting, x, x coord, lon, long, longitude Z z, elev, elevation, el, height, h, z coord, rl D d, desc, description, code, raw description, full description, note, notes, feature Haddii magac madax aan la aqoonsan, ama magacyadu aanay mid ka mid ah siddeedda habab sameyn, madaxa waa la dhaafaa, habka tiirarkana waxaa loo qiyaasaa tirada tiirarka. Madax leh magac latitude (lat, latitude) iyo magac longitude (lon, long, longitude) labaduba waxaa loo akhriyaa darajo, ma aha woqooyi-koorsi iyo bari-galbeed. Soo dhoofi dhibcaha waxaa loo beddelaa nidaamka kala-sarrayn ee mashruuca, mashruuc aan lahayn wuxuu marka hore kuu weydiin doonaa inaad doorato. Safafka ka baxsan ±90° latitude ama ±180° longitude waa la diidaa. Eeg Soo dhoofi xogta GIS. Qiyaasta tirada tiirarka Haddii madax lagu isticmaali karo ma jiro oo Tiirarka uu weli ku joogo Ogaag: 5 ama ka badan tiirar: PNEZD. 4 tiirar: PNEZ marka tiirka koowaad yahay lambar oo dhan safka kasta la qaaday, tiirka afaraadna yahay tiro; haddii kale NEZD. 3 tiirar: NEZ. PNEZD iyo PENZD lama kala saari karo tirooyinka. Qiyaasta waxay raacdaa Safafka barta ee Dejinta CivilCraft: P, N, E, Z, D bilowga, ama P, E, N, Z, D (markaas afar tiir waxaa loo akhriyaa PENZ, saddex tiirna ENZ). Wada-hadalku wuxuu leeyahay \"qiyaasta tirada tiirarka — hubi in woqooyi-koorsi iyo bari-galbeed aanay is-beddelin\". Haddii muuqaalku khaldan yahay, dooro habka saxda ah Tiirarka hoose. Sida safafka loo hubiyo Safku wuu ka saari karaa sharraxaadda. Woqooyi-koorsi iyo bari-galbeed waa inay noqdaan tirooyin. Sare-joogga wuu madhan karaa (barta way ka soo kaydsan tahay laakiin uma adeegsanto dusha sare). Lambarka barta wuxuu noqon karaa qoraal kasta (xarfo ayaa ku jiri kara, sida CP1), laakiin waa inuu ku jirtaa. Haddii lambarka barta uu soo noqnoqdo, safka hore ayaa la hayaa, kuwa kalena waxaa lagu liis gareeyaa sida aan la akhrin. Sharraxaadaha waxa la hayaa ilaa 200 xaraf; xarfaha xakamaynta waxay noqdaan meelo bannaan. Ilaa 200 safaf aan la akhrin ayaa la hayaa wada-hadalka (25 ayaa la muujiyaa), dhammaantoodna waa la tiriyaa. Kooxaha barta Kooxda barta waa ereyga koowaad ee sharraxaaddeeda oo weyn. \"GRD\", \"grd shot\" iyo \"Grd\" dhammaantood waa kooxda GRD. Barta aan sharraxaad lahayn waxay ku jirtaa \"(no description)\". Eeg Soo dhoofi dhibcaha sahanka. Qorista dhibcaha CivilCraft weli ma dhoofiyo fayl qoraal oo barta ah. Dhibcaha waxaa loo dhoofiyaa LandXML (sida CgPoints), faylka mashruuca, iyo Dhoofi GIS sida shapefile, GeoPackage ama GeoJSON oo leh goobaha P, N, E, Z iyo D (Dhoofi xogta as-built ee GIS). Eeg Weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"units-and-stations","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Cutubyada, istaysinnada iyo qaababka tirada","summary":"Mashaariicda feet iyo mitir, sida istaysinnada, heerarka, jiifyada dhinacyada, jihooyinka, baaxadaha, mugga iyo cabbirrada tuubooyinka loo qoro iyo loo qoro, iyo waxa beddelidda cutubyada sameyso.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["qor dherer","xisaab","xisaabiye","wadar","qayb","feet iyo inji","4+7/16","cutubyo","feet","US survey feet","mitir","metric","imperial","qaabka istaysinka","istaysinka","heerka","boqolleyda","jiifka","h:v","jihada","yaard cubic","dhexroor"],"headings":[{"id":"cutubyada-mashruuca","text":"Cutubyada mashruuca","level":2},{"id":"qorista-dherer-iyo-wadar","text":"Qorista dherer iyo wadar","level":2},{"id":"istaysinnada","text":"Istaysinnada","level":2},{"id":"heerarka-iyo-jiifyada","text":"Heerarka iyo jiifyada","level":2},{"id":"jihooyinka-iyo-xagasha","text":"Jihooyinka iyo xagasha","level":2},{"id":"xagashaha","text":"Xagashaha","level":2},{"id":"muujinta-lambarada","text":"Muujinta lambarada","level":2},{"id":"koorodinadyada","text":"Koorodinadyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"cutubyada-mashruuca\"\u003ECutubyada mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMashruuc wuxuu ku jiraa \u003Cstrong\u003EUS feet\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Emitir\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada\u003C/strong\u003E ee panel-ka bidix). Qiime kasta, sare-joog, dherer iyo istaysin mashruuca ku jira waxay ku jiraan unugga ka muuqda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddelidda \u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay beddeshaa calaamadaha, qaabka istaysinka, defaults-ka iyo sida faylasha loo qoro. Ma beddesho tiro kasta. Goob laga sameeyay feet oo loo beddelo mitir ayaa haysa tirooyinka isku mid ah, hadda loo akhrinayo sida mitir. Status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Unugyada hadda waa mitir. Koorodinadyada lama beddelin.&quot; Dhig unugyada inay ku habboon yihiin xogtaada ka hor intaadan naqshadeyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxyaabaha ku xidhan unugyada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUS feet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMitir\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka istaysinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12+34.56\u003C/code\u003E (istaysin 100 ft)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1+234.567\u003C/code\u003E (istaysin 1000 m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFardaha kontuurka la bixiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.25 ilaa 20 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.1 ilaa 10 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBaaxadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esq ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esq m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMugga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecu yd\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecu m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexroorka tuubada iyo qaabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Einji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emillimitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadius-ka wareegga caadiga ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E100 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha istaysinka ee sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emid kasta 50 ft, sumad kasta 100 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emid kasta 20 m, sumad kasta 100 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaanka daabacaadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1&quot; = 5&#039; ilaa 1&quot; = 1000&#039;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1:50 ilaa 1:10000\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnugga dherer ee LandXML\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUSSurveyFoot\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emeter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMashruuc cusub wuxuu bilaabmaa feet, ama mitir marka unugga dhererka ee lagu xusay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnugyada\u003C/span\u003E uu yahay mid metric ah. Liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa unugyada lagu shido halkaas, mar walbana kan mashruuca. Haddii unug baaxad ama mug la xusay (acres, hectares, acre-feet …), baaxadaha iyo mugga waxaa lagu soo warbixinayaa unugaas halkii unugga kor ku qoran. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EUnugyada, qiimayaasha la qoro iyo liisaska unugyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad furto LandXML, mashruucu wuxuu qaataa unugyada faylka. Fayl feet caalami ah wuxuu furmaa sida mashruuc feet; tirooyinka lama beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorista-dherer-iyo-wadar\"\u003EQorista dherer iyo wadar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuq kasta oo qaadanaya dherer ama sare-joog wuxuu akhrinayaa wax ka badan tiro fudud: riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sanduuqu wuxuu muujinayaa natiijada unugyada mashruuca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad qortid\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMashruuc feet ah\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMashruuc mitir ah\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12.5 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12.5 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12.5 ft, 12.54 ft, 0.5 ft, 3.5 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisku dherer oo mitir ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E4 7/16\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E4-7/16\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4.4375 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4.4375 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E90 cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.45 m, 1.2 m, 0.9 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 km\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft, iyo kuwa kale US survey feet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisku dherer oo mitir ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E4+7/16\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewadarta, feet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewadarta, mitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMid kasta oo calaamadda dherer ee miiska unugyada la wadaago ayaa shaqeeya, saxda ahaan. Feet mashruuc waa US survey feet, sidaas awgeed \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E waa 10 iyo \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E (silsilad ku salaysan international-foot) waa 197.9996. Isticmaal \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E iyo bracket-yada, iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E. Dhib (-) oo lagu qoray dherer waa qayb ka mid ah (\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6-1/2\u003C/code\u003E); meel bannaan ayey ku jirtaa, wuu kala jaraa (\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039; - 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E = 23.5 ft). Tiro keliya wuu dhufanayaa ama kala qaybiyaa dherer, dherer ahna wuxuu noqdaa unugyada mashruuca marka lagu daro dherer. Haddii CivilCraft aanu akhrin karin waxa aad qortay, sanduuqa waa la calaamadeeyaa, status bar-kuna wuxuu sheegayaa meesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIstaysinnadu maaha wadar: \u003Ccode\u003E10+00\u003C/code\u003E sanduuqa istaysinka waa istaysin 10+00. Heerarka boqolleyda, lambarrada barta iyo sharaxaadaha waa la akhrinayaa sida ay yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"istaysinnada\"\u003EIstaysinnada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIstaysin waa masaafo ku taal jeex, oo lagu qoro calaamadda ku-dar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFeet: qaybta ka horeysa calaamadda ku-dar waa boqollaal feet. \u003Ccode\u003E12+34.56\u003C/code\u003E waa 1,234.56 ft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMitir: qaybta ka horeysa calaamadda ku-dar waa kun-kun mitir. \u003Ccode\u003E1+234.567\u003C/code\u003E waa 1,234.567 m.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIstaysinnada taban calaamadda taban ayey hor ku jirtaa: \u003Ccode\u003E-0+50.00\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeel kasta oo aad istaysin ku qorto (\u003Cstrong\u003EIstaysinka bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIstaysinka\u003C/strong\u003E PVI), waxaad ku qori kartaa calaamadda ku-dar (\u003Ccode\u003E12+34.56\u003C/code\u003E) ama lambar fudud (\u003Ccode\u003E1234.56\u003C/code\u003E). Meelaha bannaan waa la dhaafaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerarka-iyo-jiifyada\"\u003EHeerarka iyo jiifyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka\u003C/strong\u003E (muuqaalka dherer, tuubooyinka, jiifyada dariiqa iyo garoomada) waa boqolleyda: \u003Ccode\u003E+1.25%\u003C/code\u003E wuu kor u kacaa marka istaysinku kordho, \u003Ccode\u003E-0.50%\u003C/code\u003E wuu hoos u dhacaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiifyada dhinacyada\u003C/strong\u003E (gooynta iyo buuxinta pad-ka, gooynta iyo buuxinta koridoorka) waa toosan iyo tuduc: \u003Ccode\u003E3\u003C/code\u003E macnaheedu waa 3 : 1, saddex ka dhinac ah hal kor ama hal hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EK\u003C/strong\u003E ee wareegga toosan waa dhererkiisa oo loo qaybiyay isbeddelka heerka boqolleyda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jihooyinka-iyo-xagasha\"\u003EJihooyinka iyo xagasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJihooyinku waa jihooyinka afar-geesoodka ah ee darajooyinka, daqiiqadaha iyo ilbiriqsiyada: \u003Ccode\u003EN 63°12&#039;05&quot; E\u003C/code\u003E. Wareegyada jeexdu (Δ) waxay isticmaalaan darajooyin, daqiiqado iyo ilbiriqsi isku mid ah, oo leh &quot;bidix&quot; ama &quot;midig&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xagashaha\"\u003EXagashaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXagashaha ka fog jeex waa masaafo toosan, lagu calaamadeeyay \u003Cstrong\u003EL\u003C/strong\u003E (bidix) ama \u003Cstrong\u003ER\u003C/strong\u003E (midig) marka lagu eego sare-istaysinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muujinta-lambarada\"\u003EMuujinta lambarada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-xirka iyo sare-joogga waxay muujinayaan 2 meelood oo dhibcood panel-ka iyo status bar-ka (3 barta sahan dhulka la doortay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBaaxadaha iyo mugga waxaa loo kooxeeyay kun-kun: \u003Ccode\u003E128,250 sq ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E454.9 cu yd\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoorodinadyada weligood lama kooxeeyo, sidaas awgeed waa la koobiyeyn karaa sida ay yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koorodinadyada\"\u003EKoorodinadyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa diyaarad caadi ah: bari midig, waqooyi kor. Shaqada naqshadeynta mar walba waxay ku dhacdaa koorodinado la mashruuciyay (state plane, UTM ama shabakad maxalli ah). Waad u sheegi kartaa CivilCraft nidaamka koorodinadyada, iyo haddii ay yihiin koorodinado shabakad, dhul ama maxalli; markaas wuxuu muujinayaa latitude iyo longitude, wuuna dhigaa faylasha GIS iyo layers-ka khariidadda, laakiin weligiis ma beddelo unugyada ama ma dhaqaajiyo koorodinadyadaada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/coordinate-systems\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/coordinate-systems\"\u003EDeji nidaamka koorodinadyada mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/ground-and-local-coordinates\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/ground-and-local-coordinates\"\u003EKoorodinadyada dhulka iyo kuwa maxalliga ah\u003C/a\u003E. Qiyamka state plane ee waaweyn (malaayiin feet) waa fiican yihiin; CivilCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa xagga goobta gudaheeda si uu saxnaanta u ilaaliyo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Cutubyada mashruuca Mashruuc wuxuu ku jiraa US feet ama mitir (Unugyada ee panel-ka bidix). Qiime kasta, sare-joog, dherer iyo istaysin mashruuca ku jira waxay ku jiraan unugga ka muuqda. Beddelidda Unugyada waxay beddeshaa calaamadaha, qaabka istaysinka, defaults-ka iyo sida faylasha loo qoro. Ma beddesho tiro kasta. Goob laga sameeyay feet oo loo beddelo mitir ayaa haysa tirooyinka isku mid ah, hadda loo akhrinayo sida mitir. Status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay \"Unugyada hadda waa mitir. Koorodinadyada lama beddelin.\" Dhig unugyada inay ku habboon yihiin xogtaada ka hor intaadan naqshadeyn. Waxyaabaha ku xidhan unugyada: US feet Mitir Qaabka istaysinka 12+34.56 (istaysin 100 ft) 1+234.567 (istaysin 1000 m) Fardaha kontuurka la bixiyo 0.25 ilaa 20 ft 0.1 ilaa 10 m Baaxadda sq ft sq m Mugga cu yd cu m Dhexroorka tuubada iyo qaabka inji millimitir Radius-ka wareegga caadiga ah 100 ft 30 m Calaamadaha istaysinka ee sawirka mid kasta 50 ft, sumad kasta 100 ft mid kasta 20 m, sumad kasta 100 m Miisaanka daabacaadda 1\" = 5' ilaa 1\" = 1000' 1:50 ilaa 1:10000 Unugga dherer ee LandXML USSurveyFoot meter Mashruuc cusub wuxuu bilaabmaa feet, ama mitir marka unugga dhererka ee lagu xusay Dejinta › Guud › Unugyada uu yahay mid metric ah. Liiska Unugyada wuxuu muujinayaa unugyada lagu shido halkaas, mar walbana kan mashruuca. Haddii unug baaxad ama mug la xusay (acres, hectares, acre-feet …), baaxadaha iyo mugga waxaa lagu soo warbixinayaa unugaas halkii unugga kor ku qoran. Eeg Unugyada, qiimayaasha la qoro iyo liisaska unugyada. Markaad furto LandXML, mashruucu wuxuu qaataa unugyada faylka. Fayl feet caalami ah wuxuu furmaa sida mashruuc feet; tirooyinka lama beddelo. Qorista dherer iyo wadar Sanduuq kasta oo qaadanaya dherer ama sare-joog wuxuu akhrinayaa wax ka badan tiro fudud: riix Enter sanduuqu wuxuu muujinayaa natiijada unugyada mashruuca. Waxa aad qortid Mashruuc feet ah Mashruuc mitir ah 12.5 12.5 ft 12.5 m 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 6\", 3 ft 6 in 12.5 ft, 12.54 ft, 0.5 ft, 3.5 ft isku dherer oo mitir ah 4 7/16, 4-7/16 4.4375 ft 4.4375 m 450 mm, 1.2 m, 90 cm feet 0.45 m, 1.2 m, 0.9 m 10 US ft, 3 ch, 2 rd, 0.5 mi, 1 km 10 ft, iyo kuwa kale US survey feet isku dherer oo mitir ah 4+7/16, 12'6\" + 3/4\", (24'-0\")/3, 2*450mm wadarta, feet wadarta, mitir Mid kasta oo calaamadda dherer ee miiska unugyada la wadaago ayaa shaqeeya, saxda ahaan. Feet mashruuc waa US survey feet, sidaas awgeed 10 US ft waa 10 iyo 3 ch (silsilad ku salaysan international-foot) waa 197.9996. Isticmaal + - * / iyo bracket-yada, iyo abs, round, ceil iyo floor. Dhib (-) oo lagu qoray dherer waa qayb ka mid ah (24'-6\", 6-1/2); meel bannaan ayey ku jirtaa, wuu kala jaraa (24' - 6\" = 23.5 ft). Tiro keliya wuu dhufanayaa ama kala qaybiyaa dherer, dherer ahna wuxuu noqdaa unugyada mashruuca marka lagu daro dherer. Haddii CivilCraft aanu akhrin karin waxa aad qortay, sanduuqa waa la calaamadeeyaa, status bar-kuna wuxuu sheegayaa meesha. Istaysinnadu maaha wadar: 10+00 sanduuqa istaysinka waa istaysin 10+00. Heerarka boqolleyda, lambarrada barta iyo sharaxaadaha waa la akhrinayaa sida ay yihiin. Istaysinnada Istaysin waa masaafo ku taal jeex, oo lagu qoro calaamadda ku-dar: Feet: qaybta ka horeysa calaamadda ku-dar waa boqollaal feet. 12+34.56 waa 1,234.56 ft. Mitir: qaybta ka horeysa calaamadda ku-dar waa kun-kun mitir. 1+234.567 waa 1,234.567 m. Istaysinnada taban calaamadda taban ayey hor ku jirtaa: -0+50.00. Meel kasta oo aad istaysin ku qorto (Istaysinka bilowga, Istaysinka PVI), waxaad ku qori kartaa calaamadda ku-dar (12+34.56) ama lambar fudud (1234.56). Meelaha bannaan waa la dhaafaa. Heerarka iyo jiifyada Heerarka (muuqaalka dherer, tuubooyinka, jiifyada dariiqa iyo garoomada) waa boqolleyda: +1.25% wuu kor u kacaa marka istaysinku kordho, -0.50% wuu hoos u dhacaa. Jiifyada dhinacyada (gooynta iyo buuxinta pad-ka, gooynta iyo buuxinta koridoorka) waa toosan iyo tuduc: 3 macnaheedu waa 3 : 1, saddex ka dhinac ah hal kor ama hal hoos. K ee wareegga toosan waa dhererkiisa oo loo qaybiyay isbeddelka heerka boqolleyda. Jihooyinka iyo xagasha Jihooyinku waa jihooyinka afar-geesoodka ah ee darajooyinka, daqiiqadaha iyo ilbiriqsiyada: N 63°12'05\" E. Wareegyada jeexdu (Δ) waxay isticmaalaan darajooyin, daqiiqado iyo ilbiriqsi isku mid ah, oo leh \"bidix\" ama \"midig\". Xagashaha Xagashaha ka fog jeex waa masaafo toosan, lagu calaamadeeyay L (bidix) ama R (midig) marka lagu eego sare-istaysinka. Muujinta lambarada Isku-xirka iyo sare-joogga waxay muujinayaan 2 meelood oo dhibcood panel-ka iyo status bar-ka (3 barta sahan dhulka la doortay). Baaxadaha iyo mugga waxaa loo kooxeeyay kun-kun: 128,250 sq ft, 454.9 cu yd. Koorodinadyada weligood lama kooxeeyo, sidaas awgeed waa la koobiyeyn karaa sida ay yihiin. Koorodinadyada CivilCraft wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa diyaarad caadi ah: bari midig, waqooyi kor. Shaqada naqshadeynta mar walba waxay ku dhacdaa koorodinado la mashruuciyay (state plane, UTM ama shabakad maxalli ah). Waad u sheegi kartaa CivilCraft nidaamka koorodinadyada, iyo haddii ay yihiin koorodinado shabakad, dhul ama maxalli; markaas wuxuu muujinayaa latitude iyo longitude, wuuna dhigaa faylasha GIS iyo layers-ka khariidadda, laakiin weligiis ma beddelo unugyada ama ma dhaqaajiyo koorodinadyadaada. Eeg Deji nidaamka koorodinadyada mashruuca iyo Koorodinadyada dhulka iyo kuwa maxalliga ah. Qiyamka state plane ee waaweyn (malaayiin feet) waa fiican yihiin; CivilCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa xagga goobta gudaheeda si uu saxnaanta u ilaaliyo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"landxml-reference","scope":"civilcraft","title":"LandXML: waxa la akhriyo oo la qoro","summary":"Elementiyada iyo sifooyinka LandXML 1.2 ee CivilCraft akhriyo oo qoro, element kasta oo kale, iyo wixii ay ka tagto.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["landxml","xml","cgpoints","surface","tin","breaklines","boundary","alignment","coordgeom","profile","profalign","pvi","paracurve","pipenetworks","struct","pipe","planfeatures","planfeature","khadka muuqaalka","skeema"],"headings":[{"id":"waa-la-qoray","text":"Waa la qoray","level":2},{"id":"waa-la-akhriyay","text":"Waa la akhriyay","level":2},{"id":"waa-la-tagay-waana-lagu-xusay-fariimaha","text":"Waa la tagay, waana lagu xusay fariimaha","level":2},{"id":"fariimaha-marka-faylku-furmi-waayo","text":"Fariimaha marka faylku furmi waayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu qoraa LandXML 1.2 oo leh magaca rasmiga ah iyo goobta skeemada. Wuxuu akhrinayaa fayl kasta oo xididka elementigiisu yahay \u003Ccode\u003ELandXML\u003C/code\u003E, wuxuuna qaataa elementiyada hoose magacyadooda: horyaalka magaca-meeleedka waa la iska indho tirayaa; nooca ma la hubinayo. Akhristaha XML-ka wuxuu aqbalaa kaliya shan entity-yada caadiga ah iyo tilmaamayaasha lambarka-xarfaha; ma soo rarto DTD ama fayl dibadda ah. Tallaabooyinka, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landxml\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landxml\"\u003EIsweydaarsashada LandXML\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELandXML waxa uu qoraa iskuxirka waqooyi-marka-hore: barta waa &quot;N E&quot; ama &quot;N E Z&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-la-qoray\"\u003EWaa la qoray\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EElementi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa CivilCraft qorayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUnits\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EImperial\u003C/code\u003E (linearUnit USSurveyFoot, aagagga cagaha labajibbaaran, mugga cagaha sadexjibbaaran, dhexroorka inji) ama \u003Ccode\u003EMetric\u003C/code\u003E (meter, mitir labajibbaaran, mitir sadexjibbaaran, millimeter)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EProject\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E = magaca mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EApplication\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emagaca CivilCraft, soo-saaraha CadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ECgPoints\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003ECgPoint\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E = lambarka barta, \u003Ccode\u003Edesc\u003C/code\u003E = sharraxaad, \u003Ccode\u003Ecode\u003C/code\u003E = kooxda; qoraal &quot;N E Z&quot; (ama &quot;N E&quot; la&#039;aanta muuqaalka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EAlignments\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EAlignment\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elength\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EstaStart\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ECoordGeom\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003ELine\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EstaStart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elength\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EStart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EEnd\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ECoordGeom\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003ECurve\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EcrvType\u003C/code\u003E arc, \u003Ccode\u003Erot\u003C/code\u003E cw ama ccw, \u003Ccode\u003Eradius\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elength\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EstaStart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Echord\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edelta\u003C/code\u003E (darajo), \u003Ccode\u003Etangent\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eexternal\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EmidOrd\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003EStart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECenter\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EEnd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EPI\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EProfile\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EProfSurf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edhulka jira ee toosinta ku dhex jira, oo ah lamaane station iyo muuqaal (\u003Ccode\u003EPntList2D\u003C/code\u003E), oo la kala jaray meesha ka baxda dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EProfile\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EProfAlign\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emuuqaalka naqshadda (oo loo magacaabay &quot;&lt;alignment&gt; design&quot;): \u003Ccode\u003EPVI\u003C/code\u003E dhammaadka iyo barta xagasha, \u003Ccode\u003EParaCurve\u003C/code\u003E oo leh \u003Ccode\u003Elength\u003C/code\u003E dhuuntada toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ESurfaces\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003ESurface\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Edesc\u003C/code\u003E; marka hore dhulka jira, kadibna &quot;Proposed&quot; marka pad-yada ama corridor-yada sare-u-qaadaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ESourceData\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EBreaklines\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EBreakline\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EbrkType\u003C/code\u003E standard, \u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EPntList3D\u003C/code\u003E (dhulka jira kaliya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ESourceData\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EBoundaries\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EBoundary\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EbndType\u003C/code\u003E outer, \u003Ccode\u003EedgeTrim\u003C/code\u003E true, \u003Ccode\u003EPntList2D\u003C/code\u003E (dhulka jira kaliya, marka uu jiro)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EDefinition\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EsurfType\u003C/code\u003E TIN, \u003Ccode\u003Earea2DSurf\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earea3DSurf\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EelevMax\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EelevMin\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003EPnts\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E oo leh \u003Ccode\u003Eid\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003EFaces\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EF\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EPipeNetworks\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EPipeNetwork\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EpipeNetType\u003C/code\u003E storm ama sanitary\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EStruct\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EelevRim\u003C/code\u003E (xadka la isticmaalay, la dejiyay ama dusha laga qaatay), \u003Ccode\u003EelevSump\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003ECenter\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003ECircStruct\u003C/code\u003E oo leh \u003Ccode\u003Ediameter\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003EInvert\u003C/code\u003E oo leh \u003Ccode\u003Eelev\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EflowDir\u003C/code\u003E in ama out, \u003Ccode\u003ErefPipe\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EPipe\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ErefStart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ErefEnd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elength\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eslope\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003ECircPipe\u003C/code\u003E oo leh \u003Ccode\u003Ediameter\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EPlanFeatures\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EPlanFeature\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emid kasta khad muuqaal: \u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003ECoordGeom\u003C/code\u003E oo leh \u003Ccode\u003ELine\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Elength\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EStart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EEnd\u003C/code\u003E) iyo \u003Ccode\u003ECurve\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Erot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EcrvType\u003C/code\u003E arc, \u003Ccode\u003Eradius\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elength\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Echord\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edelta\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003EStart\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EEnd\u003C/code\u003E sida &quot;N E Z&quot;, \u003Ccode\u003ECenter\u003C/code\u003E sida &quot;N E&quot;); \u003Ccode\u003EFeature\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003Ecode=&quot;CivilCraft&quot;\u003C/code\u003E oo leh \u003Ccode\u003EProperty\u003C/code\u003E isticmaal iyo closed\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELama qorin: pad-yada iyo corridor-yada sida shay (natiijadooda waa dusha &quot;Proposed&quot;), toosinta leh khaladaad, tuubooyinka aan labada inverts lahayn, xeerarka shabakada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-la-akhriyay\"\u003EWaa la akhriyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EElementi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa CivilCraft qaataa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUnits\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EImperial\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EMetric\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003ElinearUnit\u003C/code\u003E ayaa go&#039;aaminaya cagaha ama mitirka. Unit aan la aqoon waa la xusay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EProject\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu noqdaa magaca mashruuca.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ECgPoints\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003ECgPoint\u003C/code\u003E (xitaa kuwa ku-dhex-jira)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emagaca (ama \u003Ccode\u003EoID\u003C/code\u003E), &quot;N E&quot; ama &quot;N E Z&quot;, \u003Ccode\u003Edesc\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003Ecode\u003C/code\u003E) sida sharraxaadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ESurface\u003C/code\u003E oo leh \u003Ccode\u003EDefinition surfType=&quot;TIN&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EPnts\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EFaces\u003C/code\u003E sida dhulka jira (dusha koowaad oo keliya); wajiyada aan muuqan (\u003Ccode\u003Ei=&quot;1&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) waa la reebay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ESourceData\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EBreaklines\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Exariiqyada 3D, oo lagu hayo dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ESourceData\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EBoundaries\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Exuduudka dibadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EAlignment\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003ECoordGeom\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eelementiyada \u003Ccode\u003ELine\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003ECurve\u003C/code\u003E; PI-yada dib loo dhisay \u003Ccode\u003EPI\u003C/code\u003E curve kasta, ama \u003Ccode\u003ECenter\u003C/code\u003E iyo tangents; \u003Ccode\u003EstaStart\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EProfile\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EProfAlign\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EPVI\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EParaCurve\u003C/code\u003E (oo leh \u003Ccode\u003Elength\u003C/code\u003E); muuqaalka naqshadda ee koowaad oo leh ugu yaraan laba PVI\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EPlanFeatures\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003EPlanFeature\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emid kasta sida khad muuqaal: \u003Ccode\u003ELine\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECurve\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003EStart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECenter\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EEnd\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Erot\u003C/code\u003E) iyo \u003Ccode\u003EIrregularLine\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003EPntList3D\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EPntList2D\u003C/code\u003E) oo isku xira dhammaadka ilaa dhamaadka (godka waxaa lagu xidhaa jid toosan oo la xusay); la xiray haddii ay ku dhamaato meeshii ay ka bilaabatay; isticmaal iyo closed-ka \u003Ccode\u003EFeature\u003C/code\u003E ee CivilCraft, haddii kale \u003Cstrong\u003EKaliya la sawiray\u003C/strong\u003E. Barooyinka aan muuqaal lahayn waxay helaan 0 (la xusay).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ESpiral\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Espiral-yada clothoid ee \u003Ccode\u003ECurve\u003C/code\u003E ag dhow (gudaha iyo dibadda; waxa loo akhriyaa PI oo leh radius iyo dhererka spiral-ka, dib loo qoraa \u003Ccode\u003Etheta\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EtotalX\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EtotalY\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EtanLong\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EtanShort\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Econstant\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EPipeNetwork\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eshabakada koowaad ee leh tuubooyin: \u003Ccode\u003EStruct\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003ECenter\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EelevRim\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EelevSump\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECircStruct\u003C/code\u003E diameter, \u003Ccode\u003EInvert\u003C/code\u003E tuubo kasta) iyo \u003Ccode\u003EPipe\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003ErefStart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ErefEnd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECircPipe\u003C/code\u003E diameter)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-la-tagay-waana-lagu-xusay-fariimaha\"\u003EWaa la tagay, waana lagu xusay fariimaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha ka dambeeya kan koowaad, dusha grid-ka iyo dusha kasta oo aan TIN ahayn\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToosinta leh \u003Ccode\u003EIrregularLine\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EChain\u003C/code\u003E, spiral-yada aan clothoid ahayn, spiral u dhexeeya laba curve, ama toosinta aan geometry lahayn\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuuqaalka naqshadda ee ka dambeeya kan koowaad; \u003Ccode\u003ECircCurve\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EUnsymParaCurve\u003C/code\u003E dhuuntada toosan (PVI-yadooda waa la haynayaa iyada oo aan curve lahayn)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarooyinka oo kaliya tixraacaya barooyin kale (\u003Ccode\u003EpntRef\u003C/code\u003E), iyo barooyinka aan lagu akhrin karin isku-xirka\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagacyada barooyinka soo noqnoqday (kan koowaad ayaa la hayaa)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXuduudyada qarsan, muujinta iyo xogta-jarka; xariiqyada aan lahayn barooyin 3D\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShabakadaha tuubooyinka ka dambeeya kan koowaad; noocyada shabakada aan storm iyo sanitary ahayn (waa la akhriyaa sida storm)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaab-afar-geesood, soo-gelin iyo soo-saar ahaan (waa la akhriyaa sida goobo); tuubooyinka ukun, ellipse iyo sanduuq iyo kanaalada (waa la akhriyaa sida tuubooyin goobo ah oo aan cabbir lahayn)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EElementiyada \u003Ccode\u003ESpiral\u003C/code\u003E ee khad muuqaalka\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EParcels\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ERoadways\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EGradeModel\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003ESurvey\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka dhulka (\u003Ccode\u003EProfSurf\u003C/code\u003E) ee faylka ma la isticmaalo: CivilCraft wuxuu dhulka ka soo qaadaa dusha laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fariimaha-marka-faylku-furmi-waayo\"\u003EFariimaha marka faylku furmi waayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Waa XML laakiin ma aha LandXML (xididka elementigiisu waa &lt;…&gt;).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku waa nooc kale oo XML ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… ma leh barooyin, dusha TIN ama toosin oo CivilCraft akhriyi karo.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa ku jira faylka oo dhan waa liiska la reebay. Qoraalada ka dambeeya ayaa sheegaya waxa ku jiray.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Tag-ka dhamaadka oo aan waafaqsanayn …&quot;, &quot;Tag aan la xirin …&quot;, &quot;Faylku wuxuu ku dhammaadaa gudaha …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku waa khaldan yahay ama waa la gooyay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"CivilCraft wuxuu qoraa LandXML 1.2 oo leh magaca rasmiga ah iyo goobta skeemada. Wuxuu akhrinayaa fayl kasta oo xididka elementigiisu yahay LandXML, wuxuuna qaataa elementiyada hoose magacyadooda: horyaalka magaca-meeleedka waa la iska indho tirayaa; nooca ma la hubinayo. Akhristaha XML-ka wuxuu aqbalaa kaliya shan entity-yada caadiga ah iyo tilmaamayaasha lambarka-xarfaha; ma soo rarto DTD ama fayl dibadda ah. Tallaabooyinka, eeg Isweydaarsashada LandXML. LandXML waxa uu qoraa iskuxirka waqooyi-marka-hore: barta waa \"N E\" ama \"N E Z\". Waa la qoray Elementi Waxa CivilCraft qorayo Units Imperial (linearUnit USSurveyFoot, aagagga cagaha labajibbaaran, mugga cagaha sadexjibbaaran, dhexroorka inji) ama Metric (meter, mitir labajibbaaran, mitir sadexjibbaaran, millimeter) Project name = magaca mashruuca Application magaca CivilCraft, soo-saaraha CadCraft CgPoints / CgPoint name = lambarka barta, desc = sharraxaad, code = kooxda; qoraal \"N E Z\" (ama \"N E\" la'aanta muuqaalka) Alignments / Alignment name, length, staStart CoordGeom / Line staStart, length, Start, End CoordGeom / Curve crvType arc, rot cw ama ccw, radius, length, staStart, chord, delta (darajo), tangent, external, midOrd; Start, Center, End, PI Profile / ProfSurf dhulka jira ee toosinta ku dhex jira, oo ah lamaane station iyo muuqaal (PntList2D), oo la kala jaray meesha ka baxda dusha Profile / ProfAlign muuqaalka naqshadda (oo loo magacaabay \"\u003Calignment\u003E design\"): PVI dhammaadka iyo barta xagasha, ParaCurve oo leh length dhuuntada toosan Surfaces / Surface name iyo desc; marka hore dhulka jira, kadibna \"Proposed\" marka pad-yada ama corridor-yada sare-u-qaadaan SourceData / Breaklines / Breakline brkType standard, name, PntList3D (dhulka jira kaliya) SourceData / Boundaries / Boundary bndType outer, edgeTrim true, PntList2D (dhulka jira kaliya, marka uu jiro) Definition surfType TIN, area2DSurf, area3DSurf, elevMax, elevMin; Pnts / P oo leh id; Faces / F PipeNetworks / PipeNetwork name, pipeNetType storm ama sanitary Struct name, elevRim (xadka la isticmaalay, la dejiyay ama dusha laga qaatay), elevSump; Center; CircStruct oo leh diameter; Invert oo leh elev, flowDir in ama out, refPipe Pipe name, refStart, refEnd, length, slope; CircPipe oo leh diameter PlanFeatures / PlanFeature mid kasta khad muuqaal: name; CoordGeom oo leh Line (length, Start, End) iyo Curve (rot, crvType arc, radius, length, chord, delta; Start iyo End sida \"N E Z\", Center sida \"N E\"); Feature code=\"CivilCraft\" oo leh Property isticmaal iyo closed Lama qorin: pad-yada iyo corridor-yada sida shay (natiijadooda waa dusha \"Proposed\"), toosinta leh khaladaad, tuubooyinka aan labada inverts lahayn, xeerarka shabakada. Waa la akhriyay Elementi Waxa CivilCraft qaataa Units Imperial ama Metric iyo linearUnit ayaa go'aaminaya cagaha ama mitirka. Unit aan la aqoon waa la xusay. Project name wuxuu noqdaa magaca mashruuca. CgPoints / CgPoint (xitaa kuwa ku-dhex-jira) magaca (ama oID), \"N E\" ama \"N E Z\", desc (ama code) sida sharraxaadda Surface oo leh Definition surfType=\"TIN\" Pnts iyo Faces sida dhulka jira (dusha koowaad oo keliya); wajiyada aan muuqan (i=\"1\") waa la reebay SourceData / Breaklines xariiqyada 3D, oo lagu hayo dusha SourceData / Boundaries xuduudka dibadda Alignment / CoordGeom elementiyada Line iyo Curve; PI-yada dib loo dhisay PI curve kasta, ama Center iyo tangents; staStart Profile / ProfAlign PVI iyo ParaCurve (oo leh length); muuqaalka naqshadda ee koowaad oo leh ugu yaraan laba PVI PlanFeatures / PlanFeature mid kasta sida khad muuqaal: Line, Curve (Start, Center, End iyo rot) iyo IrregularLine (PntList3D ama PntList2D) oo isku xira dhammaadka ilaa dhamaadka (godka waxaa lagu xidhaa jid toosan oo la xusay); la xiray haddii ay ku dhamaato meeshii ay ka bilaabatay; isticmaal iyo closed-ka Feature ee CivilCraft, haddii kale Kaliya la sawiray. Barooyinka aan muuqaal lahayn waxay helaan 0 (la xusay). Spiral spiral-yada clothoid ee Curve ag dhow (gudaha iyo dibadda; waxa loo akhriyaa PI oo leh radius iyo dhererka spiral-ka, dib loo qoraa theta, totalX, totalY, tanLong, tanShort, constant) PipeNetwork shabakada koowaad ee leh tuubooyin: Struct (Center, elevRim, elevSump, CircStruct diameter, Invert tuubo kasta) iyo Pipe (refStart, refEnd, CircPipe diameter) Waa la tagay, waana lagu xusay fariimaha Dusha ka dambeeya kan koowaad, dusha grid-ka iyo dusha kasta oo aan TIN ahayn Toosinta leh IrregularLine ama Chain, spiral-yada aan clothoid ahayn, spiral u dhexeeya laba curve, ama toosinta aan geometry lahayn Muuqaalka naqshadda ee ka dambeeya kan koowaad; CircCurve iyo UnsymParaCurve dhuuntada toosan (PVI-yadooda waa la haynayaa iyada oo aan curve lahayn) Barooyinka oo kaliya tixraacaya barooyin kale (pntRef), iyo barooyinka aan lagu akhrin karin isku-xirka Magacyada barooyinka soo noqnoqday (kan koowaad ayaa la hayaa) Xuduudyada qarsan, muujinta iyo xogta-jarka; xariiqyada aan lahayn barooyin 3D Shabakadaha tuubooyinka ka dambeeya kan koowaad; noocyada shabakada aan storm iyo sanitary ahayn (waa la akhriyaa sida storm) Qaab-afar-geesood, soo-gelin iyo soo-saar ahaan (waa la akhriyaa sida goobo); tuubooyinka ukun, ellipse iyo sanduuq iyo kanaalada (waa la akhriyaa sida tuubooyin goobo ah oo aan cabbir lahayn) Elementiyada Spiral ee khad muuqaalka Parcels, Roadways, GradeModel iyo Survey Muuqaalka dhulka (ProfSurf) ee faylka ma la isticmaalo: CivilCraft wuxuu dhulka ka soo qaadaa dusha laftiisa. Fariimaha marka faylku furmi waayo Fariin Macnaha \"Waa XML laakiin ma aha LandXML (xididka elementigiisu waa \u003C…\u003E).\" Faylku waa nooc kale oo XML ah. \"… ma leh barooyin, dusha TIN ama toosin oo CivilCraft akhriyi karo.\" Waxa ku jira faylka oo dhan waa liiska la reebay. Qoraalada ka dambeeya ayaa sheegaya waxa ku jiray. \"Tag-ka dhamaadka oo aan waafaqsanayn …\", \"Tag aan la xirin …\", \"Faylku wuxuu ku dhammaadaa gudaha …\" Faylku waa khaldan yahay ama waa la gooyay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"plan-layers","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Lakabyada qorshaha","summary":"Magacyada lakabka go'an, midabada iyo xariijinta khadka ee CivilCraft isticmaasho shaashadda, DXF iyo PDF, iyo dejinta bandhigga ee xakamaysa mid kasta.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["lakabyada","magacyada lakabka","ncs","midabada","aci","miisaanka khadka","lakabyada dxf","pdf","dejinta bandhigga","khadadka"],"headings":[{"id":"miisaanka-khadka-ee-pdf","text":"Miisaanka khadka ee PDF","level":2},{"id":"cabbirrada-calaamadaha","text":"Cabbirrada calaamadaha","level":2},{"id":"lakab-lagu-muujin","text":"Lakab lagu muujin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWax walba oo qorshaha ku jira waxay ku jiraan lakab. Magacyadu waxay raacaan qaabka caadiga ah ee lakabyada dhismaha dhulka (qaybta, kooxda weyn, kooxda yar). Lakabyadu waa go&#039;an yihiin dhismahan: ma magacaabi kartid, ma beddeli kartid midabkooda, ama lakab kaaga ma dari kartid. Ku DXF, lakab kasta wuxuu leeyahay lambarka midabka ee lagu muujiyay; ku PDF-ka oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayer colors\u003C/span\u003E, isla midabyada ayaa la isticmaalaa, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBlack\u003C/span\u003E wax walba waxay ku daabacmaan madow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELakab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMidabka (lambarka DXF)\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxay muuqataa marka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-MINR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurrada yar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECawl (8)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EContours\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-MAJR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurrada waaweyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECad ama madow (7)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EContours\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-TEXT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha kontuurka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECad ama madow (7)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EContours\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EContour labels\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-TINN\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha saddexagallada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECawl (8)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETriangles\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-BRKL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka jebinta iyo xuduudka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOranji (30)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBreaklines\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-BNDY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuduudka dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECad ama madow (7)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurface edge\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-TOPO-SLOP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFallaadaha naqaska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESayaan (4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope arrows\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EV-NODE\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta sahanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECagaar (3)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoints\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EV-NODE-TEXT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha barta: lambarka, dhererka, sharaxaadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECagaar (3)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoints\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoint labels\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EV-NODE-LINE\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka laga sameeyay koodhka khadka (kooxaha aan ahayn khadadka jebinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECagaar (3)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoints\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-CNTR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka dhexe ee khadka waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECasaan (1)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarwalba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-STAN\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha istaysinka, PC iyo PT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECasaan (1)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarwalba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-CORR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuduudaha kooridorka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHuruud (2)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarwalba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-SCTN\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka muunadda (halka qaybaha laga jaro)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECawl (8)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka khadka waddadu leedahay khadadka muunadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-GRAD-PADS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuduudaha padka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuluug (5)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarwalba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-GRAD-DAYL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka daylight\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagenta (6)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarwalba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-GRAD-SLOP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka naqaska simaynta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagenta (6)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarwalba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-GRAD-FEAT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka astaanta (3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECagaar (3)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarwalba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-ROAD-SWPT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidadka wareegga: xuduudka, waddooyinka baabuurka ee ugu dambeeya, magaca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOranji (30)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarwalba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-STRM-PIPE\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuluug (5)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPipes\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-STRM-STRC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhismayaasha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuluug (5)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPipes\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-STRM-TEXT\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha tuubada iyo dhismaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuluug (5)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPipes\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC-STRM-PROB\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha dhibaato leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECasaan (1)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPipes\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadadka jebinta waxa la sawiraa keliya inta \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E ku jirta \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhig\u003C/strong\u003E tahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExisting ground\u003C/span\u003E; xuduudka waxa lagu sawiraa labada dusha midkood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaanka-khadka-ee-pdf\"\u003EMiisaanka khadka ee PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELakabyada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.50 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka dhexe ee khadka waddada, padyada, tuubooyinka, tuubooyinka dhibaato leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.35 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurrada waaweyn, khadadka daylight, dhismayaasha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.25 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka jebinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.13 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurrada yar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.09 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha saddexagallada, khadadka naqaska simaynta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.18 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax kale oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylalka DXF ma leeyihiin miisaanka khadka; dejiso lakab lakab ah barnaamijkaaga CAD.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirrada-calaamadaha\"\u003ECabbirrada calaamadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha waxa loo cabbiray warqadda: calaamadaha kontuurka 2.0 mm, calaamadaha istaysinka 1.8 mm, calaamadaha PC iyo PT iyo calaamadaha tuubada iyo dhismaha 1.6 mm, calaamadaha barta 1.5 mm. Calaamadaha tuubada waxay siiyaan magaca, dhexroorka iyo naqaska; calaamadaha dhismaha waxay siiyaan magaca iyo cidhiidhka. Shaashadda waxay isku cabbir yihiin marka aad weyneyso. Ku DXF, waxa loo miisaameeyaa miisaanka lagu magacaabay fariinta dhoofinta; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/dxf-export\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/dxf-export\"\u003EDhoofi qorshaha DXF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lakab-lagu-muujin\"\u003ELakab lagu muujin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha dhererka waxa lagu sawiraa hoosta khadadka shaashadda kaliya. Muuqaalka profiilka ma qayb ka ah qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Wax walba oo qorshaha ku jira waxay ku jiraan lakab. Magacyadu waxay raacaan qaabka caadiga ah ee lakabyada dhismaha dhulka (qaybta, kooxda weyn, kooxda yar). Lakabyadu waa go'an yihiin dhismahan: ma magacaabi kartid, ma beddeli kartid midabkooda, ama lakab kaaga ma dari kartid. Ku DXF, lakab kasta wuxuu leeyahay lambarka midabka ee lagu muujiyay; ku PDF-ka oo leh Layer colors, isla midabyada ayaa la isticmaalaa, iyo Black wax walba waxay ku daabacmaan madow. Lakab Waxa ku jira Midabka (lambarka DXF) Waxay muuqataa marka C-TOPO-MINR Kontuurrada yar Cawl (8) Contours C-TOPO-MAJR Kontuurrada waaweyn Cad ama madow (7) Contours C-TOPO-TEXT Calaamadaha kontuurka Cad ama madow (7) Contours iyo Contour labels C-TOPO-TINN Geesaha saddexagallada Cawl (8) Triangles C-TOPO-BRKL Khadadka jebinta iyo xuduudka Oranji (30) Breaklines C-TOPO-BNDY Xuduudka dusha Cad ama madow (7) Surface edge C-TOPO-SLOP Fallaadaha naqaska Sayaan (4) Slope arrows V-NODE Barta sahanka Cagaar (3) Points V-NODE-TEXT Calaamadaha barta: lambarka, dhererka, sharaxaadda Cagaar (3) Points iyo Point labels V-NODE-LINE Khadadka laga sameeyay koodhka khadka (kooxaha aan ahayn khadadka jebinta) Cagaar (3) Points C-ROAD-CNTR Khadadka dhexe ee khadka waddada Casaan (1) Marwalba C-ROAD-STAN Calaamadaha istaysinka, PC iyo PT Casaan (1) Marwalba C-ROAD-CORR Xuduudaha kooridorka Huruud (2) Marwalba C-ROAD-SCTN Khadadka muunadda (halka qaybaha laga jaro) Cawl (8) Marka khadka waddadu leedahay khadadka muunadda C-GRAD-PADS Xuduudaha padka Buluug (5) Marwalba C-GRAD-DAYL Khadadka daylight Magenta (6) Marwalba C-GRAD-SLOP Khadadka naqaska simaynta Magenta (6) Marwalba C-GRAD-FEAT Khadadka astaanta (3D) Cagaar (3) Marwalba C-ROAD-SWPT Jidadka wareegga: xuduudka, waddooyinka baabuurka ee ugu dambeeya, magaca Oranji (30) Marwalba C-STRM-PIPE Tuubooyinka Buluug (5) Pipes C-STRM-STRC Dhismayaasha Buluug (5) Pipes C-STRM-TEXT Calaamadaha tuubada iyo dhismaha Buluug (5) Pipes C-STRM-PROB Tuubooyinka iyo dhismayaasha dhibaato leh Casaan (1) Pipes Khadadka jebinta waxa la sawiraa keliya inta Dusha ku jirta Bandhig tahay Existing ground; xuduudka waxa lagu sawiraa labada dusha midkood. Miisaanka khadka ee PDF Miisaan Lakabyada 0.50 mm Khadadka dhexe ee khadka waddada, padyada, tuubooyinka, tuubooyinka dhibaato leh 0.35 mm Kontuurrada waaweyn, khadadka daylight, dhismayaasha 0.25 mm Khadadka jebinta 0.13 mm Kontuurrada yar 0.09 mm Geesaha saddexagallada, khadadka naqaska simaynta 0.18 mm Wax kale oo dhan Faylalka DXF ma leeyihiin miisaanka khadka; dejiso lakab lakab ah barnaamijkaaga CAD. Cabbirrada calaamadaha Calaamadaha waxa loo cabbiray warqadda: calaamadaha kontuurka 2.0 mm, calaamadaha istaysinka 1.8 mm, calaamadaha PC iyo PT iyo calaamadaha tuubada iyo dhismaha 1.6 mm, calaamadaha barta 1.5 mm. Calaamadaha tuubada waxay siiyaan magaca, dhexroorka iyo naqaska; calaamadaha dhismaha waxay siiyaan magaca iyo cidhiidhka. Shaashadda waxay isku cabbir yihiin marka aad weyneyso. Ku DXF, waxa loo miisaameeyaa miisaanka lagu magacaabay fariinta dhoofinta; eeg Dhoofi qorshaha DXF. Lakab lagu muujin Qaybaha dhererka waxa lagu sawiraa hoosta khadadka shaashadda kaliya. Muuqaalka profiilka ma qayb ka ah qorshaha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"defaults","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Qiimayaasha bilowga ah iyo meelo-hayeenka","summary":"Qiime kasta oo CivilCraft ku bilaabo, mashruucyada cusub, bandhigga, jidadka iyo profiles-ka, padyada, kooridorka, shabakadda biibaanka, mugga iyo qorshaha, iyo kuwa ah meelo-hayeen la bedeli karo.","section":"reference","order":70,"keywords":["defaults","settings","qiimayaasha bilowga ah","meelo-hayeen","placeholders","heerarka naqshadda","shuruudaha","standards","rules","assumptions"],"headings":[{"id":"mashruuc-cusub","text":"Mashruuc cusub","level":2},{"id":"bandhig","text":"Bandhig","level":2},{"id":"jidadka-iyo-profiles-ka","text":"Jidadka iyo profiles-ka","level":2},{"id":"padyada","text":"Padyada","level":2},{"id":"assembly-ga-kooridorka-meelo-hayeen","text":"Assembly-ga kooridorka (meelo-hayeen)","level":2},{"id":"shabakadda-biibaanka","text":"Shabakadda biibaanka","level":2},{"id":"mugga","text":"Mugga","level":2},{"id":"qorshaha","text":"Qorshaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft ma leh sanduuq dejin ama qaab. Kuwani waa qiimayaasha wax kasta ku bilaabmaan. Qiimayaasha lagu calaamadiyay \u003Cstrong\u003Emeelo-hayeen\u003C/strong\u003E laguma soo qaadanin heer; ku beddel shuruudahaaga mashruuca ka hor inta aadan ku tiirsanaan hubinta ama tirada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mashruuc-cusub\"\u003EMashruuc cusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiime\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoob aan la magacaabin (magaca faylka barta ugu horreeya ayaa beddela)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECutubka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFiit US\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxaha barta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxba kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarood\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeeska dibada ugu dheer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0 (ilaali saddexagal kasta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETallaabooyinka ka noqoshada la kaydiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E200\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bandhig\"\u003EBandhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiime\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhulka jira\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuur kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 (ft ama m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaaweyn kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurka 5aad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagaagaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontuurada, calaamadaha kontuurka, barahaa, khadadka jebinta, geesta dusha, biibaanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDemi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddexagallada, xagaagaha heerarka, fallaadaha naqaska, calaamadaha barta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidadka-iyo-profiles-ka\"\u003EJidadka iyo profiles-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiime\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidka 1, Jidka 2 …\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsteeshanka bilowga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0+00\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadius-ka curve PI kasta oo dhex ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E100 ft ama 30 m, yar haddii aanu ku habboon nus tangent kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadda profile-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidna ilaa aad bilowdo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bilow dhulka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa PVI dhulka dhamaad kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhererka curve-ka kor-u-kaca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0 (curve la&#039;aan) ilaa aad qortid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"padyada\"\u003EPadyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiime\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPad 1, Pad 2 …\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeerka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka dhexda padka, oo lagu wareejiyay 0.1 (0 haddii dhexdu dusha ka baxdo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqaska jarista\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 : 1 (meelo-hayeen)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqaska buuxinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3 : 1 (meelo-hayeen)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assembly-ga-kooridorka-meelo-hayeen\"\u003EAssembly-ga kooridorka (meelo-hayeen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFiit US\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMitir\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBallaca waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3.6 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqaska waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2%\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBallaca garabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.2 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqaska garabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4%\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqaska jarista\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 : 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 : 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqaska buuxinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3 : 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3 : 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shabakadda-biibaanka\"\u003EShabakadda biibaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFiit US\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMitir\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca iyo nooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStorm, storm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStorm, storm\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqaska ugu yar (meelo-hayeen)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.50%\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.50%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDabool ugu yar (meelo-hayeen)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.6 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoos-u-dhac qaab-dhismeedyada (meelo-hayeen)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.10 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.03 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiameter-ka qaab-dhismeed cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E48 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1200 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiameter-ka tuubo cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E300 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoto-dheerka sump\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGees\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha ka bilow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha ka bilow\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShabakadda biibaanka oo laga furay LandXML waxay isticmaashaa xeerarkan sidoo kale, sababtoo ah LandXML ma qaadi karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mugga\"\u003EMugga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiime\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakad, la tijaabiyay bartaha unugyada gudaha khadadka iftiinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka unugga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa doortay si aagga qorshaha ee la jaray u leeyahay qiyaastii 250,000 unug (1, 2 ama 5 jeer tiro laga soo qaado 10)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBalaadhin iyo yaraynta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidna\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorshaha\"\u003EQorshaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiime\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAagga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax walba\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWarqadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETabloid 11 × 17 in (mashruucyada fiitka), ISO A3 (mashruucyada mitirka); had iyo jeer toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaanka ugu weyn ee liiska ku jira oo ku habboon\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidabada lakabka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadaha DXF waxaa lagu cabbiraa miisaanka oo wax kasta ku habboon Tabloid (fiit) ama A3 (mitir).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"CivilCraft ma leh sanduuq dejin ama qaab. Kuwani waa qiimayaasha wax kasta ku bilaabmaan. Qiimayaasha lagu calaamadiyay meelo-hayeen laguma soo qaadanin heer; ku beddel shuruudahaaga mashruuca ka hor inta aadan ku tiirsanaan hubinta ama tirada. Mashruuc cusub Dejinta Qiime Magac Goob aan la magacaabin (magaca faylka barta ugu horreeya ayaa beddela) Cutubka Fiit US Magaca dusha Dhulka jira Kooxaha barta Kooxba kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa Barood Geeska dibada ugu dheer 0 (ilaali saddexagal kasta) Tallaabooyinka ka noqoshada la kaydiyo 200 Bandhig Dejinta Qiime Dusha Dhulka jira Kontuur kasta 1 (ft ama m) Waaweyn kasta Kontuurka 5aad Xagaagaha 8 Shid Kontuurada, calaamadaha kontuurka, barahaa, khadadka jebinta, geesta dusha, biibaanka Demi Saddexagallada, xagaagaha heerarka, fallaadaha naqaska, calaamadaha barta Jidadka iyo profiles-ka Dejinta Qiime Magac Jidka 1, Jidka 2 … Isteeshanka bilowga 0+00 Radius-ka curve PI kasta oo dhex ah 100 ft ama 30 m, yar haddii aanu ku habboon nus tangent kasta Naqshadda profile-ka Midna ilaa aad bilowdo; Ka bilow dhulka wuxuu dhigaa PVI dhulka dhamaad kasta Dhererka curve-ka kor-u-kaca 0 (curve la'aan) ilaa aad qortid Padyada Dejinta Qiime Magac Pad 1, Pad 2 … Heerka Dhulka dhexda padka, oo lagu wareejiyay 0.1 (0 haddii dhexdu dusha ka baxdo) Naqaska jarista 2 : 1 (meelo-hayeen) Naqaska buuxinta 3 : 1 (meelo-hayeen) Assembly-ga kooridorka (meelo-hayeen) Dejinta Fiit US Mitir Ballaca waddada 12 ft 3.6 m Naqaska waddada 2% 2% Ballaca garabka 4 ft 1.2 m Naqaska garabka 4% 4% Naqaska jarista 2 : 1 2 : 1 Naqaska buuxinta 3 : 1 3 : 1 Qaybta kasta 10 ft 5 m Shabakadda biibaanka Dejinta Fiit US Mitir Magaca iyo nooca Storm, storm Storm, storm Naqaska ugu yar (meelo-hayeen) 0.50% 0.50% Dabool ugu yar (meelo-hayeen) 2 ft 0.6 m Hoos-u-dhac qaab-dhismeedyada (meelo-hayeen) 0.10 ft 0.03 m Diameter-ka qaab-dhismeed cusub 48 in 1200 mm Diameter-ka tuubo cusub 12 in 300 mm Qoto-dheerka sump 0 0 Gees Dusha ka bilow Dusha ka bilow Shabakadda biibaanka oo laga furay LandXML waxay isticmaashaa xeerarkan sidoo kale, sababtoo ah LandXML ma qaadi karo. Mugga Dejinta Qiime Habka Shabakad, la tijaabiyay bartaha unugyada gudaha khadadka iftiinka Cabbirka unugga La doortay si aagga qorshaha ee la jaray u leeyahay qiyaastii 250,000 unug (1, 2 ama 5 jeer tiro laga soo qaado 10) Balaadhin iyo yaraynta Midna Qorshaha Dejinta Qiime Aagga Wax walba Warqadda Tabloid 11 × 17 in (mashruucyada fiitka), ISO A3 (mashruucyada mitirka); had iyo jeer toosan Miisaanka Miisaanka ugu weyn ee liiska ku jira oo ku habboon Midabka Midabada lakabka Calaamadaha DXF waxaa lagu cabbiraa miisaanka oo wax kasta ku habboon Tabloid (fiit) ama A3 (mitir).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Xallinta dhibaatooyinka","summary":"Calaamadaha, sababaha iyo xalalka dhibaatooyinka dadku ku kulmaan CivilCraft, oo leh fariimaha saxda ah ee app-ku muujiyo.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["dhibaatooyin","khalad","ma shaqeeyo","hagaaji","caawimaad","fariimo","xalin","diidan","maqan","khaldan","is-beddelay","kontuurrada maqan"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-faylasha","text":"Fur faylasha","level":2},{"id":"soo-dhoofinta-barooyinka","text":"Soo dhoofinta barooyinka","level":2},{"id":"dusha","text":"Dusha","level":2},{"id":"naqshadeynta","text":"Naqshadeynta","level":2},{"id":"jeexyada-iyo-muuqaalka-dherer","text":"Jeexyada iyo muuqaalka dherer","level":2},{"id":"koridoorada-iyo-pad-yada","text":"Koridoorada iyo pad-yada","level":2},{"id":"tuubooyinka","text":"Tuubooyinka","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-iyo-dhoofinta","text":"Kaydinta iyo dhoofinta","level":2},{"id":"app-ka-laftiisa","text":"App-ka laftiisa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFariimaha waxay ka muuqdaan status bar-ka hoose ee midig, sanduuqyada panel-yada bidix iyo midig, iyo wada-hadallada. Halkan waxaa lagu soo xigtay sida app-ku muujiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-faylasha\"\u003EFur faylasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Faylkan wuxuu ka weyn yahay 200 MB; CivilCraft weli ma furo faylal weyn sidan.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Kala qaybi faylka barooyinka, ama yaraee xogta ka hor intaadan furin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not open site.json: This is not a CivilCraft project file.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Faylku wuxuu ku dhammaadaa \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E ama wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Ccode\u003E{\u003C/code\u003E laakiin ma aha mashruuc CivilCraft. Faylasha barooyinka waa inaysan ku bilaabmin \u003Ccode\u003E{\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not open … This project file is from a newer CivilCraft (version 2).&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Mashruucii waxaa kaydiyay dhismo cusub. Ku fur halkaas, ama ka dhoofi LandXML.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not open … This is XML but not LandXML (its root element is &lt;…&gt;).&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Faylku waa nooc kale oo XML ah. Ka dhoofi LandXML barnaamijka kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… has no points, TIN surfaces or alignments CivilCraft can read.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Waxa faylka ku jira oo dhan waa wax CivilCraft ka boodo (tusaale, dusha shabakad oo keliya, ama jeexyo spiral oo keliya). Qaybta kale ee fariintu waxay sheegtaa waxa ku jiray. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landxml-reference\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landxml-reference\"\u003ELandXML: waxa la akhrinayo iyo la qorayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;The sample could not be loaded: …&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur goobta tusaalaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa fayl ka yimid goobta CadCraft. Xidhiidh la&#039;aan ahaan wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya haddii CivilCraft loo kaydiyay shaqada khadka ka baxsan (badhanka app bar-ka wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E). Khadka ku xirmo, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna wuxuu shaqeeyaa khadka ka baxsan ilaa markaas. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELama kaydin karin\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylal qaarkood lama soo dejin. Hubi xiriirka oo mar kale guji badhanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan lama heli karo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/strong\u003E Daaqaddan browser-ka ma kaydin karto nuqul khadka ka baxsan, sababtoo ah waa daaqad gaar ah ama kombiyuutarka waa la maamulo. Ku fur CivilCraft daaqad caadi ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhadka ka baxsan, app-ku ma furmo gebi ahaanba.\u003C/strong\u003E Browser-kan lama kaydin khadka ka baxsan, ama browser-ku wuu nadiifiyay xogta goobta (Safari wuu sidaas sameeyaa goobaha aan la booqan toddobaadyo badan). Khadka ku xirmo, ku fur CivilCraft oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqulka khadka ka baxsan waa dhismo hore.\u003C/strong\u003E Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya)\u003C/span\u003E isagoo khadka ku xirnaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFayl ayaa cas ahaan u muuqda sanduuqa furista.\u003C/strong\u003E Sanduuqu wuxuu liistaa kaliya faylasha barooyinka, LandXML iyo mashruucyada iyada oo loo eegayo dhamaadkooda. Fayl ku-jiid sawirka dhexdiisa halkii, ama magacdii u beddel \u003Ccode\u003E.txt\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-dhoofinta-barooyinka\"\u003ESoo dhoofinta barooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;No points could be read from this file.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro habka tiirarka \u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E gacanta. Haddii waxba shaqayn, fur faylka tafatire qoraal oo hubi inuu yahay hal barood sadar kasta, lambarro ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirka wuu rogan yahay, leexan yahay ama toos u fidsan yahay.\u003C/strong\u003E Waqooyi (northing) iyo bari (easting) waa is-beddelay. Soo koobidda waxay tidhi &quot;guessed from the column count&quot;. Dooro PENZD halkii PNEZD (ama mid kale) \u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E ku jira, ama mar kale soo dhoofi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarooyin aad uga fog kuwa kale, sawirkana wuxuu u yimid nuqul yar.\u003C/strong\u003E Sadar ayaa khalad ku leh koorodinad, ama faylku wuxuu isku qasay nidaamyo koorodinadyo oo kala duwan. Hel barta (riix si aad lambarkeeda u aragto) oo hagaaji faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka ku qoran &quot;Rows not read&quot;.\u003C/strong\u003E Eeg miiska ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points#rows-that-are-not-read\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\" data-hash=\"rows-that-are-not-read\"\u003ESoo dhoofi barooyinka sahan dhulka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarooyintaydii hore way lumeen.\u003C/strong\u003E Soo dhoofinta faylka barooyinka waxay beddeshaa dhammaan barooyinka, waxayna tirtirtaa soo celinta. Fur mashruucaaga la kaydiyay si aad ugu soo celiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha\"\u003EDusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Surface: Not built&quot; oo sanduuq cas leh.\u003C/strong\u003E Sanduuqu wuxuu sheegayaa sababta: &quot;A surface needs at least three points with elevations.&quot;, &quot;The points are all on one line: no triangles.&quot;, &quot;No points with elevations.&quot;, &quot;The boundary does not overlap the points.&quot; ama &quot;No triangles are left inside the boundary.&quot; Hubi tiirarka, kooxaha barooyinka (ma \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaga reebay\u003C/span\u003E baa?), iyo xadka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKontuurrada waxay gooyaan dhuumaha ama buurta toos ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Xariiqaas ma aha xarriiqa jabinta. Kooxdiisa dejii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E, ama samee adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EDhis oo hagaaji dusha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKooxda xarriiqa jabinta waxay samaysay zig-zag.\u003C/strong\u003E Kooxdu waxay ka kooban tahay in ka badan hal xariiq, ama barooyinkeedu lambarro iskuma raacaan jeexda. Kooxda dib ugu celi \u003Cstrong\u003EBarood\u003C/strong\u003E oo samee xariiq kasta adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaddex-geesood dheer oo cirro ah dibadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Samee xadka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ama dejii \u003Cstrong\u003EXaddiga dibadda ee ugu dheer\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKontuur ma jiro, in kasta oo dusha la dhisay.\u003C/strong\u003E Mid mid ah: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKontuurrada\u003C/span\u003E waa demaa \u003Cstrong\u003EBandhigga\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta, ama fardaha waa yar tahay inta ay ku jiri doonaan in ka badan 2,000 heer kontuur. Dooro fardo weyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXarriiqyada jabinta ama xadku waxba ma beddelo.\u003C/strong\u003E Dusha waxaa laga keenay LandXML (&quot;Surface (from LandXML)&quot;). Sidii ayuu yahay ayaa la isticmaalaa. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u dhis dusha barooyinka\u003C/span\u003E si aad uga dhisto barooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;There is no surface yet: open survey points first.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Xarriiqa jabinta, xadka iyo pad-ku waxay u baahan yihiin dusha dhulka ee hore. Marka hore soo dhoofi barooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Click a survey point with an elevation: a breakline takes the points’ elevations.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiqa jabinta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaliya doortaa barooyinka sahan dhulka. Ku weyne oo guji barta (dhibic orange ah ayaa muujinaysa midda ay qaadan doonto).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshadeynta\"\u003ENaqshadeynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarta u dambeysay way baxday markaan labo jeer gujiyay si aan dhammeeyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhismahan, labo jeer gujinta waxay dhammaysaa jeexda, pad-ka, xarriiqa jabinta ama xadka, laakiin waxay tirtirtaa barta aad labo jeer guujiyey. Guji barta u dambeysay mar, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Haddii ay horey u dhacday, isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kadibna mar kale naqshadee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa dhammayn karo naqshad taableedh ku jira.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhammaynta waxay u baahan tahay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; weli badhan shaashad ma jirto. Ku xir kiiboodh. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/keyboard#mouse-trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"mouse-trackpad-and-touch\"\u003EMowshirka, mowshirka-cabbirka iyo taabashada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidista si aad barta u dhigto waxay kor u dhaqdhaqaysaa.\u003C/strong\u003E Jiidid ka weyn dhowr pixel waxay dhaqaajinaysaa sawirka qalabka kasta. Guji adigoon dhaqaajin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;An alignment needs at least two points.&quot; / &quot;A pad needs at least three corners.&quot; / &quot;A pipe run needs at least two structures.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Waxaad riixday \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hore intaan dhammayn. Naqshadda waa la tirtiray; mar kale bilow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurayaasha sida A ama G wax ma sameeyaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Sanduuqa qoraalka ama liiska panel-ka ayaa weli fiiro haya, sidaas awgeed xarfaha ayaa u gudbaya halkaas. Guji sawirka mar, kadibna riix furaha. Mac-ka, furaha tirtirka waa Backspace browser-ka: isticmaal Fn iyo delete si aad wax u tirtirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jeexyada-iyo-muuqaalka-dherer\"\u003EJeexyada iyo muuqaalka dherer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;The curves at PI 2 and PI 3 overlap: … Use smaller radii.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Labo wareeg u baahan yihiin tangent ka badan intii u dhexaysay PI-yadooda. Hoos u dhig mid ama labadaba radius-ka miiska PI, ama ka fogee PI-yada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;PI 3 turns straight back; it cannot take a curve.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Jeexdu waxay ku soo noqotaa naftiisa PI-gaas. Ka guuri ama ka saar PI-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;This alignment has no ground under it to start from.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Jeexdu waa ka baxsan dusha. Ku guuri dusha dushiisa, ama ku dar PVI-yo adigoo guuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar PVI-yo\u003C/span\u003E oo furan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;The vertical curve at PVI 3 (L = …) starts before the curve or PVI before it ends.&quot; / &quot;… runs past the next PVI.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Gaabi dhererka wareegga ama ka fogee PVI-yada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;There is already a PVI at …&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E PVI ayaa horey u jirtay meeshaas. Guji meel kale, ama jiid midka jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka dherer waa faarug: &quot;Draw an alignment to see its profile.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro jeex, ama jeexda la doortay wuxuu leeyahay khaladaad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koridoorada-iyo-pad-yada\"\u003EKoridoorada iyo pad-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;The corridor needs a design profile without errors.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Bilow muuqaal naqshadeyn (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bilow dhulka\u003C/span\u003E) oo hagaaji isku dhacyada wareegyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;… side slopes run off the surface before meeting the ground.&quot; / &quot;… slope lines run off the surface before meeting it …&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Hagaynta waxay gaadhaa xadka dusha ka hor intaysan gaadhin dhulka. Naqshadda ka soo geli xadka, ama ku soo dhowaan dhulka. Pad cusub oo qayb ka mid ah ka baxsan dusha wuxuu ku bilaabmi karaa sare-joog 0: ku qor sare-joog dhab ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;The corridor’s daylight lines cross …&quot; / &quot;The daylight line crosses itself …&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Dhinacyada kala duwan waxay isku dhacaan: wareegyo adag, pad-yo cidhiidhi ah, gooyn qoto dheer ama buuxin sare. Isticmaal radius weyn, qaab cidhiidhi ah, pad ballaaran ama jiifyo ka sarreeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;No volumes yet: a pad needs to grade without problems.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Hagaaji dhibaatooyinka ku qoran sanduuqa cas ee ka sarreeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProposed (graded)\u003C/span\u003E waa la qarriyay.\u003C/strong\u003E Pad ama koridoor weli lama hagaaseyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tuubooyinka\"\u003ETuubooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;P2 has no inverts yet.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejii jooggeeda hoose xeerarka\u003C/span\u003E ama ku qor hoose-jooga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;P1: no ground at S1 to start from.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Qaabka soo-shubka ayaa ka baxsan dusha oo ma leh xaashi. Ku qor xaashi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETuubo kasta waa la calaamadeeyay markaan qaab dhaqaajiyay.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhaqaajinta qaabku ma beddelo hoose-joogga. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejii hoos u dhaca kasta xeerarka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFariimaha shabakada oo dhan waxaa lagu sharxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/pipe-network#read-and-fix-problems\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/pipe-network\" data-hash=\"read-and-fix-problems\"\u003EDejii shabakadda tuubooyinka xagasha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-iyo-dhoofinta\"\u003EKaydinta iyo dhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Nothing to export yet.&quot; / &quot;Nothing to plot yet.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Mashruucu waa maran yahay. Marka hore soo dhoofi barooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka la kaydiyay ma helo.\u003C/strong\u003E Waxa uu ku jiraa download-yada browser-ka (badanaa folder-ka Downloads). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/files#where-the-files-go\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/files\" data-hash=\"where-the-files-go\"\u003EFaylasha aad furi, kaydin iyo dhoofin karto\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaanka PDF waa khalad warqadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Daabac 100% ama cabbirka dhabta ah, ma aha &quot;fit to page&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha su&#039;aasha ku jira PDF-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Magacyada ama sharaxaadaha waxay isticmaalaan xarfo ka baxsan jaadka Yurub ee galbeed. Fariintu waxay tirinaysaa. Dib u magacee xarfo caadi ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirka waa la jaraa geeska.\u003C/strong\u003E Miisaanku waa weyn yahay warqadda. Dooro miisaan ku qoran &quot;(fits)&quot;, warqad weyn, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxa shaashadda ku jira\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command P\"\u003E⌘P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu furay wada-hadalka daabacaadda browser-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Bogga ma lahayn fiiro. Xidh wada-hadalka, guji sawirka, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command P\"\u003E⌘P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"app-ka-laftiisa\"\u003EApp-ka laftiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShaashadu waa madhan tahay ama qalabka waxba ma sameeyo.\u003C/strong\u003E Isticmaal nooca hadda ee Chrome, Edge, Firefox ama Safari, kadibna dib u soo rog. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowser-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EApp-ku wuu gaabiyaa faylka barooyinka weyn.\u003C/strong\u003E Demee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaddexagallada\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha barta\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagaaga heerarka\u003C/span\u003E, oo isticmaal fardo kontuur weyn. Dusha waaweyn waxay qaadaan wakhti mar kasta markaad isbeddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBrowser-ku wuxuu weydiinayaa &quot;Leave site?&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Mashruucu wuxuu leeyahay isbeddel aan la kaydin. Sug, kaydi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kadibna ka bax.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fariimaha waxay ka muuqdaan status bar-ka hoose ee midig, sanduuqyada panel-yada bidix iyo midig, iyo wada-hadallada. Halkan waxaa lagu soo xigtay sida app-ku muujiyo. Fur faylasha \"Faylkan wuxuu ka weyn yahay 200 MB; CivilCraft weli ma furo faylal weyn sidan.\" Kala qaybi faylka barooyinka, ama yaraee xogta ka hor intaadan furin. \"Could not open site.json: This is not a CivilCraft project file.\" Faylku wuxuu ku dhammaadaa .json ama wuxuu ku bilaabmaa { laakiin ma aha mashruuc CivilCraft. Faylasha barooyinka waa inaysan ku bilaabmin {. \"Could not open … This project file is from a newer CivilCraft (version 2).\" Mashruucii waxaa kaydiyay dhismo cusub. Ku fur halkaas, ama ka dhoofi LandXML. \"Could not open … This is XML but not LandXML (its root element is \u003C…\u003E).\" Faylku waa nooc kale oo XML ah. Ka dhoofi LandXML barnaamijka kale. \"… has no points, TIN surfaces or alignments CivilCraft can read.\" Waxa faylka ku jira oo dhan waa wax CivilCraft ka boodo (tusaale, dusha shabakad oo keliya, ama jeexyo spiral oo keliya). Qaybta kale ee fariintu waxay sheegtaa waxa ku jiray. Eeg LandXML: waxa la akhrinayo iyo la qorayo. \"The sample could not be loaded: …\" Fur goobta tusaalaha wuxuu akhrinayaa fayl ka yimid goobta CadCraft. Xidhiidh la'aan ahaan wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya haddii CivilCraft loo kaydiyay shaqada khadka ka baxsan (badhanka app bar-ka wuxuu muujinayaa Khadka ka baxsan diyaar). Khadka ku xirmo, guji Kaydi khadka ka baxsan, kadibna wuxuu shaqeeyaa khadka ka baxsan ilaa markaas. Eeg Khadka ka baxsan. Kaydi khadka ka baxsan wuxuu muujinayaa Lama kaydin karin. Faylal qaarkood lama soo dejin. Hubi xiriirka oo mar kale guji badhanka. Kaydi khadka ka baxsan wuxuu muujinayaa Khadka ka baxsan lama heli karo. Daaqaddan browser-ka ma kaydin karto nuqul khadka ka baxsan, sababtoo ah waa daaqad gaar ah ama kombiyuutarka waa la maamulo. Ku fur CivilCraft daaqad caadi ah. Khadka ka baxsan, app-ku ma furmo gebi ahaanba. Browser-kan lama kaydin khadka ka baxsan, ama browser-ku wuu nadiifiyay xogta goobta (Safari wuu sidaas sameeyaa goobaha aan la booqan toddobaadyo badan). Khadka ku xirmo, ku fur CivilCraft oo guji Kaydi khadka ka baxsan. Nuqulka khadka ka baxsan waa dhismo hore. Guji Khadka ka baxsan diyaar, kadibna Dib u kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya) isagoo khadka ku xirnaan. Fayl ayaa cas ahaan u muuqda sanduuqa furista. Sanduuqu wuxuu liistaa kaliya faylasha barooyinka, LandXML iyo mashruucyada iyada oo loo eegayo dhamaadkooda. Fayl ku-jiid sawirka dhexdiisa halkii, ama magacdii u beddel .txt. Soo dhoofinta barooyinka \"No points could be read from this file.\" Dooro habka tiirarka Tiirarka gacanta. Haddii waxba shaqayn, fur faylka tafatire qoraal oo hubi inuu yahay hal barood sadar kasta, lambarro ku jira. Sawirka wuu rogan yahay, leexan yahay ama toos u fidsan yahay. Waqooyi (northing) iyo bari (easting) waa is-beddelay. Soo koobidda waxay tidhi \"guessed from the column count\". Dooro PENZD halkii PNEZD (ama mid kale) Tiirarka ku jira, ama mar kale soo dhoofi. Barooyin aad uga fog kuwa kale, sawirkana wuxuu u yimid nuqul yar. Sadar ayaa khalad ku leh koorodinad, ama faylku wuxuu isku qasay nidaamyo koorodinadyo oo kala duwan. Hel barta (riix si aad lambarkeeda u aragto) oo hagaaji faylka. Safafka ku qoran \"Rows not read\". Eeg miiska ku jira Soo dhoofi barooyinka sahan dhulka. Barooyintaydii hore way lumeen. Soo dhoofinta faylka barooyinka waxay beddeshaa dhammaan barooyinka, waxayna tirtirtaa soo celinta. Fur mashruucaaga la kaydiyay si aad ugu soo celiso. Dusha \"Surface: Not built\" oo sanduuq cas leh. Sanduuqu wuxuu sheegayaa sababta: \"A surface needs at least three points with elevations.\", \"The points are all on one line: no triangles.\", \"No points with elevations.\", \"The boundary does not overlap the points.\" ama \"No triangles are left inside the boundary.\" Hubi tiirarka, kooxaha barooyinka (ma Laga reebay baa?), iyo xadka. Kontuurrada waxay gooyaan dhuumaha ama buurta toos ah. Xariiqaas ma aha xarriiqa jabinta. Kooxdiisa dejii Xarriiqa jabinta, ama samee adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka Xarriiqa jabinta. Eeg Dhis oo hagaaji dusha. Kooxda xarriiqa jabinta waxay samaysay zig-zag. Kooxdu waxay ka kooban tahay in ka badan hal xariiq, ama barooyinkeedu lambarro iskuma raacaan jeexda. Kooxda dib ugu celi Barood oo samee xariiq kasta adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka Xarriiqa jabinta. Saddex-geesood dheer oo cirro ah dibadda. Samee xadka (O) ama dejii Xaddiga dibadda ee ugu dheer. Kontuur ma jiro, in kasta oo dusha la dhisay. Mid mid ah: Kontuurrada waa demaa Bandhigga hoosta, ama fardaha waa yar tahay inta ay ku jiri doonaan in ka badan 2,000 heer kontuur. Dooro fardo weyn. Xarriiqyada jabinta ama xadku waxba ma beddelo. Dusha waxaa laga keenay LandXML (\"Surface (from LandXML)\"). Sidii ayuu yahay ayaa la isticmaalaa. Guji Dib u dhis dusha barooyinka si aad uga dhisto barooyinka. \"There is no surface yet: open survey points first.\" Xarriiqa jabinta, xadka iyo pad-ku waxay u baahan yihiin dusha dhulka ee hore. Marka hore soo dhoofi barooyinka. \"Click a survey point with an elevation: a breakline takes the points’ elevations.\" Qalabka Xarriiqa jabinta wuxuu kaliya doortaa barooyinka sahan dhulka. Ku weyne oo guji barta (dhibic orange ah ayaa muujinaysa midda ay qaadan doonto). Naqshadeynta Barta u dambeysay way baxday markaan labo jeer gujiyay si aan dhammeeyo. Dhismahan, labo jeer gujinta waxay dhammaysaa jeexda, pad-ka, xarriiqa jabinta ama xadka, laakiin waxay tirtirtaa barta aad labo jeer guujiyey. Guji barta u dambeysay mar, kadibna riix Enter. Haddii ay horey u dhacday, isticmaal Ctrl+Z, kadibna mar kale naqshadee. Ma dhammayn karo naqshad taableedh ku jira. Dhammaynta waxay u baahan tahay Enter; weli badhan shaashad ma jirto. Ku xir kiiboodh. Eeg Mowshirka, mowshirka-cabbirka iyo taabashada. Jiidista si aad barta u dhigto waxay kor u dhaqdhaqaysaa. Jiidid ka weyn dhowr pixel waxay dhaqaajinaysaa sawirka qalabka kasta. Guji adigoon dhaqaajin. \"An alignment needs at least two points.\" / \"A pad needs at least three corners.\" / \"A pipe run needs at least two structures.\" Waxaad riixday Enter hore intaan dhammayn. Naqshadda waa la tirtiray; mar kale bilow. Furayaasha sida A ama G wax ma sameeyaan. Sanduuqa qoraalka ama liiska panel-ka ayaa weli fiiro haya, sidaas awgeed xarfaha ayaa u gudbaya halkaas. Guji sawirka mar, kadibna riix furaha. Mac-ka, furaha tirtirka waa Backspace browser-ka: isticmaal Fn iyo delete si aad wax u tirtirto. Jeexyada iyo muuqaalka dherer \"The curves at PI 2 and PI 3 overlap: … Use smaller radii.\" Labo wareeg u baahan yihiin tangent ka badan intii u dhexaysay PI-yadooda. Hoos u dhig mid ama labadaba radius-ka miiska PI, ama ka fogee PI-yada. \"PI 3 turns straight back; it cannot take a curve.\" Jeexdu waxay ku soo noqotaa naftiisa PI-gaas. Ka guuri ama ka saar PI-ga. \"This alignment has no ground under it to start from.\" Jeexdu waa ka baxsan dusha. Ku guuri dusha dushiisa, ama ku dar PVI-yo adigoo guuji Ku dar PVI-yo oo furan. \"The vertical curve at PVI 3 (L = …) starts before the curve or PVI before it ends.\" / \"… runs past the next PVI.\" Gaabi dhererka wareegga ama ka fogee PVI-yada. \"There is already a PVI at …\" PVI ayaa horey u jirtay meeshaas. Guji meel kale, ama jiid midka jira. Muuqaalka dherer waa faarug: \"Draw an alignment to see its profile.\" Ma jiro jeex, ama jeexda la doortay wuxuu leeyahay khaladaad. Koridoorada iyo pad-yada \"The corridor needs a design profile without errors.\" Bilow muuqaal naqshadeyn (Ka bilow dhulka) oo hagaaji isku dhacyada wareegyada. \"… side slopes run off the surface before meeting the ground.\" / \"… slope lines run off the surface before meeting it …\" Hagaynta waxay gaadhaa xadka dusha ka hor intaysan gaadhin dhulka. Naqshadda ka soo geli xadka, ama ku soo dhowaan dhulka. Pad cusub oo qayb ka mid ah ka baxsan dusha wuxuu ku bilaabmi karaa sare-joog 0: ku qor sare-joog dhab ah. \"The corridor’s daylight lines cross …\" / \"The daylight line crosses itself …\" Dhinacyada kala duwan waxay isku dhacaan: wareegyo adag, pad-yo cidhiidhi ah, gooyn qoto dheer ama buuxin sare. Isticmaal radius weyn, qaab cidhiidhi ah, pad ballaaran ama jiifyo ka sarreeya. \"No volumes yet: a pad needs to grade without problems.\" Hagaaji dhibaatooyinka ku qoran sanduuqa cas ee ka sarreeya. Proposed (graded) waa la qarriyay. Pad ama koridoor weli lama hagaaseyn. Tuubooyinka \"P2 has no inverts yet.\" Guji Dejii jooggeeda hoose xeerarka ama ku qor hoose-jooga. \"P1: no ground at S1 to start from.\" Qaabka soo-shubka ayaa ka baxsan dusha oo ma leh xaashi. Ku qor xaashi. Tuubo kasta waa la calaamadeeyay markaan qaab dhaqaajiyay. Dhaqaajinta qaabku ma beddelo hoose-joogga. Guji Dejii hoos u dhaca kasta xeerarka. Fariimaha shabakada oo dhan waxaa lagu sharxay Dejii shabakadda tuubooyinka xagasha. Kaydinta iyo dhoofinta \"Nothing to export yet.\" / \"Nothing to plot yet.\" Mashruucu waa maran yahay. Marka hore soo dhoofi barooyinka. Faylka la kaydiyay ma helo. Waxa uu ku jiraa download-yada browser-ka (badanaa folder-ka Downloads). Eeg Faylasha aad furi, kaydin iyo dhoofin karto. Miisaanka PDF waa khalad warqadda. Daabac 100% ama cabbirka dhabta ah, ma aha \"fit to page\". Calaamadaha su'aasha ku jira PDF-ka. Magacyada ama sharaxaadaha waxay isticmaalaan xarfo ka baxsan jaadka Yurub ee galbeed. Fariintu waxay tirinaysaa. Dib u magacee xarfo caadi ah. Sawirka waa la jaraa geeska. Miisaanku waa weyn yahay warqadda. Dooro miisaan ku qoran \"(fits)\", warqad weyn, ama Waxa shaashadda ku jira. Ctrl+P wuxuu furay wada-hadalka daabacaadda browser-ka. Bogga ma lahayn fiiro. Xidh wada-hadalka, guji sawirka, kadibna riix Ctrl+P mar kale, ama guji PDF. App-ka laftiisa Shaashadu waa madhan tahay ama qalabka waxba ma sameeyo. Isticmaal nooca hadda ee Chrome, Edge, Firefox ama Safari, kadibna dib u soo rog. Eeg Browser-yada. App-ku wuu gaabiyaa faylka barooyinka weyn. Demee Saddexagallada, Calaamadaha barta iyo Xagaaga heerarka, oo isticmaal fardo kontuur weyn. Dusha waaweyn waxay qaadaan wakhti mar kasta markaad isbeddelo. Browser-ku wuxuu weydiinayaa \"Leave site?\" Mashruucu wuxuu leeyahay isbeddel aan la kaydin. Sug, kaydi Ctrl+S, kadibna ka bax.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"civilcraft","title":"Wali lama dhisin","summary":"Waxa dhismahan CivilCraft ee hadda aan wali sameyn, iyo waxa aad maanta sameyso halkiisa.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["maqan","xaddidaadyo","waddo-marin","aan diyaarneen","kuwa qaybta cad","dwg","dxf","galka","faaqidda","qaybaha","la imaanaya","xadka"],"headings":[{"id":"barooyinka","text":"Barooyinka","level":2},{"id":"dusaha","text":"Dusaha","level":2},{"id":"khadadka-waddada-iyo-muuqaalka","text":"Khadadka waddada iyo muuqaalka","level":2},{"id":"kooridorrada","text":"Kooridorrada","level":2},{"id":"jeexjeexa-iyo-mugyada","text":"Jeexjeexa iyo mugyada","level":2},{"id":"shabakadaha-tuubooyinka","text":"Shabakadaha tuubooyinka","level":2},{"id":"sagxadaha","text":"Sagxadaha","level":2},{"id":"traverses","text":"Traverses","level":2},{"id":"ulinta","text":"Ulinta","level":2},{"id":"faylalka-iyo-wax-soo-saarka","text":"Faylalka iyo wax soo saarka","level":2},{"id":"beerta","text":"Beerta","level":2},{"id":"xariiqyada-korontada","text":"Xariiqyada korontada","level":2},{"id":"masses-ka-dhismaha","text":"Masses-ka dhismaha","level":2},{"id":"gis-iyo-nidaamyada-isku-xidhka","text":"GIS iyo nidaamyada isku-xidhka","level":2},{"id":"gelinta","text":"Gelinta","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-3d","text":"Muuqaalka 3D","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft waa bilow. Bogganku wuxuu tusaa waxa dhismahan hadda aan sameyn, si aadan u raadin. Waxba halkan ku jira taariikh lagu balan qaadin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barooyinka\"\u003EBarooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu darista faylka barooyinka labaad kii hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku xir faylalka tafatire qoraal ama spreadsheet marka hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofinta fayl qoraal oo barooyin ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi LandXML (barooyinka waxa loo dhoofaa sida CgPoints), isticmaal GIS \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E (barooyinka oo leh garoonka P, N, E, Z iyo D), ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E barooyinka spreadsheet ku dhaj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka calaamadaha barta, astaamaha furaha sharaxaadda kasta, qalloocyo (qaansooyin) ka xariiqyada koodhka, fayl furaha sharaxaadda oo mashruucyo wada isticmaalaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha waxay tusaan lambarka, sare-marka iyo sharaxaadda, ama ka yar (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta CivilCraft\u003C/a\u003E); furayaasha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddelka unugyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl ka beddel ka hor inta aadan soo gelin; \u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sumadda oo keliya bedelaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusaha\"\u003EDusaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha in ka badan midkood oo barooyin laga dhisay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal mashruuc oo dusha kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQarinta xuduudaha (gudaha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EGeedka dibadda ee ugu dheer\u003C/strong\u003E ama xuduud dibadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoorashada ama wax-beddelka hal khad jejebin oo la sawiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir khadadka jejebinta ee la sawiray\u003C/span\u003E oo mar kale sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax-beddelka dusha laga akhriyay LandXML (khadadka jejebinta, xuduudda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u dhis dusha barooyinka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax-beddelka dusha laga sameeyay shabakad sare-marka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakadda mar kale soo geli doorasho kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddelka dusha laga akhriyay LandXML marka nidaamka isku-xidhka isbeddelo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u dhis dusha barooyinka\u003C/span\u003E marka hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESare-marka barta calaamadaysan iyo qiimayaasha jeexjeexa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa akhri qoraalka hoose (status bar), ama midabee dusha jeexjeexa adoo isticmaalaya \u003Cstrong\u003EFalanqaynta jeexjeexa\u003C/strong\u003E goobta beerta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/landscape-grading#grading-checks\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/landscape-grading\" data-hash=\"grading-checks\"\u003ENaqshadda beerta\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadadka-waddada-iyo-muuqaalka\"\u003EKhadadka waddada iyo muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpiral-yada aan ahayn clothoid; spiral u dhexeeya laba wareeg (isbedel isku-dhafan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpiral-yada clothoid ee dhamaadka wareeg waa la heli karaa; kuwa kale waa la magacaabaa oo waa la dhaafaa marka LandXML la soo gelinayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu darista PI u dhexeeya laba kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka dib u sawir, ama dib u qor isku-xidhka PI\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka waddada laga sameeyay shayada, ka-saaridda, ballacaadinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir adoo isticmaalaya PI-yo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qorista K wareeg toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qor L (K waa la muujinayaa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegyada toosan ee goobo iyo kuwa aan simanayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg parabolic-ka simanta ah oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaal dherer naqshadeed in ka badan hal khadka waddo kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal khad waddo mid kasta oo kala duwan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka dherer oo la weyneeyo, kayd-jeexjeexyada hoosta muuqaalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka dherer wuxuu buuxiyaa khadka waddo oo dhan; ku sawir \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plan-profile-sheets\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plan-profile-sheets\"\u003Exaashiyada qorshaha iyo muuqaalka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha DWG ama LandXML\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyada qaybaha PDF; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E ee bedka iyo mugyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyada muunadda xagga, ama ballac kala duwan dhinaca waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal ballac dhinac kasta khadka oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kooridorrada\"\u003EKooridorrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexdhexaadka, xannibaadda, iyo kor-u-kac wareejiya qaababka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab ahaan ku sawir (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor-templates\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor-templates\"\u003EQaababka kooridorka\u003C/a\u003E); qaababka isteeshanka kor-u-kac ma qaadan weli\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbedel tartiib ah u dhexeeya qaababka laba goobood (isbedel, yaraanta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel qaabka isteeshanka, ama siiyo barta bartilmaameedka ballac khad la sawiray sida yaraanta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg ku saabsan cidla, kor-u-kac LandXML\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKor-u-kaca wuxuu ku wareegaa dhexdhexaadka wareegyada goobo; ballacaadi dariiqa adoo bartilmaameed ballac ah u geynaya xariiq muuqaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBartilmaameedyada jeexjeexyada dhinaca (iftiinka ilaa khad ama dusha), dusha kooridor gaar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBartilmaameedyadu waxay dhaqaajiyaan cidlada waddada iyo garabyada (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor\"\u003EKooridorada\u003C/a\u003E); kooridorka waxa lagu jeexjeexaa dusha la soo jeediyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKerbi-soo-celin, dariiqyo rogmada iyo jasiiradaha lagu jeexjeexay isgoys; dhamaadka waddada dhinaca oo lagu jaray cidlada waddada weyn xagga xaaqada; jid lagu xidhay waddo qorshaha ku jira, dhererkeeda iyo ballaceeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaddooyinka kulma waa la xidhaa toos ah, cidlada waddada weyn waa la furaa, waddada dhinaca waa la siman tahay (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor#where-roads-meet-roads-pads-and-paths\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor\" data-hash=\"where-roads-meet-roads-pads-and-paths\"\u003EMeelaha waddooyinku ku kulmaan\u003C/a\u003E); jidku wuxuu ku joogsadaa cidlada waddada dusha la soo jeediyay iyo 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooridorada loo dhoofiyo sida waddooyinka LandXML; kooridor labaad khad waddo ku jira dhoofinta IFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha la soo jeediyay ayaa la dhoofiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaababka dhulka ee beddela dusha la soo jeediyay, 3D ama qaybaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay siiyaan aagga iyo mugga lakab kasta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/corridor-templates#terrain-templates\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/corridor-templates\" data-hash=\"terrain-templates\"\u003EQaababka dhulka\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidad wareejin oo leh xawaare, socodka taayarka, waqtiga wadista, gaadiid dhinac-socod ah ama fogaanta jirka; maktabad gaadiidyo naqshadeed caadi ah; jid wareejin oo lagu sawiro jiidista gaadiidka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidadka wareejinta xawaaraha hooseeya ee xariiqa muuqaalka ama khadka waddada, adigoo isticmaalaya cabbirrada gaadiidkaaga (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/swept-paths\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/swept-paths\"\u003EJidadka wareejinta gaadiidka\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jeexjeexa-iyo-mugyada\"\u003EJeexjeexa iyo mugyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBenchi-yo, xariiqyo muhiim furan oo naqshadda lagu jeexjeexay, jeexjeexa ilaa xariiq muhiim meel kale ka timid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqa muhiimka ah xir (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/feature-lines\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/feature-lines\"\u003EXariiqyada muhiimka ah\u003C/a\u003E), ama isticmaal sidii khadka jejebinta dhulka jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu darista ama ka saarista geed xariiq muhiim\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka mar kale sawir, ama samee ka-saarid tallaabo tallaabo ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalloocyo khadadka jejebinta la sawiray (barooyinka sahanka ayay mara), spiral-yo xariiqyada muhiimka ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq muhiim qalloocyo ku sawir oo isticmaal sidii khadka jejebinta dhulka jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJeexjeexa masaafo, sare-mar ama dusha kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka jira keliya ayaa la iftiimiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu darista ama ka saarista geed pad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPadka tirtir oo mar kale sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMugyada TIN-ilaa-TIN (prism), doorashada cabbirka unugga shabakadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHabka shabakadda, cabbirka unugga waxaa kuu doorta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKor-u-kac iyo yaraan, dhulka sare, dhumucda dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFactors-ka ku dabaqo tirooyinka la soo sheegay adigu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKharashyada gaadiidka bilaashka ah iyo dib-u-habeynta, gaadiidka u dhexeeya khadadka kala duwan, godadka amaahda iyo meelaha qashinka ee qorshaha lagu meeleeyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqdhaqaaqa mugga oo leh barta isku-dheelitirka, mugga la raray iyo masaafada gaadiidka celceliska ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shabakadaha-tuubooyinka\"\u003EShabakadaha tuubooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakad in ka badan hal mashruuc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashruuc kala gaar ah storm iyo sanitary\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka biyaha: tayada iyo da&#039;da biyaha, xakamaynta xeerka, nooca kale ee valve-ka (xakamaynta socodka, throttle, sustaining), pump-yada loo siiyay quwad, baahida oo ku xidhan cadaadiska, ikhtiyaar Darcy–Weisbach, katalogga tuubooyinka oo leh dhumucda derbiga iyo fasalka cadaadiska. Inta kale ee shabakadaha cadaadiska waa shaybaarka: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/water-mains\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/water-mains\"\u003ETuubooyinka biyaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuwaas hubi barnaamijka qaybinta biyaha; qaybaha naqshadaynta sanitary-ga waa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sanitary-design\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sanitary-design\"\u003ESocodka naqshadda sanitary-ga\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodka biyaha ceelka ee waqti ku saabsan (hydrograph, jidbaxa firfircoon, kaydinta, pump-yada, ka-burburka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sanitary-design\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sanitary-design\"\u003ESocodka naqshadda sanitary-ga\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu siiyaa socodka sare ee joogtada ah ee xaashida naqshadda isticmaasho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAwoodda galka, faafitaanka marinka, jidbaxa dib-u-xidhka, hydrograph-yada, luminta tamarta marka laga reebo hal isgoys-coefficient\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuwaas ku hubi barnaamij kale; socodka, cabbirrada iyo khadadka heerka waxay ku jiraan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/storm-drainage\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/storm-drainage\"\u003EBiyaha duufaanta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka biyaha ku-urayaa ee qorshaha PDF, DWG, DXF ama LandXML; dhulka biyaha ka dusha (biyo-kala-qaybiyeyaasha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka biyaha gacanta ku sawir; waa la kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKatalogyada tuubooyinka, tuubooyin aan goobo ahayn, dhismo aan sanduuq toosan ama silinder ahayn (koonooyin, tallaabooyin, benching), qayb biyo-qaadka maktabadda ku jirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoocyada dhismaha laga helo cabbirrada (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/pipe-network\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/pipe-network\"\u003EShabakadda tuubooyinka\u003C/a\u003E); tuubooyin leh dhexroor\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETuubooyinka muuqaalka dherer ku jira, tuubooyin qalloocan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri inverts iyo daboolka panel midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sagxadaha\"\u003ESagxadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybinta lotyada bedka ama jabhadda, sagxadaha xariiqyada ku wareegsan, xuquuqda waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESagxad kasta geedkeeda ku sawir, ama geli wicitaankeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaska wareegyada iyo miisaska xariiqyada qorshaha; calaamadaha gacanta lagu dhaqaajiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb kasta waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa dhererkeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESagxadaha LandXML\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESagxadaha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca oo waxay u gudbaan PDF, DWG iyo DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"traverses\"\u003ETraverses\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHagaajinta least-squares, xeerka transit, miisaanka xagaasha iyo masaafooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXeerka compass\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagaasha leexashada, xagaasha zenith iyo masaafooyinka jeexjeexa, sare-marka sinji-kaaseedka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu celi masaafooyinka iyo xagaasha toosan si sax ah, ama bearing-yada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinac-dhinac ah, faylalka xogta kulul ee ururiyeyaasha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyinka u soo geli sida fayl barooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ulinta\"\u003EUlinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlammaha ka-saarka (barooyinka tixraaca oo ka soo laabanaya ulinta), ulammaha jeexjeexa barta qabashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU kaadi ka-saarka aad u baahan tahay, oo ay ku jiraan wixii ka dambeeya garabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlammaha toos loogu diro qaabka ururiyaha xogta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECSV waxa uu furmaa barnaamijyada xafiiska ee ururiyeyaasha xogta badankood\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlinta tuubooyinka, padyada iyo sagxadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal barooyinka sahanka ku dhow khad waddo, ama geedaha sagxadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalka-iyo-wax-soo-saarka\"\u003EFaylalka iyo wax soo saarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal, xarriijin iyo cabbir DWG ama DXF; meel warqad; naqshado isku xidhan (xrefs); DXF binary\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka meesha moodelka waa la furaa (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/open-dwg-dxf\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/open-dwg-dxf\"\u003EFur DWG ama DXF sida khadad\u003C/a\u003E); naqshadaha isku xidhan ka fur gacanta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaajinta barooyin dhowr mar oo jiidis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGooy oo ku dheji, ama wax ka beddel mar mar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyo toosan, xarigga cinwaanka gaarka ah, daaqadaha aad habayso, xaashiyada qorshaha iyo muuqaalka DWG\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal xaashi qorshe oo toosan PDF kasta, ama xaashiyada qorshaha iyo muuqaalka waddada sida PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirka sare-marka iyo muuqaalada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKayd-jeexjeexyadu waa shaashad keliya; sawir shaashadda haddii aad u baahan tahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddelka magacyada lakabyada, midabka ama qaabka calaamadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa beddel barnaamij CAD ka dib marka DXF la dhoofiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta daruurta iyo taariikhda nooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi faylalka \u003Ccode\u003E.civilcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E oo ilaali; si aad mashruuc wada shaqayso, isticmaal kal-fadhi toos ah CadCraft Studio (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/work-live\"\u003EHal goob oo wada naqshadda, toos\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft Studio iPad iyo iPhone, iyo Google Play\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal CivilCraft browser-ka aaladda; Android, CadCraft Studio waa la rakibaa APK-ga ka yimid getcadcraft.com/download\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurista faylal barooyin ama mashruuc dhowr mar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal fayl mar kasta (faylalka GIS ee wada jira, sida qaybaha shapefile-ka, ayaa wada furmaa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beerta\"\u003EBeerta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadaxyada iyo afka-biyaha ee soo saarayaasha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadaxyo guud, ama ku dar madaxyadaada faylal; xogta soo saarayaasha way imanaysaa marka ay oggolaadaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhererka ugu badan ee xariiqyada dusha-biyo-dhigga, socodka waqtiga, pump-yada, shabakadaha tuubada xalqadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyada dusha-biyo-dhigga ku xidh dhererka ay soo saaraha daabacay; hubinta waxay u baahan tahay shabakad laanta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHareerta sax ah ee shay freeform oo qoto ah; mugga hoos-dhulka oo si sax ah loo cabbiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQolofta convex-ka waa la jeexjeexaa, mugga hoos-dhulka waa qiyaas (sheegan Sifooyinka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhirta ku jirta BimCraft iyo ModelCraft ee Ku dhig maktabadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi landscape IFC oo ku fur BimCraft dhinaca dhismaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodelada dhirta faahfaahsan (caleemo, laan, xilli) muuqaalka 3D; shayada freeform iyo biyo-dhigga muuqaalka 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhirta waxay 3D ku muuqdaan sida qaabab fudud oo cabbirkooda laga qaaday liiska dhirta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/site-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/site-3d\"\u003EArag goobta 3D\u003C/a\u003E); scatter-ka ModelCraft wuxuu sameeyaa sawirada beerta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiyada dhul adag ee dusha ku hayn heer jeexjeexan gadaashooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig madal ama pad garbaha toosan: waa darbiyada dhulka celiya ee dusha (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/grading\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/grading\"\u003EJeexjeexa\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbedelada SVG astaamahaaga; tekstuur iyo midabka moodelada dhirta GLB ee aad leedahay; geometry GLB la cadaadiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbedelada hore u rido barnaamijka sawirkaaga; moodelada waxa lagu sawiraa midabka dhirta; dhoofi GLB aan la cadaadin (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/plant-graphics\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/plant-graphics\"\u003ESawirka dhirta\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiiska dhirtaada gaarka ah ee lagu kaydiyay akoonkaaga Maktabadda (lagu wax ka beddelo barnaamijka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel liiska mashruuca ee miiska dhirta oo kaydi faylal dhirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka beerta ee kaaliyeyaasha aan daaqada lahayn (server-ka faylka iyo sadarka amarka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay shaqeeyaan markii daaqadda CivilCraft la furan yahay (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/assistants\"\u003EKaaliye AI ha kugu shaqeeyo goobtaada\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xariiqyada-korontada\"\u003EXariiqyada korontada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeer dal oo gudaha lagu dhisay (xaaladaha culeyska, fogaanta, factors)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDejii qiyamka heerkaaga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadda…\u003C/span\u003E oo kaydi, mar wada maktabadda, sidii pack aad mar kale isticmaasho oo aad wada-wadaagto (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sag-and-tension#packs-rules-and-a-library-for-a-country\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sag-and-tension\" data-hash=\"packs-rules-and-a-library-for-a-country\"\u003EPacks\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada dhinac-dhinaca ah ee sare-marka conductor-ka iyo timaha geedka ama darbiga xariiqa ku teedsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFogaanta toosan ee sare-marka dhirta iyo darbiyada xariiqa gooyo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/power-line-checks#clearances\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/power-line-checks\" data-hash=\"clearances\"\u003EHubinta xariiqa korontada\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu guuritaanka conductor-ka iyo ballaadhinta conductor cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOgolow iyaga heerkulka miiska xariiqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaynta kulaylka kaabalada qoto (qiimaynta korontada ee sida loo dhigay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeli qiimaynta korontada ee bixiyahaaga shayga kaabalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaraasadaha short-circuit, ilaalinta iyo dhulka xidhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal barnaamij koronto gaar ah; CivilCraft wuxuu siiyaa dhererka shabakadda iyo kaabalada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiirarka lattice ee gacan-gacan loo naqshadeeyay, iyo ilaalinta xagaaga dhulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaageeradu waxa lagu hubiyaa culeyska magacaaban; kaabada xagaaga waxa lagu hubiyaa culeyska la qiimeeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl daraasad \u003Ccode\u003E.DON\u003C/code\u003E oo barnaamijka akhriya lagu hubiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalkaas hubi; soo dir tusaale si aan uga tijaabinno mid dhab ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyada korontada muuqaalka 3D iyo IFC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorshaha, muuqaalka xariiqa, xaashiyada iyo lakabyada GIS\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka xariiqa korontada ee kaaliyeyaasha aan daaqada lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay shaqeeyaan markii daaqadda CivilCraft la furan yahay (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/assistants\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/assistants\"\u003EKaaliye AI ha kugu shaqeeyo goobtaada\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masses-ka-dhismaha\"\u003EMasses-ka dhismaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaktabad koodhadka qeybinta ama xeerarka magaalo kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qor xadka amarka ee aad leedahay (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/zoning-limits\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/zoning-limits\"\u003EXaddidaadda qeybinta\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiinka samada ee darbiyada (iftiinka wejiga), dabaysha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sun-hours\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sun-hours\"\u003ESaacadaha qorraxda\u003C/a\u003E waxa uu tiraa qorraxda toosan oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHooska geedaha, dhirta ama wax kasta oo aan lagu sawirin mass\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir dhismayaasha deriska ah sida masses\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka saqafka masses-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasses sare-ka fidsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFuraha, saqafyada iyo noocyada darbiyada marka mass la horumariyo BimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft wuxuu dhisaa darbiyo dibadeed oo fudud heer kasta iyo dabaq; ku dar kuwa kale halkaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gis-iyo-nidaamyada-isku-xidhka\"\u003EGIS iyo nidaamyada isku-xidhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFile Geodatabase; qaabka KML, astaamaha, dusha-dhulka korka iyo xidhiidhka shabakadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU beddel GeoPackage, shapefile ama GeoJSON marka hore; KML placemarks waa la akhriyaa iyada oo aan qaabkoodi lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax-beddelka astaamaha GIS ama sifooyinkooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu wax ka beddel barnaamij GIS oo mar kale soo geli. \u003Cstrong\u003EFalanqee\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa lakabyo cusub (buffer, overlay, join, selection) oo wuxuu ku daraa goobaha aagga iyo dhererka, laakiin ma wax-beddelo astaamaha meesha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFalanqaynta shabakadda iyo raster, buffers oo leh dhamaad fidsan ama afeef, iyo buffers dhinac keliya, ku darista ama tirtirista safafka iyo beddelka nooca goobta miiska sifooyinka, midabka fasalka gacanta, sharaxaadda qaabka qorshaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal Dooro si aad astaamo u dooranaysid oo lakab uga samayso; dhamaadyada fidsan lama bixiyo. Midabka iyo miiska sifooyinka waa la dhisay: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-symbology\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-symbology\"\u003EQaabee lakab sifo ku salaysan\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/gis-table\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/gis-table\"\u003EKu shaqee miiska sifooyinka lakabka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka calaamadaha (cabbirka, meesha) iyo calaamado iska ilaaliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha waa hal cabbir, waxay isku dhaafi karaan marka astaamuhu kaadi yihiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDatums-ka sare-marka iyo moodeelada geoid-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESare-marka waxa loo isticmaalaa sida faylka siiyo; hubi datum-ka sare-marka adigu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKala-guuritaanka grid-ka kaas oo ka duwan NAD83 oo laga soo jeediyay NAD27 aagga ku saabsan (OSTN15, NTv2 datums kale waxay shaqeeyaan markaad faylka ku darto), dhowr grid isla mar, grid-ka toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka grid-ka datum-kaaga adigu ku dar; hal grid mashruuc kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabyada khariidadda DXF ama dhoofinta 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabyada khariidadda waxay galaan PDF plot, waxayna DWG dhinaca sawir ahaan u dhowdahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EServer-yada khariidadda ee u baahan galitaan, fure ama token\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdeegyo dadweyne isticmaal, ama fayl sawir oo georeferenced ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorista faylalka LAS ama LAZ laga soo bilaabo dusha, moodelka dhulka ama qalabka shabakadda sare-marka iyo LiDAR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi dusha sida shabakad sare-marka GeoTIFF ah. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/point-clouds\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/point-clouds\"\u003EDaruurta barta\u003C/a\u003E add-on-ku wuxuu qoraa daruur nadiifsan sida LAS 1.4 ama LAZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXoogga LiDAR, midabka iyo soo noqoshada; shabakadaha sare-marka oo leh dhowr band; faylalka grid ama LiDAR ee ka weyn 200 MB\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiDAR waa la shaandhaynayaa fasalka keliya, shabakadaha waxay isticmaalaan band-ka koowaad; faylalka waaweyn marka hore u jar tiles\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gelinta\"\u003EGelinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoorashada sanduuqa taabashada (waxay u baahan tahay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix muddo dheer barta sahan kasta si aad ugu darto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-xidhka ama masaafooyinka la qoray intii la sawirayay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESi qiyaas ah u sawir, kadibna ku qor isku-xidhka PI saxda ah miiska PI khadka waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qorista isku-xidhka geedaha padyada iyo dhismayaasha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid gacmahooda; ku weyn meelaha si sax ah, ka eeg E iyo N status bar-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQabsashada shayada (ka soo horjeeda barooyinka sahanka ee khadadka jejebinta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu weyn oo fiiri status bar-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EMuuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii taas, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirka ama wax-beddelka muuqaalka 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir oo wax ka beddel qorshaha; muuqaalka 3D wuxuu raacaa wax-beddel kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoorashada xariiqyada muhiimka ah ee kooridorka ama astaamaha GIS guji 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji qorshaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofinta muuqaalka la weyneeyay ama feet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofintu waa cabbir run ah oo meetir ah; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/export-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/export-3d\"\u003EDhoofi goobta 3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha dhoofinta GLB ama OBJ, cabbirka iyo qaabka calaamadaha 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadaha waxay muuqdaan muuqaalka 3D oo keliya, hal cabbir; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/site-3d\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/site-3d\"\u003EArag goobta 3D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETekstuurada sawirrada, duulid lagu duubo video, hoos-ka goobta ka baxsan, saacadaha qorraxda muuqaalka 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabyada khariidadda ee dusha lagu dhigay; wadista iyo booska qorraxda waqti; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/sun-hours\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/sun-hours\"\u003Esaacadaha qorraxda\u003C/a\u003E maalin ama xilli qorshaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"CivilCraft waa bilow. Bogganku wuxuu tusaa waxa dhismahan hadda aan sameyn, si aadan u raadin. Waxba halkan ku jira taariikh lagu balan qaadin. Barooyinka Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Ku darista faylka barooyinka labaad kii hore Isku xir faylalka tafatire qoraal ama spreadsheet marka hore Dhoofinta fayl qoraal oo barooyin ah Dhoofi LandXML (barooyinka waxa loo dhoofaa sida CgPoints), isticmaal GIS Dhoofi (barooyinka oo leh garoonka P, N, E, Z iyo D), ama Koobiyee barooyinka spreadsheet ku dhaj Qaabka calaamadaha barta, astaamaha furaha sharaxaadda kasta, qalloocyo (qaansooyin) ka xariiqyada koodhka, fayl furaha sharaxaadda oo mashruucyo wada isticmaalaan Calaamadaha waxay tusaan lambarka, sare-marka iyo sharaxaadda, ama ka yar (Dejinta CivilCraft); furayaasha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca Beddelka unugyada Fayl ka beddel ka hor inta aadan soo gelin; Unugyada wuxuu sumadda oo keliya bedelaa Dusaha Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Dusha in ka badan midkood oo barooyin laga dhisay Hal mashruuc oo dusha kasta Qarinta xuduudaha (gudaha) Isticmaal Geedka dibadda ee ugu dheer ama xuduud dibadda Doorashada ama wax-beddelka hal khad jejebin oo la sawiray Ctrl+Z, ama Tirtir khadadka jejebinta ee la sawiray oo mar kale sawir Wax-beddelka dusha laga akhriyay LandXML (khadadka jejebinta, xuduudda) Dib u dhis dusha barooyinka Wax-beddelka dusha laga sameeyay shabakad sare-marka Shabakadda mar kale soo geli doorasho kale Beddelka dusha laga akhriyay LandXML marka nidaamka isku-xidhka isbeddelo Dib u dhis dusha barooyinka marka hore Sare-marka barta calaamadaysan iyo qiimayaasha jeexjeexa Ka akhri qoraalka hoose (status bar), ama midabee dusha jeexjeexa adoo isticmaalaya Falanqaynta jeexjeexa goobta beerta (Naqshadda beerta) Khadadka waddada iyo muuqaalka Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Spiral-yada aan ahayn clothoid; spiral u dhexeeya laba wareeg (isbedel isku-dhafan) Spiral-yada clothoid ee dhamaadka wareeg waa la heli karaa; kuwa kale waa la magacaabaa oo waa la dhaafaa marka LandXML la soo gelinayo Ku darista PI u dhexeeya laba kale Khadka dib u sawir, ama dib u qor isku-xidhka PI Khadadka waddada laga sameeyay shayada, ka-saaridda, ballacaadinta Sawir adoo isticmaalaya PI-yo Ku qorista K wareeg toosan Ku qor L (K waa la muujinayaa) Wareegyada toosan ee goobo iyo kuwa aan simanayn Wareeg parabolic-ka simanta ah oo keliya Muuqaal dherer naqshadeed in ka badan hal khadka waddo kasta Hal khad waddo mid kasta oo kala duwan Muuqaalka dherer oo la weyneeyo, kayd-jeexjeexyada hoosta muuqaalka Muuqaalka dherer wuxuu buuxiyaa khadka waddo oo dhan; ku sawir xaashiyada qorshaha iyo muuqaalka Qaybaha DWG ama LandXML Xaashiyada qaybaha PDF; CSV ee bedka iyo mugyada Xariiqyada muunadda xagga, ama ballac kala duwan dhinaca waddada Hal ballac dhinac kasta khadka oo dhan Kooridorrada Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Dhexdhexaadka, xannibaadda, iyo kor-u-kac wareejiya qaababka Qaab ahaan ku sawir (Qaababka kooridorka); qaababka isteeshanka kor-u-kac ma qaadan weli Isbedel tartiib ah u dhexeeya qaababka laba goobood (isbedel, yaraanta) Beddel qaabka isteeshanka, ama siiyo barta bartilmaameedka ballac khad la sawiray sida yaraanta Wareeg ku saabsan cidla, kor-u-kac LandXML Kor-u-kaca wuxuu ku wareegaa dhexdhexaadka wareegyada goobo; ballacaadi dariiqa adoo bartilmaameed ballac ah u geynaya xariiq muuqaal Bartilmaameedyada jeexjeexyada dhinaca (iftiinka ilaa khad ama dusha), dusha kooridor gaar ah Bartilmaameedyadu waxay dhaqaajiyaan cidlada waddada iyo garabyada (Kooridorada); kooridorka waxa lagu jeexjeexaa dusha la soo jeediyay Kerbi-soo-celin, dariiqyo rogmada iyo jasiiradaha lagu jeexjeexay isgoys; dhamaadka waddada dhinaca oo lagu jaray cidlada waddada weyn xagga xaaqada; jid lagu xidhay waddo qorshaha ku jira, dhererkeeda iyo ballaceeda Waddooyinka kulma waa la xidhaa toos ah, cidlada waddada weyn waa la furaa, waddada dhinaca waa la siman tahay (Meelaha waddooyinku ku kulmaan); jidku wuxuu ku joogsadaa cidlada waddada dusha la soo jeediyay iyo 3D Kooridorada loo dhoofiyo sida waddooyinka LandXML; kooridor labaad khad waddo ku jira dhoofinta IFC Dusha la soo jeediyay ayaa la dhoofiyaa Qaababka dhulka ee beddela dusha la soo jeediyay, 3D ama qaybaha Waxay siiyaan aagga iyo mugga lakab kasta (Qaababka dhulka) Jidad wareejin oo leh xawaare, socodka taayarka, waqtiga wadista, gaadiid dhinac-socod ah ama fogaanta jirka; maktabad gaadiidyo naqshadeed caadi ah; jid wareejin oo lagu sawiro jiidista gaadiidka Jidadka wareejinta xawaaraha hooseeya ee xariiqa muuqaalka ama khadka waddada, adigoo isticmaalaya cabbirrada gaadiidkaaga (Jidadka wareejinta gaadiidka) Jeexjeexa iyo mugyada Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Benchi-yo, xariiqyo muhiim furan oo naqshadda lagu jeexjeexay, jeexjeexa ilaa xariiq muhiim meel kale ka timid Xariiqa muhiimka ah xir (Xariiqyada muhiimka ah), ama isticmaal sidii khadka jejebinta dhulka jira Ku darista ama ka saarista geed xariiq muhiim Khadka mar kale sawir, ama samee ka-saarid tallaabo tallaabo ah Qalloocyo khadadka jejebinta la sawiray (barooyinka sahanka ayay mara), spiral-yo xariiqyada muhiimka ah Xariiq muhiim qalloocyo ku sawir oo isticmaal sidii khadka jejebinta dhulka jira Jeexjeexa masaafo, sare-mar ama dusha kale Dhulka jira keliya ayaa la iftiimiyaa Ku darista ama ka saarista geed pad Padka tirtir oo mar kale sawir Mugyada TIN-ilaa-TIN (prism), doorashada cabbirka unugga shabakadda Habka shabakadda, cabbirka unugga waxaa kuu doorta Kor-u-kac iyo yaraan, dhulka sare, dhumucda dusha Factors-ka ku dabaqo tirooyinka la soo sheegay adigu Kharashyada gaadiidka bilaashka ah iyo dib-u-habeynta, gaadiidka u dhexeeya khadadka kala duwan, godadka amaahda iyo meelaha qashinka ee qorshaha lagu meeleeyo Dhaqdhaqaaqa mugga oo leh barta isku-dheelitirka, mugga la raray iyo masaafada gaadiidka celceliska ah Shabakadaha tuubooyinka Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Shabakad in ka badan hal mashruuc Mashruuc kala gaar ah storm iyo sanitary Tuubooyinka biyaha: tayada iyo da'da biyaha, xakamaynta xeerka, nooca kale ee valve-ka (xakamaynta socodka, throttle, sustaining), pump-yada loo siiyay quwad, baahida oo ku xidhan cadaadiska, ikhtiyaar Darcy–Weisbach, katalogga tuubooyinka oo leh dhumucda derbiga iyo fasalka cadaadiska. Inta kale ee shabakadaha cadaadiska waa shaybaarka: Tuubooyinka biyaha Kuwaas hubi barnaamijka qaybinta biyaha; qaybaha naqshadaynta sanitary-ga waa Socodka naqshadda sanitary-ga Socodka biyaha ceelka ee waqti ku saabsan (hydrograph, jidbaxa firfircoon, kaydinta, pump-yada, ka-burburka) Socodka naqshadda sanitary-ga wuxuu siiyaa socodka sare ee joogtada ah ee xaashida naqshadda isticmaasho Awoodda galka, faafitaanka marinka, jidbaxa dib-u-xidhka, hydrograph-yada, luminta tamarta marka laga reebo hal isgoys-coefficient Kuwaas ku hubi barnaamij kale; socodka, cabbirrada iyo khadadka heerka waxay ku jiraan Biyaha duufaanta Dhulka biyaha ku-urayaa ee qorshaha PDF, DWG, DXF ama LandXML; dhulka biyaha ka dusha (biyo-kala-qaybiyeyaasha) Dhulka biyaha gacanta ku sawir; waa la kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca Katalogyada tuubooyinka, tuubooyin aan goobo ahayn, dhismo aan sanduuq toosan ama silinder ahayn (koonooyin, tallaabooyin, benching), qayb biyo-qaadka maktabadda ku jirta Noocyada dhismaha laga helo cabbirrada (Shabakadda tuubooyinka); tuubooyin leh dhexroor Tuubooyinka muuqaalka dherer ku jira, tuubooyin qalloocan Akhri inverts iyo daboolka panel midig Sagxadaha Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Qaybinta lotyada bedka ama jabhadda, sagxadaha xariiqyada ku wareegsan, xuquuqda waddada Sagxad kasta geedkeeda ku sawir, ama geli wicitaankeeda Miisaska wareegyada iyo miisaska xariiqyada qorshaha; calaamadaha gacanta lagu dhaqaajiyo Qayb kasta waxa lagu calaamadeeyaa dhererkeeda Sagxadaha LandXML Sagxadaha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka mashruuca oo waxay u gudbaan PDF, DWG iyo DXF Traverses Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Hagaajinta least-squares, xeerka transit, miisaanka xagaasha iyo masaafooyinka Xeerka compass Xagaasha leexashada, xagaasha zenith iyo masaafooyinka jeexjeexa, sare-marka sinji-kaaseedka Ku celi masaafooyinka iyo xagaasha toosan si sax ah, ama bearing-yada Dhinac-dhinac ah, faylalka xogta kulul ee ururiyeyaasha Barooyinka u soo geli sida fayl barooyin Ulinta Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Ulammaha ka-saarka (barooyinka tixraaca oo ka soo laabanaya ulinta), ulammaha jeexjeexa barta qabashada U kaadi ka-saarka aad u baahan tahay, oo ay ku jiraan wixii ka dambeeya garabka Ulammaha toos loogu diro qaabka ururiyaha xogta CSV waxa uu furmaa barnaamijyada xafiiska ee ururiyeyaasha xogta badankood Ulinta tuubooyinka, padyada iyo sagxadaha Isticmaal barooyinka sahanka ku dhow khad waddo, ama geedaha sagxadda Faylalka iyo wax soo saarka Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Qoraal, xarriijin iyo cabbir DWG ama DXF; meel warqad; naqshado isku xidhan (xrefs); DXF binary Khadadka meesha moodelka waa la furaa (Fur DWG ama DXF sida khadad); naqshadaha isku xidhan ka fur gacanta Dhaqaajinta barooyin dhowr mar oo jiidis Gooy oo ku dheji, ama wax ka beddel mar mar Xaashiyo toosan, xarigga cinwaanka gaarka ah, daaqadaha aad habayso, xaashiyada qorshaha iyo muuqaalka DWG Hal xaashi qorshe oo toosan PDF kasta, ama xaashiyada qorshaha iyo muuqaalka waddada sida PDF Sawirka sare-marka iyo muuqaalada Kayd-jeexjeexyadu waa shaashad keliya; sawir shaashadda haddii aad u baahan tahay Beddelka magacyada lakabyada, midabka ama qaabka calaamadaha Ka beddel barnaamij CAD ka dib marka DXF la dhoofiyo Kaydinta daruurta iyo taariikhda nooca Kaydi faylalka .civilcraft.json oo ilaali; si aad mashruuc wada shaqayso, isticmaal kal-fadhi toos ah CadCraft Studio (Hal goob oo wada naqshadda, toos) CadCraft Studio iPad iyo iPhone, iyo Google Play Isticmaal CivilCraft browser-ka aaladda; Android, CadCraft Studio waa la rakibaa APK-ga ka yimid getcadcraft.com/download Furista faylal barooyin ama mashruuc dhowr mar Hal fayl mar kasta (faylalka GIS ee wada jira, sida qaybaha shapefile-ka, ayaa wada furmaa) Beerta Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Madaxyada iyo afka-biyaha ee soo saarayaasha Madaxyo guud, ama ku dar madaxyadaada faylal; xogta soo saarayaasha way imanaysaa marka ay oggolaadaan Dhererka ugu badan ee xariiqyada dusha-biyo-dhigga, socodka waqtiga, pump-yada, shabakadaha tuubada xalqadda Xariiqyada dusha-biyo-dhigga ku xidh dhererka ay soo saaraha daabacay; hubinta waxay u baahan tahay shabakad laanta Hareerta sax ah ee shay freeform oo qoto ah; mugga hoos-dhulka oo si sax ah loo cabbiray Qolofta convex-ka waa la jeexjeexaa, mugga hoos-dhulka waa qiyaas (sheegan Sifooyinka) Dhirta ku jirta BimCraft iyo ModelCraft ee Ku dhig maktabadda Dhoofi landscape IFC oo ku fur BimCraft dhinaca dhismaha Moodelada dhirta faahfaahsan (caleemo, laan, xilli) muuqaalka 3D; shayada freeform iyo biyo-dhigga muuqaalka 3D Dhirta waxay 3D ku muuqdaan sida qaabab fudud oo cabbirkooda laga qaaday liiska dhirta (Arag goobta 3D); scatter-ka ModelCraft wuxuu sameeyaa sawirada beerta Darbiyada dhul adag ee dusha ku hayn heer jeexjeexan gadaashooda Dhig madal ama pad garbaha toosan: waa darbiyada dhulka celiya ee dusha (Jeexjeexa) Isbedelada SVG astaamahaaga; tekstuur iyo midabka moodelada dhirta GLB ee aad leedahay; geometry GLB la cadaadiyay Isbedelada hore u rido barnaamijka sawirkaaga; moodelada waxa lagu sawiraa midabka dhirta; dhoofi GLB aan la cadaadin (Sawirka dhirta) Liiska dhirtaada gaarka ah ee lagu kaydiyay akoonkaaga Maktabadda (lagu wax ka beddelo barnaamijka) Wax ka beddel liiska mashruuca ee miiska dhirta oo kaydi faylal dhirta Qalabka beerta ee kaaliyeyaasha aan daaqada lahayn (server-ka faylka iyo sadarka amarka) Waxay shaqeeyaan markii daaqadda CivilCraft la furan yahay (Kaaliye AI ha kugu shaqeeyo goobtaada) Xariiqyada korontada Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Heer dal oo gudaha lagu dhisay (xaaladaha culeyska, fogaanta, factors) Dejii qiyamka heerkaaga Xaaladaha culeyska iyo xaddidaadda… oo kaydi, mar wada maktabadda, sidii pack aad mar kale isticmaasho oo aad wada-wadaagto (Packs) Masaafada dhinac-dhinaca ah ee sare-marka conductor-ka iyo timaha geedka ama darbiga xariiqa ku teedsan Fogaanta toosan ee sare-marka dhirta iyo darbiyada xariiqa gooyo (Hubinta xariiqa korontada) Ku guuritaanka conductor-ka iyo ballaadhinta conductor cusub Ogolow iyaga heerkulka miiska xariiqa Qiimaynta kulaylka kaabalada qoto (qiimaynta korontada ee sida loo dhigay) Geli qiimaynta korontada ee bixiyahaaga shayga kaabalka Daraasadaha short-circuit, ilaalinta iyo dhulka xidhka Isticmaal barnaamij koronto gaar ah; CivilCraft wuxuu siiyaa dhererka shabakadda iyo kaabalada Tiirarka lattice ee gacan-gacan loo naqshadeeyay, iyo ilaalinta xagaaga dhulka Taageeradu waxa lagu hubiyaa culeyska magacaaban; kaabada xagaaga waxa lagu hubiyaa culeyska la qiimeeyay Fayl daraasad .DON oo barnaamijka akhriya lagu hubiyo Halkaas hubi; soo dir tusaale si aan uga tijaabinno mid dhab ah Xariiqyada korontada muuqaalka 3D iyo IFC Qorshaha, muuqaalka xariiqa, xaashiyada iyo lakabyada GIS Qalabka xariiqa korontada ee kaaliyeyaasha aan daaqada lahayn Waxay shaqeeyaan markii daaqadda CivilCraft la furan yahay (Kaaliye AI ha kugu shaqeeyo goobtaada) Masses-ka dhismaha Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Maktabad koodhadka qeybinta ama xeerarka magaalo kasta Ku qor xadka amarka ee aad leedahay (Xaddidaadda qeybinta) Iftiinka samada ee darbiyada (iftiinka wejiga), dabaysha Saacadaha qorraxda waxa uu tiraa qorraxda toosan oo keliya Hooska geedaha, dhirta ama wax kasta oo aan lagu sawirin mass Sawir dhismayaasha deriska ah sida masses Qaabka saqafka masses-ka Masses sare-ka fidsan Furaha, saqafyada iyo noocyada darbiyada marka mass la horumariyo BimCraft BimCraft wuxuu dhisaa darbiyo dibadeed oo fudud heer kasta iyo dabaq; ku dar kuwa kale halkaas GIS iyo nidaamyada isku-xidhka Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta File Geodatabase; qaabka KML, astaamaha, dusha-dhulka korka iyo xidhiidhka shabakadda U beddel GeoPackage, shapefile ama GeoJSON marka hore; KML placemarks waa la akhriyaa iyada oo aan qaabkoodi lahayn Wax-beddelka astaamaha GIS ama sifooyinkooda Ku wax ka beddel barnaamij GIS oo mar kale soo geli. Falanqee wuxuu sameeyaa lakabyo cusub (buffer, overlay, join, selection) oo wuxuu ku daraa goobaha aagga iyo dhererka, laakiin ma wax-beddelo astaamaha meesha Falanqaynta shabakadda iyo raster, buffers oo leh dhamaad fidsan ama afeef, iyo buffers dhinac keliya, ku darista ama tirtirista safafka iyo beddelka nooca goobta miiska sifooyinka, midabka fasalka gacanta, sharaxaadda qaabka qorshaha Isticmaal Dooro si aad astaamo u dooranaysid oo lakab uga samayso; dhamaadyada fidsan lama bixiyo. Midabka iyo miiska sifooyinka waa la dhisay: eeg Qaabee lakab sifo ku salaysan iyo Ku shaqee miiska sifooyinka lakabka Qaabka calaamadaha (cabbirka, meesha) iyo calaamado iska ilaaliya Calaamadaha waa hal cabbir, waxay isku dhaafi karaan marka astaamuhu kaadi yihiin Datums-ka sare-marka iyo moodeelada geoid-ka Sare-marka waxa loo isticmaalaa sida faylka siiyo; hubi datum-ka sare-marka adigu Kala-guuritaanka grid-ka kaas oo ka duwan NAD83 oo laga soo jeediyay NAD27 aagga ku saabsan (OSTN15, NTv2 datums kale waxay shaqeeyaan markaad faylka ku darto), dhowr grid isla mar, grid-ka toosan Faylka grid-ka datum-kaaga adigu ku dar; hal grid mashruuc kasta Lakabyada khariidadda DXF ama dhoofinta 3D Lakabyada khariidadda waxay galaan PDF plot, waxayna DWG dhinaca sawir ahaan u dhowdahay Server-yada khariidadda ee u baahan galitaan, fure ama token Adeegyo dadweyne isticmaal, ama fayl sawir oo georeferenced ah Qorista faylalka LAS ama LAZ laga soo bilaabo dusha, moodelka dhulka ama qalabka shabakadda sare-marka iyo LiDAR Dhoofi dusha sida shabakad sare-marka GeoTIFF ah. Daruurta barta add-on-ku wuxuu qoraa daruur nadiifsan sida LAS 1.4 ama LAZ Xoogga LiDAR, midabka iyo soo noqoshada; shabakadaha sare-marka oo leh dhowr band; faylalka grid ama LiDAR ee ka weyn 200 MB LiDAR waa la shaandhaynayaa fasalka keliya, shabakadaha waxay isticmaalaan band-ka koowaad; faylalka waaweyn marka hore u jar tiles Gelinta Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Doorashada sanduuqa taabashada (waxay u baahan tahay Shift) Riix muddo dheer barta sahan kasta si aad ugu darto Isku-xidhka ama masaafooyinka la qoray intii la sawirayay Si qiyaas ah u sawir, kadibna ku qor isku-xidhka PI saxda ah miiska PI khadka waddada Ku qorista isku-xidhka geedaha padyada iyo dhismayaasha Jiid gacmahooda; ku weyn meelaha si sax ah, ka eeg E iyo N status bar-ka Qabsashada shayada (ka soo horjeeda barooyinka sahanka ee khadadka jejebinta) Ku weyn oo fiiri status bar-ka Muuqaalka 3D Wali lama dhisin Halkii taas, maanta Sawirka ama wax-beddelka muuqaalka 3D Sawir oo wax ka beddel qorshaha; muuqaalka 3D wuxuu raacaa wax-beddel kasta Doorashada xariiqyada muhiimka ah ee kooridorka ama astaamaha GIS guji 3D Guji qorshaha Dhoofinta muuqaalka la weyneeyay ama feet Dhoofintu waa cabbir run ah oo meetir ah; eeg Dhoofi goobta 3D Calaamadaha dhoofinta GLB ama OBJ, cabbirka iyo qaabka calaamadaha 3D Calaamadaha waxay muuqdaan muuqaalka 3D oo keliya, hal cabbir; eeg Arag goobta 3D Tekstuurada sawirrada, duulid lagu duubo video, hoos-ka goobta ka baxsan, saacadaha qorraxda muuqaalka 3D Lakabyada khariidadda ee dusha lagu dhigay; wadista iyo booska qorraxda waqti; saacadaha qorraxda maalin ama xilli qorshaha","lang":"so"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Isticmaalka caawintan","summary":"Fur caawinta, baadh, oo arag tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["caawin","f1","baadh","casharro","buug"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-caawinta","text":"Fur caawinta","level":2},{"id":"raadi-mawduuc","text":"Raadi mawduuc","level":2},{"id":"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga","text":"Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga","level":2},{"id":"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka","text":"Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la&#039;aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-caawinta\"\u003EFur caawinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ee app-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo la socda furaha \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EFurayaasha Mac-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-mawduuc\"\u003ERaadi mawduuc\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga\"\u003ETillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go&#039;aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan &quot;Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/span\u003E sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka\"\u003ECaawintaas oo kale websaydhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWebsaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la'aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa. Fur caawinta Riix F1, ama dooro Caawin barka sare ee app-ka. Riix Esc ama dooro Xir si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd. Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix F1 oo la socda furaha fn (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka Caawin. Eeg Furayaasha Mac-ka. Raadi mawduuc Ku qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa. Mawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka. Xiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. Dib u noqo wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid. Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga Qaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go'aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan \"Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online\". Dooro Beddel sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale. Dooro Muuji dhammaan si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh. Gaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: Ctrl+S wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S. Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka Websaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, Ku fur website-ka oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarada","summary":"Browserrada app-yadu ku shaqeeyaan, waxa ka duwan dhexdooda, iyo waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","browser","mac","windows","linux","ipad","tablet","webgl","shuruudaha","xusuusta"],"headings":[{"id":"browserka","text":"Browserka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan","text":"Waxa browserada ku kala duwan","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-iyo-linux","text":"Mac, Windows iyo Linux","level":2},{"id":"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada","text":"Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada","level":2},{"id":"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan","text":"Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay","text":"Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EMeesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka\"\u003EBrowserka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBrowser\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEngine\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan\"\u003EWaxa browserada ku kala duwan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuridda folder-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome ama Edge, shid &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFirefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji &quot;File download location&quot; &quot;Ask for each download&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-iyo-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows iyo Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada\"\u003ETaabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan\"\u003EBrowserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee \u003Cem\u003Ebilaabmo\u003C/em\u003E, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay\"\u003EWaxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan). Browserka Isticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan: Browser Engine Faahfaahin Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Kan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha. Firefox Gecko Way shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah. Safari WebKit Way shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad. Dhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga. Waxa browserada ku kala duwan Furidda folder-ka. Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba. Kaydinta. Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go'aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin. Chrome ama Edge, shid \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Firefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro \"Always ask you where to save files\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Safari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji \"File download location\" \"Ask for each download\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Mac, Windows iyo Linux Apps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada. Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada Qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro. Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan Waxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo. Nooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4) CadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo. Tanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee bilaabmo, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo. Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay Kuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray: 8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn). Chip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga. Shaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan. Faylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada","summary":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro, furayaasha function ee Mac-ka, riix midig iyo panning la'aan mouse.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["kiiboodh","gaadh","shortcut","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","furayaasha function","trackpad","riix midig","badhanka dhexe","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka","text":"Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka","level":2},{"id":"gaadhka-browserku-hayo","text":"Gaadhka browserku hayo","level":2},{"id":"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka","text":"Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka","level":2},{"id":"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal","text":"Qorista sanduuq qoraal","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro\"\u003ESida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoran\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMac-ka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWindows iyo Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuraha Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. &quot;Kadib&quot; waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka\"\u003EFurayaasha function ee Mac-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehay \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Efur \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, oo shid &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gaadhka-browserku-hayo\"\u003EGaadhka browserku hayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Mac-ka iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashadda buuxda ee browserka (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka\"\u003EBadhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood. Shid &quot;Secondary click&quot; \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E gudaha, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal\"\u003EQorista sanduuq qoraal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista &quot;L&quot; waxay qortaa L. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro Caawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo. Qoran Mac-ka Windows iyo Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) iyo S Ctrl iyo S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F Ctrl, Shift iyo F Alt+← Option (⌥) iyo ← Alt iyo ← Backspace furaha Delete Backspace Delete fn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore) Delete Enter Return Enter Calaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. \"Kadib\" waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo. Gaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed Ctrl+Z labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (Ctrl+Shift+F), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso. Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto: hay fn (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama fur System Settings, kadibna Keyboard, kadibna Keyboard Shortcuts, kadibna Function Keys, oo shid \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Qaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii. Gaadhka browserku hayo Bog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T iyo Ctrl+W had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas. Ctrl+Q Mac-ka iyo Alt+F4 Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi. Shaashadda buuxda ee browserka (Control-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda / F11) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo Ctrl+Shift+F ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara. Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn: Riix midig: guji labo farood. Shid \"Secondary click\" System Settings gudaha, kadibna Trackpad, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. Ctrl la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero. Riix midig: guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Qorista sanduuq qoraal Intaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista \"L\" waxay qortaa L. Riix Esc ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Hel qalab ama dejin","summary":"Riix Ctrl+K oo qor xarfo yar si aad u wada fuliso qalab kasta, u beddesho dejin ama furto mawduuc caawin.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["raadi","baadh","palet amarka","furid degdeg","fuli amar","qalab","dejin","gaadh","ctrl k","cmd k"],"headings":[{"id":"raadi-oo-fuli","text":"Raadi oo fuli","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-oo-fuli\"\u003ERaadi oo fuli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel text&quot;, &quot;units&quot;. Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa sanduuqa xidha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"App kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka. Raadi oo fuli Riix Ctrl+K, ama dooro Raadi barka sare ku jirta. Qor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: \"fillet\", \"panel text\", \"units\". Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid. Riix Enter si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. Esc ayaa sanduuqa xidha. Qalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa Dejinta oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa. Waxa aad ogaataa Waxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay. Qalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay. Qalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Habee panelada oo isticmaal shaashad labaad","summary":"Ku xidh panelada dhinaca bidix, midig ama hoosta, isku rari, u kooxee sida tab-yo, ku hay ama qari, ku dhaaf naqshadda, ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow, dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo, ama u wareeji daaqad gaar ah shaashad kale.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["panelada","ku xidh","ku dhaaf","wareeji panel","jiid","qaabeynta","tab-yada","kooxda tab-ka","isku rari","ku hay","auto-hide","qari panel","xir panel","kooban","cabbirka qaabeynta","dhow","safafka qalabka","lafmeyso","1 safka","2 safka","khadka qalabka","shaashad labaad","laba shaashad","shaashado badan","daaqad","daaqad kor u soo booda","dib u deji qaabka"],"headings":[{"id":"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda","text":"Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda","level":2},{"id":"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo","text":"U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo","level":2},{"id":"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi","text":"Pin, qari oo soo celi","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow","text":"Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow","level":2},{"id":"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo","text":"Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-kiiboodhka","text":"Isticmaal kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad","text":"Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad","level":2},{"id":"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan","text":"Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan","level":2},{"id":"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah","text":"Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah","level":2},{"id":"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal","text":"Dhaqaaji wada-hadal","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada","text":"Dib u dhig panelada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPanelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda\"\u003EDhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo\"\u003EU kooxee panelada sida tab-yo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa beddela tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove out of the tab group\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi\"\u003EPin, qari oo soo celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eauto-hide\u003C/strong\u003E: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnpin\u003C/span\u003E, si aad u xidho si joogto ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka xidhka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow\"\u003EKa dhig qaabeynta mid dhow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout density\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay laba doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComfortable\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompact\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo\"\u003EDooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar rows\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWrap\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 row\u003C/span\u003E hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-kiiboodhka\"\u003EIsticmaal kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the left\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock at the bottom\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFloat over the drawing\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin to the edge\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E panel kale, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa xidha menu-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove all panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E gudahiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su&#039;aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan\"\u003EHal daaqad oo panelo ka badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to panels window 2\u003C/span\u003E (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa &quot;panels 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the next one\u003C/span\u003E mar kasta daaqad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah\"\u003EIsku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E qaybtaas oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal\"\u003EDhaqaaji wada-hadal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlot to PDF\u003C/span\u003E ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in its own window\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen it\u003C/span\u003E si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep them here\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Panelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan. Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu ⋯, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu ⋯ oo keliya. Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda Jiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare. Intaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa. Ku dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca. Panelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso. Panel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa. Ku jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu ⋯. U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo Laba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa beddela tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Si aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro Move out of the tab group menu ⋯-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro Tab with iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin. Pin, qari oo soo celi Pin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa auto-hide: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix Esc) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro Unpin, si aad u xidho si joogto ah. Badhanka xidhka, ama Hide this panel menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix Enter. Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow Settings › General › Layout density waxay leedahay laba doorasho. Comfortable waa caadiga. Compact wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. Reset layout ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay. Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo Settings › General › Toolbar rows waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. Wrap waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. 2 rows wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, 1 row hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama Tab ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos 2 rows, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta Settings › CadCraft. Isticmaal kiiboodhka Badhanka ⋯ ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: Dock on the left, Dock on the right, Dock at the bottom, Float over the drawing, Pin to the edge, Hide this panel, Tab with panel kale, Move to a new window iyo Put it back. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix Enter, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix Enter. Esc ayaa xidha menu-ga. Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad Dooro ⋯ panel, kadibna Move all panels to a new window. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa Move panels to a new window Settings gudahiisa. Daaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto. Sii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad. Furayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su'aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad. Chrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro Put it on my other screen daaqadda panelada (ama Put the panels on my other screen menu ⋯ panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa. Daaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa. Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta. Menu ⋯ ee panel, Move to a new window wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, Move to panels window 2 (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa \"panels 2\". Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa. Daaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada. Markaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro Open the next one mar kasta daaqad kasta. Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah Qaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu ⋯ qaybtaas oo dooro Move to a new window; Put it back (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah. Dhaqaaji wada-hadal Wada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso. Kiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix Alt+Shift+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar Ctrl si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa. Taleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin. Ku dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka Plot to PDF ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, Open in its own window. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha. Dib u dhig panelada Dooro Put the panels back daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Xidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro Open it si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama Keep them here. Settings › General › Reset layout wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen. Haddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale. Qaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"float-a-group-over-the-drawing","text":"Float a group over the drawing","level":2},{"id":"pin","text":"Pin","level":2},{"id":"close-a-group","text":"Close a group","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Drag a group&#039;s grip onto one: it becomes a palette there, and a second group dropped on the same place joins it as a tab.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"float-a-group-over-the-drawing\"\u003EFloat a group over the drawing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPick \u003Cstrong\u003EFloat on the drawing\u003C/strong\u003E in a group&#039;s grip menu, or drag the grip onto the drawing where no place is outlined. The palette floats there; drag its grip to move it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin\"\u003EPin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPin\u003C/strong\u003E in a grip menu keeps that bar or palette where it is: it cannot be dragged, closed or hidden, and a pinned ribbon stays unfolded. \u003Cstrong\u003EUnpin\u003C/strong\u003E gives it all back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"close-a-group\"\u003EClose a group\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach ribbon group has a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the right of its name, and every group&#039;s grip menu has \u003Cstrong\u003EClose\u003C/strong\u003E. The group leaves its bar; the bar&#039;s own grip menu lists it as \u003Cstrong\u003EShow … again\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Drag a group's grip onto one: it becomes a palette there, and a second group dropped on the same place joins it as a tab. Float a group over the drawing Pick Float on the drawing in a group's grip menu, or drag the grip onto the drawing where no place is outlined. The palette floats there; drag its grip to move it. Pin Pin in a grip menu keeps that bar or palette where it is: it cannot be dragged, closed or hidden, and a pinned ribbon stays unfolded. Unpin gives it all back. Close a group Each ribbon group has a × at the right of its name, and every group's grip menu has Close. The group leaves its bar; the bar's own grip menu lists it as Show … again. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka ribbon tab-yo ah oo naqshadda dushiisa ku jira, oo leh Properties iyo baadhe mashruuc dhinaca bidix iyo tab kasta muuqaal furan, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","ribbon","tab-yada ribbon","baadhaha mashruuca","baadhe","palet-yada","palet properties","tab-yada muuqaalka","safka xaaladda","degdeg fur","xidh ribbon","qaabka caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn","beddel","dhigan"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka","text":"Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii","text":"Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka magaca:\u003C/strong\u003E magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat each tool does here\u003C/span\u003E (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka xulashada:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPanelka bidix:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale &quot;Marka hore fur fayl&quot;, ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka\"\u003EKa isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii\"\u003ERibbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the ribbon back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Ribbon and project browser. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Safka magaca: magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, What each tool does here (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, Help iyo Settings. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka. Ribbon: qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. File bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa. Safka xulashada: hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay. Panelka bidix: Properties sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto. Tab-yada muuqaalka: hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay. Safka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda: hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale \"Marka hore fur fayl\", ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka Markaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii Laba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka Move the ribbon ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay Collapse the ribbon iyo Keep the ribbon open sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta. Move the ribbon › Move to a new window ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the ribbon back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"interface-styles","scope":"basics","title":"Pick an interface style","summary":"Choose how the toolbar, panels and tabs are arranged, see what a style leaves out in your app, keep one style for every app or one for a single app, and export or import a style file.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["interface style","style","layout","workspace","ribbon","toolbox","drafting","multi-view","sketch","vector","duncan","classic","per app","import","export","ccworkspace","arrange","my tools","settings"],"headings":[{"id":"pick-a-style","text":"Pick a style","level":2},{"id":"see-what-a-style-leaves-out","text":"See what a style leaves out","level":2},{"id":"one-style-for-every-app-or-one-for-this-app","text":"One style for every app, or one for this app","level":2},{"id":"arrange-your-own","text":"Arrange your own","level":2},{"id":"export-and-import-a-style","text":"Export and import a style","level":2},{"id":"if-a-style-does-not-work","text":"If a style does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAn interface style is one arrangement of the toolbar, the panels, the tabs and the command line. Pick the one you are used to and the app opens in it. Your tools, menus and keys do not change; only where they sit does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pick-a-style\"\u003EPick a style\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and choose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface style\u003C/span\u003E choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick a style\u003C/span\u003E. The list shows each style with a line that says how it is arranged.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose one. The window changes at once. The first choice, the app&#039;s classic style, is the arrangement the app started with.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe styles are \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMulti-view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVector\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuncan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutoRev\u003C/span\u003E and the four \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad1 Ribbon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad2 Workbench\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad3 Review\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad4 Studio\u003C/span\u003E styles. Styles that come from an add-on or from a file you imported are listed under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. Which of these you see depends on the app and on the build: a style the app cannot use is not offered.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis page describes the picker as it stands in the lab build. Some of the styles are still being finished; a style that looks incomplete in your build is one of those.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-what-a-style-leaves-out\"\u003ESee what a style leaves out\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn app is not the same as every other app. A style may ask for a ribbon, a tool column, view tabs, several views side by side or a 3D view cube, and your app may have none of those. Under the picker \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E says what the chosen style leaves out in this app, for example: &quot;In this app this style leaves out: the ribbon (this app has none).&quot; It also counts tools and commands the style names that the app does not have. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMulti-view\u003C/span\u003E splits the drawing area into Top, Front, Right and Perspective views, which needs an app with a 3D model; in an app with one view at a time it keeps that one view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"one-style-for-every-app-or-one-for-this-app\"\u003EOne style for every app, or one for this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe style you pick is used in every app that has it; an app that does not have it keeps its own layout. To give just this app a different style, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse a different interface style for\u003C/span\u003E this app. Unticked, the app follows your choice for all apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn the lab (the version for testing) the choice under the picker reads \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E is the start: the style you pick is kept for the app you are in, and the other apps keep theirs. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E to make this app follow the style you pick for every app; choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E again and the style in use becomes this app&#039;s own. Each app opens in its own style straight away, before the page draws.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-your-own\"\u003EArrange your own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own interface style…\u003C/span\u003E opens a list of choices for where each part goes: the commands as a ribbon or the app&#039;s toolbar, what is on the left and the right, the tabs, a status bar, an info box or quick bar, the edit palette by the pointer and the look of tabs and button outlines. Only parts the app has are offered. The result is saved as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy layout\u003C/span\u003E (or the name you type), works in every app that has layouts, and its panels still dock, float and move to their own window (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a style that has the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E slots, right-click a tool and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to My tools\u003C/span\u003E, or drag it to an empty slot. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmpty this slot\u003C/span\u003E clears one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"export-and-import-a-style\"\u003EExport and import a style\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this interface style\u003C/span\u003E saves the style as a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccworkspace.json\u003C/code\u003E file. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport an interface style…\u003C/span\u003E reads one, or drop the file on the box. The file holds layout data only and is read as untrusted: it can arrange the app&#039;s own blocks and cannot run anything. A file that is larger than 64 kB, made for a newer version, or has no name or blocks is refused, and the message says why. Up to eight imported styles are kept; remove one before adding a ninth. An imported style appears under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E; pick it there.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-style-does-not-work\"\u003EIf a style does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf a style cannot be used in this app, the app shows its classic layout and says so.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFinish or cancel the running command first: a style cannot change while a tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo go back at any time, choose the classic style again in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"An interface style is one arrangement of the toolbar, the panels, the tabs and the command line. Pick the one you are used to and the app opens in it. Your tools, menus and keys do not change; only where they sit does. Pick a style Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,) and choose the Global tab. Under Interface style choose Pick a style. The list shows each style with a line that says how it is arranged. Choose one. The window changes at once. The first choice, the app's classic style, is the arrangement the app started with. The styles are Drafting, Multi-view, Sketch, Vector, Duncan, Ribbon and project browser, Toolbox and info box, AutoRev and the four PRO-cad1 Ribbon, PRO-cad2 Workbench, PRO-cad3 Review and PRO-cad4 Studio styles. Styles that come from an add-on or from a file you imported are listed under From add-ons and files. Which of these you see depends on the app and on the build: a style the app cannot use is not offered. This page describes the picker as it stands in the lab build. Some of the styles are still being finished; a style that looks incomplete in your build is one of those. See what a style leaves out An app is not the same as every other app. A style may ask for a ribbon, a tool column, view tabs, several views side by side or a 3D view cube, and your app may have none of those. Under the picker Settings says what the chosen style leaves out in this app, for example: \"In this app this style leaves out: the ribbon (this app has none).\" It also counts tools and commands the style names that the app does not have. Multi-view splits the drawing area into Top, Front, Right and Perspective views, which needs an app with a 3D model; in an app with one view at a time it keeps that one view. One style for every app, or one for this app The style you pick is used in every app that has it; an app that does not have it keeps its own layout. To give just this app a different style, tick Use a different interface style for this app. Unticked, the app follows your choice for all apps. In the lab (the version for testing) the choice under the picker reads This app or Every app, and This app is the start: the style you pick is kept for the app you are in, and the other apps keep theirs. Choose Every app to make this app follow the style you pick for every app; choose This app again and the style in use becomes this app's own. Each app opens in its own style straight away, before the page draws. Arrange your own Arrange your own interface style… opens a list of choices for where each part goes: the commands as a ribbon or the app's toolbar, what is on the left and the right, the tabs, a status bar, an info box or quick bar, the edit palette by the pointer and the look of tabs and button outlines. Only parts the app has are offered. The result is saved as My layout (or the name you type), works in every app that has layouts, and its panels still dock, float and move to their own window (Arrange the panels). In a style that has the My tools slots, right-click a tool and choose Add to My tools, or drag it to an empty slot. Empty this slot clears one. Export and import a style Export this interface style saves the style as a .ccworkspace.json file. Import an interface style… reads one, or drop the file on the box. The file holds layout data only and is read as untrusted: it can arrange the app's own blocks and cannot run anything. A file that is larger than 64 kB, made for a newer version, or has no name or blocks is refused, and the message says why. Up to eight imported styles are kept; remove one before adding a ninth. An imported style appears under From add-ons and files; pick it there. If a style does not work If a style cannot be used in this app, the app shows its classic layout and says so. Finish or cancel the running command first: a style cannot change while a tool is running. To go back at any time, choose the classic style again in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka tiir qalab ah oo dhinaca bidix ku jira, oo leh meel aad ku kaydiso qalabkaaga, sanduuq macluumaad oo naqshadda sare ku socda oo raacaya qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, socodsiiye dhinaca midig, tab muuqaal kasta, degdeg dooro iyo palet wax-beddel, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","sanduuqa qalabka","tiirka qalabka","sanduuqa macluumaadka","macluumaad","socodsiiye","khariidadda mashruuca","safka degdega ah","degdeg dooro","palet wax-beddel","palet pet","my tools","qalabkayga","tab-yada muuqaalka","daaqadda sanduuqa qalabka","qaabeynta caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa macluumaadka:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Nothing selected&quot;. Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMy tools:\u003C/strong\u003E kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to My tools\u003C/span\u003E; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESocodsiiyaha:\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka degdega ah:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPalet-ka wax-beddelka:\u003C/strong\u003E riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu&#039;aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii\"\u003ESanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the toolbox\u003C/span\u003E ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the toolbox back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Toolbox and info box. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Qalabka: qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa. Sanduuqa macluumaadka: hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, Ctrl+Z ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay \"Nothing selected\". Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan. Sanduuqa qalabka: tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa. My tools: kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro Add to My tools; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan. Socodsiiyaha: panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, Properties iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig. Tab-yada muuqaalka: tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa. Safka degdega ah: hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada. Palet-ka wax-beddelka: riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu'aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo Properties. Esc, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii Badhanka Move the toolbox ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay Move to a new window: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the toolbox back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Habee qaabeyntaada oo kaydi habayntaada","summary":"Dooro panelka ku muujinaya baadhaha mashruuca, Properties ama waxa panelka u gaar ah, meesha sanduuqa qalabka ku jiro iyo waxa safafka ku jiro, kaydi sida qaabeyntaada, oo kaydi habayn oo dhan magac hoose oo aad ku beddesho.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","habee","u habee","qaabeyntayda","qaabeyntayda gaarka ah","panelada","tafatirayaasha","baadhaha mashruuca","properties","sanduuqa qalabka","safka degdega","sanduuqa macluumaadka","deegaanka shaqada","habayn","profile","kaydi habayn","beddel habayn","dhoofi habayn","soo deji habayn","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"habee-qaabeyntaada","text":"Habee qaabeyntaada","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo","text":"Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habee-qaabeyntaada\"\u003EHabee qaabeyntaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii magac, kadibna dooro:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dushiisa:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dhinaceeda:\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeel naqshaddu:\u003C/strong\u003E tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this layout\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo\"\u003EKaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi:\u003C/strong\u003E qor magac hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWork environments\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave my setup\u003C/span\u003E. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwitch to it\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadaag:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport a setup…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejin, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Marka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto. Habee qaabeyntaada Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,), dooro Global, kadibna Layout. Dooro Arrange your own layout…. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho. Ku sii magac, kadibna dooro: Naqshadda dushiisa: qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo. Naqshadda dhinaceeda: sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo My tools oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda. Meel naqshaddu: tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda. Muuqaalka: cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka. Dooro Use this layout. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya. Waxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa From add-ons and files; Export this layout wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran Habee panelada. Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo Deegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo My tools. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan. Kaydi: qor magac hoosta Work environments oo dooro Save my setup. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas. Beddel: dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro Switch to it. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta. Wadaag: Export wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl .ccenv.json; Import a setup… wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna. Ka saar: dooro dejin, kadibna dooro Remove. Waxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin. Si aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka, qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca iyo qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox","window","palette stack","large tools","small tools","more tools"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"a-block-in-a-window-of-its-own","text":"A block in a window of its own","level":2},{"id":"palettes-in-two-stacks","text":"Palettes in two stacks","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the first … tools\u003C/span\u003E keeps that many tools of the group in view; the rest wait under the group&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E▾\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all its tools\u003C/span\u003E undoes it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the ribbon, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELarge tools\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmall tools\u003C/span\u003E draw every tool of the group one size; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESizes as the app draws them\u003C/span\u003E goes back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-block-in-a-window-of-its-own\"\u003EA block in a window of its own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn Arrange mode the map of places also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn a window\u003C/span\u003E for the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox and the status bar. The block stays in its place until you click \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in windows\u003C/span\u003E in the note at the bottom: a browser opens a window only when you click. A layout file can ask for the same with the place \u003Ccode\u003Ewindow\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"palettes-in-two-stacks\"\u003EPalettes in two stacks\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe panel&#039;s palettes can stand in two stacks, one over the other, each with its own tabs. Drag a palette by its tab (or use the grip at the left of its stack&#039;s tabs) to the other stack, to a stack of its own, or to the other panel. Each move is one step of \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E. The panel&#039;s own content always stays in its panel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Show the first … tools keeps that many tools of the group in view; the rest wait under the group's ▾. Show all its tools undoes it. In the ribbon, Large tools and Small tools draw every tool of the group one size; Sizes as the app draws them goes back. A block in a window of its own In Arrange mode the map of places also has In a window for the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox and the status bar. The block stays in its place until you click Open in windows in the note at the bottom: a browser opens a window only when you click. A layout file can ask for the same with the place window. Palettes in two stacks The panel's palettes can stand in two stacks, one over the other, each with its own tabs. Drag a palette by its tab (or use the grip at the left of its stack's tabs) to the other stack, to a stack of its own, or to the other panel. Each move is one step of Undo. The panel's own content always stays in its panel. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Shaqada khadka ka baxsan","summary":"Kaydi app si aad ugu shaqeyso khadka ka baxsan, waxa ku shaqeeya xidhiidh la'aan, iyo waxa u baahan xidhiidh.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["offline","internet la'aan","diyaarad","booqasho goob","cache","service worker","rakib","soo deji","xidhiidh"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan","text":"Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya","text":"Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan","text":"Waxa xidhiidh u baahan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan\"\u003EKaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur app-ka intaad online tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E barka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug &quot;Offline ready&quot;. Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la&#039;aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya\"\u003EWaxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuridda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan\"\u003EWaxa xidhiidh u baahan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHelidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada websaydhka, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi&#039;ax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Apps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la'aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo. Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan Fur app-ka intaad online tahay. Dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan barka sare. Sug \"Offline ready\". Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa. Tan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la'aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa. Hadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay. Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya Furidda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta. Kaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga. Caawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda. Waxa xidhiidh u baahan Markii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan. Helidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, Kaydi khadka ka baxsan nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa. Xiriirrada websaydhka, sida Ku fur website-ka iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale. Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn. Waxa aad ogaataa Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi'ax. Daaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin. Safari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar. CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself yet. To hide the interface and show only the drawing, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/present\" data-topic=\"basics/present\"\u003EPresent a drawing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself yet. To hide the interface and show only the drawing, see Present a drawing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"theme-light-dark","scope":"basics","title":"Light and dark: the sun and the moon","summary":"Switch every app and the site between the light and the dark theme with the sun and the moon in the top bar, or pick one in Settings, or let your system decide.","section":"start","order":44,"keywords":["theme","light","dark","sun","moon","dark mode","light mode","night","paper","model","colours","contrast","match the system","appearance"],"headings":[{"id":"switch-it-in-the-top-bar","text":"Switch it in the top bar","level":2},{"id":"choose-it-in-settings","text":"Choose it in Settings","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery CadCraft app and the website share one theme: light or dark. Change it in one app and the others and the site follow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-it-in-the-top-bar\"\u003ESwitch it in the top bar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the right of the top bar there are two small buttons:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ethe \u003Cstrong\u003Esun\u003C/strong\u003E is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELight theme\u003C/span\u003E: a light page with dark lines;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ethe \u003Cstrong\u003Emoon\u003C/strong\u003E is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDark theme\u003C/span\u003E: a dark page with light lines.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe one in use is lit. Hover over a button to see its name. On a phone the two buttons are in the top bar&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E menu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the sun and the moon are not there yet, the same two buttons carry the words \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E (light) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E (dark). They do the same thing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it-in-settings\"\u003EChoose it in Settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETheme\u003C/span\u003E offers the light theme (the sun), the dark theme (the moon) and a third choice that matches your system. With that one the apps follow your computer&#039;s light or dark setting and change when it changes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe theme is kept in this browser. It is not part of a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003Ework environment\u003C/a\u003E and it does not change your drawing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe drawing&#039;s own spaces are a different thing: in CadCraft, model space and paper space (the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E tab and the sheet tabs) are where you draw and where you lay out sheets. The theme only changes the colours of the interface.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELogos and icons follow the theme by themselves.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Every CadCraft app and the website share one theme: light or dark. Change it in one app and the others and the site follow. Switch it in the top bar At the right of the top bar there are two small buttons: the sun is the Light theme: a light page with dark lines; the moon is the Dark theme: a dark page with light lines. The one in use is lit. Hover over a button to see its name. On a phone the two buttons are in the top bar's More menu. Where the sun and the moon are not there yet, the same two buttons carry the words Paper (light) and Model (dark). They do the same thing. Choose it in Settings Settings › Global › Theme offers the light theme (the sun), the dark theme (the moon) and a third choice that matches your system. With that one the apps follow your computer's light or dark setting and change when it changes. Good to know The theme is kept in this browser. It is not part of a work environment and it does not change your drawing. The drawing's own spaces are a different thing: in CadCraft, model space and paper space (the Model tab and the sheet tabs) are where you draw and where you lay out sheets. The theme only changes the colours of the interface. Logos and icons follow the theme by themselves.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"craft-menu","scope":"basics","title":"The CadCraft menu: settings, help, presenting and your account in one place","summary":"In the Drafting layout, the app mark and name at the top left open one menu with Settings, Full screen, Help, About, Save for offline, Present, the theme switch and your account. Pin what you use often to the top row.","section":"start","order":44,"keywords":["craft menu","cadcraft menu","app menu","settings","full screen","help","about","offline","present","presentation","account","sign in","sign out","theme","light","dark","sun","moon","pin","add-ons","alt+o","find"],"headings":[{"id":"what-the-menu-holds","text":"What the menu holds","level":2},{"id":"pin-what-you-use-often","text":"Pin what you use often","level":2},{"id":"add-ons-and-find","text":"Add-ons and Find","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe buttons that belong to the site rather than to your drawing sit in one menu. Click the app mark and name at the very top left, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option O\"\u003E⌥O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-the-menu-holds\"\u003EWhat the menu holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E, when the app can be kept on this computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPresent\u003C/span\u003E: hides the interface so only the drawing shows. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/present\" data-topic=\"basics/present\"\u003EPresent a drawing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisit GetCadCraft.com\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA row of two icons for the theme: the sun is the light theme, the moon is the dark theme.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAccount\u003C/span\u003E with \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign out\u003C/span\u003E under it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign in\u003C/span\u003E when you are not signed in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin-what-you-use-often\"\u003EPin what you use often\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach option has a small dot at its right. Click the dot to pin that option as a button in the top row, and click it again to unpin it. Up to six options can be pinned. A number on a pinned button, or on the app mark, is something waiting for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-ons-and-find\"\u003EAdd-ons and Find\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E in the top row lists the add-ons and panels; a tick means one is open, and picking it opens or closes it. At the right of the top row, the search box finds commands and help topics.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe menu is part of the Drafting layout (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E). The other layouts keep these buttons in the app bar. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003EThe Drafting layout\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The buttons that belong to the site rather than to your drawing sit in one menu. Click the app mark and name at the very top left, or press Alt+O. What the menu holds Settings (Ctrl+,), Full screen, Help (F1) and About. Save for offline, when the app can be kept on this computer. Present: hides the interface so only the drawing shows. See Present a drawing. Visit GetCadCraft.com. A row of two icons for the theme: the sun is the light theme, the moon is the dark theme. Account with Sign out under it, or Sign in when you are not signed in. Pin what you use often Each option has a small dot at its right. Click the dot to pin that option as a button in the top row, and click it again to unpin it. Up to six options can be pinned. A number on a pinned button, or on the app mark, is something waiting for you. Add-ons and Find Add-ons in the top row lists the add-ons and panels; a tick means one is open, and picking it opens or closes it. At the right of the top row, the search box finds commands and help topics. Good to know The menu is part of the Drafting layout (Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting). The other layouts keep these buttons in the app bar. See The Drafting layout. This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"present","scope":"basics","title":"Present a drawing: hide the interface","summary":"Present hides the bars, ribbon and palettes so a client sees only the drawing. Nothing closes; Esc or Exit presentation brings everything back.","section":"start","order":45,"keywords":["present","presentation","presentation mode","show client","hide interface","clean view","hide toolbars","hide panels","meeting","exit presentation","escape"],"headings":[{"id":"start-presenting","text":"Start presenting","level":2},{"id":"stop-presenting","text":"Stop presenting","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhen you show a drawing to someone across a table or on a shared screen, the interface gets in the way. Present hides it and leaves the drawing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"start-presenting\"\u003EStart presenting\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen the CadCraft menu (click the app mark and name at the top left, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option O\"\u003E⌥O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and pick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPresent\u003C/span\u003E. To have it one click away, pin it to the top row with the dot beside it (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/craft-menu\" data-topic=\"basics/craft-menu\"\u003EThe CadCraft menu\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe title bar, menu bar, ribbon, palettes, status bar and the marks over the drawing are hidden. The view cube stays, so you can still turn a 3D view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stop-presenting\"\u003EStop presenting\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, or click \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit presentation\u003C/span\u003E at the top right corner. Everything comes back where it was: nothing was closed and nothing in the drawing changed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPresent is in the Drafting layout, where the CadCraft menu is.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"When you show a drawing to someone across a table or on a shared screen, the interface gets in the way. Present hides it and leaves the drawing. Start presenting Open the CadCraft menu (click the app mark and name at the top left, or press Alt+O) and pick Present. To have it one click away, pin it to the top row with the dot beside it (see The CadCraft menu). The title bar, menu bar, ribbon, palettes, status bar and the marks over the drawing are hidden. The view cube stays, so you can still turn a 3D view. Stop presenting Press Esc, or click Exit presentation at the top right corner. Everything comes back where it was: nothing was closed and nothing in the drawing changed. Good to know Present is in the Drafting layout, where the CadCraft menu is. This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan","summary":"Faylalku kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan, sida kaydintu u shaqeyso, iyo waxa browserku xasuusto.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["asturnaan","upload","cloud","kaydi","soo dejin","kaydin","maxalli","amni","sirta"],"headings":[{"id":"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan","level":2},{"id":"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso","text":"Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserku-xasuusto","text":"Waxa browserku xasuusto","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-cloud-ka","text":"Kaydinta cloud-ka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan\"\u003EFaylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka lama soo dirin.\u003C/strong\u003E Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso\"\u003ESida kaydintu u shaqeyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo \u003Cstrong\u003Esoo dejinaya\u003C/strong\u003E fayl cusub:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EBrowserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida &quot;(edited)&quot; ama &quot;(marked up)&quot;, si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserku-xasuusto\"\u003EWaxa browserku xasuusto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-cloud-ka\"\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan Markaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. Faylka lama soo dirin. Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la'aan. Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso Bog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo soo dejinaya fayl cusub: Soo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada). Apps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida \"(edited)\" ama \"(marked up)\", si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii. Haddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"). Waxa browserku xasuusto Qaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso. Kaydinta cloud-ka Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"recipes-you-can-run","text":"Recipes you can run","level":2},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes-you-can-run\"\u003ERecipes you can run\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/getcadcraft/examples\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Egithub.com/getcadcraft/examples\u003C/a\u003E has recipes as files you can run yourself: \u003Ccode\u003Emcp-tidy-a-drawing\u003C/code\u003E makes an assistant&#039;s calls step by step (check a drawing against office standards, fix it with a LISP routine, save and plot), and \u003Ccode\u003Ecli-check-standards\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003Ecli-convert-and-plot\u003C/code\u003E do the same jobs with the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Recipes you can run github.com/getcadcraft/examples has recipes as files you can run yourself: mcp-tidy-a-drawing makes an assistant's calls step by step (check a drawing against office standards, fix it with a LISP routine, save and plot), and cli-check-standards and cli-convert-and-plot do the same jobs with the cadcraft command line. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the pen is turned on for the apps (Settings › Global › Input devices › Pen), CadCraft&#039;s sketch tools take a stroke&#039;s pressure as its lineweight and BimCraft&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch stair\u003C/span\u003E takes one pen stroke as the walking line; the other apps don&#039;t use pressure yet. No app uses the pen&#039;s tilt yet, and no app has a handwriting tool.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Where the pen is turned on for the apps (Settings › Global › Input devices › Pen), CadCraft's sketch tools take a stroke's pressure as its lineweight and BimCraft's Sketch stair takes one pen stroke as the walking line; the other apps don't use pressure yet. No app uses the pen's tilt yet, and no app has a handwriting tool.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffCraft The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"so","chain":["so","en"]};
